msgid ".22 FMJ"
msgid_plural ".22 FMJ"
msgstr[0] ".22 FMJ"
msgstr[1] ".22 FMJ"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.22 FMJ'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with 30gr FMJ bullets.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak with very low stopping power, short range, and negligible "
"recoil.  It is most useful for rifle training, and hunting small animals."
msgstr ""
"Munición .22 Long Rifle con balas de 30gr FMJ. La bala .22 LR es "
"extremadamente débil con muy poca potencia de parada, corto alcance y "
"retroceso insignificante. Es más útil para el entrenamiento de tiro y caza "
"de pequeños animales."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".22 LR"
msgid_plural ".22 LR"
msgstr[0] ".22 LR"
msgstr[1] ".22 LR"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.22 LR'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".22 Long Rifle ammunition with 40gr unjacketed bullets.  The .22LR round is "
"extremely weak with very low stopping power, short range, and negligible "
"recoil.  It is most useful for rifle training, and hunting small animals."
msgstr ""
"Munición .22 Long Rifle con balas sin chaqueta metálica de 40gr. La bala .22"
" LR es extremadamente débil y tiene poca potencia de parada, corto alcance y"
" retroceso insignificante. Es más útil para el entrenamiento de tiro y caza "
"de animales pequeños."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
