#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py lang/json/ammunition_type_from_json.py
msgid ".300 AAC Blackout"
msgid_plural ".300 AAC Blackouts"
msgstr[0] ".300 AAC Blackout"
msgstr[1] ".300 AAC Blackout"

#. ~ Description for .300 AAC Blackout
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A .300 AAC Blackout round with a 125gr open tip match bullet.  300 BLK is an"
" intermediate cartridge necked up from 5.56x45mm, designed to achieve "
"similar ballistics to 7.62x39mm.  It is compatible with standard AR-15 lower"
" receivers and will feed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Munición .300 AAC Blackout con bala de punta abierta de competición de "
"125gr. 300 BLK es un cartucho intermedio con cuello de 5.56x45mm, diseñado "
"para lograr una balística similar a la de 7.62x39mm. Es compatible con los "
"cargadores del  arma AR-15 y alimentará los cargadores STANAG."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".300 AAC Blackout subsonic"
msgid_plural ".300 AAC Blackout subsonics"
msgstr[0] ".300 AAC Blackout subsónica"
msgstr[1] ".300 AAC Blackout subsónica"

#. ~ Description for .300 AAC Blackout subsonic
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A subsonic .300 AAC Blackout round with a 220gr open tip match bullet.  300 "
"BLK is an intermediate cartridge necked up from 5.56x45mm, designed to "
"achieve similar ballistics to 7.62x39mm.  It is compatible with standard "
"AR-15 lower receivers and will feed from STANAG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Munición .300 AAC Blackout  subsónica con bala de 220gr de punta abierta de "
"competición. 300 BLK es un cartucho intermedio con cuello de 5.56x45mm, "
"diseñado para lograr una balística similar a la de 7.62x39mm.  Es compatible"
" con los cargadores del arma AR-15 y se alimentará los cargadores STANAG."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".300 AAC Blackout, black powder"
msgid_plural ".300 AAC Blackouts, black powder"
msgstr[0] ".300 AAC Blackout, pólvora negra"
msgstr[1] ".300 AAC Blackout, pólvora negra"

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ".300 AAC Blackout, reloaded"
msgid_plural ".300 AAC Blackouts, reloaded"
msgstr[0] ".300 AAC Blackout, recargado"
msgstr[1] ".300 AAC Blackout, recargado"

#. ~ Description for .300 AAC Blackout, reloaded
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".300 AAC Blackout is an intermediate cartridge that achieves ballistics "
"similar to the 7.62x39 but allows use on the AR-15 platform.  The round is "
"necked-up from the 5.56mm NATO, but feeds from a STANAG magazine.  It "
"requires a specific barrel, so will not work in a standard M4 or similar "
"carbine.  This one has been hand-reloaded."
msgstr ""
"Munición .300 AAC Blackout es un cartucho intermedio que logra una balística"
" similar al 7.62x39 pero permite su uso en la plataforma AR-15. El cartucho "
"es más alargado que el 5,56 mm NATO, pero se alimenta de un cargador STANAG."
" Requiere un cañón específico, por lo que no funcionará en una carabina "
"estándar M4 o una similar. Esta munición ha sido recargado a mano."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
