#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.357 magnum FMJ'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Jacketed .357 magnum ammunition.  The .357 magnum round is derived from the "
"earlier .38 special, with a marginally longer case and generating greater "
