msgstr[1] ".380 ACP JHP"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.380 ACP JHP'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".380 ACP ammunition with a 95gr jacketed hollow point bullet.  It is a "
"popular round for small concealable backup pistols, and often the weakest "
"recommended defensive caliber.  One should be careful not to chamber it in "
"9x18mm Makarov or 9x19mm firearms."
msgstr ""
"Munición .380 ACP con una bala de 95 grs de punta hueca con chaqueta. Es un "
"cartucho popular para pequeñas pistolas, y a menudo el calibre defensivo más"
" débil recomendado. Hay que tener cuidado de no cargarla en armas de fuego "
"9x18mm Makarov o 9x19mm."

