#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '.454 Casull'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".454 Casull ammunition with 300gr jacketed soft point bullets.  The .454 "
"Casull round is derived from .45 Long Colt with a stronger, lengthened case."
"  It is an exceptionally powerful cartridge with higher stopping power than "
"many rifle rounds, although it suffers from extreme recoil making it "
"unsuitable for most purposes."
msgstr ""
"Munición .454 Casull con bala de 300gr con chaqueta y punta suave. La bala "
".454 Casull proviene de la .45 Long Colt con un casquillo más fuerte y "
"alargado. Es un cartucho excepcionalmente poderoso con mayor potencia de "
"parada que muchas balas de rifle, aunque sufre de un retroceso extremo lo "
"que la hace inadecuada para la mayoría de las ocasiones."

