#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
".45-70 Government ammunition loaded with a 305 grain soft point round.  One "
"of the oldest cartridges still in use, it is still a favorite for large game"
" hunting at short ranges.  This one has been hand-loaded."
msgstr ""
"Munición .45-70 Government está cargada con una bala de 305 granos de punta "
"suave. Uno de los cartuchos más antiguos todavia en uso, el favorito para "
"caza mayor a corta distancia. Este ha sido recargada a mano."

