".45-70 Government +P ammunition loaded with a 305 grain solid copper "
"penetrator projectile.  Designed for maximum penetration through thick hide "
"and bone while maintaining ideal wounding characteristics.  This one has "
"been hand-loaded."
msgstr ""
"Munición .45-70 Government +P cargada con un proyectil perforante sólido de "
"cobre de 305 granos. Diseñada para maximizar la penetración de pellejo duro "
