msgid_plural "4.6x30mm"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm"
msgstr[1] "4.6x30mm"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '4.6x30mm'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with 31gr copper plated steel bullets.  The 4.6x30mm "
"round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge."
"  It has low recoil and excellent armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"Munición 4.6x30mm con bala de 31 gr de acero con chaqueta de cobre. La bala "
"4.6x30mm fue desarrollada por H&K para competir con el cartucho 5.7x28mm de "
"FN Herstal. Tiene poco retroceso y una excelente penetración de blindaje."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid "4.6x30mm, black powder"
msgid_plural "4.6x30mm, black powder"
msgstr[0] "4.6x30mm, pólvora negra"
msgstr[1] "4.6x30mm, pólvora negra"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '4.6x30mm, black powder'}
#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': '4.6x30mm, reloaded'}
#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
msgid ""
"4.6x30mm ammunition with 31gr copper plated lead bullets.  The 4.6x30mm "
"round was developed by H&K to compete with FN Herstal's 5.7x28mm cartridge."
"  It has low recoil, but no usual armor penetration due to using simple lead"
" bullets rather than proper factory-made penetrator projectiles."
msgstr ""
"Munición de 4,6x30mm con balas de plomo revestidas de cobre de 31gr. La "
"ronda de 4.6x30mm fue desarrollada por H&K para competir con el cartucho de "
"5.7x28mm de FN Herstal. Tiene bajo retroceso, pero no tiene la habitual "
"penetración de blindaje debido al uso de simples balas de plomo en lugar de "
"los proyectiles penetradores hechos en fábrica."

#: lang/json/AMMO_from_json.py
