msgid "You pop the wheels back in."
msgstr "Pliegas las ruedas."

#. ~ Description for pair of heelys (on)
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of sneakers with wheels, currently the wheels are out."
msgstr ""
"Un par de zapatillas con ruedas, actualmente las ruedas están desplegadas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "par de pantalones pesados de cota de malla"
msgstr[1] "pares de pantalones pesados de cota de malla"

#. ~ Description for pair of chainmail chausses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Customized chainmail chausses that cover the feet, like booties made of "
"chainmail."
msgstr ""
"Pantalones de cota de malla personalizados que cubren los pies, como botines"
" hechos de cota de malla."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of XL chainmail chausses"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL chainmail chausses"
msgstr[0] "par de pantalones pesados de cota de malla XL"
msgstr[1] "pares de pantalones pesados de cota de malla XL"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of fetlock furs"
msgid_plural "pairs of fetlock furs"
msgstr[0] "par de espolones de piel"
msgstr[1] "pares de espolones de piel"

#. ~ Description for pair of fetlock furs
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Snug fur sleeves to keep your fetlocks warm."
msgstr "Mangas de piel ajustadas, que mantienen tus espolones abrigados."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of flame-resistant socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of flame-resistant socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines ignífugos"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines ignífugos"

#. ~ Description for pair of flame-resistant socks
#. ~ Description for pair of XL flame-resistant socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A snug fitting pair of stockings made from thin and lightweight Nomex fire-"
"resistant fabric.  Tough yet breathable, they are light and comfortable to "
"wear under clothing."
msgstr ""
"Un par de medias ajustadas hechas de una delgada y ligera tela ignífuga "
"Nomex. Duras pero transpirables, son ligeras y confortables y se llevan bajo"
" la ropa."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of XL flame-resistant socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL flame-resistant socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines ignífugos XL"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines ignífugos XL"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines"

#. ~ Description for pair of socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Socks.  Put 'em on your feet."
msgstr "Calcetines. Ponlos en tus pies."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of XL socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines XL"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines XL"

#. ~ Description for pair of XL socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Socks.  Big ones.  Put 'em on your feet."
msgstr "Calcetines. Grandes. Ponlos en tus pies."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of ankle socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of ankle socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines de tobillo"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines de tobillo"

#. ~ Description for pair of ankle socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Short socks, commonly used for sports.  These are designed to protect your "
"feet from friction, not temperature"
msgstr ""
"Calcetines cortos, comúnmente usados para el deporte. Están diseñados para "
"proteger los pies de la fricción, no de la temperatura"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of bag socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of bag socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines bolsa"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines bolsa"

#. ~ Description for pair of bag socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of disposable plastic bags, adapted to be used as socks."
msgstr ""
"Un par de bolsas desechables de plástico, adaptadas para usarse como "
"calcetines."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of disposable bowling socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of disposable bowling socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines de bolos desechables"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines de bolos desechables"

#. ~ Description for pair of disposable bowling socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cheap one time socks.  Can keep your feet clean, but too thin to give any "
"protection."
msgstr ""
"Calcetines baratos desechables. Te pueden mantener los pies limpios, pero "
"son demasiado finos como para brindarte protección."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of wool socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of wool socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines de lana"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines de lana"

#. ~ Description for pair of wool socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Warm socks made of wool."
msgstr "Calcetines abrigados hechos de lana."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of XL wool socks"
msgid_plural "pairs of XL wool socks"
msgstr[0] "par de calcetines de lana XL"
msgstr[1] "pares de calcetines de lana XL"

#. ~ Description for pair of XL wool socks
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Warm socks made of wool for a larger than you'd previously thought possible "
"human."
msgstr ""
"Calcetines calientes hechos de lana para un humano más grande de lo que "
"antes creías posible."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stockings"
msgid_plural "pairs of stockings"
msgstr[0] "par de medias"
msgstr[1] "pares de medias"

#. ~ Description for pair of stockings
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Long cotton socks that reach above the knees to help protect from the cold."
msgstr ""
"Calcetines largos de algodón que llegan a las rodillas, para protegerte del "
"frío."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of tentacle stockings"
msgid_plural "pairs of tentacle stockings"
msgstr[0] "par de medias tentáculos"
msgstr[1] "pares de medias tentáculos"

#. ~ Description for pair of tentacle stockings
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Six long cotton tubes sized to fit over tentacles and help protect them from"
" the cold."
msgstr ""
"Seis largos tubos de algodón con el tamaño adecuado para cubrir tentáculos y"
" ayudar a protegerlos del frío."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of tabi"
msgid_plural "pairs of tabi"
msgstr[0] "par de tabi"
msgstr[1] "pares de tabi"

#. ~ Description for pair of tabi
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of black tabi, as worn with traditional Japanese clothes."
msgstr ""
"Un par de tabi negros, como los de las vestimentas japonesas tradicionales."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of gi tabi"
msgid_plural "pairs of gi tabi"
msgstr[0] "par de gi tabi"
msgstr[1] "pares de gi tabi"

#. ~ Description for pair of gi tabi
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of white tabi, as used by martial arts practitioners."
msgstr ""
"Un par de tabi blancos, como los que usan los que practican artes marciales."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "American flag"
msgid_plural "American flags"
msgstr[0] "Bandera estadounidense"
msgstr[1] "Banderas estadounidenses"

#. ~ Description for American flag
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A large American flag made to fly in even the worst conditions."
msgstr ""
"Una bandera grande de Estados Unidos hecha para seguir ondeando hasta en las"
" peores situaciones."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Foodperson's cape"
msgid_plural "Foodperson's capes"
msgstr[0] "Capa de Personacomida"
msgstr[1] "Capas de Personacomida"

#. ~ Description for Foodperson's cape
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A brightly-colored cape emblazoned with the \"Fp\" symbol."
msgstr "Una capa de color brillante con el símbolo \"Pc\"."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "cloak"
msgid_plural "cloaks"
msgstr[0] "capa"
msgstr[1] "capas"

#. ~ Description for cloak
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A heavy cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "Una capa pesada que se pone sobre tu cuerpo."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "fur cloak"
msgid_plural "fur cloaks"
msgstr[0] "capa de piel"
msgstr[1] "capas de piel"

#. ~ Description for fur cloak
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A heavy fur cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "Una capa pesada de piel que se pone sobre tu cuerpo."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather cloak"
msgid_plural "leather cloaks"
msgstr[0] "capa de cuero"
msgstr[1] "capas de cuero"

#. ~ Description for leather cloak
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A heavy leather cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "Una pesada capa de cuero que se pone sobre tu cuerpo."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "wool cloak"
msgid_plural "wool cloaks"
msgstr[0] "capa de lana"
msgstr[1] "capas de lana"

#. ~ Description for wool cloak
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A heavy woolen cloak meant to be thrown over your body."
msgstr "Una capa pesada de lana que se pone sobre tu cuerpo."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Jedi cloak"
msgid_plural "Jedi cloaks"
msgstr[0] "capa de Jedi"
msgstr[1] "capas de Jedi"

#. ~ Description for Jedi cloak
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Long, flowing robes.  Simple and comfortable to wear.  Be sure to tear it "
"off dramatically before fighting any foes!"
msgstr ""
"Largas y fluidas túnicas. Simples y cómodas de llevar. ¡Asegúrate de "
"quitártela dramáticamente antes de luchar contra cualquier enemigo!"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "wool poncho"
msgid_plural "wool ponchos"
msgstr[0] "poncho de lana"
msgstr[1] "ponchos de lana"

#. ~ Description for wool poncho
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple wool garment worn over the torso.  Provides a bit of protection."
msgstr ""
"Una prenda simple de lana que se usa en el torso. Proporciona un poco de "
"protección."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "snuggie"
msgid_plural "snuggies"
msgstr[0] "batamanta"
msgstr[1] "batamantas"

#. ~ Description for snuggie
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Perfect for reading all those books you scavenged."
msgstr "Perfecta para leer todos esos libros que estuviste juntando."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "turnout coat"
msgid_plural "turnout coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de bombero"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de bombero"

#. ~ Description for turnout coat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy protective coat worn by firefighters.  Highly resistant to heat and "
"flame, it provides excellent protection from injury."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo protector grande usado por los bomberos. Muy resistente al calor y"
" al fuego. Proporciona una excelente protección contra heridas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "cassock"
msgid_plural "cassocks"
msgstr[0] "sotana"
msgstr[1] "sotanas"

#. ~ Description for cassock
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A piece of clerical clothing, usually worn by Christian priests."
msgstr ""
"Una vestimenta usada por sacerdotes y y religiosos de la iglesia Católica."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "fur coat"
msgid_plural "fur coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de piel"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de piel"

#. ~ Description for fur coat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Extremely warm."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo de piel con un par de bolsillos pequeños. Extremadamente abrigado."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL fur coat"
msgid_plural "XL fur coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de piel XL"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de piel XL"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de piel sintética"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de piel sintética"

#. ~ Description for faux fur coat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A garishly-colored faux fur coat with a couple small pockets.  Although not "
"as warm as the natural fur, it gives you some of that unique flair."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo de piel de color chillón con un par de bolsillos pequeños. Aunque "
"no es tan cálido como el pelo natural, te da un toque único."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL faux fur coat"
msgid_plural "XL faux fur coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de piel sintética XL"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de piel sintética XL"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sable coat"
msgid_plural "sable coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de marta"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de marta"

#. ~ Description for sable coat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A very well-made fur coat, featuring thick panels of sable fur.  Very warm "
"and very good-looking."
msgstr "Un excelente abrigo hecho con piel de marta. Muy abrigado y hermoso."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "lab coat"
msgid_plural "lab coats"
msgstr[0] "bata de laboratorio"
msgstr[1] "batas de laboratorio"

#. ~ Description for lab coat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long white coat with several large pockets.  Comes with a very nice pocket"
" protector."
msgstr ""
"Una bata larga y blanca con varios bolsillos grandes. Viene con un agradable"
" protector para los bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "rain coat"
msgid_plural "rain coats"
msgstr[0] "impermeable"
msgstr[1] "impermeables"

#. ~ Description for rain coat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plastic coat with a hood and two very large pockets.  Provides protection "
"from rain."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo de plástico con una capucha y dos bolsillos grandes. Proporciona "
"protección contra la lluvia."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "straw cape"
msgid_plural "straw capes"
msgstr[0] "capa de paja"
msgstr[1] "capas de paja"

#. ~ Description for straw cape
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bulky traditional Japanese raincoat made from straw, which covers the "
"entire body.  Also known as mino."
msgstr ""
"Un voluminoso impermeable tradicional japonés hecho de paja, que cubre todo "
"el cuerpo. También conocido como mino."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "gutskin parka"
msgid_plural "gutskin parkas"
msgstr[0] "anorak de piel intestinal"
msgstr[1] "anoraks de piel intestinal"

#. ~ Description for gutskin parka
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An intricately sewn coat of treated and split intestines, prized for its "
"light weight and waterproofness among the indigenous peoples of the arctic."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo intrincadamente cosido de intestinos tratados y partidos, valorado"
" por su peso ligero y su impermeabilidad entre la gente indígena del ártico."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "winter coat"
msgid_plural "winter coats"
msgstr[0] "abrigo de invierno"
msgstr[1] "abrigos de invierno"

#. ~ Description for winter coat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A padded coat with deep pockets and a hood.  Very warm."
msgstr "Un abrigo acolchado con capucha y bolsillos grandes. Muy abrigado."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "duster"
msgid_plural "dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos"

#. ~ Description for duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A rugged full-length duster coat.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "Un abrigo robusto y largo, con muchos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "fur duster"
msgid_plural "fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de piel"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de piel"

#. ~ Description for fur duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A thick fur full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "Un abrigo robusto y largo de piel, con muchos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL fur duster"
msgid_plural "XL fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos XL de piel"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos XL de piel"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL duster"
msgid_plural "XL dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos XL"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos XL"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de piel sintética"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de piel sintética"

#. ~ Description for faux fur duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many pockets for "
"storing things."
msgstr ""
"Es una gabardina gruesa de piel sintética, que te llega hasta las rodillas. "
"Tiene muchos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "XL faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos XL de piel sintética"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos XL de piel sintética"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather duster"
msgid_plural "leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de cuero"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de cuero"

#. ~ Description for leather duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A thick leather full-length duster.  Has many pockets for storage."
msgstr "Un abrigo robusto de cuero resistente, con muchos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL leather duster"
msgid_plural "XL leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos XL de cuero"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos XL de cuero"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "survivor duster"
msgid_plural "survivor dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de superviviente"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de superviviente"

#. ~ Description for survivor duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Kevlar armored custom full-length duster, covered with pouches and "
"pockets.  Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr ""
"Un guardapolvos largo blindado con protección de Kevlar cubierto con bolsos "
"y bolsillos. Cómodo, duradero y con muy buena capacidad de almacenamiento."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "XL survivor duster"
msgid_plural "XL survivor dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos XL de superviviente"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos XL de superviviente"

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "greatcoat"
msgid_plural "greatcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabán"
msgstr[1] "gabanes"

#. ~ Description for greatcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy, full-length wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo pesado de lana de cuerpo entero. Incómodo pero abrigado y con "
"bolsillos grandes."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "hakama"
msgid_plural "hakamas"
msgstr[0] "hakama"
msgstr[1] "hakamas"

#. ~ Description for hakama
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Plain black hakama for use in kendo and other martial arts."
msgstr ""
"Un hakama negro que se utiliza en el kendo y en otras artes marciales."

#. ~ Description for hakama
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A flowing, pleated garment which can be worn over a kimono."
msgstr "Una prenda fluida y con pliegues que se puede llevar sobre un kimono."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "bathrobe"
msgid_plural "bathrobes"
msgstr[0] "albornoz"
msgstr[1] "albornoces"

#. ~ Description for bathrobe
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An outer garment of absorbent, towel-like material traditionally worn to "
"cover one's nakedness to and from the bath.  It makes you wish you had "
"running water to bathe with."
msgstr ""
"Una prenda exterior de material absorbente, similar a una toalla, que se usa"
" tradicionalmente para cubrir la desnudez hacia y desde el baño. Te hace "
"desear tener agua corriente para bañarte."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "army jacket"
msgid_plural "army jacket"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta militar"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas militares"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'army jacket'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A tough jacket with lots of pockets.  Favored by the military."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta resistente con muchos bolsillos. De las favoritas de los "
"soldados."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "chef's jacket"
msgid_plural "chef's jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de chef"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de chef"

#. ~ Description for chef's jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This double-breasted uniform is unusually thick to protect against the heat "
"of the kitchen."
msgstr ""
"Este uniforme de doble botonadura es inusualmente grueso para proteger del "
"calor de la cocina."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "emergency jacket"
msgid_plural "emergency jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de emergencia"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de emergencia"

#. ~ Description for emergency jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bright & cheaply made FEMA-issue windbreaker jacket with a hood.  One "
"size, fits none.  Helps keep you unfrozen & visible for rescuers."
msgstr ""
"Cortavientos con capucha de colores brillantes y materiales baratos, de las "
"que utiliza FEMA (Agencia Federal para la Gestión de Emergencias). Existe un"
" solo tamaño que no le queda bien a nadie. Impide que te congeles y te hace "
"visible a los rescatadores."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "flannel jacket"
msgid_plural "flannel jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de franela"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de franela"

#. ~ Description for flannel jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A jacket made from flannel-style denim, favored by outdoorsy types.  "
"Provides decent protection from cuts."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta hecha de tela vaquera de franela, preferida por los que viven "
"al aire libre. Proporciona una protección decente contra los cortes."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "jean jacket"
msgid_plural "jean jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta vaquera"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas vaqueras"

#. ~ Description for jean jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A jacket made from denim.  Provides decent protection from cuts."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta hecha de tela vaquera. Proporciona una buena protección contra "
"los cortes."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A jacket made from denim.  Provides decent protection from cuts.  This one "
"is haphazardly covered with patches featuring metal band logos."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta hecha de vaqueros. Proporciona una protección decente contra "
"cortes. Esta está cubierta al azar con parches logotipos de bandas "
"metálicas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather jacket"
msgid_plural "leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de cuero"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de cuero"

#. ~ Description for leather jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A jacket made from thick leather.  Cumbersome, but offers excellent "
"protection from cuts."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta hecha de cuero grueso. Incómoda, pero ofrece una excelente "
"protección contra cortes."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "red leather jacket"
msgid_plural "red leather jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de cuero roja"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de cuero rojas"

#. ~ Description for red leather jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A candy-apple-red leather jacket with black strips and shoulder protrusions."
"  It has a number of zippers and snaps in the front."
msgstr ""
"chaqueta de cuero color rojo manzana de caramelo, con rayas negras y "
"hombreras. Tiene varios cierres y broches en la parte posterior."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "light jacket"
msgid_plural "light jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta ligera"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas ligeras"

#. ~ Description for light jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A thin cotton jacket with a hood.  Good for brisk weather."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta fina de algodón con capucha. Útil para cuando hace fresco."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "windbreaker"
msgid_plural "windbreakers"
msgstr[0] "rompeviento"
msgstr[1] "rompevientos"

#. ~ Description for windbreaker
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light synthetic jacket with a hood.  Not very warm, but will keep out the "
"rain."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta ligera sintética con capucha. No es muy abrigado, pero te "
"protegerá de la lluvia."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "judo gi"
msgid_plural "judo gis"
msgstr[0] "judogi"
msgstr[1] "judogis"

#. ~ Description for judo gi
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Plain white judo gi.  Thick and a little stiff, it gives minor protection "
"from cuts and punches."
msgstr ""
"Un judogi blanco. Grueso y un poco rígido, ofrece un poco de protección "
"contra cortes y puños."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "karate gi"
msgid_plural "karate gis"
msgstr[0] "karategi"
msgstr[1] "karategis"

#. ~ Description for karate gi
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Plain white karate gi.  Loose and flowing, it offers little protection, and "
"little encumbrance."
msgstr ""
"Un karategi blanco. Suelto y flojo ofrece poca protección, pero es un poco "
"incómodo."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "kariginu"
msgid_plural "kariginus"
msgstr[0] "kariginu"
msgstr[1] "kariginus"

#. ~ Description for kariginu
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Shinto robe with several layers and very wide "
"sleeves."
msgstr ""
"Una túnica tradicional sintoísta, larga hasta los tobillos, con varias capas"
" y mangas muy anchas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "kasaya"
msgid_plural "kasayas"
msgstr[0] "kasaya"
msgstr[1] "kasayas"

#. ~ Description for kasaya
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Buddhist robe, stitched together from three "
"pieces of traditional saffron dyed cloth."
msgstr ""
"Una tradicional túnica budista hasta el tobillo, cosida con tres grandes "
"piezas rectangulares de tela teñida con azafrán."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "keikogi"
msgid_plural "keikogis"
msgstr[0] "keikogi"
msgstr[1] "keikogis"

#. ~ Description for keikogi
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Plain white keikogi for use in martial arts."
msgstr "Un keikogi blanco para utilizar en las artes marciales."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "kimono"
msgid_plural "kimono"
msgstr[0] "kimono"
msgstr[1] "kimonos"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'kimono'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Japanese robe, wrapped around the body with a "
"sash."
msgstr ""
"Una túnica tradicional japonesa, larga hasta los tobillos, que se envuelve "
"alrededor del cuerpo con un cinto."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "yukata"
msgid_plural "yukatas"
msgstr[0] "yukata"
msgstr[1] "yukatas"

#. ~ Description for yukata
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An easy-to-wear, breezy robe secured with a sash.  Essentially Japanese "
"pajamas.  Great for summer nights."
msgstr ""
"Una bata suelta fácil de llevar y que se sujeta con una cinta. Esencialmente"
" un pijama japonés. Ideal para las noches de verano."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "haori"
msgid_plural "haoris"
msgstr[0] "Haori"
msgstr[1] "Haoris"

#. ~ Description for haori
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A loose coat with wide sleeves that is worn unfastened over a kimono.  It is"
" jet black with sparse, tasteful golden embroidery."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo suelto con mangas anchas que se lleva desabrochado sobre un "
"kimono. Es negro azabache con un bordado dorado de buen gusto."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "kittel"
msgid_plural "kittels"
msgstr[0] "kittel"
msgstr[1] "kittels"

#. ~ Description for kittel
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A white, knee-length cotton robe, traditionally worn by Jews on special "
"occasions."
msgstr ""
"Una túnica blanca de algodón, larga hasta las rodillas. Tradicionalmente, "
"usada por los judíos en ocasiones especiales."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "peacoat"
msgid_plural "peacoats"
msgstr[0] "chaquetón"
msgstr[1] "chaquetones"

#. ~ Description for peacoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A heavy wool coat.  Cumbersome, but warm and with deep pockets."
msgstr ""
"Un abrigo pesado de lana. Incómodo pero abrigado y con bolsillos grandes."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "robe"
msgid_plural "robes"
msgstr[0] "túnica"
msgstr[1] "túnicas"

#. ~ Description for robe
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A loose-fitting outer garment with sleeves, and a mysterious amount of well-"
"hidden pockets."
msgstr ""
"Una prenda externa suelta, con mangas y una misteriosa cantidad de bolsillos"
" ocultos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "samghati"
msgid_plural "samghatis"
msgstr[0] "samghati"
msgstr[1] "samghatis"

#. ~ Description for samghati
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A traditional, double layered Buddhist coat, used as an outer cloak for "
"various occasions."
msgstr ""
"Un tradicional abrigo budista de doble capa, usado como capa exterior para "
"varias ocasiones."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "ski jacket"
msgid_plural "ski jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta de esquí"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas de esquí"

#. ~ Description for ski jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An insulated, breathable hoodie made for alpine skiing.  Very warm, and with"
" sizable pockets."
msgstr ""
"Una sudadera con capucha aislada y transpirable hecha para el esquí alpino. "
"Muy cálida, y con grandes bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rugged full-length duster that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty "
"of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""
"Un guardapolvos robusto y grande que deja tus brazos libres. Tiene mucha "
"capacidad de almacenamiento debido a sus numerosos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de piel sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de piel sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless fur duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick fur full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""
"Un guardapolvos robusto y grande de piel, sin mangas por lo que deja tus "
"brazos liberados. Tiene mucha capacidad de almacenamiento debido a sus "
"numerosos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless faux fur duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless faux fur dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de piel sintética sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de piel sintética sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless faux fur duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick, sleeveless faux fur duster, falling below your knees.  Has many "
"pockets for storing things."
msgstr ""
"Un grueso guardapolvos de piel sintética sin mangas, que cae por debajo de "
"las rodillas. Tiene muchos bolsillos para guardar cosas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless leather duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless leather dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos de cuero sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos de cuero sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless leather duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick leather full-length duster without sleeves, leaving your arms "
"unencumbered.  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""
"Un grueso guardapolvos robusto y grande de cuero resistente, sin mangas por "
"lo que deja tus brazos liberados. Tiene mucha capacidad de almacenamiento "
"debido a sus numerosos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless survivor duster"
msgid_plural "sleeveless survivor dusters"
msgstr[0] "guardapolvos sin mangas de superviviente"
msgstr[1] "guardapolvos sin mangas de superviviente"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless survivor duster
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A custom Kevlar armored full-length duster without sleeves, covered with "
"pouches and pockets.  Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr ""
"Un guardapolvos blindado personalizado sin mangas, blindado con Kevlar, "
"cubierto con muchos bolsos y bolsillos. Cómodo, duradero y con muy buena "
"capacidad de almacenamiento."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin cotton trenchcoat that leaves your arms unencumbered.  Has plenty of "
"storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""
"Una fina gabardina de algodón que te deja los brazos libres. Tiene mucha "
"capacidad de almacenamiento debido a sus numerosos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina de piel sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas de piel sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless fur trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick fur trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered.  Has"
" plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina gruesa de piel sin mangas, que te deja los brazos libres. "
"Tiene mucha capacidad de almacenamiento debido a sus numerosos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina de piel sintética sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas de piel sintética sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless faux fur trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat without sleeves.  Has plenty of storage space, "
"and looks pretty good."
msgstr ""
"Una gruesa gabardina de piel, sin mangas. Tiene mucho espacio de "
"almacenamiento, y se ve bastante bien."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina de cuero sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas de cuero sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless leather trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick leather trenchcoat without sleeves, leaving your arms unencumbered."
"  Has plenty of storage space due to its many pockets."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina de cuero grueso sin mangas, que te deja los brazos libres. "
"Tiene mucha capacidad de almacenamiento debido a sus numerosos bolsillos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless survivor trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "sleeveless survivor trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina sin mangas de superviviente"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas sin mangas de superviviente"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless survivor trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A custom Kevlar armored trenchcoat without sleeves, covered with pouches and"
" pockets.  Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina personalizada sin mangas, blindada con Kevlar cubierto con "
"bolsos y bolsillos. Cómodo, duradero y con muy buena capacidad de "
"almacenamiento."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "sleeveless tunic"
msgid_plural "sleeveless tunics"
msgstr[0] "túnica sin mangas"
msgstr[1] "túnicas sin mangas"

#. ~ Description for sleeveless tunic
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A sleeveless cloth garment that covers the torso and legs."
msgstr "Una prenda de tela sin mangas que cubre el torso y las piernas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "thawb"
msgid_plural "thawb"
msgstr[0] "thawb"
msgstr[1] "thawb"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'thawb'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long, loose-fitting robe with wide sleeves, a traditional Arab garment."
msgstr ""
"Una túnica larga y suelta con mangas anchas. Una prenda tradicional árabe."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas"

#. ~ Description for trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A thin cotton trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina fina de algodón con varios bolsillos. Ofrece muy buena "
"capacidad de almacenamiento."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina de piel"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas de piel"

#. ~ Description for fur trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A thick fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina gruesa de piel, con varios bolsillos. Tiene muy buena "
"capacidad de almacenamiento."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "faux fur trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "faux fur trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina de piel sintética"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas de piel sintética"

#. ~ Description for faux fur trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick faux fur trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage, and "
"makes you the talk of the town."
msgstr ""
"Una gruesa gabardina de piel sintética, forrado con bolsillos. Genial para "
"el almacenamiento, y te hace la comidilla de la ciudad."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "leather trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina de cuero"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas de cuero"

#. ~ Description for leather trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A thick leather trenchcoat, lined with pockets.  Great for storage."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina gruesa de cuero, con varios bolsillos. Tiene muy buena "
"capacidad de almacenamiento."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "survivor trenchcoat"
msgid_plural "survivor trenchcoats"
msgstr[0] "gabardina de superviviente"
msgstr[1] "gabardinas de superviviente"

#. ~ Description for survivor trenchcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Kevlar armored custom trenchcoat, covered with pouches and pockets.  "
"Comfortable, durable, and great for storage."
msgstr ""
"Una gabardina personalizada blindada con kevlar cubierto de bolsos y "
"bolsillos. Cómodo, duradero y con muy buena capacidad de almacenamiento."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "tunic"
msgid_plural "tunics"
msgstr[0] "túnica"
msgstr[1] "túnicas"

#. ~ Description for tunic
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A simple garment long enough to cover down to the knees."
msgstr ""
"Una simple prenda lo suficientemente larga como para cubrirte hasta las "
"rodillas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "rag tunic"
msgid_plural "rag tunics"
msgstr[0] "túnica de trapos"
msgstr[1] "túnicas de trapos"

#. ~ Description for rag tunic
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A poorly made long tunic with a string tied around the waist to keep it all "
"in place."
msgstr ""
"Una túnica larga mal hecha con un cordón atado a la cintura para mantenerlo "
"todo en sitio."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "tuxedo"
msgid_plural "tuxedos"
msgstr[0] "esmoquin"
msgstr[1] "esmóquines"

#. ~ Description for tuxedo
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A full-body tuxedo.  Makes the apocalypse feel a little more classy."
msgstr ""
"Un esmoquin de cuerpo entero. Hace que el apocalipsis tenga un poco más de "
"clase."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "waistcoat"
msgid_plural "waistcoats"
msgstr[0] "chaleco"
msgstr[1] "chalecos"

#. ~ Description for waistcoat
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An elegant waistcoat.  Ideal for those occasions when wearing only a shirt "
"would be too casual and a suit would be just overdoing it."
msgstr ""
"Un chaleco elegante. Ideal para esos momentos donde usar solo una camiseta "
"sería demasiado informal, pero un traje sería demasiado elegante."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "army winter jacket"
msgid_plural "army winter jackets"
msgstr[0] "chaqueta militar de invierno"
msgstr[1] "chaquetas militares de invierno"

#. ~ Description for army winter jacket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tough hooded jacket with lots of pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  "
"Favored by the military."
msgstr ""
"Una chaqueta resistente con capucha y muchos bolsillos, forrada  gruesamente"
" para abrigar. De las favoritas de los soldados."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of eclipse glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of eclipse glasses"
msgstr[0] "par de gafas para eclipses"
msgstr[1] "pares de gafas para eclipses"

#. ~ Description for pair of eclipse glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of cardboard-framed glasses with UV and IR-filtered lenses topped "
"with a layer of aluminum coating.  They allow safe viewing of extremely "
"bright and harmful sources of light, like the sun during a solar eclipse."
msgstr ""
"Un par de gafas de cartulina con lentes con filtro UV e IR, y una capa "
"adicional de recubrimiento de aluminio. Permiten mirar a fuentes de luz "
"extremadamente brillantes y peligrosas, como el sol durante un eclipse "
"solar."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather eyepatch"
msgid_plural "leather eyepatches"
msgstr[0] "parche de ojo de cuero"
msgstr[1] "parches de ojo de cuero"

#. ~ Description for leather eyepatch
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A patch of black leather to cover an eye, with a string to keep it from "
"falling off.  If wearing this doesn't make you feel a pirate, nothing will."
msgstr ""
"Un parche de cuero negro para cubrir un ojo, con una cuerda para evitar que "
"se caiga. Si usar esto no te hace sentir un pirata, nada lo hará."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of stylish sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of stylish sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "par de gafas de sol elegantes"
msgstr[1] "pares de gafas de sol elegantes"

#. ~ Description for pair of stylish sunglasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of stylish sunglasses.  Look good while keeping the glare out of your"
" eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un par de gafas de sol elegantes. Te quedan bien y te protegen contra "
"deslumbramientos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of fit-over sunglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of fit-over sunglasses"
msgstr[0] "par de gafas de sol de ajuste"
msgstr[1] "pares de gafas de sol de ajuste"

#. ~ Description for pair of fit-over sunglasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of fit-over sunglasses designed to be worn over a pair of corrective "
"glasses.  Good for keeping the glare out of your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Gafas de sol de ajuste diseñadas para poder ser utilizadas cómodamente sobre"
" un par de gafas graduadas. Útiles como protección contra deslumbramientos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of ballistic glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of ballistic glasses"
msgstr[0] "par de gafas de balística"
msgstr[1] "pares de gafas de balística"

#. ~ Description for pair of ballistic glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Modern tactical eyewear that protects from small projectiles and fragments."
"  Provides excellent protection from environmental dangers."
msgstr ""
"Gafas protectoras tácticas, que evitan el daño de proyectiles pequeños y de "
"fragmentos. Excelente protección contra los peligros del medio ambiente."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of bifocal glasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of bifocal glasses"
msgstr[0] "par de gafas bifocales"
msgstr[1] "pares de gafas bifocales"

#. ~ Description for pair of bifocal glasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of bifocal glasses for those who are both near-sighted and far-"
"sighted.  You can use them to focus sunlight."
msgstr ""
"Un par de gafas bifocales para los que son hipermétropes y miopes. Las "
"puedes usar para concentrar la luz del sol."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "pair of eyeglasses"
msgid_plural "pairs of eyeglasses"
msgstr[0] "par de gafas"
msgstr[1] "pares de gafas"

#. ~ Description for pair of eyeglasses
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of glasses for the near-sighted.  The concave lenses diffuse the "
"sunlight, rendering them useless for starting fires."
msgstr ""
"Un par de gafas para los miopes. Las lentes cóncavas dispersan la luz, lo "
"que las hace inservibles para encender un fuego."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "monocle"
msgid_plural "monocles"
msgstr[0] "monóculo"
msgstr[1] "monóculos"

#. ~ Description for monocle
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An essential article of the gentleman's apparel.  Also corrects near-"
"sightedness.  The concave lenses diffuse the sunlight, rendering them "
"useless for starting fires."
msgstr ""
"Un artículo esencial en el atuendo de un caballero. Además corrige la "
