msgstr[1] "medallones de cobre"

#. ~ Description for copper locket
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A circular, copper locket.  It's been tarnished with use, and has gained "
"some dull green spots.  You can wear it if you like, but it won't provide "
"any effects."
msgstr ""
"Un medallón circular de cobre. Ha sido oscurecido con el uso, y ha ganado "
"algunas manchas verdes opacas. Puedes usarlo si quieres, pero no te "
"proporcionará ningún efecto."

