"An invisible aura that strikes melee attackers with arcs of electricity."
msgstr ""
"Un aura invisible que golpea a los atacantes con arcos de electricidad."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "feral aura"
msgid_plural "feral auras"
msgstr[0] "aura salvaje"
msgstr[1] "auras salvajes"

#. ~ Description for feral aura
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The manifestation of your rage.  It won't disappear until you calm down."
msgstr "La manifestación de tu furia. No desaparecerá hasta que te calmes."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "acid aura"
msgid_plural "acid auras"
msgstr[0] "aura acida"
msgstr[1] "auras acidas"

#. ~ Description for acid aura
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An aura of thin acid, swirling around your body ready to corrode when struck"
" or while striking."
msgstr ""
"Un aura de ácido ligera, arremolinándose alrededor de tu cuerpo listo para "
"corroerse cuando se golpea o mientras tu golpeas."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "werewolf aura"
msgid_plural "werewolf auras"
msgstr[0] "aura de hombre lobo"
msgstr[1] "auras de hombre lobo"

#. ~ Description for werewolf aura
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "You have become the werewolf.  Boys becoming men, men becoming wolves."
msgstr ""
"Te has convertido en el hombre lobo. Los chicos se convierten en hombres, "
"los hombres se convierten en lobos."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py lang/json/SPELL_from_json.py
msgid "Black Dragon Shell"
msgid_plural "Black Dragon Shells"
msgstr[0] "Caparazón de Dragón Negro"
msgstr[1] "Caparazones de Dragón Negro"

#. ~ Description for Black Dragon Shell
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An aura of black and green draconic energy, swirling around your body "
"protecting you and punishing those who strike you."
msgstr ""
"Un aura de energía draconiana negra y verde, arremolinándose alrededor de tu"
" cuerpo protegiéndote y castigando a los que te golpean."

#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "spiritual armor"
msgid_plural "spiritual armor"
msgstr[0] "armadura espiritual"
msgstr[1] "armaduras espirituales"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'spiritual armor'}
#: lang/json/ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "A summoned medieval armor.  It glows softly and looks sturdy."
msgstr "Una armadura medieval invocada. Brilla levemente y parece robusta."

#: lang/json/BATTERY_from_json.py
msgid "test battery"
msgid_plural "test batteries"
msgstr[0] "batería de prueba"
msgstr[1] "baterías de prueba"

#. ~ Description for test battery
#: lang/json/BATTERY_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a testing item for the BATTERY item type.  If you found one in game,"
" it's a bug."
msgstr ""
"Este es un elemento de prueba para el tipo de elemento BATERÍA. Si "
"encontraste uno en el juego, es un bicho."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fusion Blaster Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Fusion Blaster Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Brazo de pistola de fusión"
msgstr[1] "MCB Brazo de pistola de fusión"

#. ~ Description for Fusion Blaster Arm CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your left arm has been replaced by a heavy-duty fusion blaster!  You may use"
" your energy banks to fire a damaging heat ray.  However, you are unable to "
"use or carry two-handed items, and your strength limits what you can use "
"with your one hand."
msgstr ""
"¡Tu brazo izquierdo ha sido reemplazado con una pistola de fusión! Puedes "
"usar tus reservas de energía para disparar un rayo de calor. Sin embargo, no"
" puedes usar o agarrar objetos que necesitan las dos manos, y tu fuerza "
"determina qué puedes usar con una mano sola y qué no."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Kinetic Shock Absorbers CBM"
msgid_plural "Kinetic Shock Absorbers CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Amortiguadores Cinéticos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Amortiguadores Cinéticos"

#. ~ Description for Kinetic Shock Absorbers CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of hydraulic springs and foldable padding that replaces most of the "
"flesh in the limbs and upper torso.  While active, these absorbers will "
"negate damage from severe impacts such as falling, at the cost of reducing "
"the user's ability to move effectively."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de muelles hidráulicos y acolchado plegable que reemplaza la "
"mayor parte de la carne de las extremidades y la parte superior del torso. "
"Mientras estén activos, estos absorbedores anularán los daños causados por "
"impactos severos, como las caídas, a costa de reducir la capacidad del "
"usuario para moverse con eficacia."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "abstract bionic module"
msgid_plural "abstract bionic modules"
msgstr[0] "módulo biónico abstracto"
msgstr[1] "módulos biónicos abstractos"

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "abstract bionic module (npc usable)"
msgid_plural "abstract bionic modules (npc usable)"
msgstr[0] "módulo biónico abstracto (usable por PNJ)"
msgstr[1] "módulos biónicos abstractos (usables por PNJ)"

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "abstract faulty bionic module"
msgid_plural "abstract faulty bionic modules"
msgstr[0] "módulo biónico defectuoso abstracto"
msgstr[1] "módulos biónicos defectuosos abstractos"

#. ~ Description for abstract faulty bionic module
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "This CBM is broken beyond repair, you can't do anything with it."
msgstr "Este CBM esta en un estado irreparable, no puedes hacer nada con el."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Adrenaline Pump CBM"
msgid_plural "Adrenaline Pump CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Bomba de adrenalina"
msgstr[1] "MCB Bomba de adrenalina"

#. ~ Description for Adrenaline Pump CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stimulator system that is implanted alongside the adrenal glands, allowing"
" the user to trigger their body's adrenaline response at the cost of some "
"bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Implantado al lado de tus glándulas suprarrenales se encuentra un sistema "
"diseñado para activar la liberación de adrenalina en tu cuerpo al costo de "
"energía biónica."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Active Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Active Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de defensa activa"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de defensa activa"

#. ~ Description for Active Defense System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bionic projects a thin forcefield around the user's body.  Anything "
"attempting to penetrate this field has a chance of being deflected at the "
"cost of energy, reducing their ability to deal damage.  Bullets will be "
"deflected more than swords and those in turn more than massive objects."
msgstr ""
"Este CBM proyecta un fino campo de fuerza alrededor del usuario. Cualquier "
"objeto que intente penetrar este campo puede ser desviado usando energía "
"biónica, Balas serán desviadas con mas frecuencia que espadas y estas con "
"mas frecuencia que objetos mas grandes. "

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Alarm System CBM"
msgid_plural "Alarm System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de alarma"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de alarma"

#. ~ Description for Alarm System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A motion-detecting alarm system will notice almost all movement within a "
"fifteen-foot radius, and will silently alert the user.  This is very useful "
"during sleep, or if the user suspects a cloaked pursuer."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de alarma de detección de movimiento notará casi todo el "
"movimiento en un radio de 15 pies, y alertará silenciosamente al usuario. "
"Esto es muy útil durante el sueño, o si el usuario sospecha de un "
"perseguidor encubierto."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Arms Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Arms Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Placas de aleación para brazos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Placas de aleación para brazos"

#. ~ Description for Arms Alloy Plating CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alloy plating that replaces the flesh on the user's arms.  Provides passive "
"protection and can be used in conjunction with bionic martial arts."
msgstr ""
"Placas de aleación remplazan la carne en los brazos del usuario. Provee "
"protección y puede ser usado en conjunto con artes marciales biónicas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Protective Lenses CBM"
msgid_plural "Protective Lenses CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Lentes protectoras"
msgstr[1] "MCB Lentes protectoras"

#. ~ Description for Protective Lenses CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bionic package that seals the user's eye sockets with highly protective "
"mirrored lenses and re-routes their tear ducts to their mouth.  When the "
"user cries, they must spit out or swallow their tears."
msgstr ""
"Las cuencas de tus ojos han sido selladas con lentes protectoras "
"refractivas, y tus conductos lagrimales han sido desviados hacia tu boca. "
"Cuando lloras, tienes que escupir o tragarte tus lágrimas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Head Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Head Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Placas de aleación para cabeza"
msgstr[1] "MCB Placas de aleación para cabeza"

#. ~ Description for Head Alloy Plating CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alloy plating that replaces the flesh on the user's head, protecting both "
"their head and jaw regions."
msgstr ""
"Son unas placas de aleación reemplazan la carne en la cabeza del usuario, "
"protegiendo tanto la cabeza como la mandíbula."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Legs Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Legs Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Placas de aleación para piernas"
msgstr[1] "MCB Placas de aleación para piernas"

#. ~ Description for Legs Alloy Plating CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alloy plating that replaces the flesh on the user's legs.  Provides passive "
"protection and can be used in conjunction with bionic martial arts."
msgstr ""
"Placas de aleación remplazan la carne en las piernas del usuario. Provee "
"protección y puede ser usado en conjunto con artes marciales biónicas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Torso Alloy Plating CBM"
msgid_plural "Torso Alloy Plating CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Placas de aleación para torso"
msgstr[1] "MCB Placas de aleación para torso"

#. ~ Description for Torso Alloy Plating CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alloy plating that replaces the flesh on the user's torso, protecting it "
"from physical trauma."
msgstr ""
"Placas de aleación remplazan la carne en el torso del usuario, protegiéndolo"
" de daño físico."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Battery System CBM"
msgid_plural "Battery System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de baterías"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de baterías"

#. ~ Description for Battery System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A battery draining attachment to make use of the energy contained in normal,"
" everyday batteries."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema diseñado para hacer uso de la energía contenida en baterías "
"comunes. Presiona 'E' para consumir cargas de baterías. Se puede activar y "
"desactivar a voluntad."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Monomolecular Blade CBM"
msgid_plural "Monomolecular Blade CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Cuchilla monomolecular"
msgstr[1] "MCB Cuchilla monomolecular"

#. ~ Description for Monomolecular Blade CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deadly foot-long blade made of advanced material that is installed inside "
"the forearm, capable of being extended through the back of the user's wrist "
"at the cost of a small amount of power.  Though exceptionally sharp, it will"
" prevent the user from holding anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Es una mortal cuchilla de 30 cm hecha de un material superior que se "
"encuentra ahora dentro del antebrazo, y puede extenderse desde la muñeca del"
" usuario con un gasto mínimo de energía. Aunque está excepcionalmente "
"afilada, no permite agarrar nada con la mano cuando está extendida."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Shotgun Arm CBM"
msgid_plural "Shotgun Arm CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Brazo Escopeta "
msgstr[1] "MBCs Brazo Escopeta "

#. ~ Description for Shotgun Arm CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A concealed, single shot 12 gauge shotgun that is implanted inside the left "
"forearm.  Perfect in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"En tu antebrazo izquierdo se encuentra implantada una escopeta calibre 12. "
"Perfecta en un apuro."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Blood Analysis CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Analysis CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Análisis de sangre"
msgstr[1] "MCB Análisis de sangre"

#. ~ Description for Blood Analysis CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small sensors that are implanted in the user's heart, allowing them to "
"analyze their blood.  This will detect many illnesses, drugs, and other "
"conditions."
msgstr ""
"Son unos pequeños sensores que han sido implantados en el corazón, "
"permitiéndoles analizar tu sangre. Esto detectará muchas enfermedades, "
"drogas y otras condiciones."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Blood Filter CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Filter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Filtro de sangre"
msgstr[1] "MCB Filtro de sangre"

#. ~ Description for Blood Filter CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A filtration system that is installed in the heart and can actively filter "
"out chemical impurities, primarily drugs, with limited impact on viruses.  "
"Note that it is not a targeted filter; ALL drugs in the system will be "
"affected."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de filtros implantado en el corazón que permite filtrar impurezas"
" químicas, principalmente drogas, con poco impacto en viruses. Todas las "
"drogas en tu sistema serán afectadas al filtrar."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cable Charger System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cable Charger System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de Cable Cargador"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de Cable Cargador"

#. ~ Description for Cable Charger System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A complex port that is mounted above the hip.  While active, it will "
"recharge bionic power when connected to a battery via jumper cable."
msgstr ""
"Sobre tu cintura se encuentra un puerto, que cuando activo y conectado a una"
" batería mediante un cable de arranque, recargara tu poder biónico."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM"
msgid_plural "Subdermal Carbon Filament CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Filamento de carbono subdérmico"
msgstr[1] "MCB Filamento de carbono subdérmico"

#. ~ Description for Subdermal Carbon Filament CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin armor made of carbon nanotubes, implanted just beneath the skin.  "
"This reduces bashing damage by 2 and cutting damage by 4."
msgstr ""
"Implantado justo debajo de la piel se encuentra una delgada armadura de "
"nanotubos de carbono. Reduce daño golpeante en 2 y el cortante en 4."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Chain Lightning CBM"
msgid_plural "Chain Lightning CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Rayos en cadena"
msgstr[1] "MCB Rayos en cadena"

#. ~ Description for Chain Lightning CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A chain lightning generator that emits a blast of lightning at a target, "
"leaving a trail of lightning in its wake and jumping to additional targets "
"within 4 tiles of the previous target."
msgstr ""
"Un generador de rayos en cadena que emite una ráfaga de rayos a un objetivo,"
" dejando una estela de rayos a su paso y saltando a objetivos adicionales "
"dentro de 4 cuadros del objetivo anterior."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Claws CBM"
msgid_plural "Bionic Claws CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Garras biónicas"
msgstr[1] "MCB Garras biónicas"

#. ~ Description for Bionic Claws CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Vicious, retractable claws that are implanted inside the user's fingers.  "
"These do considerable cutting damage, but prevent the user from holding "
"anything else while extended."
msgstr ""
"Garras feroces han sido implantadas dentro de los dedos del usuario. Estas "
"producen un considerable daño cortante, cunado están extendidas te impiden "
"sostener objetos en tus manos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Climate Control CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Climate Control CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Control interno de temperatura"
msgstr[1] "MCB Control interno de temperatura"

#. ~ Description for Internal Climate Control CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A network of thermal piping which eases the effects of high and low ambient "
"temperatures once activated."
msgstr ""
"Una red de canales térmicos se extienden por tu cuerpo, reduce los efectos "
"de altas o bajas temperaturas al activarse."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cloaking System CBM"
msgid_plural "Cloaking System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de ocultamiento"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de ocultamiento"

#. ~ Description for Cloaking System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This high-power system uses a set of cameras and LEDs to make the user blend"
" into their surroundings, rendering them fully invisible to eyes and optical"
" sensors.  However, this doesn't prevent detection from other means such as "
"infrared, sonar, etc."
msgstr ""
"Este sistema de gran potencia utiliza una serie de cámaras y LEDs para "
"camuflarte con el ambiente, volviéndote invisible a simple vista. Aun así "
"puedes ser detectado mediante sonares, luz infrarroja, etc."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Close Quarters Battle CBM"
msgid_plural "Close Quarters Battle CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Pelea en espacios cerrados"
msgstr[1] "MCB Pelea en espacios cerrados"

#. ~ Description for Close Quarters Battle CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of bionic processors and databanks, loaded with martial arts combat "
"programs.  Whilst active, the CQB module will improve the user's hand-to-"
"hand combat skills, but prevents them from improving them through combat "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de procesadores biónicos y bancos de datos, cargados con "
"programas de combate de artes marciales. Mientras esté activo, el módulo CQB"
" mejorará las habilidades de combate mano a mano del usuario, pero evita que"
" las mejore a través de la experiencia de combate."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Wired Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Wired Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Reflejos conectados"
msgstr[1] "MCB Reflejos conectados"

#. ~ Description for Wired Reflexes CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bionic nerve stimulators that greatly enhance reaction times, granting a +2 "
"bonus to dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Son unos estimuladores biónicos de nervios que mejoran mucho el tiempo de "
"reacción, lo que otorga un bonus de +2 a la destreza."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Expanded Digestive System CBM"
msgid_plural "Expanded Digestive System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema digestivo expandido"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema digestivo expandido"

#. ~ Description for Expanded Digestive System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This module contains three synthetic stomachs and industrial-grade "
"intestines.  Not only will these extract much more nutrition from food, but "
"also increase the user's resistance to foodborne illness, and occasionally "
"allow the digestion of rotten food."
msgstr ""
"Has sido equipado con tres estómagos sintéticos y con intestinos "
"industriales. No solo puedes extraer muchos más nutrientes de la comida, "
"sino que también eres mas resistente a las enfermedades transmitidas por los"
" alimentos, y a veces puedes comer comida podrida."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Enhanced Hearing CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Hearing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Audición mejorada"
msgstr[1] "MCB Audición mejorada"

#. ~ Description for Enhanced Hearing CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While this bionic is active, the user's hearing will be drastically "
"improved, allowing them to hear ten times better than the average person.  "
"Additionally, high-intensity sounds will be automatically dampened before "
"they can damage their hearing."
msgstr ""
"Mientras este biónico esté activo, la audición del usuario mejorará "
"drásticamente, permitiéndole oír diez veces mejor que la persona promedio. "
"Además, los sonidos de alta intensidad se amortiguarán automáticamente antes"
" de que puedan dañar su audición."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Directional EMP CBM"
msgid_plural "Directional EMP CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB PEM direccional"
msgstr[1] "MCB PEM direccional"

#. ~ Description for Directional EMP CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small parabolic EMP field generators that are mounted in the palm of the "
"user's right hand.  These can be used to instantly fire a wide, but short-"
"ranged blast which will disable electronics and robots."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños generadores de campo EMP parabólicos que se montan en la palma de "
"la mano derecha del usuario. Estos pueden ser usados para disparar "
"instantáneamente una amplia, pero de corto alcance explosión que desactivará"
" la electrónica y los robots."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "EMP Projector CBM"
msgid_plural "EMP Projector CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Proyector PEM"
msgstr[1] "MCB Proyector PEM"

#. ~ Description for EMP Projector CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A ranged EMP generator system that is implanted in the user's right arm and "
"hand.  The system fires precise, single-target pulses that require time to "
"aim.  Extremely effective against electronic targets but mostly useless "
"otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema generador de EMP a distancia que se implanta en el brazo y la "
"mano derecha del usuario. El sistema dispara pulsos precisos de un solo "
"objetivo que requieren tiempo para apuntar. Extremadamente efectivo contra "
"objetivos electrónicos pero mayormente inútil de otra manera."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Ethanol Burner CBM"
msgid_plural "Ethanol Burner CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Quemador de etanol"
msgstr[1] "MCB Quemador de etanol"

#. ~ Description for Ethanol Burner CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A reactor that burns alcohol as fuel in an extremely efficient reaction.  It"
" can store up to 500ml and accepts ethanol, methanol and denatured alcohol "
"as fuel."
msgstr ""
"Es un reactor que quema alcohol para ser usado como combustible de una "
"manera extremadamente eficiente. Puede contener hasta 500ml y acepta como "
"combustible etanol, metanol y alcohol desnaturalizado."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Aero-Evaporator CBM"
msgid_plural "Aero-Evaporator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Aero-evaporador"
msgstr[1] "MCB Aero-evaporadores"

#. ~ Description for Aero-Evaporator CBM
#. ~ Description for Aero-Evaporator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This unit draws moisture from the surrounding air, which slowly trickles "
"directly into your blood stream.  It may fail in very dry environments."
msgstr ""
"Esta unidad extrae humedad del aire, y la trasporta hasta tu torrente "
"sanguíneo. Podría no funcionar en ambientes muy secos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Diamond Cornea CBM"
msgid_plural "Diamond Cornea CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Córnea de diamante"
msgstr[1] "MCB Córnea de diamante"

#. ~ Description for Diamond Cornea CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of diamond corneas which greatly enhance the user's vision, granting a"
" +2 bonus to perception."
msgstr ""
"Un juego de corneas de diamante que mejoran considerablemente la visión del "
"usuario, otorgando +2 a percepción."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Telescopic Eyes CBM"
msgid_plural "Telescopic Eyes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Ojos Telescópicos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Ojos Telescópicos"

#. ~ Description for Telescopic Eyes CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An array of high-powered, auto-focusing lenses that replaces much of the "
"material in the inner eye.  This fixes any vision problems and allows for an"
" increased vision range akin to binoculars."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de lentes de alta potencia y autoenfoque que sustituye gran "
"parte del material del ojo interno. Esto arregla cualquier problema de "
"visión y permite un mayor rango de visión similar al de los binoculares."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Facial Distortion CBM"
msgid_plural "Facial Distortion CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Distorsión facial"
msgstr[1] "MCB Distorsión facial"

#. ~ Description for Facial Distortion CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Through controlled application of electrochemical impulses, this bionic "
"module lets the user alter their facial structure so as to subtly affect the"
" reactions of others.  This grants a bonus to all social interactions."
msgstr ""
"Mediante la aplicación controlada de impulsos electroquímicos, este módulo "
"biónico permite al usuario alterar su estructura facial para afectar "
"sutilmente a las reacciones de los demás. Esto otorga una ventaja a todas "
"las interacciones sociales."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Dielectric Capacitance System CBM"
msgid_plural "Dielectric Capacitance System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de capacitancia dieléctrica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de capacitancia dieléctrica"

#. ~ Description for Dielectric Capacitance System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A network of miniature piezoelectric capacitors, implanted throughout the "
"body to protect from external electrical discharge."
msgstr ""
"Una red de condensadores piezoeléctricos en miniatura, implantados en todo "
"el cuerpo para protegerse de las descargas eléctricas externas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fingerhack CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerhack CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dedo-hackeador"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dedo-hackeador"

#. ~ Description for Fingerhack CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A miniature electrohack, surgically embedded in a finger of the right hand."
"  This is an all-purpose hacking unit used to override control panels and "
"the like, but not computers.  Computer proficiency is important, and a "
"failed use may cause damage."
msgstr ""
"Un electrochoque en miniatura, incrustado quirúrgicamente en un dedo de la "
"mano derecha. Esta es una unidad de hacking multipropósito usada para anular"
" paneles de control y similares, pero no ordenadores. El dominio de la "
"computadora es importante, y un uso fallido puede causar daños."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Flashbang Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Flashbang Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Generador de destellos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Generador de destellos"

#. ~ Description for Flashbang Generator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A combination of LEDs and speakers that create a flash and sound comparable "
"to a flashbang grenade, deafening and blinding nearby enemies."
msgstr ""
"Una combinación de LEDs y altavoces que crean un destello y un sonido "
"comparable al de una granada de destello, ensordecedor y cegador de los "
"enemigos cercanos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cranial Flashlight CBM"
msgid_plural "Cranial Flashlight CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Linterna craneal"
msgstr[1] "MCB Linterna craneal"

#. ~ Description for Cranial Flashlight CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "A small, but powerful LED flashlight that is mounted between the eyes."
msgstr "Una pequeña pero poderosa linterna LED que se monta entre los ojos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "LED Tattoo"
msgid_plural "LED Tattoos"
msgstr[0] "tatuaje LED"
msgstr[1] "tatuajes LED"

#. ~ Description for LED Tattoo
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An LED display implanted beneath the epidermis that can display patterns or "
"pictures through the skin.  When active it glows dimly, providing a very "
"small amount of light."
msgstr ""
"Una pantalla LED implantada debajo de la epidermis que puede mostrar "
"patrones o imágenes a través de la piel. Cuando está activo, brilla "
"tenuemente, proporcionando una cantidad muy pequeña de luz."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Integrated Dosimeter CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Dosimeter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dosímetro integrado"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dosímetro integrado"

#. ~ Description for Integrated Dosimeter CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small radiation sensors that are implanted throughout the body, allowing the"
" user to analyze their level of absorbed radiation.  They will also alert "
"the user whenever exposed to environmental radiation."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños sensores de radiación que se implantan en todo el cuerpo, "
"permitiendo al usuario analizar su nivel de radiación absorbida. También "
"alertarán al usuario cuando se exponga a la radiación ambiental."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Respirator CBM"
msgid_plural "Respirator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Respirador"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Respirador"

#. ~ Description for Respirator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A complex respiration augmentation system that increases the user's maximal "
"oxygen uptake and allows for underwater breathing akin to gills.  Will "
"automatically activate if the user is drowning."
msgstr ""
"Un complejo sistema de aumento de la respiración que aumenta la máxima "
"captación de oxígeno del usuario y permite la respiración submarina similar "
"a las branquias. Se activará automáticamente si el usuario se está ahogando."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Terranian Sonar CBM"
msgid_plural "Terranian Sonar CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sonar terrestre"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sonar terrestre"

#. ~ Description for Terranian Sonar CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Precision sonar equipment, implanted in the feet to allow the detection of "
"below-ground movement, buried traps, and unstable terrain."
msgstr ""
"Equipo de sonar de precisión, implantado en los pies para permitir la "
"detección de movimientos bajo tierra, trampas enterradas y terreno "
"inestable."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Heat Drain CBM"
msgid_plural "Heat Drain CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Drenaje de calor"
msgstr[1] "MCB Drenaje de calor"

#. ~ Description for Heat Drain CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed against a warm-blooded opponent, there is a chance "
"that a successful hit will drain body heat, inflicting a small amount of "
"extra damage, and recharging the user's bionic power reserves slightly."
msgstr ""
"Mientras se lucha desarmado contra un oponente de sangre caliente, existe la"
" posibilidad de que un golpe exitoso drene el calor corporal, infligiendo "
"una pequeña cantidad de daño extra y recargando ligeramente las reservas de "
"energía biónica del usuario."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Thermal Dissipation CBM"
msgid_plural "Thermal Dissipation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Disipación térmica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Disipación térmica"

#. ~ Description for Thermal Dissipation CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Powerful heatsinks and supermaterials are woven into the user's flesh.  "
"While powered, this system will prevent external heat damage up to 2000 "
"degrees Fahrenheit.  Note that this does not affect the internal body "
"temperature."
msgstr ""
"Poderosos disipadores térmicos y supermateriales se tejen en la carne del "
"usuario.Cuando esta encendido, este sistema evitará daños por calor externo "
"hasta los 1090 grados Celsius. Tenga en cuenta que esto no afecta a la "
"temperatura interna del cuerpo."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Hydraulic Muscles CBM"
msgid_plural "Hydraulic Muscles CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Musculatura hidráulica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Musculatura hidráulica"

#. ~ Description for Hydraulic Muscles CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hydraulic muscle support system that when active, increases strength by "
"20."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema hidráulico de apoyo muscular que, cuando está activo, aumenta la "
"fuerza en 20."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Infrared Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Infrared Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Visión infrarroja"
msgstr[1] "MCB Visión infrarroja"

#. ~ Description for Infrared Vision CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bionic module that extends the range of vision into the infrared, allowing"
" the user to see warm-blooded creatures in the dark and through smoke."
msgstr ""
"Un módulo biónico que amplía el rango de visión al infrarrojo, permitiendo "
"al usuario ver criaturas de sangre caliente en la oscuridad y a través del "
"humo."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Cerebral Booster CBM"
msgid_plural "Cerebral Booster CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Estimulador cerebral"
msgstr[1] "MCB Estimulador cerebral"

#. ~ Description for Cerebral Booster CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bionic coprocessors that are implanted in the brain, granting a +2 bonus to "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Coprocesadores biónicos que se implantan en el cerebro, otorgando un bono +2"
" a la inteligencia."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Finger-Mounted Laser CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger-Mounted Laser CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dedo-Láser"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dedo-Láser"

#. ~ Description for Finger-Mounted Laser CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, high-powered laser that is embedded in the fingertip.  This long "
"range weapon is not incredibly damaging, but is very accurate, and has the "
"potential to start fires."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño láser de alta potencia que está incrustado en la punta del dedo. "
"Esta arma de largo alcance no es increíblemente dañina, pero es muy precisa,"
" y tiene el potencial de iniciar incendios."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Leukocyte Breeder System CBM"
msgid_plural "Leukocyte Breeder System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema cultivador de leucocitos"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema cultivador de leucocitos"

#. ~ Description for Leukocyte Breeder System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bionic stimulators which augment the user's haematopoiesis system, allowing "
"them to accelerate white blood cell production using bionic power.  It is "
"designed for continuous use and may cause unpleasant side effects when "
"turned off."
msgstr ""
"Estimuladores biónicos que aumentan el sistema de hematopoyesis del usuario,"
" permitiéndole acelerar la producción de glóbulos blancos utilizando la "
"energía biónica. Está diseñado para un uso continuo y puede causar efectos "
"secundarios desagradables cuando se apaga."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Finger Lighter CBM"
msgid_plural "Finger Lighter CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Mechero Dedo"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Mechero Dedo"

#. ~ Description for Finger Lighter CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Powerful fire starters which extend from the tip of both hands' index "
"fingers."
msgstr ""
"Poderosos iniciadores de fuego que se extienden desde la punta de los dedos "
"índices de ambas manos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fingerpick CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingerpick CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dedo-ganzúa"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dedo-ganzúa"

#. ~ Description for Fingerpick CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An electronic lockpick that is embedded in a fingertip.  This automatic "
"system will quickly unlock all but the most advanced key locks without any "
"skill required on the part of the user."
msgstr ""
"Una ganzúa electrónica que está incrustada en la punta de un dedo. Este "
"sistema automático desbloqueará rápidamente todas las cerraduras de llave, "
"excepto las más avanzadas, sin necesidad de ninguna habilidad por parte del "
"usuario."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Electromagnetic Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electromagnetic Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad electromagnética"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad electromagnética"

#. ~ Description for Electromagnetic Unit CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful electromagnet that is implanted into the user's right hand, "
"allowing them to indiscriminately pull all nearby magnetic objects towards "
"them.  Unlucky bystanders might be injured or killed by flying objects."
msgstr ""
"Un poderoso electroimán que se implanta en la mano derecha del usuario, "
"permitiéndole atraer indiscriminadamente hacia él todos los objetos "
"magnéticos cercanos. Los espectadores desafortunados pueden resultar heridos"
" o muertos por los objetos voladores."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Nictating Membrane CBM"
msgid_plural "Nictating Membrane CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Membrana nictitante"
msgstr[1] "MCB Membrana nictitante"

#. ~ Description for Nictating Membrane CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin membrane that closes over the eyes while underwater, negating any "
"vision penalties."
msgstr ""
"Una fina membrana que se cierra sobre los ojos mientras se está bajo el "
"agua, negando cualquier penalización de la visión."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Enhanced Memory Banks CBM"
msgid_plural "Enhanced Memory Banks CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Bancos mejorados de memoria"
msgstr[1] "MCB Bancos mejorados de memoria"

#. ~ Description for Enhanced Memory Banks CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of highly-advanced quantum storage drives used to enhance memory.  "
"While active, they increase the rate that the user learns skills, and give "
"them near-perfect memory of skills and terrain."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de unidades de almacenamiento cuántico muy avanzadas utilizadas "
"para mejorar la memoria. Mientras están activas, aumentan el ritmo de "
"aprendizaje del usuario y le proporcionan una memoria casi perfecta de las "
"habilidades y el terreno."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Metabolic Interchange CBM"
msgid_plural "Metabolic Interchange CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Intercambio metabólico"
msgstr[1] "MCB Intercambio metabólico"

#. ~ Description for Metabolic Interchange CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This module interconnects the user's digestive system and power supply, "
"letting them replenish bionic energy by burning calories."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo interconecta el sistema digestivo y la fuente de alimentación "
"del usuario, permitiéndole reponer la energía biónica mediante la quema de "
"calorías."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Weather Reader CBM"
msgid_plural "Weather Reader CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Lector de clima"
msgstr[1] "MCB Lector de clima"

#. ~ Description for Weather Reader CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A multitude of scientific instruments and sensors collect environmental "
"data.  The data is compiled and presented as a simple readout of the current"
" weather.  It also passively tells the user their external temperature."
msgstr ""
"Una multitud de instrumentos y sensores científicos recogen datos "
"medioambientales. Los datos son compilados y presentados como una simple "
"lectura del clima actual. También le dice pasivamente al usuario su "
"temperatura externa."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Repair Nanobots CBM"
msgid_plural "Repair Nanobots CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Nanobots de reparación"
msgstr[1] "MCB Nanobots de reparación"

#. ~ Description for Repair Nanobots CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fleet of tiny dormant robots.  While activated they will flit about the "
"user's body, repairing damage and stopping bleeding at the cost of power."
msgstr ""
"Una flota de pequeños robots dormidos. Mientras están activados, "
"revolotearán por el cuerpo del usuario, reparando los daños y deteniendo la "
"hemorragia a costa de la energía."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Artificial Night Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Artificial Night Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Generador artificial de noche"
msgstr[1] "MCB Generador artificial de noche"

#. ~ Description for Artificial Night Generator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When active, this bionic eliminates all light within a 15 tile radius "
"through destructive interference."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está activo, este biónico elimina toda la luz en un radio de 15 "
"azulejos a través de interferencias destructivas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Implanted Night Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Implanted Night Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Implante de visión nocturna"
msgstr[1] "MCB Implante de visión nocturna"

#. ~ Description for Implanted Night Vision CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bionic module modifies the user's eyes to amplify existing light, "
"allowing them to see in the dark."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico modifica los ojos del usuario para amplificar la luz "
"existente, permitiéndole ver en la oscuridad."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Offensive Defense System CBM"
msgid_plural "Offensive Defense System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de defensa ofensiva"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de defensa ofensiva"

#. ~ Description for Offensive Defense System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin forcefield gets projected around the user's body, continually "
"draining power.  This field does not deflect attacks, but rather delivers a "
"strong shock, damaging unarmed attackers and those with a conductive weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un delgado campo de fuerza se proyecta alrededor del cuerpo del usuario, "
"drenando continuamente la energía. Este campo no desvía los ataques, sino "
"que da un fuerte choque, dañando a los atacantes desarmados y a los que "
"tienen un arma conductora."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Sensory Dulling CBM"
msgid_plural "Sensory Dulling CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Adormecimiento sensorial"
msgstr[1] "MCB Adormecimiento sensorial"

#. ~ Description for Sensory Dulling CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This module lets the user's nervous system inhibit pain signals, allowing "
"them to dull their senses at will.  However, the use of this system may "
"cause delayed reaction times and drowsiness."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo permite al sistema nervioso del usuario inhibir las señales de "
"dolor, permitiéndole embotar sus sentidos a voluntad. Sin embargo, el uso de"
" este sistema puede causar retrasos en los tiempos de reacción y "
"somnolencia."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Armor Interface CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Interface CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Interfaz de armadura de poder"
msgstr[1] "MCB Interfaz de armadura de poder"

#. ~ Description for Power Armor Interface CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Interfaces the user's bionic power system with the internal charging port on"
" suits of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power "
"banks."
msgstr ""
"Interfaz del sistema de energía biónica del usuario con el puerto de carga "
"interno de los trajes de armadura de energía, permitiéndoles extraer de los "
"bancos de energía biónica del usuario."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Interfaz Mk. II de armadura de poder"
msgstr[1] "MCB Interfaz Mk. II de armadura de poder"

#. ~ Description for Power Armor Mk. II Interface CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Interfaces the user's bionic power system with the internal charging port on"
" suits of power armor, allowing them to draw from the user's bionic power "
"banks.  Twice as efficient as the Mk. I model.  The Mk. II was designed by "
"DoubleTech Inc., to meet the popularity of the Mk. II power armor series."
msgstr ""
"Interfaz del sistema de energía biónica del usuario con el puerto de carga "
"interno de los trajes de armadura de energía, permitiéndoles extraer de los "
"bancos de energía biónica del usuario. Dos veces más eficiente que el modelo"
" Mk. I. El Mk. II fue diseñado por DoubleTech Inc., para satisfacer la "
"popularidad de la serie de armaduras de energía Mk. II."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía"
msgstr[1] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía"

#. ~ Description for Power Storage CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module that upgrades the user's power capacity by 100 "
"units.  Having at least one of these is a prerequisite to using powered "
"bionics.  The user will also need a power supply, found in various CBMs."
msgstr ""
"Un Módulo Biónico Compacto que aumenta la capacidad de energía del usuario "
"en 100 unidades. Tener al menos uno de estos es un requisito previo para "
"usar la biónica con potencia. El usuario también necesitará una fuente de "
"alimentación, que se encuentra en varios CBMs."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Power Storage CBM Mk. II"
msgid_plural "Power Storage CBM Mk. II"
msgstr[0] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía Mk. II"
msgstr[1] "MCB Almacenamiento de energía Mk. II"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Power Storage CBM Mk. II'}
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Compact Bionics Module developed at DoubleTech Industries as a replacement"
" for the highly successful Power Storage CBM.  Increases the user's power "
"capacity by 250 units."
msgstr ""
"Un Módulo Biónico Compacto desarrollado en las Industrias DoubleTech como "
"reemplazo del altamente exitoso CBM de Almacenamiento de Energía. Aumenta la"
" capacidad de energía del usuario en 250 unidades."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Probability Travel CBM"
msgid_plural "Probability Travel CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Barrera de potencial"
msgstr[1] "MCB Barrera de potencial"

#. ~ Description for Probability Travel CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Increases the body's wavelength, allowing the user to quantum tunnel through"
" walls, reappearing on the other side.  Power drain in standby is minimal, "
"but each tile tunneled through costs 250 bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta la longitud de onda del cuerpo, permitiendo al usuario hacer un "
"túnel cuántico a través de las paredes, reapareciendo en el otro lado. El "
"consumo de energía en espera es mínimo, pero cada azulejo que se atraviesa "
"cuesta 250 biónicos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Air Filtration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Air Filtration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de filtrado de aire"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de filtrado de aire"

#. ~ Description for Air Filtration System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An advanced filtration system that is implanted in the trachea.  If toxins, "
"or airborne diseases find their way into the windpipe, the filter will "
"attempt to remove them."
msgstr ""
"Un avanzado sistema de filtración que se implanta en la tráquea. Si las "
"toxinas, o enfermedades transmitidas por el aire encuentran su camino hacia "
"la tráquea, el filtro intentará eliminarlas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Radiation Scrubber System CBM"
msgid_plural "Radiation Scrubber System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de limpieza de radiación"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de limpieza de radiación"

#. ~ Description for Radiation Scrubber System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A system of advanced piezomechanical blood filters that are implanted "
"throughout your body, allowing the user to purge themself of absorbed "
"radiation at the cost of some bionic power."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de avanzados filtros piezomecánicos de sangre que se implantan en"
" todo el cuerpo, permitiendo al usuario purgarse de la radiación absorbida a"
" costa de algo de energía biónica."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Railgun CBM"
msgid_plural "Railgun CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Cañón de riel"
msgstr[1] "MCB Cañón de riel"

#. ~ Description for Railgun CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"EM field generators in the user's arms increase the range and damage of "
"thrown magnetic objects at a cost of 1 bionic power per throw.  They will "
"create a trail of electricity that can cause additional damage."
msgstr ""
"Los generadores de campo electromagnético en los brazos del usuario aumentan"
" el alcance y el daño de los objetos magnéticos lanzados a un coste de 1 "
"potencia biónica por lanzamiento. Crearán una estela de electricidad que "
"puede causar daños adicionales."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Fingertip Razors CBM"
msgid_plural "Fingertip Razors CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Uñas-navaja"
msgstr[1] "MCB Uñas-navaja"

#. ~ Description for Fingertip Razors CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of ten double-edged, four centimeter long razor-sharp claws that are "
"implanted underneath the fingernails.  These will deal a small amount of "
"unarmed slashing damage whenever the user's fingertips are uncovered."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de diez garras de doble filo, de cuatro cm de largo, que se "
"implantan debajo de las uñas. Estas garras causarán una pequeña cantidad de "
"daño por corte sin armas cuando se descubran las puntas de los dedos del "
"usuario."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM"
msgid_plural "Gasoline Fuel Cell CBMs"
msgstr[0] " MBC Célula de Combustible de Gasolina"
msgstr[1] " MBCs Célula de Combustible de Gasolina"

#. ~ Description for Gasoline Fuel Cell CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small gasoline fuel cell able to convert gasoline to bionic power.  It's "
"connected to a diffuse network of bio-plastic bladders able to hold up to "
"500 ml of gasoline."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña célula de combustible de gasolina capaz de convertir la gasolina"
" en energía biónica. Está conectada a una red difusa de vejigas bio-"
"plásticas capaces de contener hasta 500 ml de gasolina."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Recycler Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Recycler Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de reciclado"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de reciclado"

#. ~ Description for Recycler Unit CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A series of filters and processors that is implanted in the user's digestive"
" system, allowing them to reclaim waste liquid and, to a lesser degree, "
"nutrients.  The net effect is a greatly reduced need to eat and drink."
msgstr ""
"Una serie de filtros y procesadores que se implanta en el sistema digestivo "
"del usuario, permitiéndole recuperar el líquido de desecho y, en menor "
"grado, los nutrientes. El efecto neto es una gran reducción de la necesidad "
"de comer y beber."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Remote Controller CBM"
msgid_plural "Remote Controller CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Controlador Remoto"
msgstr[1] "MCB Controlador Remoto"

#. ~ Description for Remote Controller CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small module that connects to the user's brain and allows them to "
"interface with nearby devices with wireless capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño módulo que se conecta al cerebro del usuario y le permite "
"interactuar con dispositivos cercanos con capacidades inalámbricas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Sonic Resonator CBM"
msgid_plural "Sonic Resonator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Resonador sónico"
msgstr[1] "MCB Resonador sónico"

#. ~ Description for Sonic Resonator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bionic module allows the user's entire body to resonate at very high "
"power, creating a short-range shockwave.  While it will not do much damage "
"to creatures, solid objects such as walls and doors will be damaged."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico permite que todo el cuerpo del usuario resuene a muy "
"alta potencia, creando una onda de choque de corto alcance. Aunque no "
"causará mucho daño a las criaturas, los objetos sólidos como las paredes y "
"las puertas se dañarán."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Olfactory Mask CBM"
msgid_plural "Olfactory Mask CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Máscara olfativa"
msgstr[1] "MCB Máscara olfativa"

#. ~ Description for Olfactory Mask CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While this system is powered, the user's body will produce very little odor,"
" making it nearly impossible for creatures to track them by scent."
msgstr ""
"Mientras este sistema esté activado, el cuerpo del usuario producirá muy "
"poco olor, haciendo casi imposible que las criaturas los rastreen por el "
"olor."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Electroshock Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Electroshock Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de electroshock"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de electroshock"

#. ~ Description for Electroshock Unit CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While fighting unarmed, or with a weapon that conducts electricity, there is"
" a chance that a successful hit will shock the user's opponent, inflicting "
"extra damage and disabling them temporarily at the cost of some energy."
msgstr ""
"Mientras se lucha desarmado, o con un arma que conduce la electricidad, "
"existe la posibilidad de que un golpe exitoso dé una sacudida al oponente "
"del usuario, infligiendo un daño extra e incapacitándolo temporalmente a "
"costa de algo de energía."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Shockwave Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Shockwave Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Generador de onda sísmica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Generador de onda sísmica"

#. ~ Description for Shockwave Generator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bionic module generates a powerful shockwave, knocking back all nearby "
"creatures.  Targets are stunned briefly, take damage and additional stun "
"upon impact with impassable terrain, and knock back any creatures they "
"collide with."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico genera una poderosa onda de choque, derribando a todas "
"las criaturas cercanas. Los objetivos son aturdidos brevemente, reciben daño"
" y aturdimiento adicional al impactar en terreno intransitable, y hacen "
"retroceder a cualquier criatura con la que choquen."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Synaptic Accelerator CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Accelerator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Acelerador de sinapsis"
msgstr[1] "MCB Acelerador de sinapsis"

#. ~ Description for Synaptic Accelerator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Bionic stimulators that enhance the nervous system, granting a 10% boost to "
"your speed."
msgstr ""
"Estimuladores biónicos que mejoran el sistema nervioso, dando un 10% de "
"impulso a su velocidad."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Muscle Augmentation CBM"
msgid_plural "Muscle Augmentation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Aumento muscular"
msgstr[1] "MCB Aumento muscular"

#. ~ Description for Muscle Augmentation CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Myomer fibers that enhance the muscular system, granting a +2 bonus to "
"strength."
msgstr ""
"Fibras mioméricas que mejoran el sistema muscular, otorgando un bono de +2 a"
" la fuerza."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM"
msgid_plural "Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Bisturís Quirúrgicos Autónomos"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Bisturís Quirúrgicos Autónomos"

#. ~ Description for Autonomous Surgical Scalpels CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A system of surgical grade scalpels that is implanted in the user's fingers."
"  They allow for automated precise cuts and can be used as a high-quality "
"butchering tool."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de bisturís de grado quirúrgico que se implanta en los dedos del "
"usuario. Permiten realizar cortes precisos automatizados y pueden ser "
"utilizados como una herramienta de carnicería de alta calidad."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Anti-Glare Compensators CBM"
msgid_plural "Anti-Glare Compensators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Compensadores anti-reflejo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Compensadores anti-reflejo"

#. ~ Description for Anti-Glare Compensators CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of quick-reacting transition lenses that are installed over the user's"
" eyes.  They negate glare penalties, partially protect from bright flashes, "
"and protect the eyes when welding."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de lentes de transición de reacción rápida que se instalan sobre"
" los ojos del usuario. Anulan las penalizaciones por deslumbramiento, "
"protegen parcialmente de los destellos brillantes y protegen los ojos al "
"soldar."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Targeting System CBM"
msgid_plural "Targeting System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de selección de objetivo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de selección de objetivo"

#. ~ Description for Targeting System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bionic module contains range finders and synchronizes the movement of "
"the user's eyes with their arms, to a degree.  Shots they fire will be much "
"more accurate, particularly at long ranges."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico contiene telémetro y sincroniza el movimiento de los "
"ojos del usuario con sus brazos, hasta cierto punto. Los disparos que hagan "
"serán mucho más precisos, especialmente a larga distancia."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Teleportation Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Teleportation Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de teletransportación"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de teletransportación"

#. ~ Description for Teleportation Unit CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This highly experimental unit folds space over short distances, instantly "
"transporting the user's body up to 25 feet in a random duration at the cost "
"of much power.  Note that prolonged or frequent use may have dangerous side "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Esta unidad altamente experimental pliega el espacio en distancias cortas, "
"transportando instantáneamente el cuerpo del usuario hasta 25 pies en una "
"duración aleatoria a costa de mucha energía. Tenga en cuenta que el uso "
"prolongado o frecuente puede tener efectos secundarios peligrosos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Time Dilation CBM"
msgid_plural "Time Dilation CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Dilación del tiempo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Dilación del tiempo"

#. ~ Description for Time Dilation CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"At the cost of all stored bionic power, the user may increase their body "
"speed and reactions dramatically, essentially freezing time.  Violent or "
"rapid movements may cause damage due to friction."
msgstr ""
"A costa de toda la energía biónica almacenada, el usuario puede aumentar la "
"velocidad y las reacciones de su cuerpo de forma drástica, esencialmente "
"congelando el tiempo. Los movimientos violentos o rápidos pueden causar "
"daños debido a la fricción."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Integrated Toolset CBM"
msgid_plural "Integrated Toolset CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Caja de herramientas integrada"
msgstr[1] "MCB Caja de herramientas integrada"

#. ~ Description for Integrated Toolset CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A surgically implanted set of tools - screwdriver, hammer, wrench, hacksaw, "
"drill, welder and heating elements.  These can be used in place of many "
"tools when crafting."
msgstr ""
"Un juego de herramientas implantadas quirúrgicamente: destornillador, "
"martillo, llave inglesa, sierra de arco, taladro, soldador y elementos "
"calefactores. Estos pueden ser usados en lugar de muchas herramientas cuando"
" se trabaja."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Torsion Ratchet CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Articulaciones cinéticas"
msgstr[1] "MCB Articulaciones cinéticas"

#. ~ Description for Joint Torsion Ratchet CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Torsion ratchets that replace the user's joints to slowly generate power "
"when they move.  These can be toggled to generate more power, but movement "
"will require more effort."
msgstr ""
"Trinquetes de torsión que reemplazan las articulaciones del usuario para "
"generar lentamente energía cuando se mueven. Se pueden cambiar para generar "
"más energía, pero el movimiento requerirá más esfuerzo."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Joint Servo CBM"
msgid_plural "Joint Servo CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Articulaciones Servo"
msgstr[1] "MCB Articulaciones Servo"

#. ~ Description for Joint Servo CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of servomotors that get installed on leg joints to provide power-"
"assisted movement.  They are optimized for running, but walking also "
"requires less effort while this bionic is active.  However, when it's "
"offline it will hamper the user's movement."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de servomotores que se instalan en las articulaciones de las "
"piernas para proporcionar un movimiento asistido. Están optimizados para "
"correr, pero caminar también requiere menos esfuerzo mientras este biónico "
"está activo. Sin embargo, cuando está desconectado, obstaculizará el "
"movimiento del usuario."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Uncanny Dodge CBM"
msgid_plural "Uncanny Dodge CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Evasión asombrosa"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Esquiva asombrosa"

#. ~ Description for Uncanny Dodge CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bionic processors that augment the user's nervous system, allowing them to "
"dodge attacks beyond normal human capability, including bullets."
msgstr ""
"Procesadores biónicos que aumentan el sistema nervioso del usuario, "
"permitiéndole esquivar los ataques más allá de la capacidad humana normal, "
"incluyendo las balas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Unified Power System CBM"
msgid_plural "Unified Power System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB UPS"
msgstr[1] "MCB UPS"

#. ~ Description for Unified Power System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Unified Power System that is wired into the user's bionic power banks.  "
"Objects that run on a UPS can now directly draw power from the bionic power "
"supply."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de energía unificado que está conectado a los bancos de energía "
"biónica del usuario. Los objetos que funcionan con un UPS pueden ahora "
"obtener energía directamente de la fuente de energía biónica."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Chronometer CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Chronometer CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Cronómetro interno"
msgstr[1] "MCB Cronómetro interno"

#. ~ Description for Internal Chronometer CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bionic module contains an atomic clock, complete with silent alarm "
"clock function."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo biónico contiene un reloj atómico, con función de despertador "
"silencioso."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Water Extraction Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Water Extraction Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Unidad de extracción de agua"
msgstr[1] "MCB Unidad de extracción de agua"

#. ~ Description for Water Extraction Unit CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This module contains nanotubes that are embedded in the palm of the hand to "
"pump any available fluid out of a dead body, cleanse it of impurities and "
"convert it into potable water.  Water container not included."
msgstr ""
"Este módulo contiene nanotubos que están incrustados en la palma de la mano "
"para bombear cualquier fluido disponible de un cuerpo muerto, limpiarlo de "
"impurezas y convertirlo en agua potable. No se incluye el contenedor de "
"agua."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Intravenous Needletip CBM"
msgid_plural "Intravenous Needletip CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Aguja Intravenosa"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Aguja Intravenosa"

#. ~ Description for Intravenous Needletip CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small tube with a retractable needle that terminates in a net of tiny "
"hoses instead of a plunger.  Installed, it allows the user to draw "
"substances directly into their bloodstream akin to a regular syringe."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño tubo con una aguja retráctil que termina en una red de pequeñas "
"mangueras en lugar de un émbolo. Instalado, permite al usuario extraer "
"sustancias directamente a su corriente sanguínea como una jeringa normal."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM"
msgid_plural "Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB de Esqueleto de Titanio"
msgstr[1] "MCB de Esqueleto de Titanio"

#. ~ Description for Titanium Skeletal Bracing CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of hinges, springs, and other synthetic augments for the skeletal "
"structure.  These artificial enhancers strengthen the knees and elbows, "
"allowing the user to carry more weight."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de bisagras, resortes y otros aparatos sintéticos para la "
"estructura esquelética. Estas mejoras artificiales fortalecen las rodillas y"
" los codos, lo que le permite al usuario soportar más peso."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Taste Modifier CBM"
msgid_plural "Taste Modifier CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Modificador del Gusto"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Modificador del Gusto"

#. ~ Description for Taste Modifier CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of highly sensitive sensors implanted in the user's mouth, combined "
"with a sophisticated analyzer.  While active, it will block all unpleasant "
"taste and texture at the cost of bionic energy."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de sensores de alta sensibilidad implantados en la boca del "
"usuario, combinados con un sofisticado analizador. Mientras esté activo, "
"bloqueará todo sabor y textura desagradables a costa de la energía biónica."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Soporific Induction CBM"
msgid_plural "Soporific Induction CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Inductor Soporífero"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Inductor Soporífero"

#. ~ Description for Soporific Induction CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A microscopic electrode designed to gently stimulate a particular cluster of"
" neurons in the hypothalamus, helping the user to fall asleep."
msgstr ""
"Un electrodo microscópico diseñado para estimular suavemente un grupo "
"particular de neuronas en el hipotálamo, ayudando al usuario a dormirse."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Squeaky Ankles"
msgid_plural "Squeaky Ankles"
msgstr[0] "Tobillo chillón"
msgstr[1] "Tobillos chillones"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Squeaky Ankles'}
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of defective bionics that make squeaking noises."
msgstr "Un par de biónicos defectuosos que hacen ruidos de chirrido."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Pieces Of Junk"
msgid_plural "Pieces of Junk"
msgstr[0] "Desechos"
msgstr[1] "Desechos"

#. ~ Description for Pieces Of Junk
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A jumble of broken metal pieces that were removed during reconstructive "
"surgery."
msgstr ""
"Un amasijo de piezas metálicas rotas que fueron retiradas durante la cirugía"
" reconstructiva."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Acidic Leaking CBM"
msgid_plural "Acidic Leaking CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Fuga Ácida"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Fuga Ácida"

#. ~ Description for Acidic Leaking CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This CBM has been breached in several places and some acid is leaking from "
"it."
msgstr ""
"Este CBM se ha roto en varios lugares y algo de ácido se está filtrando de "
"ella."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Faulty Electric System"
msgid_plural "Faulty Electric Systems"
msgstr[0] "Sistema Eléctrico Defectuoso"
msgstr[1] "Sistemas Eléctricos Defectuosos"

#. ~ Description for Faulty Electric System
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "This CBM is a mess of naked wire and burnt resistors."
msgstr "Este CBM es un lío de alambre desnudo y resistencias quemadas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Electrical Drain"
msgid_plural "Electrical Drains"
msgstr[0] "Drenaje Eléctrico"
msgstr[1] "Drenajes Eléctricos"

#. ~ Description for Electrical Drain
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This CBM was wired incorrectly and would drain power from any system "
"connected to it."
msgstr ""
"Este MCB está cableado de manera incorrecta y gastará energía de cualquier "
"sistema al que esté conectado."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Itchy Metal Thing"
msgid_plural "Itchy Metal Things"
msgstr[0] "Cosa Metálica Picante"
msgstr[1] "Cosas Metálicas Picantes"

#. ~ Description for Itchy Metal Thing
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can't recognize what this is supposed to be, but it's a very awkward "
"thing to have in one's body."
msgstr ""
"No puedes reconocer lo que se supone que es esto, pero es algo muy incómodo "
"de tener en el cuerpo."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Glowy Thing"
msgid_plural "Glowy Things"
msgstr[0] "Cosa brillante"
msgstr[1] "Cosas brillantes"

#. ~ Description for Glowy Thing
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "It's a… thing?  And it glows, at least it did when it was plugged in."
msgstr "Es una... ¿cosa? Y brilla, al menos lo hacía cuando estaba enchufado."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Leaky Bionic"
msgid_plural "Leaky Bionics"
msgstr[0] "Biónico Goteando"
msgstr[1] "Biónicos Goteando"

#. ~ Description for Leaky Bionic
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mess of pierced pipes and broken seals, something unpleasant is leaking "
"from it."
msgstr ""
"Un lío de tuberías perforadas y sellos rotos, algo desagradable se está "
"filtrando."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Noisemaker"
msgid_plural "Noisemakers"
msgstr[0] "Matraca"
msgstr[1] "Matracas"

#. ~ Description for Noisemaker
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A malfunctioning bionic.  When powered, it occasionally emits a loud burst "
"of noise."
msgstr ""
"Es un biónico que funciona mal. Cuando está activado, emitirá ocasionalmente"
" un ruido muy fuerte."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Nostril"
msgid_plural "Bionic Nostrils"
msgstr[0] "Fosa Nasal Biónica"
msgstr[1] "Fosas Nasales Biónicas"

#. ~ Description for Bionic Nostril
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This thing was up someone's nose, they're probably glad to be rid of it."
msgstr ""
"Esta cosa estaba adentro de la nariz de alguien, que debe estar contento de "
"habérselo sacado."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Visual Impairment"
msgid_plural "Bionic Visual Impairments"
msgstr[0] "Discapacidad Visual Biónica"
msgstr[1] "Discapacidades Visuales Biónicas"

#. ~ Description for Bionic Visual Impairment
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "A defective bionic that impairs vision."
msgstr "Un biónico defectuoso que perjudica la visión."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Power Overload"
msgid_plural "Power Overloads"
msgstr[0] "Sobrecarga de Energía"
msgstr[1] "Sobrecargas de Energía"

#. ~ Description for Power Overload
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bunch of defective power circuits that are prone to short-circuiting."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de circuitos de energía defectuosos que son propensos a los "
"cortocircuitos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Short Circuit"
msgid_plural "Bionic Short Circuits"
msgstr[0] "Cortocircuito Biónico"
msgstr[1] "Cortocircuitos Biónicos"

#. ~ Description for Bionic Short Circuit
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "This bionic is poorly wired and occasionally short-circuits."
msgstr "Esta biónica está mal cableado y ocasionalmente sufre cortocircuitos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Endocrine Enervator"
msgid_plural "Endocrine Enervators"
msgstr[0] "Enervador Endocrino"
msgstr[1] "Enervadores Endocrinos"

#. ~ Description for Endocrine Enervator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This malfunctioning bionic causes fatigue by altering the unfortunate user's"
" brain chemistry."
msgstr ""
"Este biónico defectuoso causa fatiga al alterar la química del desafortunado"
" usuario."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Synaptic Regeneration System CBM"
msgid_plural "Synaptic Regeneration System CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Sistema de Regeneración Sináptica"

#. ~ Description for Synaptic Regeneration System CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An electromagnetic stimulator has been surgically implanted on the back of "
"your head and along your spine, continually draining power.  As long as it's"
" active, you won't become sleep deprived; and if you're sleep deprived "
"already, it will boost the rate of recovery."
msgstr ""
"Un potenciador electromagnético que ha sido implantado quirúrgicamente en tu"
" nuca y espina, drenando energía constantemente. Mientras esté activo, no "
"notarás falta de sueño, y si ya tienes falta de sueño, aumentará tu ratio de"
" recuperación."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Motor Control Overstimulator"
msgid_plural "Motor Control Overstimulators"
msgstr[0] "Sobreestimulador de Control Motor"
msgstr[1] "Sobreestimuladores de Control Motor"

#. ~ Description for Motor Control Overstimulator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The result of poor configuration, this bionic module frequently causes "
"debilitating muscle spasms."
msgstr ""
"Como resultado de una mala configuración, este módulo biónico causa "
"frecuentemente espasmos musculares debilitantes."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Wire-Induced Stiffness"
msgid_plural "Wire-Induced Stiffnesses"
msgstr[0] "Parálisis Inducida-Por-Cable"
msgstr[1] "Parálisis Inducida-Por-Cable"

#. ~ Description for Wire-Induced Stiffness
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "A length of poorly installed wiring that would cause stiffness."
msgstr "Una largo cableado mal instalado que causaría rigidez."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Self-Locking Thumbs"
msgid_plural "Self-Locking Thumbs"
msgstr[0] "Pulgares Auto-Bloqueantes"
msgstr[1] "Pulgares Auto-Bloqueantes"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Self-Locking Thumbs'}
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of faulty, self-locking thumb bionics."
msgstr "Un par de biónicos para el pulgar, defectuosos y con autobloqueo."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Visual Disruptor"
msgid_plural "Visual Disruptors"
msgstr[0] "Alterador Visual"
msgstr[1] "Alteradores Visuales"

#. ~ Description for Visual Disruptor
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of defective ocular bionics that cause visual distortion and "
"pixelation."
msgstr ""
"Un par de biónicos oculares defectuosos que causan distorsión visual y "
"pixelación."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Voice Remodulator"
msgid_plural "Voice Remodulators"
msgstr[0] "Remodulador de Voz"
msgstr[1] "Remoduladores de Voz"

#. ~ Description for Voice Remodulator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Part of the autodoc's 'Cyborg Identity Package', this bionic gives the user "
"a creepy robot voice."
msgstr ""
"Parte del \"Paquete de Identidad Cyborg\" del autodoc, este biónico le da al"
" usuario una espeluznante voz de robot."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Furnace CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Furnace CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Horno interno"
msgstr[1] "MCB Horno interno"

#. ~ Description for Internal Furnace CBM
#. ~ Description for Internal Furnace
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can use this bionic to burn energy dense organic material as fuel (use "
"'E'), recharging your power level.  Some materials will produce more power "
"than others."
msgstr ""
"Puedes usar este biónico para quemar material orgánico denso como el "
"combustible (usa la \"E\"), recargando tu nivel de energía. Algunos "
"materiales producirán más energía que otros."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Internal Storage CBM"
msgid_plural "Internal Storage CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Almacenamiento interno"
msgstr[1] "MCB Almacenamiento interno"

#. ~ Description for Internal Storage CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Space inside your chest cavity has been converted into a storage area.  You "
"may carry an extra 2 liters of volume."
msgstr ""
"El espacio dentro de la cavidad de tu pecho ha sido convertido en un lugar "
"de almacenamiento. Puedes transportar 2 litros extra por volumen."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Scent Vision CBM"
msgid_plural "Scent Vision CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Visión de olor"
msgstr[1] "MCB Visión de olor"

#. ~ Description for Scent Vision CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This system lets the user visually sense their own scent, making it possible"
" for them to recognize their surroundings even in complete darkness."
msgstr ""
"Este sistema permite al usuario percibir visualmente su propio olor, lo que "
"hace posible que reconozca su entorno incluso en la oscuridad total."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Solar Panels CBM"
msgid_plural "Solar Panels CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Paneles solares"
msgstr[1] "MCB Paneles solares"

#. ~ Description for Solar Panels CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Installed on your back is a set of retractable solar panels.  When in direct"
" sunlight, they will automatically deploy and slowly recharge your power "
"level."
msgstr ""
"En tu espalda hay instalado un conjunto de paneles solares retráctiles. "
"Cuando les da la luz solar directamente, se despliegan automáticamente y se "
"recargan hasta alcanzar tu nivel de energía."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Deployable Grenade Launcher CBM"
msgid_plural "Deployable Grenade Launcher CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Lanzagranadas desplegable"
msgstr[1] "MCBs Lanzagranadas desplegable"

#. ~ Description for Deployable Grenade Launcher CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, folding tube that attaches to your right arm.  Once implanted, it "
"can serve as a portable, integrated tool for firing 40mm grenades and "
"canisters."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño tubo plegable que se fija a tu brazo derecho. Una vez se "
"implanta, puede servir como una herramienta portátil integrada para lanzar "
"granadas de 40mm y latas."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Linguistic Coprocessor CBM"
msgid_plural "Linguistic Coprocessor CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Coprocesador Lingüístico"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Coprocesador Lingüístico"

#. ~ Description for Linguistic Coprocessor CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A microcomputer installed into the left hemisphere of your brain to increase"
" the speed that it processes language.  When installed, it provides a "
"passive boost to reading speed."
msgstr ""
"Es una microcomputadora instalada en el hemisferio izquierdo de tu cerebro "
"para incrementar la velocidad de procesamiento de lenguaje. Cuando está "
"instalado, acelera tu velocidad de lectura."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Dopamine Stimulators CBM"
msgid_plural "Dopamine Stimulators CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Estimulador de Dopamina"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Estimulador de Dopamina"

#. ~ Description for Dopamine Stimulators CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of tiny bionic nerve stimulators that install into the reward center "
"of your brain.  When run with bionic power, it periodically releases a hit "
"of dopamine and other reward chemicals, inducing a state of euphoria and "
"suppressing fear."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de diminutos estimuladores nerviosos biónicos que se instalan en"
" el centro de recompensa de tu cerebro. Cuando funciona con el poder "
"biónico, periódicamente libera un golpe de dopamina y otros químicos de "
"recompensa, induciendo un estado de euforia y suprimiendo el miedo."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Counteractive Reflexes CBM"
msgid_plural "Counteractive Reflexes CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Reflejos Contractivos"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Reflejos Contractivos"

#. ~ Description for Counteractive Reflexes CBM
#. ~ Description for Counteractive Reflexes
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cybernetic stimulators installed across your nervous system boost your "
"reflexes whenever you are hit in melee, granting you an extra action.  This "
"bionic must be active to function."
msgstr ""
"Los estimuladores cibernéticos instalados a través de tu sistema nervioso "
"potencian tus reflejos cada vez que te golpean en el combate cuerpo a "
"cuerpo, otorgándote una acción extra. Este biónico debe estar activo para "
"funcionar."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Melee Optimization Unit CBM"
msgid_plural "Melee Optimization Unit CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Unidad de Optimización de Cuerpo A Cuerpo"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Unidad de Optimización de Cuerpo A Cuerpo"

#. ~ Description for Melee Optimization Unit CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An implanted AI executes the optimal followup for each of your melee "
"strikes, allowing you to chain them with unnatural speed and grace.  This "
"bionic must be active to function."
msgstr ""
"Una IA implantada ejecuta el seguimiento óptimo para cada uno de tus golpes "
"cuerpo a cuerpo, permitiéndote encadenarlos con una velocidad y gracia "
"antinaturales. Esta biónico debe estar activo para funcionar."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Neurosoft: Aeronautics CBM"
msgid_plural "Neurosoft: Aeronautics CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Neurosoft: Aeronáutica"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Neurosoft: Aeronáutica"

#. ~ Description for Neurosoft: Aeronautics CBM
#. ~ Description for Neurosoft: Aeronautics
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A brain implant that grants instinctual knowledge about the operation of "
"flying machines."
msgstr ""
"Un implante cerebral que otorga un conocimiento instintivo sobre el "
"funcionamiento de las máquinas voladoras."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Cranium Bomb"
msgid_plural "Cranium Bombs"
msgstr[0] "Bomba de Cráneo"
msgstr[1] "Bombas de Cráneo"

#. ~ Description for Cranium Bomb
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bomb installed where your spine meets your brain stem.  It's on a timer "
"from installation and you don't have the codes to reset the timer."
msgstr ""
"Una bomba instalada donde la columna vertebral se encuentra con el tronco "
"cerebral. Está instalado con un temporizador y no tienes los códigos para "
"reiniciar el temporizador."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Skullgun CBM"
msgid_plural "Skullgun CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC arma cráneal"
msgstr[1] "MBCs arma cráneal"

#. ~ Description for Skullgun CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Concealed in your head is a single shot .40 pistol.  Activate the bionic to "
"fire and reload the skullgun."
msgstr ""
"Oculto en tu cabeza hay una pistola de un solo tiro de .40 Activa la biónica"
" para disparar y recargar la pistola del cráneo."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Emergency Insulation"
msgid_plural "Emergency Insulations"
msgstr[0] "Aislamiento de Emergencia"
msgstr[1] "Aislamientos de Emergencia"

#. ~ Description for Emergency Insulation
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A system designed to prevent instantaneous frostbite in workers exposed to "
"things like hard vacuum and liquid nitrogen."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema diseñado para prevenir la congelación instantánea en trabajadores"
" expuestos a cosas como el vacío y el nitrógeno líquido."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Precision Solderers CBM"
msgid_plural "Precision Solderers CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Soldador de precisión"
msgstr[1] "MCBs Soldador de precisión"

#. ~ Description for Precision Solderers CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of tiny electronics tools, including soldering irons and wire cutters."
"  They serve no purpose on their own, but are required for crafting bionics."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de pequeñas herramientas electrónicas, incluyendo soldadoras de "
"mano y tenazas cortaalambres. No sirven para nada por sí mismas, pero son "
"necesarias para fabricar biónicos."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Wind Turbine CBM"
msgid_plural "Wind Turbine CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Turbina de Viento"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Turbina de Viento"

#. ~ Description for Wind Turbine CBM
#. ~ Description for Wind Turbines
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Installed on your body is a set of small retractable wind turbines.  When "
"activated, they will deploy and slowly harvest wind power to recharge your "
"power level."
msgstr ""
"Instalado en tu cuerpo hay un conjunto de pequeñas turbinas de viento "
"retráctiles. Cuando se activan, se despliegan y cosechan lentamente la "
"energía del viento para recargar tu nivel de energía."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid "Ionic Overload Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Ionic Overload Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MCB Generador de Sobrecarga Iónica"
msgstr[1] "MCB Generador de Sobrecarga Iónica"

#. ~ Description for Ionic Overload Generator CBM
#. ~ Description for Ionic Overload Generator
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast.  The resulting blast ignites oxygen "
"creating fires as it moves and an explosion on impact.  Close range use is "
"highly discouraged."
msgstr ""
"Un poderoso generador de energía de iones es implantado en su pecho. Dispara"
" una poderosa explosión de energía en constante expansión. La explosión "
"resultante enciende el oxígeno creando incendios al moverse y una explosión "
"al impactar. Se desaconseja el uso a corta distancia."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Blood Power Generator CBM"
msgid_plural "Blood Power Generator CBMs"
msgstr[0] "MBC Generador de Poder Sanguíneo"
msgstr[1] "MBCs Generadores de Poder Sanguíneo"

#. ~ Description for Blood Power Generator CBM
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Using the latest advancement in technomancy this bionic is able to convert "
"the innate energy stored in blood into bionic power.  The stronger the blood"
" the better.  It can hold up to 100 mL of blood."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando la última tecnología en tecnomancia, este biónico es capaz de "
"convertir la energía interna almacenada en la sangre en energía biónica. "
"Cuanto más fuerte sea la sangre, mejor. Puede contener hasta 100 ml de "
"sangre."

#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement"
msgid_plural "Crystallized Mana Nose Replacements"
msgstr[0] "Reemplazo de la nariz de maná cristalizado"
msgstr[1] "Reemplazos de la nariz de maná cristalizado"

#. ~ Description for Crystallized Mana Nose Replacement
#: lang/json/BIONIC_ITEM_from_json.py lang/json/bionic_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large gem made with crystallized mana and some other stabilizing metals.  "
"Comes with a specially designed power pack (installed into the skull) that "
"does not interfere with your mana ley lines.  WARNING: for Technomancer use "
"only.  By using this spell you are waiving all liability of Frikken Laser "
"Beams Inc.  and its subsidiaries."
msgstr ""
"Una gran gema hecha con maná cristalizado y algunos otros metales "
"estabilizadores. Viene con un paquete de energía especialmente diseñado "
"(instalado en el cráneo) que no interfiere con las líneas de mana ley. "
"ADVERTENCIA: para uso exclusivo del tecnomante. Al usar este hechizo estás "
"renunciando a toda responsabilidad de Frikken Laser Beams Inc. y sus "
"subsidiarias."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "chicken walker schematics"
msgid_plural "chicken walker schematics"
msgstr[0] "esquema de gallina caminante"
msgstr[1] "esquemas de gallina caminante"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'chicken walker schematics'}
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Northrop, those are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the chicken walker.  Most of this is useless to you, "
"but you could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Con el logo de Northrop, son planos de montaje, especificaciones de diseño y"
" dibujos técnicos para la gallina caminante. La mayoría de esto es inútil "
"para ti, pero podrías usar los planos de ensamblaje para reensamblar el "
"robot a partir de las piezas recuperadas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "tank drone schematics"
msgid_plural "tank drone schematics"
msgstr[0] "esquema de dron tanque"
msgstr[1] "esquemas de dron tanque"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tank drone schematics'}
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Northrop, those are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the tank drone.  Most of this is useless to you, but "
"you could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Con el logo de Northrop, esos son los planos de montaje, especificaciones de"
" diseño, y dibujos técnicos para el dron tanque. La mayoría de esto es "
"inútil para ti, pero podrías usar los planos de ensamblaje para reensamblar "
"el robot a partir de las piezas recuperadas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "tripod schematics"
msgid_plural "tripod schematics"
msgstr[0] "esquema de trípode"
msgstr[1] "esquemas de trípode"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'tripod schematics'}
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bearing the logo of Honda, those are assembly plans, design specs, and "
"technical drawings for the tripod.  Most of this is useless to you, but you "
"could use the assembly plans to re-assemble the robot from salvaged parts."
msgstr ""
"Con el logo de Northrop, esos son los planos de montaje, especificaciones de"
" diseño, y dibujos técnicos para el dron tanque. La mayoría de esto es "
"inútil para ti, pero podrías usar los planos de ensamblaje para reensamblar "
"el robot a partir de las piezas recuperadas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "238-NK: Practicality Enhancement"
msgid_plural "copies of 238-NK: Practicality Enhancement"
msgstr[0] "238-NK: Mejora de la funcionalidad"
msgstr[1] "copias de 238-NK: Mejora de la funcionalidad"

#. ~ Description for 238-NK: Practicality Enhancement
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The authors of this thoroughly researched and documented proposal make a "
"very persuasive case for the adoption of spring-driven nuclear shells.  It's"
" stamped \"DENIED\"."
msgstr ""
"Los autores de esta propuesta investigada exhaustivamente y documentada, "
"presentan un caso muy convincente para la adopción de las carcasas "
"nucleares. Tiene un sello que dice \"RECHAZADO\"."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Museum of All Things Awesome and That Go Boom"
msgid_plural "copies of The Museum of All Things Awesome and That Go Boom"
msgstr[0] "El Museo de Todas las Cosas Asombrosas que Hacen Boom"
msgstr[1] "copias de El Museo de Todas las Cosas Asombrosas que Hacen Boom"

#. ~ Description for The Museum of All Things Awesome and That Go Boom
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Museum of All Things Awesome and That Go Boom is an anthology of science"
" fiction featuring blunt force trauma, explosions, adventure, derring-do, "
"tigers, Martians, zombies, fanged monsters, dinosaurs (alien and domestic), "
"ray guns, rocket ships, and anthropomorphized marshmallows.  Published by "
"Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""
"El Museo de Todas las Cosas Asombrosas y que Hacen Boom es una antología de "
"ciencia ficción que presenta traumas por fuerza contundente, explosiones, "
"aventuras, actos de destreza, tigres, marcianos, zombis, monstruos con "
"colmillos, dinosaurios (alienígenas y domésticos), pistolas de rayos, "
"cohetes y malvaviscos antropomorfizados. Publicado por Libros Zapato de Goma"
" Superior."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Sunvault: Stories of Solarpunk & Eco-Speculation"
msgid_plural "copies of Sunvault"
msgstr[0] "Bóveda Solar: Historias del Solarpunk & Eco-Especulación"
msgstr[1] "Copias de Bóveda Solar"

#. ~ Description for Sunvault: Stories of Solarpunk & Eco-Speculation
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sunvault is the first English-language anthology to broadly collect "
"solarpunk short fiction, artwork, and poetry.  A new genre for the 21st "
"Century, solarpunk is a revolution against despair.  Focusing on solutions "
"to environmental disasters, solarpunk envisions a future of green, "
"sustainable energy used by societies that value inclusiveness, cooperation, "
"and personal freedom.  Published by Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""
"Sunvault es la primera antología en lengua inglesa que recoge ampliamente la"
" ficción corta, el arte y la poesía solarpunk. El solarpunk, un nuevo género"
" para el siglo XXI, es una revolución contra la desesperación. Centrado en "
"las soluciones a los desastres medioambientales, el solarpunk imagina un "
"futuro de energía verde y sostenible utilizado por sociedades que valoran la"
" inclusión, la cooperación y la libertad personal. Publicado por Libros "
"Zapato de Goma Superior"

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Sharp & Sugar Tooth"
msgid_plural "copies of Sharp & Sugar Tooth"
msgstr[0] "Diente Azúcar & Afilado"
msgstr[1] "copias de Diente de Azúcar & Afilado"

#. ~ Description for Sharp & Sugar Tooth
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sharp & Sugar Tooth: Women Up To No Good is a horror anthology of dark "
"fiction and darker appetites, edited by Octavia Cade.  Containing 22 stories"
" of “bad” women, and “good” women who just haven’t been caught yet, it "
"features 22 fearless writers who identify as female, non-binary, or a "
"marginalized sex or gender identity.  Published by Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""
"Sharp & Sugar Tooth: Women Up To No Good es una antología de terror de "
"ficción oscura y apetitos más oscuros, editada por Octavia Cade. Contiene 22"
" historias de mujeres \"malas\" y mujeres \"buenas\" que aún no han sido "
"atrapadas, y presenta a 22 intrépidos escritores que se identifican como "
"mujeres, no binarios o con una identidad de sexo o género marginada. "
"Publicado por Libros Zapato de Goma Superior."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Broad Knowledge"
msgid_plural "copies of Broad Knowledge"
msgstr[0] "Amplios Conocimientos"
msgstr[1] "copias de Amplios Conocimientos"

#. ~ Description for Broad Knowledge
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Broad Knowledge: 35 Women Up To No Good is a feminist anthology of dark "
"fiction and darker knowledge, edited by Joanne Merriam.  Containing 35 "
"stories of “bad” women, and “good” women who just haven’t been caught yet.  "
"Published by Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""
"Amplios conocimientos: 35 Women Up To No Good es una antología feminista de "
"ficción oscura y conocimiento más oscuro, editada por Joanne Merriam. "
"Contiene 35 historias de mujeres \"malas\" y de mujeres \"buenas\" que aún "
"no han sido atrapadas. Publicado por Libros Zapato de Goma Superior."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Choose Wisely"
msgid_plural "copies of Choose Wisely"
msgstr[0] "Elige Sabiamente"
msgstr[1] "copias de Elige Sabiamente"

#. ~ Description for Choose Wisely
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Choose Wisely: 35 Women Up To No Good is a feminist anthology of dark "
"fiction, co-edited by H. L. Nelson and Joanne Merriam.  Containing 35 "
"stories of “bad” women, and “good” women who just haven’t been caught yet, "
"it features Joyce Carol Oates, Aimee Bender, Diane Cook, and 33 other "
"fearless women writers.  Published by Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""
"Elige sabiamente: 35 Women Up To No Good es una antología feminista de "
"ficción oscura, coeditada por H. L. Nelson y Joanne Merriam. Contiene 35 "
"historias de mujeres \"malas\" y de mujeres \"buenas\" que aún no han sido "
"atrapadas, y en ella aparecen Joyce Carol Oates, Aimee Bender, Diane Cook y "
"otras 33 intrépidas escritoras. Publicado por Libros Zapato de Goma "
"Superior."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Apocalypse Now"
msgid_plural "copies of Apocalypse Now"
msgstr[0] "copia de Apocalipsis Ahora"
msgstr[1] "copias de Apocalipsis Ahora"

#. ~ Description for Apocalypse Now
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Every society and every generation has its version of the apocalypse: swine "
"flu, genetic mutation, global warming, nuclear fallout, the second coming, "
"peak oil, mass extinction, giant irradiated ants, zombies… Apocalypse Now: "
"Poems and Prose from the End of Days is the first anthology of its kind to "
"bring together the poetry and prose of some of America’s finest (though not "
"always most well-known) literary voices with an eye for the literary and the"
" popular, for story and lyric, for the past and the future, for the "
"psychological and the physical, for the real and the fantastic.  Published "
"by Upper Rubber Boot Books."
msgstr ""
"Cada sociedad y cada generación tiene su versión del apocalipsis: la gripe "
"porcina, la mutación genética, el calentamiento global, la lluvia "
"radiactiva, la segunda venida, el pico del petróleo, la extinción masiva, "
"las hormigas gigantes irradiadas, los zombis... Apocalipsis Ahora: Poemas y "
"prosa del fin de los días es la primera antología de este tipo que reúne la "
"poesía y la prosa de algunas de las mejores voces literarias de Estados "
"Unidos (aunque no siempre las más conocidas) con un ojo puesto en lo "
"literario y lo popular, en el relato y la lírica, en el pasado y el futuro, "
"en lo psicológico y lo físico, en lo real y lo fantástico. Publicado por "
"Libros Zapato de Goma Superior."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "How to Live on Other Planets: A Handbook for Aspiring Aliens"
msgid_plural "copies of How to Live on Other Planets"
msgstr[0] ""
"Cómo vivir en otros planetas: Manual para Aspirantes a Extraterrestres"
msgstr[1] "copias de Como Vivir En Otros Planetas"

#. ~ Description for How to Live on Other Planets: A Handbook for Aspiring
#. Aliens
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"How to Live on Other Planets: A Handbook for Aspiring Aliens explores the "
"immigrant experience in a science fiction setting, with exciting fiction and"
" poetry from some of the genre’s best writers.  Published by Upper Rubber "
"Boot Books."
msgstr ""
"Cómo vivir en otros planetas: Manual para Aspirantes a Extraterrestres "
"explora la experiencia del inmigrante en un entorno de ciencia ficción, con "
"emocionantes obras de ficción y poesía de algunos de los mejores escritores "
"del género. Publicado por Libros Zapato de Goma Superior."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "archery skill training abstract"
msgid_plural "archery skill training abstracts"
msgstr[0] "abstracto de entrenamiento de habilidad de tiro con arco"
msgstr[1] "abstractos de entrenamiento de habilidad de tiro con arco"

#. ~ Description for archery skill training abstract
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "template for heavy books that confer archery skill training"
msgstr ""
"plantilla para los libros pesados que confieren la formación de habilidades "
"de tiro con arco"

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter"
msgid_plural "copies of Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter"
msgstr[0] "Lecciones para el Cazador con Arco Novato"
msgstr[1] "copias de Lecciones para el Cazador con Arco Novato"

#. ~ Description for Lessons for the Novice Bowhunter
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This hefty paperback book contains all the information needed for novice "
"archers to get started hunting with a variety of bows and crossbows."
msgstr ""
"Este robusto libro en rústica contiene toda la información necesaria para "
"que el arquero principiante pueda comenzar a cazar con una variedad de arcos"
" y ballestas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Zen and the Art of Archery"
msgid_plural "copies of Zen and the Art of Archery"
msgstr[0] "Zen y el Arte del Tiro con Arco"
msgstr[1] "copias de Zen y el Arte del Tiro con Arco"

#. ~ Description for Zen and the Art of Archery
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This massive book contains a wealth of vital information for the novice "
"archer."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme libro contiene mucha información vital para el arquero novato."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Archery for Kids"
msgid_plural "issues of Archery for Kids"
msgstr[0] "Tiro con Arco para Niños"
msgstr[1] "fascículos de Tiro con Arco para Niños"

#. ~ Description for Archery for Kids
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Will you be able to place the arrow right into the bullseye?  It is not that"
" easy, but once you know how it's done, you will have a lot of fun with "
"archery."
msgstr ""
"¿Serás capaz de clavar la flecha en el medio de la diana? No es fácil, pero "
"una vez que sepas cómo se hace, te vas a divertir mucho con en tiro con "
"arco."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "car buyer's guide"
msgid_plural "car buyer's guides"
msgstr[0] "catálogo de coches"
msgstr[1] "catálogos de coches"

#. ~ Description for car buyer's guide
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Normally this glossy, ad-filled magazine about cars would be pointless, but "
"it has a series of articles on haggling techniques."
msgstr ""
"Esta revista brillante, llena de publicidades acerca de coches sería "
"normalmente inservible, pero tiene artículos sobre técnicas para regatear "
"precios."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "How to Succeed in Business"
msgid_plural "copies of How to Succeed in Business"
msgstr[0] "Cómo Tener Éxito en los Negocios"
msgstr[1] "copias de Cómo Tener Éxito en los Negocios"

#. ~ Description for How to Succeed in Business
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Useful if you want to get a good deal when purchasing goods."
msgstr "Es útil si quieres obtener un buen negocio cuando compras cosas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Advanced Economics"
msgid_plural "copies of Advanced Economics"
msgstr[0] "Economía Avanzada"
msgstr[1] "copias de Economía Avanzada"

#. ~ Description for Advanced Economics
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "A college textbook on economics."
msgstr "Un texto escolar sobre economía."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Batter Up!"
msgid_plural "issues of Batter Up!"
msgstr[0] "¡Batear!"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de ¡Batear!"

#. ~ Description for Batter Up!
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A baseball magazine that focuses on batting tips.  There are lots of "
"colorful, full-page photos of skilled athletes demonstrating proper form and"
" technique."
msgstr ""
"Una revista sobre béisbol que se especializa en consejos para batear. Está "
"lleno de fotos de página completa a todo color de atletas demostrando la "
"técnica correcta."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "tactical baton defense manual"
msgid_plural "tactical baton defense manuals"
msgstr[0] "manual de defensa con bastón táctico"
msgstr[1] "manuales de defensa con bastón táctico"

#. ~ Description for tactical baton defense manual
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An informative guide to self-defense using clubs and batons.  Aimed at the "
"law enforcement and military market, it is packed with time tested, no-"
"nonsense information and written to be understandable for beginners."
msgstr ""
"Una guía informativa para la defensa personal usando garrotes y bastones. "
"Escrito para el mercado militar y policial, está lleno de información "
"comprobada y escrita para que lo pueda comprender un principiante."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Advanced Physical Chemistry"
msgid_plural "copies of Advanced Physical Chemistry"
msgstr[0] "Química Física Avanzada"
msgstr[1] "copias de Química Física Avanzada"

#. ~ Description for Advanced Physical Chemistry
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A university-level textbook on advanced principles of physical chemistry and"
" all its branches: thermochemistry, electrochemistry, solid-state chemistry,"
" photochemistry, quantum chemistry et cetera."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de texto de nivel universitario sobre principios avanzados de "
"química física y todas sus ramas: termoquímica, electroquímica, química del "
"estado sólido, fotoquímica, química cuántica, etc."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Modern Tanner"
msgid_plural "copies of The Modern Tanner"
msgstr[0] "El Curtidor Moderno"
msgstr[1] "copias de El Curtidor Moderno"

#. ~ Description for The Modern Tanner
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An in-depth and easy to read guide that details a very modern take on the "
"ancient art of leather tanning."
msgstr ""
"Una guía profunda y fácil de leer que detalla una visión muy moderna del "
"antiguo arte del curtido del cuero."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "PE050 \"Alpha\": Preliminary Report"
msgid_plural "copies of PE050 \"Alpha\": Preliminary Report"
msgstr[0] "PE050 \"Alfa\": Informe Preliminar"
msgstr[1] "copias de PE050 \"Alfa\": Informe Preliminar"

#. ~ Description for PE050 "Alpha": Preliminary Report
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers--dated two weeks before all this started--describes "
"some new chemical formula, and its effects on human subjects.  It's stamped "
"\"APPROVED\"…"
msgstr ""
"Este montón de papeles, fechados dos semanas antes de que todo esto "
"empezara, describe alguna nueva fórmula química, y sus efectos en los "
"sujetos humanos. Tiene el sello de \"APROBADO\"..."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "lab journal-Dionne"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Dionne"
msgstr[0] "registro de laboratorio-Dionne"
msgstr[1] "registros de laboratorio-Dionne"

#. ~ Description for lab journal-Dionne
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This team logbook details several varieties of mutagenic experiments, "
"focusing on those derived from various Earth fauna.  The team seems quite "
"enthusiastic--if not eager--about their results."
msgstr ""
"Este registro del equipo de trabajo detalla diversas variedades de "
"experimentos con mutágenos, centrándose en aquellos derivados de la variada "
"fauna terrestre. El equipo parece bastante entusiasta (incluso ansioso) con "
"de sus resultados."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "PE065 \"Chimera\": Best Practices"
msgid_plural "copies of PE065 \"Chimera\": Best Practices"
msgstr[0] "PE065 \"Quimera\": Mejores Prácticas"
msgstr[1] "copias de PE065 \"Quimera\": Mejores Prácticas"

#. ~ Description for PE065 "Chimera": Best Practices
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers describes a new chemical formula in detail and supplies"
" instructions for its use as some sort of… crowd-control catalyst?  That "
"can't be right…"
msgstr ""
"Este montón de papeles describe una nueva fórmula química en detalle y "
"proporciona instrucciones para su uso como una especie de... ¿catalizador de"
" control de masas? Eso no puede ser correcto..."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "lab journal-Smythe"
msgid_plural "lab journals-Smythe"
msgstr[0] "registro de laboratorio-Smythe"
msgstr[1] "registros de laboratorio-Smythe"

#. ~ Description for lab journal-Smythe
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This team logbook details several varieties of mutagenic experiments, "
"focusing on those derived from flesh contaminated with XE037.  The results "
"look promising but the procurement methods seem awfully vague…"
msgstr ""
"Este cuaderno de bitácora del equipo detalla varias variedades de "
"experimentos mutagénicos, centrándose en los derivados de la carne "
"contaminada con XE037. Los resultados parecen prometedores, pero los métodos"
" de obtención parecen muy vagos..."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "standpipe maintenance log"
msgid_plural "standpipe maintenance logs"
msgstr[0] "registro de mantenimiento de tuberías"
msgstr[1] "registros de mantenimiento de tuberías"

#. ~ Description for standpipe maintenance log
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This binder details the scheduled maintenance for several plumbing systems "
"throughout the facility.  However, some of the log sheets seem to be filled "
"with… a chemical formula?"
msgstr ""
"Esta carpeta detalla el mantenimiento programado para varios sistemas de "
"plomería en toda la instalación. Sin embargo, algunas de las hojas de "
"registro parecen estar llenas de... ¿una fórmula química?"

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "chemical reference-CLASSIFIED"
msgid_plural "chemical references-CLASSIFIED"
msgstr[0] "referencia química-CLASIFICADO"
msgstr[1] "referencias químicas-CLASIFICADO"

#. ~ Description for chemical reference-CLASSIFIED
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This somewhat technical binder has several intimidating security warnings on"
" the cover, yet guarantees unauthorized readers \"permanent employment, for "
"life\".  It contains useful information on \"basic\" chemical projects like "
"methamphetamine and heroin, along with briefing on things called \"XE037\" "
"and \"PE012\"."
msgstr ""
"Esta carpeta bastante técnica tiene varias advertencias intimidatorias de "
"seguridad en la tapa, y aún así, garantiza a los lectores no autorizados "
"\"empleo permanente, para toda la vida\". Contiene información útil acerca "
"de proyectos químicos \"básicos\" como la metanfetamina y la heroína, con "
"instrucciones acerca de algo llamado \"XE037\" y \"PE012\"."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "lab journal-x-|xp"
msgid_plural "lab journals-x-|xp"
msgstr[0] "registro de laboratorio-x-lxp"
msgstr[1] "registros de laboratorio-x-lxp"

#. ~ Description for lab journal-x-|xp
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This damaged team logbook lacks (deliberately?) any identifying information,"
" but still contains useful information on several types of mutagen and their"
" development."
msgstr ""
"Este registro dañado del equipo de trabajo no tiene (¿a propósito?) "
"información que lo identifique, pero de todas maneras contiene información "
"útil en varias clases de mutágeno y su desarrollo."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "PE023 \"Medical\": Application and Findings"
msgid_plural "copies of PE023 \"Medical\": Application and Findings"
msgstr[0] "PE023 \"Médico\": Aplicación y hallazgos"
msgstr[1] "copias del PE023 \"Médico\": Aplicación y hallazgos"

#. ~ Description for PE023 "Medical": Application and Findings
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This binder of highly technical papers describes some new chemical formula, "
"and its effects on human subjects.  It's stamped \"APPROVED\"…"
msgstr ""
"Esta carpeta de documentos altamente técnicos describe alguna nueva fórmula "
"química, y sus efectos en los sujetos humanos. Tiene el sello de "
"\"APROBADO\"..."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "PE070 \"Raptor\": Proposal"
msgid_plural "copies of PE070 \"Raptor\": Proposal"
msgstr[0] "PE070 \"Raptor\": Propuesta"
msgstr[1] "copias del PE070 \"Raptor\": Propuesta"

#. ~ Description for PE070 "Raptor": Proposal
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This sheaf of papers is a highly speculative proposal for focusing "
"\"PE065\".  Scribbled notes throughout seem to think that it might work, but"
" that there's no time."
msgstr ""
"Este manojo de artículos es una propuesta muy especulativa para concentrar "
"el \"PE065\". Los garabatos parecen decir que puede funcionar, pero que ya "
"no hay tiempo."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Best Practices for Compound Delivery"
msgid_plural "copies of Best Practices for Compound Delivery"
msgstr[0] "Mejores Prácticas para Suministrar Compuestos"
msgstr[1] "copias de Mejores Prácticas para Suministrar Compuestos"

#. ~ Description for Best Practices for Compound Delivery
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This internal manual details several varieties of mutagenic experiments, as "
"well as describing the protocols used to concentrate mutagens for quicker "
"results.  The authors recommend that researchers ensure that their subjects "
"are well-fed and in good health, as the concentrated serums draw heavily on "
"subjects' bodies."
msgstr ""
"Este manual detalla diversas variedades de experimentos con mutágenos, así "
"como también describe los protocolos utilizados para concentrar mutágenos "
"para resultados más rápidos. Los autores recomiendan que los investigadores "
"aseguran que sus sujetos están bien alimentados y en buen estado de salud, "
"porque el suero concentrado dependen del cuerpo del sujeto."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "CRC-Merck Handbook, 4th edition"
msgid_plural "copies of CRC-Merck Handbook, 4th edition"
msgstr[0] "Manual de CRC-Merck, 4ª edición"
msgstr[1] "copias del Manual de CRC-Merck, 4ª edición"

#. ~ Description for CRC-Merck Handbook, 4th edition
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This huge hardbound book is a collection of reference data and formulae "
"pertinent to many technical disciplines.  If poring over tables of chemical "
"and physical data is your thing, this is the book for you."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme libro de tapa dura es una colección de datos de referencia y "
"fórmulas pertinentes para muchas disciplinas técnicas. Si lo tuyo es "
"analizar las tablas de datos químicos y físicos, este es el libro para ti."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "chemistry textbook"
msgid_plural "chemistry textbooks"
msgstr[0] "libro de texto de química"
msgstr[1] "libros de texto de química"

#. ~ Description for chemistry textbook
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "A college textbook on chemistry."
msgstr "Un libro escolar sobre química."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Essential Oil Enthusiasts Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of The Essential Oil Enthusiasts Handbook"
msgstr[0] "Manual para Entusiastas de Aceites Esenciales"
msgstr[1] "copias del Manual para Entusiastas de Aceites Esenciales"

#. ~ Description for The Essential Oil Enthusiasts Handbook
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy hardback book explaining the process of essential oil making, with "
"schematics for the equipment to do it.  Good luck, and don't blow yourself "
"up!"
msgstr ""
"Un pesado libro de tapa dura que explica el proceso de fabricación de "
"aceites esenciales, con esquemas del equipo para hacerlo. ¡Buena suerte, y "
"no te vueles por los aires!"

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Art and Science of Chemical Warfare"
msgid_plural "copies of Art and Science of Chemical Warfare"
msgstr[0] "Arte y Ciencia de la Guerra Química"
msgstr[1] "copias de Arte y Ciencia de la Guerra Química"

#. ~ Description for Art and Science of Chemical Warfare
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This in-depth and technical text covers the design, development, "
"dissemination of, and defenses against various chemical weapons throughout "
"the centuries.  The photographs the author chose make it a difficult read at"
" times, though the information is top-notch."
msgstr ""
"Este texto técnico y detallado, explica el diseño, desarrollo, diseminación "
"y defensas contra varias armas químicas a lo largo de los siglos. Las "
"fotografías que el autor seleccionó lo hacen un poco difícil de leer, aunque"
" la información es de lo mejor."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Chemistry for Kids: Awesome Science Experiments that Really Work"
msgid_plural ""
"copies of Chemistry for Kids: Awesome Science Experiments that Really Work"
msgstr[0] ""
"Química para Niños: Impresionantes Experimentos Científicos que Realmente "
"Funcionan"
msgstr[1] ""
"copias de Química para Niños: Impresionantes Experimentos Científicos que "
"Realmente Funcionan"

#. ~ Description for Chemistry for Kids: Awesome Science Experiments that
#. Really Work
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A book with comprehensive and accurate step-by-step illustrated instructions"
" for many scientific experiments for young researchers and anyone else who "
"want to delve into an amazing world of chemistry."
msgstr ""
"Un libro con instrucciones ilustradas exhaustivas y precisas paso a paso "
"para muchos experimentos científicos para jóvenes investigadores y cualquier"
" persona que quiera profundizar en el asombroso mundo de la química."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Biodiesel: Renewable Fuel Resource"
msgid_plural "copies of Biodiesel: Renewable Fuel Resource"
msgstr[0] "Biodiesel: Fuente de Combustible Renovable"
msgstr[1] "copias de Biodiesel: Fuente de Combustible Renovable"

#. ~ Description for Biodiesel: Renewable Fuel Resource
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "A large textbook for college students about biodiesel."
msgstr "Es un manual para estudiantes acerca del biodiésel."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "SICP"
msgid_plural "copies of SICP"
msgstr[0] "SICP"
msgstr[1] "copias de SICP"

#. ~ Description for SICP
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A classic text, \"The Structure and Interpretation of Computer Programs.\" "
"Written with examples in LISP, but applicable to any language."
msgstr ""
"Un texto clásico, \"Estructura e Interpretación de los Programas de "
"Computación\". Escrito con ejemplos en LISP pero aplicable a cualquier "
"lenguaje."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Computer Science 301"
msgid_plural "copies of Computer Science 301"
msgstr[0] "Ciencia de la Computación 301"
msgstr[1] "copias de Ciencia de la Computación 301"

#. ~ Description for Computer Science 301
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "A college textbook on computer science."
msgstr "Un texto escolar sobre las ciencias de la computación."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "How to Browse the Web"
msgid_plural "copies of How to Browse the Web"
msgstr[0] "Cómo Navegar por la Web"
msgstr[1] "copias de Cómo Navegar por la Web"

#. ~ Description for How to Browse the Web
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Very beginner-level information about computers."
msgstr "Información sobre informática para principiantes."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Computer World"
msgid_plural "issues of Computer World"
msgstr[0] "Computer World"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de Computer World"

#. ~ Description for Computer World
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An informative magazine all about computers, both hardware and software."
msgstr ""
"Una revista informativa acerca de informática, tanto hardware como software."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Computer Science 101"
msgid_plural "copies of Computer Science 101"
msgstr[0] "Ciencia de la Computación 101"
msgstr[1] "copias de Ciencia de la Computación 101"

#. ~ Description for Computer Science 101
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "An entry-level textbook about computers."
msgstr "Un libro de texto sobre ordenadores de nivel básico."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Advanced Programming"
msgid_plural "copies of Principles of Advanced Programming"
msgstr[0] "Principios de Programación Avanzada"
msgstr[1] "copias de Principios de Programación Avanzada"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Advanced Programming
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy textbook dedicated to advanced-level software design, written for "
"several different programming languages."
msgstr ""
"Un libro pesado dedicado al diseño de software de nivel avanzado, escrito "
"para diferentes lenguajes de programación."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Homebrewer's Bible"
msgid_plural "copies of The Homebrewer's Bible"
msgstr[0] "La Biblia del Cervecero"
msgstr[1] "copias de La Biblia del Cervecero"

#. ~ Description for The Homebrewer's Bible
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A book full of easy-to-follow recipes and useful advice on homebrewing, "
"malting, and fermenting.  It even smells faintly of booze."
msgstr ""
"Un libro lleno de recetas fáciles de hacer y consejos útiles sobre hacer "
"cerveza en casa, transformar en malta y la fermentación. Incluso tiene un "
"olorcito a alcohol."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Cooking on a Budget"
msgid_plural "copies of Cooking on a Budget"
msgstr[0] "Cocinando con Presupuesto"
msgstr[1] "copias de Cocinando con Presupuesto"

#. ~ Description for Cooking on a Budget
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A nice cook book that goes beyond recipes and into the chemistry of food."
msgstr ""
"Un lindo libro de cocina que va más allá de las recetas, cubre también la "
"química de la comida."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "To Serve Man"
msgid_plural "copies of To Serve Man"
msgstr[0] "Servir al Hombre"
msgstr[1] "copias de Servir al Hombre"

#. ~ Description for To Serve Man
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "It's… it's a cookbook!"
msgstr "Es... ¡es un libro de cocina!"

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Cucina Italiana"
msgid_plural "copies of Cucina Italiana"
msgstr[0] "Cucina Italiana"
msgstr[1] "copias de Cucina Italiana"

#. ~ Description for Cucina Italiana
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This cookbook is written in Italian, but handily illustrated with step by "
"step photo instructions."
msgstr ""
"Este libro de recetas está escrito en italiano, pero convenientemente "
"ilustrado con fotografías paso por paso."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Sushi Made Easy"
msgid_plural "copies of Sushi Made Easy"
msgstr[0] "Sushi con Facilidad"
msgstr[1] "copias de Sushi con Facilidad"

#. ~ Description for Sushi Made Easy
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple text for the aspiring sushi lover, this easy to read guide is "
"filled with lots of helpful illustrations for everything from basic rice "
"preparation to setting a proper Japanese table."
msgstr ""
"Un texto simple para el amante del sushi. Esta guía fácil de leer está llena"
" con ilustraciones para todo, desde la preparación básica del arroz hasta "
"cómo poner adecuadamente la mesa a la japonesa."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "family cookbook"
msgid_plural "family cookbooks"
msgstr[0] "libro de recetas familiares"
msgstr[1] "libros de recetas familiares"

#. ~ Description for family cookbook
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A big binder full of somebody's family recipes.  The well-turned pages and "
"creased corners speak volumes of the culinary knowledge contained within.  "
"You could probably learn a lot about cooking from studying this domestic "
"artifact."
msgstr ""
"Una gran carpeta llena de recetas de alguna familia. Las elegantes páginas y"
" esquinas arrugadas nos da una idea de la cantidad de conocimiento culinario"
" que contiene. Probablemente, puedas aprender mucho sobre cocina estudiando "
"este libro casero."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Bon Appetit"
msgid_plural "issues of Bon Appetit"
msgstr[0] "Bon Appetit"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de Bon Appetit"

#. ~ Description for Bon Appetit
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Exciting recipes and restaurant reviews.  Full of handy tips about cooking."
msgstr ""
"Libro con recetas apasionantes y reseñas de restaurantes. Lleno de consejos "
"útiles para cocinar."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Glamopolitan"
msgid_plural "issues of Glamopolitan"
msgstr[0] "Glamopolitan"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de Glamopolitan"

#. ~ Description for Glamopolitan
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a full-size glossy women's magazine.  There are a few unoriginal "
"recipes and some simple cooking tips somewhere in between the fashion photos"
" and the sex advice columns."
msgstr ""
"Una revista brillante para mujeres. Tiene algunas recetas poco originales y "
"simples consejos de cocina entre las fotos de moda y las columnas sobre "
"sexo."

#. ~ That would translate out to The Scottish Book of Cookery, or The Scottish
#. Cookbook.
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgid_plural "copies of Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgstr[0] "Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"
msgstr[1] "copias de Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery"

#. ~ Description for Ye Scots Beuk o Cuikery
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-translated Gaelic cookbook from sixteenth century Scotland.  While a "
"bit difficult to read, as there are a disquieting number of illustrations of"
" people stabbing each other mixed with rants about 'True Scotsman', it "
"provides insights into medieval Scottish cuisine and culture."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de cocina gaélico semi-traducido de la Escocia del siglo XVI. "
"Aunque es un poco difícil de leer, ya que hay un número inquietante de "
"ilustraciones de personas apuñalándose unas a otras mezcladas con charlas "
"sobre el \"verdadero escocés\", proporciona una visión de la cocina y la "
"cultura escocesa medieval."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Vinegar Maker's Handbook"
msgstr[0] "Manual del Fabricante de Vinagre"
msgstr[1] "copias del Manual del Fabricante de Vinagre"

#. ~ Description for The Vinegar Maker's Handbook
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This book describes in detail all the ways that one can make vinegar.  You "
"would have thought that there wasn't much to making vinegar, but the girth "
"of this book tells you otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Este libro describe en detalle todas las maneras en que se puede hacer "
"vinagre. Seguro pensaste que no había mucha información sobre hacer vinagre,"
" pero el ancho de este libro te dice lo contrario."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Drink the Harvest"
msgid_plural "copies of Drink the Harvest"
msgstr[0] " Beber la Cosecha"
msgstr[1] "copias de Beber la Cosecha"

#. ~ Description for Drink the Harvest
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Canning foods doesn't have to stop with jam and pickles.  This book provides"
" a plethora of juices that can be preserved."
msgstr ""
"Los alimentos enlatados no tienen por qué detenerse con la mermelada y los "
"pepinillos. Este libro proporciona una plétora de zumos que pueden ser "
"conservados."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Offal Holiday Cooking"
msgid_plural "copies of Offal Holiday Cooking"
msgstr[0] "Cocina de Despojos para las Fiestas"
msgstr[1] "copias de Cocina de Despojos para las Fiestas"

#. ~ Description for Offal Holiday Cooking
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Offal Holiday Cooking, by Evelyn Turncoat, is a book of holiday recipes that"
" utilize organ meats from various animals.  For the true nose-to-tail cook."
msgstr ""
"Cocina de Despojos para las Fiestas, de Evelyn Turncoat, es un libro de "
"recetas para las fiestas que utiliza carne de órganos de varios animales. "
"Para el verdadero cocinero de nariz a cola."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Things to do with Milk"
msgid_plural "copies of Things to do with Milk"
msgstr[0] "Cosas que hacer con Leche"
msgstr[1] "copias de Cosas que hacer con Leche"

#. ~ Description for Things to do with Milk
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Whatever you want to do with milk, you will probably find it in this book."
msgstr ""
"Sea lo que quieras hacer con leche, probablemente lo encuentres en este "
"libro."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Liver-Licious Recipes Your Kids Will Love"
msgid_plural "copies of Liver-Licious Recipes"
msgstr[0] "Recetas para el hígado-cioso que Tus Hijos Querran"
msgstr[1] "copias de Recetas para el hígado-cioso."

#. ~ Description for Liver-Licious Recipes Your Kids Will Love
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This cookbook is written by liver enthusiast Tamsyn Beckerleg.  Inside "
"you'll find a great deal of anecdotes about the near-certain ruination of "
"children who refuse to eat their liver."
msgstr ""
"Este libro de cocina está escrito por el entusiasta del hígado Tamsyn "
"Beckerleg. Dentro encontrará muchas anécdotas sobre la casi segura ruina de "
"los niños que se niegan a comer su hígado."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Dainty Dishes Fit for a King"
msgid_plural "copies of Dainty Dishes"
msgstr[0] "Platos Exquisitos"
msgstr[1] "copias de Platos Exquisitos"

#. ~ Description for Dainty Dishes Fit for a King
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This cookbook contains many fanciful recipes.  Some of them are even worth "
"the trouble to actually prepare.  Lovely pen and ink illustrations of "
"overweight knights and gluttonous monks line the pages."
msgstr ""
"Este libro de cocina contiene muchas recetas extravagantes. Algunas de ellas"
" incluso valen la pena de ser preparadas. Adorables ilustraciones a pluma y "
"tinta de caballeros con sobrepeso y monjes glotones llenan las páginas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Eat Your Way to a Fit Physique"
msgid_plural "copies of Eat Your Way"
msgstr[0] "Comer a Tu Manera Para Tener un Buen Físico"
msgstr[1] "copias de Comer a tu Manera"

#. ~ Description for Eat Your Way to a Fit Physique
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This self-help book, by \"acclaimed nutrition and health guru Amar de "
"Freitas,\" is as dubious as its title.  Worse, it is boring.  It does, "
"however, contain a few basic cooking instructions."
msgstr ""
"Este libro de autoayuda, del \"aclamado gurú de la nutrición y la salud Amar"
" de Freitas\", es tan dudoso como su título. Peor aún, es aburrido. Sin "
"embargo, contiene algunas instrucciones básicas de cocina."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Food Fashions for Young Moderns"
msgid_plural "copies of Food Fashions"
msgstr[0] "Alimentos de Moda"
msgstr[1] "copias de Alimentos de Moda"

#. ~ Description for Food Fashions for Young Moderns
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cookbook professing itself to be for those seeking \"daring and "
"sophisticated flavors.\"  The book exhorts the reader to defy convention and"
" break the rules, and then presents a number of useful rules and conventions"
" for preparing food."
msgstr ""
"Un libro de cocina que dice ser para aquellos que buscan \"sabores atrevidos"
" y sofisticados\". El libro exhorta al lector a desafiar las convenciones y "
"a romper las reglas, y luego presenta una serie de reglas y convenciones "
"útiles para preparar la comida."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Winemaking for Beginners"
msgid_plural "copies of Winemaking for Beginners"
msgstr[0] "Vinicultor para Principiantes"
msgstr[1] "copias de Vinicultor para Principiantes"

#. ~ Description for Winemaking for Beginners
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Winemaking, is an art form.  This book teaches you how to crayon within the "
"lines."
msgstr ""
"La vinicultura, es una forma de arte. Este libro te enseña a dibujar con "
"lápiz de colores dentro de las líneas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "You Can Can at Home"
msgid_plural "copies of You Can Can at Home"
msgstr[0] "Tu Puedes Enlatar en Casa"
msgstr[1] "copias de Tu Puedes Enlatar en Casa"

#. ~ Description for You Can Can at Home
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This entry-level guide to home canning talks about the importance of acidity"
" and food contents in preservation, and how to avoid contaminants in your "
"canning batches."
msgstr ""
"Esta guía básica de enlatado en casa habla de la importancia de la acidez y "
"el contenido de los alimentos en la conservación, y de cómo evitar los "
"contaminantes en tus lotes de enlatado."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Can Sealer Instructions"
msgid_plural "copies of Can Sealer Instructions"
msgstr[0] "Instrucciones del Sellador de latas"
msgstr[1] "copias del Instrucciones del Sellador de latas"

#. ~ Description for Can Sealer Instructions
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This dry guide to a home-use tin can sealer goes into clear detail on "
"everything you can seal with the device and how to do it safely, and "
"includes some basic recipes."
msgstr ""
"Esta guía seca de un sellador de latas de uso casero explica con todo "
"detalle todo lo que se puede sellar con el dispositivo y cómo hacerlo de "
"forma segura, e incluye algunas recetas básicas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Baker's Companion"
msgid_plural "copies of The Baker's Companion"
msgstr[0] "El Compañero Panadero"
msgstr[1] "copias del El Compañero Panadero"

#. ~ Description for The Baker's Companion
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This book promises to teach you the ways of baking, from cakes to souffles."
msgstr ""
"Este libro promete enseñarte las formas de hornear, desde pasteles hasta "
"soufflés."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Fermenting Culture"
msgid_plural "copies of Fermenting Culture"
msgstr[0] "Fermentar Cultura"
msgstr[1] "copias de Fermentar Cultura"

#. ~ Description for Fermenting Culture
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fermenting as a cooking practice only recently came back into vogue before "
"the Cataclysm.  Here is a book with dozens of recipes, many of which you are"
" unlikely to ever see the ingredients for again."
msgstr ""
"Fermentar es una práctica de cocina que sólo recientemente volvió a estar de"
" moda antes del Cataclismo. Aquí hay un libro con docenas de recetas, muchas"
" de las cuales es poco probable que vuelvas a ver los ingredientes."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Out of the Holler and into the Home: A guide to home distillation"
msgid_plural "copies of Out of the Holler"
msgstr[0] ""
"Fuera del Holler y dentro del Hogar: Una guía para la destilación casera"
msgstr[1] "copias de Fuera del Holler"

#. ~ Description for Out of the Holler and into the Home: A guide to home
#. distillation
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A book describing the history of at home distillation by liquor.  Each "
"chapter contains a complete recipe for its namesake."
msgstr ""
"Un libro que describe la historia de la destilación casera con licor. Cada "
"capítulo contiene una receta completa para su homónimo."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Sweets for your Sweet Child"
msgid_plural "copies of Sweets for Sweet"
msgstr[0] "Dulces para tu Dulce Hijo"
msgstr[1] "copias de Dulces para tu Dulce"

#. ~ Description for Sweets for your Sweet Child
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sweets for your Sweet Child is the best selling cooking book to the parents "
"of young children.  Every recipe uses oversized text, easy words and diagram"
" instructions for children learning to cook with their parents."
msgstr ""
"Dulces para tu Dulce Hijo es el libro de cocina más vendido a los padres de "
"niños pequeños. Cada receta utiliza un texto de gran tamaño, palabras "
"sencillas e instrucciones en forma de diagramas para los niños que aprenden "
"a cocinar con sus padres."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Pocket Survival Cookbook"
msgid_plural "copies of Pocket Survival Cookbook"
msgstr[0] "Guía de Cocina de Supervivencia de Bolsillo"
msgstr[1] "copias de la Guía de Cocina de  Supervivencia de Bolsillo"

#. ~ Description for Pocket Survival Cookbook
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The smallest cookbook on the market, marketed exclusively to the "
"outdoorsman.  Packs a surprising number of recipes for its tiny size."
msgstr ""
"El libro de cocina más pequeño del mercado, comercializado exclusivamente "
"para el hombre de campo. Contiene un número sorprendente de recetas para su "
"pequeño tamaño."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Tasting India"
msgid_plural "copies of Tasting India"
msgstr[0] "Saboreando La India"
msgstr[1] "copias de Saboreando La India"

#. ~ Description for Tasting India
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick hardcover book as much about Indian culture as it is a cookbook, "
"clearly written with adoration."
msgstr ""
"Un grueso libro de tapa dura tanto sobre la cultura india como un libro de "
"cocina, escrito claramente con adoración."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "All About Swords"
msgid_plural "issues of All About Swords"
msgstr[0] "Todo Sobre Espadas"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de Todo Sobre Espadas"

#. ~ Description for All About Swords
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An interesting magazine that contains information about swords and sword "
"fighting techniques from all across the world."
msgstr ""
"Una revista interesante que contiene información acerca de espadas y de las "
"técnicas de uso de las espadas de todo el mundo."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "knife fighter's notes"
msgid_plural "knife fighter's notes"
msgstr[0] "notas sobre luchador con cuchillo"
msgstr[1] "notas sobre luchador con cuchillo"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': "knife fighter's notes"}
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It seems to be a guide to edged weapon combat, poorly photocopied and "
"released on spiral- bound paper.  Still, there are lots of useful tips for "
"beginners."
msgstr ""
"Parece ser una guía para el combate con armas afiladas, mal fotocopiado y en"
" un cuaderno anillado. De todas maneras, tiene un montón de consejos útiles "
"para los principiantes."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "USMC Sword Manual Procedure"
msgid_plural "copies of USMC Sword Manual Procedures"
msgstr[0] "Procedimientos del Manual de la Espada USMC"
msgstr[1] "copias de Procedimientos del Manual de la Espada USMC"

#. ~ Description for USMC Sword Manual Procedure
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "A text on stationary sword drills in US Marine Corps."
msgstr ""
"Un texto sobre ejercicios de espada estacionarios en el Cuerpo de Marines de"
" los Estados Unidos."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Dance Dance Dance!"
msgid_plural "issues of Dance Dance Dance!"
msgstr[0] "¡Danza Danza Danza!"
msgstr[1] "ediciones de ¡Danza Danza Danza!"

#. ~ Description for Dance Dance Dance!
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Learn the moves of the trendiest dances right now."
msgstr "Aprendé los movimientos de los bailes de moda."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Book of Dances"
msgid_plural "copies of The Book of Dances"
msgstr[0] "El Libro de las Danzas"
msgstr[1] "copias de El Libro de las Danzas"

#. ~ Description for The Book of Dances
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This massive antique book documents dances from all around the world in "
"great detail.  A perceptive reader could learn a lot about defensive "
"footwork from some of the war dances."
msgstr ""
"Este libro enorme y antiguo documenta las danzas de todo el mundo con mucho "
"detalle. Un lector perceptivo puede aprender mucho sobre los movimientos de "
"pies defensivos de las danzas de guerra."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Break a Leg!"
msgid_plural "copies of Break a Leg!"
msgstr[0] "¡Rompe una pierna!"
msgstr[1] "copias de ¡Rompe una pierna!"

#. ~ Description for Break a Leg!
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "The Kids' Guide to Acting and Stagecraft."
msgstr "Es la Guía de Actuación y Arte Teatral para Niños."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing"
msgid_plural "copies of Western Dancing"
msgstr[0] "Tesoro de Leyendas sobre Bailes Occidentales"
msgstr[1] "copias de Bailes Occidentales"

#. ~ Description for Treasury of Legends about Western Dancing
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Written by Emanuel Nogueira, a constabulario and historian of Nuevo Laredo, "
"this massive book details the movements and cultural legacies of a variety "
"of North American folk dances."
msgstr ""
"Escrito por Emanuel Nogueira, un constabulario e historiador de Nuevo "
"Laredo, este enorme libro detalla los movimientos y legados culturales de "
"una variedad de danzas populares norteamericanas."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "AAA Guide"
msgid_plural "copies of AAA Guide"
msgstr[0] "Guía AAA"
msgstr[1] "copias de la Guía AAA"

#. ~ Description for AAA Guide
#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tourist-centric guide to points of interest throughout the country.  "
"Though it focuses on the north-central US, the driving sections contain some"
" practical tips on proper driving techniques."
msgstr ""
"Una guía orientada al turista de los puntos de interés en tu país. A pesar "
"de que está centrada en la parte norte del centro de EE.UU., la sección "
"sobre conducción tiene algunos consejos prácticos sobre las técnicas "
"adecuadas de conducción."

#: lang/json/BOOK_from_json.py
msgid "Top Gear magazine"
msgid_plural "Top Gear magazines"
