"This milkshake has been enhanced with added sweeteners, and even has a "
"cherry on top.  Tastes great, but is fairly awful for your health."
msgstr ""
"Este batido ha sido mejorado con edulcorantes añadidos, e incluso tiene una "
"cereza encima. Sabe muy bien, pero es bastante horrible para la salud."

