"This chocolate milkshake has been enhanced with added sweeteners, and even "
"has a cherry on top.  Tastes great, but is fairly awful for your health."
msgstr ""
"Este batido de chocolate ha sido mejorado con edulcorantes añadidos, e "
"incluso tiene una cereza encima. Sabe muy bien, pero es bastante horrible "
"para tu salud."

#: lang/json/COMESTIBLE_from_json.py
