msgstr[1] "software variado"

#. ~ Description for integrated circuit datasheet archives
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge archives of numerous IC circuit datasheets from several major "
"manufacturers.  Probably valuable to the right person, as it would be hard "
"to salvage and reuse these components without them."
msgstr ""
"Enormes archivos de numerosas hojas de datos de circuitos integrados de "
"varios fabricantes importantes. Probablemente valiosos para la persona "
"adecuada, ya que sería difícil salvar y reutilizar estos componentes sin "
"ellos."

