#. ~ Description for handwritten note
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, meticulously folded piece of paper, filled with tiny handwriting "
"and some surprisingly precise diagrams of subway tunnels, access codes, "
"ventilation shafts, and…guard shifts?  You have the feeling they weren't "
"supposed to write any of this stuff down."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño papel meticulosamente doblado, lleno de letra diminuta y algunos "
"diagramas sorprendentemente precisos de túneles de metro, códigos de acceso,"
" pozos de ventilación y... ¿turnos de guardia? Tienes la sensación de que no"
" debían escribir nada de esto."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "military operations map"
msgid_plural "military operations maps"
msgstr[0] "mapa de operaciones militares"
msgstr[1] "mapas de operaciones militares"

#. ~ Use action message for military operations map.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add roads and facilities to your map."
msgstr "Agregas calles e instalaciones útiles en tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for military operations map
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a printed topographical map of the local area.  Originally of "
"military origin, it details the locations of evacuation centers and military"
" facilities.  Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr ""
"Es un mapa impreso topográfico del área local. De origen militar, detalla "
"los lugares de los centros de evacuación y las instalaciones militares. Si "
"lo usas, agregas puntos de interés en tu mapa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "survivor's map"
msgid_plural "survivor's maps"
msgstr[0] "mapa de superviviente"
msgstr[1] "mapas de superviviente"

#. ~ Use action message for survivor's map.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add roads and possible supply points to your map."
msgstr "Agregas calles y posibles lugares de recursos en tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for survivor's map
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a hand-drawn map of the local area.  Whoever created it has marked "
"down the locations of nearby supply sources including gun stores and gas "
"stations.  Using it will add points of interest to your map."
msgstr ""
"Este es un mapa dibujado a mano del área local. Quienquiera que lo haya "
"creado ha marcado la ubicación de las fuentes de suministro cercanas, "
"incluyendo almacenes de armas y gasolineras. Usarlo añadirá puntos de "
"interés a su mapa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "road map"
msgid_plural "road maps"
msgstr[0] "mapa de caminos"
msgstr[1] "mapas de caminos"

#. ~ Use action message for road map.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add roads and points of interest to your map."
msgstr "Agregas calles y puntos de interés en tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for road map
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a road map for the local area.  Listing information on civic sites "
"like hospitals and police stations, it can be used to add points of interest"
" to your map."
msgstr ""
"Es un mapa de los caminos del área local. Tiene información acerca de sitios"
" como hospitales y comisarías. Puede ser usado para agregar puntos de "
"interés en tu mapa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "subway maintenance map"
msgid_plural "subway maintenance maps"
msgstr[0] "mapa de mantenimiento del metro"
msgstr[1] "mapas de mantenimiento del metro"

#. ~ Use action message for subway maintenance map.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr "Añades las líneas de metro y las estaciones de metro a tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for subway maintenance map
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a map of subway tunnels formerly used by public maintenance workers."
"  Using it will add subway lines and underground stations to your map."
msgstr ""
"Este es un mapa de los túneles del metro que antes usaban los trabajadores "
"de mantenimiento público. Usarlo añadirá líneas de metro y estaciones de "
"metro a tu mapa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "trail guide"
msgid_plural "trail guides"
msgstr[0] "guía de senderos"
msgstr[1] "guías de senderos"

#. ~ Use action message for trail guide.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add trails and trailheads to your map."
msgstr "Agregas los caminos y senderos en tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for trail guide
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a printed guide to the best local trails.  It has general details "
"about the trails, trailhead amenities, suggestions for the best thru-hikes, "
"and advice on interacting with local wildlife in a responsible and "
"respectful manner."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una guía impresa de los mejores senderos locales. Contiene detalles "
"generales sobre los senderos, servicios en la cabecera del sendero, "
"sugerencias para las mejores caminatas y consejos para interactuar con la "
"vida silvestre local de una manera responsable y respetuosa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "tourist guide"
msgid_plural "tourist guides"
msgstr[0] "guía de turismo"
msgstr[1] "guías de turismo"

#. ~ Use action message for tourist guide.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add roads and tourist attractions to your map."
msgstr "Agregas calles y atracciones turísticas en tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for tourist guide
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet for tourists that details local hotels and "
"attractions."
msgstr ""
"Es un folleto impreso brillante pensado para los turistas, detalla los "
"hoteles y las atracciones locales."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "restaurant guide"
msgid_plural "restaurant guides"
msgstr[0] "guía de restaurantes"
msgstr[1] "guías de restaurantes"

#. ~ Use action message for restaurant guide.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add roads and restaurants to your map."
msgstr "Agregas calles y restaurantes en tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for restaurant guide
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is glossy printed pamphlet that details dining establishments in the "
"local area.  Printed by the Chamber of Commerce, it lists the addresses of "
"all the best diners and bars.  Using it will add points of interest to your "
"map."
msgstr ""
"Es un folleto impreso brillante que detalla los establecimientos para ir a "
"comer en el área local. Impreso por la Cámara de Comercio, lista las "
"direcciones de todos los mejores restaurantes y bares. Si lo usas, agregas "
"puntos de interés en tu mapa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "satellite map"
msgid_plural "satellite maps"
msgstr[0] "mapa por satélite"
msgstr[1] "mapas por satélite"

#. ~ Use action message for satellite map.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr "Añades terreno y carreteras a tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for satellite map
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a printed satellite map of the local area.  Due to it's low quality "
"and lack of map legend, you are unable to recognise most buildings.  Using "
"it will add terrain and roads to your map."
msgstr ""
"Este es un mapa por satélite impreso de la zona local. Debido a su baja "
"calidad y a la falta de leyenda en el mapa, no podrás reconocer la mayoría "
"de los edificios. Si lo utilizas, añadirás terreno y carreteras a tu mapa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "juvenile sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "juvenile sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "iniciador juvenil de masa fermentada"
msgstr[1] "iniciadores juveniles de masa fermentada"

#. ~ Use action msg for juvenile sourdough starter.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"After feeding it and caring for it for a week, your sourdough starter is "
"finally ready for the big leagues."
msgstr ""
"Luego de alimentarla y cuidarla por semanas, el iniciador de masa madre está"
" finalmente preparado para jugar en las grandes ligas."

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for juvenile sourdough starter.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've been caring for your starter for a while, but it's going to need "
"longer before you can do anything tasty with it."
msgstr ""
"Has estado cuidando tu entrante por un tiempo, pero va a necesitar más "
"tiempo antes de que puedas hacer algo sabroso con él."

#. ~ Description for juvenile sourdough starter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This jar contains a floury paste that is slowly going bad.  Someday it will "
"be sourdough."
msgstr ""
"Este tarro contiene una pasta harinosa que se va estropeando poco a poco. "
"Algún día será masa madre."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "freshly fed sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "freshly fed sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "masa madre recién alimentada"
msgstr[1] "masas madre recién alimentadas"

#. ~ Use action msg for freshly fed sourdough starter.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "The starter is now stinky and bubbly, and looks ready for cooking."
msgstr ""
"La masa fermentada ahora tiene feo olor y burbujas, y parece lista para "
"cocinar."

#. ~ Use action not_ready_msg for freshly fed sourdough starter.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "The starter isn't quite ready to go."
msgstr "El arranque no está listo."

#. ~ Description for freshly fed sourdough starter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This jar contains a floury paste with sourdough starter mixed in.  It needs "
"a day to recover its strength before it can be used again."
msgstr ""
"Este tarro contiene una pasta harinosa con un iniciador de masa madre "
"mezclado. Necesita un dia para recuperar su fuerza antes de que pueda ser "
"usada de nuevo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "sourdough starter"
msgid_plural "sourdough starters"
msgstr[0] "masa madre"
msgstr[1] "masas madre"

#. ~ Description for sourdough starter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This jar contains a precious mix of flour, water, molds and bacteria from "
"the air.  When you add flour and water to it, after a few hours it froths "
"and rises."
msgstr ""
"Este tarro contiene una preciosa mezcla de harina, agua, moho y bacterias "
"del aire. Cuando le añades harina y agua, después de unas pocas horas hace "
"espuma y se eleva."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "human bone"
msgid_plural "human bones"
msgstr[0] "hueso humano"
msgstr[1] "huesos humanos"

#. ~ Description for human bone
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bone from a human being.  Could be used to make some stuff, if you're "
"feeling sufficiently ghoulish."
msgstr ""
"Es un hueso de un ser humano. Puede ser usado para hacer cosas, si te "
"sientes lo suficientemente morboso."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "demihuman bone"
msgid_plural "demihuman bones"
msgstr[0] "hueso demihumano"
msgstr[1] "huesos demihumanos"

#. ~ Description for demihuman bone
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bone from a demihuman being.  Could be used to make some stuff, if you're "
"feeling sufficiently ghoulish."
msgstr ""
"Un hueso de un ser demihumano. Puede ser usado para hacer algunas cosas, si "
"te sientes lo suficientemente macabro."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "corpse"
msgid_plural "corpses"
msgstr[0] "cuerpo"
msgstr[1] "cuerpos"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'corpse'} when FLAG matches FIELD_DRESS
#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'corpse'} when FLAG matches
#. FIELD_DRESS_FAILED
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "carcass"
msgid_plural "carcasses"
msgstr[0] "carcasa"
msgstr[1] "carcasas"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'corpse'} when FLAG matches SKINNED
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "skinned %s"
msgid_plural "skinned %s"
msgstr[0] " %sdespellejado"
msgstr[1] "%s despellejado"

#. ~ Conditional name for {'str': 'corpse'} when FLAG matches QUARTERED
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "carcass quarter"
msgid_plural "carcass quarters"
msgstr[0] "cuarto de carcasa"
msgstr[1] "cuartos de carcasa"

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead body."
msgstr "Es un cadáver."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "desiccated corpse"
msgid_plural "desiccated corpses"
msgstr[0] "cuerpo disecado"
msgstr[1] "cuerpos disecados"

#. ~ Description for desiccated corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dead body, badly mangled and desiccated.  It seems whatever killed him did"
" so with a gigantic claw."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver, muy destrozado y disecado. Parece que lo que lo mató lo hizo con"
" una garra gigante."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead human body."
msgstr "Un cuerpo humano muerto."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead body of a middle-aged man."
msgstr "Un cuerpo muerto de un hombre de mediana edad."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead body of a young woman."
msgstr "El cuerpo muerto de una joven."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead body of a little boy."
msgstr "El cuerpo muerto de un niño pequeño."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead body of a little girl."
msgstr "El cuerpo muerto de una niña pequeña."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The dead body of a small child.  Their corpse bears a calm facial "
"expression, as if they died instantly."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un niño pequeño. Su cadáver tiene una expresión facial "
"tranquila, como si hubiera muerto al instante."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The dead body of a child, riddled by bullets to the extent that you can no "
"longer tell their gender."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de un niño, acribillado por las balas hasta el punto de que ya no"
" se puede saber su sexo."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dead body of an old woman.  Both of her earlobes are torn, several fingers"
" on her hands have been chopped off, and several teeth have been knocked "
"out."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver de una anciana. Los dos lóbulos de sus orejas están desgarrados, "
"varios dedos de sus manos han sido cortados, y varios dientes han sido "
"arrancados."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead body, coated in congealed blood."
msgstr "Es un cadáver cubierto de sangre coagulada."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dead body with a frightful grimace.  He appears to have been horribly "
"mangled prior to his death."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver con una mueca espantosa. Parece haber sido horriblemente "
"destrozado antes de su muerte."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "An awful, almost unidentifiable mass of charred flesh."
msgstr "Una horrible, casi inidentificable masa de carne carbonizada."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A dead body with a gaping stab wound in its back."
msgstr "Un cadáver con una puñalada abierta en la espalda."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The dead body of a person.  Their forehead bears a large bullet entrance "
"wound.  An even larger exit wound is present on the back of their head."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo muerto de una persona. Su frente tiene una gran herida de entrada "
"de bala. Una herida de salida aún más grande está presente en la parte "
"posterior de su cabeza."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The upper half of a dead body, as if torn apart with enormous force.  Some "
"organs are hanging out."
msgstr ""
"La mitad superior de un cadáver, como si fuera desgarrado con una fuerza "
"enorme. Algunos órganos están colgando."

#. ~ Description for corpse
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A half-decapitated dead body.  It is unclear what could have caused such a "
"wound."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver medio decapitado. No está claro qué pudo haber causado tal "
"herida."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken exodii worker"
msgid_plural "broken exodii workers"
msgstr[0] "trabajador exodii roto"
msgstr[1] "trabajadores exodii rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken exodii worker
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A broken exodii worker.  It's possible it could be gutted for parts."
msgstr "Un trabajador del éxodii roto. Es posible desmontarlo por sus partes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken exodii quadruped"
msgid_plural "broken exodii quadrupeds"
msgstr[0] "cuadrupedo exodii roto"
msgstr[1] "cuadrupedos exodii rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken exodii quadruped
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken exodii walker.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently "
"inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Un caminante del exodii roto. Todavía se ve intimidante a pesar de ser "
"permanentemente inoperativo, posiblemente debido al tamaño y la masa. Podría"
" ser destripado por partes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken exodii turret"
msgid_plural "broken exodii turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta exodii rota"
msgstr[1] "torretas exodii rotas"

#. ~ Description for broken exodii turret
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken exodii turret.  Still looks intimidating despite being permanently "
"inoperative, possibly due to the sheer size and mass.  Could be gutted for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Una torreta de exodii rota. Todavía se ve intimidante a pesar de estar "
"permanentemente inoperativo, posiblemente debido al tamaño y la masa. Podría"
" ser destripado por partes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken exodii balloon-drone"
msgid_plural "broken exodii balloon-drones"
msgstr[0] "globodrón exodii roto"
msgstr[1] "globodrones exodii rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken exodii balloon-drone
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken balloon drone.  The balloon has been shredded, but most of the "
"chassis is still intact.  Could be gutted for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un globodrón roto. El globo ha sido destrozado, pero la mayor parte del "
"chasis sigue intacto. Podría ser destripado por partes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "ammo belt linkage"
msgid_plural "ammo belt linkages"
msgstr[0] "unión metálica de cinta cargadora"
msgstr[1] "uniones metálicas de cinta cargadora"

#. ~ Description for ammo belt linkage
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A small metal linkage from a disintegrating ammo belt."
msgstr "Es una pequeña unión metálica de una cinta cargadora usada."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ".223 ammo belt linkage"
msgid_plural ".223 ammo belt linkages"
msgstr[0] "unión metálica de munición .223"
msgstr[1] "uniones metálicas de munición .223"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ".308 ammo belt linkage"
msgid_plural ".308 ammo belt linkages"
msgstr[0] "unión metálica de munición .308"
msgstr[1] "uniones metálicas de munición .308"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "40mm grenade belt linkage"
msgid_plural "40mm grenade belt linkages"
msgstr[0] "unión metálica de granada .308"
msgstr[1] "uniones metálicas de granada .308"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ".50 ammo belt linkage"
msgid_plural ".50 ammo belt linkages"
msgstr[0] "unión metálica de munición .50"
msgstr[1] "uniones metálicas de munición .50"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "generic grooming"
msgid_plural "generic groomings"
msgstr[0] "genérico de cuidado personal"
msgstr[1] "genéricos de cuidado personal"

#. ~ Description for generic grooming
#. ~ Description for generic silverware
#. ~ Description for generic utensil
#. ~ Description for generic silverware
#. ~ Description for generic dish
#. ~ Description for generic cook pot
#. ~ Description for generic kitchen knife
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "generic item template"
msgstr "Genérico objeto plantilla"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "soap dish"
msgid_plural "soap dishes"
msgstr[0] "jabón para lavar platos"
msgstr[1] "jabones para lavar platos"

#. ~ Description for soap dish
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shallow dish for holding a bar of soap.  It has ridges to help drain water"
" away from the dish.  Not the most exciting of items."
msgstr ""
"Un plato poco profundo para sostener una barra de jabón. Tiene bordes para "
"ayudar a drenar el agua del plato. No es el más emocionante de los "
"artículos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "shaving razor"
msgid_plural "shaving razors"
msgstr[0] "maquinilla de afeitar"
msgstr[1] "maquinillas de afeitar"

#. ~ Description for shaving razor
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A razor blade on a comfortable handle.  Much easier to shave with than a "
"loose razor."
msgstr ""
"Una maquinilla de afeitar en un cómodo mango. Mucho más fácil de afeitar que"
" una cuchilla de afeitar suelta."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "toothbrush"
msgid_plural "toothbrushes"
msgstr[0] "cepillo de dientes"
msgstr[1] "cepillos de dientes"

#. ~ Description for toothbrush
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A plastic brush with soft bristles for cleaning your teeth."
msgstr "Un cepillo de plástico con cerdas suaves para limpiar los dientes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plastic brush with soft bristles for cleaning your teeth.  It has a cheap,"
" blocky handle and is likely meant to be disposable."
msgstr ""
"Un cepillo de plástico con cerdas suaves para limpiar los dientes. Tiene un "
"mango barato y bloqueado, y es probable que esté destinado a ser desechable."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A combination toothbrush and gum massager.  It has an ergonomic silicone "
"grip.  Luxurious!"
msgstr ""
"Una combinación de cepillo de dientes y masajeador de encías. Tiene un mango"
" ergonómico de silicona. ¡Lujoso!"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plastic brush with soft bristles for cleaning your teeth.  The blue and "
"white pattern on the handle implies cleanliness."
msgstr ""
"Un cepillo de plástico con cerdas suaves para limpiar los dientes. El patrón"
" azul y blanco en el mango implica limpieza."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short toothbrush designed for children.  It has a wide-eyed cartoon pony "
"on the handle."
msgstr ""
"Un cepillo de dientes corto diseñado para los niños. Tiene un pony de "
"dibujos animados de ojos anchos en el mango."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short toothbrush designed for children.  It has a grinning red racecar on "
"the handle."
msgstr ""
"Un cepillo de dientes corto diseñado para los niños. Tiene un coche de "
"carreras rojo y sonriente en el mango."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "dirty toothbrush"
msgid_plural "dirty toothbrushes"
msgstr[0] "cepillo de dientes sucio"
msgstr[1] "cepillos de dientes sucios"

#. ~ Description for dirty toothbrush
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Someone has been using this plastic toothbrush to clean grease or muck.  It "
"is now irrevocably dirty."
msgstr ""
"Alguien ha estado usando este cepillo de dientes de plástico para limpiar "
"grasa o mugre. Ahora está irrevocablemente sucio."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "hairbrush"
msgid_plural "hairbrushes"
msgstr[0] "cepillo para el cabello"
msgstr[1] "cepillos para el cabello"

#. ~ Description for hairbrush
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "An instrument of hair torture."
msgstr "Un instrumento de tortura para el cabello."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An instrument of hair torture.  There are round safety tips on the bristles."
msgstr ""
"Un instrumento de tortura para el cabello. Hay consejos de seguridad "
"redondos en las cerdas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "An old-fashioned hair-straightening device with a faux-wood handle."
msgstr ""
"Un anticuado aparato para alisar el cabello con un mango de madera falsa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A soft, cushioned hairbrush.  The shiny chrome design appears modern."
msgstr ""
"Un cepillo de pelo suave y acolchado. El diseño de cromo brillante parece "
"moderno."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tacky kid's hairbrush.  The cartoon whale on the handle seems friendly "
"enough."
msgstr ""
"El cepillo de pelo de un niño de mal gusto. La ballena de los dibujos "
"animados en el mango parece bastante amistosa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "hair curler"
msgid_plural "hair curlers"
msgstr[0] "rulo"
msgstr[1] "rulos"

#. ~ Description for hair curler
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A soft plastic cylinder you can wrap a lock of your hair around to curl it."
msgstr ""
"Un cilindro de plástico suave con el que puedes envolver un mechón de tu "
"pelo para rizarlo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "dental floss"
msgid_plural "rolls of dental floss"
msgstr[0] "rollo de hilo dental"
msgstr[1] "rollos de hilo dental"

#. ~ Description for dental floss
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Twenty-five yards of finely waxed thread wound up inside a plastic "
"container.  Perfect for picking bits of smoked meat out of your teeth.  "
"Disassemble to use the thread for something else."
msgstr ""
"25 yardas de hilo finamente encerado enrollado dentro de un contenedor de "
"plástico. Perfecto para sacar trozos de carne ahumada de tus dientes. "
"Desmóntalo para usar el hilo para otra cosa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "comb"
msgid_plural "combs"
msgstr[0] "peine"
msgstr[1] "peines"

#. ~ Description for comb
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A grooming tool with teeth for straightening your hair."
msgstr "Una herramienta de aseo personal con dientes para alisar el cabello."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Somehow, a few teeth have already broken off the end of this otherwise "
"pristine comb."
msgstr ""
"De alguna manera, ya se han roto algunos dientes del extremo de este peine, "
"que de otra manera sería prístino."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A grooming tool with teeth for straightening your hair.  This one is narrow,"
" black and austere."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de aseo con dientes para alisar el cabello. Este es "
"estrecho, negro y austero."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A comb made of soft plastic.  Its tortoiseshell pattern makes it seem "
"antique."
msgstr ""
"Un peine hecho de plástico blando. Su patrón de carey hace que parezca "
"antiguo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A comb which folds on a hinge, in case you want to look like a greaser."
msgstr ""
"Un peine que se dobla en una bisagra, por si quieres parecer un engrasador."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "toilet plunger"
msgid_plural "toilet plungers"
msgstr[0] "desatascador de inodoro"
msgstr[1] "desatascadores de inodoros"

#. ~ Description for toilet plunger
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rubber-tipped tool for unclogging pipes, or a club for an immature "
"survivor."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta con punta de goma para desatascar tuberías, o un garrote "
"para un superviviente inmaduro."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "professional plunger"
msgid_plural "professional plungers"
msgstr[0] "desatascador profesional"
msgstr[1] "desatascadores profesionales"

#. ~ Description for professional plunger
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This hollow plastic toilet plunger's bell compresses like an accordion.  It "
"is efficient at its intended purpose, and complete rubbish as a weapon."
msgstr ""
"La campana de este desatascador de inodoro de plástico hueco se comprime "
"como un acordeón. Es eficiente en su propósito, y una completa basura como "
"arma."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "toilet paper"
msgid_plural "rolls of toilet paper"
msgstr[0] "rollo de papel higiénico"
msgstr[1] "rollos de papel higiénico"

#. ~ Description for toilet paper
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A luxurious remnant of civilization."
msgstr "Un lujoso remanente de la civilización."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Imagine the thinnest, most disposable paper you could possibly make.  Now "
"imagine something thinner than that."
msgstr ""
"Imagina el papel más delgado y desechable que podrías hacer. Ahora imagina "
"algo más delgado que eso."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This roll of toilet paper is two-ply and quilted, for vandalizing houses "
"more comfortably than ever."
msgstr ""
"Este rollo de papel higiénico tiene dos capas y está acolchado, para que el "
"vandalismo en las casas sea más cómodo que nunca."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This brand of toilet paper is designed to dissolve completely in water!"
msgstr ""
"¡Esta marca de papel higiénico está diseñada para disolverse completamente "
"en agua!"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Images of your least favorite politician are printed on each individual "
"sheet."
msgstr ""
"Las imágenes de tu político menos favorito están impresas en cada hoja "
"individual."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A luxurious remnant of civilization.  The splinters of unprocessed wood "
"visible in this one make it seem less luxurious, though."
msgstr ""
"Un lujoso remanente de la civilización. Las astillas de madera no procesada "
"visibles en este hacen que parezca menos lujoso, sin embargo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "hair dryer"
msgid_plural "hair dryers"
msgstr[0] "secador de pelo"
msgstr[1] "secadores de pelo"

#. ~ Description for hair dryer
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This tool dries your hair by pushing air through a coil of hot wires.  "
"Without a functioning power grid, it is a motorized paper weight."
msgstr ""
"Esta herramienta te seca el pelo tirando aire a través de una resistencia de"
" cables calientes. Sin una red eléctrica funcionando, es un pisapapeles con "
"motor."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "curling iron"
msgid_plural "curling irons"
msgstr[0] "rizador de pelo"
msgstr[1] "rizadoras de pelo"

#. ~ Description for curling iron
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wand made of heat-resistant ceramics.  When plugged into an outlet, it is "
"hot enough to shape your hair into curls.  Too bad the power's out."
msgstr ""
"Una varita hecha de cerámica resistente al calor. Cuando se enchufa en un "
"tomacorriente, está lo suficientemente caliente como para dar forma a tu "
