msgstr "Quitar gancho de seguridad"

#. ~ Description for fungicidal gas grenade
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use this item "
"to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active fungicidal "
"grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile spray that is "
"highly toxic to fungal life forms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada de bote llena de solución fungicida. Usa este artículo "
"para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en una granada "
"fungicida activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un spray volátil "
"que es altamente tóxico para las formas de vida fúngica."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "armed fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "bote de gas fungicida armado"
msgstr[1] "botes de gas fungicida armados"

#. ~ Description for armed fungicidal gas canister
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling highly toxic "
"gas."
msgstr ""
"A esta bomba fungicida le han quitado la clavija y está expulsando un gas "
"altamente tóxico."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift fungicidal gas grenade"
msgid_plural "makeshift fungicidal gas grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada de gas fungicida improvisada"
msgstr[1] "granadas de gas fungicidas improvisadas"

#. ~ Description for makeshift fungicidal gas grenade
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a makeshift canister grenade filled with fungicidal solution.  Use "
"this item to pull the pin and light the fuse, turning it into an active "
"fungicidal grenade.  In five seconds it will begin to expel a volatile spray"
" that is highly toxic to fungal life forms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una granada improvisada llena de solución fungicida. Usa este "
"artículo para tirar del pasador y encender la mecha, convirtiéndola en una "
"granada fungicida activa. En cinco segundos comenzará a expulsar un spray "
"volátil que es altamente tóxico para los hongos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister"
msgid_plural "armed makeshift fungicidal gas canisters"
msgstr[0] "bote de gas fungicida improvisado armado"
msgstr[1] "botes de gas fungicida improvisados armados"

#. ~ Description for armed makeshift fungicidal gas canister
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This makeshift fungicidal bomb has had its pin removed and is expelling "
"highly toxic haze."
msgstr ""
"A esta bomba fungicida improvisada le han quitado el alfiler y está "
"expulsando una neblina altamente tóxica."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "canister grenade"
msgid_plural "canister grenades"
msgstr[0] "granada de lata"
msgstr[1] "granadas de lata"

#. ~ Use action message for canister grenade.
