#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  It's the "
"skeleton and armor of the military robot."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda cuando se quitan todas las partes móviles y electrónicas. Es el"
" esqueleto y la armadura del robot militar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "military humaniform chassis"
msgid_plural "military humaniform chassis"
msgstr[0] "chasis humaniforme militar"
msgstr[1] "chasis humaniforme militar"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'military humaniform chassis'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What's left when you remove all moving parts and electronics.  You still "
"feel deep down that its hollow eyes are studying you."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda cuando se quitan todas las partes móviles y electrónicas. "
"Todavía sientes en lo profundo que sus ojos huecos te están estudiando."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "folded nanotech forge"
msgid_plural "folded nanotech forges"
msgstr[0] "forja de nanotecnología plegada"
msgstr[1] "forjas de nanotecnología plegadas"

#. ~ Description for folded nanotech forge
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics created this portable nanotech forge for when "
"expeditions are setting up a basecamp far from population centers.  Once "
"deployed it can be used to craft ultratech marvels that otherwise are too "
"minute for human crafting."
msgstr ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics creó esta forja nanotecnológica portátil para "
"cuando las expediciones están montando un campamento base lejos de los "
"centros de población. Una vez desplegada, puede ser usada para fabricar "
"maravillas ultraterrenas que de otra manera serían demasiado pequeñas para "
"la fabricación humana."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "folded diamond press"
msgid_plural "folded diamond presses"
msgstr[0] "prensa de diamante plegable"
msgstr[1] "prensas de diamantes plegables"

#. ~ Description for folded diamond press
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics this device that can create pressures beyond those "
"that create diamonds.  Once deployed it can be used to craft ultratech "
"marvels that require substances of singular qualities."
msgstr ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics este dispositivo que puede crear presiones más allá"
" de las que crean los diamantes. Una vez desplegado, puede ser usado para "
"fabricar maravillas ultraterrenas que requieren sustancias de cualidades "
"singulares."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "robot carrier"
msgid_plural "robot carriers"
msgstr[0] "transportador de robots"
msgstr[1] "transportadores de robots"

#. ~ Description for robot carrier
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy frame outfitted with tie-downs and attachment points for carrying "
"cargo, with additional railings to keep a large machine in place.  It is "
"meant to hold large drones and robots for transport.  Use it on a suitable "
"robot to capture, use it on an empty tile to release."
msgstr ""
"Un marco pesado equipado con amarres y puntos de sujeción para el transporte"
" de carga, con barandillas adicionales para mantener una máquina grande en "
"su lugar. Está destinado a albergar grandes zánganos y robots para su "
"transporte. Úsalo en un robot adecuado para capturar, úsalo en un espacio "
"para soltar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "hydraulic gauntlet"
msgid_plural "hydraulic gauntlets"
msgstr[0] "guantelete hidráulico"
msgstr[1] "guanteletes hidráulicos"

#. ~ Description for hydraulic gauntlet
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, heavy metal gauntlet lined with tubing and gauges.  Slow and "
"unwieldy, it uses internal pressure to deliver devastating blows, but takes "
"tremendous strength to use effectively.  Thanks to an internal microreactor,"
" it doesn't require power of its own."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme y pesado guante de metal forrado con tubos y medidores. Lento y "
"poco manejable, utiliza la presión interna para dar golpes devastadores, "
"pero requiere una tremenda fuerza para ser usado efectivamente. Gracias a un"
" microreactor interno, no requiere energía propia."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "titanium bat"
msgid_plural "titanium bats"
msgstr[0] "bate de titanio"
msgstr[1] "bates de titanio"

#. ~ Description for titanium bat
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A luxury baseball bat made out of titanium that was banned from competitive "
"sport due to the increased performance that put defenders at risk."
msgstr ""
"Un lujoso bate de béisbol hecho de titanio que fue prohibido en el deporte "
"de competición debido al aumento del rendimiento que ponía en riesgo a los "
"defensores."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "trident"
msgid_plural "tridents"
msgstr[0] "tridente"
msgstr[1] "tridentes"

#. ~ Description for trident
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A three pronged spear that is surface treated to be used confidently above "
"and below water."
msgstr ""
"Una lanza de tres puntas que es tratada en la superficie para ser usada con "
"confianza por encima y por debajo del agua."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "ur-scrap"
msgid_plural "ur-scraps"
msgstr[0] "tu-chatarra"
msgstr[1] "tus-chatarras"

#. ~ Description for ur-scrap
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A small techno doodad."
msgstr "Un pequeño tecno doodad."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "monomeric slurry"
msgid_plural "monomeric slurry"
msgstr[0] "Lodo monomérico"
msgstr[1] "Lodos monomérico"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'monomeric slurry'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A collection of the building blocks of polymers.  With this and a whole lot "
"of know-how, you can create proteins and other building blocks of life."
msgstr ""
"Es una colección de piedras angulares de polímeros. Con esto y mucho "
"conocimiento podrías crear proteínas y otras cosas fundamentales para la "
"vida."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "micellular growth medium"
msgid_plural "micellular growth mediums"
msgstr[0] "medio de crecimiento de micellular"
msgstr[1] "medios de crecimiento de micellular"

#. ~ Description for micellular growth medium
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For the mixing of biomaterials that might otherwise be antithetical to one "
"another."
msgstr ""
"Para la mezcla de biomateriales que de otra manera podrían ser antitéticos "
"entre sí."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "artificial muscle fibers"
msgid_plural "artificial muscle fibers"
msgstr[0] "fibras musculares artificiales"
msgstr[1] "fibras musculares artificiales"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'artificial muscle fibers'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lab-grown or bioprinted muscle fibers; much denser and with higher "
"performance ratios than baseline human muscles."
msgstr ""
"Fibras musculares cultivadas en laboratorio o bioimpresas; mucho más densas "
"y con mayor rendimiento que los músculos humanos de base."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "self healing polymers"
msgid_plural "self healing polymers"
msgstr[0] "polímero autocurativo"
msgstr[1] "polímeros autocurativos"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'self healing polymers'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Materials capable of taking environmental chemicals and utilizing them for "
"self-repair; be careful you don't make grey goo."
msgstr ""
"Materiales capaces de tomar químicos ambientales y utilizarlos para la auto-"
"reparación; ten cuidado de no hacer una sustancia viscosa gris."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "autologous totipotent tissue culture"
msgid_plural "autologous totipotent tissue cultures"
msgstr[0] "cultivo de tejido totipotencial autólogo"
msgstr[1] "cultivos de tejido totipotencial autólogo"

#. ~ Description for autologous totipotent tissue culture
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Uncontaminated pure cellular matter that, with the right instructions, can "
"become just about anything."
msgstr ""
"Materia celular pura no contaminada que, con las instrucciones adecuadas, "
"puede convertirse en casi cualquier cosa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "scrap photonics"
msgid_plural "scrap photonics"
msgstr[0] "resto fotónico"
msgstr[1] "restos fotónicos"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'scrap photonics'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Small circuits blue and gold, transmitting signals through light."
msgstr ""
"Pequeños circuitos azules y dorados, que transmiten señales a través de la "
"luz."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "photonic circuitry"
msgid_plural "photonic circuitries"
msgstr[0] "circuito fotónico"
msgstr[1] "circuitos fotónicos"

#. ~ Description for photonic circuitry
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A resplendent golden grid inlaid on dark blue substrate."
msgstr ""
"Una resplandeciente rejilla dorada incrustada en un sustrato azul oscuro."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "photonic computation core"
msgid_plural "photonic computation cores"
msgstr[0] "núcleo de computación fotónica"
msgstr[1] "núcleos de computación fotónica"

#. ~ Description for photonic computation core
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A monolithic circuit shaped as a glowing cube of crystal."
msgstr "Es un circuito monolítico con forma de cubo de cristal brillante."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "hypergeometric photonics"
msgid_plural "hypergeometric photonics"
msgstr[0] "fotónico hipergeométrico"
msgstr[1] "fotónicos hipergeométricos"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hypergeometric photonics'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In your hands lies a self-contained digital universe.  Its programs glowing "
"like stars fixed on computational shells infinitely layered."
msgstr ""
"En tus manos yace un universo digital autónomo. Sus programas brillando como"
" estrellas fijadas en cáscaras computacionales de capas infinitas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "acausal logic permutator"
msgid_plural "acausal logic permutators"
msgstr[0] "permutador lógico acausal"
msgstr[1] "permutadores lógicos acausales"

#. ~ Description for acausal logic permutator
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "It has given you an answer, but you are yet to ask anything."
msgstr "Te ha dado una respuesta, pero aún no has preguntado nada."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "woven metamaterial sheet"
msgid_plural "woven metamaterial sheets"
msgstr[0] "hoja de metamaterial tejida"
msgstr[1] "hojas de metamaterial tejidas"

#. ~ Description for woven metamaterial sheet
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An intricately spun and carefully engineered sheet of iridescent fibers."
msgstr "Una intrincada y cuidadosamente diseñada hoja de fibras iridiscentes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "nanowire battery"
msgid_plural "nanowire batteries"
msgstr[0] "batería de nanocables"
msgstr[1] "baterías de nanocables"

#. ~ Description for nanowire battery
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A small battery component with a very high energy density."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño componente de la batería con una densidad de energía muy alta."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "ultracapacitor"
msgid_plural "ultracapacitors"
msgstr[0] "ultracondensador"
msgstr[1] "ultracondensadores"

#. ~ Description for ultracapacitor
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A capacitor made from exotic compounds, capable of storing a high amount of "
"electric charge."
msgstr ""
"Un condensador hecho de compuestos exóticos, capaz de almacenar una gran "
"cantidad de carga eléctrica."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "ultracapacitor array"
msgid_plural "ultracapacitor arrays"
msgstr[0] "matriz de ultacondensadores"
msgstr[1] "matrices de ultracondensadores"

#. ~ Description for ultracapacitor array
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Ultracapacitors assembled into a finely tuned energy storage array."
msgstr ""
"Ultracondensadores ensamblados en un conjunto de almacenamiento de energía "
"finamente ajustado."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "superconductive coil"
msgid_plural "superconductive coils"
msgstr[0] "bobina superconductora"
msgstr[1] "bobinas superconductoras"

#. ~ Description for superconductive coil
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Superconductive wire warped upon itself manipulates the electromagnetic "
"spectrum to store vast amounts of power."
msgstr ""
"El cable superconductor torcido sobre sí mismo manipula el espectro "
"electromagnético para almacenar grandes cantidades de energía."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "zero-point energy extractor"
msgid_plural "zero-point energy extractors"
msgstr[0] "extractor de energía de punto cero"
msgstr[1] "extractores de energía de punto cero"

#. ~ Description for zero-point energy extractor
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A complex grid pins space-time to the surface of the multiversal hyper-"
"torus, allowing the energies within to leak into our sliver of existence."
msgstr ""
"Una compleja red fija el espacio-tiempo a la superficie del hipotoro "
"multiversal, permitiendo que las energías en su interior se filtren en "
"nuestra esquirla de existencia."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "conductive thermoplastic"
msgid_plural "conductive thermoplastics"
msgstr[0] "termoplástico conductor"
msgstr[1] "termoplásticos conductores"

#. ~ Description for conductive thermoplastic
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An excellent heat conductor and electrical insulator.  Conductive "
"thermoplastics were introduced to the civilian market nearly two centuries "
"ago, and have tightly integrated themselves into the modern society since "
"then."
msgstr ""
"Un excelente conductor de calor y aislante eléctrico. Los termoplásticos "
"conductores se introdujeron en el mercado civil hace casi dos siglos, y "
"desde entonces se han integrado estrechamente en la sociedad moderna."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "carbon-lattice heatsink"
msgid_plural "carbon-lattice heatsinks"
msgstr[0] "disipador de rejilla de carbono"
msgstr[1] "disipadores de rejilla de carbono"

#. ~ Description for carbon-lattice heatsink
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sections of dark, translucent, monocrystalline carbon fins, functionally "
"identical to diamond.  Microscopic etches on the inside allows the flow of "
"high-pressure coolant.  Crystalline carbon lattices exhibit far superior "
"thermal conductivity and deformation resistance than any other conventional "
"metals."
msgstr ""
"Secciones de aletas de carbono monocristalinas oscuras y translúcidas, "
"funcionalmente idénticas al diamante. Los grabados microscópicos en el "
"interior permiten el flujo de refrigerante de alta presión. Las redes de "
"carbono cristalino exhiben una conductividad térmica y una resistencia a la "
"deformación muy superiores a las de cualquier otro metal convencional."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "fermionic nanoribbon"
msgid_plural "fermionic nanoribbons"
msgstr[0] "nanocinta fermiónica"
msgstr[1] "nanocintas fermiónicas"

#. ~ Description for fermionic nanoribbon
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This delicate bundle of silvery, iridescent cables is capable of "
"transporting heat energy between its connections instantly without ever "
"heating up by itself.  Even the slightest damage to the casing will "
"annihilate the ground-state quantum uniformity of the fermionic superfluid "
"matrix - Handle with care!"
msgstr ""
"Este delicado haz de cables plateados e iridiscentes es capaz de transportar"
" la energía térmica entre sus conexiones de forma instantánea sin calentarse"
" por sí mismo. Incluso el más mínimo daño a la carcasa aniquilará la "
"uniformidad cuántica de la matriz de superfluidos fermiónicos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "maxwellian entropic chirality generator"
msgid_plural "maxwellian entropic chirality generators"
msgstr[0] "generador de quiralidad entrópica maxwelliana"
msgstr[1] "generadores de quiralidad entrópica maxwelliana"

#. ~ Description for maxwellian entropic chirality generator
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A nondescript square piece of metal about the size of a computer chip.  One "
"side is cold to the touch, while the other is uncomfortably hot.  "
"Hermetically sealed and devoid of any identifying feature, this peculiar "
"device gives off an unexplainable, sinister aura."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza de metal cuadrada y anodina del tamaño de un chip de ordenador. Un"
" lado está frío al tacto, mientras que el otro está incómodamente caliente. "
"Herméticamente sellado y desprovisto de cualquier rasgo identificador, este "
"peculiar dispositivo emite un aura inexplicable y siniestra."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "salvaged coolant system"
msgid_plural "salvaged coolant systems"
msgstr[0] "sistema de refrigeración recuperado"
msgstr[1] "sistemas de refrigeración recuperados"

#. ~ Description for salvaged coolant system
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Rusty fluid reservoirs and decomposing high-pressure tubing containing still"
" usable supercritical coolant.  You could disassemble it to separate the "
"liquid coolant from the rest of the scrap."
msgstr ""
"Depósitos de fluidos oxidados y tubos de alta presión en descomposición que "
"contienen refrigerante supercrítico todavía utilizable. Podrías desmontarlo "
"para separar el refrigerante líquido del resto de la chatarra."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "high quality electromagnet"
msgid_plural "high quality electromagnets"
msgstr[0] "electroiman de alta calidad"
msgstr[1] "electroimanes de alta calidad"

#. ~ Description for high quality electromagnet
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A sturdy, industrially crafted electromagnet."
msgstr "Un robusto electroimán de fabricación industrial."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "cryo electromagnet"
msgid_plural "cryo electromagnets"
msgstr[0] "crioelectroiman"
msgstr[1] "crioelectroimanes"

#. ~ Description for cryo electromagnet
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful super conductive electromagnet, that must be kept  at very low "
"temperatures to operate."
msgstr ""
"Un poderoso electroimán superconductor, que debe mantenerse a muy bajas "
"temperaturas para funcionar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "super conductive electromagnet"
msgid_plural "super conductive electromagnets"
msgstr[0] "electroiman superconductor"
msgstr[1] "electroimanes superconductores"

#. ~ Description for super conductive electromagnet
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A powerful electromagnet made from a room temperature superconductor."
msgstr ""
"Un poderoso electroimán hecho de un superconductor a temperatura ambiente."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "ferrofluid dynamo"
msgid_plural "ferrofluid dynamos"
msgstr[0] "dínamo de ferrofluido"
msgstr[1] "dínamos de ferrofluido"

#. ~ Description for ferrofluid dynamo
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Black metallic fluid, harmonically flowing from one fractal shape to the "
"next."
msgstr ""
"Fluido negro metálico, fluyendo armónicamente de una forma fractal a la "
"siguiente."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "composite alloy"
msgid_plural "composite alloys"
msgstr[0] "aleación compuesta"
msgstr[1] "aleaciones compuestas"

#. ~ Description for composite alloy
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Miscellaneous scrap pieces made from a composite alloy."
msgstr "Piezas de chatarra miscelánea hechas de una aleación compuesta."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "vacuum cast carbide"
msgid_plural "vacuum cast carbides"
msgstr[0] "carburo fundido al vacío"
msgstr[1] "carburos fundidos al vacío"

#. ~ Description for vacuum cast carbide
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Malleable carbide cast by forges on high earth orbit."
msgstr "Carburo maleable fundido por forjas en la alta órbita terrestre."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "nanoprinted alloy"
msgid_plural "nanoprinted alloys"
msgstr[0] "aleación nanoimpresa"
msgstr[1] "aleaciones nanoimpresas"

#. ~ Description for nanoprinted alloy
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A meta material fabricated by precisely layering different elements at an "
"atomic scale."
msgstr ""
"Un meta material fabricado por la estratificación precisa de diferentes "
"elementos a escala atómica."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "crystal forged neutrite"
msgid_plural "crystal forged neutrites"
msgstr[0] "neutrino forjado en cristal"
msgstr[1] "neutrinos forjados en cristal"

#. ~ Description for crystal forged neutrite
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Great forges within the Earth's core wrought hydrogen into flaming metal and"
" poured it within lattices of super conductive lanthanum.  Locked in "
"magnetic equilibrium, it was left to cool into a dark unbreakable metal"
msgstr ""
"Grandes forjas dentro del núcleo de la Tierra forjaron el hidrógeno en el "
"metal en llamas y lo vertieron dentro de las redes del lantano "
"superconductor. Encerrado en el equilibrio magnético, se dejó enfriar en un "
"oscuro e irrompible metal"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "phase uneven matter"
msgid_plural "phase uneven matters"
msgstr[0] "materia desigual de fase"
msgstr[1] "materias desiguales de fase"

#. ~ Description for phase uneven matter
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Matter condensed from the liminal spaces between dimensions."
msgstr "Materia condensada de los espacios liminales entre las dimensiones."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "peripheral electrode"
msgid_plural "peripheral electrodes"
msgstr[0] "electrodo periférico"
msgstr[1] "electrodos periféricos"

#. ~ Description for peripheral electrode
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin strand of wire and a clamp, meant to be spliced into the smaller "
"nerves of the human body."
msgstr ""
"Es un hilo fino de alambre con un gancho, diseñado para ser partido en "
"nervios más pequeños del cuerpo humano."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "neural electrode"
msgid_plural "neural electrodes"
msgstr[0] "electrodo neuronale"
msgstr[1] "electrodos neuronales"

#. ~ Description for neural electrode
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small array of metallic needles allows complex communication between "
"machine and human mind."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño conjunto de agujas metálicas permite una compleja comunicación "
"entre la máquina y la mente humana."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "brain implant prod"
msgid_plural "brain implant prods"
msgstr[0] "picana de implante cerebral"
msgstr[1] "picanas de implante cerebral"

#. ~ Description for brain implant prod
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A complexly etched rod of metal interfaces with the corpus callosum of the "
"patient, granting increased control of bionic functions."
msgstr ""
"Una varilla de metal complejamente grabada se conecta con el cuerpo calloso "
"del paciente, lo que permite un mayor control de las funciones biónicas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "artificial neural tissue"
msgid_plural "artificial neural tissues"
msgstr[0] "tejido neuronal artificial"
msgstr[1] "tejidos neuronales artificiales"

#. ~ Description for artificial neural tissue
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Photonic axons process thought at speeds far surpassing primitive, chemical-"
"driven communication."
msgstr ""
"Axones fotónicos procesan el pensamiento a velocidades que superan con "
"creces la comunicación primitiva, impulsada por productos químicos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "neurosynaptic interface matrix"
msgid_plural "neurosynaptic interface matrices"
msgstr[0] "matrix de interfaz neurosináptica"
msgstr[1] "matrices de interfaz neurosináptica"

#. ~ Description for neurosynaptic interface matrix
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A membrane of artificial neurons envelops the cerebral cortex, melding "
"machine and human intellect into a gestalt much greater than its individual "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Una membrana de neuronas artificiales envuelven la corteza cerebral, la "
"máquina de fusión y el intelecto humano en una gestalt mucho mayor que sus "
"partes individuales."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "laser optics"
msgid_plural "laser optics"
msgstr[0] "optica laser"
msgstr[1] "opticas laser"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'laser optics'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lenses, mirrors, emitters and other optical elements that once belonged to a"
" weapon, industrial cutter or laser research setup."
msgstr ""
"Lentes, espejos, emisores y otros elementos ópticos que alguna vez "
"pertenecieron a un arma, a un cortador industrial o a un equipo de "
"investigación con láser."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "metamaterial lens"
msgid_plural "metamaterial lenses"
msgstr[0] " lente de metamaterial"
msgstr[1] " lentes de metamateriales"

#. ~ Description for metamaterial lens
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A diminute sphere of crystal and metal, magnetically affixed to the centroid"
" of its containing chamber."
msgstr ""
"Una diminuta esfera de cristal y metal, fijada magnéticamente al centro de "
"su cámara de contención."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "ultralight frame"
msgid_plural "ultralight frames"
msgstr[0] "marco ultraligero"
msgstr[1] "marcos ultraligeros"

#. ~ Description for ultralight frame
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A sturdy, lightweight frame made from titanium.  Useful for crafting."
msgstr ""
"Una estructura robusta y ligera hecha de titanio. Útil para la artesanía."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "ultralight foldable frame"
msgid_plural "ultralight foldable frames"
msgstr[0] "marco plegable ultraligero"
msgstr[1] "marcos plegables ultraligeros"

#. ~ Description for ultralight foldable frame
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A sturdy, lightweight foldable frame made from titanium."
msgstr "Una estructura plegable, robusta y ligera, hecha de titanio."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "control station"
msgid_plural "control stations"
msgstr[0] "estación de control"
msgstr[1] "estaciones de control"

#. ~ Description for control station
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large and complex piloting station from a military vehicle, including a "
"camera station, steering tools, and electronics controls."
msgstr ""
"Una estación de pilotaje grande y compleja de un vehículo militar, que "
"incluye una estación de cámaras, herramientas de dirección y controles "
"electrónicos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "vehicle shelving"
msgid_plural "vehicle shelvings"
msgstr[0] "estantería de vehículo"
msgstr[1] "estanterías de vehículos"

#. ~ Description for vehicle shelving
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Several heavy frames retrofitted to be installed together which are "
"outfitted with tie-downs and attachment points gallore for carrying an "
"extended amount of cargo."
msgstr ""
"Varios bastidores pesados acondicionados para ser instalados juntos que se "
"equipan con amarres y puntos de fijación de galería para transportar una "
"cantidad extendida de carga."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "solar array"
msgid_plural "solar arrays"
msgstr[0] "matriz solar"
msgstr[1] "matrices solares"

#. ~ Description for solar array
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A vertical array of three solar panels set on a chassis rising above one "
"another on a metal pole with rudimentary tracking and motors.  Due to the "
"flimsy nature of the hydraulics and high surface area profile to maximize "
"sunlight, they can't really be installed onto an existing vehicle.  Requires"
" a jumper cable or similar to pull power from."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto vertical de tres paneles solares colocados en un chasis que se "
"eleva sobre un poste metálico con un seguimiento y motores rudimentarios. "
"Debido a la naturaleza endeble de la hidráulica y al alto perfil de la "
"superficie para maximizar la luz solar, no pueden ser realmente instalados "
"en un vehículo existente. Requiere un cable de arranque o similar para sacar"
" la energía."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "reinforced solar array"
msgid_plural "reinforced solar arrays"
msgstr[0] "array solar reforzado"
msgstr[1] "arrays solares reforzados"

#. ~ Description for reinforced solar array
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A vertical array of three reinforced solar panels set on a chassis rising "
"above one another on a metal pole with rudimentary tracking and motors.  Due"
" to the flimsy nature of the hydraulics and high surface area profile to "
"maximize sunlight, they can't really be installed onto an existing vehicle."
"  Requires a jumper cable or similar to pull power from."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto vertical de tres paneles solares reforzados colocados en un "
"chasis que se eleva sobre un poste metálico con un seguimiento y motores "
"rudimentarios. Debido a la naturaleza endeble de la hidráulica y al alto "
"perfil de la superficie para maximizar la luz solar, no pueden ser realmente"
" instalados en un vehículo existente. Requiere un cable de arranque o "
"similar para sacar la energía."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "upgraded solar array"
msgid_plural "upgraded solar arrays"
msgstr[0] "matriz solar mejorada"
msgstr[1] "matrices solares mejoradas"

#. ~ Description for upgraded solar array
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A vertical array of three upgraded solar panels set on a chassis rising "
"above one another on a metal pole with rudimentary tracking and motors.  Due"
" to the flimsy nature of the hydraulics and high surface area profile to "
"maximize sunlight, they can't really be installed onto an existing vehicle."
"  Requires a jumper cable or similar to pull power from."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto vertical de tres paneles solares mejorados colocados en un "
"chasis que se eleva sobre un poste metálico con un seguimiento y motores "
"rudimentarios. Debido a la naturaleza endeble de la hidráulica y al alto "
"perfil de la superficie para maximizar la luz solar, no pueden ser realmente"
" instalados en un vehículo existente. Requiere un cable de arranque o "
"similar para sacar la energía."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "upgraded reinforced solar array"
msgid_plural "upgraded reinforced solar arrays"
msgstr[0] "conjunto de paneles solares mejorados reforzados"
msgstr[1] "conjuntos de paneles solares mejorados reforzados"

#. ~ Description for upgraded reinforced solar array
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A vertical array of three upgraded reinforced solar panels set on a chassis "
"rising above one another on a metal pole with rudimentary tracking and "
"motors.  Due to the flimsy nature of the hydraulics and high surface area "
"profile to maximize sunlight, they can't really be installed onto an "
"existing vehicle.  Requires a jumper cable or similar to pull power from."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto vertical de tres paneles solares reforzados y mejorados "
"colocados en un chasis que se eleva sobre un poste metálico con un "
"seguimiento y motores rudimentarios. Debido a la naturaleza endeble de la "
"hidráulica y al alto perfil de la superficie para maximizar la luz solar, no"
" pueden ser realmente instalados en un vehículo existente. Requiere un cable"
" de arranque o similar para sacar la energía."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "withered plant bundle"
msgid_plural "withered plant bundles"
msgstr[0] "fardo de plantas marchitas"
msgstr[1] "fardos de plantas marchitas"

#. ~ Description for withered plant bundle
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "A bundle of plant matter"
msgstr "Es un manojo de materia vegetal."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT hatchet"
msgid_plural "CRIT hatchets"
msgstr[0] "hacha de mano CRIT"
msgstr[1] "hachas de mano CRIT"

#. ~ Use action msg for CRIT hatchet.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You extend your hatchet"
msgstr "Extiendes tu hacha de mano"

#. ~ Description for CRIT hatchet
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An incredibly sharp, heavy duty, one-handed hatchet.  Makes a great melee "
"weapon, and is useful both for chopping things and for use as a hammer when "
"extended."
msgstr ""
"Un hacha de mano increíblemente afilada y resistente. Es un gran arma de "
"combate cuerpo a cuerpo, y es útil tanto para cortar cosas como para usarla "
"como martillo cuando se extiende."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT axe"
msgid_plural "CRIT axes"
msgstr[0] "hacha CRIT"
msgstr[1] "hachas CRIT"

#. ~ Use action msg for CRIT axe.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You collapse your axe"
msgstr "Cierras tu hacha."

#. ~ Description for CRIT axe
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An incredibly sharp, heavy duty, full length axe.  Makes a heavy-hitting "
"melee weapon, and is useful both for chopping things and for use as a hammer"
" when extended."
msgstr ""
"Un hacha increíblemente afilada, de gran resistencia y de longitud total. Es"
" un arma de combate cuerpo a cuerpo muy potente, y es útil tanto para cortar"
" cosas como para usarla como martillo cuando está extendida."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT Blade-work manual"
msgid_plural "CRIT Blade-work manuals"
msgstr[0] "manual de trabajo con espadas C.R.I.T."
msgstr[1] "manuales de trabajo con espadas C.R.I.T."

#. ~ Description for CRIT Blade-work manual
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
