msgid_plural "broken CROWS II Heavy"
msgstr[0] "CROWS II Pesado roto"
msgstr[1] "CROWS II Pesado rotos"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken launcher TALON UGV"
msgid_plural "broken launcher TALON UGVs"
msgstr[0] " TALON UGV lanzador roto"
msgstr[1] " TALON UGV lanzadores rotos"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken rifle TALON UGV"
msgid_plural "broken rifle TALON UGVs"
msgstr[0] "TALON UGV rifle roto"
msgstr[1] "TALON UGV rifles rotos"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "artificer's toolkit"
msgid_plural "artificer's toolkits"
msgstr[0] "juego de herramientas de artifice"
msgstr[1] "juegos de herramientas de artifice"

#. ~ Description for artificer's toolkit
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a magical device that can take the shape of many tools.  When not in"
" use it looks like a simple screwdriver."
msgstr ""
"Este es un dispositivo mágico que puede tomar la forma de muchas "
"herramientas. Cuando no se usa parece a un simple destornillador."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "stone shell"
msgid_plural "stone shells"
msgstr[0] "cascara de piedra"
msgstr[1] "cascaras de piedra"

#. ~ Description for stone shell
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The broken fragment of an owlbear egg.  With luck it might still contain "
"some of its former power, though if nothing else it's still a bit sharp."
msgstr ""
"El fragmento roto de un huevo de buhoso. Con suerte, puede que aún contenga "
"algo de su antiguo poder, aunque si nada más, sigue siendo un poco afilado."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "glow dust"
msgid_plural "glow dusts"
msgstr[0] "polvo brillante"
msgstr[1] "polvos brillantes"

#. ~ Description for glow dust
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The powdered remains of a will-o-wisps's physical form.  It seems to still "
"possess an otherworldly glow."
msgstr ""
"Los restos pulverizados de la forma física de un fuego fatuo. Parece que "
"todavía posee un brillo de otro mundo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "magical reading light"
msgid_plural "magical reading lights"
msgstr[0] "luz mágica de lectura"
msgstr[1] "luces mágicas de lectura"

#. ~ Description for magical reading light
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of glow powder and lesser mana potions, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at "
"least a decade.  Use it to close the cover and hide the light."
msgstr ""
"Impulsada por la magia del polvo brillante y las pociones de maná menores, "
"esta pequeña luz extremadamente cara proporcionará la luz suficiente para "
"leer durante al menos una década. Úsala para cerrar la tapa y ocultar la "
"luz."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "magical reading light (covered)"
msgid_plural "magical reading lights (covered)"
msgstr[0] "luz mágica de lectura (cubierta)"
msgstr[1] "luces mágicas de lectura (cubiertas)"

#. ~ Description for magical reading light (covered)
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Powered by the magic of glow powder and lesser mana potions, this extremely "
"expensive little light will provide just enough light to read by for at "
"least a decade.  The cover is closed.  Use it to open the cover and show the"
" light."
msgstr ""
"Impulsada por la magia del polvo brillante y las pociones de maná menores, "
"esta pequeña luz extremadamente cara proporcionará la luz suficiente para "
"leer durante al menos una década. La tapa está cerrada. Úsala para abrir la "
"tapa y mostrar la luz."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "bulette plate"
msgid_plural "bulette plates"
msgstr[0] "placa de bulette"
msgstr[1] "placas de bulette"

#. ~ Description for bulette plate
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The great plates from behind a bulette's head have always been prized for "
"use in shield and armor making."
msgstr ""
"Las grandes placas de detrás de la cabeza de un bulette siempre han sido muy"
" apreciadas para su uso en la fabricación de escudos y armaduras."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "bulette pearl"
msgid_plural "bulette pearls"
msgstr[0] "perla de bulette"
msgstr[1] "perlas de bulette"

#. ~ Description for bulette pearl
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As a bulette burrows through the earth its gills collect minute amounts of "
"precious metals and gems which slowly aggregate into lustrous gemstones "
"prized for their beauty and power."
msgstr ""
"A medida que un bulette madruga a través de la tierra, sus branquias recogen"
" diminutas cantidades de metales preciosos y gemas que lentamente se agregan"
" en lustrosas piedras preciosas apreciadas por su belleza y poder."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "stirge proboscis"
msgid_plural "stirge proboscises"
msgstr[0] "proboscide de strige"
msgstr[1] "proboscides de striges"

#. ~ Description for stirge proboscis
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long sucking apparatus harvested from stirge corpse.  Makes a poor melee "
"weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un largo aparato de succión cosechado de un cadáver revuelto. Es una pobre "
"arma de combate cuerpo a cuerpo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "chunk of demon chitin"
msgid_plural "chunks of demon chitin"
msgstr[0] "trozo de quitina de demonio"
msgstr[1] "trozos de quitina de demonio"

#. ~ Description for chunk of demon chitin
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A piece of demon spider exoskeleton.  It is light and very durable, and "
"probably has some magical properties."
msgstr ""
"Una pieza de exoesqueleto de araña demoníaca. Es ligero y muy duradero, y "
"probablemente tiene algunas propiedades mágicas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "bundle of demon chitin chunks"
msgid_plural "bundles of demon chitin chunks"
msgstr[0] "paquete de trozos de quitina de demonio"
msgstr[1] "paquetes de trozos de quitina de demonio"

#. ~ Description for bundle of demon chitin chunks
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pieces of demon spider exoskeleton, bundled tightly together for storage.  "
"Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr ""
"Piezas de exoesqueleto de araña demonio, atadas fuertemente para su "
"almacenamiento. Desmontar para desempaquetar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "demon chitin plate"
msgid_plural "demon chitin plates"
msgstr[0] "placa de quitina demoníaca"
msgstr[1] "placas de quitina demoníaca"

#. ~ Description for demon chitin plate
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large piece of demon spider exoskeleton, painstakingly cut from the corpse"
" of an adult demon spider.  A plate of this size can be used to create armor"
" plating."
msgstr ""
"Una gran pieza de exoesqueleto de araña demonio, cuidadosamente cortado del "
"cadáver de una araña demonio adulta. Una placa de este tamaño puede ser "
"usada para crear un blindaje."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "demon spider fang"
msgid_plural "demon spider fangs"
msgstr[0] "colmillo de araña del demonio"
msgstr[1] "colmillos de araña del demonio"

#. ~ Description for demon spider fang
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fang from a demon spider.  It seems to still drip with poison; you might "
"be able to use this in some alchemical recipe?"
msgstr ""
"Un colmillo de una araña demoníaca. Parece que todavía gotea con veneno; "
"¿podrías usar esto en alguna receta alquímica?"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "mana dust"
msgid_plural "mana dusts"
msgstr[0] "polvo de mana"
msgstr[1] "polvos de mana"

#. ~ Description for mana dust
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Crystalized mana in powdered form.  It faintly pulses with arcane energy."
msgstr "Maná cristalizado en polvo. Pulsa débilmente con energía arcana."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "mana pearl"
msgid_plural "mana pearls"
msgstr[0] "perla de mana"
msgstr[1] "perlas de mana"

#. ~ Description for mana pearl
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gemstone created by alchemy.  You can feel it attract surrounding mana."
msgstr ""
"Una gema creada por la alquimia. Puedes sentir que atrae al maná "
"circundante."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "enchanted wood"
msgid_plural "enchanted wood"
msgstr[0] "madera encantada"
msgstr[1] "maderas encantadas"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'enchanted wood'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Wood that has been infused with mana."
msgstr "Madera que ha sido infundida con maná."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "black dragon scale"
msgid_plural "black dragon scales"
msgstr[0] "escama de dragón negro"
msgstr[1] "escamas de dragón negro"

#. ~ Description for black dragon scale
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A scale from a black dragon.  It still has its magical properties and acid "
"resistance."
msgstr ""
"Una escama de un dragón negro. Todavía tiene sus propiedades mágicas y su "
"resistencia a los ácidos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "bundle of black dragon scales"
msgid_plural "bundles of black dragon scales"
msgstr[0] "paquete de escamas negras de dragón"
msgstr[1] "paquetes de escamas negras de dragón"

#. ~ Description for bundle of black dragon scales
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Scales from a black dragon, bundled tightly together for storage.  "
"Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr ""
"Escamas de un dragón negro, atadas fuertemente para su almacenamiento. "
"Desmontar para desempaquetar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "black dragon hide"
msgid_plural "black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "pellejo de dragón negro "
msgstr[1] "pellejos de dragón negro "

#. ~ Description for black dragon hide
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Prepared hide from a black dragon.  Hard, acid-resistant, and with more "
"scales could make a suit of armor as hard as steel and half as heavy."
msgstr ""
"Pellejo preparado  de un dragón negro. Duro, resistente a los ácidos y con "
"más escamas podría hacer una armadura tan dura como el acero y la mitad de "
"pesada."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "bundle of black dragon hides"
msgid_plural "bundles of black dragon hides"
msgstr[0] "fardo de pellejos de dragón negro"
msgstr[1] "fardos de pellejos de dragón negro"

#. ~ Description for bundle of black dragon hides
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Hides from a black dragon, bundled tightly together for storage.  "
"Disassemble to unpack."
msgstr ""
"Pellejos de un dragón negro, atados fuertemente para su almacenamiento. "
"Desmontar para desempaquetar."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "vacation brochure"
msgid_plural "vacation brochures"
msgstr[0] "folleto de vacaciones"
msgstr[1] "folletos de vacaciones"

#. ~ Use action message for vacation brochure.
#. ~ Use action message for lair map.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "You add the locations to your map."
msgstr "Añade las localizaciones a tu mapa."

#. ~ Description for vacation brochure
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a glossy brochure encouraging students to book vacations at a lake "
"retreat or remote cabin.  The brochure includes lush photographs of a tower "
"on an island and a remote looking cabin in the woods.  It includes a map of "
"the areas."
msgstr ""
"Este es un folleto brillante que anima a los estudiantes a reservar "
"vacaciones en un retiro del lago o una cabaña remota. El folleto incluye "
"exuberantes fotografías de una torre en una isla y una cabaña de aspecto "
"remoto en el bosque. Incluye un mapa de las áreas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "lair map"
msgid_plural "lair maps"
msgstr[0] "mapa de guarida"
msgstr[1] "mapas de guaridas"

#. ~ Description for lair map
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an well worn map.  It has pictures of fantastical beasts "
"embellishing the carefully drawn map markers."
msgstr ""
"Este es un mapa bien usado. Tiene dibujos de bestias fantásticas que adornan"
" los marcadores del mapa cuidadosamente dibujados."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "old photo"
msgid_plural "old photos"
msgstr[0] "foto antigua"
msgstr[1] "fotos antiguas"

#. ~ Description for old photo
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A photo of a jovial, old wizard, he seems to be dancing with a coat rack in "
"this basement.  There is a stack of suitcases in the background."
msgstr ""
"Una foto de un viejo mago jovial, parece estar bailando con un perchero en "
"este sótano. Hay una pila de maletas en el fondo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "golem core"
msgid_plural "golem cores"
msgstr[0] "núcleo de gólems"
msgstr[1] "núcleos de gólems"

#. ~ Description for golem core
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The \"heart\" of a golem.  Makes a soft humming noise when you hold it close"
" to your ear."
msgstr ""
"El \"corazón\" de un golem. Emite un suave zumbido cuando lo acercas al "
"oído."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken clay golem"
msgid_plural "broken clay golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de arcilla roto"
msgstr[1] "golems de arcilla rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken clay golem
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken clay golem, looking like a piece of post-modern art.  Could be "
"smashed for clay."
msgstr ""
"Un golem de arcilla roto, que parece una pieza de arte post-moderno. Podría "
"ser aplastado por la arcilla."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken plastic golem"
msgid_plural "broken plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de plástico roto"
msgstr[1] "golems de plástico rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken plastic golem
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken plastic golem, like a giant action figure chewed up by an equally "
"giant puppy.  You could smash it up into recycled plastic bits."
msgstr ""
"Un golem de plástico roto, como una figura de acción gigante masticada por "
"un cachorro igualmente gigante. Podrías romperlo en trocitos de plástico "
"para reciclarlo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken stone golem"
msgid_plural "broken stone golems"
msgstr[0] "gólem de piedra rota"
msgstr[1] "gólems de piedra rotas"

#. ~ Description for broken stone golem
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken stone golem, not that much different from big boulder.  Could be "
"smashed for stone."
msgstr ""
"Un gólem de piedra roto, no muy diferente de una gran roca. Podría ser "
"aplastado por la piedra."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken iron golem"
msgid_plural "broken iron golems"
msgstr[0] "gólem de hierro roto"
msgstr[1] "gólems de hierro rotos"

#. ~ Description for broken iron golem
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken iron golem, with all iron you would possibly ever need.  Could be "
"smashed for iron."
msgstr ""
"Un golem de hierro roto, con todo el hierro que puedas necesitar. Podría "
"romperse por el hierro."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "broken forge born"
msgid_plural "broken forge borns"
msgstr[0] "forja nacida rota"
msgstr[1] "forjas nacidas rotas"

#. ~ Description for broken forge born
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broken forge born, with all orichalcum you would possibly ever need.  "
"Could be smashed for orichalcum."
msgstr ""
"Una forja nacida rota, con todo el oricalco que puedas necesitar. Podría "
"romperse por el oricalco."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "lesser dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "lesser dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "bolsa dimensional menor"
msgstr[1] "bolsas dimensionales menores"

#. ~ Description for lesser dimensional bag
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a bag that can contain more than it should.  The bag magically "
"reduces the weight of its contents and expands less than the amount of stuff"
" you put into it.  It takes a few words and hand-waving to take an item out."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una bolsa que puede contener más de lo que debería. La bolsa reduce "
"mágicamente el peso de su contenido y se expande menos que la cantidad de "
"cosas que pones en ella. Se necesitan unas pocas palabras y agitar la mano "
"para sacar un artículo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "bolsa dimensional"
msgstr[1] "bolsas dimensionales"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "greater dimensional bag"
msgid_plural "greater dimensional bags"
msgstr[0] "bolsa dimensional grande"
msgstr[1] "bolsas dimensionales grandes"

#. ~ Description for greater dimensional bag
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This dimensional bag has reached the limits of human innovation with a "
"combination of manufacturing and magical secrets."
msgstr ""
"Esta bolsa dimensional ha alcanzado los límites de la innovación humana con "
"una combinación de fabricación y secretos mágicos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "supergravity preservation box"
msgid_plural "supergravity preservation boxes"
msgstr[0] "caja de preservación de supergravedad"
msgstr[1] "cajas de preservación de supergravedad"

#. ~ Description for supergravity preservation box
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A box that uses gravity magic to preserve food.  It makes the box much "
"heavier, but anything in it lasts far longer and you can store more."
msgstr ""
"Una caja que usa la magia de la gravedad para preservar la comida. Hace que "
"la caja sea mucho más pesada, pero todo lo que hay en ella dura mucho más "
"tiempo y se puede almacenar más."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "minor staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "minor staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "bastón de los magi mínimo"
msgstr[1] "bastones de los magi mínimos"

#. ~ Description for minor staff of the magi
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple carved staff, made of wood.  It faintly glows with magic when you "
"cast spells.  Wielding it slightly increases your mana regeneration"
msgstr ""
"Un simple bastón tallado, hecho de madera. Brilla débilmente con magia "
"cuando haces hechizos. Blandirla aumenta ligeramente tu regeneración de maná"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "lesser staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "lesser staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "bastón de los magi menor"
msgstr[1] "bastones de los magi menores"

#. ~ Description for lesser staff of the magi
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood.  It faintly glows with "
"magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon.  Wielding "
"it increases your mana regeneration."
msgstr ""
"Un bastón bellamente tallado, hecho de madera encantada. Brilla tenuemente "
"con magia cuando haces hechizos, pero no es un arma de combate robusta. "
"Blandirla aumenta tu regeneración de maná."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "greater staff of the magi"
msgid_plural "greater staves of the magi"
msgstr[0] "bastón mayor de los magi"
msgstr[1] "bastones mayores de los magi"

#. ~ Description for greater staff of the magi
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A beautifully carved staff, made of enchanted wood and mithril.  It faintly "
"glows with magic when you cast spells, but it is not a sturdy melee weapon."
"  Wielding it greatly increases your mana regeneration."
msgstr ""
"Un bastón bellamente tallado, hecho de madera encantada y mitril. Brilla "
"tenuemente con magia cuando se lanzan hechizos, pero no es un arma de "
"combate robusta. Blandirla aumenta enormemente tu regeneración de maná."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "fireball hammer"
msgid_plural "fireball hammers"
msgstr[0] "martillo de bola de fuego"
msgstr[1] "martillos de bola de fuego"

#. ~ Description for fireball hammer
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Use with caution!  Flammable!  Explosive!"
msgstr "¡Utilícelo con precaución! ¡Inflamable! ¡Explosivo!"

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "The Iron Whip"
msgid_plural "Iron Whips"
msgstr[0] "Látigo de Hierro"
msgstr[1] "Látigos de Hierro"

#. ~ Use action msg for The Iron Whip.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You loop the whip in your hand and it coils back into a belt form in an "
"instant."
msgstr ""
"Enroscas el látigo en tu mano y se vuelve a enrollar en forma de cinturón en"
" un instante."

#. ~ Description for The Iron Whip
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long braided flexible steel bullwhip that narrows into a sharp blade at "
"the end.  Easily capable of slicing and dicing anything that comes at you.  "
"It transforms back into a belt."
msgstr ""
"Un largo torbellino de acero flexible trenzado que se estrecha en una hoja "
"afilada en el extremo. Fácilmente capaz de rebanar y cortar en cubos "
"cualquier cosa que venga hacia ti. Se transforma de nuevo en un cinturón."

