msgid "Wicked Bonespear"
msgid_plural "Wicked Bonespears"
msgstr[0] "Lanza de Hueso Maldita"
msgstr[1] "Lanzas de Hueso Malditas"

#. ~ Description for Wicked Bonespear
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "This is a wicked spear/halberd hybrid entirely created of bone."
msgstr ""
"Este es un híbrido malvado de lanza y alabarda creada enteramente de hueso."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "flaming sword"
msgid_plural "flaming swords"
msgstr[0] "espada llameante"
msgstr[1] "espadas llameantes"

#. ~ Description for flaming sword
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This wooden sword is ablaze!  It seems to be safe-ish to hold, but will burn"
" up soon."
msgstr ""
"¡Esta espada de madera está en llamas! Parece que es segura de sostener, "
"pero se quemará pronto."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "decaying boneclub"
msgid_plural "decaying boneclubs"
msgstr[0] "garrote de hueso pútrido"
msgstr[1] "garrotes de hueso pútrido"

#. ~ Description for decaying boneclub
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pulsating club made of bone, stained with an ever-moving blood coating "
"eager to absorb the living."
msgstr ""
"Un garrote pulsante hecho de hueso, manchado con una capa de sangre en "
"constante movimiento, ansioso de absorber a los vivos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "subzero talons"
msgid_plural "subzero talons"
msgstr[0] "garra bajo cero"
msgstr[1] "garras bajo cero"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'subzero talons'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Claws made from ice, able to freeze on contact while mauling foes.  You, "
"however, feel only a slight chill on your hands."
msgstr ""
"Garras hechas de hielo, capaces de congelar al contacto mientras se ataca a "
"los enemigos. Sin embargo, tu sólo sientes un ligero escalofrío en tus "
"manos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "jar of force"
msgid_plural "jars of force"
msgstr[0] "tarro de fuerza"
msgstr[1] "tarros de fuerza"

#. ~ Description for jar of force
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A three-liter container made out of transparent force.  Can be used to store"
" liquids."
msgstr ""
"Un recipiente de tres litros hecho de fuerza transparente. Puede utilizarse "
"para almacenar líquidos."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "holy sword"
msgid_plural "holy swords"
msgstr[0] "espada sagrada"
msgstr[1] "espadas sagradas"

#. ~ Description for holy sword
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a summoned medieval sword, between the lighter arming sword and "
"later two-handed swords in size.  It glows slightly and its edge is "
"exceedingly sharp."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una espada medieval invocada, entre la espada de caballero más "
"ligera y las grandes espadas de dos manos en tamaño. Brilla ligeramente y su"
" filo es extremadamente afilado."

#. ~ Description for Mjölnir
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mjölnir, the legendary hammer of Thor.  It is rumored to be able to level "
"mountains with a single blow.  You feel the power of Asgard coursing through"
" the hammer."
msgstr ""
"Mjölnir, el legendario martillo de Thor. Se rumorea que es capaz de nivelar "
"montañas con un solo golpe. Sientes el poder de Asgard corriendo a través "
"del martillo."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Gungnir"
msgid_plural "Gungnirs"
msgstr[0] "Gungnir"
msgstr[1] "Gungnirs"

#. ~ Description for Gungnir
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Gungnir, the spear of Odin.  It is rumored to be the perfect spear, "
"perfectly hitting any target regardless of the wielder's strength or skill."
"  If feels like Odin's protecting you."
msgstr ""
"Gungnir, la lanza de Odín. Se rumorea que es la lanza perfecta, que da en el"
" blanco sin importar la fuerza o habilidad del que la usa. Se siente como si"
" Odín te protegiera."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Gram"
msgid_plural "Grams"
msgstr[0] "Gram"
msgstr[1] "Grams"

#. ~ Description for Gram
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Gram, the sword of Sigurd.  It is rumored to be the sword that slayed the "
"legendary dragon, Fafnir.  Once said to have cleaved Regin's anvil in half, "
"the edge is impeccable."
msgstr ""
"Gram, la espada de Sigurd. Se rumorea que es la espada que mató al "
"legendario dragón Fafnir. Una vez se dijo que había partido el yunque de "
"Regin por la mitad, el filo es impecable."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "Laevateinn"
msgid_plural "Laevateinns"
msgstr[0] "Laevateinn"
msgstr[1] "Laevateinns"

#. ~ Description for Laevateinn
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Laevateinn, the staff of Loki.  Said to have been plucked from the gates of "
"Hel by Loki.  Imbued with a mysterious magic, the magic of the trickster god"
" himself."
msgstr ""
"Laevateinn, el bastón de Loki. Se dice que fue arrancado de las puertas de "
"Hel por Loki. Imbuido de una magia misteriosa, la magia del mismísimo dios "
"embaucador."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/SPELL_from_json.py
msgid "Wolfsbane"
msgid_plural "Wolfsbanes"
msgstr[0] "Wolfsbane"
msgstr[1] "Wolfsbanes"

#. ~ Description for Wolfsbane
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wolfsbane pikes are generally antiques brought over from Europe.  Forged "
"during the days when the Black Forest went from France to Transylvania, "
"these spears targeted the Loup Garou that were weak against fire."
msgstr ""
"Las picas de wolfsbane son generalmente antigüedades traídas de Europa. "
"Forjadas durante los días en que la Selva Negra iba de Francia a "
"Transilvania, estas lanzas apuntaban a los Loup Garou que eran débiles "
"contra el fuego."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "orichalcum ingot"
msgid_plural "orichalcum ingots"
msgstr[0] "lingote de oricalco"
msgstr[1] "lingotes de oricalco"

#. ~ Description for orichalcum ingot
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ingot of orichalcum.  About 3 cm by 7 cm by 12 cm in size, ready to be "
"used for various blacksmithing tasks."
msgstr ""
"Un lingote de oricalco. De unos 3 cm por 7 cm por 12 cm de tamaño, listo "
"para ser usado para varias tareas de herrería."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "mithril ingot"
msgid_plural "mithril ingots"
msgstr[0] "lingote de mithril"
msgstr[1] "lingotes de mithril"

#. ~ Description for mithril ingot
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ingot of mithril.  About 3 cm by 7 cm by 12 cm in size, ready to be used "
"for various blacksmithing tasks."
msgstr ""
"Un lingote de mithril. De unos 3 cm por 7 cm por 12 cm de tamaño, listo para"
" ser usado para varias tareas de herrería."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "toolbox token"
msgid_plural "toolbox tokens"
msgstr[0] "ficha de caja de herramientas"
msgstr[1] "fichas de caja de herramientas"

#. ~ Use action msg for toolbox token.
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You say the command word engraved on the token, and it rapidly grows and "
"morphs into a shiny pristine toolbox!"
msgstr ""
"Dices la palabra de comando grabada en la ficha, y rápidamente crece y se "
"transforma en una brillante caja de herramientas prístina!"

#. ~ Description for toolbox token
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large silver coin that, when activated by uttering the word on the back, "
"turns into the item pictured on the front, in this case a toolbox."
msgstr ""
"Una gran moneda de plata que, cuando se activa pronunciando la palabra en el"
" reverso, se convierte en el artículo que aparece en el anverso, en este "
"caso una caja de herramientas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "cauldron of purification"
msgid_plural "cauldrons of purification"
msgstr[0] "caldera de purificación"
msgstr[1] "calderas de purificación"

#. ~ Description for cauldron of purification
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This cauldron made of demon spider chitin seems to absorb the light.  It "
"will hold 16 liters of material and will absorb poisons from it.  It may "
"have other properties that require discovery."
msgstr ""
"Este caldero hecho de quitina de araña demoníaca parece absorber la luz. "
"Contendrá 16 litros de material y absorberá venenos de él. Puede tener otras"
" propiedades que requieren ser descubiertas."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "orichalcum cauldron"
msgid_plural "orichalcum cauldrons"
msgstr[0] "caldera de oricalco"
msgstr[1] "calderas de oricalco"

#. ~ Description for orichalcum cauldron
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an alchemical cauldron made of orichalcum.  The metal is especially "
"resistant to the unique types of corrosion caused by alchemy."
msgstr ""
"Este es un caldero alquímico hecho de oricalco. El metal es especialmente "
"resistente a los tipos únicos de corrosión causados por la alquimia."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "fireproof mortar"
msgid_plural "fireproof mortar"
msgstr[0] "mortero ignífugo"
msgstr[1] "mortero ignífugo"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fireproof mortar'}
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some alchemical mortar, ready to be used in building projects expecting "
"temperatures on par with dragonbreath."
msgstr ""
"Mortero alquímico, listo para ser usado en proyectos de construcción que "
"esperan temperaturas a la par con el aliento de dragón."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "greatclub"
msgid_plural "greatclubs"
msgstr[0] "garrote grande"
msgstr[1] "garrotes grandes"

#. ~ Description for greatclub
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stout knotty club with a large knob at the top.  While it's very heavy, "
"it's a very effective weapon in the hands of a strong opponent."
msgstr ""
"Es un palo robusto y nudoso con una gran perilla en la parte superior. "
"Aunque es muy pesado, es un arma muy efectiva en las manos de un oponente "
"fuerte."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "wood trident"
msgid_plural "wood tridents"
msgstr[0] "tridente de madera"
msgstr[1] "tridentes de madera"

#. ~ Description for wood trident
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wooden melee weapon with a hand-forged steel forked spearhead attached to "
"the end.  It can be used for stabbing opponents either in close-range or as "
"a thrown weapon, and in the right hands can also readily disarm opponents."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de madera con una punta de acero forjado a mano y con una horquilla "
"en el extremo. Puede ser usada para apuñalar a los oponentes, ya sea a corta"
" distancia o como arma arrojada, y en las manos correctas también puede "
"desarmar fácilmente a los oponentes."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "barbed javelin"
msgid_plural "barbed javelins"
msgstr[0] "jabalina con alambre de púas"
msgstr[1] "jabalinas con alambre de púas"

#. ~ Description for barbed javelin
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This weapon measures about 3 feet in length and is fletched like an arrow "
"for better accuracy.  The business end of the javelin has wicked-looking "
"barbs which could cause significant bleeding."
msgstr ""
"Esta arma mide alrededor de 3 pies de largo y se flexiona como una flecha "
"para una mejor precisión. El extremo de la jabalina tiene púas de aspecto "
"malvado que podrían causar una hemorragia significativa."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "foldable orichalcum frame"
msgid_plural "foldable orichalcum frames"
msgstr[0] "marco plegable de oricalco"
msgstr[1] "marcos plegables de oricalco"

#. ~ Description for foldable orichalcum frame
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A folding frame made of orichalcum pipes.  Not as light as aluminum, but "
"significantly sturdier."
msgstr ""
"Un marco plegable hecho de tubos de oricalco. No tan ligero como el "
"aluminio, pero significativamente más resistente."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "orichalcum frame"
msgid_plural "orichalcum frames"
msgstr[0] "marco de oricalco"
msgstr[1] "marcos de oricalco"

#. ~ Description for orichalcum frame
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A frame made of orichalcum.  Significantly sturdier than steel, but also "
"much more expensive."
msgstr ""
"Un marco hecho de oricalco. Significativamente más robusto que el acero, "
"pero también mucho más caro."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "light orichalcum frame"
msgid_plural "light orichalcum frames"
msgstr[0] "marco ligero de oricalco"
msgstr[1] "marcos ligeros de oricalco"

#. ~ Description for light orichalcum frame
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A frame made of orichalcum.  Partially torn down in order to reduce weight "
"at the cost of durability."
msgstr ""
"Un marco hecho de oricalco. Parcialmente desmontado para reducir el peso a "
"costa de la durabilidad."

#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid "magic v-twin combustion engine"
msgid_plural "magic v-twin combustion engines"
msgstr[0] "motor de combustión bicilíndrico mágico"
msgstr[1] "motores de combustión bicilíndricos mágicos"

#. ~ Description for magic v-twin combustion engine
#: lang/json/GENERIC_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A magically manifested combustion engine.  Despite operating entirely off of"
" mana rather than normal fuel, it otherwise functions exactly as a "
"conventional internal combustion engine."
msgstr ""
"Un motor de combustión manifestado mágicamente. A pesar de funcionar "
"completamente con maná en lugar de con combustible normal, su funcionamiento"
" es idéntico al de un motor de combustión interna convencional."

