"Un pez luna de oreja larga. Un pequeño pez relacionado con la lubina o la "
"morraja de agalla azul."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "redear sunfish"
msgid_plural "redear sunfish"
msgstr[0] "pez luna de oreja roja"
msgstr[1] "peces luna de oreja roja"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'redear sunfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A redear sunfish.  A small fish related to bass or bluegill."
msgstr ""
"Un pez luna de oreja roja. Un pequeño pez emparentado con la lubina o la "
"mojarra de pez azul."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rock bass"
msgid_plural "rock bass"
msgstr[0] "lubina de roca"
msgstr[1] "lubinas de roca"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'rock bass'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rock bass.  Related to sunfish, this tiny fish has a camouflage-like "
"patterning and a red eye."
msgstr ""
"Un lubina de roca. Relacionado con el pez luna, este pequeño pez tiene un "
"patrón de camuflaje y un ojo rojo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "calico bass"
msgid_plural "calico bass"
msgstr[0] "Paralabrax clathratus"
msgstr[1] "Paralabrax clathratus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'calico bass'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A calico bass.  A medium-sized fish also known as a 'Crappie'."
msgstr ""
"Un calico bass. Un pez de tamaño mediano también conocido como \"Crappie\"."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "warmouth"
msgid_plural "warmouths"
msgstr[0] "Lepomis gulosus"
msgstr[1] "Lepomis gulosus"

#. ~ Description for warmouth
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A warmouth, similar to a rock bass, this small fish is related to the "
"sunfish."
msgstr ""
"Un warmouth, similar al rock bass, este pequeño pez está relacionado con el "
"pez luna."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bullhead"
msgid_plural "bullheads"
msgstr[0] "siluro"
msgstr[1] "siluros"

#. ~ Description for bullhead
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A bullhead, a type of catfish.  Delicious battered and fried."
msgstr "Es un bagre, una especie del pez gato. Es delicioso rebozado y frito."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "channel catfish"
msgid_plural "channel catfish"
msgstr[0] "siluro de canal"
msgstr[1] "siluros de canal"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'channel catfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A channel catfish, they have a forked tail and long whiskers."
msgstr "Un siluro de canal, tienen una cola bífida y largos bigotes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "white catfish"
msgid_plural "white catfish"
msgstr[0] "pez gato blanco"
msgstr[1] "peces gato blanco"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'white catfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A white catfish, a small whiskered fish with a broad head."
msgstr "Un gato blanco, un pequeño pez con bigotes y cabeza ancha."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgctxt "fish"
msgid "pike"
msgid_plural "pikes"
msgstr[0] "lucio"
msgstr[1] "lucios"

#. ~ Description for pike
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A northern pike.  Pike can be a pretty aggressive fish, careful around those"
" teeth."
msgstr ""
"Es un lucio del norte. Los lucios pueden ser peces muy agresivos, ten "
"cuidado con esos dientes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pickerel"
msgid_plural "pickerels"
msgstr[0] " lucio"
msgstr[1] " lucios"

#. ~ Description for pickerel
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A pickerel.  It looks like a pike, but much smaller."
msgstr "Un lucio. Se parece a una pica, pero es mucho más pequeña."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "muskellunge"
msgid_plural "muskellunges"
msgstr[0] "lucio"
msgstr[1] "lucios"

#. ~ Description for muskellunge
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A muskellunge.  Closely related to pike, it shares the same aggression and "
"sharp teeth."
msgstr ""
"Un lucio.  Estrechamente relacionado con el lucio, comparte la misma "
"agresión y dientes afilados."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "white sucker"
msgid_plural "white suckers"
msgstr[0] "Catostomus commersonii"
msgstr[1] "Catostomus commersonii"

#. ~ Description for white sucker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A white sucker.  It has a streamlined body with a round mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un chupador blanco.  Tiene un cuerpo aerodinámico con una boca redonda."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "carp"
msgid_plural "carps"
msgstr[0] "carpa"
msgstr[1] "carpas"

#. ~ Description for carp
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A golden-yellow common carp.  Some people think they don't taste great, but "
"you can't afford to be choosy in the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Una carpa común de color amarillo dorado. Algunas personas piensan que no "
"saben bien, pero no puedes permitirte ser exigente en el Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grass carp"
msgid_plural "grass carps"
msgstr[0] "carpa forrajera"
msgstr[1] "carpas forrajeras"

#. ~ Description for grass carp
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A huge grass carp.  A golden, herbivorous fish."
msgstr "Una enorme carpa forrajera. Un pez dorado y herbívoro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bowfin"
msgid_plural "bowfins"
msgstr[0] "amia calva"
msgstr[1] "amias calva"

#. ~ Description for bowfin
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bowfin.  These fish are related to gar but without the huge teeth, skin "
"rending scales, and aggression."
msgstr ""
"Amia calva. Estos peces están relacionados con el gar pero sin los enormes "
"dientes, las escamas desgarradoras de la piel y la agresión."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fallfish"
msgid_plural "fallfish"
msgstr[0] "Semotilus corporalis"
msgstr[1] "semotilus corporalis"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fallfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fallfish.  These fish are related to gar but without the huge teeth, skin "
"rending scales, and aggression."
msgstr ""
"Un Semotilus corporalis. Estos peces están relacionados con el gar pero sin "
"los enormes dientes, las escamas desgarradoras de la piel y la agresión."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lobster"
msgid_plural "lobsters"
msgstr[0] "langosta"
msgstr[1] "langostas"

#. ~ Description for lobster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These things were once considered pests not worth eating, then some "
"marketing genius started selling them to people as a delicacy and they took "
"off in popularity… and price."
msgstr ""
"Estas cosas fueron consideradas una vez como plagas que no valían la pena "
"comer, entonces algún genio del marketing empezó a venderlas a la gente como"
" una delicadeza y despegaron en popularidad... y precio."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crayfish"
msgid_plural "crayfish"
msgstr[0] "cangrejo de rio"
msgstr[1] "cangrejos de rio"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'crayfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you could get a hold of a bunch more of these, a hefty pot of boiling "
"water, and some spicy seasonings…"
msgstr ""
"Si pudieras conseguir un montón más de estos, una olla grande de agua "
"hirviendo, y algunos condimentos picantes..."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Blinky"
msgid_plural "Blinkies"
msgstr[0] "Blinky"
msgstr[1] "Blinkies"

#. ~ Description for Blinky
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A strange three-eyed fish."
msgstr "Un extraño pez de tres ojos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "freshwater eel"
msgid_plural "freshwater eels"
msgstr[0] "anguila de agua dulce"
msgstr[1] "anguilas de agua dulce"

#. ~ Description for freshwater eel
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An American eel.  Used to be quite common in these parts until the dams were"
" built.  Guess they'll get a second chance now that they aren't running."
msgstr ""
"Es una anguila americana. Antes era muy común por estos lugares hasta que se"
" construyeron las represas. Supongo que ahora tendrán otra oportunidad ya "
"que las represas no funcionan."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge crayfish"
msgid_plural "huge crayfish"
msgstr[0] "cangrejo de rio enorme"
msgstr[1] "cangrejos de rio enorme"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'huge crayfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant crayfish the size of a dog with a brown carapace, claws, and long "
"antennae."
msgstr ""
"Un cangrejo mutante del tamaño de un perro con un caparazón marrón, garras y"
" largas antenas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant crayfish"
msgid_plural "giant crayfish"
msgstr[0] "cangrejo de rio gigante"
msgstr[1] "cangrejos de rio gigantes"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'giant crayfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant, terrestrial variety of the signal crayfish, this massive "
"crustacean resembles a humongous lobster."
msgstr ""
"Una mutada variedad de tierra de las cangrejos de río, este enorme crustáceo"
" se parece a una langosta inmensa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "colossal crayfish"
msgid_plural "colossal crayfish"
msgstr[0] "cangrejo de rio colosal"
msgstr[1] "cangrejos de rio colosales"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'colossal crayfish'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "An enormous mutated gray crayfish with pincer claws and long antennae."
msgstr "Un enorme cangrejo gris mutado con garras de pinza y largas antenas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "razorclaw"
msgid_plural "razorclaws"
msgstr[0] "garracuchilla"
msgstr[1] "garracuchillas"

#. ~ Description for razorclaw
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A man-sized crustacean clad in an iron-like chitin, capable of emitting the "
"most horrible of shrieks.  Often spotted near shipwrecks or other dark damp "
"places, which it uses as nesting grounds."
msgstr ""
"Un crustáceo del tamaño de un humano cubierto de una quitina que parece de "
"hierro, capaz de emitir el más horrible de los aullidos. Se lo puede "
"encontrar a menudo cerca de los naufragios y otros lugares húmedos y "
"oscuros, que utiliza para hacer sus nidos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant carp"
msgid_plural "giant carps"
msgstr[0] "carpa gigante"
msgstr[1] "carpas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant carp
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This thing seems like a carp, only swollen and very very angry.  Death is "
"the gift of the carp god."
msgstr ""
"Esta cosa se parece a una carpa, pero hinchada y muy muy enojada. La muerte "
"es el regalo para el dios carpa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant salmon"
msgid_plural "giant salmons"
msgstr[0] "salmón gigante"
msgstr[1] "salmones gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant salmon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutated salmon, the same size as a large dog and quite dangerous to the "
"inexperienced angler."
msgstr ""
"Un salmón mutado, del mismo tamaño que un perro y bastante peligroso para el"
" pescador inexperto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "seweranha"
msgid_plural "seweranhas"
msgstr[0] "piraña de cloaca"
msgstr[1] "pirañas de cloaca"

#. ~ Description for seweranha
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large mutant variety of carp.  It has shimmering green scales and a mouth "
"lined with three jagged rows of razor-sharp teeth."
msgstr ""
"Una variedad mutada de una carpa grande. Tiene escamas verdes relucientes y "
"una boca con tres filas dentadas con dientes afilados como navajas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal boomer"
msgid_plural "fungal boomers"
msgstr[0] "boomer con hongos"
msgstr[1] "boomers con hongos"

#. ~ Description for fungal boomer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rotund and bloated human body with pasty, fungus-ridden flesh.  Its mouth "
"drips with a frothing gray sludge."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano gordo e hinchado con la carne pálida infestada por hongos. "
"De su boca gotea un cieno gris espumoso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal blossom"
msgid_plural "fungal blossoms"
msgstr[0] "capullo fúngico"
msgstr[1] "capullos fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal blossom
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A broad fungus, looking much like a glowing blue sunflower.  It appears to "
"emit finer spores than the typical fungal emission."
msgstr ""
"Un hongo ancho, muy parecido a un brillante girasol azul. Parece emitir "
"esporas más finas que las que emiten típicamente los hongos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal hedgerow"
msgid_plural "fungal hedgerows"
msgstr[0] "seto fúngico"
msgstr[1] "setos fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal hedgerow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Looking at first glance like a dull gray privet, this \"hedge\" is really a "
"mass of barbed fungal tendrils, defending the fungal tower."
msgstr ""
"A primera vista, parece un aburrido ligustro gris, pero este \"seto\" es en "
"realidad una masa de zarcillos fúngicos con púas, que defienden la torre "
"fúngica."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal tendril"
msgid_plural "fungal tendrils"
msgstr[0] "zarcillo fúngico"
msgstr[1] "zarcillos fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal tendril
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A long and delicate-looking tendril with a sharp tip."
msgstr "Un zarcillo largo y aparentemente delicado, con la punta afilada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "fungal wall"
msgid_plural "fungal walls"
msgstr[0] "pared fúngica"
msgstr[1] "paredes fúngicas"

#. ~ Description for fungal wall
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A veritable wall of fungus, grown as a natural defense by the fungal spire."
"  New spores erupt from the surface every few seconds, and tendrils "
"constrict around it, pulling new mass into its shape.  They move with an "
"inexorable strength that could snap limbs."
msgstr ""
"Una verdadera pared de hongos, cultivada como una defensa natural por la "
"espira de los hongos. Nuevas esporas salen de la superficie cada pocos "
"segundos, y los zarcillos se estrechan a su alrededor, atrayendo nueva masa "
"a su forma. Se mueven con una fuerza inexorable que podría romper las "
"extremidades."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungaloid"
msgid_plural "fungaloids"
msgstr[0] "fungaloide"
msgstr[1] "fungaloides"

#. ~ Description for fungaloid
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pale white fungus, one meaty gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  "
"Spores are periodically expelled from its gills, and a few tendrils extend "
"from the base, allowing mobility and some basic means of defense."
msgstr ""
"Es un pálido hongo blanco, un tallo carnoso gris arriba del cual se apoya el"
" sombrero. De vez en cuando, algunas esporas son despedidas por sus "
"branquias y algunos zarcillos se extienden desde su base, lo que le permite "
"moverse y tener medios para defenderse."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungaloid shambler"
msgid_plural "fungaloid shamblers"
msgstr[0] "desastre fungaloide"
msgstr[1] "desastres fungaloides"

#. ~ Description for fungaloid shambler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large white fungus, a bulging gray stalk supporting a bloom at the top.  "
"Spores float from its gills and tendrils extend from the base.  Chunks of "
"rock, metal, bone, and wood are held by tendrils as a kind of armor."
msgstr ""
"Un gran hongo blanco, un tallo gris abultado que sostiene una floración en "
"la parte superior. Las esporas flotan desde sus branquias y los zarcillos se"
" extienden desde la base. Trozos de roca, metal, hueso y madera son "
"sostenidos por los zarcillos como una especie de armadura."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The fungaloid shambler throws a rock!"
msgstr "¡El desastre fungaloide lanza una piedra!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal spire"
msgid_plural "fungal spires"
msgstr[0] "torre fúngica"
msgstr[1] "torres fúngicas"

#. ~ Description for fungal spire
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous fungal spire, towering over the ground.  It pulsates slowly, "
"continuously growing new defenses."
msgstr ""
"Es una enorme torre fúngica, que se eleva desde el cielo. Palpita lentamente"
" y está generando continuamente nuevas defensas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant fungal blossom"
msgid_plural "giant fungal blossoms"
msgstr[0] "capullo fúngico gigante"
msgstr[1] "capullos fúngicos gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant fungal blossom
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An immense fungal blossom, towering over its surroundings.  It pulses with a"
" soft blue glow, continuously pumping its spores into the air."
msgstr ""
"Un inmenso capullo fúngico, que sobresale en el paisaje. Palpita con un "
"brillo azul suave, y está continuamente tirando esporas en el aire."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/overmap_terrain_from_json.py
msgid "fungal tower"
msgid_plural "fungal towers"
msgstr[0] "torre fúngica"
msgstr[1] "torres fúngicas"

#. ~ Description for fungal tower
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous fungal tower.  On closer inspection, its cap is supported by "
"LOTS of fungal tendrils of various thicknesses, emerging from yet more "
"bristling tendrils at ground level.  Between this redundancy and their "
"noticeable movement creating frequent gaps, it's tough to get a solid shot "
"on the thing."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme torre fúngica. Mirando más de cerca, su parte de arriba está "
"apoyado en MUCHOS zarcillos de diferentes grosores, que emergen de más "
"zarcillos erizados que están en el suelo. Entre esta repetición y su "
"movimiento notable para crear grietas frecuentes, es difícil poder "
"dispararle a la cosa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal sporeling"
msgid_plural "fungal sporelings"
msgstr[0] "espora fúngica"
msgstr[1] "esporas fúngicas"

#. ~ Description for fungal sporeling
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fungal stalk several feet in height.  Two vicious looking tendrils extend "
"from its thorned and leathery exterior, and it moves about faster than the "
"larger fungaloids."
msgstr ""
"Es un tallo de hongo de más de un metro de alto. Dos zarcillos de apariencia"
" feroz se extienden desde el curtido tallo que está lleno de espinas. Se "
"mueve un poco más rápido que los fungaloides más grandes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "spore cloud"
msgid_plural "spore clouds"
msgstr[0] "nube de esporas"
msgstr[1] "nubes de esporas"

#. ~ Description for spore cloud
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A mass of spores the size of a balled fist, wafting around in the air."
msgstr "Es una masa de esporas del tamaño de puños flotando por el aire."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi con hongos"
msgstr[1] "zombis con hongos"

#. ~ Description for fungal zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once human, fungal tendrils now sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other "
"orifices, holding together a shambling mass of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr ""
"Una vez fue un humano, ahora brotan tallos de hongos de su boca, ojos y "
"otros orificios, manteniendo unido la masa desordenada de carne cubierta con"
" moho."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bloated fungal zombie"
msgid_plural "bloated fungal zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi hinchado fúngico"
msgstr[1] "zombis hinchados fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for bloated fungal zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With its swollen gray skin overgrown by thick layer of mold, this balloon-"
"like fungal zombie looks like it could violently burst with a cloud of "
"noxious spores."
msgstr ""
"Con su piel gris e hinchada, cubierta por una gruesa capa de moho, este "
"zombi fúngico con forma de globo parece que podría estallar violentamente "
"con una nube de esporas nocivas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pollinator zombie"
msgid_plural "pollinator zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi polinizador"
msgstr[1] "zombis polinizadores"

#. ~ Description for pollinator zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Every breath of this crooked, fungus-ridden zombie emits a fine dust of "
"spores, and it constantly looks like it's emerging from a cloud of mist."
msgstr ""
"Cada aliento de este torcido zombi, lleno de hongos, emite un fino polvo de "
"esporas, y constantemente parece que está emergiendo de una nube de niebla."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal juggernaut"
msgid_plural "fungal juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "gigante fúngico"
msgstr[1] "gigantes fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal juggernaut
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the ossified plates of this ponderous bone "
"titan, and it seems even its eyes are lost to it.  A dust of spores lands on"
" the ground with every sluggish stomp of its heavy legs."
msgstr ""
"Los hongos florecen en las grietas de las placas osificadas de este pesado "
"titán de los huesos, y parece que hasta sus ojos se han perdido. Un polvo de"
" esporas se posa en el suelo con cada golpe lento de sus pesadas patas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal child"
msgid_plural "fungal children"
msgstr[0] "niño fúngico"
msgstr[1] "niños fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal child
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It is hard to recognize a human child in this creature.  Disgusting-looking "
"mold covers most of its skin.  Many cracks perforate its body, with small "
"fungal stalks poking through."
msgstr ""
"Es difícil reconocer a un niño humano en esta criatura. Un moho de aspecto "
"repugnante cubre la mayor parte de su piel. Muchas grietas perforan su "
"cuerpo, con pequeños tallos de hongos que se abren paso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal ant"
msgid_plural "fungal ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga fúngica"
msgstr[1] "hormigas fúngicas"

#. ~ Description for fungal ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pale, sickly gray in color, this giant ant's cracked exoskeleton is barely "
"held together by coils of fungus erupting from every joint in its body."
msgstr ""
"Esta hormiga gigante, pálida, de un gris enfermizo, tiene el exoesqueleto "
"roto y sus partes están sostenidos por espirales de hongos que salen por "
"cada articulación de su cuerpo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal spider"
msgid_plural "fungal spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña fúngica"
msgstr[1] "arañas fúngicas"

#. ~ Description for fungal spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The abdomen of this sickly looking giant spider is now home to many lumps of"
" blooming fungi.  It is leaving behind a trail of tainted secretions when "
"the spider struggles to drag it along the ground."
msgstr ""
"El abdomen de esta gigante araña de apariencia enfermiza está cubierto de "
"muchos hongos florecientes. Va dejando un rastro de secreciones contaminadas"
" cada vez que la araña se arrastra con esfuerzo por el suelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dark wyrm"
msgid_plural "dark wyrms"
msgstr[0] "wyrm oscuro"
msgstr[1] "wyrms oscuros"

#. ~ Description for dark wyrm
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge mutated worm found deep underground.  It has a gaping round mouth "
"lined with dagger-like teeth, and its flesh is slick with bubbling blue "
"slime."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme gusano mutado, de las profundidades subterráneas. Tiene una boca "
"muy grande y redonda llena de dientes como dagas, y su carne es resbaladiza "
"por una baba azul burbujeante que la cubre."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "graboid"
msgid_plural "graboids"
msgstr[0] "graboid"
msgstr[1] "graboides"

#. ~ Description for graboid
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A monstrous beast the size of a semi truck with a tripartite mouth that "
"opens to reveal hundreds of writhing tongues with razor sharp edges.  It "
"keeps most of its enormous body hidden underground."
msgstr ""
"Una bestia monstruosa del tamaño de un camión con una boca tripartita que se"
" abre para revelar cientos de lenguas retorcidas con bordes afilados. "
"Mantiene la mayor parte de su enorme cuerpo escondido bajo tierra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "half worm"
msgid_plural "half worms"
msgstr[0] "mediogusano"
msgstr[1] "mediogusanos"

#. ~ Description for half worm
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A squiggling severed portion of a wounded giant worm."
msgstr "Una parte movediza cortada de un gusano gigante herido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant worm"
msgid_plural "giant worms"
msgstr[0] "gusano gigante"
msgstr[1] "gusanos gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant worm
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, mutated creature that might once have been a nightcrawler.  It "
"possesses a large fanged mouth and a long slender body that comes up to your"
" shoulder, with even more surely hiding underground."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme criatura mutada que antes podría haber sido una lombriz. Posee "
"una gran boca con colmillos y un cuerpo largo y fino que es alto como hasta "
"tu hombro, pero seguro que tiene la mayoria del cuerpo oculto debajo del "
"suelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "large worm"
msgid_plural "large worms"
msgstr[0] "gusano grande"
msgstr[1] "gusanos grandes"

#. ~ Description for large worm
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large mutated subterranean creature similar to a "
"nightcrawler.  It possesses a fanged mouth and a long slender body that "
"comes up to your knees, with even more surely hiding underground."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme criatura mutada que antes podría haber sido una lombriz. Posee "
"una gran boca con colmillos y un cuerpo largo y fino que es alto como hasta "
"tu hombro, pero seguro que tiene más cuerpo oculto debajo del suelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge cockroach"
msgid_plural "huge cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha enorme"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge cockroach
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Es una cucaracha mutante, del tamaño de un perro pequeño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skittering plague"
msgid_plural "skittering plagues"
msgstr[0] "plaga de escabullidores"
msgstr[1] "plagas de escabullidores"

#. ~ Description for skittering plague
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A giant infected roach, it has been feeding on the undead."
msgstr ""
"Es una cucaracha gigante e infectada, que se ha estado alimentando de los "
"muertos vivientes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "plague nymph"
msgid_plural "plague nymphs"
msgstr[0] "plaga de ninfas"
msgstr[1] "plagas de ninfas"

#. ~ Description for plague nymph
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "An infected mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "Es una cucaracha mutante e infectada del tamaño de una rata."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "plague vector"
msgid_plural "plague vectors"
msgstr[0] "vector de la plaga"
msgstr[1] "vectores de la plaga"

#. ~ Description for plague vector
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This infected roach has been feeding on the undead and started to mutate "
"chaotically.  Extra limbs and growths sprout from its thorax."
msgstr ""
"Esta cucaracha infectada se ha estado alimentando de los no-muertos y ha "
"comenzado a mutar caóticamente. De su tórax brotan miembros y crecimientos "
"adicionales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha gigante"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant cockroach
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A mutant cockroach the size of a dog."
msgstr "Una cucaracha mutante del tamaño de un perro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant cockroach nymph"
msgid_plural "giant cockroach nymphs"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha ninfa gigante"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas ninfas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant cockroach nymph
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A baby mutant cockroach about the size of a rat."
msgstr "Es una cucaracha mutante bebé, del tamaño de una rata."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pregnant giant cockroach"
msgid_plural "pregnant giant cockroaches"
msgstr[0] "cucaracha gigante embarazada"
msgstr[1] "cucarachas gigantes embarazadas"

#. ~ Description for pregnant giant cockroach
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant cockroach the size of a small dog.  Its abdomen is heavily swollen."
msgstr ""
"Una cucaracha mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño. Su abdomen está muy "
"hinchado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge bee"
msgid_plural "huge bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja enorme"
msgstr[1] "abejas enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge bee
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A mutant bee the size of a small dog."
msgstr "Una abeja mutante del tamaño de un perro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant bee"
msgid_plural "giant bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja gigante"
msgstr[1] "abejas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant bee
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With a stinger the size of a kitchen knife, this dog-sized insect's black "
"and yellow markings warn you to leave it undisturbed."
msgstr ""
"Con un aguijón del tamaño de una cuchilla, este insecto del tamaño de un "
"perro es negro con rayas amarillas, que te advierten que te alejes y no "
"molestes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "alpha bee"
msgid_plural "alpha bees"
msgstr[0] "abeja alfa"
msgstr[1] "abejas alfa"

#. ~ Description for alpha bee
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant bee with black and white markings and a long stinger "
"spelling doom."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme abeja mutante con marcas blancas y negras y un largo aguijón que "
"deletrea."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "centipede"
msgid_plural "centipedes"
msgstr[0] "ciempiés"
msgstr[1] "ciempiés"

#. ~ Description for centipede
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A brightly colored mutant centipede the size of a small dog, skittering "
"quickly in the underbrush.  Probably won't think you're suitable prey, but "
"beware its venom."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés mutante de color brillante del tamaño de un perro pequeño, que "
"se desliza rápidamente en la maleza. Probablemente no piense que eres una "
"presa adecuada, pero ten cuidado con su veneno."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant centipede"
msgid_plural "giant centipedes"
msgstr[0] "Ciempiés gigante"
msgstr[1] "Ciempiés gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant centipede
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A two meter long centipede with a menacing set of venom-dripping mandibles "
"and a worrying number of grabbing appendages, moving swiftly on dozens of "
"spindly legs.  It has a pair of small compound eyes, but seems to mostly "
"orient itself with its antennae."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés de dos metros de largo con un amenazador conjunto de mandíbulas "
"que gotean veneno y un preocupante número de apéndices de agarre, que se "
"mueve rápidamente sobre docenas de patas flacas. Tiene un par de pequeños "
"ojos compuestos, pero parece orientarse mayormente con sus antenas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "centipede matriarch"
msgid_plural "centipede matriarchs"
msgstr[0] "matriarca de ciempiés"
msgstr[1] "matriarcas de ciempiés"

#. ~ Description for centipede matriarch
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant centipede grown even larger, hind segments curled up to protect a "
"huge clump of eggs and its children of different ages.  Sometimes one of its"
" young gets shaken off by its clutchmates and disappears into the "
"underbrush."
msgstr ""
"Un ciempiés gigante que creció aún más, los segmentos traseros se curvan "
"para proteger a un enorme grupo de huevos y a sus hijos de diferentes "
"edades. A veces una de sus crías es sacudida por sus compañeros de nidada y "
"desaparece entre la maleza."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "centipede matriarch"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A small centipede is shaken off in the struggle!"
msgstr "¡Un pequeño ciempiés es sacudido en la lucha!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "armored centipede"
msgid_plural "armored centipedes"
msgstr[0] "ciempiés blindado"
msgstr[1] "ciempiés blindados"

#. ~ Description for armored centipede
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge mutated centipede covered in interlocking chitinous plates of "
"metallic grey, reminding you more of a runaway train car than any living "
"animal.  Its mandibles end in jagged points, seemingly specialised to hunt "
"prey at least as well-armored as itself.  You really don't want to try if "
"you'd fare better."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme ciempiés mutado cubierto de placas quitinosas entrelazadas de "
"color gris metálico, que recuerda más a un vagón de tren fugitivo que a "
"cualquier otro animal vivo. Sus mandíbulas terminan en puntos dentados, "
"aparentemente especializados para cazar presas al menos tan bien blindadas "
"como él. Realmente no quieres intentar ver si puedes con él."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge dragonfly naiad"
msgid_plural "huge dragonfly naiads"
msgstr[0] "náyade de libélula enorme"
msgstr[1] "náyades de libélula enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge dragonfly naiad
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The predatory, aquatic larva of a dragonfly, normally barely a centimeter "
"long and feeding on small fishes, grown to the size of a catfish.  "
"Underneath its sharp mandibles you can see that its folded lower jaw changed"
" into something resembling a barbed spear."
msgstr ""
"La larva acuática depredadora de una libélula, normalmente de apenas un cm "
"de largo y que se alimenta de pequeños peces, crece hasta el tamaño de un "
"pez gato. Debajo de sus afiladas mandíbulas se puede ver que su mandíbula "
"inferior doblada se convirtió en algo parecido a una lanza de púas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant dragonfly"
msgid_plural "giant dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libélula gigante"
msgstr[1] "libélulas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant dragonfly
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A ferocious, bright green dragonfly, still lightning-fast despite growing to"
" the size of a schoolchild.  Its head is little more than a basketball-sized"
" pair of rainbow compound eyes, and its legs - already specialized for "
"grasping prey - end in curved talons."
msgstr ""
"Una feroz libélula verde brillante, que sigue siendo veloz como un rayo a "
"pesar de haber crecido hasta el tamaño de un niño de escuela. Su cabeza es "
"poco más que un par de ojos compuestos del tamaño de un balón de baloncesto,"
" y sus patas - ya especializadas para agarrar presas - terminan en garras "
"curvas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fused dragonflies"
msgid_plural "fused dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libélula fusionada"
msgstr[1] "libélulas fusionadas"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'fused dragonflies'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What appears to be a single, enormous insect with a swollen abdomen is "
"actually the amalgamation of two dragonflies, bodies still locked into a "
"telltale heart shape.  The remains of their wings and abdomens form an egg "
"sac they sluggishly pull between them, periodically dropping a handful of "
"glistening eggs."
msgstr ""
"Lo que parece ser un solo y enorme insecto con el abdomen hinchado es en "
"realidad la amalgama de dos libélulas, cuerpos todavía encerrados en una "
"forma de corazón revelador. Los restos de sus alas y su abdomen forman un "
"saco de huevos que lentamente tiran entre ellos, dejando caer periódicamente"
" un puñado de huevos brillantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "firefly"
msgid_plural "fireflies"
msgstr[0] "luciernaga"
msgstr[1] "luciernagas"

#. ~ Description for firefly
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutated firefly grown to the size of a large housecat, brightly glowing "
"abdomen bobbing up and down as it tries to impress its unseen mate.  It "
"looks strangely uninterested in you and everything else."
msgstr ""
"Una luciérnaga mutada que crece hasta el tamaño de un gato doméstico grande,"
" con un abdomen brillante que se balancea hacia arriba y hacia abajo "
"mientras trata de impresionar a su pareja invisible. Parece extrañamente "
"desinteresada en ti y en todo lo demás."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge fly"
msgid_plural "huge flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca enorme"
msgstr[1] "moscas enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge fly
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant housefly the size of a small dog.  Its buzzing is high-pitched and "
"somehow sad."
msgstr ""
"Una mosca doméstica mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño. Su zumbido es "
"agudo y de alguna manera triste."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant fly"
msgid_plural "giant flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca gigante"
msgstr[1] "moscas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant fly
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tremendous housefly the size of a dog, predictably accompanied by a loud, "
"incessant buzzing sound."
msgstr ""
"Es una tremenda mosca común del tamaño de un perro y como era de esperar, la"
" acompaña un zumbido incesante y fuerte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "frigate fly"
msgid_plural "frigate flies"
msgstr[0] "mosca fragata"
msgstr[1] "moscas fragata"

#. ~ Description for frigate fly
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "An enormous mutant housefly creating a loud buzzing sound."
msgstr "Una enorme mosca doméstica mutante creando un fuerte zumbido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge mosquito"
msgid_plural "huge mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito enorme"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge mosquito
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant mosquito the size of a small dog, buzzing and fluttering "
"erratically."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño, zumbando y revoloteando "
"erráticamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant mosquito"
msgid_plural "giant mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito gigante"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant mosquito
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant mutant mosquito, fluttering erratically.  Its face is dominated by a"
" long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante gigante, revoloteando erráticamente. Su cara está "
"dominada por una larga probóscide con punta de lanza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bloodbank mosquito"
msgid_plural "bloodbank mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito banco de sangre"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos banco de sangre"

#. ~ Description for bloodbank mosquito
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant mosquito with huge thin wings and legs.  Its face is "
"dominated by a long, spear-tipped proboscis."
msgstr ""
"Un mosquito mutante enorme con enormes y delgadas alas y patas. Su cara está"
" dominada por una larga probóscide con punta de lanza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge cellar spider"
msgid_plural "huge cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de sótano gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas de sótano gigantes"

#. ~ Description for huge cellar spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant brown spider the size of a small dog with long thin legs, big eyes,"
" and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña marrón mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño con patas largas y "
"delgadas, grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de sótano gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas de sótano gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant cellar spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A twitchy mutant brown spider, with a relatively small body and spindly long"
" legs.  Its smaller brethren are known for being agile, and for preying upon"
" other spiders."
msgstr ""
"Es una araña mutante marrón e inquieta, con un cuerpo relativamente pequeño "
"y patas larguiruchas. Sus familiares pequeños son conocidos por ser ágiles, "
"y por asediar a otras arañas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "warehouse spider"
msgid_plural "warehouse spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de almacén"
msgstr[1] "arañas de almacén"

#. ~ Description for warehouse spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous mutated brown spider with spindly long legs.  Looks like a "
"classic house spider, but so much more."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme araña marrón mutada con patas largas y delgadas. Se parece a la "
"clásica araña doméstica, pero mas grande."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "immature giant cellar spider"
msgid_plural "immature giant cellar spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de sótano gigante inmadura"
msgstr[1] "arañas de sótano gigantes inmaduras"

#. ~ Description for immature giant cellar spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A newly-hatched giant cellar spider.  Too small to possess much venom, but "
"still quick and agile like an adult."
msgstr ""
"Es una araña de patas largas recientemente salida de su huevo. Demasiado "
"pequeña para tener mucho veneno, pero igual es rápida y ágil como un adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge jumping spider"
msgid_plural "huge jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña saltarina gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas saltarinas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for huge jumping spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant spider the size of a small dog with big forelegs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante del tamaño de un perro pequeño con grandes patas "
"delanteras, grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant jumping spider"
msgid_plural "giant jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña saltarina gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas saltarinas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant jumping spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant spider with big forelegs and two pairs of inquisitive-looking eyes."
"  It can leap quite quickly, even into the treetops."
msgstr ""
"Es una araña gigante con grandes patas delanteras y dos pares de ojos "
"inquisitivos. Puede saltar bastante rápido, e incluso sobre los árboles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "missile spider"
msgid_plural "missile spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña misil"
msgstr[1] "arañas misil"

#. ~ Description for missile spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous hairy mutated spider with strong forelegs and a raised, bloated "
"thorax.  Smells like rotten eggs"
msgstr ""
"Una enorme araña mutante peluda con fuertes patas delanteras y un tórax "
"elevado e hinchado. Huele a huevos podridos"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "huge trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampilla enorme"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampilla enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge trapdoor spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dark brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a bulbous thorax, big "
"eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante marrón oscuro del tamaño de un perro con un tórax bulboso,"
" grandes ojos y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "giant trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampilla gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampillas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant trapdoor spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic dark brown spider with a bulbous thorax.  It digs a deep "
"underground burrow that serves as a pit to trap unwary prey."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca araña marrón oscuro con un tórax bulboso. Cava una profunda "
"madriguera subterránea que sirve como foso para atrapar presas incautas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "deathtrap spider"
msgid_plural "deathtrap spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampa mortal"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampa mortal"

#. ~ Description for deathtrap spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous mutated spider with strong thick legs, and a bulbous thorax, "
"dark brown in color."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme araña mutada con fuertes y gruesas patas, y un tórax bulboso, de "
"color marrón oscuro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge web spinning spider"
msgid_plural "huge web spinning spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña tejedora enorme"
msgstr[1] "arañas tejedoras enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge web spinning spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light gray mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, big eyes, and"
" oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante gris claro del tamaño de un perro con patas largas, ojos "
"grandes y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant web spider"
msgid_plural "giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant web spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light gray giant mutated grass spider, it waits for prey to become "
"ensnared in the vast webs that it weaves between the trees."
msgstr ""
"Una araña gigante de la hierba mutada de color gris claro, espera a que su "
"presa quede atrapada en las vastas telarañas que teje entre los árboles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wyrd spider"
msgid_plural "wyrd spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña destino"
msgstr[1] "arañas destino"

#. ~ Description for wyrd spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous mutated grass spider with long spindly legs, light gray in "
"color."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme araña mutante de la hierba con largas patas espinosas, de color "
"gris claro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "immature giant web spider"
msgid_plural "immature giant web spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña gigante inmadura"
msgstr[1] "arañas gigantes inmaduras"

#. ~ Description for immature giant web spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A still immature giant grass spider.  Too young to be venomous, or to walk "
"proficiently for that matter"
msgstr ""
"Una araña gigante todavía inmadura. Demasiado joven para ser venenosa, o "
"para caminar bien, incluso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge black widow spider"
msgid_plural "huge black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra enorme"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge black widow spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A black mutant spider the size of a cat with a long legs, big eyes, and "
"oversized fangs.  There is a red hourglass shape on its thorax."
msgstr ""
"Una araña negra mutante del tamaño de un gato con patas largas, grandes ojos"
" y colmillos de gran tamaño. Tiene una forma de reloj de arena rojo en su "
"tórax."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant black widow"
msgid_plural "giant black widows"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra gigante"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant black widow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on its "
"thorax.  A highly venomous nightmare come to life."
msgstr ""
"Una araña viuda negra gigante mutada. Tiene una forma de reloj de arena rojo"
" en su tórax. Una pesadilla altamente venenosa cobra vida."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black death widow"
msgid_plural "black death widows"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras"

#. ~ Description for black death widow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous mutated black widow spider.  There is a red hourglass shape on "
"its thorax."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme araña viuda negra mutada. Tiene una forma de reloj de arena rojo "
"en su tórax."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant black widow spiderling"
msgid_plural "giant black widow spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "cría de viuda negra gigante"
msgstr[1] "crías de viuda negra gigante"

#. ~ Description for giant black widow spiderling
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The horrid spawn of a giant black widow spider.  Even as a newborn, this "
"foul creature knows only how to kill."
msgstr ""
"El retoño hórrido de una araña viuda negra gigante. Incluso así como recién "
"nacida, esta horrible criatura solo sabe matar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge wolf spider"
msgid_plural "huge wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña lobo enorme"
msgstr[1] "arañas lobo enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge wolf spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shaggy brown mutant spider the size of a dog with a long legs, two "
"especially big eyes, and oversized fangs."
msgstr ""
"Una araña mutante marrón peluda del tamaño de un perro con patas largas, dos"
" ojos especialmente grandes y colmillos de gran tamaño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant wolf spider"
msgid_plural "giant wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña-lobo gigante"
msgstr[1] "arañas-lobo gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant wolf spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wolf spider mutated to about thirty times its normal size, it moves "
"quickly and aggressively to catch and consume prey."
msgstr ""
"Una araña lobo mutada que creció una treinta veces su tamaño normal. Se "
"mueve rápidamente y de manera agresiva para cazar y consumir a su presa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "necrowolf spider"
msgid_plural "necrowolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña necrolobo"
msgstr[1] "arañas necrolobos"

#. ~ Description for necrowolf spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "An enormous hairy mutant wolf spider."
msgstr "Una enorme araña lobo mutante peluda."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wasp larva"
msgid_plural "wasp larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de avispa"
msgstr[1] "larvas de avispa"

#. ~ Description for wasp larva
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dog-sized white grub, featureless apart from a vestigal mouthpart.  It "
"hangs upside-down in its cell, and regurgitates sweet-smelling fluid in "
"return for the scraps of viscera fed to it by the workers below."
msgstr ""
"Una larva blanca del tamaño de un perro, sin más rasgos que un vestigio de "
"boca. Está colgado boca abajo en su celda y regurgita un líquido de olor "
"dulce a cambio de los restos de vísceras que le dan los trabajadores de "
"abajo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wasp pupa"
msgid_plural "wasp pupae"
msgstr[0] "pupa de avispa"
msgstr[1] "pupas de avispa"

#. ~ Description for wasp pupa
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wasp larva undergoing metamorphosis into a full-grown giant wasp.  It "
"looks like a strangely immobile adult coated in a thin white membrane, its "
"legs and wings packed tightly into its cell."
msgstr ""
"Una larva de avispa en proceso de metamorfosis a una avispa gigante adulta. "
"Parece un adulto extrañamente inmóvil recubierto de una fina membrana "
"blanca, con las patas y las alas apretadas en su celda."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wasp"
msgid_plural "wasps"
msgstr[0] "avispa"
msgstr[1] "avispas"

#. ~ Description for wasp
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge wasp the size of a large cat with bright yellow markings on her jet-"
"black carapace and a threatening stinger.  It flies around erratically, "
"searching for smaller prey."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme avispa del tamaño de un gato grande con marcas amarillas "
"brillantes en su caparazón negro azabache y un amenazante aguijón. Vuela "
"erráticamente en busca de presas más pequeñas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wasp guard"
msgid_plural "wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "avispa guardiana"
msgstr[1] "avispas guardianas"

#. ~ Description for wasp guard
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp worker, buzzing around their nest.  While their foraging "
"sisters are relatively content to leave you be, this one won't hesitate to "
"attack anything it considers a threat to the nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr ""
"Una avispa obrera mutada, zumbando alrededor de su nido. Mientras que sus "
"hermanas, buscadoras de alimento, se contentan con vivir y dejar vivir, ésta"
" no dudará en atacar cualquier cosa que considere una amenaza para el nido. "
"No te detengas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wasp queen"
msgid_plural "wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "avispa reina"
msgstr[1] "avispas reina"

#. ~ Description for wasp queen
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutated wasp queen grown to the size of a person, laying a single white "
"egg in each empty cell it comes across while scurrying around on the paper "
"walls of their home.  It struggles to fit into some of them, but the newer "
"cells seem to be getting larger…"
msgstr ""
"Una reina avispa mutada que ha crecido hasta alcanzar el tamaño de una "
"persona, pone un solo huevo blanco en cada celda vacía que encuentra "
"mientras corretea por las paredes de papel de su hogar. Le cuesta caber en "
"algunas de ellas, pero las celdas más nuevas parecen ser cada vez más "
"grandes..."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant wasp"
msgid_plural "giant wasps"
msgstr[0] "avispa gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant wasp
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic wasp worker, scouring the landscape for an easy meal to feed the "
"next generation.  Its abdomen glowers with ominous yellow stripes and ends "
"in a half-hidden stinger the size of a kitchen knife."
msgstr ""
"Una gigantesca avispa obrera, recorriendo el paisaje en busca de una comida "
"fácil para alimentar a la próxima generación. Su abdomen brilla con ominosas"
" rayas amarillas y termina con un aguijón semioculto del tamaño de un "
"cuchillo de cocina."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant wasp guard"
msgid_plural "giant wasp guards"
msgstr[0] "avispa guardiana gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas guardianas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant wasp guard
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wasp worker grown to the size of a person, buzzing around their home.  "
"While their foraging sisters are relatively content to live and let live, "
"this one won't hesitate to attack anything it considers a threat to the "
"nest.  Don't linger."
msgstr ""
"Una avispa obrera del tamaño de una persona, zumbando alrededor de su casa. "
"Mientras que sus hermanas, buscadoras de alimento, se contentan con vivir y "
"dejar vivir, ésta no dudará en atacar cualquier cosa que considere una "
"amenaza para el nido. No te detengas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant wasp queen"
msgid_plural "giant wasp queens"
msgstr[0] "avispa reina gigante"
msgstr[1] "avispas reina gigante"

#. ~ Description for giant wasp queen
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A yellowjacket queen grown to the size of a horse, towering over their "
"daughters.  Even with their abdomen swollen with eggs and wings long unused "
"it still poses a threat to interlopers, should their children have failed at"
" subduing them."
msgstr ""
"Una reina de chaqueta amarilla crecida hasta el tamaño de un caballo, se "
"eleva sobre sus hijas. Incluso con su abdomen hinchado de huevos y las alas "
"sin usar sigue siendo una amenaza para los entrometidos, en caso de que sus "
"hijos hayan fracasado en someterlos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dermatik larva"
msgid_plural "dermatik larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva dermática"
msgstr[1] "larvas dermáticas"

#. ~ Description for dermatik larva
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fat white grub as big as a squirrel, with a pair of large, spadelike "
"mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una larva blanca y gorda, grande como una ardilla, con un par de mandíbulas "
"largas, con forma de palas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dermatik"
msgid_plural "dermatiks"
msgstr[0] "dermatik"
msgstr[1] "dermatiks"

#. ~ Description for dermatik
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A colorful parasitoid wasp grown to the size of a dog, with a huge "
"ovipositor extruding from her abdomen.  It darts around in search of a "
"suitable home for her many, many children."
msgstr ""
"Una colorida avispa parasitoide del tamaño de un perro, con un enorme "
"ovipositor que sale de su abdomen. Se lanza en busca de un hogar adecuado "
"para sus muchos, muchos hijos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dermatik midwife"
msgid_plural "dermatik midwives"
msgstr[0] "matrona dermatik"
msgstr[1] "matronas dermatik"

#. ~ Description for dermatik midwife
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dermatik grown even larger, its wings and ovipositor chewed off by her "
"sisters.  It now stands watch in the nest, tending to the unfortunate hosts "
"dragged home and ensuring they don't perish before their purpose is "
"fulfilled."
msgstr ""
"Una dermatik crecida aún más, con sus alas y su ovipositor masticados por "
"sus hermanas. Ahora vigila en el nido, atendiendo a los desafortunados "
"huéspedes arrastrados a casa y asegurándose de que no perezcan antes de "
"cumplir su propósito."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "motionless deer"
msgid_plural "motionless deers"
msgstr[0] "ciervo inmóvil"
msgstr[1] "ciervos inmóviles"

#. ~ Description for motionless deer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A paralyzed, emaciated deer.  It spasms as it notices your presence, "
"terrified eyes darting around the muddy chamber when it fails to stand and "
"flee."
msgstr ""
"Un ciervo paralizado y demacrado. Tiene espasmos al notar tu presencia, sus "
"ojos aterrorizados recorren la cámara de barro cuando no logra ponerse de "
"pie y huir."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "motionless deer"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The sudden motion of their host cause some dermatik larvae to flee!"
msgstr ""
"¡El movimiento repentino de su huésped hace que algunas larvas de dermatik "
"huyan!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "helpless dog"
msgid_plural "helpless dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro desvalido"
msgstr[1] "perros desvalidos"

#. ~ Description for helpless dog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A barely living dog, panting in a pool of slime and blood.  As you draw near"
" it lets out a faint whimper, and you see the smallest hint of a twitch in "
"its tail."
msgstr ""
"Un perro apenas vivo, jadeando en un charco de baba y sangre. Cuando te "
"acercas, suelta un leve gemido y ves el más mínimo movimiento de su cola."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "twitching spider"
msgid_plural "twitching spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña temblorosa"
msgstr[1] "arañas temblorosas"

#. ~ Description for twitching spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant, mutated spider lying on its back, legs twitching without pause.  A "
"translucent slime, mixed with its ichor seeps from its joints, and its "
"chitin is marked by numerous exit wounds."
msgstr ""
"Una araña gigante y mutada que yace sobre su espalda, con las patas "
"moviéndose sin pausa. Una baba translúcida, mezclada con su icor, se filtra "
"de sus articulaciones, y su quitina está marcada por numerosas heridas de "
"salida."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge ant"
msgid_plural "huge ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga enorme"
msgstr[1] "hormigas enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutant red ant the size of a dog covered in chitinous plates.  It "
"possesses a pair of wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga roja mutante del tamaño de un perro cubierto de placas "
"quitinosas. Posee un par de antenas que se retuercen y unas mandíbulas de "
"aspecto vicioso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant ant"
msgid_plural "giant ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga gigante"
msgstr[1] "hormigas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous red ant covered in chitinous plates.  It possesses a pair of "
"wriggling antennae and vicious-looking mandibles."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme hormiga roja cubierta de placas de quitina. Posee un par de "
"antenas bamboleantes y mandíbulas de apariencia feroz."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge acidic ant"
msgid_plural "huge acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga ácida enorme"
msgstr[1] "hormigas ácidas enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge acidic ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A brown mutated ant with a swollen abdomen, that ends with a small orifice "
"at the tip.  Glistening liquid drips out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga mutante marrón con un abdomen hinchado, que termina con un "
"pequeño orificio en la punta. El líquido brillante gotea periódicamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant acidic ant"
msgid_plural "giant acidic ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga ácida gigante"
msgstr[1] "hormigas ácidas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant acidic ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A monstrous brown ant with a swollen abdomen, that ends with a small orifice"
" at the tip.  Glistening liquid seems to drip out periodically."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga marrón monstruosa con un abdomen hinchado, que termina con un "
"pequeño orificio en la punta. El líquido brillante parece gotear "
"periódicamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "acidic ant larva"
msgid_plural "acidic ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de hormiga ácida"
msgstr[1] "larvas de hormiga ácida"

#. ~ Description for acidic ant larva
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A squirming yellow grub that seems to be oozing liquid from both ends of its"
" body.  It appears its chitin hasn't developed enough to resist acid."
msgstr ""
"Es una larva brillante que parece estar chorreando un líquido viscoso de las"
" dos extremos de su cuerpo. Parece que su quitina todavía no se ha "
"desarrollado lo suficiente como para resistir el ácido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "acidic queen ant"
msgid_plural "acidic queen ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga ácida reina"
msgstr[1] "hormigas ácidas reina"

#. ~ Description for acidic queen ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous brown ant with an elongated, pulsating abdomen.  Its orifice "
"seems developed only for egg-laying rather than spraying acid like the rest "
"of the colony, but it doesn't seem affected by the acrid liquid either."
msgstr ""
"Es una enorme hormiga marrón con el abdomen hinchado y palpitante. Parece "
"tener un orificio desarrollado solo para poner huevos en lugar de escupir "
"ácido como las otras hormigas, pero tampoco parece ser afectada por el agrio"
" líquido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "acidic soldier ant"
msgid_plural "acidic soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga ácida soldado"
msgstr[1] "hormigas ácidas soldado"

#. ~ Description for acidic soldier ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive woolly brown ant that towers over the worker ants with a giant "
"head crest.  Along with its huge mandibles, a corrosive liquid seeps from "
"the end of its bloated abdomen."
msgstr ""
"Es una inmensa hormiga marrón y peluda que sobresale entre las hormigas "
"obreras con su gigante cabeza con cresta. Además de sus enormes mandíbulas, "
"un líquido corrosivo se filtra desde el fondo de su hinchado abdomen."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "ant larva"
msgid_plural "ant larvae"
msgstr[0] "larva de hormiga"
msgstr[1] "larvas de hormiga"

#. ~ Description for ant larva
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pulsating sausage of glistening white flesh, the size of a large cat.  On "
"one end is a set of squirming mouth parts."
msgstr ""
"Como una salchicha de reluciente carne blanca que palpita, del tamaño de un "
"gato grande. En un extremo hay un conjunto de piezas bucales que se "
"retuercen."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "queen ant"
msgid_plural "queen ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga reina"
msgstr[1] "hormigas reinas"

#. ~ Description for queen ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A colossal red ant with a bulging, bloated thorax.  It moves slowly and "
"deliberately, tending to nearby eggs and continually laying more."
msgstr ""
"Una colosal hormiga roja con un tórax hinchado y saltón. Se mueve lenta y "
"deliberadamente, cuidando los huevos cercanos y continuamente poniendo más."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "soldier ant"
msgid_plural "soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga soldado"
msgstr[1] "hormigas soldado"

#. ~ Description for soldier ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge and hairy red ant almost twice the size of other giant ants.  Bulging"
" pincers extend from its jaws."
msgstr ""
"Una hormiga roja enorme y peluda, casi del doble de tamaño de las otras "
"hormigas gigantes. Grandes pinzas se extienden de su mandíbula."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "super soldier ant"
msgid_plural "super soldier ants"
msgstr[0] "hormiga super soldado"
msgstr[1] "hormigas super soldado"

#. ~ Description for super soldier ant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "An enormous hairy red ant.  Bulging pincers extend from its jaws."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme hormiga roja peluda. Unas pinzas abultadas se extienden desde sus"
" mandíbulas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge locust"
msgid_plural "huge locusts"
msgstr[0] "langosta enorme (Insecto)"
msgstr[1] "langostas enormes (Insecto)"

#. ~ Description for huge locust
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a cat with big eyes and long "
"powerful legs."
msgstr ""
"Una langosta mutada amarilla y marrón del tamaño de un gato con grandes ojos"
" y largas y poderosas patas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant locust"
msgid_plural "giant locusts"
msgstr[0] "langosta gigante"
msgstr[1] "langostas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant locust
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A yellow and brown mutated locust the size of a dog with big eyes and long "
"powerful legs.  You don't think it'll eat you but it could cause massive "
"damage to nearby plants."
msgstr ""
"Una langosta mutada amarilla y marrón del tamaño de un perro con grandes "
"ojos y largas y poderosas patas. No crees que te comerá pero podría causar "
"un daño masivo a las plantas cercanas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "famine"
msgid_plural "famines"
msgstr[0] "hambruna"
msgstr[1] "hambrunas"

#. ~ Description for famine
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous yellow and brown mutated locust with huge staring eyes and long "
"powerful legs."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme langosta mutada amarilla y marrón con enormes ojos fijos y largas"
" y poderosas patas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "locust nymph"
msgid_plural "locust nymphs"
msgstr[0] "ninfa de langosta (Insecto)"
msgstr[1] "ninfas de langosta (Insecto)"

#. ~ Description for locust nymph
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A locust the size of a rabbit.  You'd hate to think what a swarm of these "
"could do."
msgstr ""
"Una langosta(Insecto) del tamaño de un conejo. Odiarías pensar lo que un "
"enjambre de estos podría hacer."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fleshy shambler"
msgid_plural "fleshy shamblers"
msgstr[0] "desastre carnoso"
msgstr[1] "desastres carnosos"

#. ~ Description for fleshy shambler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An amalgamation of throbbing organs from various creatures have fused "
"together into this lurching, vaguely-humanoid shape.  Its myriad roughly-"
"formed mouths susurrate in a chorus of sibilant groans and whispers."
msgstr ""
"Una amalgama de órganos palpitantes de varias criaturas que se han fusionado"
" en esta forma tambaleante y vagamente humanoide. Sus innumerables bocas de "
"forma tosca susurran en un coro de gemidos y susurros sibilantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "flesh golem"
msgid_plural "flesh golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de carne"
msgstr[1] "golems de carne"

#. ~ Description for flesh golem
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A seeping conglomeration of spasming muscle and organs have fused together "
"into this towering caricature of the human form.  Various organs fall off of"
" its hulking body only to be reabsorbed moments later."
msgstr ""
"Un conglomerado de músculos y órganos espasmódicos se han fusionado en esta "
"imponente caricatura de la forma humana. Varios órganos se caen de su cuerpo"
" mole sólo para ser reabsorbidos momentos después."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "jabberwock"
msgid_plural "jabberwocks"
msgstr[0] "jabberwock"
msgstr[1] "jabberwocks"

#. ~ Description for jabberwock
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A putrid amalgamation of body parts from humans and other creatures have "
"fused together in this aberration of flesh.  The eyes of all the heads dart "
"about rapidly and the mouths form a chorus of groaning screams."
msgstr ""
"Es una combinación pútrida de partes de cuerpos humanos y otras criaturas "
"que se han fusionado para formar esta aberración de carnes. Los ojos de "
"todas las cabezas se mueven rápidamente y las bocas arman un coro de gritos "
"y quejidos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py src/mtype.cpp
msgid "human"
msgid_plural "humans"
msgstr[0] "humano"
msgstr[1] "humanos"

#. ~ Description for human
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Place holder for human corpses.  If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr "Coloca un soporte para cadáveres humanos. Si ves esto, es un error."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bat"
msgid_plural "bats"
msgstr[0] "murciélago"
msgstr[1] "murciélagos"

#. ~ Description for bat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the vesper bats, a family of winged insect-eating mammals.  It roosts"
" in caves and other hollows, and uses a form of echolocation to aerially "
"navigate through tricky terrain at rapid speeds."
msgstr ""
"Un vespertiliónido, de la familia de los mamíferos alados que comen "
"insectos. Habita en cuevas y otros lugares huecos, y utiliza una forma de "
"ecolocación para orientarse por el aire a gran velocidad a través de terreno"
" complicado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black bear cub"
msgid_plural "black bear cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de oso negro"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de oso negro"

#. ~ Description for black bear cub
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A juvenile American black bear.  This one isn't much of a threat, but be "
"wary of its parent; black bears are known for their protectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Un joven oso negro americano. Este no es una gran amenaza, pero ten cuidado "
"con su padre; los osos negros son conocidos por su protección."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black bear"
msgid_plural "black bears"
msgstr[0] "oso negro"
msgstr[1] "osos negros"

#. ~ Description for black bear
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The American black bear.  A large omnivorous scavenger, it has powerful "
"claws and jaws, and is an effective ambush hunter.  Most individuals are shy"
" around humans, but they're fiercely protective of their cubs."
msgstr ""
"El oso negro americano. Un gran carroñero omnívoro, tiene poderosas garras y"
" mandíbulas, y es un efectivo cazador de emboscadas. La mayoría de los "
"individuos son tímidos con los humanos, pero son ferozmente protectores de "
"sus cachorros."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "beaver"
msgid_plural "beavers"
msgstr[0] "castor"
msgstr[1] "castores"

#. ~ Description for beaver
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The North American beaver, the continent's largest rodent.  Its paddle-"
"shaped tail helps ferry it through the water, and its prominent teeth can "
"chew through wood, which it uses to build dam-like nests in lakes and "
"streams."
msgstr ""
"El castor de Norte América, el roedor más grande del continente. Su cola en "
"forma de paleta lo ayuda a transportarse por el agua, y sus dientes "
"prominentes pueden masticar la madera, que utiliza para crear nidos en forma"
" de diques en los lagos y arroyos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black rat"
msgid_plural "black rats"
msgstr[0] "rata negra"
msgstr[1] "ratas negras"

#. ~ Description for black rat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The black rat, an omnivorous rodent with sheer black fur and a long, rough "
"tail.  Harbinger of pestilence, famine, and mange, it will sometimes swarm "
"over the dead or dying."
msgstr ""
"La rata negra, un roedor omnívoro con el pelaje largo y totalmente negro, y "
"cola dura. Heraldo de la pestilencia, hambruna y sarna, a veces forman "
"manadas sobre los cadáveres o cosas muertas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lab rat"
msgid_plural "lab rats"
msgstr[0] "rata de laboratorio"
msgstr[1] "ratas de laboratorio"

#. ~ Description for lab rat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The albino Norway rat, an omnivorous rodent with sleek white fur and a long,"
" rough tail.  While its ancestors were harbingers of plague, these clever "
"animals are omnipresent in modern biomedical research."
msgstr ""
"La rata noruega albina, un roedor omnívoro de elegante pelaje blanco y cola "
"larga y áspera. Si bien sus antepasados eran precursores de la peste, estos "
"inteligentes animales están omnipresentes en la investigación biomédica "
"moderna."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wild boar piglet"
msgid_plural "wild boar piglets"
msgstr[0] "lechón de jabalí"
msgstr[1] "lechones de jabalí"

#. ~ Description for wild boar piglet
#. ~ Description for wild boar
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Originally not native in the US, this wild omnivore is a crossbreed between "
"the Eurasian wild boar escaped from hunting reserves and the domesticated "
"pig went feral in the wilderness.  Its population has skyrocketed in the US "
"during the last few decades."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente no nativo de los Estados Unidos, este omnívoro salvaje es un "
"cruce entre el jabalí eurasiático escapado de las reservas de caza y el "
"cerdo domesticado que se volvió salvaje en la naturaleza. Su población se ha"
" disparado en los EE.UU. durante las últimas décadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wild boar"
msgid_plural "wild boars"
msgstr[0] "jabalí"
msgstr[1] "jabalíes"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bobcat"
msgid_plural "bobcats"
msgstr[0] "gato montés"
msgstr[1] "gatos monteses"

#. ~ Description for bobcat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A spotted wild cat living across much of North America.  It is not a serious"
" threat to humans, but it can be aggressive when threatened."
msgstr ""
"Un gato salvaje manchado que vive en gran parte de América del Norte. No es "
"una amenaza seria para los humanos, pero puede ser agresivo cuando se ve "
"amenazado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shorthair kitten"
msgid_plural "shorthair kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de pelo corto"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de pelo corto"

#. ~ Description for shorthair kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cuddly kitten meowing and scampering amidst the death.  Currently feral."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable gatito maullando y correteando en medio de la muerte. "
"Actualmente salvaje."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shorthair cat"
msgid_plural "shorthair cats"
msgstr[0] "gato de pelo corto"
msgstr[1] "gatos de pelo corto"

#. ~ Description for shorthair cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small domesticated predator gone feral in the absence of human "
"stewardship.  Harried by the elements and the rigors of survival, it is "
"scruffy and skittish."
msgstr ""
"Un depredador pequeño y domesticado, que puede volverse salvaje en ausencia "
"del cuidado humano. Agobiado por la intemperie y el rigor de la "
"supervivencia, queda desaliñado y se vuelve asustadizo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "longhair cat"
msgid_plural "longhair cats"
msgstr[0] "gato de pelo largo"
msgstr[1] "gatos de pelo largo"

#. ~ Description for longhair cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This cat's long fur appears difficult to groom, but the cat seems to manage "
"it despite the environmental conditions."
msgstr ""
"El largo pelaje de este gato parece difícil de cuidar, pero el gato parece "
"manejarlo a pesar de las condiciones ambientales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "longhair kitten"
msgid_plural "longhair kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de pelo largo"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de pelo largo"

#. ~ Description for longhair kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Barely more than a ball of fluff with eyes, this kitten looks like a "
"longhair breed."
msgstr ""
"Es poco más que una bola de pelusa con ojos, este gatito parece de una raza "
"de pelo largo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Maine coon cat"
msgid_plural "Maine coon cats"
msgstr[0] "gato mapache de Maine"
msgstr[1] "gatos mapache de Maine"

#. ~ Description for Maine coon cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Impressively large for a domestic cat, this thick-haired breed was once "
"native to the state of Maine."
msgstr ""
"Impresionantemente grande para un gato doméstico, esta raza de pelo grueso "
"fue una vez nativa del estado de Maine."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Maine coon kitten"
msgid_plural "Maine coon kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de mapache de Maine"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de mapache de Maine"

#. ~ Description for Maine coon kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This young Maine coon has tufted ears and a striking pattern on its face."
msgstr ""
"Este joven gato mapache de Maine tiene las orejas puntiagudas y un patrón "
"llamativo en su cara."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Siamese cat"
msgid_plural "Siamese cats"
msgstr[0] "gato siamés"
msgstr[1] "gatos siameses"

#. ~ Description for Siamese cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This cat has the distinctive dark extremities of a Siamese, first native to "
"Asia but a common domestic breed in North America."
msgstr ""
"Este gato tiene las extremidades oscuras distintivas de un siamés, "
"originario de Asia pero una raza doméstica común en América del Norte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Siamese kitten"
msgid_plural "Siamese kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatos Siames"
msgstr[1] "gatos Siameses"

#. ~ Description for Siamese kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With cream-colored fur and dark points, you guess this kitten must be a "
"young Siamese."
msgstr ""
"Con pelaje de color crema y puntos oscuros, supongo que este gatito debe ser"
" un joven siamés."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Persian cat"
msgid_plural "Persian cats"
msgstr[0] "gato persa"
msgstr[1] "gatos persas"

#. ~ Description for Persian cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The short nose and rounded face of this cat suggest it comes from the "
"popular Persian breed."
msgstr ""
"La nariz corta y la cara redondeada de este gato sugieren que proviene de la"
" popular raza persa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Persian kitten"
msgid_plural "Persian kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito persa"
msgstr[1] "gatitos persas"

#. ~ Description for Persian kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorably squashed nose and sad pleading eyes beg you to adopt this tiny "
"Persian."
msgstr ""
"Una nariz adorablemente aplastada y unos tristes ojos suplicantes te "
"suplican que adoptes a este pequeño persa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Bengal cat"
msgid_plural "Bengal cats"
msgstr[0] "gato de Bengala"
msgstr[1] "gatos de Bengala"

#. ~ Description for Bengal cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Looking like a spotted wild cat, the Bengal breed derives from the Asian "
"leopard cat and Egyptian Mau."
msgstr ""
"Con el aspecto de un gato salvaje manchado, la raza Bengalí deriva del gato "
"leopardo asiático y del Mau egipcio."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Bengal kitten"
msgid_plural "Bengal kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito de Bengala"
msgstr[1] "gatitos de Bengala"

#. ~ Description for Bengal kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have seen spots like this on Bengal cats, but this one is just a kitten."
msgstr ""
"Has visto manchas como esta en los gatos de Bengala, pero este es sólo un "
"gatito."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Devon Rex cat"
msgid_plural "Devon Rex cats"
msgstr[0] "gato Devon Rex"
msgstr[1] "gatos Devon Rex"

#. ~ Description for Devon Rex cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An unusual-looking cat with strikingly large eyes and ears, sporting a soft "
"curly coat of fur."
msgstr ""
"Un gato de aspecto inusual con ojos y orejas sorprendentemente grandes, con "
"un suave pelaje rizado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Devon Rex kitten"
msgid_plural "Devon Rex kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito Devon Rex"
msgstr[1] "gatitos Devon Rex"

#. ~ Description for Devon Rex kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This curly-coated kitten has enormous ears and inquisitive eyes, possibly a "
"Devon Rex."
msgstr ""
"Este gatito de capa rizada tiene enormes orejas y ojos curiosos, "
"posiblemente un Devon Rex."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Sphynx cat"
msgid_plural "Sphynx cats"
msgstr[0] "gato esfinge"
msgstr[1] "gatos esfinge"

#. ~ Description for Sphynx cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Sphynx cat has practically no fur on its body, exposing its curiously "
"wrinkled skin."
msgstr ""
"El gato esfinge prácticamente no tiene pelo en su cuerpo, exponiendo su piel"
" curiosamente arrugada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Sphynx kitten"
msgid_plural "Sphynx kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito esfinge"
msgstr[1] "gatitos esfinge"

#. ~ Description for Sphynx kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An almost total lack of fur on this kitten suggests it is of the hairless "
"Sphynx breed."
msgstr ""
"La casi total falta de pelo en este gatito sugiere que es de la raza esfinge"
" sin pelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tabby cat"
msgid_plural "tabby cats"
msgstr[0] "gato atigrado"
msgstr[1] "gatos atigrados"

#. ~ Description for tabby cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Marked with the characteristic 'M' on its forehead and decorated with "
"swirling stripes, the tabby's markings must provide excellent camouflage."
msgstr ""
"Marcado con la característica \"M\" en su frente y decorado con rayas "
"arremolinadas, las marcas del atigrado deben proporcionar un excelente "
"camuflaje."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tabby kitten"
msgid_plural "tabby kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito atigrado"
msgstr[1] "gatitos atigrados"

#. ~ Description for tabby kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sharp lines around the eyes and familiar wavy stripes mark this kitten as a "
"common tabby."
msgstr ""
"Líneas afiladas alrededor de los ojos y las conocidas rayas onduladas marcan"
" a este gatito como un gato atigrado común."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "calico cat"
msgid_plural "calico cats"
msgstr[0] "gato calicó"
msgstr[1] "gatos calicó"

#. ~ Description for calico cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Partly white with patches of orange and black, the calico coloring tells you"
" this cat is probably female.  The Calico was the Maryland State cat (back "
"when there were still states)."
msgstr ""
"Parcialmente blanco con manchas de naranja y negro, la coloración del calicó"
" te dice que este gato es probablemente una hembra. El calicó fue el gato "
"del estado de Maryland (cuando todavía había estados)."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "calico kitten"
msgid_plural "calico kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito calicó"
msgstr[1] "gatitos calicó"

#. ~ Description for calico kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Splotches of tan and grey mark this young cat as a calico, and probably "
"female."
msgstr ""
"Manchas de bronceado y gris marcan a este joven gato como un calicó, y "
"probablemente una hembra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "golden chonker"
msgid_plural "golden chonkers"
msgstr[0] "rechoncho dorados"
msgstr[1] "rechonchos dorados"

#. ~ Description for golden chonker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lawd, he comin!  This impressive feline would once have been celebrated on "
"internet cat forums for its chonkiness and majestic golden mane.  Appears "
"surprisingly well-groomed for a feral cat."
msgstr ""
"¡Oh, ya viene! Este impresionante felino fue una vez celebrado en los foros "
"de internet por su corpulencia y su majestuosa melena dorada. Parece "
"sorprendentemente bien cuidado para un gato salvaje."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "yellow kitten"
msgid_plural "yellow kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito amarillo"
msgstr[1] "gatitos amarillos"

#. ~ Description for yellow kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This poor little kitten is starving!  You wonder if you have some cat food "
"around…"
msgstr ""
"¡Este pobre gatito se muere de hambre! Te preguntas si tienes algo de comida"
" para gatos por aquí..."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "chipmunk"
msgid_plural "chipmunks"
msgstr[0] "ardilla"
msgstr[1] "ardillas"

#. ~ Description for chipmunk
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The eastern chipmunk, a tiny omnivorous rodent with a characteristic striped"
" coat.  It spends much of the day patrolling its elaborate burrow and the "
"precious stores of foraged food within."
msgstr ""
"La ardilla del este, un pequeño roedor omnívoro con su característica piel "
"rayada. Pasa muchas horas de su día patrullando su elaborada madriguera y  "
"el precioso almacenamiento de comida que tiene adentro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cougar"
msgid_plural "cougars"
msgstr[0] "puma"
msgstr[1] "pumas"

#. ~ Description for cougar
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Eastern cougar, a large feline predator.  Once thought extinct in this "
"region, conservation efforts were successful in restoring a thriving "
"population.  Fast and silent, this predator can cover long distances with "
"powerful leaps and pounces, catching its prey with its deadly claws before "
"delivering the finishing blow with its enormous fangs."
msgstr ""
"El puma del este, un gran felino depredador. Alguna vez se pensó que estaba "
"extinto en esta región, pero los esfuerzos de conservación fueron exitosos y"
" se restauró su población. Rápido y silencioso, este predador puede cubrir "
"largas distancias con fuertes saltos, cazando su presa con sus mortales "
"garras antes de dar el golpe final con sus enormes colmillos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tiger"
msgid_plural "tigers"
msgstr[0] "tigre"
msgstr[1] "tigres"

#. ~ Description for tiger
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The majestic tiger, a large feline predator.  Native to Asia, they are now "
"most populous in private reserves in the United States.  Fast and powerful, "
"this predator is one of the most recognizable and beloved animals in the "
"world.  Also one of the deadliest."
msgstr ""
"El majestuoso tigre, un gran depredador felino. Originario de Asia, ahora "
"están más poblados en las reservas privadas de los Estados Unidos. Rápido y "
"poderoso, este depredador es uno de los animales más reconocidos y queridos "
"del mundo. También es uno de los más mortíferos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "calf"
msgid_plural "calves"
msgstr[0] "ternero"
msgstr[1] "terneros"

#. ~ Description for calf
#. ~ Description for cow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  It is quite muscular, "
"and the males can have a violent streak to accompany their nasty-looking "
"horns."
msgstr ""
"La vaca doméstica, un rumiante y torvo animal de granja. Es bastante "
"muscular, y los machos pueden ser un poco violentos para acompañar sus "
"intimidatorios cuernos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cow"
msgid_plural "cows"
msgstr[0] "vaca"
msgstr[1] "vacas"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "coyote"
msgid_plural "coyotes"
msgstr[0] "coyote"
msgstr[1] "coyotes"

#. ~ Description for coyote
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Eastern coyote, also called the tweed wolf, is a territorial canine "
"descended from the offspring of gray wolves and true coyotes.  It is "
"intimidated by humans and other predators, but it will still fight if "
"threatened, and the Cataclysm has made it more fearless than usual."
msgstr ""
"Es el coyote del este, también llamado lobo de tweed, es un canino "
"territorial descendiente de los hijos de los lobos grises y verdaderos "
"coyotes. Es intimidado por los humanos y otros depredadores, pero va a "
"pelear si se siente amenazado, y el Cataclismo lo ha hecho más temerario que"
" antes."

#. ~ Description for coyote
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Northeastern coyote, a widespread canine pack hunter.  More timid than a"
" wolf, it is an opportunistic feeder and prefers to hunt smaller and weaker "
"prey, but is typically timid around humans."
msgstr ""
"El coyote del noreste, un cazador de manada canina muy extendido. Más tímido"
" que un lobo, es un alimentador oportunista y prefiere cazar presas más "
"pequeñas y débiles, pero es típicamente tímido con los humanos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fawn"
msgid_plural "fawns"
msgstr[0] "cervatillo"
msgstr[1] "cervatillos"

#. ~ Description for fawn
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A juvenile northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing "
"animal.  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"Un joven ciervo de cola blanca de los bosques del norte, un rápido y fuerte "
"animal de pastoreo. Presa preferida de coyotes, lobos y arañas gigantes "
"mutantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "deer"
msgid_plural "deers"
msgstr[0] "ciervo"
msgstr[1] "ciervos"

#. ~ Description for deer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The northern woodland white-tailed deer, a quick and strong grazing animal."
"  Favored prey of coyotes, wolves, and giant spider mutants."
msgstr ""
"El ciervo de cola blanca de los bosques del norte, un animal de pastoreo "
"rápido y fuerte. Es la presa favorita de los coyotes, lobos y arañas "
"mutantes gigantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Labrador mutt"
msgid_plural "Labrador mutts"
msgstr[0] "perro labrador"
msgstr[1] "perros labrador"

#. ~ Description for Labrador mutt
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This once-average Labrador mixed breed dog has clearly gone feral.  Though "
"it likely still instinctively trusts humans, it's probably far from domestic"
" by now."
msgstr ""
"Este perro mestizo de Labrador, que alguna vez fue un promedio, se ha vuelto"
" claramente salvaje. Aunque probablemente aún confía instintivamente en los "
"humanos, probablemente esté lejos de ser doméstico ahora."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Labrador puppy"
msgid_plural "Labrador puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de labrador"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de labrador"

#. ~ Description for Labrador puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Labrador puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog."
msgstr ""
"Es un cachorrito de labrador, adorable e indefenso. Mucho más fácil de "
"domesticar que uno adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bulldog"
msgid_plural "bulldogs"
msgstr[0] "bulldog"
msgstr[1] "bulldogs"

#. ~ Description for bulldog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The American bulldog is a hardy, well built dog, that seems suited for "
"surviving the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"El bulldog americano es un perro resistente y bien construido, que parece "
"adecuado para sobrevivir al apocalipsis."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bulldog puppy"
msgid_plural "bulldog puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de bulldog"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de bulldog"

#. ~ Description for bulldog puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless American bulldog puppy.  Much safer to tame than an"
" adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de bulldog americano. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pit bull mix"
msgid_plural "pit bull mixes"
msgstr[0] "mezcla de pit bull"
msgstr[1] "mezclas de pit bull"

#. ~ Description for pit bull mix
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The oft-misunderstood pit bull is not actually a single breed but a label "
"for several kinds of terriers.  It has average abilities, and is well-known "
"for its 'lock jaw' - which isn't real, but their incredible determination "
"is."
msgstr ""
"El a menudo incomprendido pit bull no es en realidad una sola raza, sino una"
" etiqueta para varios tipos de terrier. Tiene habilidades promedio, y es "
"bien conocido por su \"mandíbula de bloqueo\", que no es real, pero su "
"increíble determinación sí lo es."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pit bull puppy"
msgid_plural "pit bull puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de pit bull"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de pit bull"

#. ~ Description for pit bull puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless pit bull puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de pit bull. Mucho más seguro de domesticar"
" que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "beagle"
msgid_plural "beagles"
msgstr[0] "beagle"
msgstr[1] "beagles"

#. ~ Description for beagle
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable beagle that has managed to survive the apocalypse.  Being agile "
"and small, they are difficult to shoot at.  Generally attacks in packs."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable sabueso que ha logrado sobrevivir al apocalipsis. Al ser ágiles "
"y pequeños, son difíciles de disparar. Generalmente atacan en manadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "beagle puppy"
msgid_plural "beagle puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de beagle"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de beagle"

#. ~ Description for beagle puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless beagle puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de beagle. Mucho más seguro de domesticar "
"que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "border collie"
msgid_plural "border collies"
msgstr[0] "border collie"
msgstr[1] "border collies"

#. ~ Description for border collie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An athletic and hyperactive dog that loves to herd animals and jump, the "
"Border Collie is an agile attacker.  Although they can be easy to train, "
"they don't work well in packs."
msgstr ""
"Un perro atlético e hiperactivo al que le encanta arrear animales y saltar, "
"el Border Collie es un ágil atacante. Aunque pueden ser fáciles de entrenar,"
" no funcionan bien en manadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "border collie puppy"
msgid_plural "border collie puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de border collie"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de border collie"

#. ~ Description for border collie puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Border Collie puppy.  Much safer to tame than an "
"adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de Border Collie. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "boxer mastiff"
msgid_plural "boxer mastiffs"
msgstr[0] "mastín boxer"
msgstr[1] "mastines boxer"

#. ~ Description for boxer mastiff
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ordinary breed full of affection, the boxer mastiff doesn't otherwise "
"stand out amongst other dogs with its capabilities."
msgstr ""
"Una raza ordinaria llena de afecto, el mastín bóxer no se destaca entre "
"otros perros con sus capacidades."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "boxer puppy"
msgid_plural "boxer puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de boxer"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de boxer"

#. ~ Description for boxer puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless boxer puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de boxer. Mucho más seguro de domesticar "
"que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Chihuahua"
msgid_plural "Chihuahuas"
msgstr[0] "Chihuahua"
msgstr[1] "Chihuahuas"

#. ~ Description for Chihuahua
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It's a tiny Chihuahua.  How it has managed to survive is a miracle, although"
" its small size and aggressive nature may have proven useful."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño Chihuahua. La forma en que ha logrado sobrevivir es un "
"milagro, aunque su pequeño tamaño y su naturaleza agresiva pueden haber sido"
" útiles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Chihuahua puppy"
msgid_plural "Chihuahua puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de Chihuahua"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de Chihuahua"

#. ~ Description for Chihuahua puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Chihuahua puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de chihuahua. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dachshund"
msgid_plural "dachshunds"
msgstr[0] "dachshund"
msgstr[1] "dachshunds"

#. ~ Description for dachshund
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wiener dog!  This awkward looking dog can be a useful watchdog, plus it "
"looks adorable as it bumbles around.  Its tiny size also makes it hard to "
"shoot (you monster)."
msgstr ""
"¡Un perro salchicha! Este perro de aspecto torpe puede ser un útil perro "
"guardián, además de que se ve adorable mientras anda dando tumbos. Su "
"pequeño tamaño también hace que sea difícil de disparar (tu monstruo)."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dachshund puppy"
msgid_plural "dachshund puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de dachshund"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de dachshund"

#. ~ Description for dachshund puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless dachshund puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de perro salchicha. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "German Shepherd"
msgid_plural "German Shepherds"
msgstr[0] "pastor alemán"
msgstr[1] "pastores alemanes"

#. ~ Description for German Shepherd
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The original K-9 breed.  An easy to train and great attack dog that will "
"also defend its owner to the death, however they don't work well in packs."
msgstr ""
"Es la raza K-9 original. Es un perro fácil de entrenar y muy bueno para "
"atacar, que también defenderá a su dueño hasta la muerte. Aunque no trabaja "
"bien en manada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "German Shepherd puppy"
msgid_plural "German Shepherd puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de pastor alemán"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de pastor alemán"

#. ~ Description for German Shepherd puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless German Shepherd puppy.  Much safer to tame than an "
"adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de pastor alemán. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Great Pyrenees"
msgid_plural "Great Pyrenees"
msgstr[0] "Gran Pirineo"
msgstr[1] "Grandes Pirineos"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Great Pyrenees'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large and powerful breed, the Great Pyrenees has a beautiful, thick white "
"coat.  Originally bred to deter wolves and other predators, now faced with "
"protecting livestock from shambling hordes of undead."
msgstr ""
"Una raza grande y poderosa, el Gran Pirineo tiene un hermoso y grueso pelaje"
" blanco. Originalmente criado para disuadir a los lobos y otros "
"depredadores, ahora se enfrenta a la protección del ganado de las hordas de "
"muertos vivientes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Great Pyrenees puppy"
msgid_plural "Great Pyrenees puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de Gran Pirineo"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de Gran Pirineo"

#. ~ Description for Great Pyrenees puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Great Pyrenees puppy.  Much safer to tame than an "
"adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de Gran Pirineo. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rottweiler"
msgid_plural "rottweilers"
msgstr[0] "rottweiler"
msgstr[1] "rottweilers"

#. ~ Description for rottweiler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A terrifying breed to face feral, Rottweilers are descended from Roman "
"legion mastiffs.  It's robust, vicious, and quite capable of mauling a human"
" to death."
msgstr ""
"Una raza aterradora para enfrentarse a lo salvaje, los Rottweilers "
"descienden de los mastines de la legión romana. Es robusto, vicioso, y "
"bastante capaz de matar a un humano hasta la muerte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rottweiler puppy"
msgid_plural "rottweiler puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de rottweiler"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de rottweiler"

#. ~ Description for rottweiler puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Rottweiler puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult"
" dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de Rottweiler. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cattle dog"
msgid_plural "cattle dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro de ganado"
msgstr[1] "perros de ganado"

#. ~ Description for cattle dog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An agile and sturdy breed that is welcome on any farm, the Australian cattle"
" dog is adept at leaping fences and herding livestock."
msgstr ""
"Es una raza resistente y ágil, bienvenida en cualquier granja. El perro "
"pastor australiano es capaz de saltar sobre cercos y pastorear ganado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cattle dog puppy"
msgid_plural "cattle dog puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de perro de ganado"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de perro de ganado"

#. ~ Description for cattle dog puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Australian cattle dog puppy.  Much safer to tame "
"than an adult dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de perro de ganado australiano. Mucho más "
"seguro de domesticar que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "samoyed"
msgid_plural "samoyeds"
msgstr[0] "samoyedo"
msgstr[1] "samoyedos"

#. ~ Description for samoyed
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, white, fluffy herding dog from Siberia.  Samoyeds are rarely "
"aggressive: Their smiley face doesn't help either.  They can be agile for "
"their size and can be taught to pull sleds."
msgstr ""
"Un perro de pastoreo grande, blanco y esponjoso de Siberia. Los samoyedos "
"rara vez son agresivos: Su cara sonriente tampoco ayuda. Pueden ser ágiles "
"para su tamaño y se les puede enseñar a tirar de los trineos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "samoyed puppy"
msgid_plural "samoyed puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de samoyedo"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de samoyedo"

#. ~ Description for samoyed puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Samoyed puppy.  Much safer to tame than an adult "
"dog."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro samoyedo. Mucho más seguro de domesticar "
"que un perro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fox"
msgid_plural "foxes"
msgstr[0] "zorro"
msgstr[1] "zorros"

#. ~ Description for fox
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small omnivorous canine with an almost cat-like manner.  It is a solitary "
"hunter, and one of the only canids able to climb trees."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño canino omnívoro con maneras casi de gato. Es un cazador "
"solitario, y uno de los únicos cánidos capaz de trepar árboles"

#. ~ Description for fox
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The red fox, an omnivorous canine and largest of the true foxes, it is a "
"wily hunter with a combative, suspicious temperament."
msgstr ""
"Un zorro rojo, un canino omnívoro y el más grande de los zorros verdaderos. "
"Es un cazador astuto con un temperamento combativo y suspicaz."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "groundhog"
msgid_plural "groundhogs"
msgstr[0] "marmota"
msgstr[1] "marmotas"

#. ~ Description for groundhog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also known as the woodchuck, this ground squirrel has no actual talent for "
"chucking wood."
msgstr ""
"La marmota es una ardilla menos ágil, no la vas a ver trepando los árboles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "jackrabbit"
msgid_plural "jackrabbits"
msgstr[0] "liebre"
msgstr[1] "liebres"

#. ~ Description for jackrabbit
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The snowshoe hare, a small grass-eater with a brown fur coat that changes to"
" white in the wintertime."
msgstr ""
"La liebre americana, un pequeño comedor de hierba con piel marrón que en "
"invierno se pone blanca."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "horse"
msgid_plural "horses"
msgstr[0] "caballo"
msgstr[1] "caballos"

#. ~ Description for horse
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hooved grazing mammal with a mane of hair, a sweeping tail, and powerful-"
"looking muscles."
msgstr ""
"Un mamífero de pastoreo con pezuñas con una melena, una cola grande y "
"músculos que parecen poderosos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lemming"
msgid_plural "lemmings"
msgstr[0] "lemming"
msgstr[1] "lemmings"

#. ~ Description for lemming
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Northern bog lemming, a small, predominantly vegetarian rodent that "
"spends its life in the murk of swamps and other wetlands.  Contrary to "
"popular belief, these creatures are not particularly hapless or suicidal, "
"but they can eat themselves into scarcity within a few generations."
msgstr ""
"Un lemming de las ciénagas del norte, es un roedor pequeño, "
"predominantemente vegetariano que pasa su vida en la oscuridad de los "
"pantanos y otras zonas húmedas. Al contrario de la creencia popular, estas "
"criaturas no son desgraciadas o suicidas, pero pueden volverse escasas en un"
" par de generaciones."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mink"
msgid_plural "minks"
msgstr[0] "visón"
msgstr[1] "visones"

#. ~ Description for mink
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The American mink, a partially aquatic weasel, once factory-farmed for its "
"fur.  It is a capable fisher, but the presence of otters in these parts "
"makes it rely more on food from the land."
msgstr ""
"El visón americano, una comadreja parcialmente acuática, una vez cultivada "
"en fábrica por su piel. Es un pescador capaz, pero la presencia de nutrias "
"en estas partes hace que dependa más de la comida de la tierra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "moose"
msgid_plural "moose"
msgstr[0] "alce"
msgstr[1] "alces"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'moose'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Eastern moose, the largest living species of deer.  While they aren't "
"aggressive unless angered, the mating season can make the bulls quite ill-"
"tempered."
msgstr ""
"El alce del este, el más grande de la familia de los ciervos. Aunque no son "
"agresivos si no se los molestan, durante la temporada de celo son bastante "
"malhumorados."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "muskrat"
msgid_plural "muskrats"
msgstr[0] "rata almizclera"
msgstr[1] "ratas almizcleras"

#. ~ Description for muskrat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large omnivorous rodent with a thick furry pelt, found in wetlands across "
"the Northern Hemisphere.  It marks its territory with a musky odor for which"
" it is named."
msgstr ""
"Un roedor omnívoro grande con una piel peluda y gruesa, que se encuentra en "
"los humedales del hemisferio norte. Marca su territorio con un olor "
"almizclado por el que recibe su nombre."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gigantic naked mole-rat"
msgid_plural "gigantic naked mole-rats"
msgstr[0] "rata topo desnuda gigante"
msgstr[1] "ratas topo desnudas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for gigantic naked mole-rat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, rumbling mutated mass of wrinkly, nearly translucent skin that has "
"been toughened by constant tunneling.  Its hide is riddled with giant scabs,"
" as a pair of incisors the size of an industrial excavator's buckets gnash "
"constantly and several car-length whiskers twitch in the air.  It regularly "
"makes high-pitched chirps as it roams around."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme masa mutada y estruendosa de piel arrugada, casi translúcida, que"
" se ha endurecido por los constantes túneles. Su pellejo está plagado de "
"costras gigantes, como un par de incisivos del tamaño de los cubos de una "
"excavadora industrial que crujen constantemente y varios bigotes de coche se"
" mueven en el aire. Regularmente hace chirridos agudos mientras deambula por"
" ahí."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "opossum"
msgid_plural "opossums"
msgstr[0] "zarigüeya"
msgstr[1] "zarigüeyas"

#. ~ Description for opossum
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Virginia opossum, a small omnivorous marsupial native to North America."
"  About the size of a cat, it is hardy and adaptive, and a fairly common "
"sight in urban areas."
msgstr ""
"Es la zarigüeya de Virginia, un pequeño marsupial omnívoro nativo de América"
" del Norte. Más o menos del tamaño de un gato, robusto y de fácil "
"adaptación, es común verlo en las zonas urbanas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "otter"
msgid_plural "otters"
msgstr[0] "nutria"
msgstr[1] "nutrias"

#. ~ Description for otter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The North American river otter is a shy water dwelling relative of the "
"weasel, living in large families along the banks of streams.  It is an "
"excellent fisher and a resourceful survivor, using the abandoned dens of "
"beavers and other animals to raise its own young."
msgstr ""
"La nutria de río de Norte América es un tímido pariente de la comadreja que "
"vive en familias grandes a lo largo de las orillas de los arroyos. Es un "
"excelente pescador y un ingenioso superviviente, que utiliza las madrigueras"
" abandonadas de castores y otros animales para criar a sus propias crías."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "piglet"
msgid_plural "piglets"
msgstr[0] "lechón"
msgstr[1] "lechones"

#. ~ Description for piglet
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A domesticated omnivore descended from the wild boar, intelligent and "
"inquisitive.  Left to its own devices, it has gone feral.  Unlike the fully "
"grown version it can be tamed."
msgstr ""
"Un omnívoro domesticado descendiente del jabalí, inteligente e inquisitivo. "
"Dejado a su suerte, se ha vuelto salvaje. A diferencia de la versión "
"completamente desarrollada, puede ser domesticado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pig"
msgid_plural "pigs"
msgstr[0] "cerdo"
msgstr[1] "cerdos"

#. ~ Description for pig
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A domesticated omnivore descended from the wild boar, intelligent and "
"inquisitive.  Left to its own devices, it has gone feral."
msgstr ""
"Un omnívoro domesticado que desciende del jabalí salvaje. Es inteligente y "
"curioso. Dejado a su propio cuidado, se ha vuelto salvaje."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rabbit"
msgid_plural "rabbits"
msgstr[0] "conejo"
msgstr[1] "conejos"

#. ~ Description for rabbit
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small mammal with a cute wiggling nose, cotton tail, and made of delicious"
" flesh."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño mamífero con una nariz simpática, cola algodonada, y con una "
"carne deliciosa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "raccoon"
msgid_plural "raccoons"
msgstr[0] "mapache"
msgstr[1] "mapaches"

#. ~ Description for raccoon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small mammal native to North America, distinctive for its dexterous paws "
"and facial markings.  It is resourceful and agile enough to open sealed "
"containers with its paws."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño mamífero nativo de América del Norte, conocido por la destreza"
" de sus garras y las marcas en su cara. Es lo suficientemente ingenioso y "
"ágil como para abrir recipientes sellados con sus patas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rat king"
msgid_plural "rat kings"
msgstr[0] "rata rey"
msgstr[1] "ratas rey"

#. ~ Description for rat king
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A towering swarm of mutated rats, their tails knotted together in a filthy "
"mass.  A fetid stench flows from its filthy presence."
msgstr ""
"Un enjambre de ratas mutadas formando una torre, sus colas están atadas "
"entre sí formando una desagradable masa. Un hedor fétido fluye de esta "
"desagradable presencia."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sewer rat"
msgid_plural "sewer rats"
msgstr[0] "rata de cloaca"
msgstr[1] "ratas de cloaca"

#. ~ Description for sewer rat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A worm-tailed rodent with long whiskers and beady eyes.  The way it squeaks "
"makes it sound… hungry."
msgstr ""
"Un roedor de cola de gusano con largos bigotes y ojos brillantes. La forma "
"en que chirría hace que suene... hambriento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lamb"
msgid_plural "lambs"
msgstr[0] "cordero"
msgstr[1] "corderos"

#. ~ Description for lamb
#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sheep'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A timid, hooved grazing mammal, and one of the first animals ever "
"domesticated.  Its body is covered in a thick layer of wool, and the males "
"have long, spiraling horns."
msgstr ""
"Un tímido mamífero de pastoreo con pezuñas, y uno de los primeros animales "
"domesticados. Su cuerpo está cubierto de una gruesa capa de lana, y los "
"machos tienen largos cuernos en espiral."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sheep"
msgid_plural "sheep"
msgstr[0] "oveja"
msgstr[1] "ovejas"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "squirrel"
msgid_plural "squirrels"
msgstr[0] "ardilla"
msgstr[1] "ardillas"

#. ~ Description for squirrel
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small granivorous rodent with a long bushy tail, often seen darting amid "
"the branches of trees.  A skittish varmint with an expression of unwavering "
"austerity, it is the mortal enemy of cat and dog alike."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño roedor granívoro con una cola larga y tupida, a menudo se la ve "
"corriendo a toda velocidad entre las ramas de los árboles. Una alimaña "
"asustadiza con expresión de austeridad inquebrantable. Es el enemigo mortal "
"de los gatos y los perros."

#. ~ Description for squirrel
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tiny opportunistic rodent with a long bushy tail.  The pine squirrel is "
"clever and cute, and hunted by nearly everything in the woods with a taste "
"for meat."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño roedor oportunista con una cola larga y tupida. La ardilla de "
"pino es linda e inteligente, y es cazada por casi todo lo que anda por el "
"bosque que tenga ganas de comer carne."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "weasel"
msgid_plural "weasels"
msgstr[0] "comadreja"
msgstr[1] "comadrejas"

#. ~ Description for weasel
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The long-tailed weasel, a small but ubiquitous predator whose range extends "
"across the continent.  It forms its den in small burrows, preferring to "
"occupy the nesting holes of its prey."
msgstr ""
"Es una comadreja de cola larga, es un depredador roedor pequeño pero que "
"está por todas partes del continente. Arma su nido en pequeñas madrigueras, "
"y prefiere ocupar las madrigueras de su presa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wolf"
msgid_plural "wolves"
msgstr[0] "lobo"
msgstr[1] "lobos"

#. ~ Description for wolf
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cunning pack predator, once extinct in the New England area, the wolf was "
"successfully reintroduced and their numbers reached record highs in the "
"decade before the Cataclysm.  Lucky you."
msgstr ""
"Un astuto depredador de manada, una vez extinguido en el área de Nueva "
"Inglaterra, el lobo fue reintroducido con éxito y su número alcanzó niveles "
"récord en la década anterior al Cataclismo. Qué suerte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Reindeer"
msgid_plural "Reindeers"
msgstr[0] "Reno"
msgstr[1] "Renos"

#. ~ Description for Reindeer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also known as the Caribou, this deer is native to North America and parts of"
" Eurasia, although usually friendly, they can be aggressive during mating "
"season as well as when hungry."
msgstr ""
"También conocido como el caribú, este ciervo es nativo de América del Norte "
"y partes de Eurasia, aunque normalmente es amistoso, puede ser agresivo "
"durante la temporada de apareamiento así como cuando tiene hambre."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Reindeer fawn"
msgid_plural "Reindeer fawns"
msgstr[0] "cervatillo de reno"
msgstr[1] "cervatillos de reno"

#. ~ Description for Reindeer fawn
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A juvenile Caribou, it seems to be smaller than its adult counterparts, as "
"well as having shorter antlers."
msgstr ""
"Un caribú juvenil, parece ser más pequeño que sus homólogos adultos, además "
"de tener la cornamenta más corta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marloss zealot"
msgid_plural "marloss zealots"
msgstr[0] "fanático marloss"
msgstr[1] "fanáticos marloss"

#. ~ Description for marloss zealot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Her eyes lie vacant and spittle foams in her mouth, as she recites from the "
"hymns in rapturous ecstasy."
msgstr ""
"Sus ojos están vacíos y escupe espuma en su boca, mientras recita los himnos"
" en un éxtasis extático."

#. ~ Description for marloss zealot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"His eyes lie vacant and spittle foams in his mouth, as he recites from the "
"hymns in rapturous ecstasy."
msgstr ""
"Sus ojos están vacíos y escupe espuma en su boca, mientras recita los himnos"
" en un éxtasis extático."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mech"
msgid_plural "X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mechs"
msgstr[0] "X-03: Mecánico de Reconocimiento 'Spectre'"
msgstr[1] "X-03: Mecánicos de Reconocimiento 'Spectre'"

#. ~ Description for X-03: 'Spectre' Recon Mech
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Boeing-Daewoo RMES (Recon Mechanical Exoskeleton Suit), a recent "
"acquisition by the US military, it was designed to be used in a scout-recon-"
"sniper role, due to its mobility and integrated laser sniper rifle and suite"
" of optics for target designation and battlefield awareness.  It was not "
"deployed before the Cataclysm hit, though there were a few prototypes in the"
" field.  You may be able to hack it to accept you as its pilot.  Like all "
"mech-suits it can act as a UPS from its large battery."
msgstr ""
"El Boeing-Daewoo EMR (Exoesqueleto mecánico de reconocimiento), una "
"adquisición reciente del ejército de los Estados Unidos, fue diseñado para "
"ser utilizado en una función de explorador-reconocimiento-francotirador, "
"debido a su movilidad y a su rifle de francotirador láser integrado y al "
"conjunto de ópticas para la designación de objetivos y el conocimiento del "
"campo de batalla. No se desplegó antes del impacto del Cataclismo, aunque "
"había algunos prototipos en el campo. Es posible que puedas hackearlo para "
"que te acepte como su piloto. Como todos los trajes de mechas, puede actuar "
"como un SAI desde su gran batería."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "X-02: 'Grunt' Combat Mech"
msgid_plural "X-02: 'Grunt' Combat Mechs"
msgstr[0] "X-02: Mecánico de Combate 'Grunt'"
msgstr[1] "X-02: Mecánicos de Combate 'Grunt'"

#. ~ Description for X-02: 'Grunt' Combat Mech
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Boeing-Daewoo CMES (Combat Mechanical Exoskeleton Suit), a recent "
"acquisition by the US military, it was designed to be used in a fire support"
" role, due to its fearsome integrated gatling laser.  It was not deployed "
"before the Cataclysm hit, though there were a few prototypes in the field.  "
"You may be able to hack it to accept you as its pilot.  Like all mech-suits "
"it can act as a UPS from its large battery."
msgstr ""
"El Boeing-Daewoo EMC (Exoesqueleto Mecánico de Combate ), una reciente "
"adquisición del ejército de los EE.UU., fue diseñado para ser utilizado en "
"un papel de apoyo de fuego, debido a su temible láser de gatling integrado. "
"No se desplegó antes del impacto del Cataclismo, aunque había algunos "
"prototipos en el campo. Puede que seas capaz de hackearlo para que te acepte"
" como su piloto. Como todos los trajes de mecano, puede actuar como un SAI "
"desde su gran batería."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "X-01: 'Jack' Lifting Mech"
msgid_plural "X-01: 'Jack' Lifting Mechs"
msgstr[0] "X-01: Mecánico de Elevación 'Jack'."
msgstr[1] "X-01: Mecánicos de Elevación 'Jack'."

#. ~ Description for X-01: 'Jack' Lifting Mech
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Boeing-Daewoo LMES (Lifting Mechanical Exoskeleton Suit), a recent "
"acquisition by the US military, it was designed to be piloted by an operator"
" to load and unload heavy material, and for limited combat support roles, it"
" was not deployed before the Cataclysm hit, though there were a few "
"prototypes in the field.  You may be able to hack it to accept you as its "
"pilot.  Like all mech-suits it can act as a UPS from its large battery."
msgstr ""
"El Boeing-Daewoo EME (Exoesqueleto Mecánico de Elevación), una reciente "
"adquisición del ejército de los EE.UU., fue diseñado para ser pilotado por "
"un operador para cargar y descargar material pesado, y para funciones "
"limitadas de apoyo al combate, no fue desplegado antes del impacto del "
"Cataclismo, aunque había unos pocos prototipos en el campo. Es posible que "
"puedas hackearlo para que te acepte como su piloto. Como todos los trajes de"
" mecano, puede actuar como un UPS desde su gran batería."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mi-go"
msgid_plural "mi-gos"
msgstr[0] "mi-go"
msgstr[1] "mi-gos"

#. ~ Description for mi-go
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body "
"bears numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of "
"ribbed, membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and simply "
"gazing upon the unnatural beast fills you with primordial dread."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una criatura alienígena de origen incierto. Su cuerpo rosa sin forma"
" tiene numerosos conjuntos de apéndices de función desconocida, y un par de "
"alas acanaladas y membranosas que parecen ser bastante inútiles. Su cabeza "
"extraña, vagamente en forma de pirámide, se eriza con numerosas antenas "
"vacilantes, y simplemente mirar a la bestia antinatural te llena de temor "
"primordial."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mi-go slaver"
msgid_plural "mi-go slavers"
msgstr[0] "esclavo mi-go"
msgstr[1] "esclavos mi-go"

#. ~ Description for mi-go slaver
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an alien creature of uncertain origin.  Its shapeless pink body "
"bears numerous sets of paired appendages of unknown function, and a pair of "
"ribbed, membranous wings which seem to be quite useless.  Its odd, vaguely "
"pyramid-shaped head bristles with numerous wavering antennae, and simply "
"gazing upon the unnatural beast fills you with primordial dread.  It is "
"carrying an oblong object that hums with an odd keening sound."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una criatura alienígena de origen incierto. Su cuerpo rosa sin forma"
" tiene numerosos conjuntos de apéndices de función desconocida, y un par de "
"alas acanaladas y membranosas que parecen ser bastante inútiles. Su cabeza "
"extraña, vagamente en forma de pirámide, se eriza con numerosas antenas "
"vacilantes, y simplemente mirar a la bestia antinatural te llena de temor "
"primordial. Lleva un objeto oblongo que zumba con un extraño sonido agudo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mi-go surgeon"
msgid_plural "mi-go surgeons"
msgstr[0] "cirujano mi-go"
msgstr[1] "cirujanos mi-go"

#. ~ Description for mi-go surgeon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This mi-go has a slender body with snaking carapace along it, and even more "
"paired clawed appendages.  Its claws are smaller and more delicate looking, "
"but that does not make them less unnerving."
msgstr ""
"Este mi-go tiene un cuerpo delgado con un caparazón serpenteante a lo largo "
"de él, e incluso más apéndices con garras emparejadas. Sus garras son más "
"pequeñas y de aspecto más delicado, pero eso no las hace menos inquietantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mi-go guard"
msgid_plural "mi-go guards"
msgstr[0] "guardia mi-go"
msgstr[1] "guardias mi-go"

#. ~ Description for mi-go guard
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This, like the more common mi-go, is an alien creature; this one is more "
"heavily armored.  Its trunk is a shapeless mass of strange flesh encased in "
"an iridescent carapace, from which sprout several appendages terminating in "
"what appear to be devices of some sort.  Its pyramidal head is encrusted in "
"barnacle-like armor, aside from the bristling antennae that serve as its - "
"you must assume sensory devices and mouth."
msgstr ""
"Este, como el mi-go más común, es una criatura alienígena; este está más "
"fuertemente blindado. Su tronco es una masa informe de carne extraña "
"encerrada en un caparazón iridiscente, de la cual brotan varios apéndices "
"que terminan en lo que parecen ser dispositivos de algún tipo. Su cabeza "
"piramidal está incrustada en una armadura parecida a la de un percebe, "
"además de las erizadas antenas que le sirven de... hay que asumir los "
"dispositivos sensoriales y la boca."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mi-go myrmidon"
msgid_plural "mi-go myrmidons"
msgstr[0] "mirmidón mi-go"
msgstr[1] "mirmidones mi-go"

#. ~ Description for mi-go myrmidon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This creature resembles the smaller mi-go like a grizzly bear resembles a "
"human.  Its enormous, thick body is covered in an iridescent segmented "
"carapace, like a scarab crossed with an isopod.  It boasts several pairs of "
"deadly looking claws and other appendages, and it moves with a strange, slow"
" grace, like an otherworldly dancer.  It actually appears to be carrying "
"weaponry."
msgstr ""
"Esta criatura se asemeja al mi-go más pequeño como un oso pardo se asemeja a"
" un humano. Su enorme y grueso cuerpo está cubierto por un caparazón "
"segmentado iridiscente, como un escarabajo cruzado con un isópodo. Presume "
"de tener varios pares de garras de aspecto mortal y otros apéndices, y se "
"mueve con una gracia extraña y lenta, como un bailarín de otro mundo. En "
"realidad parece que lleva armas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mi-go scout"
msgid_plural "mi-go scouts"
msgstr[0] "explorador mi-go"
msgstr[1] "exploradores mi-go"

#. ~ Description for mi-go scout
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This slender mi-go is a little smaller than most others of its kind.  It has"
" a weird oblong thing attached to the center of its body with some sort of a"
" diaphragm or a membrane on the end.  The thing seems like an integral part "
"of the mi-go, and all its appendages are supporting it to prevent swaying."
msgstr ""
"Este delgado mi-go es un poco más pequeño que la mayoría de los otros de su "
"clase. Tiene una extraña cosa oblonga unida al centro de su cuerpo con una "
"especie de diafragma o membrana en el extremo. La cosa parece ser una parte "
"integral del mi-go, y todos sus apéndices lo sostienen para evitar el "
"balanceo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The mi-go scout fires its weapon!"
msgstr "¡El explorador mi-go dispara su arma!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "debug monster"
msgid_plural "debug monsters"
msgstr[0] "depurar monstruo"
msgstr[1] "depurar monstruos"

#. ~ Description for debug monster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "This monster exists only for testing purposes."
msgstr "Este monstruo solo existe para hacer pruebas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "ancient red dragon"
msgid_plural "ancient red dragons"
msgstr[0] "antiguo dragón rojo"
msgstr[1] "antiguos dragones rojos"

#. ~ Description for ancient red dragon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A towering, hulking dragon, with tremendous, curving horns and shining red "
"scales, its glowing maw peeled back in a hateful grimace as its eyes bore "
"into yours."
msgstr ""
"Un altísimo y mole de dragón, con tremendos cuernos curvos y brillantes "
"escamas rojas, su brillante fauce se despegó con una mueca de odio mientras "
"sus ojos se clavaban en los tuyos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "generator"
msgid_plural "generators"
msgstr[0] "generador"
msgstr[1] "generadores"

#. ~ Description for generator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your precious generator, noisily humming away.  Defend it at all costs!"
msgstr ""
"Tu precioso generador, haciendo un zumbido. ¡Tienes que defenderlo cueste lo"
" que cueste!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "your mother"
msgid_plural "your mothers"
msgstr[0] "tu madre"
msgstr[1] "tus madres"

#. ~ Description for your mother
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Mom?"
msgstr "¿Mamá?"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "evil multi-cooker"
msgid_plural "evil multi-cookers"
msgstr[0] "multicocina malévola"
msgstr[1] "multicocinas malévolas"

#. ~ Description for evil multi-cooker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The multi-cooker's got a mind of its own!  Look out!"
msgstr "¡La multicocina tiene una mente propia! ¡Cuidado!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mannequin"
msgid_plural "mannequins"
msgstr[0] "maniquí"
msgstr[1] "maniquíes"

#. ~ Description for mannequin
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Is this mannequin moving?"
msgstr "¿Se esta moviendo este maniquí?"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hologram"
msgid_plural "holograms"
msgstr[0] "holograma"
msgstr[1] "hologramas"

#. ~ Description for hologram
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "An image made from light, nearly identical to the real deal."
msgstr "Es una imagen hecha de luz, casi parece real."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/SPELL_from_json.py
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "inflatable dragon"
msgid_plural "inflatable dragons"
msgstr[0] "dragón inflable"
msgstr[1] "dragones inflables"

#. ~ Description for inflatable dragon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A giant inflatable dragon for Halloween decorations."
msgstr "Un dragón inflable gigante para las decoraciones de Halloween."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/SPELL_from_json.py
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid "inflatable ghost"
msgid_plural "inflatable ghosts"
msgstr[0] "fantasma inflable"
msgstr[1] "fantasmas inflables"

#. ~ Description for inflatable ghost
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A human sized inflatable for Halloween decorations."
msgstr "Un inflable de tamaño humano para las decoraciones de Halloween."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "C.H.U.D."
msgid_plural "C.H.U.D.s"
msgstr[0] "H.H.S.C."
msgstr[1] "H.H.S.C."

#. ~ Description for C.H.U.D.
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The C.H.U.D. or Cannibalistic Humanoid Underground Dweller.  A human being "
"turned pale and mad from years of underground isolation."
msgstr ""
"El H.H.S.C., o Habitante Humanoide Subterráneo Canibalesco. Un humano que se"
" volvió pálido y loco por los años que pasó aislado y bajo tierra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "experimental mutant"
msgid_plural "experimental mutants"
msgstr[0] "mutante experimental"
msgstr[1] "mutantes experimentales"

#. ~ Description for experimental mutant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deformed amalgamation of man and animal.  Grotesque humanoid covered in "
"fur and a torn jumpsuit.  The sinister fangs, claws and the look of insanity"
" in his pale yellow eyes are a testament to that he lost all of his "
"humanity."
msgstr ""
"Una deformada amalgama de hombre y animal. Grotesco humanoide cubierto de "
"piel y un mono roto. Los siniestros colmillos, garras y la mirada de locura "
"en sus pálidos ojos amarillos son un testamento de que perdió toda su "
"humanidad."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "evolved mutant"
msgid_plural "evolved mutants"
msgstr[0] "mutante evolucionado"
msgstr[1] "mutantes evolucionados"

#. ~ Description for evolved mutant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A towering beast that is neither human nor animal anymore.  A malformed, "
"huge creature covered in thick fur and the torn bottom part of a jumpsuit.  "
"The sinister fangs, claws and the look of insanity in his pale yellow eyes "
"are a testament to that he lost all of his humanity."
msgstr ""
"Una bestia imponente que ya no es ni humana ni animal. Una malformada y "
"enorme criatura cubierta de un grueso pelaje y la parte inferior rota de un "
"mono. Los siniestros colmillos, garras y la mirada de locura en sus pálidos "
"ojos amarillos son un testamento de que perdió toda su humanidad."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cyclopean"
msgid_plural "cyclopeans"
msgstr[0] "ciclópeo"
msgstr[1] "ciclópeos"

#. ~ Description for cyclopean
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A relatively humanoid mutant with purple hair and a grapefruit-sized "
"bloodshot eye."
msgstr ""
"Un mutante relativamente humanoide con el pelo púrpura y un ojo inyectado en"
" sangre del tamaño de un pomelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Cerbearus"
msgid_plural "Cerberuses"
msgstr[0] "Cerbero"
msgstr[1] "Cerberos"

#. ~ Description for Cerbearus
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sometime between the Cataclysm and now, this black bear has gained two extra"
" heads.  This doesn't seem to have improved its disposition."
msgstr ""
"En algún momento entre el cataclismo y ahora, este oso negro ha ganado dos "
"cabezas extra. Esto no parece haber mejorado su disposición."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dambreaker"
msgid_plural "dambreakers"
msgstr[0] "rompedor de presa"
msgstr[1] "rompedores de presa"

#. ~ Description for dambreaker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This mutated beaver's size is almost double what it should be, and its back "
"is covered with tough-looking bristles."
msgstr ""
"El tamaño de este castor mutado es casi el doble de lo que debería ser, y su"
" espalda está cubierta de cerdas de aspecto duro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "feaver"
msgid_plural "feavers"
msgstr[0] "caspluma"
msgstr[1] "casplumas"

#. ~ Description for feaver
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This mutant beaver's body is covered with brightly-colored feathers in a "
"particularly eyecatching pattern.  It must have been very lucky not to have "
"been caught by a predator before now."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo de este castor mutante está cubierto de plumas de colores "
"brillantes en un patrón particularmente llamativo. Debe haber sido muy "
"afortunado de no haber sido capturado por un depredador antes de ahora."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "iridescent cat"
msgid_plural "iridescent cats"
msgstr[0] "gato iridiscente"
msgstr[1] "gatos iridiscentes"

#. ~ Description for iridescent cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As it moves, this cat's colors shift unnaturally in the light.  You can't "
"make out the breed, but its fur pattern seems to change with every step."
msgstr ""
"A medida que se mueve, los colores de este gato cambian de forma poco "
"natural con la luz. No se puede distinguir la raza, pero su patrón de pelo "
"parece cambiar con cada paso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "iridescent kitten"
msgid_plural "iridescent kittens"
msgstr[0] "gatito iridiscente"
msgstr[1] "gatitos iridiscentes"

#. ~ Description for iridescent kitten
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In the light, this adorably tiny bundle of unkempt fluff is an ever-changing"
" flurry of brilliant colors."
msgstr ""
"A la luz, este adorable y diminuto bulto de pelusa descuidada es una ráfaga "
"siempre cambiante de colores brillantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grinning coyote"
msgid_plural "grinning coyotes"
msgstr[0] "coyote sonriente"
msgstr[1] "coyotes sonrientes"

#. ~ Description for grinning coyote
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Were it not for the misshapen snout and visible teeth, this would look like "
"an ordinary Northeastern coyote.  Closer inspection of its mouth reveals row"
" after row of serrated, shark-like teeth."
msgstr ""
"Si no fuera por el hocico deforme y los dientes visibles, esto se vería como"
" un coyote común del noreste. Una inspección más cercana de su boca revela "
"fila tras fila de dientes dentados, como los de un tiburón."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "slavering coyote"
msgid_plural "slavering coyotes"
msgstr[0] "coyote esclavo"
msgstr[1] "coyotes esclavos"

#. ~ Description for slavering coyote
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Unnatural bulges line the neck of this obviously-mutated coyote; green-"
"tinted foam flecks from its lips, and there's a crazed look in its eyes."
msgstr ""
"Bultos antinaturales cubren el cuello de este coyote obviamente mutado; "
"manchas de espuma de color verde en sus labios, y hay una mirada loca en sus"
" ojos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dire wolf"
msgid_plural "dire wolves"
msgstr[0] "lobo feroz"
msgstr[1] "lobos feroces"

#. ~ Description for dire wolf
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This wolf has grown to terrifying proportions, rivalling a small car.  Its "
"teeth give steak knives a run for their money, and it definitely doesn't "
"look friendly."
msgstr ""
"Este lobo ha crecido a proporciones aterradoras, rivalizando con un pequeño "
"coche. Sus dientes hacen que los cuchillos para carne den verguenza, y "
"definitivamente no se ve amigable."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "spideer"
msgid_plural "spideers"
msgstr[0] "ciervaña"
msgstr[1] "ciervañas"

#. ~ Description for spideer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This once-ordinary deer has grown a disturbingly agile array of extra limbs,"
" plus three extra eyes.  Its antlers wriggle subtly in the wind."
msgstr ""
"Este extraordinario ciervo ha desarrollado un inquietante y ágil conjunto de"
" extremidades adicionales, además de tres ojos adicionales. Su cornamenta se"
" retuerce sutilmente con el viento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "spideer fawn"
msgid_plural "spideer fawns"
msgstr[0] "cervatillo de ciervaña"
msgstr[1] "cervatillos de ciervaña"

#. ~ Description for spideer fawn
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This obviously mutated adolescent deer moves unsteadily on its eight legs, "
"nervously scanning the area with all five eyes."
msgstr ""
"Este ciervo adolescente obviamente mutado se mueve inestablemente en sus "
"ocho patas, escudriñando nerviosamente el área con sus cinco ojos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mongrel"
msgid_plural "mongrels"
msgstr[0] "mestizo"
msgstr[1] "mestizos"

#. ~ Description for mongrel
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This dog of unidentifiable breed looks like it has seen better days.  Its "
"wiry hair is patchy, revealing scales underneath, but it still happily wags "
"its tails anyways."
msgstr ""
"Este perro de raza no identificable parece haber visto mejores días. Su pelo"
" enjuto es irregular, revelando escamas debajo, pero aún así mueve "
"felizmente la cola."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "albino penguin"
msgid_plural "albino penguins"
msgstr[0] "pingüino albino"
msgstr[1] "pingüinos albino"

#. ~ Description for albino penguin
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Eight-feet-tall ghastly white penguins.  Placid unless otherwise provoked."
msgstr ""
"Pingüinos de dos metros y medio de alto, de un blanco fantasmal. Son calmos "
"hasta que se los provocan."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "amigara horror"
msgid_plural "amigara horrors"
msgstr[0] "horror amigara"
msgstr[1] "horrores amigara"

#. ~ Description for amigara horror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hellish, vaguely humanoid horror, two stories tall.  Its face is "
"grotesquely stretched out, its limbs deformed to unrecognizable outgrowths."
msgstr ""
"Un horror infernal, vagamente humanoide, alto como un edificio de dos pisos."
" Su cara está grotescamente estirada hacia afuera, y sus labios deformados "
"de manera irreconocible."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "blank body"
msgid_plural "blank bodies"
msgstr[0] "cadáver vacío"
msgstr[1] "cadáveres vacíos"

#. ~ Description for blank body
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is some form of unnatural changeling creature; its appearance is a "
"bland mockery of the human form.  Featureless and pale, its repugnant "
"countenance is all the more unsettling due to its lack of eyes and "
"distinguishing features except for a perfectly round mouth.  Naked and "
"trembling, it almost seems pitiful but for the way that its unearthly "
"presence makes the hair on the back of your neck stand up in nameless "
"horror."
msgstr ""
"Es alguna clase de criatura sobrenatural, su apariencia parece una burla de "
"la forma humana. Sin gesto, pálido, su expresión repugnante es todavía más "
"perturbadora debido a su carencia de ojos y características distinguibles, "
"excepto una boca perfectamente redonda. Desnudo y temblando casi que te da "
"lástima, pero su presencia hace que se te paren los pelitos de la nuca de "
"horror."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "blood sacrifice"
msgid_plural "blood sacrifices"
msgstr[0] "sacrificio sangriento"
msgstr[1] "sacrificios sangrientos"

#. ~ Description for blood sacrifice
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A defiled human body, once living.  Tortured to death long ago, it remains "
"chained to the altar, the putrescent flays of its peeled skin quivering like"
" so much flotsam upon a murky pond."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano profanado, que alguna vez estuvo vivo. Torturado hasta "
"morir hace mucho tiempo, todavía se encuentra encadenado al altar. Los "
"flecos putrefactos de su piel arrancada se agitan como restos de un "
"naufragio en un estanque turbio."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "breather"
msgid_plural "breathers"
msgstr[0] "respirador"
msgstr[1] "respiradores"

#. ~ Description for breather
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is some sort of unearthly pink flesh sac; moist and ridged with veins, "
"it is otherwise without discernible exterior features.  Seemingly immobile "
"and defenseless, it sits in place, swelling and collapsing upon itself as it"
" breathes."
msgstr ""
"Este es una especie de saco de carne rosado, húmedo y con venas, sin rasgos "
"exteriores perceptibles. Aparentemente inmóvil e indefenso, se sienta en su "
"lugar, hinchándose y colapsando sobre sí mismo mientras respira."

#. ~ Description for breather
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A weird mass of immobile pink goo.  It seems to breathe."
msgstr "Una rara masa de viscosidad rosa inmóvil. Parece respirar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wraith"
msgid_plural "wraiths"
msgstr[0] "espectro"
msgstr[1] "espectros"

#. ~ Description for wraith
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic shadow, chaotically changing in shape and volume.  Two piercing "
"orbs of light dominate what can only be described as its head."
msgstr ""
"Una sombra gigantesca, cambiando caóticamente de forma y volumen. Dos "
"penetrantes orbes de luz dominan lo que sólo puede describirse como su "
"cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dementia"
msgid_plural "dementias"
msgstr[0] "dementia"
msgstr[1] "dementias"

#. ~ Description for dementia
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crazed individual, the bloody scars on the side of its shaved head suggest"
" some sort of partial lobotomy."
msgstr ""
"Un individuo enloquecido, las cicatrices sangrientas en el lado de su cabeza"
" afeitada sugieren algún tipo de lobotomía parcial."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "dog"
msgid_plural "dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro"
msgstr[1] "perros"

#. ~ Description for dog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A domesticated mongrel of the canine persuasion.  In the absence of human "
"society, it has turned feral."
msgstr ""
"Un mestizo domesticado de la persuasión canina. En ausencia de la sociedad "
"humana, se ha vuelto salvaje."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "flaming eye"
msgid_plural "flaming eyes"
msgstr[0] "ojo llameante"
msgstr[1] "ojos llameantes"

#. ~ Description for flaming eye
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air"
" through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, "
"it possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat "
"and trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about; its "
"unearthly presence filling you with dread at the prospect of falling under "
"its baleful gaze."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme globo ocular incorpóreo del tamaño de una persona, volando por el "
"aire a través de alguna agencia desconocida. Envuelto en una llama azul "
"parpadeante y antinatural, posee un iris amarillo ardiente con una pupila "
"rajada como la de un gato y sigue un conjunto de zarcillos negros ondulantes"
" mientras se desplaza lentamente; su presencia sobrenatural te llena de "
"temor ante la perspectiva de caer bajo su mirada maligna."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "flying polyp"
msgid_plural "flying polyps"
msgstr[0] "pólipo volador"
msgstr[1] "pólipos voladores"

#. ~ Description for flying polyp
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A half polypous, utterly alien creature.  It's only partly material and has "
"the ability to fly, despite the absence of wings.  It produces strange "
"whistling noises which send cold shivers of primal terror down your spine."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura medio polipo, totalmente alienígena. Es sólo parcialmente "
"material y tiene la capacidad de volar, a pesar de la ausencia de alas. "
"Produce extraños silbidos que envían escalofríos de terror primitivo por su "
"columna vertebral."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "unseen hunter"
msgid_plural "unseen hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador invisible"
msgstr[1] "cazadores invisibles"

#. ~ Description for unseen hunter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There was nothing here a moment ago, but now you see the faintest outline of"
" an otherworldly creature approaching you with jittery leaps.  Trying to "
"focus on it reveals a pointed beak dripping translucent fluid and rows upon "
"rows of bladed legs grasping the floor, before your eyes begin to burn and "
"your head starts to spin."
msgstr ""
"Hace un momento no había nada aquí, pero ahora ves la tenue silueta de una "
"criatura de otro mundo que se acerca a ti con saltos nerviosos. Al intentar "
"enfocarla, ves un pico puntiagudo que gotea un líquido translúcido y filas y"
" filas de patas con cuchillas que se agarran al suelo, antes de que tus ojos"
" empiecen a arder y tu cabeza a dar vueltas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gozu"
msgid_plural "gozus"
msgstr[0] "gozu"
msgstr[1] "gozus"

#. ~ Description for gozu
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is some sort of unnatural cross between a bull and a man.  Quite "
"different from the minotaur of legend, it possesses a shaggy white bull’s "
"head on an otherwise unremarkable human body.  Clad in sagging socks and "
"stained jockey shorts, it grunts and snuffles, drooling ropey strands of "
"white slobber down its chest.  Its mere presence fills you with an "
"unfathomable dread."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una especie de cruce antinatural entre un toro y un hombre. Muy "
"diferente del minotauro de la leyenda, posee una peluda cabeza de toro "
"blanca en un cuerpo humano poco llamativo. Vestido con calcetines caídos y "
"calzoncillos manchados, gruñe y resopla, babeando hilos de baba blanca en su"
" pecho. Su mera presencia te llena de un temor insondable."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gracken"
msgid_plural "grackens"
msgstr[0] "gracken"
msgstr[1] "grackens"

#. ~ Description for gracken
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is some form of eldritch monstrosity; an uncouth black being with "
"smooth, oily, skin and unpleasant horns that curve inward toward each other."
"  Tall and thin, the shadows cling unnaturally to its vaguely defined "
"humanoid form as it shuffles along, its hands twitching and spasming so "
"rapidly as to appear a little more than a black blur of claws.  Gazing upon "
"its disturbing form fills you with an unspeakable terror."
msgstr ""
"Esto es alguna clase de monstruosidad de otro planeta; un ser oscuro y "
"ordinario con piel suave y aceitosa, y unos cuernos desagradables que se "
"curva hacia adentro. Alto y delgado, las sombras se aferran de manera "
"sobrenatural a su vagamente definida forma humanoide mientras se mueve, sus "
"manos se retuercen tan rápidamente que parecen una mancha de garras negras. "
"Viendo su inquietante forma sentís un terror inenarrable."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tentacle dog"
msgid_plural "tentacle dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro tentáculo"
msgstr[1] "perros tentáculo"

#. ~ Description for tentacle dog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dog's body with a mass of ropey, black tentacles reaching out from its "
"head."
msgstr ""
"El cuerpo de un perro con una masa de tentáculos filamentosos negros que "
"salen de su cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hound of tindalos"
msgid_plural "hounds of tindalos"
msgstr[0] "perro de tindalos"
msgstr[1] "perros de tindalos"

#. ~ Description for hound of tindalos
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A grotesque hound-like beast, its frame is angular and emaciated and its "
"head is like that of an abyssal fish.  When it moves, twisted limbs "
"duplicate, merge, disappear, and reform in dissonance, as if a hundred "
"copies of itself were somehow forced to inhabit the same space.  Extraneous "
"to our reality, it moves between the corners of the world, hunting those "
"that would dare stepping beyond time and space."
msgstr ""
"Una grotesca bestia parecida a un perro, su estructura es angular y "
"demacrada y su cabeza es como la de un pez abisal. Cuando se mueve, sus "
"miembros retorcidos se duplican, se fusionan, desaparecen y se reforman en "
"disonancia, como si un centenar de copias de sí misma se vieran obligadas de"
" alguna manera a habitar el mismo espacio. Extras de nuestra realidad, se "
"mueve entre los rincones del mundo, cazando a aquellos que se atreven a ir "
"más allá del tiempo y el espacio."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "human snail"
msgid_plural "human snails"
msgstr[0] "caracol humano"
msgstr[1] "caracoles humanos"

#. ~ Description for human snail
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous fleshy snail, with an oddly human face.  Eyestalks protrude from"
" where the eyes should be."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme caracol carnoso, con una extraña cara humana. Ojos pedunculados "
"salen de donde deberían estar los ojos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hunting horror"
msgid_plural "hunting horrors"
msgstr[0] "horror cazador"
msgstr[1] "horrores cazador"

#. ~ Description for hunting horror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously "
"distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself "
"with the aid of black rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  Its form "
"writhes and changes before your eyes, filling you with unnameable horror."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una especie de gran criatura viperina, poseedora de una cabeza "
"curiosamente distorsionada y enormes apéndices con garras. Se sostiene "
"parcialmente con la ayuda de unas gomosas alas negras de dimensiones "
"monstruosas. Su forma se retuerce y cambia ante tus ojos, llenándote de un "
"horror innombrable."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "kreck"
msgid_plural "krecks"
msgstr[0] "kreck"
msgstr[1] "krecks"

#. ~ Description for kreck
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is some form of otherworldly hound.  Lean and hungry looking, its "
"twisted red flesh is stretched tightly across its misshapen, angular frame."
"  Loping grotesquely along, its unusually long neck stretches forward, its "
"skull-like head near the ground as it sniffs out its prey.  Its foulness "
"partially veiled by some arcane force, it seems to almost flicker in and out"
" of your perceptions in a fashion that awakens ancient nameless terrors in "
"the back of your mind."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una forma de sabueso de otro mundo. De aspecto delgado y hambriento,"
" su retorcida carne roja se extiende con fuerza a través de su deforme y "
"anguloso armazón. Se inclina grotescamente, su cuello inusualmente largo se "
"extiende hacia adelante, su cabeza parecida al cráneo cerca del suelo "
"mientras huele a su presa. Su asquerosidad parcialmente velada por alguna "
"fuerza arcana, parece casi parpadear dentro y fuera de sus percepciones de "
"una manera que despierta antiguos terrores sin nombre en el fondo de tu "
"mente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/field_type_from_json.py
msgid "shadow"
msgid_plural "shadows"
msgstr[0] "sombra"
msgstr[1] "sombras"

#. ~ Description for shadow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an animate shadow.  Looking like nothing more than an errant patch "
"of normal shadow, it draws your attention by the way it moves subtly and "
"whispers softly in the back of your mind.  Strange intrusive thoughts "
"accompany the quiet murmur, awakening your most horrific memories and fears."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una sombra animada. Pareciendo nada más que un trozo errante de "
"sombra normal, atrae tu atención por la forma en que se mueve sutilmente y "
"susurra suavemente en el fondo de tu mente. Extraños pensamientos intrusivos"
" acompañan el tranquilo murmullo, despertando tus más horribles recuerdos y "
"miedos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shadow snake"
msgid_plural "shadow snakes"
msgstr[0] "serpiente de sombra"
msgstr[1] "serpientes de sombra"

#. ~ Description for shadow snake
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an animate shadow in the form of a long and sinuous snake.  "
"Translucent and dark, it glides silently across the floor, wriggling and "
"flexing as it moves."
msgstr ""
"Es una sombra animada en forma de una serpiente sinuosa y larga. Traslúcida "
"y oscura, se desliza silenciosamente por el suelo, retorciéndose."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shoggoth"
msgid_plural "shoggoths"
msgstr[0] "shoggoth"
msgstr[1] "shoggoths"

#. ~ Description for shoggoth
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gargantuan protoplasmic blob, constantly reshaping, forming new pseudopods"
" seemingly at will.  All over its body are eyes that form and disappear.  It"
" looks at you with malice."
msgstr ""
"Un pantagruélico blobo protoplasmáco, cambiando de forma constantemente, "
"generando nuevos pseudópodos a voluntad. Por todo su cuerpo hay ojos que se "
"forman y desaparecen. Te mira con malicia."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py src/handle_action.cpp
msgid "thing"
msgid_plural "things"
msgstr[0] "cosa"
msgstr[1] "cosas"

#. ~ Description for thing
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An amorphous black creature, detaching and sprouting tentacles without any "
"apparent pause."
msgstr ""
"Un criatura amorfa negra, a la que le crecen tentáculos a medida que se le "
"van desprendiendo, sin pausa aparente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "twisted body"
msgid_plural "twisted bodies"
msgstr[0] "cuerpo retorcido"
msgstr[1] "cuerpos retorcidos"

#. ~ Description for twisted body
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human body, but with its limbs, neck, and hair impossibly twisted.  It "
"clambers around swiftly, making awful screeching sounds."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano pero con sus miembros, cuello y pelo retorcidos de una "
"manera imposible. Va trepando velozmente, haciendo unos horribles sonidos "
"como chirridos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "yugg"
msgid_plural "yuggs"
msgstr[0] "yugg"
msgstr[1] "yuggs"

#. ~ Description for yugg
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a huge, slimy worm-like creature.  Its pale, flattened head drips an"
" oily mucus as it breaches the ground, searching for prey.  Its pinkish "
"mouth opens and closes, revealing long fangs glistening with ropey strands "
"of saliva, which leave smoldering stains wherever they drip.  The mere sight"
" of its putrid whitish visage is enough to loose prehistoric terrors within "
"the darkest recesses of your mind."
msgstr ""
"Este es un gigante gusano baboso. Su cabeza chata y pálida chorrea una "
"mucosa aceitosa mientras atraviesa el suelo, buscando a su presa. Su boca "
"rosada se abre y se cierra, revelando largos colmillos con brillantes hilos "
"de saliva, que dejan manchas ardientes donde caen. La mera vista de su "
"pútrido rostro blancuzco es suficiente para liberar horrores prehistóricos "
"en los recovecos más oscuros de tu mente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "vortex"
msgid_plural "vortexes"
msgstr[0] "vórtice"
msgstr[1] "vórtices"

#. ~ Description for vortex
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A twisting spot in the air, with some kind of morphing mass at its center."
msgstr ""
"Un punto como un torbellino en el aire, con alguna clase de masa que se va "
"transformando en su centro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "deer mouse"
msgid_plural "deer mouses"
msgstr[0] "arce"
msgstr[1] "arces"

#. ~ Description for deer mouse
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The white-footed mouse, a prolific rodent with a white underbelly and a long"
" fuzzy tail.  A common sight in fields, forests, and research centers."
msgstr ""
"Es un ratón de patas blancas, un roedor prolífico con la parte de abajo "
"blanca y una cola peluda. Es muy común verlo en los campos, bosques y "
"centros de investigación."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dragonfly"
msgid_plural "dragonflies"
msgstr[0] "libélula"
msgstr[1] "libélulas"

#. ~ Description for dragonfly
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin-bodied insectoid predator with a large wingspan and big compound "
"eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un depredador insectoide de cuerpo delgado, de larga envergadura y grandes "
"ojos compuestos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bull frog"
msgid_plural "bull frogs"
msgstr[0] "rana toro"
msgstr[1] "ranas toro"

#. ~ Description for bull frog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The American bullfrog, in its natural habitat.  It feeds on insects, mice, "
"lizards and any other living thing it can stuff down its gullet."
msgstr ""
"La rana toro americana, en su hábitat natural. Se alimenta de insectos, "
"ratones, lagartijas y otros seres vivos que puede meterse en la garganta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mosquito"
msgid_plural "mosquitos"
msgstr[0] "mosquito"
msgstr[1] "mosquitos"

#. ~ Description for mosquito
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A blood-sucking fly with a needle-like proboscis.  Its bite leaves behind "
"itchy welts and can easily spread disease."
msgstr ""
"Una mosca chupasangre con una trompa en forma de aguja. Su mordida deja una "
"roncha que pica y puede fácilmente propagar enfermedades."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shrew"
msgid_plural "shrews"
msgstr[0] "musaraña"
msgstr[1] "musarañas"

#. ~ Description for shrew
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The masked shrew, a mouse-like creature with a pointed, whiskery snout.  It "
"digs tunnels into the ground in search of bugs to eat."
msgstr ""
"La musaraña enmascarada, una criatura similar al ratón con el hocico "
"puntiagudo y lleno de bigotes. Hace túneles en el suelo para buscar y comer "
"insectos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "slug"
msgid_plural "slugs"
msgstr[0] "babosa"
msgstr[1] "babosas"

#. ~ Description for slug
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The leopard slug, an omnivorous gastropod.  It consumes decaying matter as "
"well as planted crops, and will attack and eat other slugs that cross its "
"path."
msgstr ""
"La babosa leopardo, un gastrópodo omnívoro. Consume materia en "
"descomposición y también cultivos, y atacará y se comerá otras babosas que "
"se le crucen por el camino."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "jumping spider"
msgid_plural "jumping spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña saltarina"
msgstr[1] "arañas saltarinas"

#. ~ Description for jumping spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A little spider with elongated forelegs.  It does not build extensive webs, "
"but leaps very quickly, appearing to move instantaneously from one spot to "
"another."
msgstr ""
"Es una araña pequeña con las patas delanteras largas. No construye telarañas"
" muy extensas pero salta muy rápido, lo que hace parecer que se traslada "
"instantáneamente de un lugar a otro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "trapdoor spider"
msgid_plural "trapdoor spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña trampilla"
msgstr[1] "arañas trampillas"

#. ~ Description for trapdoor spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A midsized spider with a bulbous thorax.  It creates a subterranean nest and"
" lies in wait for prey to draw close enough for capture."
msgstr ""
"Es una araña de tamaño medio con un tórax protuberante. Construye nidos "
"subterráneos y allí espera que la presa se acerque lo suficiente para "
"atacar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black widow spider"
msgid_plural "black widow spiders"
msgstr[0] "viuda negra"
msgstr[1] "viudas negras"

#. ~ Description for black widow spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An infamous spider with a characteristic red hourglass marking on its black "
"carapace, known for its highly toxic bite."
msgstr ""
"La famosa araña que tiene el característico reloj de arena rojo marcado en "
"su caparazón negro, y conocida por si mordida muy tóxica."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wolf spider"
msgid_plural "wolf spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña lobo"
msgstr[1] "arañas lobo"

#. ~ Description for wolf spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fairly large spider which tracks and catches prey through agility and "
"stealth.  Its bite can be irritating even to large animals."
msgstr ""
"Una araña bastante grande que rastrea y caza a su presa con su agilidad y "
"sigilo. Su mordida puede molesta incluso para animales grandes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tripod"
msgid_plural "tripods"
msgstr[0] "trípode"
msgstr[1] "trípodes"

#. ~ Description for tripod
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Honda Regnal, a tall robot walking on three spidery legs.  For weapons, "
"it has a trio of spiked retractable cables and a flamethrower mounted on its"
" head."
msgstr ""
"El Honda Regnal, un robot alto que camina sobre tres patas similares a las "
"de una araña. Como armas, lleva un trío de cables retraíbles con púas, y un "
"lanzallamas montado en su cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Beagle Mini-Tank UGV"
msgid_plural "Beagle Mini-Tank UGVs"
msgstr[0] "UGV Mini-Tanque Beagle"
msgstr[1] "UGV Mini-Tanques Beagle"

#. ~ Description for Beagle Mini-Tank UGV
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Northrop Beagle is a refrigerator-sized urban warfare UGV.  Sporting an "
"anti-tank missile launcher, 40mm grenade launcher, and numerous anti-"
"infantry weapons, it's designed for high-risk urban fighting."
msgstr ""
"El Northrop Beagle es un UGV de guerra urbana del tamaño de un refrigerador."
" Con un lanzador de misiles anti-tanque, un lanzagranadas de 40mm y "
"numerosas armas anti-infantiles, está diseñado para la lucha urbana de alto "
"riesgo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "chicken walker"
msgid_plural "chicken walkers"
msgstr[0] "mecha-gallina"
msgstr[1] "mecha-gallinas"

#. ~ Description for chicken walker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Northrop ATSV, a massive, heavily-armed and armored robot walking on a "
"pair of reverse-jointed legs.  Armed with a 40mm anti-vehicle grenade "
"launcher, 5.56 anti-personnel gun, and the ability to electrify itself "
"against attackers, it is an effective automated sentry, though production "
"was limited due to a legal dispute."
msgstr ""
"El ATSV de Northrop, un enorme robot fuertemente armado y blindado que "
"camina sobre un par de piernas articuladas al revés. Armado con un "
"lanzagranadas antivehículo de 40 mm, un cañón antipersonal de 5.56 y la "
"capacidad de electrificarse contra los atacantes, es un efectivo centinela "
"automatizado, aunque su producción fue limitada debido a una disputa legal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "laser turret"
msgid_plural "laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta láser"
msgstr[1] "torretas láser"

#. ~ Description for laser turret
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the art revolving laser cannon system with three barrels that charge from"
" solar cells embedded in its hull."
msgstr ""
"La TX-5LR Cerberus es una actualización de su predecesores. Posee un sistema"
" de cañón láser rotativo de última generación, con tres cañones que se "
"cargan con las celdas solares que están dispuestas por todo su casco."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "leech blossom"
msgid_plural "leech blossoms"
msgstr[0] "flor sanguijuela"
msgstr[1] "flores sanguijuela"

#. ~ Description for leech blossom
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A resplendent alien fern, crowned with flowers colored deep indigo.  It "
"appears to be the centerpiece of this otherworldly bloom."
msgstr ""
"Un resplandeciente helecho alienígena, coronado con flores de color índigo "
"profundo. Parece ser la pieza central de este florecimiento de otro mundo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Lightning arcs from the leech blossom!"
msgstr "¡Arcos de rayos de la flor de sanguijuela!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "a faint buzz"
msgstr "un débil zumbido"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "leech stalk"
msgid_plural "leech stalks"
msgstr[0] "tallo de sanguijuela"
msgstr[1] "tallos de sanguijuela"

#. ~ Description for leech stalk
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A resplendent and voluminous alien fern.  A faint buzzing sound emanates "
"from it, and the shadow cast by its canopy continuously glows with electric "
"charge."
msgstr ""
"Un resplandeciente y voluminoso helecho alienígena. Un débil zumbido emana "
"de él, y la sombra que proyecta su dosel brilla continuamente con carga "
"eléctrica."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Lightning arcs from the leech stalk!"
msgstr "¡Arcos de rayos del tallo de la sanguijuela!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "signal tree"
msgid_plural "signal trees"
msgstr[0] "árbol señal"
msgstr[1] "arboles señales"

#. ~ Description for signal tree
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A trunk reaches tall into the sky, its topmost branches glowing with yellow "
"light.  A low drum periodically shakes its vicinities."
msgstr ""
"Un tronco llega alto en el cielo, sus ramas superiores brillan con luz "
"amarilla. Un bajo tambor sacude periódicamente sus alrededores."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "leech pod cluster"
msgid_plural "leech pod clusters"
msgstr[0] "grupo de vainas de sanguijuelas"
msgstr[1] "grupos de vainas de sanguijuelas"

#. ~ Description for leech pod cluster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The translucent egg pods of an alien plant, firmly attached by luminous "
"rhizomes.  You can barely distinguish a root drone floating within a cloudy "
"substance."
msgstr ""
"Las vainas de huevo translúcidas de una planta alienígena, firmemente "
"adheridas por rizomas luminosos. Apenas se puede distinguir un zángano de "
"raíz flotando dentro de una sustancia nublada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Lightning arcs from the pod cluster!"
msgstr "¡Arcos de rayos del grupo de vainas!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "root runner"
msgid_plural "root runners"
msgstr[0] "corredor de raíz"
msgstr[1] "corredores de raíz"

#. ~ Description for root runner
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This clump of woody vegetation hastily clambers around in a lizard-like "
"fashion.  Three translucent scale-leaves stand tall on the backside of the "
"creature, and the thin ridges within them periodically glow through some "
"unknown mean.  It's seemingly a symbiote of the nearby alien ferns, and "
"looks ready to defend them with its life."
msgstr ""
"Este grupo de vegetación leñosa se agrupa apresuradamente alrededor de una "
"forma similar a un lagarto. Tres hojas de escamas translúcidas se erigen en "
"la parte trasera de la criatura, y las delgadas crestas dentro de ellas "
"brillan periódicamente a través de algún medio desconocido. Parece ser un "
"simbionte de los helechos alienígenas cercanos, y parece estar listo para "
"defenderlos con su vida."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Sparks fly from the root runner!"
msgstr "¡Las chispas vuelan desde el corredor de la raíz!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "root drone"
msgid_plural "root drones"
msgstr[0] "dron de raiz"
msgstr[1] "drones de raiz"

#. ~ Description for root drone
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small bulb with a beak-like protuberance, skittishly roaming about under "
"three tendril rhizomes.  Dripping and glistening, it resembles a creature "
"newly born rather than a sapling grown from seeds."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño bulbo con una protuberancia en forma de pico, vagando asustado "
"bajo tres rizomas de zarcillos. Goteando y brillando, se asemeja a una "
"criatura recién nacida en lugar de un árbol joven crecido a partir de "
"semillas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Lightning arcs from the root pod!"
msgstr "¡Se ven rayos que salen de las raíces!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge frog"
msgid_plural "huge frogs"
msgstr[0] "rana enorme"
msgstr[1] "ranas enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge frog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A mutant bullfrog the size of a person.  It looks unwell."
msgstr "Una rana toro mutante del tamaño de una persona. No se ve bien."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant frog"
msgid_plural "giant frogs"
msgstr[0] "rana gigante"
msgstr[1] "ranas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant frog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutated bullfrog taller than you are.  It stares with amber eyes as it "
"considers the easiest way to swallow you whole."
msgstr ""
"Una rana toro mutada, más alta que tú. Tiene los ojos ámbar y te mira "
"mientras considera la manera más fácil de tragarte entero."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sewer gator"
msgid_plural "sewer gators"
msgstr[0] "caimán de alcantarilla"
msgstr[1] "caimanes de alcantarilla"

#. ~ Description for sewer gator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In the late 20th century, there was an urban legend about pet alligators "
"getting flushed down the toilet and growing to adulthood in sewers.  This "
"large specimen doesn't look like it sees humans as anything other than a "
"meal."
msgstr ""
"A fines del siglo XX había una leyenda urbana acerca de unos pequeños "
"cocodrilos que eran tirados por el inodoro y se hacían adultos en las "
"cloacas. Este gran espécimen parece ver a los humanos solo como alimento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rattlesnake"
msgid_plural "rattlesnakes"
msgstr[0] "serpiente de cascabel"
msgstr[1] "serpientes de cascabel"

#. ~ Description for rattlesnake
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The timber rattlesnake is the most venomous viper native to New England.  "
"Climatic changes have extended its range far into the north."
msgstr ""
"La serpiente de cascabel de la madera es la víbora más venenosa nativa de "
"Nueva Inglaterra. Los cambios climáticos la han llevado hacia el norte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant rattlesnake"
msgid_plural "giant rattlesnakes"
msgstr[0] "serpiente de cascabel gigante"
msgstr[1] "serpientes de cascabel gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant rattlesnake
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutated timber rattlesnake, about three times as large as the norm.  While"
" it isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is more "
"aggressive and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr ""
"Es una serpiente de cascabel de la madera mutada, de unas tres veces más "
"grande que la común. Aunque no es lo suficientemente grande como para "
"considerar a los humanos su presa, es más agresiva y peligrosa comparada a "
"la cascabel normal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sewer snake"
msgid_plural "sewer snakes"
msgstr[0] "serpiente de cloaca"
msgstr[1] "serpientes de cloaca"

#. ~ Description for sewer snake
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An aggressive mutant variety of the worm snake, turned pale yellow from its "
"underground life.  It swarms beneath the ground and is named for its habit "
"of infesting sewer lines."
msgstr ""
"Una variedad agresiva mutada de la serpiente, que se puso de un amarillo "
"pálido por su vida subterránea. Se mueve en manada por debajo del suelo y su"
" nombre es por su hábito de infestar las cloacas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "prototype laser turret"
msgid_plural "prototype laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "prototipo de torreta laser"
msgstr[1] "prototipos de torreta laser"

#. ~ Description for prototype laser turret
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This appears to be a very experimental automated tower.  Plating-less and "
"seemingly half-built, it's little more than an oversized laser emitter and a"
" camera, both welded to a swiveling platform."
msgstr ""
"Esta parece ser una torre automatizada muy experimental. Sin placas y "
"aparentemente a medio construir, es poco más que un emisor láser de gran "
"tamaño y una cámara, ambos soldados a una plataforma giratoria."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/material_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "slime"
msgid_plural "slimes"
msgstr[0] "légamo"
msgstr[1] "légamos"

#. ~ Description for slime
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living "
"oil."
msgstr ""
"Es un monstruo masa amorfa gelatinosa negro y viscoso, que se desliza por el"
" suelo chorreando como si fuera una gota de aceite viviente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "brain slime"
msgid_plural "brain slimes"
msgstr[0] "légamo cerebral"
msgstr[1] "légamos cerebrales"

#. ~ Description for brain slime
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob "
"of living oil.  Other slimes seem to swarm around it."
msgstr ""
"Un gigantesco glóbulo negro de sustancia viscosa, rezumando a través del "
"suelo como un globo de aceite vivo. Otros légamos parecen pulular a su "
"alrededor."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "big slime"
msgid_plural "big slimes"
msgstr[0] "légamo grande"
msgstr[1] "légamos grandes"

#. ~ Description for big slime
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran monstruo masa amorfa gelatinosa negro y viscoso, que se desliza "
"por el suelo chorreando como si fuera una gota de aceite viviente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "small slime"
msgid_plural "small slimes"
msgstr[0] "légamo pequeño"
msgstr[1] "légamos pequeños"

#. ~ Description for small slime
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño monstruo masa amorfa gelatinosa negro y viscoso, que se "
"desliza por el suelo chorreando como si fuera una gota de aceite viviente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "amoebic mold"
msgid_plural "amoebic molds"
msgstr[0] "moho amebiano"
msgstr[1] "mohos amebianos"

#. ~ Description for amoebic mold
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A formless slime mold the size of a cow.  Crusty bits of cytoplasm fall away"
" as it oozes across the ground."
msgstr ""
"Es un moho mucilaginoso sin forma, del tamaño de una vaca. Le caen pedacitos"
" crujientes de citoplasma mientras va goteando por el suelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "slimespring"
msgid_plural "slimesprings"
msgstr[0] "légamo elástico"
msgstr[1] "légamos elásticos"

#. ~ Description for slimespring
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A familiar-looking blob of goo.  It sprouts the occasional eyestalk."
msgstr ""
"Es un monstruo masa amorfa gelatinosa viscoso que te resulta familiar. "
"Ocasionalmente, le brota un ojo peduncular."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sludge crawler"
msgid_plural "sludge crawlers"
msgstr[0] "reptador de cieno"
msgstr[1] "reptadores de cieno"

#. ~ Description for sludge crawler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sluglike creature, eight feet long and the width of a refrigerator.  Its "
"black body glistens as it oozes its way along the ground.  Eye stalks "
"occasionally push their way out of the oily mass and look around."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura similar a una babosa, de dos metros y medio de largo y ancha "
"como una heladera. Su cuerpo negro brilla mientras va rezumando por el "
"suelo. Sus ojos pedunculados salen ocasionalmente de la masa aceitosa y "
"miran a su alrededor."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "large slug"
msgid_plural "large slugs"
msgstr[0] "babosa grande"
msgstr[1] "babosas grandes"

#. ~ Description for large slug
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large mutated slug as large as a human.  Venom drips from "
"something like a mouth and it is covered with sticky mucus."
msgstr ""
"Una perturbadora babosa mutada tan grande como un humano. El veneno gotea de"
" algo como una boca y está cubierto de moco pegajoso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant slug"
msgid_plural "giant slugs"
msgstr[0] "babosa gigante"
msgstr[1] "babosas gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant slug
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mutated leopard slug, as wide as a golf cart.  Venom dripping from its "
"fanged maw, it slithers ahead slowly, leaving a trail of glistening slime."
msgstr ""
"Una babosa leopardo mutada, tan ancha como un carrito de golf. Le gotea "
"veneno de sus fauces con colmillos, repta lentamente hacia adelante, dejando"
" un rastro de baba brillante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "biollante sprig"
msgid_plural "biollante sprigs"
msgstr[0] "ramita biollante"
msgstr[1] "ramitas biollante"

#. ~ Description for biollante sprig
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A short fat stalk with broad leaves and tiny flower buds."
msgstr ""
"Un tallo corto y gordo con hojas anchas y pequeños capullos de flores."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "biollante sprout"
msgid_plural "biollante sprouts"
msgstr[0] "brote biollante"
msgstr[1] "brotes biollante"

#. ~ Description for biollante sprout
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick stalk that rises five feet from the ground and has heavy broad "
"leaves at its base.  Purple flower buds adorn the top."
msgstr ""
"Un grueso tallo que se eleva a un metro y medio del suelo y tiene hojas "
"anchas y pesadas en su base. Los capullos de flores púrpuras adornan la "
"parte superior."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "biollante"
msgid_plural "biollantes"
msgstr[0] "biollante"
msgstr[1] "biollantes"

#. ~ Description for biollante
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A drooped, quivering plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  "
"Its petals are closed, and pulsate ominously."
msgstr ""
"Una planta de ramas colgantes con un tallo grueso adornado con una flor "
"púrpura. Sus pétalos están cerrados, y palpitan ominosamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "creeper hub"
msgid_plural "creeper hubs"
msgstr[0] "enredadera central"
msgstr[1] "enredaderas centrales"

#. ~ Description for creeper hub
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thick stalk, rooted to the ground.  It rapidly sprouts thorny vines in all"
" directions."
msgstr ""
"Un tallo grueso enraizado al suelo. Rápidamente, puede hacer brotar "
"enredaderas espinosas en todas las direcciones."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "creeper vine"
msgid_plural "creeper vines"
msgstr[0] "enredadera brotada"
msgstr[1] "enredaderas brotadas"

#. ~ Description for creeper vine
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A thorny vine, twisting wildly as it grows with incredible speed."
msgstr ""
"Una enredadera espinosa, que se retuerce salvajemente mientras crece a una "
"velocidad increíble."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "triffid sprig"
msgid_plural "triffid sprigs"
msgstr[0] "ramita de trífido"
msgstr[1] "ramitas de trífido"

#. ~ Description for triffid sprig
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A teeny-tiny triffid that has recently germinated.  Like a house cat, you "
"know it wants to eat you but it just can't figure out how."
msgstr ""
"Un trífido diminuto que ha germinado recientemente. Como un gato doméstico, "
"sabes que quiere comerte, pero no sabe cómo hacerlo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "triffid sprout"
msgid_plural "triffid sprouts"
msgstr[0] "brote de trífido"
msgstr[1] "brotes de trífido"

#. ~ Description for triffid sprout
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small triffid, only a few feet tall.  It has not yet developed bark, but "
"its sting is still sharp and deadly."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño trífido de menos de un metro de alto. Todavía no ha desarrollado "
"una corteza, pero su aguijón es afilado y mortal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "triffid"
msgid_plural "triffids"
msgstr[0] "trífido"
msgstr[1] "trífidos"

#. ~ Description for triffid
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A creeping animate plant, growing as tall as a moose.  It has a single bark-"
"covered stalk supporting a flowery head with a paralyzing sting concealed "
"within."
msgstr ""
"Una planta animada que se arrastra, alta como un alce. Tiene un tallo "
"cubierto con corteza, que sostiene una cabeza tipo flor y un aguijón "
"paralizante oculto adentro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "triffid queen"
msgid_plural "triffid queens"
msgstr[0] "trífido reina"
msgstr[1] "trífidos reina"

#. ~ Description for triffid queen
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A ponderous and particularly arborescent triffid.  It has enormous red "
"petals surrounded by a haze of spores, and two thick barbed vines stick out "
"from the stems like wary harpoons."
msgstr ""
"Un trífido muy pesado y particularmente arborescente. Tiene unos enormes "
"pétalos rojos y una nube de esporas lo rodea. Dos ramas enredaderas con púas"
" le salen del tallo como si fueran arpones."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "vine beast"
msgid_plural "vine beasts"
msgstr[0] "bestia enredadera"
msgstr[1] "bestias enredaderas"

#. ~ Description for vine beast
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An animated mass of roots and vines, creeping along the ground with alarming"
" speed.  The tangle is thick enough that the center from which they grow is "
"concealed."
msgstr ""
"Una masa animada de enredaderas y raíces, que se arrastra por el suelo con "
"una velocidad alarmante. La maraña es tan gruesa que el centro del cual está"
" creciendo, queda oculto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal fighter"
msgid_plural "fungal fighters"
msgstr[0] "guerrero fúngico"
msgstr[1] "guerreros fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal fighter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stout woody plant that can dig through the ground and flick spines from "
"its branches.  The thorns carry a fungicidal compound with paralytic "
"effects."
msgstr ""
"Una corpulenta planta leñosa que puede cavar en el suelo y usar las púas de "
"sus ramas. Esas espinas tiene un compuesto fungicida que puede causar "
"parálisis."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "triffid flower"
msgid_plural "triffid flowers"
msgstr[0] "trífido flor"
msgstr[1] "trífidos flor"

#. ~ Description for triffid flower
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant plant with a thick stalk adorned by a purple flower.  Its petals are"
" open with ominous shine in center."
msgstr ""
"Una planta gigante con un grueso tallo adornado por una flor púrpura. Sus "
"pétalos están abiertos con un brillo ominoso en el centro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/overmap_terrain_from_json.py
msgid "triffid heart"
msgid_plural "triffid hearts"
msgstr[0] "trífido corazón"
msgstr[1] "trífidos corazón"

#. ~ Description for triffid heart
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A knot of tubular roots, flowing with sap and beating like a heart.  Strands"
" of vascular tissue reach out to the surrounding root walls."
msgstr ""
"Un nudo de raíces tubulares, con savia fluyendo y latiendo como un corazón. "
"Las hebras de tejido vascular se estiran hacia las raíces de alrededor."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "improvised MP5 turret"
msgid_plural "improvised MP5 turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta MP5 improvisada"
msgstr[1] "torretas MP5 improvisadas"

#. ~ Description for improvised MP5 turret
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An MP5 attached to a motorized chassis with basic autonomous software "
"control.  There is no mechanism to reload the weapon when its magazine is "
"empty and the fire control system is only designed for semi automatic fire."
msgstr ""
"Un MP5 acoplado a un chasis motorizado con un control de software autónomo "
"básico. No hay ningún mecanismo para recargar el arma cuando su cargador "
"está vacío y el sistema de control de fuego sólo está diseñado para el fuego"
" semiautomático."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "milspec searchlight"
msgid_plural "milspec searchlights"
msgstr[0] "foco reflector milspec"
msgstr[1] "focos reflectores milspec"

#. ~ Description for milspec searchlight
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Three high-powered searchlights with automated search AI and mounting, "
"continually seeking targets."
msgstr ""
"Son tres focos reflectores de gran potencia con inteligencia artificial para"
" búsqueda y montaje automatizados, lo que lo hace estar constantemente "
"buscando objetivos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "M2HB autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M2HB autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "CROWS II autónoma M2HB"
msgstr[1] "CROWS II autónomas M2HB"

#. ~ Description for M2HB autonomous CROWS II
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" anything up to light vehicles at long range without exposing the operator."
"  This one is fitted with a M2HB."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de armas a distancia derivado del CROWS M153 II y mejorado con un"
" software de funcionamiento autónomo. Miles de ellas fueron desplegadas por "
"el ejército de EE.UU. antes del Cataclismo y fueron valoradas por su uso "
"para atacar cualquier cosa hasta vehículos ligeros a larga distancia sin "
"exponer al operador. Este está equipado con un M2HB"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "M249 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M249 autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] " CROWS II autónoma M249"
msgstr[1] " CROWS II autónomas M249 "

#. ~ Description for M249 autonomous CROWS II
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M249."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de armas a distancia derivado del M153 CROWS II y mejorado con un"
" software de funcionamiento autónomo. Miles de ellas fueron desplegadas por "
"el ejército de EE.UU. antes del Cataclismo y fueron valoradas por su uso en "
"la participación de la infantería sin exponer al operador. Este está "
"equipado con un M249."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "M240 autonomous CROWS II"
msgid_plural "M240 autonomous CROWS IIs"
msgstr[0] "CROWS II autónoma M240"
msgstr[1] "CROWS II autónomas M240"

#. ~ Description for M240 autonomous CROWS II
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A remote weapon system derived from the M153 CROWS II and enhanced with "
"autonomous operation software.  Thousands of these were deployed by the US "
"military before the Cataclysm and they were valued for their use in engaging"
" infantry without exposing the operator.  This one is fitted with a M240."
msgstr ""
"Un sistema de armas a distancia derivado del M153 CROWS II y mejorado con un"
" software de funcionamiento autónomo. Miles de ellas fueron desplegadas por "
"el ejército de EE.UU. antes del Cataclismo y fueron valoradas por su uso en "
"la participación de la infantería sin exponer al operador. Este está "
"equipado con un M240."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "riot control platform"
msgid_plural "riot control platforms"
msgstr[0] "plataforma antidisturbios"
msgstr[1] "plataformas antidisturbios"

#. ~ Description for riot control platform
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These TALON-derived riot control platforms were widely publicized a few "
"years before the cataclysm as a new semi-autonomous device that could fire "
"less-lethal rounds with far more accuracy than a human, ensuring safer hits "
"against a target's limbs.  They were quickly adopted by prisons and inner "
"city police forces, where they demonstrated that 'less lethal' is not the "
"same as 'non-lethal'.  In the days before the cataclysm, massive stockrooms "
"of the things were put into circulation.  On the bright side, although it "
"shoots autonomously, it requires a human operator to relocate, so it's not "
"so mobile anymore."
msgstr ""
"Estas plataformas de control de disturbios derivadas del TALÓN fueron "
"ampliamente publicitadas unos años antes del cataclismo como un nuevo "
"dispositivo semiautónomo que podía disparar balas menos letales con mucha "
"más precisión que un humano, asegurando impactos más seguros contra las "
"extremidades de un objetivo. Fueron rápidamente adoptados por las prisiones "
"y las fuerzas policiales del centro de la ciudad, donde demostraron que "
"\"menos letal\" no es lo mismo que \"no letal\". En los días anteriores al "
"cataclismo, se pusieron en circulación enormes reservas de estas cosas. Por "
"el lado positivo, aunque dispara de forma autónoma, requiere de un operador "
"humano para reubicarse, por lo que ya no es tan móvil."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Universal curfew is in effect.  Please return to your home.  This unit is "
"authorized to open fire.\""
msgstr ""
"\"El toque de queda universal está en vigor. Por favor, vuelvan a sus casas."
" Esta unidad está autorizada a abrir fuego\"."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "loudspeaker"
msgid_plural "loudspeakers"
msgstr[0] "altavoz"
msgstr[1] "altavoces"

#. ~ Description for loudspeaker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "High-powered loudspeaker, repeating loud messages over and over again."
msgstr ""
"Es un altavoz de gran potencia, que repite mensajes fuertes una y otra vez."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "upcycled turret"
msgid_plural "upcycled turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta sobreciclada"
msgstr[1] "torretas sobrecicladas"

#. ~ Description for upcycled turret
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This hefty turret appears to be bolted together out of various scraps of "
"technology, many of them extremely foreign looking.  It is equipped with a "
"hefty looking machine gun."
msgstr ""
"Esta pesada torreta parece estar atornillada con varios retazos de "
"tecnología, muchos de ellos de aspecto extremadamente extraño. Está equipada"
" con una ametralladora de aspecto robusto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "\"Beep.\""
msgstr "\"Bip.\""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "eyebot"
msgid_plural "eyebots"
msgstr[0] "ojobot"
msgstr[1] "ojobots"

#. ~ Description for eyebot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A quadcopter drone largely comprised of a high-resolution camera lens and a "
"speaker, this robot hovers above the ground, documenting the carnage and "
"mayhem around it.  While it is no longer able to report to a central "
"authority, it's likely that some of its automated alert systems are still "
"functional, given that the thing seems to have an operational charging "
"station somewhere."
msgstr ""
"Un dron cuatricóptero compuesto en gran parte por una lente de cámara de "
"alta resolución y un altavoz, este robot se eleva sobre el suelo, "
"documentando la carnicería y el caos a su alrededor. Aunque ya no puede "
"informar a una autoridad central, es probable que algunos de sus sistemas de"
" alerta automatizados sigan funcionando, dado que la cosa parece tener una "
"estación de carga operativa en algún lugar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grocery bot"
msgid_plural "grocery bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de compras"
msgstr[1] "robots de compras"

#. ~ Description for grocery bot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A popular product from Uncanny, this friendly android can carry your bag or "
"push your Grocery Cart for you.  You know it's friendly because its human "
"face is constantly smiling at you.  According to the ads it uses a state-"
"machine of a complexity never seen before, Uncanny even hired professional "
"actors to record its lines.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr ""
"Un producto popular de Uncanny, este simpático androide puede llevar tu "
"bolsa o empujar tu carrito de la compra por ti. Sabes que es amigable porque"
" su cara humana te sonríe constantemente. Según los anuncios, utiliza una "
"máquina de estado de una complejidad nunca antes vista, Uncanny incluso "
"contrató a actores profesionales para grabar sus líneas. Examina para "
"hacerte su amigo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "busted grocery bot"
msgid_plural "busted grocery bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de compras averiado"
msgstr[1] "robots de compras averiados"

#. ~ Description for busted grocery bot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A busted grocery bot, it can still carry your bag but its arms are too "
"damaged to push a Grocery Cart.  Despite its current state it's still "
"smiling at you.  Examine to befriend."
msgstr ""
"Un robot de supermercado roto, todavía puede llevar tu bolsa pero sus brazos"
" están demasiado dañados para empujar un carrito de supermercado. A pesar de"
" su estado actual, todavía te sonríe. Examina para ser su amigo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cleaner bot"
msgid_plural "cleaner bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de limpieza"
msgstr[1] "robots de limpieza"

#. ~ Description for cleaner bot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Ford Sanitron, a utility robot designed for cleaning up waste material "
"in hazardous conditions."
msgstr ""
"El Ford Sanitron, un robot utilitario diseñado para limpiar el material de "
"desperdicio en condiciones peligrosas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "miner bot"
msgid_plural "miner bots"
msgstr[0] "robot anti-minas"
msgstr[1] "robots anti-minas"

#. ~ Description for miner bot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A snake-like, segmented robot built to tunnel into the ground and detonate "
"landmines."
msgstr ""
"Similar a una serpiente, este robot segmentado fue construido para cavar "
"túneles en el suelo y detonar las minas terrestres."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "nurse bot"
msgid_plural "nurse bots"
msgstr[0] "robot de enfermería"
msgstr[1] "robots de enfermería"

#. ~ Description for nurse bot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The first product from Uncanny, a towering four-armed humanoid with a gentle"
" face.  The details of its visage are striking, but the stiffness of it "
"makes you really uncomfortable.  The end of the world did not stop it from "
"looking for patient to assist."
msgstr ""
"El primer producto de Uncanny, un humanoide de cuatro brazos con una cara "
"amable. Los detalles de su rostro son sorprendentes, pero la rigidez del "
"mismo lo hace realmente incómodo. El fin del mundo no impidió que buscara un"
" paciente para que lo asistiera."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skeletal dog"
msgid_plural "skeletal dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro esquelético"
msgstr[1] "perros esqueléticos"

#. ~ Description for skeletal dog
#. ~ Description for skeletal wolf
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This once-canine has shed all of its skin, revealing a carapace of fused "
"bones and ribs.  Devoid entirely of flesh, this walking suit of bone seems "
"to be controlled by a net of veins and sinews which pulse with glistening "
"black goo."
msgstr ""
"Este antiguo canino se ha despojado de toda su piel, revelando un caparazón "
"de huesos y costillas fusionados. Desprovisto por completo de carne, este "
"traje de huesos parece estar controlado por una red de venas y tendones que "
"laten con una brillante sustancia viscosa negra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "barghest"
msgid_plural "barghests"
msgstr[0] "barghest"
msgstr[1] "barghests"

#. ~ Description for barghest
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge swollen zombie dog, smeared black with slime.  Its teeth are longer and"
" its broad back is rippling with muscles and oozing wounds."
msgstr ""
"Enorme perro zombi hinchado, cubierto de baba negra. Sus dientes son más "
"largos y su amplio lomo está ondulado con músculos y heridas supurantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hulking horror"
msgid_plural "hulking horrors"
msgstr[0] "horror enorme"
msgstr[1] "horrores enormes"

#. ~ Description for hulking horror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A four-legged canine body now grotesquely swollen, with arms as wide as a "
"trash can and massive exposed teeth."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo canino de cuatro patas ahora grotescamente hinchado, con brazos "
"tan anchos como un cubo de basura y enormes dientes expuestos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "boneplate wolf"
msgid_plural "boneplate wolves"
msgstr[0] "lobo de placas de hueso"
msgstr[1] "lobos de placas de hueso"

#. ~ Description for boneplate wolf
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a four legged creature covered in fused bony plates, shaped somewhat"
" like a dog or wolf.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una criatura de cuatro patas cubierta de placas óseas fusionadas, "
"con forma de perro o lobo. Las articulaciones y grietas alrededor de su "
"cuerpo rezuman una sustancia viscosa negra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skull pig"
msgid_plural "skull pigs"
msgstr[0] "cerdo calavera"
msgstr[1] "cerdos calavera"

#. ~ Description for skull pig
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This former wild boar appears to have been a truly massive specimen in life."
"  Stretching eight to nine feet in length, the most arresting feature of "
"this animal is that the enamel of its tusks has spread across its face "
"leaving a skull-like appearance with deep-set eyeholes."
msgstr ""
"Este antiguo jabalí parece haber sido un espécimen realmente enorme en vida."
" Con una longitud de entre dos y tres metros, la característica más "
"llamativa de este animal es que el esmalte de sus colmillos se ha extendido "
"por la cara, dejando un aspecto de cráneo con profundos orificios oculares."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "trench pig"
msgid_plural "trench pigs"
msgstr[0] "cerdo de trinchera"
msgstr[1] "cerdos de trinchera"

#. ~ Description for trench pig
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Billowing clouds of yellow-streaked gas precede boar-shaped shadows.  "
"Glimpses of a zombie boar are quickly obscured by the gases leaving its body"
" through open wounds."
msgstr ""
"Las nubes de gas amarillento preceden a las sombras en forma de jabalí. La "
"visión de un jabalí zombi queda rápidamente oscurecida por los gases que "
"salen de su cuerpo a través de sus heridas abiertas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skeletal wolf"
msgid_plural "skeletal wolves"
msgstr[0] "lobo esqueleto"
msgstr[1] "lobos esqueletos"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "spearcat hunter"
msgid_plural "spearcat hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador de lanzagato"
msgstr[1] "cazadores de lanzagato"

#. ~ Description for spearcat hunter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This cougar's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its fur is torn, "
"revealing deep festering wounds.  Its claws and teeth are unnaturally long "
"and sharpened into dangerous looking spikes"
msgstr ""
"Los ojos de este puma rezuman un líquido oscuro y aceitoso, y su pelaje está"
" desgarrado, revelando profundas heridas purulentas. Sus garras y dientes "
"son anormalmente largos y están afilados en forma de peligrosos pinchos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skeletal zombear"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombears"
msgstr[0] "zomboso esqueletico"
msgstr[1] "zombosos esqueleticos"

#. ~ Description for skeletal zombear
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A monstrous overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this zombear's "
"rotting skin with an organic armor of dense bone.  Large clumps of black goo"
" seep from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with sickening crackling "
"sounds filling the surrounding air."
msgstr ""
"Un monstruoso crecimiento excesivo de tejido osificado ha sustituido la piel"
" podrida de este zomboso por una armadura orgánica de hueso denso. De sus "
"articulaciones se desprenden grandes masas de sustancia viscosa negra "
"mientras se tambalea sin rumbo fijo, con sonidos crepitantes que llenan el "
"aire circundante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shadowcat"
msgid_plural "shadowcats"
msgstr[0] "sombragato"
msgstr[1] "sombragatos"

#. ~ Description for shadowcat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is the outline of a large, "
"shambling cat."
msgstr ""
"Una extraña sombra envuelve a esta criatura, como si la propia luz le "
"repugnara tocarla. Lo único que se puede distinguir es la silueta de un gran"
" gato que se tambalea."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "acidic zombear"
msgid_plural "acidic zombears"
msgstr[0] "zomboso acido"
msgstr[1] "zombosos acidos"

#. ~ Description for acidic zombear
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking dead dead black bear with patchy fur.  Its skin looks "
"especially thin, with a sticky, yellow fluid flowing through the clearly "
"visible veins."
msgstr ""
"Un oso negro muerto de aspecto enfermizo y con el pelaje parcheado. Su piel "
"parece especialmente fina, con un fluido amarillo y pegajoso que fluye por "
"las venas claramente visibles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "antlered hammer"
msgid_plural "antlered hammers"
msgstr[0] "martillo astado"
msgstr[1] "martillos astados"

#. ~ Description for antlered hammer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This once great moose's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is "
"torn and scarred.  Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and "
"swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Los ojos de este antiguo gran alce rezuman con un líquido oscuro y aceitoso,"
" y su carne está desgarrada y llena de cicatrices. Todo su cuerpo sobresale "
"con músculos distendidos y heridas hinchadas y supurantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "thorny moose shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny moose shamblers"
msgstr[0] "alce desastre espinoso"
msgstr[1] "alces desastre espinosos"

#. ~ Description for thorny moose shambler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What once was a great moose is now covered with long, matted hair twisted "
"with thorny vines that wrap together and then twist back into the body.  "
"Long interlocking thorns wrap the antlers, dripping with a mysterious "
"silvery liquid."
msgstr ""
"Lo que una vez fue un gran alce está ahora cubierto de un pelo largo y "
"enmarañado, retorcido por vides espinosas que se enrollan y luego se "
"retuercen en el cuerpo. Largas espinas entrelazadas envuelven la cornamenta,"
" que gotea un misterioso líquido plateado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "jawed terror"
msgid_plural "jawed terrors"
msgstr[0] "terror dentado"
msgstr[1] "terrores dentados"

#. ~ Description for jawed terror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a normally-aggressive, normally-hungry bull shark, this jawed terror is"
" now even more of the same, possibly thanks to its lack of a functioning "
"brain."
msgstr ""
"Este tiburón con mandíbulas, que antes era un tiburón toro normalmente "
"agresivo y hambriento, es ahora más de lo mismo, posiblemente gracias a su "
"falta de cerebro funcional."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie dog"
msgid_plural "zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro zombi"
msgstr[1] "perros zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombie dog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated corpse of a canine; a sinewy beast which can easily "
"outpace its two-legged friends."
msgstr ""
"El cadáver deformado y animado de un canino; una bestia sinuosa que puede "
"superar fácilmente a sus amigos de dos patas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Z-9"
msgid_plural "Z-9s"
msgstr[0] "Z-9"
msgstr[1] "Z-9s"

#. ~ Description for Z-9
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A zombified version of one of the German Shepherd dogs used in law "
"enforcement.  Its deformed body is encased in a protective Kevlar harness."
msgstr ""
"Una versión zombificada de uno de los perros pastor alemán utilizados por "
"las fuerzas del orden. Su cuerpo deformado está envuelto en un arnés "
"protector de Kevlar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rot-weiler"
msgid_plural "rot-weilers"
msgstr[0] "rot-weiler"
msgstr[1] "rot-weilers"

#. ~ Description for rot-weiler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An acrid smell accompanies this canine corpse.  Its whole body is covered in"
" chains of pulsing cysts and slime-dribbling ulcers."
msgstr ""
"Un olor acre acompaña a este cadáver canino. Todo su cuerpo está cubierto de"
" cadenas de quistes pulsantes y úlceras que gotean limo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grim howler"
msgid_plural "grim howlers"
msgstr[0] "aullador sombrío"
msgstr[1] "aulladores sombríos"

#. ~ Description for grim howler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A zombified wolf.  Its mouth oozes with a black substance, coating its "
"vicious-looking white fangs."
msgstr ""
"Un lobo zombificado. Su boca rezuma una sustancia negra que recubre sus "
"colmillos blancos de aspecto feroz."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombear"
msgid_plural "zombears"
msgstr[0] "oso zombi"
msgstr[1] "osos zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombear
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This black bear's eyes ooze with dark, oily fluid, and its flesh is torn and"
" scarred.  It shuffles as it walks."
msgstr ""
"Los ojos de este oso negro rezuman un líquido oscuro y aceitoso, y su carne "
"está desgarrada y cicatrizada. Se arrastra mientras camina."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "festering boar"
msgid_plural "festering boars"
msgstr[0] "jabalí podrido"
msgstr[1] "jabalís podridos"

#. ~ Description for festering boar
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A zombified omnivore descended from the wild boar.  Now it's got black goo "
"all over it, instead of mud."
msgstr ""
"Un omnívoro zombificado descendiente del jabalí salvaje. Ahora tiene una "
"viscosidad negra que lo cubre completamente, en lugar de barro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombeaver"
msgid_plural "zombeavers"
msgstr[0] "castorombi"
msgstr[1] "castorombis"

#. ~ Description for zombeaver
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This wall-eyed beast has a large wound on its side, and inside, its gore-"
"stained ribs are clearly visible.  Its most prominent features are the "
"fearsome incisors and thick, black goo in its mouth that it seems proud to "
"display.  It doesn't look interested in chewing on trees anymore."
msgstr ""
"Esta bestia con ojos de pared tiene una gran herida en el costado, y en su "
"interior se ven claramente sus costillas manchadas de sangre. Sus rasgos más"
" destacados son los temibles incisivos y la gruesa y negra mucosidad de su "
"boca, que parece mostrar con orgullo. Ya no parece interesado en masticar "
"árboles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "antlered horror"
msgid_plural "antlered horrors"
msgstr[0] "horror con cuernos"
msgstr[1] "horrores con cuernos"

#. ~ Description for antlered horror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic moose has succumbed to the infection which is killing"
" the world.  Shiny green blowflies swarm the vast, suppurated patches of "
"purulent flesh where its skin has sloughed away, and its remaining fur is "
"black and matted with necrotic discharge."
msgstr ""
"Este alce, antes majestuoso, ha sucumbido a la infección que está matando al"
" mundo. Brillantes moscardones verdes pululan por las vastas manchas "
"supurantes de carne purulenta en las que se ha desprendido la piel, y el "
"pelaje que le queda está negro y enmarañado con secreciones necróticas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "decayed pouncer"
msgid_plural "decayed pouncers"
msgstr[0] "saltador putrefacto"
msgstr[1] "saltadores putrefactos"

#. ~ Description for decayed pouncer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An otherwise normal-looking cougar, except that its hind legs are swollen, "
"and its eyes bulge with black goo."
msgstr ""
"Podría parecer un puma normal si no fuera que sus patas traseras están "
"agrandadas, y sus ojos resaltan con una viscosidad negra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie horse"
msgid_plural "zombie horses"
msgstr[0] "caballo zombi"
msgstr[1] "caballos zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie horse
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"From the looks of this zombie horse's ghastly features--its protruding ribs,"
" off-white skull, and decayed, tattered muscles--it doesn't seem like it "
"should put up much of a fight, but its mutant strength gives it power.  "
"Black, reeking ichor drips from its wounds."
msgstr ""
"Por el aspecto de este caballo zombi -sus costillas sobresalientes, su "
"cráneo blanquecino y sus músculos carcomidos y destrozados- no parece que "
"vaya a dar mucha guerra, pero su fuerza mutante le da poder. De sus heridas "
"gotea un icor negro y apestoso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger wight"
msgid_plural "Tiger wights"
msgstr[0] "criatura tigre"
msgstr[1] "criaturas tigre"

#. ~ Description for Tiger wight
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This otherwise normal-looking tiger stumbles and sways, its jaws slack, its "
"eyes wide open and shining black."
msgstr ""
"Este tigre, que por lo demás tiene un aspecto normal, se tambalea y se "
"balancea, con las mandíbulas flojas, los ojos muy abiertos y brillantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie cow"
msgid_plural "zombie cows"
msgstr[0] "vaca zombi"
msgstr[1] "vacas zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie cow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a placid cow, this leathery horror stumbles and shudders, its pulsing "
"black eyes scanning for prey beneath wicked horns.  It is big and heavy and "
"murderous."
msgstr ""
"Este horror correoso, que antes era una plácida vaca, se tambalea y se "
"estremece, con sus ojos negros palpitantes que buscan a la presa bajo unos "
"cuernos malvados. Es grande, pesada y asesina."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombull"
msgid_plural "zombulls"
msgstr[0] "zomtoro"
msgstr[1] "zomtoros"

#. ~ Description for zombull
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This enormous, massive creature with oily black eyes and dread horns was "
"once a domestic bull.  Its nasty character makes it attack everyone it meets"
" with tremendous speed and an unbridled rage."
msgstr ""
"Esta enorme y maciza criatura de ojos negros y aceitosos cuernos fue una vez"
" un toro doméstico. Su carácter repugnante le hace atacar a todos los que "
"encuentra con una velocidad tremenda y una furia desenfrenada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "woodland wight"
msgid_plural "woodland wights"
msgstr[0] "criatura del bosque"
msgstr[1] "criaturas del bosque"

#. ~ Description for woodland wight
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pale, stumbling, white-tailed deer, rivulets of slime running down its "
"neck.  Its limbs twist and bend in unnatural, haphazard directions, and yet "
"it moves with uncanny strength and speed.  Thanks to the Cataclysm, it has "
"now turned the tables; what was once prey, now itself preys on coyotes, "
"wolves, and giant mutated spiders."
msgstr ""
"Un ciervo de cola blanca, pálido y tambaleante, con riachuelos de baba "
"corriendo por su cuello. Sus miembros se retuercen y doblan en direcciones "
"antinaturales y desordenadas, pero se mueve con una fuerza y una velocidad "
"asombrosas. Gracias al Cataclismo, ahora ha cambiado las tornas; lo que "
"antes era una presa, ahora depreda coyotes, lobos y arañas gigantes "
"mutantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mass of zombie spiders"
msgid_plural "masses of zombie spiders"
msgstr[0] "masa de arañas zombi"
msgstr[1] "masas de arañas zombi"

#. ~ Description for mass of zombie spiders
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thousands, maybe millions of spiders piling up high, each slowly oozing "
"sticky green pus, struggling to keep the fetid mass together and moving."
msgstr ""
"Miles, tal vez millones de arañas amontonadas en lo alto, cada una rezumando"
" lentamente pus verde y pegajoso, luchando por mantener la masa fétida unida"
" y en movimiento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Zeindeer"
msgid_plural "Zeindeers"
msgstr[0] "zeno"
msgstr[1] "zenos"

#. ~ Description for Zeindeer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A once-majestic caribou, this undead creature barely resembles the reindeer "
"of tradition and seems to only be interested in human flesh."
msgstr ""
"Esta criatura no muerta, que en su día fue un caribú majestuoso, apenas se "
"parece a los renos de la tradición y parece que sólo le interesa la carne "
"humana."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "scarred zombie"
msgid_plural "scarred zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi cicatrizado"
msgstr[1] "zombis cicatrizados"

#. ~ Description for scarred zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deformed human body, its skin transformed into one thick, calloused "
"envelope of scar tissue."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano deformado, su piel transformada en una gruesa y callosa "
"envoltura de tejido cicatrizante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "zombie"
msgid_plural "zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi"
msgstr[1] "zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human body, swaying as it moves, an unstoppable rage visible in its oily "
"black eyes."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano que se arrastra para moverse, y con una ira incontenible"
" en sus aceitosos ojos negros."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie cop"
msgid_plural "zombie cops"
msgstr[0] "zombi policía"
msgstr[1] "zombis policías"

#. ~ Description for zombie cop
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human body covered by a weather-beaten and badly damaged set of riot gear."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver humano cubierto con un equipo policial anti-disturbios muy dañado"
" y gastado por el clima."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crawling zombie"
msgid_plural "crawling zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi arrastrador"
msgstr[1] "zombis arrastradores"

#. ~ Description for crawling zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This human corpse drags itself along slowly with its arms.  Its legs are "
"damaged beyond repair."
msgstr ""
"Este cadáver humano se va arrastrando lentamente con sus brazos. Sus piernas"
" están demasiado dañadas para caminar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie dancer"
msgid_plural "zombie dancers"
msgstr[0] "zombi bailarín"
msgstr[1] "zombis bailarines"

#. ~ Description for zombie dancer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The foulest stench is in the air,\n"
"The funk of forty thousand years,\n"
"And grisly ghouls from every tomb,\n"
"Are closing in to seal your doom!\n"
"\n"
"The dancer doesn't even notice you, it seems like something nearby is controlling it."
msgstr ""
"The foulest stench is in the air,\n"
"The funk of forty thousand years,\n"
"And grisly ghouls from every tomb,\n"
"Are closing in to seal your doom!\n"
"(Canción \"Thriller\" de Michael Jackson).\n"
"El bailarín ni siquiera se da cuenta de ti, parece que algo cercano lo está controlando."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fat zombie"
msgid_plural "fat zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi gordo"
msgstr[1] "zombis gordos"

#. ~ Description for fat zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stumbling as it moves, this corpse of an overweight human regards its "
"surroundings with an empty black gaze."
msgstr ""
"Va tropezando mientras se mueve, este cadáver de un humano con sobrepeso "
"observa sus alrededores con una mirada negra y vacía."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "firefighter zombie"
msgid_plural "firefighter zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi bombero"
msgstr[1] "zombis bomberos"

#. ~ Description for firefighter zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A decaying human body clad in tattered firefighting gear.  It staggers "
"aimlessly, reeking of smoke and decay."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver humano en descomposición, vestido con ropa harapienta de bombero."
" Se va tambaleando sin dirección alguna, apestando a humo y putrefacción."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hazmat zombie"
msgid_plural "hazmat zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi con materiales peligrosos"
msgstr[1] "zombis con materiales peligrosos"

#. ~ Description for hazmat zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie's face and body is completely covered by a protective suit.  It "
"wanders around, unsteadily."
msgstr ""
"La cara y el cuerpo de este zombi están completamente cubiertos con un traje"
" de protección. Anda deambulando, con paso vacilante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "decayed zombie"
msgid_plural "decayed zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi descompuesto"
msgstr[1] "zombis descompuestos"

#. ~ Description for decayed zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A once-dead human corpse.  Its discolored swollen flesh is riddled with "
"festering wounds and open sores."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver humano que alguna vez estuvo muerto. Su carne hinchada y "
"descolorida está llena de heridas infectadas y llagas abiertas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "SWAT zombie"
msgid_plural "SWAT zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi SWAT"
msgstr[1] "zombis SWAT"

#. ~ Description for SWAT zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie was part of a specialized unit of law enforcement.  It still "
"wears a battered armor with the SWAT logo emblazoned on the front."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi formaba parte de una unidad especializada de las fuerzas del "
"orden. Todavía lleva una armadura maltrecha con el logotipo del SWAT "
"estampado en la parte delantera."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tough zombie"
msgid_plural "tough zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi fuerte"
msgstr[1] "zombis fuertes"

#. ~ Description for tough zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once an athletic human, now a brutal monster.  Its facial features are "
"twisted into an expression of pure rage."
msgstr ""
"Lo que alguna vez fue un humano atlético, ahora es un monstruo brutal. Sus "
"gestos faciales están torcidos en una expresión de pura ira."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sleek zombie"
msgid_plural "sleek zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi elegante"
msgstr[1] "zombis elegantes"

#. ~ Description for sleek zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "This zombie is rather sleek and barely clothed."
msgstr "Este zombi es bastante elegante y apenas está vestido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bouncer zombie"
msgid_plural "bouncer zombies"
msgstr[0] "portero de bar zombi"
msgstr[1] "porteros de bar zombis"

#. ~ Description for bouncer zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie looks beefed and is dressed in the tattered remnants of a "
"security uniform."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi parece musculoso y está vestido con los restos destrozados de un "
"uniforme de seguridad."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie medic"
msgid_plural "zombie medics"
msgstr[0] "medico zombi"
msgstr[1] "medicos zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie medic
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shambling corpse is dressed like a medical professional.  Either it was"
" a doctor or only played one on TV."
msgstr ""
"Este cadáver ambulante está vestido como un profesional de la medicina. O "
"bien era un médico o interpretaba a uno en la televisión."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "medical horror"
msgid_plural "medical horrors"
msgstr[0] "horror médico"
msgstr[1] "horrores médicos"

#. ~ Description for medical horror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bulging corpse is dressed like a medical professional.  Its entire body"
" bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Este abultado cadáver está vestido como un profesional de la medicina. Todo "
"su cuerpo abulta con músculos distendidos y heridas hinchadas y supurantes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sawbones"
msgid_plural "sawbones"
msgstr[0] "serrahueso"
msgstr[1] "serrahuesos"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'sawbones'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this former medical "
"professional's rotting skin with an organic armor of dense bone.  Large "
"clumps of black goo seep from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with "
"sickening crackling sounds filling the surrounding air."
msgstr ""
"Un crecimiento excesivo de tejido osificado ha sustituido la piel podrida de"
" este antiguo profesional de la medicina por una armadura orgánica de hueso "
"denso. De sus articulaciones se desprenden grandes masas de sustancia "
"viscosa negra mientras se tambalea sin rumbo fijo, con sonidos crepitantes "
"que llenan el aire circundante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "doctor burns"
msgid_plural "doctor burns"
msgstr[0] "doctor quemado"
msgstr[1] "doctores quemados"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'doctor burns'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The pale shuffling corpse of a medical professional.  Its skin looks "
"especially thin, with a sticky, yellow fluid flowing through the clearly "
"visible veins."
msgstr ""
"El pálido cadáver arrastrado de un profesional de la medicina. Su piel "
"parece especialmente delgada, con un líquido amarillo y pegajoso que fluye "
"por las venas claramente visibles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pupating zombie crawler"
msgid_plural "pupating zombie crawlers"
msgstr[0] "reptador zombi pupante"
msgstr[1] "reptadores zombi pupante"

#. ~ Description for pupating zombie crawler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This half of a human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover "
"everything neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is strange rhythmic "
"movement grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""
"Esta mitad de un cadáver humano está envuelta en fibras negras pegajosas que"
" cubren todo el cuello hacia abajo. Bajo la envoltura hay un extraño "
"movimiento rítmico que resulta grotesco de contemplar."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "pupating zombie crawler"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The pupating zombie crawler bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out"
" of the corpse!"
msgstr ""
"¡El reptador zombi pupante estalla y del cadáver salen bestias aladas "
"cubiertas de sangre!."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi pupante"
msgstr[1] "zombis pupante"

#. ~ Description for pupating zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover everything "
"neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is strange rhythmic movement "
"grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""
"Este cadáver humano está envuelto en fibras negras pegajosas que lo cubren "
"todo de cuello para abajo. Debajo de la envoltura hay un extraño movimiento "
"rítmico grotesco de contemplar."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "pupating zombie"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The pupating zombie bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out of the "
"corpse!"
msgstr ""
"¡El zombi pupante estalla y del cadáver salen bestias aladas untadas de "
"sangre!."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pupating brute"
msgid_plural "pupating brutes"
msgstr[0] "bestia pupante"
msgstr[1] "bestias pupantes"

#. ~ Description for pupating brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This muscular human corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers that cover "
"everything from the neck down.  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange "
"rhythmic movement, grotesque to behold."
msgstr ""
"Este musculoso cadáver humano está envuelto en pegajosas fibras negras que "
"lo cubren todo desde el cuello hacia abajo. Bajo la envoltura hay un extraño"
" movimiento rítmico, grotesco de contemplar."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "pupating brute"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The pupating brute bursts, and gore-smeared winged beasts climb out of the "
"corpse!"
msgstr ""
"¡El bruto pupante estalla y del cadáver salen bestias aladas untadas de "
"sangre!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hive hulk"
msgid_plural "hive hulks"
msgstr[0] "mole enjambre"
msgstr[1] "moles enjambre"

#. ~ Description for hive hulk
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The bloated torso of this gigantic corpse is wrapped in sticky black fibers."
"  Beneath the wrapping there is a strange rhythmic movement, grotesque to "
"behold."
msgstr ""
"El torso hinchado de este gigantesco cadáver está envuelto en pegajosas "
"fibras negras. Bajo la envoltura hay un extraño movimiento rítmico, grotesco"
" de contemplar."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "hive hulk"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The hive hulk opens its mouth, and a gore-smeared winged beast flies out of "
"it!"
msgstr ""
"La mole colmena abre la boca y de ella sale volando una bestia alada "
"embadurnada de sangre."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shady pupating zombie"
msgid_plural "shady pupating zombies"
msgstr[0] "crisálida zombi sombría"
msgstr[1] "crisálidas zombis sombrías"

#. ~ Description for shady pupating zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"what once may have been a human being, but its edges bulge rhythmically in "
"places that are not anatomically possible for humans."
msgstr ""
"Una extraña sombra envuelve a esta criatura. Se puede distinguir el contorno"
" de lo que alguna vez pudo ser un ser humano, pero sus bordes se abultan "
"rítmicamente en lugares que no son anatómicamente posibles para los humanos"

#. ~ Attack message of monster "shady pupating zombie"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The pupating zombie bursts, and shadowy winged beasts climb out of the "
"corpse!"
msgstr ""
"¡El zombi pupante estalla y del cadáver salen bestias aladas sombrias!."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "batwing zombie"
msgid_plural "batwing zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi alas de murciélago"
msgstr[1] "zombis alas de murciélago"

#. ~ Description for batwing zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome fleshy membrane.  The mutation does not suit it "
"well: it moves clumsily, even compared to other zombies."
msgstr ""
"Los brazos de este zombi se han estirado mucho más allá de los límites "
"humanos, la piel se ha alargado hasta convertirse en una espantosa membrana "
"carnosa. La mutación no le sienta bien: se mueve con torpeza, incluso en "
"comparación con otros zombis."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "garghoul"
msgid_plural "garghouls"
msgstr[0] "garghoul"
msgstr[1] "garghouls"

#. ~ Description for garghoul
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie's arms have stretched far beyond human limits, the skin "
"lengthened into a gruesome fleshy membrane.  The rest has become emaciated, "
"thin rope-like muscles ripping through taut flesh.  While it doesn't appear "
"to be able to truly fly, it uses its mutated arms to make shockingly fast "
"leaps through the air."
msgstr ""
"Los brazos de este zombi se han estirado mucho más allá de los límites "
"humanos, la piel se ha alargado hasta convertirse en una espantosa membrana "
"carnosa. El resto se ha vuelto escuálido, con finos músculos en forma de "
"sogas que atraviesan la carne tensa. Aunque no parece ser capaz de volar de "
"verdad, utiliza sus brazos mutados para dar saltos sorprendentemente rápidos"
" por el aire."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "flesh-raptors"
msgstr[0] "carneraptor"
msgstr[1] "carneraptores"

#. ~ Description for flesh-raptor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This small winged predator darts through the air on three thinly haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  Where the wings meet juts a "
"sheer jagged spike.  It looks like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet "
"strangely like it was made of human parts."
msgstr ""
"Este pequeño depredador alado se lanza por el aire con tres alas de pelo "
"fino que parecen manos humanas estiradas. En el punto de unión de las alas "
"sobresale un enorme pico dentado. No se parece a nada que se haya visto en "
"la Tierra y, sin embargo, parece extrañamente hecho con partes humanas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shadow raptor"
msgid_plural "shadow raptors"
msgstr[0] "sombraraptor"
msgstr[1] "sombraraptores"

#. ~ Description for shadow raptor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature.  You can make out the outline of "
"three flapping wings connected to a jagged pointed object."
msgstr ""
"Una extraña sombra envuelve a esta criatura. Se puede distinguir el contorno"
" de tres alas que baten conectadas a un objeto puntiagudo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgid_plural "unstable flesh-raptor"
msgstr[0] "carneraptor inestable"
msgstr[1] "carneraptores inestables"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'unstable flesh-raptor'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This small winged predator darts through the air on three thinly haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  Where the wings meet juts a "
"jagged spike and a bloated fleshy belly."
msgstr ""
"Este pequeño depredador alado se lanza por el aire con tres alas de pelo "
"fino que parecen manos humanas estiradas. En el punto de unión de las alas "
"sobresale una espiga dentada y un vientre carnoso e hinchado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zaptor"
msgid_plural "zaptors"
msgstr[0] "electroraptor"
msgstr[1] "electroraptores"

#. ~ Description for zaptor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This small winged predator darts through the air on three thinly haired "
"wings that look like stretched human hands.  Where the wings meet juts a "
"jagged spike with a pulsing electrical glow."
msgstr ""
"Este pequeño depredador alado se lanza por el aire con tres alas de pelo "
"fino que parecen manos humanas estiradas. En el punto de unión de las alas "
"sobresale una espiga dentada con un brillo eléctrico pulsante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "acidic zombie"
msgid_plural "acidic zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi ácido"
msgstr[1] "zombis ácidos"

#. ~ Description for acidic zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sickly-looking dead one.  Its skin looks especially thin, with a sticky, "
"yellow fluid flowing through the clearly visible veins."
msgstr ""
"Es un muerto de apariencia enfermiza. Su piel parece especialmente delgada, "
"con un fluido pegajoso y amarillo corriéndole por sus venas claramente "
"visibles."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "corrosive zombie"
msgid_plural "corrosive zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi corrosivo"
msgstr[1] "zombis corrosivos"

#. ~ Description for corrosive zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This body has swollen to immense proportions, but still manages to hold "
"itself together with semi-congealed acid all over its bloated body.  It "
"clumsily moves around, but attacks with a large reserve of acid."
msgstr ""
"Este cadáver está hinchado a proporciones inmensas, pero todavía se mantiene"
" en pie con un ácido semi-coagulado que le corre por todo su cuerpo "
"hinchado. Se mueve de manera torpe, pero ataque con grandes reservas de "
"ácido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The corrosive zombie spits a glob of acid!"
msgstr "¡El zombi corrosivo escupe un pegote de ácido!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "spitter zombie"
msgid_plural "spitter zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi escupidor"
msgstr[1] "zombis escupidores"

#. ~ Description for spitter zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hunched human body with its eyes pushed up into its forehead and drooping "
"cheeks, most of its face is occupied by a puckered mouth.  Its stomach is "
"swollen and nearly translucent, with a sickly yellow tint."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano encorvado con los ojos apretados contra la frente y las "
"mejillas colgando, la mayor parte de su cara está ocupada por una boca "
"fruncida. Su estómago está hinchado y es casi transparente, de un tinte "
"amarillo enfermizo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wretched puker"
msgid_plural "wretched pukers"
msgstr[0] "vomitador desgraciado"
msgstr[1] "vomitadores desgraciados"

#. ~ Description for wretched puker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A degenerate corpse, shambling as it walks.  Several junks and waste "
"materials have unified into its skin and wounds around it reeks in black "
"goo."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver degenerado, que se tambalea al caminar. Varios desechos y "
"materiales de desecho se han unido a su piel y las heridas a su alrededor "
"apestan a sustancia negra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "acidic zombie dog"
msgid_plural "acidic zombie dogs"
msgstr[0] "perro zombi acido"
msgstr[1] "perros zombi acidos"

#. ~ Description for acidic zombie dog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deformed, sickly-looking animated corpse of a canine.  A dangerous-looking"
" yellow saliva drips from its mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver animado, deforme y de aspecto enfermizo, de un canino. De su boca"
" gotea una saliva amarilla de aspecto peligroso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "blistered horror"
msgid_plural "blistered horrors"
msgstr[0] "horror con quistes"
msgstr[1] "horrores con quistes"

#. ~ Description for blistered horror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge canine with multiple large, foul-looking blisters covering its body."
"  A corrosive liquid spills from its menacing-looking mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme perro con múltiples y grandes ampollas de aspecto asqueroso que "
"cubren su cuerpo. Un líquido corrosivo brota de su boca de aspecto "
"amenazante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie kinderling"
msgid_plural "zombie kinderlings"
msgstr[0] "zombi infantil"
msgstr[1] "zombis infantiles"

#. ~ Description for zombie kinderling
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tiny charred body, jumping and kicked and flailing around in a mockery of "
"playground exercise.  It does not need a face for you to feel bad about "
"killing it."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño cuerpo chamuscado, saltando y revolcándose en lo que parece "
"una burla al ejercicio. No necesita tener una cara para que te haga sentir "
"mal por matarlo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fiend"
msgid_plural "fiends"
msgstr[0] "diablillo"
msgstr[1] "diablillos"

#. ~ Description for fiend
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Charred zombie with bony plates, spikes and protrusions.  Moves stiffly, but"
" swiftly."
msgstr ""
"Es un zombi chamuscado con placas, púas y protuberancias óseas. Se mueve "
"rígidamente, pero rápidamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "scorched zombie"
msgid_plural "scorched zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi chamuscado"
msgstr[1] "zombis chamuscados"

#. ~ Description for scorched zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Heavily burned zombie that still reeks of charred flesh.  Its flesh has "
"mended into a leathery shell."
msgstr ""
"Es un zombi quemado severamente que todavía tiene el olor de la carne "
"chamuscada. Su carne se ha convertido en una coraza de cuero."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "anklebiter"
msgid_plural "anklebiters"
msgstr[0] "mordedor de tobillo"
msgstr[1] "mordedores de tobillos"

#. ~ Description for anklebiter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This horrifying little mutated wretch looks to have once been a child, but "
"its massive gaping jaws are now far more suggestive of a predatory beast."
msgstr ""
"Este horroroso y despreciable pequeño mutado parece haber sido un niño "
"alguna vez, pero sus inmensas mandíbulas ahora son más propias de una bestia"
" depredadora."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie child"
msgid_plural "zombie children"
msgstr[0] "niño zombi"
msgstr[1] "niños zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombie child
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It was only a child, and little is different about it now aside from the "
"hungry look in its eyes.  You'd be hard pressed to not feel like you were "
"killing an actual child by putting it down."
msgstr ""
"Era solo un niño, y no ha cambiado mucho ahora excepto por su mirada "
"hambrienta. Si lo matas, te va a resultar muy difícil no sentir que estás "
"matando a un niño normal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "creepy crawler"
msgid_plural "creepy crawlers"
msgstr[0] "reptante espeluznante"
msgstr[1] "reptantes espeluznantes"

#. ~ Description for creepy crawler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What was once a child is now a mutant beast with blackened skin and massive "
"eyes.  This abomination's vile form makes mockery of its human origin."
msgstr ""
"Lo que alguna vez fue un niño, ahora es una bestia mutada con la piel "
"ennegrecida y ojos enormes. La vil forma de esta abominación se burla de sus"
" orígenes humanos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shriekling"
msgid_plural "shrieklings"
msgstr[0] "chillido"
msgstr[1] "chillidos"

#. ~ Description for shriekling
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This heavily mutated child zombie twitches and flails its limbs in painful "
"looking spasms as it runs about."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi niño ha sufrido varias mutaciones, retuerce y sacude sus miembros"
" con espasmos dolorosos mientras va corriendo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "snotgobbler"
msgid_plural "snotgobblers"
msgstr[0] "mocoso"
msgstr[1] "mocosos"

#. ~ Description for snotgobbler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This swollen, gooey looking mutant child looks bad, even for a zombie.  "
"Maybe that's why it seems to want a hug so badly."
msgstr ""
"Este niño mutante, hinchado y viscoso parece estar en mal estado... incluso "
"para un zombi. Quizás sea por eso que parece necesitar tanto un abrazo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sproglodyte"
msgid_plural "sproglodytes"
msgstr[0] "proleglodita"
msgstr[1] "prolegloditas"

#. ~ Description for sproglodyte
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This crouching child-mutant's face is dominated by a pair of huge black eyes"
" and its fingertips end in sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"La cara de este niño mutante encorvado está dominada por un par de ojos "
"negros enormes, y sus dedos terminan en unas garras afiladas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "howling waif"
msgid_plural "howling waifs"
msgstr[0] "niño aullador"
msgstr[1] "niños aulladores"

#. ~ Description for howling waif
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Undeath has not been kind to the children of the apocalypse.  This one is "
"little more than a reanimated membrane of skin stretched across tiny brittle"
" bones."
msgstr ""
"Esta muerte viviente no ha sido nada generosa con los niños del apocalipsis."
" Este es poco más que una membrana de piel reanimada estirada por los "
"pequeños y frágiles huesos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shocker brute"
msgid_plural "shocker brutes"
msgstr[0] "bestia eléctrica"
msgstr[1] "bestias eléctricas"

#. ~ Description for shocker brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge beast covered in visible scarring from what you can only guess was "
"'research'.  Being near it, you can hear a slight humming, like that of an "
"electrical transformer."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme bestia cubierto de cicatrices de lo que puedes imaginar como "
"resultado de 'investigaciones'. Al estar cerca de él, puedes sentir un suave"
" zumbido, como el que hace un transformador eléctrico."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shocker zombie"
msgid_plural "shocker zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi eléctrico"
msgstr[1] "zombis eléctricos"

#. ~ Description for shocker zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano con la piel de color azul pálido, y chisporroteando de "
"energía eléctrica."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "incandescent husk"
msgid_plural "incandescent husks"
msgstr[0] "cáscara incandescente"
msgstr[1] "cáscaras incandescentes"

#. ~ Description for incandescent husk
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This once-human is visible only as a glowing white silhouette that you have "
"to squint to see, cloaked in a crackling field of lightning that pulses like"
" a beating heart.  It walks slowly and deliberately, the thunderstorm "
"surrounding it eagerly jumping to anything conductive within its grasp."
msgstr ""
"Este antiguo humano es visible sólo como una silueta blanca y brillante que "
"hay que entrecerrar los ojos para ver, cubierta por un campo de rayos que "
"late como un corazón que late. Camina lenta y deliberadamente, la tormenta "
"eléctrica que lo rodea salta ansiosamente a cualquier cosa conductora a su "
"alcance."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zapper zombie"
msgid_plural "zapper zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi descarga"
msgstr[1] "zombis descarga"

#. ~ Description for zapper zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A very pale dead body with the worst case of static hair you have ever seen."
"  Sometimes, you can see sparks of electricity around it."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver muy pálido con el peor caso de pelo estático que hayas visto. A "
"veces, puedes ver chispas de electricidad a su alrededor."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "boomer"
msgid_plural "boomers"
msgstr[0] "boomer"
msgstr[1] "boomers"

#. ~ Description for boomer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rotund human body, bloated beyond belief and layered in rolls of fat.  It "
"emits a horrible odor, and a putrid pink sludge dribbles from its mouth."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano gordo, hinchado más allá de lo posible y cubierto con "
"rollos de grasa. Emite un olor horrible y de su boca gotea un pútrido cieno "
"rosa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "huge boomer"
msgid_plural "huge boomers"
msgstr[0] "boomer enorme"
msgstr[1] "boomers enormes"

#. ~ Description for huge boomer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This boomer, normally swollen and ready to burst, has strengthened and "
"solidified.  The bile dribbling from its mouth also appears to have changed…"
msgstr ""
"Este boomer, normalmente hinchado y listo para explotar, se ha fortalecido y"
" solidificado. La bilis que gotea de su boca también parece haber "
"cambiado..."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gasoline zombie"
msgid_plural "gasoline zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi de gasolina"
msgstr[1] "zombis de gasolina"

#. ~ Description for gasoline zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge bloated zombie that appears to have fed upon gasoline; fumes and "
"flames escape from its mouth and fuel leaks from its waddling form."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme zombi hinchado que parece haberse alimentado de gasolina; los "
"vapores y las llamas escapan de su boca y el combustible se escapa de su "
"forma de andar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bloated zombie"
msgid_plural "bloated zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi hinchado"
msgstr[1] "zombis hinchados"

#. ~ Description for bloated zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With its gray skin swollen to near rupture with putrid gas, this cyst "
"covered zombie looks like it could violently burst under the slightest of "
"disturbances."
msgstr ""
"Con su piel gris hinchada con gas putrefacto hasta casi romperse, este zombi"
" cubierto de quistes parece como si pudiera explotar violentamente ante la "
"menor perturbación."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "boomer glutton"
msgid_plural "boomer gluttons"
msgstr[0] "glotón boomer"
msgstr[1] "glotones boomer"

#. ~ Description for boomer glutton
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, grotesque ball of flesh and fat.  Seemingly vestigial limbs flop "
"around haphazardly as it rolls across the ground.  You occasionally catch a "
"glimpse of bulging eyes and a distended gaping maw oozing some sort of black"
" sludge."
msgstr ""
"Una gran y grotesca bola de carne y grasa. Sus miembros, aparentemente "
"vestigiales, se mueven al azar mientras rueda por el suelo. De vez en cuando"
" ves unos ojos saltones y unas fauces distendidas que rezuman una especie de"
" cieno negro."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "boomer glutton"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The glutton vomits sludge!"
msgstr "¡El glotón vomita cieno!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rust zombie"
msgid_plural "rust zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi oxidado"
msgstr[1] "zombis oxidados"

#. ~ Description for rust zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A zombie impaled with a multitude of metal fragments that are covered with a"
" thick layer of rust that seems to propagate to other parts of the body."
msgstr ""
"Un zombi empalado con multitud de fragmentos de metal que se cubren con una "
"gruesa capa de óxido que parece propagarse a otras partes del cuerpo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rust shell zombie"
msgid_plural "rust shell zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi cascara oxidado"
msgstr[1] "zombis cascara oxidado"

#. ~ Description for rust shell zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Jagged fragments of rust-bitten metal have fused into this zombie's flesh "
"and displaced parts of its spine."
msgstr ""
"Fragmentos irregulares de metal oxidado se han fundido en la carne de este "
"zombi y han desplazado partes de su columna vertebral."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rust plated zombie"
msgid_plural "rust plated zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi de placas oxidada"
msgstr[1] "zombis de placas oxidada"

#. ~ Description for rust plated zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ruptures in this zombie's skin expose fragments of metal arranged like armor"
" underneath.  Black sludge can be seen in places where the rust has receded."
msgstr ""
"Las roturas en la piel de este zombi dejan al descubierto fragmentos de "
"metal dispuestos como una armadura por debajo. Se puede ver cieno negro en "
"los lugares donde el óxido ha retrocedido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rust urchin"
msgid_plural "rust urchins"
msgstr[0] "erizo oxidado"
msgstr[1] "erizos oxidados"

#. ~ Description for rust urchin
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A spiked horror of a zombie covered in long rusty spikes."
msgstr "Un horror de zombi cubierto de largas púas oxidadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rust fist brute"
msgid_plural "rust fist brutes"
msgstr[0] "bestia de puño oxidado"
msgstr[1] "bestias de puño oxidado"

#. ~ Description for rust fist brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This brute of a zombie is covered in rusted metal detritus.  Chunks of metal"
" smashed through its arms have deformed them into hammers."
msgstr ""
"Esta bestia de zombi está cubierta de restos de metal oxidado. Los trozos de"
" metal que han atravesado sus brazos los han deformado hasta convertirlos en"
" martillos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crawler"
msgid_plural "crawlers"
msgstr[0] "reptante"
msgstr[1] "reptantes"

#. ~ Description for crawler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A conglomeration of human parts fused together in a horrible mishmash of "
"function, slowly dragging its eldritch body across the ground."
msgstr ""
"Es una conglomeración de partes de cuerpos humanos, fusionadas juntas en un "
"horrible revoltijo de funciones. Va arrastrando lentamente su espeluznante "
"cuerpo por el suelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "dissoluted devourer"
msgid_plural "dissoluted devourers"
msgstr[0] "devorador disoluto"
msgstr[1] "devoradores disolutos"

#. ~ Description for dissoluted devourer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Human bodies fused together into a colossus with heads and limbs sticking "
"out of its bloated body.  You may have trouble estimating its healthiness "
"and its capabilities might change."
msgstr ""
"Los cuerpos humanos se fusionaron en un coloso con cabezas y miembros que "
"sobresalen de su cuerpo hinchado. Puede ser difícil estimar su salud y sus "
"capacidades pueden cambiar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "trapped tendril"
msgid_plural "trapped tendrils"
msgstr[0] "zarcillo atrapado"
msgstr[1] "zarcillos atrapados"

#. ~ Description for trapped tendril
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A great tendril of mutated flesh and sharpened bone.  Emergent from a "
"crevice in the ruined floor, hundreds of human limbs seek freedom and writhe"
" incessantly from underneath its grotesque carapace.  As enormous as it may "
"already be, you feel certain that this is just part of a creature much "
"bigger, for when it moves, you can feel this whole ruin tremble, as if an "
"unseen giant struggled against the weight of its concrete tomb."
msgstr ""
"Un gran zarcillo de carne mutada y hueso afilado. Emergiendo de una grieta "
"en el suelo en ruinas, cientos de miembros humanos buscan la libertad y se "
"retuercen incesantemente debajo de su grotesco caparazón. Por muy enorme que"
" ya sea, se siente seguro de que esto es sólo parte de una criatura mucho "
"más grande, ya que cuando se mueve, se puede sentir toda esta ruina temblar,"
" como si un gigante invisible luchara contra el peso de su tumba de "
"hormigón."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gangrenous flesh"
msgid_plural "gangrenous flesh"
msgstr[0] "carne gangrenosa"
msgstr[1] "carne gangrenosa"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'gangrenous flesh'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Immobile from grievous wounds, its gray skin has bloated to near rupture "
"with putrid gas.  Between lumps of unrecognizable gore, a human head lamely "
"follows your walking with empty, black eyes."
msgstr ""
"Inmóvil por las graves heridas, su piel gris se ha hinchado hasta casi "
"romperse con el gas pútrido. Entre bultos de sangre irreconocible, una "
"cabeza humana sigue su camino con ojos vacíos y negros."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gangrenous crawler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous crawlers"
msgstr[0] "reptante gangrenado"
msgstr[1] "reptantes gangrenados"

#. ~ Description for gangrenous crawler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A nightmarish spidery abomination, born from human gore.  It deftly crawls "
"between walls and ceiling with limbs grown from its own disjointed ribs."
msgstr ""
"Una abominación arácnida de pesadilla, nacida de la sangre humana. Se "
"arrastra hábilmente entre las paredes y el techo con extremidades crecidas "
"de sus propias costillas desunidas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gangrenous impaler"
msgid_plural "gangrenous impalers"
msgstr[0] "empalador gangrenoso"
msgstr[1] "empaladores gangrenosos"

#. ~ Description for gangrenous impaler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A corpse hideously twisted into an insect-like form.  A hollow tendril "
"reaches out from its open thorax."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver horriblemente retorcido en una forma de insecto. Un zarcillo "
"hueco se extiende desde su tórax abierto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The impaler launches a barb!"
msgstr "¡El empalador lanza una púa!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "scissorlimbs"
msgid_plural "scissorlimbs"
msgstr[0] "cortador de extremidades"
msgstr[1] "cortadores de extremidades"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'scissorlimbs'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
" A nightmarish spider of gore stands tall among the ruins, and keeps silent "
"watch of the blighted landscape.  Its spindly limbs of bone slip between the"
" rubble with otherworldly speed."
msgstr ""
" Una araña de pesadilla se alza entre las ruinas y vigila en silencio el "
"paisaje asolado. Sus enjutas extremidades de hueso se deslizan entre los "
"escombros con una velocidad de otro mundo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hanging innards"
msgid_plural "hanging innards"
msgstr[0] "entraña colgante"
msgstr[1] "entrañas colgantes"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'hanging innards'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Great snakes of flesh hang from the ceiling above, madly thrashing and "
"reaching about."
msgstr ""
"Grandes serpientes de carne cuelgan del techo, se agitan y se extienden "
"locamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "spasming lump"
msgid_plural "spasming lumps"
msgstr[0] "bulto espasmódico"
msgstr[1] "bultos espasmódicos"

#. ~ Description for spasming lump
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A great pile of merged bodies and mutated flesh.  It spasms in an arrhythmic"
" and desperate manner."
msgstr ""
"Un gran montón de cuerpos fusionados y carne mutada. Tiene espasmos "
"arrítmicos y desesperados."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "flesh wall"
msgid_plural "flesh walls"
msgstr[0] "muro de carne"
msgstr[1] "muros de carne"

#. ~ Description for flesh wall
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A great lump of mutated flesh.  It resembles the innards of some gigantic "
"creature and is covered in a grid of diminutive veins."
msgstr ""
"Un gran bulto de carne mutada. Se asemeja a las entrañas de una criatura "
"gigante y está cubierto por una red de venas diminutas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie scientist"
msgid_plural "zombie scientists"
msgstr[0] "científico zombi"
msgstr[1] "científicos zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombie scientist
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Apart from the jet-black eyes, this zombie looks less decomposed and inhuman"
" than most.  Clad in a tattered lab coat, it seems to have a glimmer of "
"awareness - not a human awareness, but something more sinister.  As you "
"watch it, its movements look almost marionette-like."
msgstr ""
"Aparte de los ojos negros, este zombi parece menos descompuesto e inhumano "
"que la mayoría. Vestido con una bata de laboratorio andrajosa, parece tener "
"un destello de conciencia, no de conciencia humana, sino de algo más "
"siniestro. Al verlo, sus movimientos parecen casi como de marioneta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie security guard"
msgid_plural "zombie security guards"
msgstr[0] "guardia de seguridad zombi"
msgstr[1] "guardias de seguridad zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie security guard
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shambling human corpse wearing a gray uniform and bulletproof vest with "
"\"SECURITY\" emblazoned across the front.  It looks like the guard was quite"
" physically fit before its death; it moves quickly and powerfully, albeit "
"clumsily."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver humano destartalado con un uniforme gris y un chaleco antibalas "
"con \"SEGURIDAD\" blasonado en la parte delantera. Parece que el guardia "
"estaba en buena forma física antes de su muerte; se mueve rápida y "
"poderosamente, aunque con torpeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "phase skulker"
msgid_plural "phase skulkers"
msgstr[0] "acechador fase"
msgstr[1] "acechadores fase"

#. ~ Description for phase skulker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and "
"enervated by the presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It walks "
"and stumbles in stuttered way, and is granted tenuous corporality only by "
"grace of the experimental gear inherited from its past life."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda de un investigador perdido en las tormentas del portal, "
"retorcido y enervado por las presencias que acechan bajo la percepción "
"natural. Camina y tropieza de forma tartamuda, y sólo se le concede una "
"tenue corporalidad por gracia del equipo experimental heredado de su vida "
"pasada."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "phase skulker"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The skulker shifts and melts inwards before disappearing!"
msgstr ""
"¡El oculto se desplaza y se derrite hacia dentro antes de desaparecer!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "phase shrike"
msgid_plural "phase shrikes"
msgstr[0] "alcaudón de fase"
msgstr[1] "alcaudones de fase"

#. ~ Description for phase shrike
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What remains of a researcher lost to the portal storms, twisted and "
"enervated by the presences that lurk beneath natural perception.  It "
"unnaturally skitters on four bone-plated spikes, its every motion trailing "
"an aura of energetic distortion."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda de un investigador perdido en las tormentas del portal, "
"retorcido y enervado por las presencias que acechan bajo la percepción "
"natural. Se desliza de forma antinatural sobre cuatro púas recubiertas de "
"hueso, y cada uno de sus movimientos arrastra un aura de distorsión "
"energética."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "phase shrike"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The shrike shifts and disappears amidst an electric surge!"
msgstr ""
"¡El alcaudón se desplaza y desaparece en medio de una oleada eléctrica!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "frog mother"
msgid_plural "frog mothers"
msgstr[0] "madre rana"
msgstr[1] "madres ranas"

#. ~ Description for frog mother
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, bulbous creature with an extremely large mouth and small, stubby "
"legs with no feet.  It is covered in an oily greenish-black residue and "
"large, white pustules that seem ready to pop."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura grande y bulbosa con una boca extremadamente grande y patas "
"pequeñas y rechonchas sin pies. Está cubierto de un residuo aceitoso de "
"color negro verdoso y de grandes pústulas blancas que parecen estar a punto "
"de estallar."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "frog mother"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some of the pustules pop, and the frog mother opens her mouth and vomits "
"tadpoles!"
msgstr ""
"Algunas pústulas estallan y la madre rana abre la boca y vomita renacuajos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tadpole constrictor"
msgid_plural "tadpole constrictors"
msgstr[0] "renacuajo constrictor"
msgstr[1] "renacuajos constrictores"

#. ~ Description for tadpole constrictor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The only resemblance this creature bears to a tadpole is its slick black-"
"green skin and its slender body.  Its three appendages, resembling long "
"tentacles or pseudopods, propel it across the ground at a maddening speed.  "
"It has no outward sensory organs or a mouth, and steam rises from its skin "
"as if it is burning away its own lifeforce to catch you."
msgstr ""
"El único parecido de esta criatura con un renacuajo es su resbaladiza piel "
"negro-verdosa y su esbelto cuerpo. Sus tres apéndices, que parecen largos "
"tentáculos o seudópodos, lo impulsan por el suelo a una velocidad "
"enloquecedora. No tiene órganos sensoriales externos ni boca, y de su piel "
"sale vapor como si quemara su propia fuerza vital para atraparte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "slavering biter"
msgid_plural "slavering biters"
msgstr[0] "mordedor esclavizante"
msgstr[1] "mordedores esclavizantes"

#. ~ Description for slavering biter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A distorted and swollen human body.  Its jaws have elongated into a "
"crocodile-like snout, dripping with foul-smelling saliva."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano distorsionado e hinchado. Sus mandíbulas se han alargado "
"hasta convertirse en un hocico de cocodrilo que gotea una saliva maloliente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "brainless zombie"
msgid_plural "brainless zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi descerebrado"
msgstr[1] "zombis descerebrados"

#. ~ Description for brainless zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A zombie like any other, except that its facial features and skull have been"
" devastated.  It's unclear what caused the damage, but between the scraps of"
" flesh you can see that its face and brain are gone, though its ears remain "
"intact."
msgstr ""
"Un zombi como cualquier otro, salvo que sus rasgos faciales y su cráneo han "
"sido devastados. No está claro qué ha causado el daño, pero entre los restos"
" de carne se puede ver que su cara y su cerebro han desaparecido, aunque sus"
" orejas permanecen intactas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "headless horror"
msgid_plural "headless horrors"
msgstr[0] "horror decapitado"
msgstr[1] "horrores decapitados"

#. ~ Description for headless horror
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This headless zombie has swollen to frightening proportions, towering almost"
" nine feet tall.  Six-foot-long feelers of black ooze blindly wave from its "
"neck, violently twitching at nearby sounds, and it moves at terrifying speed"
" with its grotesquely-swollen hands."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi sin cabeza se ha hinchado hasta alcanzar proporciones "
"aterradoras, llegando a medir casi nueve pies de altura. Sensores de seis "
"pies de largo de rezumado negro ondean ciegamente de su cuello, se sacude "
"violentamente ante los sonidos cercanos, y se mueve a una velocidad "
"aterradora con sus manos grotescamente hinchadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie brute"
msgid_plural "zombie brutes"
msgstr[0] "bestias zombi"
msgstr[1] "bestias zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its entire body bulges with distended muscles and swollen, festering wounds."
msgstr ""
"Su cuerpo entero está abultado con músculos dilatados y heridas infectadas e"
" hinchadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie wrestler"
msgid_plural "zombie wrestlers"
msgstr[0] "zombi luchador"
msgstr[1] "zombis luchadores"

#. ~ Description for zombie wrestler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A slab of festering muscle the size of a well-toned bodybuilder.  Seems "
"eager to strangle the life from you."
msgstr ""
"Es como un bloque de músculo infectado, del tamaño de un fisiculturista en "
"buena forma. Parece tener ganas de estrangularte la vida."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie nightstalker"
msgid_plural "zombie nightstalkers"
msgstr[0] "zombi acosador nocturno"
msgstr[1] "zombis acosadores nocturnos"

#. ~ Description for zombie nightstalker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Somehow this brute hides in the dark like some kind of boogeyman.  Very "
"agile for such a large zombie."
msgstr ""
"De alguna manera, esta bestia se esconde en la oscuridad como si fuera el "
"coco. Es muy ágil para ser un zombi tan grande."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "listener zombie"
msgid_plural "listener zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi oyente"
msgstr[1] "zombis oyentes"

#. ~ Description for listener zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The head of this zombie was once obviously destroyed, the gaps in its scraps"
" of face now filling with a peculiar gray goo.  Human ears hang from the "
"sides, enormous and unsettling.  Thin slits at the front suggest it may be "
"able to see."
msgstr ""
"La cabeza de este zombi fue una vez obviamente destruida, los huecos en los "
"restos de su cara ahora se llenan con una peculiar sustancia viscosa gris. "
"Las orejas humanas cuelgan de los lados, enormes e inquietantes. Las finas "
"hendiduras en la parte delantera sugieren que puede ser capaz de ver."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grabber zombie"
msgid_plural "grabber zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi agarrador"
msgstr[1] "zombis agarradores"

#. ~ Description for grabber zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deformed human body, once living.  Its arms dangle from its sides like the"
" limbs of some skinless ape, mindlessly groping at their surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano deformado, que alguna vez estuvo vivo. Sus brazos "
"cuelgan a los costados como miembros de algún simio sin piel, y va "
"toqueteando sus alrededores catatónicamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grappler zombie"
msgid_plural "grappler zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi aferrador"
msgstr[1] "zombis aferradores"

#. ~ Description for grappler zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An undead humanoid, its elongated arms drag along the ground as it moves.  "
"It looks to almost have a hunch from the swollen back and shoulder muscles "
"tearing though its skin."
msgstr ""
"Un muerto viviente humanoide, cuyos brazos estirados se arrastran por el "
"suelo mientras se va moviendo. Parece como si tuviera una joroba en su "
"espalda hinchada, y los músculos de sus hombros sobresalen como si "
"estuvieran rompiéndole la piel."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie hollow"
msgid_plural "zombie hollows"
msgstr[0] "zombi hueco"
msgstr[1] "zombis huecos"

#. ~ Description for zombie hollow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Black hollow eyes survey the surroundings as the zombie stretches and bends "
"in ways that whoever the original body belonged to never could.  The only "
"thing that seems solid on this flexible, black-veined body is the rows of "
"sharp, black teeth.  You get the feeling that the only human thing remaining"
" is the skin, worn as one might wear clothes."
msgstr ""
"Unos ojos negros y huecos observan el entorno mientras el zombi se estira y "
"se dobla de una forma que nunca podría hacer quien fuera el cuerpo original."
" Lo único que parece sólido en este cuerpo flexible y de venas negras son "
"las hileras de dientes negros y afilados. Se tiene la sensación de que lo "
"único humano que queda es la piel, que se lleva como la ropa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie hulk"
msgid_plural "zombie hulks"
msgstr[0] "zombi mole"
msgstr[1] "zombis mole"

#. ~ Description for zombie hulk
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human body now swollen to the size of six men, with arms as wide as a "
"trash can."
msgstr ""
"Es un cuerpo humano que ahora está agrandado y tiene el tamaño de seis "
"hombres, con brazos tan anchos como cubos de basura."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie hunter"
msgid_plural "zombie hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador zombi"
msgstr[1] "cazadores zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie hunter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This once-human body is barely recognizable; it scrambles about on all "
"fours, its nails and teeth both sharpened into dangerous-looking spikes."
msgstr ""
"Este cuerpo, antes humano, es apenas reconocible; se desplaza a cuatro "
"patas, con las uñas y los dientes afilados en forma de peligrosos pinchos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Thriller"
msgid_plural "Thrillers"
msgstr[0] "Thriller"
msgstr[1] "Thrillers"

#. ~ Description for Thriller
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"And though you fight to stay alive,\n"
"Your body starts to shiver.\n"
"For no mere mortal can resist,\n"
"The evil of the thriller."
msgstr ""
"And though you fight to stay alive,\n"
"Your body starts to shiver.\n"
"For no mere mortal can resist,\n"
"The evil of the thriller.\n"
"(Canción \"Thriller\" de Michael Jackson)."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie snapper"
msgid_plural "zombie snappers"
msgstr[0] "chasqueador zombi"
msgstr[1] "chasqueadores zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombie snapper
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With a crocodile-like snout and rows of protruding teeth, this swimwear-clad"
" zombie lurks in the water."
msgstr ""
"Con una trompa similar a la de un cocodrilo y varias filas de dientes "
"saltones, este zombi vestido con malla merodea por el agua."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie master"
msgid_plural "zombie masters"
msgstr[0] "maestro zombi"
msgstr[1] "maestros zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombie master
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once human, its features have tightened, its lips pulled back into an "
"unnatural grin, revealing rows of blackened teeth beneath its large, "
"piercing eyes.  It stands tall and its movements are fluid and tightly "
"controlled.  A feeling of danger permeates the surrounding air, and the "
"light that falls on it seems somehow harsher and more glaring."
msgstr ""
"Sus rasgos, antaño humanos, se han endurecido, sus labios se han retraído en"
" una sonrisa antinatural, revelando hileras de dientes ennegrecidos bajo sus"
" grandes y penetrantes ojos. Es alto y sus movimientos son fluidos y muy "
"controlados. Una sensación de peligro impregna el aire que lo rodea, y la "
"luz que incide sobre él parece más dura y deslumbrante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie necromancer"
msgid_plural "zombie necromancers"
msgstr[0] "zombi nigromante"
msgstr[1] "zombis nigromantes"

#. ~ Description for zombie necromancer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A twisted mockery of the human form, emaciated, with jet-black skin and "
"glowing red eyes.  It is somehow painful to look at, awakening fears deep "
"within your psyche, and even the surrounding air seems more sinister, "
"somehow darker and more dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Una burla retorcida de la forma humana, demacrada, con piel negra como el "
"azabache y ojos rojos brillantes. Resulta doloroso mirarlo, despertando "
"miedos en lo más profundo de tu psique, e incluso el aire que lo rodea "
"parece más siniestro, más oscuro y peligroso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie necro-boomer"
msgid_plural "zombie necro-boomers"
msgstr[0] "necroboomer zombi"
msgstr[1] "necroboomers zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie necro-boomer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"At first this creature looks like nothing more than a grotesque and "
"oleaginous husk, bloated and punctured by jet-black pustules.  When "
"approached, its glowing red eyes and an aching grin take form; its skin "
"tears and its guts teem with unmatched fecundity, as its gaze inspires fear "
"of nothing less than cosmic, inhuman ecstasy."
msgstr ""
"Al principio, esta criatura no parece más que una cáscara grotesca y "
"oleaginosa, hinchada y perforada por pústulas negras como el azabache. Al "
"acercarse, sus ojos rojos y brillantes y una sonrisa dolorosa toman forma; "
"su piel se desgarra y sus tripas rebosan de una fecundidad inigualable, "
"mientras su mirada inspira miedo nada menos que al éxtasis cósmico e "
"inhumano."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie runner"
msgid_plural "zombie runners"
msgstr[0] "corredor zombi"
msgstr[1] "corredores zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie runner
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This recently-risen body moves quickly, darting its head back and forth and "
"gnawing at its hands."
msgstr ""
"Este cuerpo reanimado recientemente se mueve rápido, corriendo a toda "
"velocidad moviendo su cabeza hacia adelante y atrás y mordisqueando sus "
"manos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie predator"
msgid_plural "zombie predators"
msgstr[0] "depredador zombi"
msgstr[1] "depredadores zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie predator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With its joints in odd places and angles, this humanoid creature prowls "
"across the landscape with surprising speed.  Its teeth and arms are "
"sharpened into fine points, and black ooze seeps out from cuts between its "
"muscles."
msgstr ""
"Con sus articulaciones en lugares y ángulos extraños, esta criatura "
"humanoide merodea por el paisaje a una velocidad sorprendente. Sus dientes y"
" brazos son muy afilados, y un fluido negro se filtro por los cortes entre "
"sus músculos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "screecher zombie"
msgid_plural "screecher zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi gritón"
msgstr[1] "zombis gritones"

#. ~ Description for screecher zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin corpse, its chest swollen in what appears to be preparation.  A thick"
" black ooze drips from its open mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver delgado, con el pecho hinchado en lo que parece ser una "
"preparación. Un espeso líquido negro gotea de su boca abierta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shady zombie"
msgid_plural "shady zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi sombrio"
msgstr[1] "zombis sombrios"

#. ~ Description for shady zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An uncanny shadow envelops this creature, as if light itself were too "
"repulsed to touch it.  All you can make out is its shambling, human-shaped "
"outline."
msgstr ""
"Una extraña sombra envuelve a esta criatura, como si la propia luz le "
"repugnara tocarla. Lo único que se puede distinguir es su contorno "
"vacilante, con forma humana."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py lang/json/map_extra_from_json.py
msgid "Shia LaBeouf"
msgid_plural "Shia LaBeouf"
msgstr[0] "Shia LaBeouf"
msgstr[1] "Shia LaBeouf"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Shia LaBeouf'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Living in the woods,\n"
"killing for sport,\n"
"eating all the bodies--\n"
"actual cannibal Shia LaBeouf."
msgstr ""
"Living in the woods,\n"
"killing for sport,\n"
"eating all the bodies,\n"
"actual cannibal Shia LaBeouf."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shrieker zombie"
msgid_plural "shrieker zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi aullador"
msgstr[1] "zombis aulladores"

#. ~ Description for shrieker zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An elongated human body with a swollen chest and a gaping hole where its jaw"
" used to be."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver humano estirado con el pecho hinchado y un agujero grande en "
"donde antes estaba la mandíbula."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skull zombie"
msgid_plural "skull zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi calavera"
msgstr[1] "zombis calavera"

#. ~ Description for skull zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This creature's head is a hideous gray skull, formed of human bone fragments"
" and some sort of goo.  Jagged teeth are visible as the thing works its jaw "
"and disturbingly human, lidless eyes stare at you from their sockets.  The "
"thing's fleshy ears are four sizes too large and droop under their own "
"weight."
msgstr ""
"La cabeza de esta criatura es un horrible cráneo gris, formado por "
"fragmentos de hueso humano y algún tipo de sustancia viscosa. Los dientes "
"dentados son visibles cuando la cosa trabaja su mandíbula y los inquietantes"
" ojos humanos sin párpados te miran desde sus órbitas. Las orejas carnosas "
"de la cosa son cuatro tamaños demasiado grandes y se caen por su propio "
"peso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "smoker zombie"
msgid_plural "smoker zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi humeante"
msgstr[1] "zombis humeantes"

#. ~ Description for smoker zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A blackened and twisted naked human body.  Strips of flesh hang from its "
"frame, and it emits a constant haze of thick black smoke."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano desnudo, ennegrecido y retorcido. De su armazón cuelgan "
"tiras de carne y emite una neblina constante de humo negro y espeso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "ashen brawler"
msgid_plural "ashen brawlers"
msgstr[0] "matón ceniciento"
msgstr[1] "matones cenicientos"

#. ~ Description for ashen brawler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic, twisted human frame with a menacing stance and rapid movements."
"  Thick clouds of smoke pour from violent-looking eviscerations spread "
"across its muscular-looking body, and its arms appear to have elongated "
"massively."
msgstr ""
"Una estructura humana gigantesca y retorcida, con una postura amenazante y "
"movimientos rápidos. Densas nubes de humo brotan de violentas vísceras que "
"se extienden por su cuerpo de aspecto musculoso, y sus brazos parecen "
"haberse alargado enormemente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "swimmer zombie"
msgid_plural "swimmer zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi nadador"
msgstr[1] "zombis nadadores"

#. ~ Description for swimmer zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human body, clad in swimwear.  Probably not a very graceful swimmer now, "
"owing to its zombified state."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano, vestido con traje de baño. Probablemente no sea un nadador"
" muy agraciado ahora, debido a su estado zombificado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "webbed zombie"
msgid_plural "webbed zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi aleta"
msgstr[1] "zombis aletas"

#. ~ Description for webbed zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A slick and glistening human body.  Its hands and feet are heavily webbed, "
"and it is clad in swimwear."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano resbaladizo y brillante. Tiene las manos y los pies "
"fuertemente palmeados y va vestido con traje de baño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie technician"
msgid_plural "zombie technicians"
msgstr[0] "zombi técnico"
msgstr[1] "zombis técnicos"

#. ~ Description for zombie technician
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Still wearing its work clothes and hardhat, this zombie likely used to work "
"on power lines or other electrical equipment."
msgstr ""
"Todavía tiene puesta su ropa de trabajo y su casco de seguridad. "
"Seguramente, este zombi antes trabajaba con líneas de tendido eléctrico o "
"con otros equipamientos eléctricos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie miner"
msgid_plural "zombie miners"
msgstr[0] "minero zombi"
msgstr[1] "mineros zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie miner
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie's face, hands, work clothes, and miner's helmet are fully "
"covered with stains of coal dust."
msgstr ""
"La cara, las manos, la ropa de trabajo y el casco de minero de este zombi "
"están totalmente cubiertos de manchas de polvo de carbón."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "thorny shambler"
msgid_plural "thorny shamblers"
msgstr[0] "desastre espinoso"
msgstr[1] "desastres espinosos"

#. ~ Description for thorny shambler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shambling undead humanoid, its body overgrown with a tangled mass of "
"otherworldly vegetation.  Hunched over and dragging its feet as it moves, "
"the bramble utterly enveloping its upper half twitches and moves with a life"
" of its own, tendrils tipped with a paralytic sting."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide no muerto que se tambalea, con el cuerpo cubierto por una masa "
"enmarañada de vegetación de otro mundo. Encorvado y arrastrando los pies "
"mientras se mueve, la zarza que envuelve su mitad superior se retuerce y se "
"mueve con vida propia, con zarcillos que tienen un aguijón paralizante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "ravenous reenactor"
msgid_plural "ravenous reenactors"
msgstr[0] "recreador voraz"
msgstr[1] "recreadores voraces"

#. ~ Description for ravenous reenactor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shambling corpse is dressed in the tatters of an antiquated soldier's "
"uniform.  Either it was a historical reenactor, or zombies have also started"
" to time travel."
msgstr ""
"Este cadáver tambaleante está vestido con los jirones de un anticuado "
"uniforme de soldado. O era un recreador histórico, o los zombis también han "
"empezado a viajar en el tiempo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "prisoner zombie"
msgid_plural "prisoner zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi prisionero"
msgstr[1] "zombis prisioneros"

#. ~ Description for prisoner zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Apparently this zombie was doing time when the Cataclysm struck.  It wears "
"black and white striped prisoner clothes, and tattoos can be seen on his "
"decaying skin."
msgstr ""
"Aparentemente este zombi estaba cumpliendo condena cuando el Cataclismo "
"golpeó. Lleva ropa de prisionero a rayas blancas y negras, y se pueden ver "
"tatuajes en su piel en descomposición."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "prisoner brute"
msgid_plural "prisoner brutes"
msgstr[0] "bestia prisionero"
msgstr[1] "bestias prisioneros"

#. ~ Description for prisoner brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "This muscular zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr ""
"Este musculoso zombi lleva ropa de prisionero a rayas blancas y negras."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fat prisoner"
msgid_plural "fat prisoners"
msgstr[0] "prisionero gordo"
msgstr[1] "prisioneros gordos"

#. ~ Description for fat prisoner
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "This fat zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr "Este zombi gordo lleva ropa de prisionero a rayas blancas y negras."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tough prisoner"
msgid_plural "tough prisoners"
msgstr[0] "prisionero duro"
msgstr[1] "prisioneros duros"

#. ~ Description for tough prisoner
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This tough-looking zombie wears black and white striped prisoner clothes."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi de aspecto duro lleva ropa de prisionero a rayas blancas y "
"negras."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "charred nightmare"
msgid_plural "charred nightmares"
msgstr[0] "pesadilla chamuscada"
msgstr[1] "pesadillas chamuscadas"

#. ~ Description for charred nightmare
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Intense radiation has spurred a unique form of necrosis and regeneration, it"
" is impossible to tell if this creature was ever human."
msgstr ""
"Algún tipo de radiación intensa ha generado una forma única de necrosis y "
"regeneración. Es imposible darse cuenta si esta criatura fue antes un "
"humano."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "irradiated wanderer"
msgid_plural "irradiated wanderers"
msgstr[0] "errante irradiado"
msgstr[1] "errantes irradiados"

#. ~ Description for irradiated wanderer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This rotting corpse seeps a glowing ooze from its lesions.  A strange "
"tattered jumpsuit marks it as an oddity across the wasteland."
msgstr ""
"Este cadáver en descomposición tiene un líquido brillante escurriéndole de "
"sus lesiones. Un extraño mono deshilachado lo marca como una rareza en este "
"páramo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skeletal zombie"
msgid_plural "skeletal zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi esquelético"
msgstr[1] "zombis esqueléticos"

#. ~ Description for skeletal zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A monstrous overgrowth of ossified tissue has replaced this zombie's rotting"
" skin with an organic armor of dense bone.  Large clumps of black goo seep "
"from its joints as it shambles aimlessly, with sickening crackling sounds "
"filling the surrounding air."
msgstr ""
"Un monstruoso crecimiento de tejido osificado ha sustituido la piel "
"putrefacta de este zombi por una armadura orgánica de hueso denso. De sus "
"articulaciones se desprenden grandes masas de sustancia viscosa negra "
"mientras se tambalea sin rumbo fijo, con sonidos crepitantes que llenan el "
"aire circundante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skeletal brute"
msgid_plural "skeletal brutes"
msgstr[0] "bestia esquelética"
msgstr[1] "bestias esqueléticas"

#. ~ Description for skeletal brute
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Distorted outgrowths of calcified bone plates cover this zombie's rotten "
"skin.  Joints and cracks around its body ooze with black goo."
msgstr ""
"Los brotes distorsionados de las placas de hueso calcificadas cubren la piel"
" podrida de este zombi. Las articulaciones y grietas alrededor de su cuerpo "
"rezuman una sustancia viscosa negra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skeletal shocker"
msgid_plural "skeletal shockers"
msgstr[0] "eléctrico esquelético"
msgstr[1] "eléctricos esqueléticos"

#. ~ Description for skeletal shocker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Heavy, jagged bone plates have grown out of the surface of this zombie.  "
"Underneath, its flesh glows and crackles with the occasional jolt of "
"electricity."
msgstr ""
"Pesadas y dentadas placas óseas han crecido en la superficie de este zombi. "
"Debajo, su carne brilla y cruje con la ocasional sacudida de electricidad."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "skeletal juggernaut"
msgid_plural "skeletal juggernauts"
msgstr[0] "gigante esquelético"
msgstr[1] "gigantes esqueléticos"

#. ~ Description for skeletal juggernaut
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This hideous golem of plated bones and misshapen flesh drags its heavy, "
"pointed limbs behind it like an unwanted burden.  Formerly soft and "
"vulnerable, bones grew around its form to protect it - only, they kept "
"growing.  And growing.  And growing."
msgstr ""
"Este espantoso golem de placas óseas y carnes malformadas, se arrastra "
"pesadamente, con sus brazos hacia atrás como si fueran una carga indeseada. "
"Los huesos han crecido para proteger lo que antes era suave y vulnerable, "
"pero siguieron creciendo. Y creciendo. Y creciendo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie soldier"
msgid_plural "zombie soldiers"
msgstr[0] "soldado zombi"
msgstr[1] "soldados zombis"

#. ~ Description for zombie soldier
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a soldier, it is dressed head to toe in combat gear and carries itself "
"rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr ""
"Alguna vez fue un soldado, está vestido de los pies a la cabeza con equipo "
"de combate y se mueve de una manera bastante firme para ser un zombi."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black-ops zombie"
msgid_plural "black-ops zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi  operaciones encubiertas"
msgstr[1] "zombis operaciones encubiertas"

#. ~ Description for black-ops zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This soldier zombie's skin radiates a sort of shadowy smoke that obscures "
"its outline, making its camouflage even harder to see against the "
"background.  In the darkness it would be nigh invisible."
msgstr ""
"La piel de este soldado zombi irradia una especie de humo sombrío que "
"oscurece su contorno, haciendo que su camuflaje sea aún más difícil de ver "
"contra el fondo. En la oscuridad sería casi invisible."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hunter-killer zombie"
msgid_plural "hunter-killer zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi cazador-asesino"
msgstr[1] "zombis cazador-asesino"

#. ~ Description for hunter-killer zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fragments of visible uniform hint that this monstrosity was once a soldier."
"  Anything human is invisible, hidden inside a sheath of living shadow.  It "
"moves with preternatural fluidity and grace."
msgstr ""
"Fragmentos de uniformes visibles insinúan que esta monstruosidad fue una vez"
" un soldado. Cualquier cosa humana es invisible, escondida dentro de una "
"envoltura de sombra viva. Se mueve con una fluidez y gracia preternaturales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bilious soldier zombie"
msgid_plural "bilious soldier zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi soldado bilioso"
msgstr[1] "zombis soldados biliosos"

#. ~ Description for bilious soldier zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This staggering soldier wears a burnt gasmask, now fused to its face.  "
"Through the melted, bile-encrusted ruination of the mask comes some sort of "
"hardened fleshy proboscis, with steaming corrosive fluid leaking from the "
"end."
msgstr ""
"Este asombroso soldado lleva una máscara de gas quemada, ahora fusionada a "
"su cara. A través de la ruina derretida e incrustada de bilis de la máscara "
"viene una especie de probóscide carnosa endurecida, con un fluido corrosivo "
"vaporoso que se filtra por el extremo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The acid-sniper zombie launches a corrosive dart!"
msgstr "¡El zombi francotirador de ácido lanza un dardo corrosivo!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "caustic soldier zombie"
msgid_plural "caustic soldier zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi soldado caústico"
msgstr[1] "zombis soldado caústico"

#. ~ Description for caustic soldier zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie wears what appears to have once been a soldier's uniform and "
"armor, now a series of cracked and melted plates that have fused to its skin"
" and thickened hide.  Its face and arms blister with strange mutated tubes "
"that pulse and drip with acid."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi lleva lo que parece haber sido una vez el uniforme y la armadura "
"de un soldado, ahora una serie de placas agrietadas y derretidas que se han "
"fusionado su gruesa piel. Su cara y brazos se ampollan con extraños tubos "
"mutados que pulsan y gotean con ácido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The acid-support zombie launches a hail of corrosive darts!"
msgstr "¡El zombi de soporte ácido lanza una ráfaga de  dardos corrosivos!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Kevlar zombie"
msgid_plural "Kevlar zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi Kevlar"
msgstr[1] "zombis Kevlar"

#. ~ Description for Kevlar zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of uniform with heavy, bulletproof "
"materials sewn in.  At this point it's impossible to tell what kind of "
"uniform it was: the monster's skin has grown over the fabric, splitting and "
"tearing it to shreds, turning the remaining Kevlar and other bits of armor "
"material into part of its hide.  Its hands, similarly, have fused into large"
" leathery cudgels."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi llevaba antes una especie de uniforme con materiales pesados y "
"antibalas cosidos. En este momento es imposible saber qué tipo de uniforme "
"era: la piel del monstruo ha crecido sobre la tela, partiéndola y haciéndola"
" pedazos, convirtiendo el kevlar restante y otros trozos de material de la "
"armadura en parte de su piel. Sus manos, igualmente, se han fusionado en "
"grandes porras de cuero."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Kevlar hulk"
msgid_plural "Kevlar hulks"
msgstr[0] "mole Kevlar"
msgstr[1] "moles Kevlar"

#. ~ Description for Kevlar hulk
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie was once wearing some kind of now long-shredded uniform with "
"heavy, bulletproof materials sewn in.  It has grown into a hulking, "
"leatherbacked beast, its mutated skin taking on a strange texture similar to"
" the Kevlar bits embedded in it.  Its arms have twisted into enormous clubs "
"of misshapen bone that it drags on the ground behind it."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi llevaba antes una especie de uniforme, ahora destrozado, con "
"materiales pesados y antibalas cosidos. Ha crecido hasta convertirse en una "
"bestia mole con espalda de cuero, cuya piel mutada adquiere una extraña "
"textura similar a la de los trozos de Kevlar incrustados en ella. Sus brazos"
" se han retorcido hasta convertirse en enormes garrotes de hueso deformado "
"que arrastra por el suelo tras de sí."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie military pilot"
msgid_plural "zombie military pilots"
msgstr[0] "zombi piloto de ejército"
msgstr[1] "zombis piloto de ejército"

#. ~ Description for zombie military pilot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a pilot, it is dressed in basic military fatigues, aviator sunglasses, "
"and a sturdy looking helmet."
msgstr ""
"Alguna vez fue un piloto, esta vestido con una ropa militar básica, gafas de"
" sol de aviador, y un casco de aspecto robusto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "uniformed zombie"
msgid_plural "uniformed zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi uniformado"
msgstr[1] "zombis uniformados"

#. ~ Description for uniformed zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This undead soldier is adorned in standard military fatigues.  It carries "
"itself rather steadily for a zombie."
msgstr ""
"Este soldado no muerto está adornado con un traje militar estándar. Para ser"
" un zombi, sus movimientos son relativamente firmes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie burner"
msgid_plural "zombie burners"
msgstr[0] "quemador zombi"
msgstr[1] "quemadores zombi"

#. ~ Description for zombie burner
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When bullets weren't enough to stop the end of the world, the military tried"
" fire instead.  Their failure is made manifest in this gas-masked husk, its "
"black suit torn and ripped.  Its flamethrower, dangling limply at its side, "
"is attached to a tank of napalm strapped onto its back, which trickles its "
"contents onto the ground."
msgstr ""
"Cuando las balas no fueron suficientes para detener el fin del mundo, los "
"militares trataron de disparar en su lugar. Su fracaso se manifiesta en esta"
" cáscara enmascarada con gas, su traje negro roto y desgarrado. Su "
"lanzallamas, colgando sin fuerzas a su lado, está unido a un tanque de "
"napalm atado a su espalda, que hace caer su contenido al suelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "armored zombie"
msgid_plural "armored zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi blindado"
msgstr[1] "zombis blindados"

#. ~ Description for armored zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite being encased in a what was once a nigh-impenetrable suit of power "
"armor, something still managed to kill this soldier."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de estar encerrado en lo que alguna vez fue una armadura de poder "
"casi impenetrable, algo se las ingenió para matar a este soldado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "zombi bio-operador"
msgstr[1] "zombis bio-operador"

#. ~ Description for zombie bio-operator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This armored and augmented soldier's bionics crackle with energy.  Worse, it"
" appears to remember its training."
msgstr ""
"El biónico blindado e incrementado de este soldado está chisporroteando de "
"energía. Lo peor es que parece recordar su entrenamiento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "elite zombie bio-operator"
msgid_plural "elite zombie bio-operators"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador zombi elite"
msgstr[1] "bio-operadores zombi elite"

#. ~ Description for elite zombie bio-operator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a highly trained soldier, various bionics cover this zombie's broken "
"body.  Strangely, it maintains a vague martial arts stance."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi, que en su día fue un soldado altamente entrenado, tiene el "
"cuerpo destrozado gracias a la biónica. Extrañamente, mantiene una vaga "
"postura de artes marciales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi superviviente"
msgstr[1] "zombis supervivientes"

#. ~ Description for survivor zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Still wearing the tattered remnants of improvised armor and weaponry, it is "
"plain to see that this zombie was once a survivor like you."
msgstr ""
"Todavía tiene puestos los restos de una armadura improvisada y armas, está "
"claro que este zombi fue antes un superviviente como tú."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "veteran survivor zombie"
msgid_plural "veteran survivor zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi superviviente veterano"
msgstr[1] "zombis supervivientes veteranos"

#. ~ Description for veteran survivor zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This zombie once was a survivor like you, and a pretty good one at that.  "
"Unfortunately they didn't make it, despite the custom-made, heavy armor "
"pieces they wear and the gear that they are still lugging around."
msgstr ""
"Este zombi fue una vez un superviviente como tú, y uno bastante bueno en "
"eso. Desafortunadamente no lo logró, a pesar de las pesadas piezas de "
"armadura hechas a medida que usan y el equipo que aún llevan."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Cyber Mastiff"
msgid_plural "Cyber Mastifs"
msgstr[0] "Mastín Cibernético"
msgstr[1] "Mastines Cibernéticos"

#. ~ Description for Cyber Mastiff
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mix of Great Pyrenees and Ovcharka breeds outfitted with bionic "
"enhancements.  These hounds defend Prep Phyle lands from all comers undead "
"and otherwise."
msgstr ""
"Una mezcla de razas de los Grandes Pirineos y Ovcharka con mejoras biónicas."
" Estos perros defienden las tierras de Prep Phyle de todos los muertos y no "
"muertos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Cyber Mastiff puppy"
msgid_plural "Cyber Mastiff puppies"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de Mastín Cibernético"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de Mastín Cibernético"

#. ~ Description for Cyber Mastiff puppy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An adorable, defenseless Cyber Mastiff puppy.  Much safer to tame than an "
"adult dog.  CBMs are implanted but immature in growth with the puppy."
msgstr ""
"Un adorable e indefenso cachorro de Mastín Cibernético. Mucho más seguro de "
"domesticar que un perro adulto. El CBM se implanta pero crece inmaduro con "
"el cachorro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "military robot"
msgid_plural "military robots"
msgstr[0] "robot militar"
msgstr[1] "robots militares"

#. ~ Description for military robot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A military robot still operating due to its internal power core.  This one "
"is armed with an electric prod and an integrated 5.56mm."
msgstr ""
"Un robot militar que sigue funcionando gracias a su núcleo de energía "
"interno. Este está armado con una picana eléctrica y un 5,56 mm integrado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "defense robot"
msgid_plural "defense robots"
msgstr[0] "robot de defensa"
msgstr[1] "robots de defensa"

#. ~ Description for defense robot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An automated defense robot still active due to its internal power source.  "
"This one is armed with an electric prod and an integrated 9mm firearm."
msgstr ""
"Un robot de defensa automatizado aún activo debido a su fuente de energía "
"interna. Este está armado con una picana eléctrica y un arma de fuego "
"integrada de 9 mm."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "advanced robot"
msgid_plural "advanced robots"
msgstr[0] "robot avanzado"
msgstr[1] "robots avanzados"

#. ~ Description for advanced robot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An advanced robot still functioning due to its internal fusion core.  This "
"model is armed with a powerful laser-emitter."
msgstr ""
"Un avanzado robot que sigue funcionando gracias a su núcleo de fusión "
"interna. Este modelo está armado con un poderoso emisor de láser."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "labbit"
msgid_plural "labbits"
msgstr[0] "lonejo"
msgstr[1] "lonejos"

#. ~ Description for labbit
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rabbit from earth, genetically modified to eat the lichen of Salus IV.  "
"Its fur is rust colored and its ears are shortened to preserve warmth."
msgstr ""
"Un conejo de la tierra, modificado genéticamente para comer el liquen de "
"Salus IV. Su pelaje es de color óxido y sus orejas están acortadas para "
"conservar el calor."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "runner"
msgid_plural "runners"
msgstr[0] "corredor"
msgstr[1] "corredores"

#. ~ Description for runner
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large fluffy three-legged herbivore, extremely fast and cowardly.  It "
"usually grazes alone, and relies on its keen senses to stay safe."
msgstr ""
"Un gran herbívoro de tres patas, extremadamente rápido y cobarde. Suele "
"pastar en solitario y confía en sus agudos sentidos para mantenerse a salvo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grazer"
msgid_plural "grazers"
msgstr[0] "pastante"
msgstr[1] "pastantes"

#. ~ Description for grazer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large furred herbivore, with its heavy head constantly against the ground."
"  It uses its clawed hooves to shovel up the snow to reach any dead plant "
"life to eat."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran herbívoro peludo, con su pesada cabeza constantemente contra el "
"suelo. Utiliza sus pezuñas con garras para palear la nieve y alcanzar "
"cualquier planta muerta para comer."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hevel"
msgid_plural "hevels"
msgstr[0] "hevel"
msgstr[1] "heveles"

#. ~ Description for hevel
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small creature covered in blue down, scurrying across the ground fast as "
"it digs through the snow with claws buried in its down, looking for food.  "
"It works in large packs with its fellow kin."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña criatura cubierta de plumón azul, que se desliza rápidamente por"
" el suelo mientras escarba en la nieve con las garras enterradas en el "
"plumón, en busca de comida. Trabaja en grandes manadas con sus congéneres."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "venandi"
msgid_plural "venatores"
msgstr[0] "venadi"
msgstr[1] "venadores"

#. ~ Description for venandi
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A six legged animal, showing relative intelligence in not only its ability "
"to track and hunt down prey, but its strategy of covering itself with the "
"skin of its hunts to warm itself."
msgstr ""
"Un animal de seis patas, que muestra una relativa inteligencia no sólo en su"
" capacidad de rastrear y cazar presas, sino en su estrategia de cubrirse con"
" la piel de sus presas para calentarse."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "terror bird"
msgid_plural "terror birds"
msgstr[0] "temor alado"
msgstr[1] "temores alados"

#. ~ Description for terror bird
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall bird with two long, muscular legs, a long neck, and a long sharp "
"beak."
msgstr ""
"Un pájaro alto con dos patas largas y musculares, un largo cuello y un pico "
"largo y puntiagudo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "frost maddened human"
msgid_plural "frost maddened humans"
msgstr[0] "humano enloquecido por la escarcha"
msgstr[1] "humanos enloquecidos por la escarcha"

#. ~ Description for frost maddened human
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sky blue irises cover the entirety of the eye.  What happened to this person"
" during their deep freeze?"
msgstr ""
"El iris azul cielo cubre la totalidad del ojo. ¿Qué le ocurrió a esta "
"persona durante su congelación?"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sky blue irises with grey floating flecks cover the entirety of the eye.  "
"Flurries seem to emanate from around them."
msgstr ""
"Los iris azul cielo con motas flotantes grises cubren la totalidad del ojo. "
"Parecen emanar ráfagas a su alrededor."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "None"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A burst of frozen air explodes from their lungs!"
msgstr "¡Una ráfaga de aire helado explota de sus pulmones!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "military flame robot"
msgid_plural "military flame robots"
msgstr[0] "robot militar lanzallama"
msgstr[1] "robots militares lanzallamas"

#. ~ Description for military flame robot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A military robot still operating due to its internal power core.  This one "
"is armed with an electric prod and an integrated flamethrower."
msgstr ""
"Un robot militar que sigue operando debido a su núcleo de energía interno. "
"Este está armado con una picana eléctrica y un lanzallamas integrado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "\"Hostile Detected.\""
msgstr "\"Hostil detectado.\""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hiss!"
msgstr "¡siseo!"

#. ~ Description for military robot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A military robot still operating due to its internal power core.  This one "
"is armed with an electric prod and an integrated 7.62mm firearm."
msgstr ""
"Es un robot militar todavía activo debido a su fuente interna de energía. "
"Este está armado con una picana eléctrica y un arma 7.62mm integrada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "click!"
msgstr "¡click!"

#. ~ Description for military robot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A military robot still operating due to its internal power core.  This one "
"is armed with an electric prod and an integrated 8mm firearm."
msgstr ""
"Un robot militar que sigue operando debido a su núcleo de energía interno. "
"Este está armado con una picana eléctrica y un arma de fuego integrada de 8 "
"mm."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "whirrrr!"
msgstr "¡zumbido bajo!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "railgun robot"
msgid_plural "railgun robots"
msgstr[0] "robot de cañón de riel"
msgstr[1] "robots de cañón de riel"

#. ~ Description for railgun robot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An advanced robot still functioning due to its internal fusion core.  This "
"model is furnished with a powerful railgun."
msgstr ""
"Un avanzado robot que sigue funcionando gracias a su núcleo de fusión "
"interna. Este modelo está provisto de una potente arma de cañón de riel."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "buzz!"
msgstr "¡zumbido!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "headless zombie"
msgid_plural "headless zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi sin cabeza"
msgstr[1] "zombis sin cabeza"

#. ~ Description for headless zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite lacking a head, this zombie appears to have not gotten the memo, and"
" shambles aimlessly around without functioning senses.  Black ooze pulses "
"out of its neck, and it stumbles around listlessly."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de no tener cabeza, este zombi parece no haber recibido el "
"memorándum, y anda sin rumbo fijo sin sentidos que funcionen. El rezumo "
"negro sale de su cuello, y se tambalea sin ganas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "brain blaster"
msgid_plural "brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "blaster cerebral"
msgstr[1] "blasters cerebrales"

#. ~ Description for brain blaster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The mi-go have set up some defenses here.  This horrifying techo-organic "
"amalgamation appears to use brains in jars as their operating system.  On "
"the plus side it looks like it can be headshot."
msgstr ""
"Los mi-go han establecido algunas defensas aquí. Esta horripilante amalgama "
"techo-orgánica parece usar cerebros en tarros como su sistema operativo. En "
"el lado positivo parece que puede ser un tiro a la cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Whately family brain blaster"
msgid_plural "Whately family brain blasters"
msgstr[0] "blaster cerebral de la familia Whately"
msgstr[1] "blasters cerebrales de la familia Whately"

#. ~ Description for Whately family brain blaster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Whately family deploys mi-go style techno-organic defensive turrets.  "
"They claim that these turrets are made from family members near death, but "
"you have doubts."
msgstr ""
"La familia Whately despliega torretas defensivas tecno-orgánicas de estilo "
"mi-go. Afirman que estas torretas están hechas con miembros de la familia "
"próximos a la muerte, pero tú tienes dudas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Pathfinder"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Pathfinders"
msgstr[0] "Navegador Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Navegadores Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Pathfinder
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Wraitheon Pathfinder is a massive, house-height armored robot.  It is "
"armed to the teeth with a 40mm anti-material grenade launcher, a 5.56 anti-"
"personnel gun, and an electroshock capability to defend against melee "
"strikes.  Manufactured by Wraitheon for the ESCA military, it was used along"
" with infantry thanks to the flexibility of its reverse-jointed legs."
msgstr ""
"El Navegador Wraitheon es un enorme robot blindado de la altura de una casa."
" Está armado hasta los dientes con un lanzagranadas antimaterial de 40 mm, "
"un cañón antipersona 5,56 y una capacidad de electrochoque para defenderse "
"de los ataques cuerpo a cuerpo. Fabricado por Wraitheon para el ejército de "
"la ESCA, se utilizó junto con la infantería gracias a la flexibilidad de sus"
" patas de articulación inversa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Regulator"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Regulators"
msgstr[0] "Regulador Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Reguladores Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Regulator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed by Wraitheon, the Regulator is a refrigerator-sized UGV designed "
"for high-risk urban fighting.  Armed with an anti-material missile launcher,"
" a 40mm grenade launcher, and several anti-personnel weapons, it's designed "
"to match the fervor of freedom fighters with the industrial might of Earth."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado por Wraitheon, el Regulador es un vehículo aéreo no tripulado del "
"tamaño de un refrigerador, diseñado para la lucha urbana de alto riesgo. "
"Armado con un lanzamisiles antimaterial, un lanzagranadas de 40 mm y varias "
"armas antipersona, está diseñado para igualar el fervor de los luchadores "
"por la libertad con el poderío industrial de la Tierra."

#. ~ Description for tripod
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Honda Crop King.  Originally designed for agriculture, it has a trio of "
"spiked retractable cables and where it used to mount pesticide sprayer the "
"PrepNet Phyle have modified it to have a flamethrower for their war against "
"the Mycus."
msgstr ""
"El Rey de la Cosecha de Honda. Originalmente diseñado para la agricultura, "
"tiene un trío de cables retráctiles con púas y donde solía montar el "
"rociador de pesticidas la PrepNet Phyle lo han modificado para tener un "
"lanzallamas para su guerra contra el Mycus."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Sentinel-lx"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Sentinel-lxs"
msgstr[0] "Fantasma Lx Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Fantasmas Lx Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Sentinel-lx
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its exterior plates are sable and gold, this luxurious variant of a "
"Wraitheon drone was once kept as a bodyguard by society's wealthiest.  Still"
" with its wrist sword extended, it resembles an ancient knight, standing an "
"eternal watch."
msgstr ""
"Sus placas exteriores son de color sable y oro, esta lujosa variante de un "
"zángano de Wraitheon se mantuvo una vez como guardaespaldas de los más ricos"
" de la sociedad. Todavía con su espada de muñeca extendida, se asemeja a un "
"antiguo caballero, que vigila eternamente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "\"Dispatching hostile with lethal force.\""
msgstr "\"Despachando a los hostiles con fuerza letal.\""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bloodhound drone"
msgid_plural "bloodhound drones"
msgstr[0] "dron sabueso"
msgstr[1] "drones sabueso"

#. ~ Description for bloodhound drone
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, spiked quadcopter robot equipped with a high-power spotlight.  This"
" automated seeker drone was originally designed to harry and harass "
"fugitives while maintaining visual contact for other pursuers."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño robot cuadricóptero de púas equipado con un foco de alta "
"potencia. Este dron buscador automatizado fue diseñado originalmente para "
"hostigar y acosar a los fugitivos mientras mantenía el contacto visual con "
"otros perseguidores."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "ENIAC Seneschal"
msgid_plural "ENIAC Seneschals"
msgstr[0] "Senescal ENIAC"
msgstr[1] "Senescales ENIAC"

#. ~ Description for ENIAC Seneschal
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the many cheaper models produced by ENIAC.  It is supposedly multi-"
"purpose, and equipped with several tools to facilitate this; however, it is "
"commonly used for janitorial work."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los muchos modelos más baratos producidos por ENIAC. Se supone que es"
" polivalente y está equipado con varias herramientas para facilitarlo; sin "
"embargo, se utiliza habitualmente para trabajos de limpieza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "TsKBEM Likvidator"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Likvidators"
msgstr[0] "Likvidator TsKBEM"
msgstr[1] "Likvidators TsKBEM"

#. ~ Description for TsKBEM Likvidator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A now ancient industrial robot line first made by the Soviet TsKBEM, and "
"still in use thanks to its easily obtained fabrication schematics.  Built to"
" operate within nuclear reactors and waste repositories, the Likvidator is "
"assembled around an armored bipedal chassis that mounts several heavy "
"manipulator arms.  Legend claims it was originally designed after a nuclear "
"disaster during early space-age Earth."
msgstr ""
"Una antigua línea de robots industriales fabricada por primera vez por el "
"TsKBEM soviético, y que sigue en uso gracias a sus esquemas de fabricación "
"fáciles de obtener. Construido para operar dentro de reactores nucleares y "
"depósitos de residuos, el Likvidator está montado alrededor de un chasis "
"bípedo blindado que monta varios brazos manipuladores pesados. La leyenda "
"afirma que fue diseñado originalmente después de un desastre nuclear durante"
" los primeros años de la era espacial en la Tierra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "ENIAC Famulus"
msgid_plural "ENIAC Famuli"
msgstr[0] "Famulus ENIAC"
msgstr[1] "Famuli ENIAC"

#. ~ Description for ENIAC Famulus
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A top of the line luxury model, the Famulus is a humaniform robot, derived "
"from Wraitheon schematics with slight alterations to give it a more human "
"appearance.  Designed to be a robotic servant, its AI tailored for the needs"
" for each customer, it is arguably one of the few commercial robots to pass "
"the Turing test."
msgstr ""
"El Famuli, un modelo de lujo de alta gama, es un robot humaniforme, derivado"
" de los esquemas de Wraitheon con ligeras alteraciones para darle una "
"apariencia más humana. Diseñado para ser un sirviente robótico, con su IA "
"adaptada a las necesidades de cada cliente, es posiblemente uno de los pocos"
" robots comerciales que ha superado la prueba de Turing."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "TsKBEM Udarnik"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Udarniks"
msgstr[0] "Udarnik TsKBEM"
msgstr[1] "Udarniks TsKBEM"

#. ~ Description for TsKBEM Udarnik
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A highly customizable light industrial and agricultural robot.  Its original design dates back to the ancient Soviet Union; the aptly named Udarnik \"shock worker\" was the trigger behind the automation revolution, and with subsequent adaptations, became the workhorse of early human space colonization.  Although outdated by modern standards, the Udarnik is still commonly seen in frontier worlds - thanks to its easily obtainable fabrication schematics.\n"
"\n"
"This particular version is equipped with a mix of construction and heavy cargo-handling tools and was likely involved in the construction of colony buildings."
msgstr ""
"Un robot industrial ligero y agrícola altamente personalizable. Su diseño original se remonta a la antigua Unión Soviética; el bien llamado \"trabajador de choque\" Udarnik fue el desencadenante de la revolución de la automatización y, con posteriores adaptaciones, se convirtió en el caballo de batalla de la primera colonización espacial humana. Aunque anticuado para los estándares modernos, el Udarnik todavía se ve con frecuencia en los mundos fronterizos, gracias a sus esquemas de fabricación fáciles de obtener. \n"
"\n"
"Esta versión en particular está equipada con una mezcla de herramientas de construcción y de manipulación de carga pesada y probablemente participó en la construcción de edificios de colonias."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "TsKBEM Brandspojt"
msgid_plural "TsKBEM Brandspojts"
msgstr[0] "Brandspojt TsKBEM"
msgstr[1] "Brandspojts TsKBEM"

#. ~ Description for TsKBEM Brandspojt
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An old and decidedly uncommon firefighter robot of Soviet design.  Crab-like"
" in form, its back mounts a squat water tank beneath a turreted water "
"cannon.  While effective for its original function, the design lacks the "
"flexibility of others from the TsKBEM, and most Brandspojt units still in "
"existence are museum pieces."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo y poco común robot de bomberos de diseño soviético. Con forma de "
"cangrejo, su espalda monta un tanque de agua en cuclillas bajo un cañón de "
"agua con torreta. Aunque es eficaz para su función original, el diseño "
"carece de la flexibilidad de otros del TsKBEM, y la mayoría de las unidades "
"Brandspojt que aún existen son piezas de museo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Faulty Surgical Droid"
msgid_plural "Faulty Surgical Droids"
msgstr[0] "Droide Quirúrgico Roto"
msgstr[1] "Droides Quirúrgicos Rotos"

#. ~ Description for Faulty Surgical Droid
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A free roaming medical robot capable of administering powerful anesthetics "
"and performing complex surgical operations, usually in that order.  Faulty "
"bio-diagnostic programs resulted in numerous lawsuits before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Un robot médico itinerante capaz de administrar potentes anestésicos y "
"realizar complejas operaciones quirúrgicas, normalmente en ese orden. Los "
"programas de bio-diagnóstico defectuosos resultaron en numerosas demandas "
"antes del Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rat snatcher"
msgid_plural "rat snatchers"
msgstr[0] "ladrón rata"
msgstr[1] "ladrones rata"

#. ~ Description for rat snatcher
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot repurposed for hunting small game.  It's faster than "
"the original model but far less sturdy."
msgstr ""
"Un Skitterbot recuperado, destinado a la caza menor. Es más rápido que el "
"modelo original pero mucho menos robusto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grab-bot"
msgid_plural "grab-bots"
msgstr[0] "robots-recogedor"
msgstr[1] "robots-recogedores"

#. ~ Description for grab-bot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot repurposed to grab onto and immobilize enemies.  It's "
"meant to work in a pack."
msgstr ""
"Es un arañabot reconvertido para agarrar e inmovilizar a los enemigos. Está "
"pensado para trabajar en manada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pest hunter"
msgid_plural "pest hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador de plagas"
msgstr[1] "cazadores de plagas"

#. ~ Description for pest hunter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A salvaged skitterbot refitted with an 8mm integrated firearm.  The robot's "
"small size precludes rapid fire, due to recoil, and requires the use of "
"lightweight caseless ammo."
msgstr ""
"Un Skitterbot recuperado y reequipado con un arma de fuego integrada de 8 "
"mm. El pequeño tamaño del robot impide el fuego rápido, debido al retroceso,"
" y requiere el uso de munición ligera sin carcasa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Aegis"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Aegises"
msgstr[0] "Aegis Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Aegises Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Aegis
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the many models of Wraitheon-manufactured but supposedly non-military"
" robots, the Aegis is a bulky and heavy riot control machine with "
"electroshock capabilities and an integrated riot shotgun."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los muchos modelos de robots fabricados por Wraitheon pero "
"supuestamente no militar, el Aegis es una voluminosa y pesada máquina "
"antidisturbios con capacidad de electrochoque y una escopeta antidisturbios "
"integrada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "click click!"
msgstr "¡click click!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Imaginifer"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Imaginifers"
msgstr[0] "Imaginifer Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Imaginifers Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Imaginifer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Imaginifer, one of the few examples of true humaniform robots, was "
"manufactured by Wraitheon for ESCA militaries.  They are designed to "
"complement infantry soldiers, being able to use their gear and transports.  "
"While similar in shape, they are far removed from the ENIAC's Famulus.  The "
"Wraitheon humaniforms are designed to take full advantage of a humanoid "
"shape, not to look human; programmed for game theory, not for sapience."
msgstr ""
"El Imaginifer, uno de los pocos ejemplos de verdaderos robots humaniformes, "
"fue fabricado por Wraitheon para los militares de la ESCA. Están diseñados "
"para complementar a los soldados de infantería, pudiendo utilizar sus "
"equipos y transportes. Aunque tienen una forma similar, están muy alejados "
"de los Famulus de la ENIAC. Los humaniformes Wraitheon están diseñados para "
"aprovechar al máximo la forma humanoide, no para parecer humanos; "
"programados para la teoría del juego, no para la sapiencia."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Hashashiyyin"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Hashashiyyins"
msgstr[0] "Hashashiyyin Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Hashashiyyins Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Hashashiyyin
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Hashashiyyin is unorthodox in its design as a military humaniform.  "
"While it keeps the strength of most Wraitheon humaniforms, it also "
"prioritizes stealth.  It comes equipped with an integrated 5x50mm flechette "
"gun."
msgstr ""
"El Hashashiyyin es poco ortodoxo en su diseño como humanoide militar. Aunque"
" mantiene la fuerza de la mayoría de los humanoides de Wraitheon, también da"
" prioridad al sigilo. Viene equipado con un arma de flechettes integrada de "
"5x50mm."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Suppressor"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Suppressors"
msgstr[0] "Supresor Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Supresores Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Suppressor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Looking more like a tank than a robot, the Suppressor is built to deal with "
"vehicles (including tanks) and personnel alike.  Equipped with a 40mm "
"grenade launcher, it can easily dispatch anything in its path."
msgstr ""
"Con un aspecto más parecido al de un tanque que al de un robot, el Supresor "
"está construido para hacer frente a vehículos (incluidos los tanques) y a "
"personal por igual. Equipado con un lanzagranadas de 40 mm, puede acabar "
"fácilmente con todo lo que se cruce en su camino."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Fulgent"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Fulgents"
msgstr[0] "Fulgente Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Fulgentes Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Fulgent
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An autonomous anti-personnel weapons platform, mounting a laser on an "
"insectoid chassis.  The Fulgent designation excels at 'controlling' riots "
"and (sometimes simultaneously) putting down potential freedom fighters."
msgstr ""
"Una plataforma autónoma de armas antipersona, que monta un láser en un "
"chasis insectoide. La designación Fulgente destaca en el \"control\" de "
"disturbios y (a veces simultáneamente) en la eliminación de potenciales "
"combatientes por la libertad."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Irradiant"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Irradiants"
msgstr[0] "Irradiante Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Irradiantes Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Irradiant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An autonomous anti-armor weapons platform, mounting a 5kg plasma railgun "
"over an insectoid chassis.  The Irradiant designation excels at ambush and "
"midrange combat, where it can leverage its superior agility and reduced "
"sensor profile to successfully engage technologically advanced foes."
msgstr ""
"Plataforma anit-blindado autónoma que monta un cañón de riel de plasma de 5 "
"kg sobre un chasis insectoide. La designación Irradiante destaca en las "
"emboscadas y el combate a medio alcance, donde puede aprovechar su agilidad "
"superior y su reducido perfil de sensores para enfrentarse con éxito a "
"enemigos tecnológicamente avanzados."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Irradiant emits a chilling robotic shrill as it fires its plasma "
"railgun."
msgstr ""
"La Irradiante emite un escalofriante chillido robótico al disparar su cañón "
"de riel de plasma."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "the climbing pitch of a charging plasma railgun"
msgstr "el tono ascendente de un  cañón de riel de plasma cargándose"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Isohypsa"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Isohypsas"
msgstr[0] "Isohypsa Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Isohypsas Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Isohypsa
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bulky if not particularly large aerial drone, with an advanced AI "
"overwatch unit and a bulbous carapace, mostly dedicated to mounting high-"
"resolution sensors.  As an autonomous drone control platform, the Isohypsa "
"is principally meant to coordinate and enhance the combat capabilities of "
"simpler Wraitheon robots in lieu of human operators."
msgstr ""
"Un dron aéreo voluminoso, aunque no especialmente grande, con una unidad de "
"vigilancia de IA avanzada y un caparazón abultado, dedicado principalmente a"
" montar sensores de alta resolución. Como plataforma de control de drones "
"autónomos, el Isohypsa está pensado principalmente para coordinar y mejorar "
"las capacidades de combate de los robots Wraitheon más sencillos en lugar de"
" los operadores humanos."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "Wraitheon Isohypsa"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The Isohypsa emits a rapid sequence of sibilant tones!"
msgstr "¡La Isohypsa emite una rápida secuencia de tonos sibilantes!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Kabura-ya"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Kabura-yas"
msgstr[0] "Kabura-ya Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Kabura-yas Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Kabura-ya
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A microplane drone designed to seek enemy personnel before detonating at "
"close range."
msgstr ""
"Un dron microplano diseñado para buscar al personal enemigo antes de detonar"
" a corta distancia."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Wraitheon Frequency"
msgid_plural "Wraitheon Frequencies"
msgstr[0] "Frecuencia Wraitheon"
msgstr[1] "Frecuencias Wraitheon"

#. ~ Description for Wraitheon Frequency
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An autonomous weapons platform, made to disrupt or disable electronics - "
"especially other robots - with an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr ""
"Una plataforma armamentística autónoma, hecha para interrumpir o inutilizar "
"la electrónica -especialmente otros robots- con un pulso electromagnético."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bee bot"
msgid_plural "bee bots"
msgstr[0] "robot abeja"
msgstr[1] "robots abeja"

#. ~ Description for bee bot
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A salvaged utility robot converted into an AI monitored bee hive that "
"periodically removes and delivers honey combs."
msgstr ""
"Un robot utilitario recuperado y convertido en una colmena supervisada por "
"la IA que extrae y entrega periódicamente panales de miel."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "floating lantern"
msgid_plural "floating lanterns"
msgstr[0] "linterna flotante"
msgstr[1] "linternas flotantes"

#. ~ Description for floating lantern
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A salvaged drone repurposed into a mobile lightsource."
msgstr "Un dron recuperado que se ha reconvertido en una fuente de luz móvil."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "floating heater"
msgid_plural "floating heaters"
msgstr[0] "calentador flotante"
msgstr[1] "calentadores flotantes"

#. ~ Description for floating heater
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A salvaged eyebot repurposed into a floating space heater.  It emits a "
"constant jet of warm air to heat an enclosed space."
msgstr ""
"Un globo ocular recuperado se ha reutilizado en un calefactor flotante. "
"Emite un chorro constante de aire caliente para calentar un espacio cerrado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "x-ray laser turret"
msgid_plural "x-ray laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "torreta laser rayos x"
msgstr[1] "torretas laser rayos x"

#. ~ Description for x-ray laser turret
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The TX-5LR Cerberus is an upgrade to its predecessors.  It features a state "
"of the x-ray laser cannon system with three barrels.  Each barrel will fire "
"once and be exhausted until the part can be replaced."
msgstr ""
"El TX-5LR Cerberus es una actualización de sus predecesores. Cuenta con un "
"sistema de cañón láser de rayos X de última generación con tres cañones. "
"Cada cañón disparará una vez y se agotará hasta que la pieza pueda ser "
"sustituida."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Schwarz Walder"
msgid_plural "Schwarz Walders"
msgstr[0] "Schwarz Walder"
msgstr[1] "Schwarz Walders"

#. ~ Description for Schwarz Walder
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Schwarz Walders are an uplfited animal originally developed by a German "
"company as forest rangers for the expanded Black Forest Conservation Area.  "
"Like all Uplifts they have a human level of intelligence and are indentured "
"laborers to the corporation that grew and raised them, until they reach age "
"of enfranchisement dictated by UICA regulations or they earn their "
"citizenship early.  Shortly afterward the creation of the first Schwarz "
"Walders it was determined that they also made excellent long range "
"reconnaissance units that could operate independently indefinitely.  This "
"was one of the most popular Uplift models before the Discontinuity, and many"
" frontier planet still retain significant feral and otherwise independent "
"populations.  They are skilled marksmen and this one appears to be armed "
"with an smg."
msgstr ""
"Los Walders Schwarz son animales ascendidos desarrollados originalmente por "
"una empresa Alemana como guardabosques para la zona de conservación de la "
"Selva Negra expandida. Al igual que todos los sublevados, tienen un nivel de"
" inteligencia humano y son trabajadores contratados por la corporación que "
"los ha criado, hasta que alcanzan la edad de emancipación dictada por las "
"normas de la UICA o se ganan la ciudadanía antes de tiempo. Poco después de "
"la creación de los primeros Schwarz Walders se determinó que también eran "
"excelentes unidades de reconocimiento de largo alcance que podían operar de "
"forma independiente indefinidamente. Este fue uno de los modelos más "
"populares de Ascendidos antes de la Discontinuidad, y muchos planetas "
"fronterizos aún conservan importantes poblaciones salvajes y otras "
"independientes. Son hábiles tiradores y este parece estar armado con un smg."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "\"You should walk away.\""
msgstr "\"Deberías irte.\""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Schwarz Walder cub"
msgid_plural "Schwarz Walder cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro Schwarz Walder"
msgstr[1] "cachorros Schwarz Walder"

#. ~ Description for Schwarz Walder cub
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A young Schwarz Walder.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is "
"likely nearby."
msgstr ""
"Un joven Schwarz Walder. Si uno está aquí, es probable que un padre muy "
"protector esté cerca."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "infeme"
msgid_plural "infemes"
msgstr[0] "infeme"
msgstr[1] "infemes"

#. ~ Description for infeme
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Infeme are uplifted from apes and other near human ancestors.  The Zulu "
"word for monkey became the catch-all term for many species of uplifts "
"whether majority chimp, gorilla or baboon.  They've probably formed colonies"
" hidden from the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Los infeme son ascendidos de los simios y otros ancestros casi humanos. La "
"palabra Zulú para mono se convirtió en el término que engloba a muchas "
"especies de ascendidos, ya sea chimpancé mayoritario, gorila o babuino. "
"Probablemente han formado colonias ocultas desde el Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Cecaelian Survivor"
msgid_plural "Cecaelian Survivors"
msgstr[0] "Superviviente Cecaliano"
msgstr[1] "Supervivientes Cecalianos"

#. ~ Description for Cecaelian Survivor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Cecaelia were the corporate answer to the frailty of unmodified humans "
"under the sea.  These individuals have spent a lifetime beneath the waves "
"seeing conflicts you can't even imagine."
msgstr ""
"Los Cecalianos fueron la respuesta corporativa a la fragilidad de los "
"humanos no modificados bajo el mar. Estos individuos han pasado una vida "
"bajo las olas viendo conflictos que ni siquiera puedes imaginar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "\"Under the water, it's an endless war.\""
msgstr "\"Bajo el agua, es una guerra interminable.\""

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Cecaelian Spawn"
msgid_plural "Cecaelian Spawns"
msgstr[0] "Generador Cecaliano"
msgstr[1] "Generadores Cecalianos"

#. ~ Description for Cecaelian Spawn
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A young Cecaelia.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is likely "
"nearby."
msgstr ""
"Una joven Cecaliano. Si uno está aquí, es probable que un padre muy "
"protector esté cerca."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "deep one"
msgid_plural "deep ones"
msgstr[0] "profundo"
msgstr[1] "profundos"

#. ~ Description for deep one
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its "
"tubular grey body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed "
"protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its "
"shape, shifting in and out of the water."
msgstr ""
"Un alienígena que parece haber evolucionado para sobrevivir en las "
"profundidades. Su cuerpo gris tubular lleva numerosos conjuntos de apéndices"
" emparejados con protuberancias en forma de garras, y un par de gruesas "
"aletas musculares. Se ven destellos de su forma, que se mueve dentro y fuera"
" del agua."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "deep one slaver"
msgid_plural "deep one slavers"
msgstr[0] "esclavo profundo"
msgstr[1] "esclavos profundos"

#. ~ Description for deep one slaver
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An alien that appears to have evolved for survival in the depths.  Its "
"tubular grey body bears numerous sets of paired appendages with clawed "
"protrusions, and a pair of thick muscular fins.  You see glimpses of its "
"shape, shifting in and out of the water.  It is carrying a conical object "
"that hums with an odd keening sound."
msgstr ""
"Un alienígena que parece haber evolucionado para sobrevivir en las "
"profundidades. Su cuerpo gris tubular presenta numerosos conjuntos de "
"apéndices emparejados con protuberancias en forma de garras y un par de "
"gruesas aletas musculares. Se ven destellos de su forma, que se mueve dentro"
" y fuera del agua. Lleva un objeto cónico que zumba con un extraño sonido "
"agudo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Haunting Forest Walker"
msgid_plural "Haunting Forest Walkers"
msgstr[0] "Caminante del Bosque Atormentado"
msgstr[1] "Caminantes del Bosque Atormentados"

#. ~ Description for Haunting Forest Walker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This towering zombie is covered in wounds and shedding fur.  Once it may "
"have prevented forest fires in national parks, now it kills anything it "
"catches."
msgstr ""
"Este imponente zombi está cubierto de heridas y muda de pelo. Antes podía "
"evitar los incendios forestales en los parques nacionales, ahora mata todo "
"lo que pilla."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rotting grodd"
msgid_plural "rotting grodds"
msgstr[0] "grodd podrido"
msgstr[1] "grodds podridos"

#. ~ Description for rotting grodd
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Imagine a gorilla.  Now imagine it dead and rotting and somehow looking at "
"you with more hate than you had previously imagined possible."
msgstr ""
"Imagina un gorila. Ahora imagina que está muerto y podrido y que, de alguna "
"manera, te mira con más odio del que habías imaginado posible."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Ghoulodon"
msgid_plural "Ghoulodons"
msgstr[0] "Ghoulodon"
msgstr[1] "Ghoulodons"

#. ~ Description for Ghoulodon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An undead Uplifted Elephant of ginormous size.  It still wears its assault "
"grade armor."
msgstr ""
"Un Elefante Ascendido no muerto de tamaño descomunal. Todavía lleva su "
"armadura de grado asalto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dead Sea Witch"
msgid_plural "Dead Sea Witches"
msgstr[0] "Bruja del Mar Muerto"
msgstr[1] "Brujas del Mar Muerto"

#. ~ Description for Dead Sea Witch
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There is driftwood coming out of oozing wounds.  It moves towards you on a "
"mass of writhing tentacles, black eyes like the deepest trench of the sea."
msgstr ""
"Hay madera que sale de las heridas rezumantes. Avanza hacia ti sobre una "
"masa de tentáculos que se retuercen, ojos negros como la fosa más profunda "
"del mar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "MoxPhore Scavenger"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Scavengers"
msgstr[0] "Carroñero MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Carroñeros MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description for MoxPhore Scavenger
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human stands here, towering around 2 meters high.  It's flesh is frozen "
"solid, colored black and blue from frostbite.  It constantly scratches at "
"its flesh with its claw like hands, surveying the land with frozen and foggy"
" eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un humano se encuentra aquí, con una altura de unos 2 metros. Su carne está "
"congelada, coloreada de negro y azul por la congelación. Se rasca "
"constantemente la carne con sus manos en forma de garra, observando el "
"terreno con ojos helados y empañados."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "MoxPhore Spartan"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Spartans"
msgstr[0] "Espartano MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Espartanos MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description for MoxPhore Spartan
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human stands here, its body bulging and ripped as the tissue is torn, "
"showing bluish muscle, and grey bones.  Ice crystals jut out of its visible "
"wounds as it wanders."
msgstr ""
"Un humano se encuentra aquí, con el cuerpo abultado y desgarrado por los "
"tejidos, mostrando músculos azulados y huesos grises. De sus heridas "
"visibles sobresalen cristales de hielo mientras se pasea."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "MoxPhore Regenerator"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Regenerators"
msgstr[0] "Regenerador MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Regeneradores MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description for MoxPhore Regenerator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human stands here, comically thin and scratching It's scar-ridden flesh, "
"any flesh it rips off grows back in seconds."
msgstr ""
"Aquí hay un humano graciosamente delgado y rascándose su carne sin "
"cicatrices. Cada vez que se arranca un trozo de carne, vuelve a crecer en "
"segundos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "MoxPhore Tangler"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Tanglers"
msgstr[0] "Enredado MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Enredados MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description for MoxPhore Tangler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human stands here, several rust-colored limbs jut out of its back, moving "
"around and grabbing at the air while the person looks blankly around.."
msgstr ""
"Un humano está de pie, varias extremidades de color óxido sobresalen de su "
"espalda, moviéndose y agarrando el aire mientras la persona mira "
"inexpresivamente a su alrededor."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Speaker"
msgid_plural "Speakers"
msgstr[0] "Orador"
msgstr[1] "Oradores"

#. ~ Description for Speaker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A starfish like creature stands here, covered in black metallic fur as it "
"stands out, pointing in a specific direction."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura parecida a una estrella de mar se encuentra aquí, cubierta de "
"pelaje metálico negro mientras se destaca, apuntando en una dirección "
"específica."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "MoxPhore Elder"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Elders"
msgstr[0] "Anciano MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Ancianos MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description for MoxPhore Elder
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Numerous claw-like limbs closely wrap around this alien arachnid's head and "
"thorax, forming a protective barrier.  Its antennae twitch and writhe, and "
"it seems to grope wildly toward threats"
msgstr ""
"Numerosas extremidades en forma de garra envuelven la cabeza y el tórax de "
"este arácnido alienígena, formando una barrera protectora. Sus antenas se "
"mueven y se retuercen, y parece tantear salvajemente hacia las amenazas"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "MoxPhore Bloodhound"
msgid_plural "MoxPhore Bloodhounds"
msgstr[0] "Perro MoxPhore"
msgstr[1] "Perros MoxPhore"

#. ~ Description for MoxPhore Bloodhound
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The remains of a long lost colonist, shaped and rebuilt into a twisted "
"reflection of the insectoid and canid forms.  It scuttles across the ground,"
" looking blankly with vestigial eyes as it sniffs the air."
msgstr ""
"Los restos de un colono perdido hace tiempo, moldeados y reconstruidos en un"
" reflejo retorcido de las formas insectoides y cánidas. Se escabulle por el "
"suelo, mirando inexpresivamente con ojos vestigiales mientras olfatea el "
"aire."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Moxphore Emetic"
msgid_plural "Moxphore Emetics"
msgstr[0] "Emético Moxphore"
msgstr[1] "Eméticos Moxphore"

#. ~ Description for Moxphore Emetic
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Unidentifiable walking remains, hunched  and wandering in apparent pain.  An"
" alien plant peeks meekly from its open mouth, leaking green liquid as its "
"host stumbles."
msgstr ""
"Restos caminantes inidentificables, encorvados y vagando con aparente dolor."
" Una planta alienígena asoma mansamente por su boca abierta, goteando un "
"líquido verde mientras su huésped se tambalea."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Slasher Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Slasher Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Degollador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Degolladores"

#. ~ Description for Slasher Bio-Recombinant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A horrifically twisted human body.  Two massive, bladed appendages have "
"burst through its shoulders where they are poised above its head as it "
"stalks about with terrifying purpose."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano horriblemente retorcido. Dos enormes apéndices con "
"cuchillas han irrumpido en sus hombros, donde se colocan por encima de su "
"cabeza mientras acecha con un propósito aterrador."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Weak Slasher Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Weak Slasher Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Degollador Débil"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Degolladores Débiles"

#. ~ Description for Weak Slasher Bio-Recombinant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A horrifically mutilated human body.  Two scrawny blades have freshly "
"bursted through its hand to deal with prey and the haunting visage of a "
"jawless maw and a gaping wound in its forehead sends chills down your spine."
"  The awkward steps it takes slows it down greatly."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano horriblemente mutilado. Dos hojas escuálidas han estallado "
"recientemente a través de su mano para hacer frente a la presa y el "
"inquietante rostro de una mandíbula sin mandíbula y una herida abierta en su"
" frente envía escalofríos por su columna vertebral. Los incómodos pasos que "
"da lo ralentizan enormemente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Waster Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Waster Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Vago"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Vagos"

#. ~ Description for Waster Bio-Recombinant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Clad in heavy assault gear, an eerie light green glows beneath its helmet "
"from sunken eye sockets and a gaping mouth.  Strange blade like points have "
"burst out of it's forearms making it a formidable force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""
"Vestido con un pesado equipo de asalto, un espeluznante verde claro brilla "
"bajo su casco por las cuencas de los ojos hundidos y la boca abierta. "
"Extrañas puntas como cuchillas han estallado de sus brazos que lo convierten"
" en una fuerza formidable a tener en cuenta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Leaper Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Leaper Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Saltador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Saltador"

#. ~ Description for Leaper Bio-Recombinant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This once-human body is barely recognizable, scrambling about on its abdomen"
" as it leaps forward with immense arm strength.  With elongated fangs that "
"can easily mutilate your flesh, the grotesque face roars incessantly.  The "
"lower body has fused together into one giant tail with a barbed spike."
msgstr ""
"Este cuerpo, antaño humano, es apenas reconocible, y se revuelve sobre su "
"abdomen mientras salta hacia delante con la inmensa fuerza de sus brazos. "
"Con unos colmillos alargados que pueden mutilar fácilmente tu carne, el "
"grotesco rostro ruge sin cesar. La parte inferior del cuerpo se ha fusionado"
" en una cola gigante con una espiga de púas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Twitcher Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Twitcher Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Agitador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Agitador"

#. ~ Description for Twitcher Bio-Recombinant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With narrow blades coming out of its hands, this corpse spasmically dashes "
"to-and-fro with surprising speed.  It carries itself quite steadily when "
"idle, further observation shows that the person before this husk was a "
"C.R.I.T S-I G.E.A.R operator."
msgstr ""
"Con hojas estrechas saliendo de sus manos, este cadáver corre "
"espasmódicamente de un lado a otro con una velocidad sorprendente. Se mueve "
"con bastante regularidad cuando está parado, la observación adicional "
"muestra que la persona antes de esta cáscara era un operador de C.R.I.T S-I "
"G.E.A.R."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pack Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Pack Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Manada"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Manada"

#. ~ Description for Pack Bio-Recombinant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shrieking mutated child zombie.  The face is is mainly blank with eyes "
"swollen shut and a torn-open mouth with flaps of flesh hanging to the side."
"  A pair of seemingly purposeless appendages sprout from its shoulders "
"before ending in its arms.  Its small hands end in sharp claws."
msgstr ""
"Un niño zombi mutante chillón. La cara está principalmente en blanco, con "
"los ojos hinchados y la boca abierta con colgajos de carne colgando a un "
"lado. Un par de apéndices aparentemente sin propósito brotan de sus hombros "
"antes de terminar en sus brazos. Sus pequeñas manos terminan en garras "
"afiladas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Puker Bio-Recombinant"
msgid_plural "Puker Bio-Recombinants"
msgstr[0] "Bio-Recombinante Vomitador"
msgstr[1] "Bio-Recombinantes Vomitador"

#. ~ Description for Puker Bio-Recombinant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rather mutilated corpse covered in gaping sores.  Hanging arms with hands "
"that have long corroded away reveal jagged edges that could easily pierce "
"into your flesh.  A sticky, frothing yellow sludge flows from its exposed "
"internal organs to its unhinged jaw where it drips, hissing as it eats "
"through material."
msgstr ""
"Un cadáver bastante mutilado cubierto de llagas abiertas. Los brazos "
"colgantes con manos que se han corroído durante mucho tiempo revelan bordes "
"dentados que podrían perforar fácilmente la carne. Un pegajoso y espumoso "
"cieno amarillo fluye desde sus órganos internos expuestos hasta su mandíbula"
" desquiciada donde gotea, silbando mientras come a través del material."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Animate Arm"
msgid_plural "Animate Arms"
msgstr[0] "Brazo Animado"
msgstr[1] "Brazos Animados"

#. ~ Description for Animate Arm
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dismembered arm that slowly crawls forward.  Occasionally, tentacles "
"sprout out from the wound and lash about wildly."
msgstr ""
"Un brazo desmembrado que se arrastra lentamente hacia adelante. "
"Ocasionalmente, los tentáculos brotan de la herida y golpean salvajemente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dullahan"
msgid_plural "Dullahans"
msgstr[0] "Dullahan"
msgstr[1] "Dullahans"

#. ~ Description for Dullahan
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A headless humanoid that slowly sways.  Ornate and functional armor adorn "
"this dreadful corpse which carries itself with an unerringly terrible "
"steadiness.  A long tentacle has sprouted out of its right arm which "
"occasionally flails about wildly."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide sin cabeza que se balancea lentamente. Una armadura ornamentada"
" y funcional adornan este espantoso cadáver que se sostiene con una "
"estabilidad infaliblemente terrible. Un largo tentáculo ha brotado de su "
"brazo derecho que ocasionalmente se agita salvajemente."

#. ~ Description for shocker zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human body with pale blue flesh, crackling with electrical energy.  It "
"seems eager to tell you something."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo humano de carne azul pálido, chisporroteando con energía "
"eléctrica. Parece ansioso por decirte algo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "mr skeltal"
msgid_plural "mr skeltals"
msgstr[0] "mr skeltal"
msgstr[1] "mr skeltals"

#. ~ Description for mr skeltal
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Devoid entirely of flesh and organs, this walking skeleton rattles you to "
"the bone.  In its bony hand, it holds a pristine trumpet, unmarred by the "
"end of the world."
msgstr ""
"Desprovisto de carne y órganos, este esqueleto andante te hace temblar hasta"
" los huesos. En su mano huesuda, sostiene una trompeta prístina, que no se "
"ha estropeado para el fin del mundo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "minion of skeltal"
msgid_plural "minions of skeltal"
msgstr[0] "secuaz de skeltal"
msgstr[1] "secuaces de skeltal"

#. ~ Description for minion of skeltal
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A lesser skeleton, raised by the forlorn dooting of a trumpet."
msgstr ""
"Un esqueleto menor, levantado por el desamparado sonido de una trompeta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Smoky bear"
msgid_plural "Smoky bears"
msgstr[0] "Osos ahumados"
msgstr[1] "Osos ahumados"

#. ~ Description for Smoky bear
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A smoking husk is all that remains of this once proud bear.  Its black eyes "
"gaze at you with malice… and hunger."
msgstr ""
"Una cáscara humeante es todo lo que queda de este una vez orgulloso oso. Sus"
" ojos negros te miran con malicia... y hambre."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "emissary"
msgid_plural "emissaries"
msgstr[0] "emisario"
msgstr[1] "emisarios"

#. ~ Description for emissary
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A towering, metallic creature with a stunningly beautiful design and "
"brilliantly shining etchings, standing atop three segmented legs.  The "
"tentacles that drift off of its central chassis are tipped with strange "
"looking devices as it strides slowly across the shattered landscape.  This "
"one seems less aggressive than those seen on the front-lines of the Arrival,"
" studying its surroundings and probing things in the environment with a "
"variety of internal tools, though it is infamous for kidnapping anyone it "
"comes across.  A sickeningly sweet gas hangs around it that makes you feel "
"woozy."
msgstr ""
"Una imponente criatura metálica con un diseño asombrosamente bello y "
"grabados brillantes, que se alza sobre tres patas segmentadas. Los "
"tentáculos que se desprenden de su chasis central están provistos de "
"extraños dispositivos mientras avanza lentamente por el paisaje destrozado. "
"Este parece menos agresivo que los que se han visto en las primeras líneas "
"de la llegada, estudiando su entorno y sondeando cosas en el medio ambiente "
"con una variedad de herramientas internas, aunque es infame por secuestrar a"
" cualquiera que se encuentre. Un gas asquerosamente dulce le rodea y te hace"
" sentirte mareado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The emissary emits a stream of sedative gas!"
msgstr "¡El emisario emite un flojo de gas sedante!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "the sound of pressurized gas hissing loudly."
msgstr "el sonido del gas presurizado silbando fuertemente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "a roar!"
msgstr "¡un rugido!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "emissary of pestilence"
msgid_plural "emissaries of pestilence"
msgstr[0] "emisario de pestilencia"
msgstr[1] "emisarios de pestilencia"

#. ~ Description for emissary of pestilence
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A towering, stories-tall metallic creature standing atop three long legs "
"connected to a central chassis.  It would be stunningly beautiful with its "
"glowing golden inlays and celestial design, were it not for the gas that "
"pours from its tentacle-mounted guns that despoil the landscape around it. "
"It makes your skin prickle just looking at its toxic, likely radioactive, "
"glory.  Its hums hauntingly as it moves, its footsteps booming."
msgstr ""
"Una imponente criatura metálica de varios pisos de altura que se alza sobre "
"tres largas patas conectadas a un chasis central. Sería impresionantemente "
"hermosa con sus incrustaciones doradas y su diseño celestial, si no fuera "
"por el gas que sale de sus cañones montados en tentáculos y que despoja el "
"paisaje a su alrededor. Hace que la piel se estremezca con sólo mirar su "
"gloria tóxica, probablemente radiactiva. Su zumbido es inquietante cuando se"
" mueve, con sus pasos retumbando."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Putrid gas rolls across the landscape!"
msgstr "¡El gas pútrido rueda por el paisaje!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "an ominous rumble and hiss of gas."
msgstr "un estruendo ominoso y un silbido de gas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "emissary of flame"
msgid_plural "emissaries of flame"
msgstr[0] "emisario de llama"
msgstr[1] "emisarios de llamas"

#. ~ Description for emissary of flame
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Like all emissaries, this breathtaking metallic creature stands atop three "
"long legs, with many more segmented tentacles emanating from its central "
"chassis and a glowing halo about its head.  This one is far more terrifying "
"than its peers: its claim to fame being some sort of high-intensity energy "
"cannon mounted under its chassis.  Its unique chirping and booming footsteps"
" heralded destruction during the Arrival, and now is no different."
msgstr ""
"Como todos los emisarios, esta impresionante criatura metálica se alza sobre"
" tres largas patas, con muchos más tentáculos segmentados que emanan de su "
"chasis central y un halo brillante alrededor de su cabeza. Este es mucho más"
" aterrador que sus compañeros: su reclamo para la fama es una especie de "
"cañón de energía de alta intensidad montado bajo su chasis. Su singular "
"chirrido y sus estruendosas pisadas anunciaron la destrucción durante la "
"Llegada, y ahora no es diferente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Sound returns as the emissary's cannon roars to life!!"
msgstr "¡El sonido regresa cuando el cañón del emisario ruge a la vida!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "the air pressure suddenly drop as the emissary charges its cannon!"
msgstr ""
"¡la presión del aire cae repentinamente cuando el emisario carga su cañón!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "recycler"
msgid_plural "recyclers"
msgstr[0] "reciclador"
msgstr[1] "recicladores"

#. ~ Description for recycler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sleek mass of hairy tentacles originate from a metallic core that looks "
"like a mix between a garbage disposal and a clamp, golden pinpoints of dim "
"light dotting its chassis.  It seems adept at collecting small pieces of "
"junk and debris to mulch them into their bae parts - you included."
msgstr ""
"Una brillante masa de tentáculos peludos que surge de un núcleo metálico que"
" parece una mezcla entre un triturador de basura y una pinza, con puntos "
"dorados de luz tenue que salpican su chasis. Parece experto en recoger "
"pequeños trozos de chatarra y desechos para convertirlos en sus partes base "
"- tú incluido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "tunneler"
msgid_plural "tunnelers"
msgstr[0] "tuneladora"
msgstr[1] "tuneladoras"

#. ~ Description for tunneler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge creature, encased in metal plating and covered in small golden "
"\"eyes\".  Stocky robotic appendages covering its body allow it to smash "
"through rock and propel itself forward with efficiency.  Its interior seems "
"to have been replaced by some sort of whirring processing equipment that "
"would be highly unpleasant to be caught up in.  Fortunately it doesn't seem "
"immediately interested in you."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme criatura, revestida de placas metálicas y cubierta de pequeños "
"\"ojos\" dorados. Los robustos apéndices robóticos que cubren su cuerpo le "
"permiten atravesar la roca e impulsarse hacia delante con eficacia. Su "
"interior parece haber sido sustituido por una especie de equipo de "
"procesamiento que zumba y en el que sería muy desagradable quedar atrapado. "
"Afortunadamente, no parece estar interesado en ti."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "alien skirmisher"
msgid_plural "alien skirmishers"
msgstr[0] "escaramuzador alienígena"
msgstr[1] "escaramuzadores alienígenas"

#. ~ Description for alien skirmisher
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A slouched bipedal figure, slightly smaller than an average adult human.  "
"Beneath woven full-body combat armor and a full suite of cybernetic "
"modifications are glimpses of rubbery, abscessed flesh.  It is capable of "
"short, boosted jumps using a device on its back, closing gaps to cause havoc"
" with its wicked integrated melee weapons.  Severed organic parts dangle "
"from its equipment, morbid trophies from past battles."
msgstr ""
"Una figura bípeda encorvada, ligeramente más pequeña que un humano adulto "
"medio. Bajo una armadura de combate de cuerpo entero tejida y un conjunto "
"completo de modificaciones cibernéticas, se vislumbra una carne gomosa y con"
" abscesos. Es capaz de realizar saltos cortos e impulsados mediante un "
"dispositivo en su espalda, cerrando brechas para causar estragos con sus "
"malvadas armas cuerpo a cuerpo integradas. De su equipo cuelgan partes "
"orgánicas cortadas, trofeos macabros de batallas pasadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sewer lurker"
msgid_plural "sewer lurkers"
msgstr[0] "merodeador de alcantarila"
msgstr[1] "merodeadores de alcantarila"

#. ~ Description for sewer lurker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dripping creature, a serpentine body with a mass of tentacles attached to "
"a gnashing maw, this thing seems to have found its home among trash and "
"sewage.  It is an ambush predator, preferring to lurk just beneath the "
"cloudy water before something comes close enough to snag with its long "
"tentacles."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura chorreante, un cuerpo serpenteante con una masa de tentáculos "
"unidos a unas fauces que rechinan, esta cosa parece haber encontrado su "
"hogar entre la basura y las aguas residuales. Es un depredador de emboscada,"
" que prefiere acechar justo debajo del agua turbia antes de que algo se "
"acerque lo suficiente como para engancharse con sus largos tentáculos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lurker"
msgid_plural "lurkers"
msgstr[0] "merodeador"
msgstr[1] "merodeadores"

#. ~ Description for lurker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long, serpentine body, dark and murky just like the waters it inhabits.  "
"Tendrils trail behind it, framing innumerable teeth in a gnashing central "
"mouth.  It prefers to lurk just below the surface, drifting and still, like "
"an unassuming piece of flotsam until something gets too close."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo largo y serpenteante, oscuro y turbio como las aguas que habita. "
"Los zarcillos se arrastran detrás de él, enmarcando innumerables dientes en "
"una boca central que cruje. Prefiere acechar justo debajo de la superficie, "
"a la deriva y sin moverse, como una pieza flotante sin pretensiones hasta "
"que algo se acerca."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "moss lizard"
msgid_plural "moss lizards"
msgstr[0] "lagarto de musgo"
msgstr[1] "lagartos de musgo"

#. ~ Description for moss lizard
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cow-sized reptiloid, covered in what appears to be a thick layer of mossy "
"vegetation and rocks.  It trudges about the landscape on sturdy legs, "
"foraging whatever flora it can reach with sharp little teeth.  It doesn't "
"seem to mind you too much."
msgstr ""
"Un reptiloide del tamaño de una vaca, cubierto de lo que parece ser una "
"gruesa capa de vegetación musgosa y rocas. Recorre el paisaje con sus "
"robustas patas, buscando la flora que pueda alcanzar con sus afilados "
"dientes. No pareces importarle demasiado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "pack lizard"
msgid_plural "pack lizards"
msgstr[0] "lagarto de manada"
msgstr[1] "lagartos de manada"

#. ~ Description for pack lizard
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A slim reptiloid about the size of a big dog, with a rather pretty, thick, "
"orange-blue mane of what look like 'feathers' around its head.  Frond-like "
"protrusions grow from the top of its head down to the base of its tail, "
"glowing faintly when in the presence of other members of its pack."
msgstr ""
"Un reptiloide delgado del tamaño de un perro grande, con una melena bastante"
" bonita, gruesa y azul anaranjada de lo que parecen \"plumas\" alrededor de "
"su cabeza. Desde la parte superior de la cabeza hasta la base de la cola "
"crecen unas protuberancias en forma de hoja que brillan débilmente en "
"presencia de otros miembros de su manada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "wisp"
msgid_plural "wisp"
msgstr[0] "fuego fatuo"
msgstr[1] "fuegos fatuo"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'wisp'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, fist sized critter that looks like a floating slug covered in bio-"
"luminescent markings, capable of limited flight through utilization of "
"membranous, winglike protrusions and the secretion of a faint white mist.  "
"It is most commonly found around zipping around flowers, fruits, and other "
"sugary substances in small, communal groups.  It regards you with curiosity,"
" occasionally flashing its markings at you as if trying to communicate."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño bicho del tamaño de un puño que parece una babosa flotante "
"cubierta de marcas bioluminiscentes, capaz de volar de forma limitada "
"mediante la utilización de protuberancias membranosas en forma de alas y la "
"secreción de una tenue niebla blanca. Lo más habitual es encontrarlo "
"revoloteando alrededor de flores, frutas y otras sustancias azucaradas en "
"pequeños grupos comunitarios. Te mira con curiosidad y, de vez en cuando, te"
" muestra sus marcas como si tratara de comunicarse."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bileworm"
msgid_plural "bileworms"
msgstr[0] "gusano biliar"
msgstr[1] "gusanos biliares"

#. ~ Description for bileworm
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large creature that smells like death, befitting its preferred diet of "
"carrion and other rotting organic material, though it may attack wounded "
"prey if pressed.  It is capable of both burrowing and limited land travel, "
"with the help of a multitude of stocky appendages that surround its mouth "
"and line its body."
msgstr ""
"Una gran criatura que huele a muerte, en consonancia con su dieta preferida "
"de carroña y otros materiales orgánicos en descomposición, aunque puede "
"atacar a presas heridas si se le presiona. Es capaz de excavar y de "
"desplazarse por tierra de forma limitada, con la ayuda de una multitud de "
"apéndices robustos que rodean su boca y recubren su cuerpo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "alien dispatch system"
msgid_plural "alien dispatch systems"
msgstr[0] "sistema de despacho alienígena"
msgstr[1] "sistemas de despacho alienígena"

#. ~ Description for alien dispatch system
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A monstrous intelligence, capable of teleporting drones and skirmishers to "
"the planet, or dispatching larger aliens in drop pods."
msgstr ""
"Una inteligencia monstruosa, capaz de teletransportar drones y "
"escaramuzadores al planeta, o de enviar alienígenas más grandes en cápsulas "
"de lanzamiento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "alien surveillance drone"
msgid_plural "alien surveillance drones"
msgstr[0] "dron de vigilancia alienígena"
msgstr[1] "drones de vigilancia alienígena"

#. ~ Description for alien surveillance drone
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, sleek, white-plated robot bearing a golden insignia that is capable"
" of limited flight.  It hovers about the ruins of the former world, onboard "
"cameras and spotlights impartial witness to the chaos around it.  Who knows "
"might be watching on the other side…"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño y elegante robot chapado en blanco con una insignia dorada que es"
" capaz de volar de forma limitada. Sobrevuela las ruinas del antiguo mundo, "
"con cámaras y focos a bordo que son testigos imparciales del caos que lo "
"rodea. Quién sabe si al otro lado habrá alguien observando..."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "alien seeker drone"
msgid_plural "alien seeker drones"
msgstr[0] "dron buscador de alienígena"
msgstr[1] "drones buscadores de alienígena"

#. ~ Description for alien seeker drone
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, sleek, white-plated robot bearing a golden insignia that is capable"
" of limited flight.  It hovers about the ruins of the former world, using a "
"suite of sharp retractable tools, a bright camera flash, and integrated "
"'arms' to manipulate the world around it.  It seems to watch its subjects "
"closely…"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño y elegante robot chapado en blanco con una insignia dorada que es"
" capaz de volar de forma limitada. Se cierne sobre las ruinas del antiguo "
"mundo, utilizando un conjunto de afiladas herramientas retráctiles, un "
"brillante flash de cámara y \"brazos\" integrados para manipular el mundo "
"que le rodea. Parece vigilar de cerca a sus sujetos..."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "alien seeker drone"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "%1$s blinds %3$s with its integrated camera!"
msgstr "¡%1$s ciega a %3$s con su camara integrada!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray"
msgid_plural "strays"
msgstr[0] "abducido"
msgstr[1] "abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A former human; a hateful shadow of its former self capable of violent "
"outbursts of fury.  Large patches of cyan-purple crystals grow out of its "
"bruised flesh, slowly overtaking it."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo humano; una odiosa sombra de su antiguo ser capaz de violentos "
"estallidos de furia. De su carne magullada crecen grandes manchas de "
"cristales cianopúrpura que la van invadiendo poco a poco."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray cop"
msgid_plural "stray cops"
msgstr[0] "policia abducido"
msgstr[1] "policias abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray cop
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A former law enforcer, no doubt deployed to help civilians evacuate during "
"the Arrival.  Unfortunately, despite their best efforts, many were still "
"infested.  It is still clad from head to toe in light body armor, partially "
"overtaken by crystal."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo agente de la ley, sin duda desplegado para ayudar a la evacuación"
" de los civiles durante la Llegada. Por desgracia, a pesar de sus esfuerzos,"
" muchos seguían infestados. Sigue vestido de pies a cabeza con una armadura "
"ligera, parcialmente recubierta de cristal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray soldier"
msgid_plural "stray soldiers"
msgstr[0] "soldado abducido"
msgstr[1] "soldados abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray soldier
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A former soldier, no doubt deployed to assist with evacuations and drive off"
" the aliens, dressed from head to toe in partially crystallized combat "
"armor.  Though their training could not have prepared them for what they "
"were up against, they still seem to remember enough to take you on."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo soldado, sin duda desplegado para ayudar en las evacuaciones y "
"ahuyentar a los alienígenas, vestido de pies a cabeza con una armadura de "
"combate parcialmente cristalizada. Aunque su entrenamiento no pudo haberles "
"preparado para lo que se enfrentaban, parecen recordar lo suficiente como "
"para enfrentarse a ti."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray firefighter"
msgid_plural "stray firefighters"
msgstr[0] "bombero abducido"
msgstr[1] "bomberos abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray firefighter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A former human body clad in tattered first responder gear, wet-sounding "
"breath gurgling through the gas mask encrusted to its face.  Staggering "
"around the community it once served, it is little more than yet another host"
" for the crystal infestation."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo cuerpo humano ataviado con un equipo de primeros auxilios hecho "
"jirones, con un aliento que suena húmedo a través de la máscara de gas "
"incrustada en su cara. Tambaleándose por la comunidad a la que una vez "
"sirvió, es poco más que otro huésped de la infestación de cristales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hungry stray"
msgid_plural "hungry strays"
msgstr[0] "abducido hambriento"
msgstr[1] "abducidos hambrientos"

#. ~ Description for hungry stray
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An obese former human, body studded with irregular crystal growths deforming"
" its body.  It howls in hunger as it wanders, seeking new meals to add to "
"its bulk."
msgstr ""
"Un ex-humano obeso, con el cuerpo tachonado de crecimientos irregulares de "
"cristal que deforman su cuerpo. Aúlla de hambre mientras vaga, buscando "
"nuevas comidas para aumentar su volumen."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray rockfeeder"
msgid_plural "stray rockfeeders"
msgstr[0] "comepiedras abducido"
msgstr[1] "comepiedras abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray rockfeeder
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A swollen and misshapen body pierced from the inside by rocky growths, the "
"lower half of its face nothing a distended jaw full of gnashing, crystalline"
" teeth.  It lets out bloodcurdling howls of pain and constantly drips a "
"foul-smelling slurry of rocky sludge and bile."
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo hinchado y deforme perforado desde el interior por crecimientos "
"rocosos, la mitad inferior de su cara nada una mandíbula distendida llena de"
" dientes crujientes y cristalinos. Suelta espeluznantes aullidos de dolor y "
"gotea constantemente un fangueo maloliente de cieno rocoso y bilis."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray crystaltender"
msgid_plural "stray crystaltenders"
msgstr[0] "cuidador de cristal abducido"
msgstr[1] "cuidadores de cristal abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray crystaltender
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Little more than a mobile mound of crystal and meat that occasionally spits "
"up a tide of glowing, rocky gruel from its many cracks and crevices, this "
"crab-like creature trudges to and fro bearing a heavy burden.  From just "
"behind the murky surfaces of its shell, you can almost make out small, "
"moving creatures skittering about in its complex innards.  It seems to stay "
"close to other crystal creatures, pouring the goop it secretes onto them "
"like some sort of caretaker.  When threatened it is capable of producing "
"harrowing screams, no doubt drawing its friends to its aid."
msgstr ""
"Poco más que un montículo móvil de cristal y carne que, de vez en cuando, "
"escupe una marea de gachas rocosas y brillantes por sus numerosas grietas y "
"hendiduras, esta criatura parecida a un cangrejo va de un lado a otro "
"llevando una pesada carga. Detrás de las turbias superficies de su "
"caparazón, casi se pueden distinguir pequeñas criaturas en movimiento que se"
" mueven en sus complejas entrañas. Parece permanecer cerca de otras "
"criaturas de cristal, vertiendo la sustancia viscosa que segrega sobre ellas"
" como una especie de cuidador. Cuando se ve amenazado, es capaz de producir "
"gritos desgarradores, que sin duda atraen a sus amigos en su ayuda."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crackling stray"
msgid_plural "crackling strays"
msgstr[0] "abducido chisporroteante"
msgstr[1] "abducidos chisporroteantes"

#. ~ Description for crackling stray
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hunched human form, back bristling with a hedge of buzzing blue crystals."
"  Its veins visibly glow with some sort of unearthly substance."
msgstr ""
"Una forma humana encorvada, con la espalda erizada con un seto de cristales "
"azules zumbantes. Sus venas brillan visiblemente con algún tipo de sustancia"
" sobrenatural."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "arcing stray"
msgid_plural "arcing strays"
msgstr[0] "abducido arqueante"
msgstr[1] "abducidos arqueantes"

#. ~ Description for arcing stray
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deformed multi-legged creature, its once terrestrial body now merely a "
"platform for the massive crystalline pylons that jut from its torso where "
"its head once was.  Its arms dangle uselessly at its sides, but it is more "
"than capable of simply ramming its prey to deliver dangerous electric "
"shocks."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura deforme con múltiples patas, su cuerpo, antes terrestre, es "
"ahora una mera plataforma para los enormes pilones cristalinos que "
"sobresalen de su torso donde antes estaba su cabeza. Sus brazos cuelgan "
"inútilmente a los lados, pero es más que capaz de embestir a su presa para "
"administrarle peligrosas descargas eléctricas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray sprinter"
msgid_plural "stray sprinters"
msgstr[0] "velocista abducido"
msgstr[1] " velocistas abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray sprinter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This well-toned, agile former human was once an athletic figure, and appears"
" to have retained some of its wit to boot."
msgstr ""
"Este antiguo humano, ágil y bien tonificado, fue en su día una figura "
"atlética, y parece haber conservado parte de su agudeza para esprintar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray prowler"
msgid_plural "stray prowlers"
msgstr[0] "rondador abducido"
msgstr[1] "rondadores abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray prowler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This tightly-wound mutant now moves like some sort of animal, sometimes on "
"two legs and sometimes on four.  Its mouth gapes menacingly with tusks of "
"polished stone, and its fingers gleam with crystal-fused claws."
msgstr ""
"Este mutante, fuertemente herido, se mueve ahora como una especie de animal,"
" a veces sobre dos patas y a veces sobre cuatro. Su boca se abre "
"amenazadoramente con colmillos de piedra pulida, y sus dedos brillan con "
"garras fundidas en cristal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray guardian"
msgid_plural "stray guardians"
msgstr[0] "guardian abducido"
msgstr[1] "guardianes abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray guardian
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lithe muscle and pulsating crystal fused together into a mass that must be "
"made up of multiple bodies, propelled forward by multiple grossly elongated "
"crystal limbs sharpened to dangerous points.  It strides about the streets, "
"spearing those who dare intrude on its domain like some sort of horrid "
"spider from beyond the stars."
msgstr ""
"Músculos ágiles y cristales palpitantes fusionados en una masa que debe "
"estar formada por varios cuerpos, impulsados por múltiples extremidades de "
"cristal groseramente alargadas y afiladas hasta alcanzar peligrosas puntas. "
"Se pasea por las calles, atravesando con sus lanzas a los que se atreven a "
"invadir sus dominios, como una especie de horrible araña de más allá de las "
"estrellas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray bruiser"
msgid_plural "stray bruisers"
msgstr[0] "musculoso abducido"
msgstr[1] "musculoso abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray bruiser
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A former human, athletic and toned, body girded with thick crystal armor "
"that pulsates as if alive."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo humano, atlético y tonificado, con el cuerpo ceñido por una "
"gruesa armadura de cristal que late como si estuviera vivo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray golem"
msgid_plural "stray golems"
msgstr[0] "golem abducido"
msgstr[1] "golems abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray golem
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human that has grown considerably in stature after absorbing plenty of "
"additional biomass, now at least ten feet tall and covered in rocky plates "
"that make it seem more mineral than human."
msgstr ""
"Un humano que ha crecido considerablemente en estatura tras absorber mucha "
"biomasa adicional, ahora mide al menos tres metros y está cubierto de placas"
" rocosas que lo hacen parecer más mineral que humano."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray titan"
msgid_plural "stray titans"
msgstr[0] "titán abducido"
msgstr[1] "titanes abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray titan
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This towering mass of fused flesh and crystal is humanoid, but its towering "
"height is anything but.  It crushes everything that stands in its way with "
"club-like 'hands' that are even bigger than you are and easily throws aside "
"anything in its way."
msgstr ""
"Esta imponente masa de carne y cristal fusionados es humanoide, pero su "
"enorme altura es todo lo contrario. Aplasta todo lo que se interpone en su "
"camino con unas \"manos\" en forma de garrote que son incluso más grandes "
"que tú, y tira con facilidad todo lo que se interpone."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray waif"
msgid_plural "stray waifs"
msgstr[0] "huérfano abducido"
msgstr[1] "huérfanos abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray waif
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, quick mutant, most likely once a human child, now disfigured by "
"patches of crystal.  Their features are still recognizable enough to make "
"the thought of putting them down cause your gut to churn."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño y rápido mutante, probablemente un niño humano, ahora desfigurado"
" por las manchas de cristal. Sus rasgos siguen siendo lo suficientemente "
"reconocibles como para que la idea de acabar con él haga que se te revuelvan"
" las tripas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray creep"
msgid_plural "stray creeps"
msgstr[0] "arrastrado abducido"
msgstr[1] "arrastrados abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray creep
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A terrifying, hairy husk of a creature scrambling about on all fours, a "
"mongrel house pet or the like covered in patches of crystal growths that jut"
" from it like spikes."
msgstr ""
"Una aterradora y peluda cáscara de una criatura que se desplaza a cuatro "
"patas, un animal doméstico mestizo o algo parecido cubierto de parches de "
"crecimientos de cristal que sobresalen de él como picos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray wretch"
msgid_plural "stray wretches"
msgstr[0] "desdichado abducido"
msgstr[1] "desdichados abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray wretch
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This blur of jagged, crystal-fused limbs and hair could have been anything "
"from a house pet to a human at some point, but now it leaps and skitters "
"around like something out of a nightmare."
msgstr ""
"Esta mancha de miembros y pelos irregulares y fusionados con el cristal "
"podría haber sido cualquier cosa, desde una mascota hasta un humano, pero "
"ahora salta y brinca como algo salido de una pesadilla."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray stalker"
msgid_plural "stray stalkers"
msgstr[0] "acechador abducido"
msgstr[1] "acechadores abducidos"

#. ~ Description for stray stalker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wolf-sized creature made of thick slabs of crystal, small fleshy tendrils "
"drifting off of it like cilia.  It seems more than happy to tear the life "
"out of anything unfortunate enough to cross its path, to drag back to its "
"'family'."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura del tamaño de un lobo hecha de gruesas placas de cristal, con "
"pequeños zarcillos carnosos que se desprenden de ella como cilios. Parece "
"más que feliz de arrancar la vida de cualquier cosa lo suficientemente "
"desafortunada como para cruzarse en su camino, para arrastrarla de vuelta a "
"su \"familia\"."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "flailing wretch"
msgid_plural "flailing wretches"
msgstr[0] "desdichado agitador"
msgstr[1] "desdichados agitadores"

#. ~ Description for flailing wretch
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A person-sized mass of writhing, barbed tendrils that barely seems like it "
"could have once been any terrestrial animal, originating from a barely "
"visible mass of central crystal.  It slithers across the ground, snatching "
"up organic matter to bring back to feed to its smaller companions so that "
"they, too, may grow larger."
msgstr ""
"Una masa del tamaño de una persona, con zarcillos retorcidos y con púas, que"
" apenas parece haber podido ser un animal terrestre, y que se origina en una"
" masa de cristal central apenas visible. Se desliza por el suelo, recogiendo"
" materia orgánica para alimentar a sus compañeros más pequeños para que "
"ellos también crezcan."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crackling wretch"
msgid_plural "crackling wretches"
msgstr[0] "desdichado eléctrico"
msgstr[1] "desdichados eléctricos"

#. ~ Description for crackling wretch
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A flailing mass of tendrils and burnt hair that quickly skitters across the "
"ground like an insect, arched back bristling with loudly arcing crystal "
"spears."
msgstr ""
"Una masa agitada de zarcillos y pelo quemado que se desliza rápidamente por "
"el suelo como un insecto, con la espalda arqueada erizada de lanzas de "
"cristal que lanzan arcos con fuerza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stray wretchmother"
msgid_plural "stray wretchmothers"
msgstr[0] "madre desdichada extraviada"
msgstr[1] "madres desdichadas abducidas"

#. ~ Description for stray wretchmother
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, crystal-packed creature capable of massive, bounding leaps like "
"some sort of alien wolf.  Its topmost layer of crystal sprouts several "
"flailing, fleshy tendrils, which pull anything they can reach into the "
"gnashing maw just under its body.  Something else, just as unseemly, writhes"
" just beneath the murky surface of its glassy body."
msgstr ""
"Una gran criatura repleta de cristales capaz de dar enormes saltos como una "
"especie de lobo alienígena. De su capa superior de cristal brotan varios "
"zarcillos carnosos que arrastran todo lo que pueden alcanzar hacia las "
"fauces que se abren bajo su cuerpo. Algo más, igual de indecoroso, se "
"retuerce justo debajo de la turbia superficie de su cuerpo de cristal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "germinating crystal mass"
msgid_plural "germinating crystal masses"
msgstr[0] "masa de cristales germinantes"
msgstr[1] "masas de cristales germinantes"

#. ~ Description for germinating crystal mass
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A little bulb of crystal rooted into the earth through dirt and concrete "
"alike, noodle-like tendrils squirming across the ground, grabbing any little"
" bit of organic matter it can find and drawing it to its base."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño bulbo de cristal arraigado en la tierra a través de la tierra y "
"el hormigón por igual, con zarcillos en forma de fideos que se retuercen por"
" el suelo, agarrando cualquier pedacito de materia orgánica que pueda "
"encontrar y atrayéndola hacia su base."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "sprouting crystal mass"
msgid_plural "sprouting crystal masses"
msgstr[0] "masa de cristales florecientes"
msgstr[1] "masas de cristales florecientes"

#. ~ Description for sprouting crystal mass
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A human-sized mound of shimmering bluish-purple crystals growing on the base"
" of what looks like a mound of foul smelling garbage and organic leftovers."
"  Long, thin tendrils appear to grow out of the mound, and are subtly "
"rooting down into the ground below it, boring through dirt and concrete "
"alike.  It crackles weakly with electrical energy.  If you look closely, it "
"almost looks like something wet and meaty is squirming just inside the inner"
" shell of crystals…"
msgstr ""
"Un montículo de tamaño humano de brillantes cristales púrpura-azulados crece"
" en la base de lo que parece un montón de basura maloliente y restos "
"orgánicos. Del montículo parecen salir largos y finos zarcillos que se "
"hunden sutilmente en el suelo, perforando tanto la tierra como el hormigón. "
"Crepita débilmente con energía eléctrica. Si se mira de cerca, casi parece "
"que algo húmedo y carnoso se retuerce justo dentro de la cáscara interior de"
" los cristales..."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "resonant crystal mass"
msgid_plural "resonant crystal masses"
msgstr[0] "masa de cristal resonante"
msgstr[1] "masas de cristales resonantes"

#. ~ Description for resonant crystal mass
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of rail-thin crystals growing haphazardly from a mound of rock and "
"composted organic matter, fastened in place by thick strands of bizarre "
"alien material.  The buzzing of natural energy playing among the tines seems"
" to culminate in an almost musical sound.  While pleasant at a distance, "
"this can transform into a deafening, high-pitched whine when it feels "
"threatened."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de cristales delgados como raíles que crecen desordenadamente "
"desde un montículo de roca y materia orgánica compostada, fijados en su "
"lugar por gruesas hebras de un extraño material alienigena. El zumbido de la"
" energía natural que se reproduce entre las púas parece culminar en un "
"sonido casi musical. Aunque es agradable a distancia, puede transformarse en"
" un ensordecedor y agudo quejido cuando se siente amenazado."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "flailing crystal mass"
msgid_plural "flailing crystal masses"
msgstr[0] "masa de cristal agitado"
msgstr[1] "masas de cristales agitados"

#. ~ Description for flailing crystal mass
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall, singular crystal, growing out of a sizable pile of debris that has "
"sprouted a multitude of thin, whip-like tendrils that constantly snake "
"around it like feelers.  It frequently grabs nearby objects and drags them "
"into the pile beneath it, as if hoarding."
msgstr ""
"Un cristal alto y singular, que crece en un considerable montón de escombros"
" del que han brotado multitud de finos zarcillos en forma de látigo que "
"serpentean constantemente a su alrededor como si fueran antenas. Con "
"frecuencia agarra los objetos cercanos y los arrastra hacia el montón que "
"tiene debajo, como si estuviera acaparando."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "energized crystal mass"
msgid_plural "energized crystal masses"
msgstr[0] "masa de cristal energizado"
msgstr[1] "masas de cristales energizados"

#. ~ Description for energized crystal mass
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crooked, fiercely glowing bluish-purple crystal that visibly discharges "
"electricity into the surrounding environment without any discernible intent."
msgstr ""
"Un cristal azulado-púrpura torcido y ferozmente brillante que descarga "
"visiblemente electricidad en el entorno sin ninguna intención discernible."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crystal mass wall"
msgid_plural "crystal mass walls"
msgstr[0] "muro de masa de cristales"
msgstr[1] "muros de masa de cristales"

#. ~ Description for crystal mass wall
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive wall of thick, blocky crystals that glow faintly and crackle with "
"residual electric energy."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme pared de gruesos cristales en forma de bloque que brillan "
"débilmente y crepitan con energía eléctrica residual."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crystal mass hive"
msgid_plural "crystal mass hives"
msgstr[0] "emjambre de masa de cristal"
msgstr[1] "emjambres de masa de cristal"

#. ~ Description for crystal mass hive
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A towering mass of bluish-purple crystal chunks covered in small, fist-sized"
" holes, from which drips a disgusting, faintly glowing rock slurry - perhaps"
" a nutrient mix for its young.  After all, it seems to subtly pulsate, as if"
" more organic than its mineral appearance would suggest.  The air around it "
"perpetually crackles with palpable energy, and it waves a set of thick, "
"meaty tendrils with razor-like barbs through the air, with something else "
"just as unseemly writhing just beneath the murky surface of the glassy "
"'rocks'."
msgstr ""
"Una imponente masa de trozos de cristal azulado-púrpura cubiertos de "
"pequeños agujeros del tamaño de un puño, de los que gotea un repugnante lodo"
" de roca que brilla tenuemente, tal vez una mezcla de nutrientes para sus "
"crías. Al fin y al cabo, parece palpitar sutilmente, como si fuera más "
"orgánico de lo que sugiere su aspecto mineral. El aire que lo rodea crepita "
"perpetuamente con una energía palpable, y agita un conjunto de gruesos y "
"carnosos zarcillos con púas como cuchillas en el aire, con algo igualmente "
"indecoroso retorciéndose justo debajo de la turbia superficie de las "
"\"rocas\" vidriosas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crystal seed"
msgid_plural "crystal seeds"
msgstr[0] "semilla de cristal"
msgstr[1] "semillas de cristal"

#. ~ Description for crystal seed
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tiny, multi-legged creature that appears to be made of a chunk of crystal."
"  It skitters around on wire-like legs, eating bits of organic leftovers.  "
"Possibly to gain mass in hopes of one day seeding a crystal colony of its "
"own."
msgstr ""
"Una diminuta criatura con múltiples patas que parece estar hecha de un trozo"
" de cristal. Se desliza sobre patas de alambre, comiendo trozos de restos "
"orgánicos. Posiblemente para ganar masa con la esperanza de sembrar algún "
"día una colonia de cristal propia."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "engorged crystal seed"
msgid_plural "engorged crystal seeds"
msgstr[0] "semilla de cristal abultada"
msgstr[1] "semillas de cristal abultadas"

#. ~ Description for engorged crystal seed
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A swollen crystal seed, now grown to about the size of a cat, heavy enough "
"with accumulated biomass to settle down and begin germinating into a proper "
"crystal mass."
msgstr ""
"Una semilla de cristal hinchada, ahora del tamaño de un gato, lo "
"suficientemente pesada con la biomasa acumulada como para asentarse y "
"empezar a germinar en una masa de cristal propiamente dicha."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Coelophysis"
msgid_plural "Coelophysis"
msgstr[0] "celófisis"
msgstr[1] "celófisis"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Coelophysis'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small, thin predatory bipedal dinosaur with a long head and sharp teeth and "
"long grasping claws."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño y delgado dinosaurio bípedo depredador con una cabeza larga, dientes"
" afilados y largas garras de agarre."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dilophosaurus"
msgid_plural "Dilophosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Dilophosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Dilophosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Dilophosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A medium dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony crests on its "
"head."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio mediano con dientes afilados y dos prominentes crestas óseas "
"en la cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Ceratosaurus"
msgid_plural "Ceratosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Ceratosaurio"
msgstr[1] "Ceratosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Ceratosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, fast predatory bipedal dinosaur, decorated with three colorful "
"horns on its head and dotted with bright skin bones with long sharp teeth "
"and a long flexible tail."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo depredador, grande y rápido, decorado con tres cuernos "
"de colores en la cabeza y salpicado de huesos de piel brillante con dientes "
"largos y afilados y una cola larga y flexible."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Spinosaurus"
msgid_plural "Spinosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Espinosaurio"
msgstr[1] "Espinosaurios"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Spinosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meet the king of the river, a huge dinosaur about the size of a small house,"
" with a ferocious crocodile-like head and a sail on its back.  Usually feeds"
" on fish."
msgstr ""
"Conoce al rey del río, un enorme dinosaurio del tamaño de una casa pequeña, "
"con una feroz cabeza de cocodrilo y una vela en la espalda. Suele "
"alimentarse de peces."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Allosaurus"
msgid_plural "Allosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Allosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Allosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Allosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large predatory bipedal dinosaur, with tiger-like stripes on its broad "
"back."
msgstr ""
"Un gran dinosaurio bípedo depredador, con rayas como las de un tigre en su "
"ancha espalda."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Acrocanthosaurus"
msgid_plural "Acrocanthosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Acrocanthosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Acrocanthosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Acrocanthosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge predatory bipedal dinosaur with a tall ridge running the length of its "
"back covered with heavy muscles.  Its teeth are curved and serrated like "
"sawblades."
msgstr ""
"Enorme dinosaurio bípedo depredador con una alta cresta a lo largo de su "
"espalda cubierta de pesados músculos. Sus dientes son curvos y dentados como"
" hojas de sierra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Siats"
msgid_plural "Siats"
msgstr[0] "Siats"
msgstr[1] "Siats"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Siats'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge predatory bipedal dinosaur with long claws and strong arms for "
"grappling."
msgstr ""
"Enorme dinosaurio bípedo depredador con largas garras y fuertes brazos para "
"agarrar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Tyrannosaurus rex"
msgid_plural "Tyrannosaurus rex"
msgstr[0] "Tyrannosaurus rex"
msgstr[1] "Tyrannosaurus rex"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Tyrannosaurus rex'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Enormous teeth in a massive jaw, fierce eyes and a powerful frame to drive "
"it forward."
msgstr ""
"Dientes enormes en una mandíbula maciza, ojos fieros y una estructura "
"poderosa para impulsarla."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Albertosaurus"
msgid_plural "Albertosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Albertosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Albertosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Albertosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Looks like a smaller tyrannosaurus rex, but those arms are much longer"
msgstr ""
"Parece un tiranosaurio rex más pequeño, pero esos brazos son mucho más "
"largos"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Compsognathus"
msgid_plural "Compsognathus"
msgstr[0] "Compsognathus"
msgstr[1] "Compsognathus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Compsognathus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fast moving bipedal dinosaur about the size of a turkey.  Its teeth and "
"claws are small but sharp."
msgstr ""
"Dinosaurio bípedo de movimientos rápidos del tamaño de un pavo. Sus dientes "
"y garras son pequeños pero afilados."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Gallimimus"
msgid_plural "Gallimimus"
msgstr[0] "Gallimimus"
msgstr[1] "Gallimimus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Gallimimus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur, standing as tall as a human.  It looks "
"somewhat like a reptilian ostrich."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo con plumas, parado es tan alto como un humano. Parece "
"una avestruz reptiliana."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Velociraptor"
msgid_plural "Velociraptors"
msgstr[0] "Velociraptor"
msgstr[1] "Velociraptors"

#. ~ Description for Velociraptor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers.  Small, hooked claws emerge "
"from its feet and hands."
msgstr ""
"Es un pequeño dinosaurio bípedo cubierto con plumas. Unas garras pequeñas y "
"en forma de gancho le salen de las patas inferiores y superiores."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Nothronychus"
msgid_plural "Nothronychus"
msgstr[0] "Nothronychus"
msgstr[1] "Nothronychus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Nothronychus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large feathered bipedal dinosaur with a pot-bellied stomach and a long "
"neck.  Sharp claws extend from its dextrous hands."
msgstr ""
"Un gran dinosaurio bípedo emplumado con barriga y cuello largo. De sus manos"
" diestras salen afiladas garras."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Deinonychus"
msgid_plural "Deinonychus"
msgstr[0] "Deinonychus"
msgstr[1] "Deinonychus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Deinonychus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A medium-sized bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers.  At the end of each "
"foot is a large sickle-like claw."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo de tamaño medio cubierto con plumas. En la punta de "
"cada pata tiene una garra grande como una hoz."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Utahraptor"
msgid_plural "Utahraptors"
msgstr[0] "Utahraptor"
msgstr[1] "Utahraptor"

#. ~ Description for Utahraptor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large bipedal dinosaur with feathered arms, a long tail, and scythe-like "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"Un gran dinosaurio bípedo con plumas en las patas superiores, una cola "
"larga, y garras como hoces."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Eoraptor"
msgid_plural "Eoraptors"
msgstr[0] "Eoraptor"
msgstr[1] "Eoraptors"

#. ~ Description for Eoraptor
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bipedal dinosaur about the size of a chicken.  It darts around quickly and"
" has long arms for grabbing what it desires.  It's holding something."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo del tamaño de un pollo. Se mueve rápidamente y tiene "
"brazos largos para agarrar lo que desea. Está sosteniendo algo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Apatosaurus"
msgid_plural "Apatosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Apatosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Apatosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Apatosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a long, whip-like tail.  The"
" head is upright and the neck looks like it would make a good strong club."
msgstr ""
"Dinosaurio masivo, de cuello largo y cuatro patas, con una cola larga como "
"un látigo. La cabeza está erguida y el cuello parece que sería un buen palo "
"fuerte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Brontosaurus"
msgid_plural "Brontosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Brontosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Brontosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Brontosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with bulky torso and long, whip-"
"like tail."
msgstr ""
"Dinosaurio masivo, de cuello largo y cuatro patas, con un torso voluminoso y"
" una cola larga como un látigo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Diplodocus"
msgid_plural "Diplodocus"
msgstr[0] "Diplodocus"
msgstr[1] "Diplodocus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Diplodocus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Huge, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with a long, whip-like tail."
msgstr ""
"Enorme dinosaurio cuadrúpedo de cuello largo con una larga cola en forma de "
"látigo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Camarasaurus"
msgid_plural "Camarasaurus"
msgstr[0] "Camarasaurus"
msgstr[1] "Camarasaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Camarasaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Huge four-legged dinosaur with a square head and a shorter neck and tail "
"than similar dinosaurs."
msgstr ""
"Enorme dinosaurio cuadrúpedo con cabeza cuadrada y cuello y cola más cortos "
"que otros dinosaurios similares."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Brachiosaurus"
msgid_plural "Brachiosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Brachiosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Brachiosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Brachiosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Massive, long-necked, four-legged dinosaur with longer forelegs and a whip-"
"like tail."
msgstr ""
"Dinosaurio masivo, de cuello largo y cuatro patas, con patas delanteras más "
"largas y una cola en forma de látigo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Alamosaurus"
msgid_plural "Alamosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Alamosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Alamosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Alamosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Gigantic four-legged dinosaur with a long neck and spiked tail protected by "
"natural bone armor."
msgstr ""
"Gigantesco dinosaurio cuadrúpedo con un largo cuello y una cola puntiaguda "
"protegidos por una armadura ósea natural."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Scutellosaurus"
msgid_plural "Scutellosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Scutellosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Scutellosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Scutellosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small, four-legged dinosaur with five rows of protective plates running down"
" its back."
msgstr ""
"Pequeño dinosaurio cuadrúpedo con cinco filas de placas protectoras a lo "
"largo de su espalda."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Stegosaurus"
msgid_plural "Stegosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Stegosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Stegosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Stegosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large slow quadruped dinosaur with plates on its back, and a spiked tail."
msgstr ""
"Un gran dinosaurio cuadrúpedo lento con placas en la espalda y una cola con "
"púas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dyoplosaurus"
msgid_plural "Dyoplosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Dyoplosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Dyoplosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Dyoplosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This armored dinosaur looks like a giant prehistoric armadillo.  Its tail "
"ends in a spiked club of bone."
msgstr ""
"Un gran dinosaurio cuadrúpedo lento con placas en la espalda y una cola con "
"púas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Ankylosaurus"
msgid_plural "Ankylosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Ankylosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Ankylosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Ankylosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This armored dinosaur looks like a giant prehistoric armadillo.  Its tail "
"ends in a massive spiked club of bone."
msgstr ""
"Este dinosaurio acorazado parece un gigantesco armadillo prehistórico. Su "
"cola termina en un enorme garrote de hueso con púas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Nodosaurus"
msgid_plural "Nodosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Nodosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Nodosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Nodosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This heavily armored dinosaur looks like a giant prehistoric armadillo."
msgstr ""
"Este dinosaurio fuertemente blindado parece un armadillo prehistórico "
"gigante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Edmontonia"
msgid_plural "Edmontonia"
msgstr[0] "Edmontonia"
msgstr[1] "Edmontonia"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Edmontonia'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This heavily armored dinosaur looks like a giant prehistoric armadillo with "
"long bony spikes."
msgstr ""
"Este dinosaurio fuertemente acorazado parece un gigantesco armadillo "
"prehistórico con largas púas óseas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Camptosaurus"
msgid_plural "Camptosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Camptosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Camptosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Camptosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large feathered bipedal dinosaur with strong legs, broad shoulders and a "
"pointed beak.  It moves slowly but with enormous strength."
msgstr ""
"Un gran dinosaurio bípedo emplumado con patas fuertes, hombros anchos y un "
"pico puntiagudo. Se mueve lentamente pero con una enorme fuerza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Parasaurolophus"
msgid_plural "Parasaurolophus"
msgstr[0] "Parasaurolophus"
msgstr[1] "Parasaurolophus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Parasaurolophus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A huge mottled dinosaur with a blunt head crest."
msgstr "Un enorme dinosaurio moteado con una cresta de cabeza roma."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Maiasaura"
msgid_plural "Maiasaura"
msgstr[0] "Maiasaura"
msgstr[1] "Maiasaura"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Maiasaura'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with hooves and heavy tail.  Has a flat beak, thick "
"nose, and small spiky head crest."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio escamoso con pezuñas y cola pesada. Tiene un pico "
"plano, una nariz gruesa y una pequeña cresta en la cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Corythosaurus"
msgid_plural "Corythosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Corythosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Corythosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Corythosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge scaly dinosaur with a thick neck and tail and hooves.  Has a short "
"beak and a tall head crest."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio escamoso con un grueso cuello y cola y pezuñas. Tiene "
"un pico corto y una cresta alta en la cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Edmontosaurus"
msgid_plural "Edmontosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Edmontosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Edmontosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Edmontosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A huge scaly dinosaur with a broad toothless beak."
msgstr "Un enorme dinosaurio escamoso con un amplio pico sin dientes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pachycephalosaurus"
msgid_plural "Pachycephalosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Pachycephalosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Pachycephalosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Pachycephalosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur, standing as tall as a human.  It looks like a "
"reptilian ostrich with a round hard-looking domed head."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo emplumado, con la altura de un ser humano. Parece un "
"avestruz reptiliano con una cabeza redonda y abovedada de aspecto duro."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pachyrhinosaurus"
msgid_plural "Pachyrhinosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Pachyrhinosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Pachyrhinosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Pachyrhinosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a bony crest from which two curved horns "
"and a broad bony nose emerge."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio con aspecto de rinoceronte con una cresta ósea de la "
"que salen dos cuernos curvados y una amplia nariz ósea."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pentaceratops"
msgid_plural "Pentaceratops"
msgstr[0] "Pentaceratops"
msgstr[1] "Pentaceratops"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Pentaceratops'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a tall bony crest from which four long "
"horns and a short nose horn emerge."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio con aspecto de rinoceronte con una alta cresta ósea de "
"la que salen cuatro largos cuernos y un corto cuerno nasal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Torosaurus"
msgid_plural "Torosaurus"
msgstr[0] "Torosaurus"
msgstr[1] "Torosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Torosaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a tall bony crest from which two long "
"wicked horns emerge."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio parecido a un rinoceronte con una alta cresta ósea de "
"la que salen dos largos y malvados cuernos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Triceratops"
msgid_plural "Triceratops"
msgstr[0] "Triceratops"
msgstr[1] "Triceratops"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Triceratops'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive rhino-like dinosaur with a bony crest from which three large horns"
" emerge."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio enorme con similitudes al rinoceronte, con una cresta de "
"huesos de la que le salen tres cuernos grandes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dimorphodon"
msgid_plural "Dimorphodon"
msgstr[0] "Dimorphodon"
msgstr[1] "Dimorphodon"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Dimorphodon'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A feathered flying reptile over three feet long, with short wings and a big "
"colorful beak."
msgstr ""
"Un reptil volador emplumado de más de un metro de largo, con alas cortas y "
"un gran pico colorido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pteranodon"
msgid_plural "Pteranodon"
msgstr[0] "Pteranodont"
msgstr[1] "Pteranodont"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Pteranodon'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large feathered flying reptile, with a long pointed toothless beak and a "
"long pointy head crest."
msgstr ""
"Un gran reptil volador emplumado, con un pico largo y puntiagudo sin dientes"
" y una larga cresta puntiaguda en la cabeza."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Quetzalcoatlus"
msgid_plural "Quetzalcoatlus"
msgstr[0] "Quetzalcoatlus"
msgstr[1] "Quetzalcoatlus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Quetzalcoatlus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge feathered flying reptile, with a long pointed toothless beak and a "
"long stiff neck."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme reptil volador emplumado, con un pico largo y puntiagudo sin "
"dientes y un cuello largo y rígido."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Mosasaurus"
msgid_plural "Mosasaurus"
msgstr[0] "Mosasaurus"
msgstr[1] "Mosasaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Mosasaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge aquatic dinosaur about the size of a small house, with a ferocious "
"crocodile-like head and powerful swimming fins."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio acuático del tamaño de una casa pequeña, con una feroz "
"cabeza de cocodrilo y poderosas aletas para nadar."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Qianzhousaurus"
msgid_plural "Qianzhousaurus"
msgstr[0] "Qianzhousaurus"
msgstr[1] "Qianzhousaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Qianzhousaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also known as pinnochio rex, this bipedal dinosaur is slower than most and "
"covered in fur, it also looks very hungry."
msgstr ""
"También conocido como Pinocho Rex, este dinosaurio bípedo es más lento que "
"la mayoría y está cubierto de pelaje, además parece muy hambriento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Kosmoceratops"
msgid_plural "Kosmoceratops"
msgstr[0] "Kosmoceratops"
msgstr[1] "Kosmoceratops"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Kosmoceratops'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cousin of the Triceratops, This beast has returned from extinction, and "
"although it's a herbivore it can do alot of damage when angered."
msgstr ""
"Primo del Triceratops, esta bestia ha vuelto de la extinción, y aunque es un"
" herbívoro puede hacer mucho daño cuando se enfada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Amargasaurus"
msgid_plural "Amargasaurus"
msgstr[0] "Amargasaurus"
msgstr[1] "Amargasaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Amargasaurus'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A herbivourous sauropod from the cretaceous, it seems to pose little threat "
"to you."
msgstr ""
"Un saurópodo herbívoro del cretáceo, que no parece suponer una amenaza para "
"ti."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Gallimimus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Gallimimus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador Gallimimus"
msgstr[1] "bio-operador Gallimimus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Gallimimus bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fast-moving feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  Its"
" curved claws glow menacingly."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo emplumado que se desplaza rápidamente y está salpicado "
"de biónica crepitante. Sus garras curvadas brillan amenazadoramente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Pachy bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Pachy bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador Pachy"
msgstr[1] "bio-operador Pachy"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Pachy bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics and sporting a "
"round hard-looking domed head.  Its curved claws glow menacingly."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo emplumado salpicado de biónica crepitante y con una "
"cabeza redonda y abovedada de aspecto duro. Sus garras curvadas brillan "
"amenazadoramente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Triceratops bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Triceratops bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador Triceratops"
msgstr[1] "bio-operador Triceratops"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Triceratops bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive three-horned four-legged dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  "
"The horns glow menacingly."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio de tres cuernos y cuatro patas salpicado de biónica "
"crepitante. Los cuernos brillan amenazadoramente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Velociraptor bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Velociraptor bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador Velociraptor"
msgstr[1] "bio-operador Velociraptor"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Velociraptor bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small feathered bipedal dinosaur dotted with crackling bionics.  Its "
"small, hooked claws glow menacingly."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño dinosaurio bípedo emplumado salpicado de biónica crepitante. Sus "
"pequeñas garras ganchudas brillan amenazadoramente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Deinonychus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Deinonychus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador Deinonychus"
msgstr[1] "bio-operador Deinonychus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Deinonychus bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bipedal dinosaur covered with feathers and crackling bionics.  Each foot "
"has a large glowing sickle-like claw."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio bípedo cubierto de plumas y biónica crepitante. Cada pie tiene"
" una gran garra brillante en forma de hoz."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Dimorphodon bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Dimorphodon bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador Dimorphodon"
msgstr[1] "bio-operador Dimorphodon"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Dimorphodon bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A feathered flying reptile with short wings dotted with crackling bionics "
"and a colorful glowing beak."
msgstr ""
"Un reptil volador emplumado con alas cortas salpicadas de biónicos "
"crepitantes y un colorido pico brillante."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Spinosaurus bio-operator"
msgid_plural "Spinosaurus bio-operator"
msgstr[0] "bio-operador Spinosaurus"
msgstr[1] "bio-operador Spinosaurus"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'Spinosaurus bio-operator'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive therapod with a huge fin on its back and a crocodile-like snout.  "
"It is silver from armor plating and cybernetics crackle all over its body.  "
"There seems to be a laser rifle mounted to its head.  It scans endlessly for"
" its next target."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme terápodo con una enorme aleta en la espalda y un hocico de "
"cocodrilo. Es plateado por el blindaje y la cibernética cruje por todo su "
"cuerpo. Parece tener un rifle láser montado en la cabeza. Busca sin cesar su"
" próximo objetivo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
