#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal Dilophosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "fungal Dilophosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "zombi Dilophosaurus fúngico"
msgstr[1] "zombis Dilophosaurus fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal Dilophosaurus zombie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once a predator dinosaur with sharp teeth and two prominent bony crests on "
"its head, fungal tendrils now sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other "
"orifices, holding together a shambling mass of mold-covered flesh with a "
"colorful frill of interwoven mushrooms."
msgstr ""
"Un dinosaurio depredador con dientes afilados y dos prominentes crestas "
"óseas en la cabeza, al que ahora le brotan zarcillos de hongos de la boca, "
"los ojos y otros orificios, que mantiene unida una masa de carne cubierta de"
" moho con una colorida franja de hongos entrelazados."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal zombie dragon"
msgid_plural "fungal zombie dragons"
msgstr[0] "dragón zombi fúngico"
msgstr[1] "dragones zombis fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal zombie dragon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Once an enormous, scaly dinosaur studded with bony spikes with colorful "
"horns, fungal tendrils now sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, "
"holding together a shambling mass of mold-covered scales and spikes."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme dinosaurio escamoso tachonado de púas óseas con cuernos de "
"colores, al que ahora le salen zarcillos de hongos de la boca, los ojos y "
"otros orificios, que mantienen unida una masa tambaleante de escamas y púas "
"cubiertas de moho."

