"weapon mount."
msgstr ""
"Un vehículo terrestre no tripulado TALON equipado con un lanzagranadas de "
"revólver. Es un pequeño UGV de orugas con un conjunto de motores y sensores "
"que cubren la montura de su arma."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "animated blade"
msgid_plural "animated blades"
msgstr[0] "hoja animada"
msgstr[1] "hojas animadas"

#. ~ Description for animated blade
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A conjured glowing longsword that darts and dodges around, slicing and "
"cutting your foes into small pieces."
msgstr ""
"Una espada larga y brillante que se lanza y esquiva, rebanando y cortando a "
"tus enemigos en pequeños trozos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Ogre"
msgid_plural "Ogres"
msgstr[0] "Ogro"
msgstr[1] "Ogros"

#. ~ Description for Ogre
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A green beast known for living in swamps and eating humans; it will kill "
"anything it gets its hands on."
msgstr ""
"Una bestia verde conocida por vivir en los pantanos y comer humanos; matará "
"cualquier cosa que tenga en sus manos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Orc Warrior"
msgid_plural "Orc Warriors"
msgstr[0] "Guerrero Orco"
msgstr[1] "Guerreros Orcos"

#. ~ Description for Orc Warrior
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This green brute is a orc warrior.  It stares at you menacingly, sword in "
"hand."
msgstr ""
"Esta bestia verde es un guerrero orco. Te mira amenazante, espada en mano."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "orc archer"
msgid_plural "orc archers"
msgstr[0] "arquero orco"
msgstr[1] "arqueros orcos"

#. ~ Description for orc archer
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This green brute is a orc archer.  It looks at you with a bow in hand and "
"smiles silently as it aims at you."
msgstr ""
"Este bestia verde es un arquero orco. Te mira con un arco en la mano y "
"sonríe en silencio mientras te apunta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The orc shoots you with laser accuracy"
msgstr "El orco te dispara con precisión láser"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "grunting"
msgstr "gruñendo"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Blood Orc"
msgid_plural "Blood Orcs"
msgstr[0] "Orco de Sangre"
msgstr[1] "Orcos de Sangre"

#. ~ Description for Blood Orc
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This bloody red brute is a orc warrior.  He stares at you menacingly, weapon"
" in hand; this one seems to have bathed himself in the blood of his enemies."
msgstr ""
"Esta sangrienta bestia roja es un guerrero orco. Te mira amenazante, arma en"
" mano; esta parece haberse bañado en la sangre de sus enemigos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "demon spiderling"
msgid_plural "demon spiderlings"
msgstr[0] "arañita demoníaca"
msgstr[1] "arañitas demoníacas"

#. ~ Description for demon spiderling
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite it being the size of a small dog, you can tell this is a very young "
"spider.  Its red color is why you gave it this name; you have never seen "
"this creature before the Cataclysm.  It is quick, and its large fangs drip "
"with venom."
msgstr ""
"A pesar de que es del tamaño de un perro pequeño, se puede decir que es una "
"araña muy joven. Su color rojo es la razón por la que le dio este nombre; "
"nunca ha visto a esta criatura antes del Cataclismo. Es rápida, y sus "
"grandes colmillos gotean veneno."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "demon spider"
msgid_plural "demon spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña demoníaca"
msgstr[1] "arañas demoníacas"

#. ~ Description for demon spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This spider is the size of a car.  Its huge compound eyes seem to be "
"infinite pools of blackness that seem to suck the light out of the air.  Its"
" maroon carapace is studded with wicked-looking spikes that drip with some "
"kind of viscous black liquid that sizzles when it touches the ground."
msgstr ""
"Esta araña es del tamaño de un coche. Sus enormes ojos compuestos parecen "
"ser infinitos charcos de oscuridad que parecen absorber la luz del aire. Su "
"caparazón granate está tachonado con púas de aspecto malvado que gotean con "
"algún tipo de líquido negro viscoso que chisporrotea cuando toca el suelo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "demon spider queen"
msgid_plural "demon spider queens"
msgstr[0] "reina araña demoníaca"
msgstr[1] "reinas arañas demoníacas"

#. ~ Description for demon spider queen
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This gigantic spider is the size of a moving van: you have no idea how it "
"manages to stay together, much less move with that bulk.  Its abdomen is "
"huge and swollen-looking, and an evil intelligence burns in its eyes even as"
" magic crackles around its chitinous barbs."
msgstr ""
"Esta gigantesca araña es del tamaño de un camión de mudanzas: no tienes ni "
"idea de cómo se las arregla para mantenerse unida, y mucho menos para "
"moverse con ese bulto. Su abdomen es enorme y de aspecto hinchado, y una "
"inteligencia malvada arde en sus ojos incluso cuando la magia crepita "
"alrededor de sus púas quitadas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black dragon wyrmling"
msgid_plural "black dragon wyrmlings"
msgstr[0] "wyrmling dragón negro "
msgstr[1] "wyrmlings dragón negro "

#. ~ Description for black dragon wyrmling
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a small black dragon, less than five years old.  Its scales are "
"glossy, and its horns barely peek out of its head.  Even from one so young, "
"you see the glint of sadism in its eyes."
msgstr ""
"Este es un pequeño dragón negro, de menos de cinco años. Sus escamas son "
"brillantes y sus cuernos apenas se asoman por su cabeza. Incluso desde tan "
"joven, se ve el brillo del sadismo en sus ojos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "young black dragon"
msgid_plural "young black dragons"
msgstr[0] " dragón negro joven"
msgstr[1] " dragones negros jóvenes"

#. ~ Description for young black dragon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This black dragon appears to still be in the early stages of life.  Its eyes"
" have just started to sink in its sockets, and its curved, segmented horns "
"have just begun to darken at the tips.  You can tell just by looking at it, "
"this creature is evil to its very core.  Even though this dragon is not "
"fully grown, it is the size of a full-grown bull."
msgstr ""
"Este dragón negro parece estar todavía en las primeras etapas de la vida. "
"Sus ojos acaban de empezar a hundirse en sus órbitas, y sus cuernos curvos y"
" segmentados acaban de empezar a oscurecerse en las puntas. Se puede decir "
"con sólo mirarlo, que esta criatura es malvada hasta la médula. Aunque este "
"dragón no ha crecido completamente, es del tamaño de un toro adulto."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "adult black dragon"
msgid_plural "adult black dragons"
msgstr[0] "dragón negro adulto"
msgstr[1] "dragones negros adultos"

#. ~ Description for adult black dragon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A black-scaled monstrosity with deep-set eye sockets glowing green with "
"evil.  Its face and skull appear skeletal, and acid drips from its dagger-"
"like jaws."
msgstr ""
"Una monstruosidad de escala negra con cuencas oculares profundas que brillan"
" en verde con el mal. Su cara y su cráneo parecen esqueléticos, y el ácido "
"gotea de sus mandíbulas en forma de daga."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "forge born"
msgid_plural "forge borns"
msgstr[0] "forja nacida"
msgstr[1] "forjas nacidas"

#. ~ Description for forge born
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The most elaborate, gaudy and overwrought clockwork creature that you've "
"ever seen.  Each one has its face designed in a mask displaying a single "
"emotion.  Blades extend from the wrists in combat."
msgstr ""
"La criatura de relojería más elaborada, llamativa y recargada que jamás haya"
" visto. Cada uno tiene su cara diseñada en una máscara que muestra una sola "
"emoción. Las cuchillas se extienden desde las muñecas en el combate."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "goblin forgemaster"
msgid_plural "goblin forgemasters"
msgstr[0] "maestro de forja goblin"
msgstr[1] "maestros de forja goblin"

#. ~ Description for goblin forgemaster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A goblin like none you've ever seen before.  He directs workers and "
"automatons with confidence and style."
msgstr ""
"Un goblin como ninguno que hayas visto antes. Dirige a trabajadores y "
"autómatas con seguridad y estilo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lizardfolk forgemaster"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk forgemasters"
msgstr[0] "maestro de forja lagarto"
msgstr[1] "maestros de forja lagarto"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk forgemaster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk rarely live outside of their tribes.  This one has found freedom "
"and purpose beyond serving their draconic masters."
msgstr ""
"La raza lagarto rara vez vive fuera de sus tribus. Este ha encontrado la "
"libertad y el propósito más allá de servir a sus amos dracónicos."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gracken forgemaster"
msgid_plural "gracken forgemasters"
msgstr[0] "maestro de forja gracken"
msgstr[1] "maestros de forja gracken"

#. ~ Description for gracken forgemaster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is some form of eldritch monstrosity; an uncouth black being with "
"smooth, oily, skin and unpleasant horns that curve inward toward each other."
"  Tall and thin, the shadows cling unnaturally to its vaguely defined "
"humanoid form as it shuffles along, its hands twitching and spasming so "
"rapidly as to appear a little more than a black blur of claws.  This one "
"politely asks you to mind your step as this is a working environment."
msgstr ""
"Esto es de alguna forma de monstruosidad de otro mundo; un ser negro y tosco"
" con una piel suave y aceitosa y unos desagradables cuernos que se curvan "
"hacia dentro. Alto y delgado, las sombras se adhieren de forma antinatural a"
" su forma humanoide vagamente definida mientras arrastra los pies, sus manos"
" se mueven y hacen espasmos tan rápidamente que parecen poco más que un "
"borrón negro de garras. Éste le pide amablemente que tenga cuidado con sus "
"pasos, ya que se trata de un entorno de trabajo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "forge demon"
msgid_plural "forge demons"
msgstr[0] "demonio de forja"
msgstr[1] "demonios de forja"

#. ~ Description for forge demon
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The first thing you notice is that this creature has five arms.  The next is"
" that it walks on three legs.  It walks amongst the vault until it notices "
"you then throws itself at the walls screaming bloody murder.  Its mere "
"presence fills you with an unfathomable dread."
msgstr ""
"Lo primero que se observa es que esta criatura tiene cinco brazos. Lo "
"siguiente es que camina sobre tres patas. Camina entre la bóveda hasta que "
"se percata de tu presencia y luego se lanza contra las paredes gritando una "
"barbaridad. Su mera presencia te llena de un miedo insondable."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "forge worker"
msgid_plural "forge workers"
msgstr[0] "trabajador de forja"
msgstr[1] "trabajadores de forja"

#. ~ Description for forge worker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A squat humanoid that looks quite sturdily built.  They style their hair in "
"mohawks and other strange fashions that seem to be dictated by what parts of"
" their skin aren't scarred from burns.  Their clothes are designed to "
"protect them from the intense environment they work in."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide achaparrado que parece bastante robusto. Se peinan con mohawks "
"y otras modas extrañas que parecen estar dictadas por las partes de su piel "
"que no están marcadas por las quemaduras. Sus ropas están diseñadas para "
"protegerlos del intenso ambiente en el que trabajan."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "forge hounds"
msgid_plural "forge hounds"
msgstr[0] "perro forja"
msgstr[1] "perros forja"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'forge hounds'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metallic hound steps out of a nearby angle and growls at you.  Run!!!"
msgstr "Un perro metálico sale de un ángulo cercano y te gruñe. ¡¡Corre!!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "goblin warrior"
msgid_plural "goblin warriors"
msgstr[0] "guerrero goblin"
msgstr[1] "guerreros goblin"

#. ~ Description for goblin warrior
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This short humanoid is covered in filth and shouts slurs at you as it "
"brandishes a cudgel."
msgstr ""
"Este humanoide de baja estatura está cubierto de suciedad y te grita "
"insultos mientras blande una porra."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "goblin slinger"
msgid_plural "goblin slingers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de honda goblin"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de honda goblin"

#. ~ Description for goblin slinger
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ugly creature that slings rocks almost as well as it slings insults."
msgstr "Una criatura fea que lanza rocas casi tan bien como insulta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The goblin slings a rock at you!"
msgstr "¡El duende te lanza una piedra!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "goblin chieftain"
msgid_plural "goblin chieftains"
msgstr[0] "jefe goblin"
msgstr[1] "jefes goblin"

#. ~ Description for goblin chieftain
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ugly creature that was promoted to chieftain because it figured out which"
" end of the weapon is pointy."
msgstr ""
"Una criatura fea que fue ascendida a jefe porque descubrió qué extremo del "
"arma es puntiagudo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "clay golem"
msgid_plural "clay golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de arcilla"
msgstr[1] "golems de arcilla"

#. ~ Description for clay golem
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from clay.  Its proportions are off and it "
"seems fragile."
msgstr ""
"Un gran golem humanoide hecho de arcilla. Sus proporciones no son las "
"adecuadas y parece frágil."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "plastic golem"
msgid_plural "plastic golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de plástico"
msgstr[1] "golems de plástico"

#. ~ Description for plastic golem
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Traditionally, making a golem is a months-long process involving hand tools "
"and precision craftsmanship.  A stone golem is as much a work of art as it "
"is a magical device.  The advent of 3D printing made it easy to get into the"
" golem-making hobby, and plastic golems have soared in popularity."
msgstr ""
"Tradicionalmente, hacer un gólem es un proceso de meses que involucra "
"herramientas de mano y artesanía de precisión. Un golem de piedra es tanto "
"una obra de arte como un dispositivo mágico. El advenimiento de la impresión"
" 3D facilitó la afición de hacer golem, y los golem de plástico se han "
"disparado en popularidad."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stone golem"
msgid_plural "stone golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de piedra"
msgstr[1] "golems de piedra"

#. ~ Description for stone golem
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from stone.  Its fists look similar to rockets."
msgstr ""
"Un gran golem humanoide hecho de piedra. Sus puños se parecen a los de los "
"cohetes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "iron golem"
msgid_plural "iron golems"
msgstr[0] "golem de hierro"
msgstr[1] "golems de hierro"

#. ~ Description for iron golem
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, humanoid golem made from iron.  Some sort of noxious gas seems to "
"be seeping from its mouth."
msgstr ""
"Un gran golem humanoide hecho de hierro. Parece que algún tipo de gas nocivo"
" se está filtrando de su boca."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Yule Cat"
msgid_plural "Yule Cats"
msgstr[0] "Gato Yule"
msgstr[1] "Gatos Yule"

#. ~ Description for Yule Cat
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Magical beast from Icelandic folklore, known for their catlike appearance "
"and their hobby of eating Workshop Elves."
msgstr ""
"Bestia mágica del folclore islandés, conocida por su aspecto felino y su "
"afición a comer a los elfos del taller."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Yulecat Cub"
msgid_plural "Yulecat Cubs"
msgstr[0] "Cachorros Yule"
msgstr[1] "Cachorros Yule"

#. ~ Description for Yulecat Cub
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The child of a yulecat, this catlike creature looks as if it poses no threat"
" to you, but looks can be deceiving."
msgstr ""
"Hijo de un gato Yule, esta criatura felina parece no suponer ninguna amenaza"
" para ti, pero las apariencias engañan."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Workshop Elf"
msgid_plural "Workshop Elves"
msgstr[0] "Elfo de Taller"
msgstr[1] "Elfos de Taller"

#. ~ Description for Workshop Elf
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Magical humanoids who are known for working in workshops, wearing green, and"
" being proficient at making toys."
msgstr ""
"Humanoides mágicos conocidos por trabajar en talleres, vestir de verde y ser"
" expertos en la fabricación de juguetes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Leprechaun"
msgid_plural "Leprechauns"
msgstr[0] "Duende"
msgstr[1] "Duendes"

#. ~ Description for Leprechaun
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mischievous shoemakers who wear green and love pulling pranks on mortals."
msgstr ""
"Zapateros traviesos que visten de verde y les encanta gastar bromas a los "
"mortales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lizardfolk warrior"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk warriors"
msgstr[0] "guerrero lagarto"
msgstr[1] "guerreros lagarto"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk warrior
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall, powerful, reptilian humanoid with a muscular tail whose skin is "
"covered in dark gray-green scales.  They are tribal and tend to be found in "
"caves and near water, especially in areas inhabited by dragons and wyrms.  "
"They aren't particularly hostile, though they don't care for outsiders and "
"are highly dangerous when provoked.  While they usually prefer to fight with"
" their greatclubs, they are equally ferocious with their sharp teeth and "
"claws."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide reptil alto y poderoso con una cola musculosa cuya piel está "
"cubierta de escamas de color gris verdoso oscuro. Son tribales y tienden a "
"encontrarse en cuevas y cerca del agua, especialmente en áreas habitadas por"
" dragones y gusanos. No son particularmente hostiles, aunque no se preocupan"
" por los forasteros y son muy peligrosos cuando son provocados. Aunque "
"normalmente prefieren pelear con sus grandes palos, son igualmente feroces "
"con sus afilados dientes y garras."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lizardfolk hunter"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk hunters"
msgstr[0] "cazador lagarto"
msgstr[1] "cazadores lagarto"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk hunter
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The hunter is a smaller lizardfolk than a warrior, but equally as deadly, "
"with their lithe figures and accurate javelin throws."
msgstr ""
"El cazador es un lagarto más pequeño que un guerrero, pero igual de "
"mortífero, con sus figuras ágiles y sus precisos lanzamientos de jabalina."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The hunter hurls a barbed javelin at you!"
msgstr "¡El cazador te lanza una jabalina de púas!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lizardfolk shaman"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk shamans"
msgstr[0] "chamán lagarto"
msgstr[1] "chamanes lagarto"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk shaman
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lizardfolk are very intelligent and cunning, but magical ability is a rare "
"quality.  Shamans are chosen from the tribe during childhood, when magical "
"abilities mark the fate of the young tribesman.  Not much is known about the"
" initiation ritual they must undergo, but few survive the experience.  "
"Shamans are druidic spellcasters that can use the forces of nature to battle"
" enemies, as well as summoning assistance when needed."
msgstr ""
"Los lagartos son muy inteligentes y astutos, pero la habilidad mágica es una"
" cualidad rara. Los chamanes son elegidos de la tribu durante la infancia, "
"cuando las habilidades mágicas marcan el destino del joven de la tribu. No "
"se sabe mucho sobre el ritual de iniciación al que deben someterse, pero "
"pocos sobreviven a la experiencia. Los chamanes son hechiceros druídicos que"
" pueden usar las fuerzas de la naturaleza para luchar contra los enemigos, "
"así como para invocar ayuda cuando sea necesario."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lizardfolk chieftan"
msgid_plural "lizardfolk chieftans"
msgstr[0] "jefe lagarto"
msgstr[1] "jefes lagarto"

#. ~ Description for lizardfolk chieftan
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Among the lizardfolk, ambition is a rare quality.  Chieftans earn their "
"place by exhibiting unusually high levels of ambition, often mistaken by "
"outsiders as excessive, brutal violence.  This chief is the largest and "
"strongest member of its tribe and carries a fierce trident to compliment its"
" teeth and claws."
msgstr ""
"Entre los lagartos, la ambición es una cualidad rara. Los lideres se ganan "
"su lugar exhibiendo niveles inusualmente altos de ambición, a menudo "
"confundidos por los forasteros como violencia excesiva y brutal. Este jefe "
"es el miembro más grande y fuerte de su tribu y lleva un feroz tridente para"
" complementar sus dientes y garras."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "crocodile"
msgid_plural "crocodiles"
msgstr[0] "cocodrilo"
msgstr[1] "cocodrilos"

#. ~ Description for crocodile
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A once-and-future lizardfolk shaman, this large crocodile no longer has any "
"hint of any humanoid characteristics and looks very, very dangerous."
msgstr ""
"Este gran cocodrilo ya no tiene ningún indicio de características humanoides"
" y parece muy, muy peligroso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "owlbear"
msgid_plural "owlbears"
msgstr[0] "buhoso"
msgstr[1] "buhosos"

#. ~ Description for owlbear
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The horrible owlbear is probably the result of genetic experimentation by "
"some insane wizard.  These creatures inhabit the tangled forest regions of "
"every temperate clime, as well as subterranean labyrinths.  They are "
"ravenous eaters, aggressive hunters, and evil tempered at all times.  They "
"attack prey on sight and will fight to the death."
msgstr ""
"El horrible buhoso es probablemente el resultado de la experimentación "
"genética de algún mago loco. Estas criaturas habitan en las enredadas "
"regiones forestales de todos los climas templados, así como en los "
"laberintos subterráneos. Son comedores hambrientos, cazadores agresivos y "
"malvados temperamentales en todo momento. Atacan a las presas en cuanto las "
"ven y luchan hasta la muerte."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "black pudding"
msgid_plural "black puddings"
msgstr[0] "pudding negro"
msgstr[1] "pudding negro"

#. ~ Description for black pudding
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Writhing, sticky, black sludge undulates across the ground.  A faint "
"sizzling sound comes from the ground beneath it as it lurches toward you."
msgstr ""
"El cieno negro, pegajoso y retorcido se ondula en el suelo. Un débil "
"chisporroteo viene del suelo debajo de él mientras se tambalea hacia ti."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "black pudding"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The black pudding burns %3$s with acid!"
msgstr "¡El lodo negro quema %3$s con el ácido!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "krabgek"
msgid_plural "krabgeks"
msgstr[0] "Krabgek"
msgstr[1] "Krabgeks"

#. ~ Description for krabgek
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large baleful eye peers out from the darkness, its gleam hinting at a "
"weird intelligence and unnerving malevolence.  The eye oozes some pinkish "
"liquid, and the weirdly humanoid figure is covered in sharp blue-black "
"triangular plates."
msgstr ""
"Un gran ojo malvado se asoma desde la oscuridad, su brillo insinúa una "
"inteligencia extraña y una malevolencia desconcertante. El ojo rezuma un "
"líquido rosado, y la extraña figura humanoide está cubierta de afiladas "
"placas triangulares azul-negras."

#. ~ Attack message of monster "krabgek"'s spell "None"
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "The krabgek gazes at %3$s!"
msgstr "¡El krabgek mira a%3$s !"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "owlbear cub"
msgid_plural "owlbear cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de búhoso"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de búhoso"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bulette"
msgid_plural "bulettes"
msgstr[0] "bulette"
msgstr[1] "bulettes"

#. ~ Description for bulette
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The bulette (or landshark) was the result of a mad wizard's experimental "
"cross breeding of a snapping turtle and armadillo with infusions of demons' "
"ichor.  They range temperate climates feeding on horses, men, and most other"
" flesh.  The stupid bulette is irascible and always hungry, and they fear "
"nothing."
msgstr ""
"La bulette (o tiburón) fue el resultado del cruce experimental de un mago "
"loco con una tortuga y un armadillo con infusiones de ichor de demonios. Se "
"extienden por climas templados alimentándose de caballos, hombres y la "
"mayoría de la carne. La estúpida bulette es irascible y siempre está "
"hambrienta, y no le temen a nada."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "will-o-wisp"
msgid_plural "will-o-wisps"
msgstr[0] "fuego fatuo"
msgstr[1] "fuegos fatuos"

#. ~ Description for will-o-wisp
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Will-o’-wisps can be yellow, white, green, or blue.  They are easily "
"mistaken for lanterns, especially in the foggy marshes and swamps where they"
" reside."
msgstr ""
"Fuegos fatuos pueden ser amarillos, blancos, verdes o azules. Se confunden "
"fácilmente con las linternas, especialmente en los pantanos y ciénagas de "
"niebla donde residen."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "troll"
msgid_plural "trolls"
msgstr[0] "trol"
msgstr[1] "troles"

#. ~ Description for troll
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Monstrous, green-skinned humanoid.  Trolls are renowned for their thick "
"hides and natural regenerative ability."
msgstr ""
"Monstruoso humanoide de piel verde. Los trolls son famosos por sus gruesos "
"pellejos y su capacidad de regeneración natural."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "stirge"
msgid_plural "stirges"
msgstr[0] "stirge"
msgstr[1] "stirges"

#. ~ Description for stirge
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This horrid flying creature looks like a cross between a large bat and "
"oversized mosquito."
msgstr ""
"Esta horrible criatura voladora parece un cruce entre un gran murciélago y "
"un mosquito de gran tamaño."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "shrieker"
msgid_plural "shriekers"
msgstr[0] "aullador"
msgstr[1] "aulladores"

#. ~ Description for shrieker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shrieker is a human-sized mushroom that emits a piercing screech to drive "
"off creatures that disturb it."
msgstr ""
"Un chillón es un hongo de tamaño humano que emite un chillido penetrante "
"para ahuyentar a las criaturas que lo molestan."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "frog"
msgid_plural "frogs"
msgstr[0] "rana"
msgstr[1] "ranas"

#. ~ Description for frog
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A conspicuously average american bullfrog.  You better keep prince charming "
"away from it."
msgstr ""
"Una llamativa rana toro americana. Será mejor que mantengas al príncipe azul"
" alejado de ella."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "lemure"
msgid_plural "lemures"
msgstr[0] "lemur"
msgstr[1] "lemures"

#. ~ Description for lemure
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A lemure resembles a molten mass of flesh with a vaguely humanoid head and "
"torso."
msgstr ""
"Un lemur se asemeja a una masa fundida de carne con una cabeza y un torso "
"vagamente humanoide."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "winter wolf"
msgid_plural "winter wolves"
msgstr[0] "lobo de invierno"
msgstr[1] "lobos de invierno"

#. ~ Description for winter wolf
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pure white dire wolf.  If you squint, you can see a faint mist surrounding"
" its coat, and ice shards slowly descend from its breath."
msgstr ""
"Un lobo huargo de color blanco puro. Si entrecierras los ojos, puedes ver "
"una tenue niebla que rodea su pelaje, y fragmentos de hielo que descienden "
"lentamente de su aliento."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "loup garou"
msgid_plural "loup garous"
msgstr[0] "loup garou"
msgstr[1] "loup garous"

#. ~ Description for loup garou
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Previously thought extinct outside of rural Quebec and Louisiana this cursed"
" creature has been known to breed with true wolves when it isn't madly "
"destroying any signs of humanity in it's territory."
msgstr ""
"Esta criatura maldita, que se creía extinguida fuera de las zonas rurales de"
" Quebec y Luisiana, es conocida por reproducirse con lobos verdaderos cuando"
" no está destruyendo enloquecidamente cualquier signo de humanidad en su "
"territorio."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "rotting wolf man"
msgid_plural "rotting wolf mans"
msgstr[0] "hombre lobo podrido"
msgstr[1] "hombres lobo podridos"

#. ~ Description for rotting wolf man
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The classic half man half wolf of the movies, but with a new twist: UNDEATH!"
"  This monster lopes along alternating between two and four legged gaits.  "
"It's jet black eyes seething with unsiatable hunger.  Now you will know why "
"you fear the night."
msgstr ""
"El clásico medio hombre medio lobo de las películas, pero con un nuevo giro:"
" ¡LA MUERTE! Este monstruo avanza a paso de tortuga alternando entre dos y "
"cuatro patas. Sus ojos negros azabache bullen de un hambre insaciable. Ahora"
" sabrás por qué le temes a la noche."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Zorc"
msgid_plural "Zorcs"
msgstr[0] "Zorco"
msgstr[1] "Zorcos"

#. ~ Description for Zorc
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This unholy beast looks at you with a piercing stare so strong it might "
"scare your soul away."
msgstr ""
"Esta bestia impía te mira con una mirada penetrante tan fuerte que podría "
"asustar tu alma."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "necco"
msgid_plural "neccos"
msgstr[0] "necco"
msgstr[1] "neccos"

#. ~ Description for necco
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A giant necco wafer happily hopping around."
msgstr "Una gigantesca oblea de Necco saltando felizmente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow kid"
msgid_plural "marshmallow kids"
msgstr[0] "niño malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "niños malvavisco"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow kid
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  It bumbles about on its stubby "
"cushiony legs.  How cute!"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño humanoide hecho de malvavisco. Va dando tumbos sobre sus "
"rechonchas y acolchadas piernas. ¡Qué bonito!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow guy"
msgid_plural "marshmallow guys"
msgstr[0] "persona malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "personas malvavisco"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow guy
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid with a smile drawn on its face.  It bumbles around as"
" if looking for something.  It's oddly adorable."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide de malvavisco con una sonrisa dibujada en la cara. Va dando "
"tumbos como si buscara algo. Es extrañamente adorable."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow buff"
msgid_plural "marshmallow buffs"
msgstr[0] "brillante malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "brillantes malvavisco"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow buff
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A muscular body made of marshmallow, proudly striding towards an unknown "
"goal.  Yummy!"
msgstr ""
"Un cuerpo musculoso hecho de malvavisco, caminando con orgullo hacia una "
"meta desconocida. ¡Qué rico!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow goliath"
msgid_plural "marshmallow goliaths"
msgstr[0] "goliat malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "goliats malvaviscos"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow goliath
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic marshmallow humanoid softly stomping around.  Its frozen smile "
"and big empty eyes are carefully scanning its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Un gigantesco humanoide de malvavisco que pisa fuerte. Su sonrisa congelada "
"y sus grandes ojos vacíos escudriñan cuidadosamente su entorno."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow squire"
msgid_plural "marshmallow squires"
msgstr[0] "escudero de malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "escuderos de malvavisco"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow squire
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small humanoid made of marshmallow.  Its chocolate-coated cracker armor "
"shines dully as it bumbles around on its stubby marshmallow legs.  How cute!"
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño humanoide hecho de malvavisco. Su armadura de galleta recubierta "
"de chocolate brilla con dulzura mientras va dando tumbos sobre sus "
"rechonchas piernas de malvavisco. ¡Qué bonito!"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow knight"
msgid_plural "marshmallow knights"
msgstr[0] "caballero de malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "caballeros de malvavisco"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow knight
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A marshmallow humanoid clad in knightly armor made of chocolate-coated "
"crackers.  It bumbles around as if looking around for something.  It's oddly"
" adorable in a majestic sort of way."
msgstr ""
"Un humanoide de malvavisco vestido con una armadura de caballero hecha de "
"galletas recubiertas de chocolate. Va dando tumbos como si buscara algo. Es "
"extrañamente adorable de una manera majestuosa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow champion"
msgid_plural "marshmallow champions"
msgstr[0] "campeón malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "campeones malvaviscos"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow champion
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Standing tall in its shining armor of chocolate-coated crackers, this "
"marshmallow proudly strides towards an unknown goal."
msgstr ""
"Con su brillante armadura de galletas recubiertas de chocolate, este "
"malvavisco avanza con orgullo hacia una meta desconocida."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "marshmallow war lord"
msgid_plural "marshmallow war lords"
msgstr[0] "señor de la guerra malvavisco"
msgstr[1] "señores de la guerra malvaviscos"

#. ~ Description for marshmallow war lord
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid armored with thick plates of chocolate-coated crackers."
"  Its frozen smile is barely visible from under its heavy helmet as it scans"
" its surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Un gigantesco humanoide blindado con gruesas placas de galletas recubiertas "
"de chocolate. Su sonrisa helada apenas es visible bajo su pesado casco "
"mientras escudriña su entorno."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gummy cub"
msgid_plural "gummy cubs"
msgstr[0] "cachorro de gominola"
msgstr[1] "cachorros de gominola"

#. ~ Description for gummy cub
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "An achingly adorable bear cub made of sugary gummy goodness."
msgstr "Un adorable osezno hecho de gominolas azucaradas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gummy bear"
msgid_plural "gummy bears"
msgstr[0] "oso de gominola"
msgstr[1] "osos de gominola"

#. ~ Description for gummy bear
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large bear made of flavored sugary gelatin.  Its smooth, round shape and "
"fruity smell make it somehow less scary than its fleshy counterpart."
msgstr ""
"Un gran oso hecho de gelatina azucarada aromatizada. Su forma suave y "
"redonda y su olor afrutado lo hacen menos temible que su homólogo carnoso."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gummy gator"
msgid_plural "gummy gators"
msgstr[0] "gomicaimán"
msgstr[1] "gomicaimanes"

#. ~ Description for gummy gator
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Slowly moving through the chocolate like a gummy log along the surface.  You"
" notice it's eye's following your movement as you approach."
msgstr ""
"Se mueve lentamente por el chocolate como un tronco de goma a lo largo de la"
" superficie. Notas que sus ojos siguen tu movimiento a medida que te "
"acercas."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cracker kid"
msgid_plural "cracker kids"
msgstr[0] "niño galleta"
msgstr[1] "niños galleta"

#. ~ Description for cracker kid
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A small cracker kid running around on its cracker legs."
msgstr "Un pequeño niño galleta corriendo por ahí con sus patas de galleta."

#. ~ Description for cracker
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A full grown cracker running around on its cracker legs."
msgstr "Una galleta entera corriendo por sus patas de galleta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "animal cracker largemouth bass"
msgid_plural "animal cracker largemouth bass"
msgstr[0] "perca americana de galleta"
msgstr[1] "percas americanas de galleta"

#. ~ Description for {'str_sp': 'animal cracker largemouth bass'}
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An animal cracker largemouth bass.  It leaps from the water in pursuit of "
"food."
msgstr ""
"Una animal perca americana de galleta. Salta del agua en busca de comida."

#. ~ Description for cookie
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "A small cookie, scurrying around in search for crumbs to eat."
msgstr "Una pequeña galleta, correteando en busca de migas para comer."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cookie hydra"
msgid_plural "cookie hydras"
msgstr[0] "hidra de galleta"
msgstr[1] "hidras de galleta"

#. ~ Description for cookie hydra
#. ~ Description for cookie hydra spawn
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant cookie dragon with multiple heads.  It prowls looking for food."
msgstr ""
"Un dragón gigante de galletas con múltiples cabezas. Merodea en busca de "
"comida."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "cookie hydra spawn"
msgid_plural "cookie hydra spawns"
msgstr[0] "huevos de hidra de galleta"
msgstr[1] "huevos de hidra de galleta"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "gum spider"
msgid_plural "gum spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de goma"
msgstr[1] "arañas de goma"

#. ~ Description for gum spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant piece of gum stretched in the shape of a spider.  You'd best not get"
" gummed up in its web, literally."
msgstr ""
"Un chicle gigante estirado en forma de araña. Será mejor que no te quedes "
"pringado en su tela, literalmente."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "caffeinated gum spider"
msgid_plural "caffeinated gum spiders"
msgstr[0] "araña de gominola con cafeína"
msgstr[1] "arañas de gominola con cafeína"

#. ~ Description for caffeinated gum spider
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A giant piece of gum stretched in the shape of a spider.  It jitters and "
"darts about rapidly as if it had too much energy to stand still."
msgstr ""
"Un chicle gigante estirado en forma de araña. Se agita y se mueve "
"rápidamente como si tuviera demasiada energía para quedarse quieta."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "chocolate calf"
msgid_plural "chocolate calves"
msgstr[0] "ternero de chocolate"
msgstr[1] "terneros de chocolate"

#. ~ Description for chocolate calf
#. ~ Description for chocolate cow
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The domestic cow, a baleful, ruminating farm animal.  It is quite muscular, "
"and the males can have a violent streak to accompany their nasty-looking "
"horns.  This one looks to be made entirely of chocolate."
msgstr ""
"La vaca doméstica, un animal de granja torvo y rumiante. Es bastante "
"musculoso, y los machos pueden tener una vena violenta que acompaña a sus "
"desagradables cuernos. Este parece estar hecho completamente de chocolate."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "chocolate cow"
msgid_plural "chocolate cows"
msgstr[0] "vaca de chocolate"
msgstr[1] "vacas de chocolate"

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "licorice snake"
msgid_plural "licorice snakes"
msgstr[0] "serpiente de regaliz"
msgstr[1] "serpientes de regaliz"

#. ~ Description for licorice snake
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Snake whose body is made out of Licorice, at least it's the red type."
msgstr ""
"Una Serpiente cuyo cuerpo está hecho de regaliz, al menos del tipo rojo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Licorice Snake Hatchling"
msgid_plural "Licorice Snake Hatchlings"
msgstr[0] "cría de serpiente de regaliz"
msgstr[1] "crías de serpiente de regaliz"

#. ~ Description for Licorice Snake Hatchling
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A baby snake made entirely out of licorice, possibly the children of the "
"larger Licorice Snakes."
msgstr ""
"Una cría de serpiente hecha completamente de regaliz, posiblemente los hijos"
" de las serpientes de regaliz más grandes."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "W11B10"
msgid_plural "W11B10s"
msgstr[0] "W11B10"
msgstr[1] "W11B10s"

#. ~ Description for W11B10
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wraitheon (11B) Infantry 10 Level.  Part of Wraitheon's series of one-to-one"
" auxiliaries designed to seamlessly integrate with more traditional forces."
msgstr ""
"Wraitheon (11B) Infantería Nivel 10. Parte de la serie de Wraitheon de "
"auxiliares uno a uno diseñados para integrarse con fuerzas más "
"tradicionales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "W11B10B4"
msgid_plural "W11B10B4s"
msgstr[0] "W11B10B4"
msgstr[1] "W11B10B4s"

#. ~ Description for W11B10B4
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wraitheon (11B) Infantry 20 Level (B4) Sniper.  Part of Wraitheon's series "
"of one-to-one auxiliaries designed to seamlessly integrate with more "
"traditional forces."
msgstr ""
"Francotirador (B4) de infantería de nivel 20 de Wraitheon (11B). Parte de la"
" serie de auxiliares uno a uno de Wraitheon, diseñados para integrarse sin "
"problemas con las fuerzas más tradicionales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "W12B10"
msgid_plural "W12B10s"
msgstr[0] "W12B10"
msgstr[1] "W12B10s"

#. ~ Description for W12B10
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wraitheon (12B) Combat Engineer 10 Level.  Part of Wraitheon's series of "
"one-to-one auxiliaries designed to seamlessly integrate with more "
"traditional forces."
msgstr ""
"Wraitheon (12B) Ingeniero de Combate Nivel 10. Parte de la serie de "
"auxiliares uno a uno de Wraitheon diseñados para integrarse sin problemas "
"con las fuerzas más tradicionales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "W11H10"
msgid_plural "W11H10s"
msgstr[0] "W11H10"
msgstr[1] "W11H10s"

#. ~ Description for W11H10
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wraitheon (11H) Anti-Tank Infantry 10 Level.  Part of Wraitheon's series of "
"one-to-one auxiliaries designed to seamlessly integrate with more "
"traditional forces."
msgstr ""
"Wraitheon (11H) Infantería Anti-Tanque Nivel 10. Parte de la serie de "
"Wraitheon de auxiliares uno a uno diseñados para integrarse con fuerzas más "
"tradicionales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "W12N10"
msgid_plural "W12N10s"
msgstr[0] "W12N10"
msgstr[1] "W12N10s"

#. ~ Description for W12N10
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wraitheon (12N) Construction Engineer 10 Level.  Part of Wraitheon's series "
"of one-to-one auxiliaries designed to seamlessly integrate with more "
"traditional forces."
msgstr ""
"Wraitheon (12N) Ingeniero de Construcción Nivel 10. Parte de la serie de "
"auxiliares uno a uno de Wraitheon diseñados para integrarse sin problemas "
"con las fuerzas más tradicionales."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "giant scorpion"
msgid_plural "giant scorpions"
msgstr[0] "escorpión gigante"
msgstr[1] "escorpiones gigantes"

#. ~ Description for giant scorpion
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A menacing arachnid with a second set of pedipalps, clacking rabidly as an "
"engorged stinger looms over its body."
msgstr ""
"Un arácnido amenazante con un segundo juego de pedipalpos, chasqueando "
"rabiosamente mientras un aguijón hinchado se cierne sobre su cuerpo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "bush elephant"
msgid_plural "bush elephants"
msgstr[0] "elefante arbusto"
msgstr[1] "elefantes de arbusto"

#. ~ Description for bush elephant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The African Bush Elephant is a massive terrestrial animal with two long "
"tusks protruding from its mouth.  Elephantry is on the rise since the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"El elefante africano de arbusto es un animal terrestre masivo con dos largos"
" colmillos que sobresalen de su boca. La elefantería está en aumento desde "
"el Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "hook kangaroo"
msgid_plural "hook kangaroos"
msgstr[0] "canguro de gancho"
msgstr[1] "canguros de gancho"

#. ~ Description for hook kangaroo
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Grotesque and deformed kangaroo body that has black goo seeping from its "
"orifices.  The most unnerving is its forearms have reformed into a raptorial"
" shape, like that of a praying mantis."
msgstr ""
"Grotesco y deforme cuerpo de canguro que tiene una sustancia viscosa negra "
"que se filtra por sus orificios. Lo más desconcertante es que sus antebrazos"
" se han reformado en una forma de rapiña, como la de una mantis religiosa."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "fungal elephant"
msgid_plural "fungal elephants"
msgstr[0] "elefante fúngico"
msgstr[1] "elefantes fúngicos"

#. ~ Description for fungal elephant
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A horrifying image with tendrils seeping out of many oozing wounds, this "
"elephant's form appears more eldritch than animal."
msgstr ""
"Una imagen horripilante con zarcillos que se filtran de muchas heridas "
"supurantes, la forma de este elefante parece más sobrenatural que animal."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "zandcrawler"
msgid_plural "zandcrawlers"
msgstr[0] "reptante arenoso"
msgstr[1] "reptantes arenosos"

#. ~ Description for zandcrawler
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A calloused and misshapened form that seems to have adapted to the harsh, "
"dry environment."
msgstr ""
"Una forma encallecida y deformada que parece haberse adaptado al entorno "
"duro y seco."

#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid "Gila monster"
msgid_plural "Gila monsters"
msgstr[0] "Monstruo de Gila"
msgstr[1] "Monstruos de Gila"

#. ~ Description for Gila monster
#: lang/json/MONSTER_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A reptile with aposematic coloration of black and orange that is renowned "
"for an extremely painful venom when it bites."
msgstr ""
"Un reptil con coloración aposemática de negro y naranja que es conocido por "
"un veneno extremadamente doloroso cuando muerde."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Kevlar dog harness"
msgid_plural "Kevlar dog harnesses"
msgstr[0] "arnés de Kevlar para perro"
msgstr[1] "arneses de Kevlar para perro"

#. ~ Description for Kevlar dog harness
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A blue bulletproof harness, designed to be worn by canines in the service of"
" local law enforcement, that protects from shoulders to abdomen.  You could "
"put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés azul a prueba de balas, diseñado para ser usado por los caninos al "
"servicio de la policía local, que protege desde los hombros hasta el "
"abdomen. Podrías ponerle esto a un perro amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "biosilicified chitin dog mesh harness"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin dog mesh harnesses"
msgstr[0] "arnés de malla para perros de quitina biosilicificada"
msgstr[1] "arneses de malla para perros de quitina biosilicificada"

#. ~ Description for biosilicified chitin dog mesh harness
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A makeshift harness of biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh protecting"
" the neck to flank of canines.  You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés improvisado de quitina biosilicificada ajustado a una fina malla "
"que protege el cuello al flanco de los caninos. Podrías ponerle esto a un "
"perro amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
