msgstr[1] "abrigos para perros de cadena de malla"

#. ~ Description for chainmail dog coat
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Protecteth yon hund fram ful daemons!  You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr ""
"¡Protege a tu perro de los completos demonios de! Podrías ponerle esto a un "
"perro amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather dog harness"
msgid_plural "leather dog harnesses"
msgstr[0] "arnés de cuero para perros"
msgstr[1] "arneses de cuero para perros"

#. ~ Description for leather dog harness
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A neck to hip harness made from leather that can be attached to a canine for"
" protection.  You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr ""
"Un arnés de cuello a cadera hecho de cuero que se puede sujetar a un canino "
"para protegerlo. Podrías ponerle esto a un perro amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "leather dog harness with bones"
msgid_plural "leather dog harnesses with bones"
msgstr[0] "arnés de cuero para perros con huesos"
msgstr[1] "arneses de cuero para perros con huesos"

#. ~ Description for leather dog harness with bones
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Decorative bones affixed to a leather dog harness for that true post-"
"apocalyptic style, even with a skull bone headpiece!  You could put this on "
"a friendly dog."
msgstr ""
"Huesos decorativos pegados a un arnés de cuero para perros para ese "
"verdadero estilo post-apocalíptico, ¡incluso con un tocado de hueso de "
"cráneo! Podrías ponerle esto a un perro amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "rubber dog rainsuit"
msgid_plural "rubber dog rainsuits"
msgstr[0] "chubasquero para perros"
msgstr[1] "chubasqueros para perros"

#. ~ Description for rubber dog rainsuit
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin plastic covering adapted for dogs to protect from acid rain and other"
" caustic sources.  You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr ""
"Una fina cubierta de plástico adaptada para perros para proteger de la "
"lluvia ácida y otras fuentes cáusticas. Podrías ponerle esto a un perro "
"amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "superalloy tactical dog outfit"
msgid_plural "superalloy tactical dog outfits"
msgstr[0] "traje tácticos de superaleación para perros"
msgstr[1] "trajes tácticos de superaleación para perros"

#. ~ Description for superalloy tactical dog outfit
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A thin mesh interwoven with superalloy plates and pouches for military "
"working dogs that covers from the dewlap to the croup, down to the elbows.  "
"You could put this on a friendly dog."
msgstr ""
"Una fina malla entretejida con placas de superaleación y bolsas para perros "
"de trabajo militares que cubre desde la papada hasta la grupa, hasta los "
"codos. Podrías ponerle esto a un perro amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "horse armor"
msgid_plural "horse armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura para caballos"
msgstr[1] "armaduras para caballos"

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "Kevlar-lined horse peto"
msgid_plural "Kevlar-lined horse petos"
msgstr[0] "peto de caballo forrado de Kevlar"
msgstr[1] "petos de caballo forrados de Kevlar"

#. ~ Description for Kevlar-lined horse peto
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy mattress-like armor of cloth, leather and thick linings of Kevlar, "
"originally used as protection in bullfighting.  You could put this on a "
"friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Una pesada armadura de tela, cuero y gruesos forros de Kevlar, originalmente"
" usada como protección en las corridas de toros. Podrías poner esto en un "
"caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "biosilicified chitin horse armor"
msgid_plural "biosilicified chitin horse armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de caballo de quitina biosilicificada"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de caballo de quitina biosilicificada"

#. ~ Description for biosilicified chitin horse armor
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from "
"biosilicified chitin fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a "
"friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto improvisado de criniere, peytral y crupiere hecho de quitina "
"biosilicificada ajustado a una malla fina. Podrías poner esto en un caballo "
"amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "chitin horse armor"
msgid_plural "chitin horse armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de caballo de quitina"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de caballo de quitina"

#. ~ Description for chitin horse armor
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A makeshift assembly of criniere, peytral and croupiere made from chitin "
"fitted to a thin mesh.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto improvisado de criniere, peytral y crupiere hecho de quitina "
"ajustado a una fina malla. Podrías poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "chainmail horse armor"
msgid_plural "chainmail horse armors"
msgstr[0] "armadura de caballo de cota de malla"
msgstr[1] "armaduras de caballo de cota de malla"

#. ~ Description for chainmail horse armor
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy covering of chainmail, suitably made for horses as protection.  You "
"could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Una pesada cubierta de cota de malla, adecuada para los caballos como "
"protección. Podrías poner esto en un caballo amigo."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "boiled leather horse barding with caprison"
msgid_plural "boiled leather horse bardings with caprison"
msgstr[0] "bardas de caballo de cuero hervido con caprison"
msgstr[1] "bardas de caballo de cuero hervido con caprison"

#. ~ Description for boiled leather horse barding with caprison
#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a battle between a monstrous "
"dragon and regal griffin.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un barda completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón representa una batalla entre un dragón monstruoso y"
" un grifo real. Podrías poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a red dragon breathing fire on "
"cities.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un bardín completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón representa un dragón rojo que respira fuego en las "
"ciudades. Podrías poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a bear on its hind legs and "
"forelegs outstretched in a menacing manner.  You could put this on a "
"friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un bardín completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón representa un oso con sus patas traseras y "
"delanteras extendidas de forma amenazadora. Podrías poner esto en un caballo"
" amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting an assortment of fruits and "
"vegetables with a very large orange featured in the foreground.  You could "
"put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un bardín completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón muestra un surtido de frutas y verduras con una "
"gran naranja en primer plano. Podrías poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting a massive vulture perched on a "
"mountain.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un bardín completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón representa un enorme buitre posado en una montaña. "
"Podrías poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison is depicting the mythical Erymanthian boar in"
" various artistic forms.  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un bardín completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón representa al mítico jabalí erimantiano en varias "
"formas artísticas. Podrías poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison seems to be sponsored by Rycon Construction, "
"with a tag line of \"From down under to your home, we play all the roles "
"from start to finish!\".  You could put this on a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un bardín completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón parece estar patrocinado por Rycon Construction, "
"con un lema de \"Desde abajo hasta tu casa, jugamos todos los papeles de "
"principio a fin!\". Podrías poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full barding for horses consisting of boiled leather and cloth "
"undercovering.  This caparison seems to be sponsored by Core Generator Tech,"
" with a tag line of \"Providing power solutions from culinary to graphic "
"design, we have the magic touch for your problems!\".  You could put this on"
" a friendly horse."
msgstr ""
"Un bardín completo para caballos que consiste en cuero hervido y tela de "
"cubierta. Este caparazón parece estar patrocinado por Core Generator Tech, "
"con el lema \"Proporcionando soluciones de poder desde la culinaria hasta el"
" diseño gráfico, tenemos el toque mágico para sus problemas!\". Podrías "
"poner esto en un caballo amistoso."

#: lang/json/PET_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid "boiled leather horse barding with bones"
msgid_plural "boiled leather horse bardings with bones"
msgstr[0] "barda de caballo de cuero hervido con huesos"
msgstr[1] "bardas de caballo de cuero hervido con huesos"

