msgstr[1] "toallas"

#. ~ Description for towel
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a fluffy and large towel.  It could be used to dry yourself.  Any "
"person that can travel the length and breadth of the apocalypse, rough it, "
"slum it, struggle against terrible odds, win through and still know where "
"their towel is, is clearly a force to be reckoned with."
msgstr ""
"Es una toalla grande y suave. La puedes usar para secarte. Cualquier persona"
" que pueda atravesar lo largo y lo ancho del apocalipsis, ir por los barrios"
" pobres, luchar contra terribles adversidades, salir airoso y seguir "
"sabiendo dónde guarda su toalla, es claramente una habilidad que hay que "
"reconocer."

#. ~ Description for towel
#: lang/json/TOOL_ARMOR_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a large, sopping wet towel.  If you wait a little bit, it should dry"
" out.  Don't panic."
msgstr ""
"Es una toalla grande, empapada. Si esperas un poco, se va a secar. No te "
"alteres."

