msgstr "El LED guiña el ojo dentro de la linterna."

#. ~ Description for spooky plastic jack o'lantern
#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There is a thick LED candle inside the pumpkin face.  It doesn't provide "
"very much light, but it can run for quite a long time.  This lantern is lit."
"  The face shifts."
msgstr ""
"Hay una gruesa vela LED dentro de la cara de la calabaza. No proporciona "
"mucha luz, pero puede arde por mucho tiempo. Esta vela está encendida. La "
"cara se desplaza."

#: lang/json/TOOL_from_json.py
