msgid "Your skin tingle with the power of the Devs!"
msgstr "¡Tu piel se estremece con el poder de los Devs!"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Debug Full Protection'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Your skin stops tingling, your life is empty and meaningless again."
msgstr ""
"Tu piel deja de cosquillear, tu vida vuelve a estar vacía y sin sentido."

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Feather Fall"
msgstr "Depurar Caida Pluma"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Debug Feather Fall'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You  are light as a feather and fall like one."
msgstr "Eres ligero como una pluma y caes como una."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Debug Feather Fall'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Your body feels light as a feather."
msgstr "Tu cuerpo se siente ligero como una pluma."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Debug Feather Fall'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "The earth pulls you down hard."
msgstr "La tierra te tira con fuerza."

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Scared"
msgstr "Asustado"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Frightened"
msgstr "Temeroso"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py src/npc.cpp
msgid "Terrified"
msgstr "Aterrado"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your knees are shaking, your heart beats fast, and your stomach rebels."
msgstr ""
"Tus rodillas tiemblan, tu corazón late rápido y tu estómago se rebela."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Scared, Frightened, Terrified'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You are afraid!"
msgstr "¡Tienes miedo!"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Scared, Frightened, Terrified'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Your fear dissipates."
msgstr "Tu miedo se disipa."

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Visceral Overexertion"
msgstr "Sobreesfuerzo Visceral"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Visceral Overexertion'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You feel sickened from overtaxing your body, having extended your influence "
"over such a wide area."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes enfermo por sobrecargar tu cuerpo, habiendo extendido tu "
"influencia sobre un área tan amplia."

#. ~ Description of effect 'Coagulant Weave'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Immunity to bleeding and bites, increased stamina regeneration, increased "
"hunger and thirst gain."
msgstr ""
"Inmunidad a las hemorragias y las mordeduras, aumento de la regeneración del"
" vigor, aumento del hambre y aumento de la sed."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Coagulant Weave'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "The tension running through your flesh fades."
msgstr "La tensión que corre a través de tu carne se desvanece."

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Biomantic Venom"
msgstr "Veneno Biomántico"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Biomantic Venom'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You feel sluggish and weak, from magically-induced poisoning."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes lento y débil, por el envenenamiento inducido por la magia."

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Sharp Thorns"
msgstr "Espinas Afiladas"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Sharp Thorns'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Thorns are whirling around you, regularly causing cuts into you."
msgstr ""
"Las espinas se arremolinan a tu alrededor, provocando regularmente cortes en"
" ti."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Sharp Thorns'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Thorns in the wind begin slicing into you!"
msgstr "¡Las espinas en el viento comienzan a cortarte!"

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Sharp Thorns'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "The thorns fall to the ground."
msgstr "Las espinas caen al suelo."

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Mental Boost"
msgstr "Empuje Mental"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Mental Boost'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Your mind is working incredibly fast, but your body cannot keep up"
msgstr ""
"Tu mente trabaja increíblemente rápido, pero tu cuerpo no puede seguir el "
"ritmo"

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Vault Air"
msgstr "Bóveda de Aire"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Vault Air'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You feel at home."
msgstr "Te sientes en casa."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Vault Air'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "This smells like home."
msgstr "Esto huele a hogar."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Vault Air'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Time to go."
msgstr "Hora de irse."

#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Slow Freeze"
msgstr "Congelación Lenta"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Slow Freeze'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "The cold slows down your foes."
msgstr "El frío ralentiza a tus enemigos."

#. ~ Description of effect 'Nature's Commune'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can feel Mother Nature welcoming you, revitalizing your body and calming"
" the natural fauna around you."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sentir a la Madre Naturaleza dándote la bienvenida, revitalizando tu "
"cuerpo y calmando la fauna natural que te rodea."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Nature's Commune'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "A warm embrace surrounds you, like that of a mother with her child."
msgstr "Un cálido abrazo te rodea, como el de una madre con su hijo."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Nature's Commune'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "Your commune with Mother Nature fades."
msgstr "Tu comunión con la madre naturaleza se desvanece."

#. ~ Description of effect 'Dragon Terror'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You are uneasy and fearful from a Dragon's mighty presence"
msgstr "Estás inquieto y temeroso por la poderosa presencia de un Dragón"

#. ~ Description of effect 'Dragon Boost'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You are filled with the power of Dragons."
msgstr "Estás lleno del poder de los Dragones."

#. ~ Apply message for effect(s) 'Dragon Boost'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "You let out a mighty roar as you are filled with the power of Dragons!"
msgstr ""
"Dejas escapar un poderoso rugido mientras te llenas del poder de los "
"dragones."

#. ~ Remove message for effect(s) 'Dragon Boost'.
#: lang/json/effects_from_json.py
msgid "The Draconic energy fades from within you."
msgstr "La energía Dracónica se desvanece en tu interior."

