#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Your Followers"
msgstr "Tus Seguidores"

#. ~ Description for Your Followers
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The survivors who have entrusted you with their well-being.  If morale "
"drops, poor performance and mutiny may become issues."
msgstr ""
"Los supervivientes que han confiado en ti para mantener su bienestar. Si la "
"moral cae, el bajo rendimiento y el amotinamiento pueden llegar a ser "
"problemas."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "AMF"
msgstr "AMF"

#. ~ Description for AMF
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The survivors who formerly entrusted you with their well-being, but have now"
" mutinied because of your abuse and incompetence.  They will kill you if "
"they can."
msgstr ""
"Los supervivientes que antes te confiaban su bienestar, pero que ahora se "
"han amotinado por tu abuso e incompetencia. Te matarán si pueden."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Hub 01"
msgstr "Hub 01"

#. ~ Description for Hub 01
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The surviving staff of Hub 01, a pre-Cataclysm research lab.  They rarely "
"leave their lab, if at all, and rely on their robots and advanced technology"
" to survive."
msgstr ""
"El personal superviviente de Hub 01, un laboratorio de investigación pre-"
"cataclismo. Raramente dejan su laboratorio, si es que lo hacen, y dependen "
"de sus robots y tecnología avanzada para sobrevivir."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Hub 01 Ancillia"
msgstr "Hub 01 Ancillia"

#. ~ Description for Hub 01 Ancillia
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A loose association of skilled wastelanders, traders, mercenaries and "
"scouts.  All working on behalf of Hub 01, for their own reasons."
msgstr ""
"Una asociación informal de derrochadores, comerciantes, mercenarios y "
"exploradores. Todos trabajando en nombre de Hub 01, por sus propias razones."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Old Guard"
msgstr "La Vieja Guardia"

#. ~ Description for The Old Guard
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The remains of the federal government.  The extent of their strength is "
"unknown but squads of patrolling soldiers have been seen under their banner."
msgstr ""
"Lo que queda del gobierno federal. El alcance de su fuerza es desconocido, "
"pero escuadrones de soldados patrullando han sido vistos con su bandera."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Free Merchants"
msgstr "Los Mercaderes Libres"

#. ~ Description for The Free Merchants
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A conglomeration of entrepreneurs and businessmen that stand together to "
"hammer-out an existence through trade and industry."
msgstr ""
"Una conglomeración de empresarios y emprendedores que se mantienen juntos "
"para poder continuar su existencia a través del comercio y la industria."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Beggars in the Lobby"
msgstr "Los Mendigos en el Vestíbulo"

#. ~ Description for The Beggars in the Lobby
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A collection of mentally and physically disadvantaged survivors who beg for "
"food in the Evac Center lobby."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de supervivientes con desventajas físicas y mentales que piden"
" comida en el vestíbulo del Centro de Evacuación."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Tacoma Commune"
msgstr "La Comuna Tacoma"

#. ~ Description for The Tacoma Commune
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An outpost started by the Free Merchants to provide a source of food and raw"
" materials."
msgstr ""
"Un puesto fundado por los Mercaderes Libres para proveer una fuente de "
"comida y materias primas."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Marloss Evangelists"
msgstr "Evangelistas de Marloss"

#. ~ Description for Marloss Evangelists
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Diverse bands, congregations and organizations with the common goal of "
"preaching human survival through symbiosis with fungaloids."
msgstr ""
"Diversas bandas, congregaciones y organizaciones con el objetivo común de "
"predicar la supervivencia humana a través de la simbiosis con los "
"fungaloides."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "No Faction"
msgstr "No hay facción."

#. ~ Description for No Faction
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "A lone wolf, not aligned with any faction."
msgstr "Un lobo solitario, no alineado con ninguna facción."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Wasteland Scavengers"
msgstr "Los Carroñeros del Páramo"

#. ~ Description for The Wasteland Scavengers
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Autonomous bands or individuals who make their living raiding the ruins of "
"the old-world for gear and provisions."
msgstr ""
"Bandas autónomas o individuos que se dedican a saquear las ruinas del  mundo"
" antiguo para conseguir equipo y provisiones."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Hell's Raiders"
msgstr "Piratas del Infierno"

#. ~ Description for Hell's Raiders
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The largest gang of hooligans and bandits that preys upon other survivors.  "
"Even if you have no gear, there is always a need for slaves and fresh meat."
msgstr ""
"La banda más grande de hooligans y bandidos que abusan de los otros "
"supervivientes. Y aunque no tengas equipo, siempre existe la necesidad de "
"esclavos y carne fresca."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Mutants Bees"
msgstr "Abejas Mutantes"

#. ~ Description for Mutants Bees
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Mutant bees who hate everyone."
msgstr "Abejas mutantes que odian a todo el mundo."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Isherwood family"
msgstr "La familia Isherwood"

#. ~ Description for Isherwood family
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "A small family surviving on their generational land."
msgstr "Una pequeña familia que sobrevive en su tierra por generaciones."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "New England Church Community"
msgstr "Comunidad de la Iglesia de Nueva Inglaterra"

#. ~ Description for New England Church Community
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small group of churchgoers that formed a community in the woods.  They "
"welcome anyone in their faction, but hate the unnatural."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño grupo de feligreses que formaron una comunidad en el bosque. "
"Ellos dan la bienvenida a cualquiera de su facción, pero odian lo "
"antinatural."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Rabbit Enthusiasts"
msgstr "Entusiasta de los conejos"

#. ~ Description for Rabbit Enthusiasts
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Mr Lapin and any acolytes he may have gathered in the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"El Sr. Lapin y los acólitos que pueda haber reunido en el apocalipsis."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Fisherman Family"
msgstr "Familia Fisherman"

#. ~ Description for Fisherman Family
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "A small family trying to survive in this new world."
msgstr "Una pequeña familia que intenta sobrevivir en este nuevo mundo."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Prisoners"
msgstr "Prisioneros"

#. ~ Description for Prisoners
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Former prisoners who got their freedom during the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Antiguos prisioneros que obtuvieron su libertad durante el apocalipsis."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "PrepNet Phyle"
msgstr "Phyle RedPrep"

#. ~ Description for PrepNet Phyle
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A group of bionic preppers who had expected the collapse of the economy and "
"global chaos, instead they were slightly more ready than others for the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo de preparadores biónicos que habían esperado el colapso de la "
"economía y el caos global, en su lugar estaban ligeramente más preparados "
"que otros para el Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Whately Family"
msgstr "Familia Whately"

#. ~ Description for Whately Family
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Whately's are an old New England family of eccentrics.  Eccentrics being"
" the kind words used about them."
msgstr ""
"Los Whately son una antigua familia de excéntricos de Nueva Inglaterra. Los "
"excéntricos son las palabras amables que se usan para referirse a ellos."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and Casinos"
msgstr "Comunidad religiosa de los pantanos y hoteles y casinos"

#. ~ Description for Swampers Religious Community and Hotels and Casinos
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A prosperous but secretive group of churchgoers and entertainment moguls "
"with an affection for dinosaurs.  They welcome all untainted humans."
msgstr ""
"Un grupo próspero pero reservado de feligreses y magnates del "
"entretenimiento con afición a los dinosaurios. Acogen a todos los humanos no"
" contaminados."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Ancient Ones"
msgstr "Los Antiguos"

#. ~ Description for The Ancient Ones
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The spellcrafters of old.  Hidden from the world until the cataclysm, they "
"have their own agenda and care little for you or yours."
msgstr ""
"Los hechiceros de antaño. Escondidos del mundo hasta el cataclismo, tienen "
"su propia agenda y se preocupan poco por ti o por los tuyos."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Grey Flame"
msgstr "La Llama Gris"

#. ~ Description for The Grey Flame
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A collection of those cursed by the cataclysm.  They have sworn to rid this "
"world of its curse and will stop at nothing to accomplish their task."
msgstr ""
"Una colección de los malditos por el cataclismo. Han jurado librar a este "
"mundo de su maldición y no se detendrán ante nada para cumplir su tarea."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "The Forge Lords"
msgstr "Los Señores de la Forja"

#. ~ Description for The Forge Lords
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Builders and merchants of magical wonders.  They expect to weather this "
"Cataclysm through trade and innovation.  They will take any coin from any "
"land."
msgstr ""
"Constructores y comerciantes de maravillas mágicas. Esperan capear este "
"Cataclismo mediante el comercio y la innovación. Aceptarán cualquier moneda "
"de cualquier tierra."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Captives"
msgstr "Cautivos"

#. ~ Description for Captives
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These are hapless survivors who have been captured by raiders, slavers, "
"mutants, or worse.  Without your help, the remainder of their lives will be "
"short and gruesome."
msgstr ""
"Son desafortunados supervivientes que han sido capturados por piratas, "
"esclavistas, mutantes o algo peor.  Sin tu ayuda, lo que queda de sus vidas "
"será corta y espantosa."

#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid "Refugees"
msgstr "Refugiados"

#. ~ Description for Refugees
#: lang/json/faction_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The scattered remnants of civilization, these lucky few managed to barricade"
" themselves inside during the earliest stages of the Cataclysm.  Although "
"temporarily secure, they are short on supplies and lack the skills to obtain"
" more.  It's only a matter of time before they too become the prey of "
"otherwordly creatures, or of all-too-human monsters."
msgstr ""
"Los restos dispersos de la civilización, estos pocos afortunados lograron "
"atrincherarse dentro durante las primeras etapas del Cataclismo. Aunque "
"temporalmente seguros, están cortos de suministros y carecen de las "
"habilidades para obtener más. Es sólo cuestión de tiempo antes de que "
"también se conviertan en presas de criaturas de otras palabras, o de "
"monstruos demasiado humanos."

#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Dusty"
msgstr "Polvoriento"

#. ~ description for fault '{'str': 'Dusty'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "It's dusty.  Has no effect - obsolete fault."
msgstr "Está polvoriento. No tiene ningún efecto, es una falla obsoleta."

#. ~ name of mending method for fault '{'str': 'Dusty'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Wipe clean"
msgstr "Límpiate."

#. ~ success message for mending method 'Wipe clean' of fault '{'str':
#. 'Dusty'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "You clean you %s."
msgstr "Te limpias tu %s."

#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Already deployed"
msgstr "Ya está desplegado"

#. ~ description for fault '{'str': 'Already deployed'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "This bionic needs to be reset to its factory state."
msgstr "Este biónico necesita ser reiniciado a su estado de fábrica."

#. ~ name of mending method for fault '{'str': 'Already deployed'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Reset to factory state"
msgstr "Resetear a estado de fábrica"

#. ~ success message for mending method 'Reset to factory state' of fault
#. '{'str': 'Already deployed'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "You successfully reset the %s to its factory state."
msgstr "Has restablecido con éxito el %s a su estado de fábrica."

#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Blackpowder fouling"
msgstr "La suciedad de la pólvora negra"

#. ~ description for fault '{'str': 'Blackpowder fouling'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Firing blackpowder loads from a gun fouls it, which reduces reliability and,"
" if left uncleaned, leads to rust.  It fouls the gun much faster than the "
"use of modern smokeless powder cartridges.  Fouling is only a significant "
"impact on reliability at high levels, but black powder fouling accumulates "
"quickly."
msgstr ""
"Disparar cargas de pólvora negra de un arma la ensucia, lo que reduce la "
"fiabilidad y, si se deja sin limpiar, conduce a la oxidación. Ensucia el "
"arma mucho más rápido que el uso de los modernos cartuchos de pólvora sin "
"humo. El ensuciamiento sólo tiene un impacto significativo en la fiabilidad "
"a altos niveles, pero el ensuciamiento de la pólvora negra se acumula "
"rápidamente."

#. ~ name of mending method for fault '{'str': 'Blackpowder fouling'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Clean blackpowder fouling"
msgstr "Limpiar la suciedad de la pólvora negra"

#. ~ success message for mending method 'Clean blackpowder fouling' of fault
#. '{'str': 'Blackpowder fouling'}'
#. ~ success message for mending method 'Clean gun' of fault '{'str':
#. 'Fouling'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "You clean your %s."
msgstr "Te limpias tu %s."

#. ~ name of mending method for fault '{'str': 'Blackpowder fouling'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Clean blackpowder fouling and lubricate"
msgstr "Limpiar la suciedad de la pólvora negra y lubricarla."

#. ~ success message for mending method 'Clean blackpowder fouling and
#. lubricate' of fault '{'str': 'Blackpowder fouling'}'
#. ~ success message for mending method 'Clean gun and lubricate' of fault
#. '{'str': 'Fouling'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "You clean and lubricate your %s."
msgstr "Usted limpia y lubrica su %s."

#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Spent casing in chamber"
msgstr "Casquillo gastado en la camara"

#. ~ description for fault '{'str': 'Spent casing in chamber'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This gun currently has an empty casing chambered.  It will have to be "
"removed before firing."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola tiene actualmente un casquillo vacío en la cámara. Tendrá que "
"ser retirada antes de disparar."

#. ~ name of mending method for fault '{'str': 'Spent casing in chamber'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Eject spent casing"
msgstr "Expulsar el casquillo gastado"

#. ~ success message for mending method 'Eject spent casing' of fault '{'str':
#. 'Spent casing in chamber'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "You eject the spent casing from the %s."
msgstr "Expulsas el casquillo gastado de la  %s."

#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid "Unlubricated"
msgstr "Sin lubricación"

#. ~ description for fault '{'str': 'Unlubricated'}'
#: lang/json/fault_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Either this gun is brand new and came without lubrication or it was recently"
" cleaned with a solvent without oiling afterwards.  Either way, it's not "
"lubricated and will not cycle properly, and can even be damaged."
msgstr ""
"O bien esta pistola es nueva y vino sin lubricación o fue limpiada "
"recientemente con un disolvente sin aceite después. De cualquier manera, no "
"está lubricada y no funcionará correctamente, e incluso puede ser dañada."

