msgstr "gruesas telarañas de goma"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mutated cactus"
msgstr "cactus mutado"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "glowing tendril"
msgstr "zarcillo luminoso"

#. ~ Description for glowing tendril
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A willowy tendril growing from the floor, gently waving back and forth.  A "
"faint light spills from it."
msgstr ""
"Un zarcillo de sauce que crece desde el suelo y se agita suavemente de un "
"lado a otro. Una débil luz brota de él."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "splorch!"
msgstr "¡splorch!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "whump!"
msgstr "¡pum!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "wafting anemone"
msgstr "anémona flotante"

#. ~ Description for wafting anemone
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fleshy white protuberance growing from the floor, with a cluster of "
"tendrils pouring out of it.  It looks almost exactly like a sea anemone, "
"even waving gently as though underwater."
msgstr ""
"Una protuberancia blanca y carnosa que crece en el suelo, con un grupo de "
"zarcillos que salen de ella. Se parece casi exactamente a una anémona de "
"mar, incluso se agita suavemente como si estuviera bajo el agua."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "gasping tube"
msgstr "tubo jadeante"

#. ~ Description for gasping tube
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a meaty green stalactite with a thickened hide like that of a "
"starfish, extending from the floor to the ceiling.  In the center is a "
"series of ports somewhat like mouths, from which pour bursts of a vile-"
"smelling gas."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una carnosa estalactita verde con una piel engrosada como la de "
"una estrella de mar, que se extiende desde el suelo hasta el techo. En el "
"centro hay una serie de orificios que parecen bocas, de los que brotan "
"ráfagas de un gas de mal olor."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "twitching frond"
msgstr "frondosa sacudida"

#. ~ Description for twitching frond
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A spine resembling moth antennae juts from the ground, swaying gently in the"
" air.  Every so often, a cascade of energy arcs along it and discharges into"
" the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"Una columna vertebral que se asemeja a las antenas de una polilla sobresale "
"del suelo y se balancea suavemente en el aire. De vez en cuando, una cascada"
" de energía se arquea a lo largo de ella y se descarga en el techo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "scarred lump"
msgstr "bulto cicatrizado"

#. ~ Description for scarred lump
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a pile of nondescript alien flesh, twitching and belching strange "
"gases out of injured orifices."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un montón de carne alienígena anodina, que se retuerce y eructa "
"extraños gases por los orificios heridos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "splat!"
msgstr "¡splat!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "slimy pod"
msgstr "vaina viscosa"

#. ~ Description for slimy pod
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a slick, translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  It is covered "
"in a thick mucus, obscuring whatever is floating in the gel-like substance "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vaina resbaladiza y translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. "
"Está cubierta por una espesa mucosidad, que oscurece lo que está flotando en"
" la sustancia gelatinosa del interior."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "whump."
msgstr "whump."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "organ pod"
msgstr "vaina de órgano"

#. ~ Description for organ pod
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside you can see the"
" dimly outlined shape of human organs, floating in some kind of preservative"
" goo."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior"
" se puede ver la forma poco marcada de los órganos humanos, flotando en "
"algún tipo de sustancia conservante."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "resin pod"
msgstr "vaina de resina"

#. ~ Description for resin pod
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a translucent pod suspended on a thin stalk.  Inside is a clean, "
"clear resinous-looking fluid.  You could fairly easily tear it from the "
"stalk and take it with you."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una vaina translúcida suspendida en un tallo delgado. En el interior"
" hay un fluido limpio, claro y de aspecto resinoso. Podrías arrancarlo del "
"tallo y llevártelo contigo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fleshy altar"
msgstr " altar carnoso"

#. ~ Description for fleshy altar
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This pulsing protuberance juts from the floor, its sides covered in scaled, "
"oozing skin.  The surface is flat, but undulates softly.  A handful of "
"unidentifiable appendages reach from the sides, suggesting a sort of "
"nightmarish living autodoc."
msgstr ""
"Esta protuberancia pulsante sobresale del suelo, sus lados están cubiertos "
"de piel escamosa y rezumante. La superficie es plana, pero se ondula "
"suavemente. Un puñado de apéndices no identificables llegan desde los lados,"
" sugiriendo una especie de pesadilla de autodoctorado viviente."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "scrap antenna"
msgstr "antena de chatarra"

#. ~ Description for scrap antenna
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This contraption looks like some sort of cobbled-together transmitter or "
"receiver antenna.  It consists of a number of mismatched blinking lights, "
"spinning servos, and dangling wires connected to a heft metal box."
msgstr ""
"Este artilugio parece una especie de antena transmisora o receptora "
"improvisada. Consiste en una serie de luces parpadeantes que no coinciden, "
"servos que giran y cables que cuelgan conectados a una caja metálica pesada."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "clang!"
msgstr "¡clang!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "rack of robots"
msgstr "estante de robots"

#. ~ Description for rack of robots
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a wire cage containing a number of robot parts, from chassis to "
"limbs, firmly clamped on to sturdy hanging rods.  It looks like it would be "
"exceptionally difficult to open it and get at them without damaging them, "
"probably by design."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una jaula de alambre que contiene una serie de piezas del robot, "
"desde el chasis hasta las extremidades, firmemente sujetas a resistentes "
"barras colgantes. Parece que sería excepcionalmente difícil abrirla y llegar"
" a ellas sin dañarlas, probablemente por diseño."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "spinning dish"
msgstr "plato giratorio"

#. ~ Description for spinning dish
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a slowly spinning parabolic dish engraved with an unrecognizable "
"pattern of symbols that might, at a guess, be some sort of circuitry pattern"
" - or maybe a religious incantation.  It is mounted on a completely "
"mismatched electric motor that looks fairly mundane."
msgstr ""
"Este es un plato parabólico que gira lentamente y que lleva grabado un "
"patrón irreconocible de símbolos que podría ser, en una suposición, algún "
"tipo de patrón de circuitos, o tal vez un encantamiento religioso. Está "
"montado en un motor eléctrico completamente desajustado que parece bastante "
"mundano."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "scavenged utility light"
msgstr "luz de utilidad recuperada"

#. ~ Description for scavenged utility light
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The bulbs emit an eery greenish glow, and some parts of it have a curved "
"appearance as though the metal were grown in a lab, but by and large this "
"isn't a particularly unusual looking area light."
msgstr ""
"Las bombillas emiten un resplandor verdoso y algunas partes tienen un "
"aspecto curvado, como si el metal hubiera sido cultivado en un laboratorio, "
"pero en general no se trata de una luz de área de aspecto particularmente "
"inusual."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "clanking fluid pump"
msgstr "bomba de fluido chirriante"

#. ~ Description for clanking fluid pump
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The huge sweating pipes and large tank reveal this clanking and tortuous "
"piece of equipment to be some sort of fluid pump.  It is cobbled from "
"several apparently ill-fitting parts that have been fitted together with "
"some very strange looking but surprisingly clever adaptors."
msgstr ""
"Los enormes tubos que transpiran y el gran depósito revelan que esta pieza "
"tortuosa y ruidosa es una especie de bomba de fluidos. Se trata de una bomba"
" de fluidos, fabricada a partir de varias piezas aparentemente inadecuadas "
"que se han montado con unos adaptadores de aspecto muy extraño pero "
"sorprendentemente inteligentes."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "metalloid printer"
msgstr "impresora de metaloides"

#. ~ Description for metalloid printer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This huge device actually resembles a 3D printer fairly closely, aside from "
"its industrial size.  Huge spools of various thin metallic wires top it and "
"feed into what seems to be some sort of nozzle, and massive electrical "
"cables disappear into the wall behind it."
msgstr ""
"Este enorme dispositivo se parece bastante a una impresora 3D, aparte de su "
"tamaño industrial. Enormes bobinas de varios cables metálicos finos lo "
"coronan y alimentan lo que parece ser una especie de boquilla, y enormes "
"cables eléctricos desaparecen en la pared detrás de él."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "circuit printer"
msgstr "impresora de circuitos"

#. ~ Description for circuit printer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a tall device with a lattice of pipes and nozzles.  Based on the "
"pile of products sitting in the output hopper, it looks like it’s used as a "
"printer for complex electronic components."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un aparato alto con un entramado de tubos y boquillas. A juzgar "
"por el montón de productos que hay en la tolva de salida, parece que se "
"utiliza como impresora de componentes electrónicos complejos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Mavrik 10-101 power core"
msgstr "núcleo de energía Mavrik 10-101"

#. ~ Description for Mavrik 10-101 power core
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There is a faded metallic plaque on the side of this cylindrical device.  The lettering is a strange combination of English and Cyrillic script.  It reads:\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи\n"
"Saфetи\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн"
msgstr ""
"En el lateral de este aparato cilíndrico hay una placa metálica descolorida. La letra es una extraña combinación de escritura inglesa y cirílica. En ella se puede leer:\n"
"Mavrik 10-101\n"
"Stabиlиtи\n"
"Saфetи\n"
"A нyuclиar фyutuр ви bilив iн"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "metal screeching!"
msgstr "¡chirrido de metal!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "spherical generator"
msgstr "generador esférico"

#. ~ Description for spherical generator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This huge steel plated sphere gives off a soft hum as it, presumably, "
"generates power.  A heavy lead plate bolted to the front might describe what"
" it is, but it is written in something that looks vaguely like cuneiform."
msgstr ""
"Esta enorme esfera chapada en acero emite un suave zumbido mientras, "
"presumiblemente, genera energía. Una pesada placa de plomo atornillada a la "
"parte delantera podría describir lo que es, pero está escrita en algo que "
"parece vagamente cuneiforme."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fluidic generator"
msgstr "generador de fluidos"

#. ~ Description for fluidic generator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Twisting reams of copper and steel pipes wrap around a central core that "
"thrums softly.  Although there are no labels in any language you recognize, "
"the cables connected to the base suggest that this is some sort of power "
"generator."
msgstr ""
"Unas cuantas tuberías de cobre y acero se enroscan alrededor de un núcleo "
"central que retumba suavemente. Aunque no hay etiquetas en ningún idioma que"
" reconozcas, los cables conectados a la base sugieren que se trata de algún "
"tipo de generador de energía."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "rusty generator"
msgstr "generador oxidado"

#. ~ Description for rusty generator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a tall, unremarkable cylinder capped by a wide flat saucer.  There "
"is heavy rusting at the base.  A series of connected cables suggest that "
"it's some sort of power generator."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un cilindro alto y poco llamativo, coronado por un platillo "
"ancho y plano. Hay una fuerte oxidación en la base. Una serie de cables "
"conectados sugieren que es una especie de generador de energía."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "personal charging station"
msgstr "estación de carga personal"

#. ~ Description for personal charging station
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The cyborg equivalent of a bed, this is a custom-shaped near-vertical booth "
"designed to mount a heavy metal frame and connect it to a central power "
"supply and nutrient source."
msgstr ""
"El equivalente cibernético de una cama, es una cabina casi vertical de forma"
" personalizada diseñada para montar una pesada estructura metálica y "
"conectarla a una fuente de alimentación y nutrientes central."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py src/map.cpp
msgid "crash!"
msgstr "¡crag!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "simple charging station"
msgstr "estación de carga simple"

#. ~ Description for simple charging station
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a simple, unadorned, corroded metal charging and refeeding station, "
"with hookups for two units somewhat larger than a human to stand side by "
"side and be recharged and refueled."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una estación de carga y realimentación simple, sin adornos y "
"corroída, con conectores para dos unidades un poco más grandes que un humano"
" para colocarse lado a lado y que pueden recargarse y repostarse."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "shimmering superstructure"
msgstr "superestructura reluciente"

#. ~ Description for shimmering superstructure
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple metal superstructure like you might see holding up a radio tower, "
"this one seems to give off just the faintest hint of shimmer, like heat "
"waves.  The metal has a burnt, iridescent pattern.  There is a boxy, "
"unimpressive looking device at the top of the tower."
msgstr ""
"Una simple superestructura metálica como la que podría verse sosteniendo una"
" torre de radio, esta parece emitir sólo un leve indicio de brillo, como "
"ondas de calor. El metal tiene un patrón quemado e iridiscente. En la parte "
"superior de la torre hay un dispositivo de aspecto poco impresionante."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "portal enclosure"
msgstr "recinto del portal"

#. ~ Description for portal enclosure
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy metal ring attached to dozens of wires, charred by residue that "
"gives off an acrid, unfamiliar smell."
msgstr ""
"Un pesado anillo de metal unido a decenas de cables, carbonizado por "
"residuos que desprenden un olor acre y desconocido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cooling unit"
msgstr "unidad de refrigeración"

#. ~ Description for cooling unit
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, blocky appliance encased in sheet metal.  This commonplace fixture "
"is used for cooling large indoor areas."
msgstr ""
"Un aparato grande, en forma de bloque, revestido de chapa. Este aparato tan "
"habitual se utiliza para refrigerar grandes superficies interiores."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "central air filter"
msgstr "filtro de aire central"

#. ~ Description for central air filter
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large synthetic membrane used to filter out dust, smoke, mites, and other "
"contaminants from air that passes through it."
msgstr ""
"Una gran membrana sintética utilizada para filtrar el polvo, el humo, los "
"ácaros y otros contaminantes del aire que la atraviesa."

#. ~ Description for dishwasher
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, boxy machine that uses hot water and soap to efficiently clean "
"batches of dishes.  Now that it's sat powerless for a while, a putrid scent "
"of rot is leaking from inside."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina grande y cuadrada que utiliza agua caliente y jabón para limpiar"
" eficientemente las tandas de platos. Ahora que lleva un tiempo sin "
"funcionar, de su interior se desprende un pútrido olor a podrido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "dryer"
msgstr "secadora"

#. ~ Description for dryer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A common household appliance used to quickly dry large batches of clothing "
"after they have been washed."
msgstr ""
"Un electrodoméstico común utilizado para secar rápidamente grandes lotes de "
"ropa después de haberla lavado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
#: lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "refrigerator"
msgstr "nevera"

#. ~ Description for refrigerator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall metal storage container that, if powered, will freeze food and other "
"perishables for preservation."
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor metálico alto de almacenamiento que, si recibe energía, "
"congelará los alimentos y otros productos perecederos para su conservación."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "glass door fridge"
msgstr "Nevera con puerta de cristal"

#. ~ Description for glass door fridge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern refrigerator with a thick sheet of glass in the door, often "
"specially treated to be more insulative.  Allows seeing the contents without"
" letting out the cold air, which used to be a minor convenience, and now "
"saves precious minutes until spoilage."
msgstr ""
"Un frigorífico moderno con una gruesa lámina de vidrio en la puerta, a "
"menudo tratada especialmente para ser más aislante. Permite ver el contenido"
" sin dejar salir el aire frío, lo que antes era una comodidad menor, y ahora"
" ahorra preciosos minutos hasta el deterioro."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "furnace"
msgstr "horno industrial"

#. ~ Description for furnace
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gas-powered forced-air central heating unit, with an internal fan to push "
"the air through a building's ventilation system to keep it warm."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad de calefacción central de aire forzado a gas, con un ventilador "
"interno para empujar el aire a través del sistema de ventilación de un "
"edificio para mantenerlo caliente."

#. ~ Description for washing machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, chunky machine that uses soap and large amounts of water to wash "
"batches of clothes with minimal effort."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina grande y gruesa que utiliza jabón y grandes cantidades de agua "
"para lavar lotes de ropa con el mínimo esfuerzo."

#. ~ Description for oven
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A standard convection-based oven, commonly used for heating and cooking "
"food.  You could safely light a fire inside or power it with UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un horno estándar basado en convección, utilizado habitualmente para "
"calentar y cocinar alimentos. Puedes encender un fuego en su interior o "
"alimentarlo con un SAI."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "blacksmith bellows"
msgstr "fuelles de herrero"

#. ~ Description for blacksmith bellows
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An old device for pushing air into a blacksmith's forge to strengthen the "
"fire and maintain a high temperature.  Useless in its current state, but "
"good for parts."
msgstr ""
"Antiguo dispositivo para introducir aire en la fragua del herrero para "
"reforzar el fuego y mantener una temperatura elevada. Inútil en su estado "
"actual, pero bueno para partes."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "blacksmith drop hammer"
msgstr "martillo pilón de herrero"

#. ~ Description for blacksmith drop hammer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An anvil with a large metal hammer suspended above it in a metal framework."
"  If it were working, it would be useful for shaping softened metal plates, "
"though now it is only useful for parts."
msgstr ""
"Un yunque con un gran martillo de metal suspendido sobre él en un marco "
"metálico. Si funcionara, sería útil para dar forma a las placas de metal "
"reblandecido, aunque ahora solo sirve para partes."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "document shredder"
msgstr "trituradora de documentos"

#. ~ Description for document shredder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple electronic device mounted to a large basket.  It is designed to "
"efficiently destroy paper documents with sensitive information.  Good for "
"parts, as identity theft and corporate espionage probably aren't big "
"concerns anymore."
msgstr ""
"Un sencillo dispositivo electrónico montado en una gran papelera. Está "
"diseñado para destruir eficazmente los documentos en papel con información "
"sensible. Es bueno para las partes, ya que el robo de identidad y el "
"espionaje corporativo probablemente ya no son grandes preocupaciones."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "server stack"
msgstr "pila de servidores"

#. ~ Description for server stack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large rack of specialized computers for storing and transmitting "
"information.  Powerless and largely useless for its intended purpose, the "
"laptops mounted inside can still be used if removed."
msgstr ""
"Un gran bastidor de ordenadores especializados para almacenar y transmitir "
"información. Sin energía y en gran medida inútil para su propósito, los "
"ordenadores portátiles montados en su interior pueden seguir utilizándose si"
" se extraen."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "large satellite dish"
msgstr "gran antena parabólica"

#. ~ Description for large satellite dish
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, concave metal panel with simple electronics used to receive signals"
" from satellites.  While the hundreds of expensive machines orbiting the "
"planet will likely continue to function indefinitely, their various purposes"
" have all been lost."
msgstr ""
"Un gran panel metálico cóncavo con una electrónica sencilla que sirve para "
"recibir señales de los satélites. Aunque es probable que los cientos de "
"costosas máquinas que orbitan el planeta sigan funcionando indefinidamente, "
"sus diversos propósitos se han perdido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mounted solar panel"
msgstr "panel solar montado"

#. ~ Description for mounted solar panel
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of photovoltaic power generators, which turns solar radiation into "
"useable electricity.  While useful before the cataclysm, they have become "
"priceless tools, invaluable to any survivor."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de generadores de energía fotovoltaica, que convierte la "
"radiación solar en electricidad utilizable. Mientras que eran útiles antes "
"del cataclismo, ahora se han convertido en herramientas de valor "
"incalculable para cualquier superviviente."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py src/melee.cpp
msgid "whack!"
msgstr "¡porrazo!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "road barricade"
msgstr "barricada de camino"

#. ~ Description for road barricade
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large wooden blockade used to block passage through a road.  It is lined "
"with reflective tape to increase visibility.  Despite the name, it does "
"little to stop a moving car."
msgstr ""
"Es un gran obstáculo de madera que se usa para bloquear el tránsito de una "
"calle. Está bordeado con cinta adhesiva reflectante para incrementar su "
"visibilidad. A pesar de su nombre, no logra mucho para detener a un vehículo"
" en movimiento."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py src/mapdata.cpp src/vehicle_move.cpp
msgid "smash!"
msgstr "¡clonc!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "gravelbag barricade"
msgstr "barricada de sacos de grava"

#. ~ Description for gravelbag barricade
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A low wall made of stacked gravelbags, uncommonly used to catch bullets and "
"block flooding."
msgstr ""
"Un muro bajo hecho de sacos de grava apilados, no comunmente utilizado para "
"atrapar balas y bloquear inundaciones."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "rrrip!"
msgstr "¡rrrip!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "gravelbag wall"
msgstr "pared de sacos de grava"

#. ~ Description for gravelbag wall
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A wall of stacked gravelbags, a bit taller than an average adult."
msgstr ""
"Un muro de sacos de grava apilados, un poco más alto que un adulto medio."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "earthbag barricade"
msgstr "Barricada de sacos de tierra"

#. ~ Description for earthbag barricade
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A low wall made of stacked earthbags, commonly used to catch bullets and "
"block flooding."
msgstr ""
"Un muro bajo hecho de sacos de tierra apilados, comúnmente utilizado para "
"atrapar balas y bloquear inundaciones."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "earthbag wall"
msgstr "muro de bolsas de tierra"

#. ~ Description for earthbag wall
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A wall of stacked earthbags, a bit taller than an average adult."
msgstr ""
"Un muro de sacos de tierra apilados, un poco más alto que un adulto medio."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "lane guard"
msgstr "guardarraíl"

#. ~ Description for lane guard
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A simple wooden post to mark the separation between street lanes."
msgstr ""
"Un muro de sacos de tierra apilados, un poco más alto que un adulto medio."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sandbag barricade"
msgstr "barricada de bolsas de arena"

#. ~ Description for sandbag barricade
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A low wall made of canvas sacks filled with sand, commonly used to catch "
"bullets and prevent flooding."
msgstr ""
"Muro bajo hecho con sacos de lona rellenos de arena, comúnmente utilizado "
"para atrapar balas y evitar inundaciones."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sandbag wall"
msgstr "pared de bolsas de arena"

#. ~ Description for sandbag wall
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A wall of stacked sandbags, a bit taller than an average adult."
msgstr ""
"Un muro de sacos de arena apilados, un poco más alto que un adulto medio."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "standing mirror"
msgstr "espejo de pie"

#. ~ Description for standing mirror
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full-length mirror mounted in a sleek metal frame.  You can easily see all"
" of the dirt and blood on your clothes, and the weariness in your eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un espejo de cuerpo entero montado en un elegante marco de metal. Puede ver "
"fácilmente toda la suciedad y la sangre en tu ropa, y el cansancio en tus "
"ojos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "glass breaking"
msgstr "cristal rompiéndose"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "broken standing mirror"
msgstr "espejo de pie roto"

#. ~ Description for broken standing mirror
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal frame for a full-length mirror, with most of the mirror missing.  "
"What remains in the frame are large dangerous-looking shards of fractured "
"glass."
msgstr ""
"Un marco metálico para un espejo de cuerpo entero, al que le falta la mayor "
"parte del espejo. Lo que queda en el marco son grandes fragmentos de cristal"
" fracturado de aspecto peligroso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bitts"
msgstr "bolardo"

#. ~ Description for bitts
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pair of vertical iron posts mounted on a wharf, pier, or other form of "
"dock.  They are used to secure mooring lines, ropes, and similar."
msgstr ""
"Un par de postes verticales de hierro montados en un muelle, embarcadero u "
"otra forma de muelle. Se utilizan para asegurar cabos de amarre, cuerdas y "
"similares."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cleat"
msgstr "cala"

#. ~ Description for cleat
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small horn cleat with two “horns” extending parallel to the deck or the "
"axis of the spar, and resembling a small anvil.  They are used to secure "
"mooring lines, ropes, and similar."
msgstr ""
"Pequeña cala de cuerno con dos \"cuernos\" que se extienden paralelos a la "
"cubierta o al eje del palo, y que se asemejan a un pequeño yunque. Se "
"utilizan para asegurar cabos de amarre, cuerdas y similares."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "manacles"
msgstr "esposas"

#. ~ Description for manacles
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A pair of metal shackles with heavy chains mounted to a wall or floor."
msgstr ""
"Un par de grilletes metálicos con pesadas cadenas montados en una pared o en"
" el suelo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "crack."
msgstr "crack."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "statue"
msgstr "estatua"

#. ~ Description for statue
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive block of stone that has been carefully carved into a work of "
"timeless art."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme bloque de piedra que ha sido cuidadosamente tallado en una obra de"
" arte intemporal."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "thump."
msgstr "pum."

#. ~ Description for mannequin
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A life-size wooden figure of a person, most commonly used to display "
"clothing in stores, or for tailors to design outfits on.  Considering all "
"that's happened, something about it is somewhat unnerving."
msgstr ""
"Una figura de madera de tamaño natural de una persona, más comúnmente "
"utilizada para mostrar la ropa en las tiendas, o para que los sastres "
"diseñen trajes. Teniendo en cuenta todo lo que ha sucedido, hay algo que me "
"desconcierta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "birdbath"
msgstr "baño de aves"

#. ~ Description for birdbath
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wide stone bowl mounted to a pedestal, usually filled with rainwater, "
"meant for birds to play or bathe in."
msgstr ""
"Recipiente ancho de piedra montado en un pedestal, generalmente lleno de "
"agua de lluvia, destinado a que los pájaros jueguen o se bañen en él."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "gazing ball"
msgstr "bola de observación"

#. ~ Description for gazing ball
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A mirrored glass globe mounted on a cement pedestal.  It warps your "
"reflection when you look into it"
msgstr ""
"Un globo de cristal espejado montado sobre un pedestal de cemento. Deforma "
"tu reflejo cuando te miras en él"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "rotary clothes dryer line"
msgstr "línea de secadora de ropa rotativa"

#. ~ Description for rotary clothes dryer line
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A central metal pole holding up a wide rotating frame, this would be used to"
" hang up clothes to dry in the sunlight."
msgstr ""
"Un poste metálico central que sostiene un amplio bastidor giratorio, que "
"serviría para colgar la ropa para que se secara a la luz del sol."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "floor lamp"
msgstr "lámpara de suelo"

#. ~ Description for floor lamp
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light mounted on the top of a metal pole, this would be plugged into a "
"wall socket to illuminate a room."
msgstr ""
"Una luz montada en la parte superior de un poste metálico, que se conecta a "
"una toma de corriente para iluminar una habitación."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bonk!"
msgstr "¡Bonk!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pine wreath"
msgstr "corona de pino"

#. ~ Description for pine wreath
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A decorative wreath for the winter holidays."
msgstr "Una corona decorativa para las vacaciones de invierno."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sand castle"
msgstr "castillo de arena"

#. ~ Description for sand castle
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A glorious castle made of sand.  This mighty fortress will stand tall for "
"the ages to come, a true testimony of the skills of its builder."
msgstr ""
"Un glorioso castillo de arena. Esta poderosa fortaleza se mantendrá en pie "
"durante los siglos venideros, un verdadero testimonio de las habilidades de "
"su constructor."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "crunch."
msgstr "crunch."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "decorative tree"
msgstr "árbol decorativo"

#. ~ Description for decorative tree
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A decorative pine tree littered with ornaments for the winter holidays."
msgstr ""
"Un pino decorativo repleto de adornos para las vacaciones de invierno."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "indoor plant"
msgstr "planta de interior"

#. ~ Description for indoor plant
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small potted plant, used for decoration indoors.  It appears to have dried"
" up and died a while ago."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña planta en maceta, utilizada como decoración en el interior. "
"Parece que se ha secado y ha muerto hace tiempo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "yellow indoor plant"
msgstr "planta amarilla de interior"

#. ~ Description for yellow indoor plant
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A decorative potted plant with a yellow flower, it looks to have wilted and "
"died some time ago."
msgstr ""
"Una planta decorativa en maceta con una flor amarilla, parece haberse "
"marchitado y muerto hace tiempo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "harvestable plant"
msgstr "planta cosechable"

#. ~ Description for harvestable plant
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This plant is fully grown and ready to be harvested.  Identifying how to "
"harvest it requires closer examination."
msgstr ""
"Esta planta está completamente desarrollada y lista para ser cosechada. "
"Identificar cómo cosecharla requiere un examen más detallado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "whish."
msgstr "frufrú"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mature plant"
msgstr "planta madura"

#. ~ Description for mature plant
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This plant has matured, and will be ready to harvest before long."
msgstr "Esta planta ha madurado y estará lista para cosechar en poco tiempo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "seed"
msgstr "semilla"

#. ~ Description for seed
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A freshly planted seed.  If properly tended to, it could grow into a healthy"
" plant."
msgstr ""
"Una semilla recién plantada. Si se cuida adecuadamente, puede convertirse en"
" una planta sana."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "seedling"
msgstr "brote"

#. ~ Description for seedling
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr "Una semilla que acaba de empezar a echar sus primeras raíces."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "planter"
msgstr "sembradora"

#. ~ Description for planter
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  Can "
"be used for planting crops."
msgstr ""
"Una jardinera llena de tierra y listones para permitir un drenaje adecuado. "
"Puede utilizarse para plantar cultivos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "planter with harvestable plant"
msgstr "plantador con planta cosechable"

#. ~ Description for planter with harvestable plant
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a fully grown plant, and will need closer examination to harvest."
msgstr ""
"Una jardinera llena de tierra y con listones para permitir un drenaje "
"adecuado. Esta tiene una planta completamente crecida, y necesitará un "
"examen más detallado para cosechar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "planter with mature plant"
msgstr "maceta con planta madura"

#. ~ Description for planter with mature plant
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a matured plant that should be ready for harvest before long."
msgstr ""
"Una jardinera llena de tierra y con listones para permitir un drenaje "
"adecuado. Esta tiene una planta madura que debería estar lista para la "
"cosecha en poco tiempo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "planter with seed"
msgstr "maceta con semilla"

#. ~ Description for planter with seed
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one contains a planted seed, and will need attention to grow fully."
msgstr ""
"Una jardinera llena de tierra y con listones para permitir un drenaje "
"adecuado. Esta contiene una semilla plantada, y necesitará atención para "
"crecer plenamente."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "planter with seedling"
msgstr "maceta con planta de semillero"

#. ~ Description for planter with seedling
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A garden planter full of soil and slatted to allow adequate drainage.  This "
"one has a seed that has just begun to sprout its first roots."
msgstr ""
"Una jardinera llena de tierra y con listones para permitir un drenaje "
"adecuado. Esta tiene una semilla que acaba de empezar a echar sus primeras "
"raíces."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "spider egg sack"
msgstr "capullo de huevo de araña"

#. ~ Description for spider egg sack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sizable, off-white sac of large eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see "
"them moving slightly.  Gross."
msgstr ""
"Un saco considerable, blanquecino, de huevos grandes. Al observar más de "
"cerca, se puede ver que se mueven ligeramente. Asqueroso."

#. ~ Description for spider egg sack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bulbous mass of off-white spider eggs.  Upon watching closer, you can see "
"them moving a bit.  Really gross."
msgstr ""
"Una masa bulbosa de huevos de araña de color blanquecino. Al observar más de"
" cerca, se puede ver que se mueven un poco. Realmente asqueroso."

#. ~ Description for spider egg sack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gigantic sac of spider's eggs, each one larger than your fist.  They're "
"definitely moving around.  Really gross, just seeing it makes your skin "
"crawl."
msgstr ""
"Un gigantesco saco de huevos de araña, cada uno más grande que tu puño. "
"Definitivamente se están moviendo. Realmente asqueroso, sólo con verlo se te"
" eriza la piel."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "ruptured egg sack"
msgstr "capullo roto de huevo"

#. ~ Description for ruptured egg sack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A disgusting ruptured sac of giant spider eggs.  The thought of all those "
"massive baby spiders pouring out of it is almost terrifying on its own."
msgstr ""
"Un asqueroso saco roto de huevos de araña gigantes. La idea de todas esas "
"enormes crías de araña saliendo de él es casi aterradora por sí misma."

#. ~ Description for swamp gas
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a pool of murky water, it occasionally bubbles, releasing a mildly "
"toxic gas."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una piscina de agua turbia, ocasionalmente burbujea, liberando un "
"gas ligeramente tóxico."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py src/ballistics.cpp src/map.cpp
msgid "splash!"
msgstr "splash!"

#. ~ Description for fog
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a misty cloud of fog."
msgstr "Esta es una bruma de niebla."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "metal grate"
msgstr "reja de metal"

#. ~ Description for metal grate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can feel cool air seeping out of it."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una rejilla de ventilación de metal, puedes sentir aire fresco "
"filtrándose de ella."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can feel cold air blasting out of it."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una rejilla de ventilación de metal, puedes sentir  aire frío "
"saliendo de ella."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can feel hot air seeping out of it."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una rejilla de ventilación de metal, puedes sentir el aire caliente "
"filtrándose de ella."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can see smoke seeping from it."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una rejilla de ventilación de metal, puedes ver el humo que se "
"filtra por ella."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent, you can see smoke streaming out of it."
msgstr ""
"Esto es una rejilla de ventilación de metal, puedes ver el humo fluyendo de "
"ella."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent, toxic looking clouds seep from it."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una rejilla de ventilación metálica, de la que se filtran nubes de "
"aspecto tóxico."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent, toxic looking clouds emerge from it."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una rejilla de ventilación metálica, de la que emergen nubes de "
"aspecto tóxico."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This is a metal vent."
msgstr "Esta es una rejilla de ventilación de metal."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fake workbench hands"
msgstr "Manos falsas en el banco de trabajo"

#. ~ Description for fake workbench hands
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This fake workbench holds the stats for working on a wielded item."
msgstr ""
"Esta mesa de trabajo falsa contiene los atributos para trabajar en un "
"artículo esgrimido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "ground crafting spot"
msgstr "lugar de fabricación en la piso"

#. ~ Description for ground crafting spot
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cleared spot on the ground for crafting.  Slower than using a workbench or"
" holding a project in your hands, but readily available."
msgstr ""
"Un lugar despejado en el suelo para fabricación. Más lento que usar un banco"
" de trabajo o tener un proyecto en las manos, pero fácilmente disponible."

#. ~ Description for seeing this is a bug
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Seeing this is a bug.  If seen, please report and destroy."
msgstr "Ver esto es un error. Si lo ven, por favor informen y destruyan."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fireplace"
msgstr "chimenea"

#. ~ Description for fireplace
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A common fixture for safely hosting a fire indoors, with a chimney to vent "
"the smoke to the outside.  Dangerous to leave unattended while lit."
msgstr ""
"Un accesorio común para albergar con seguridad un fuego en el interior, con "
"una chimenea para ventilar el humo al exterior. Es peligroso dejarlo "
"desatendido mientras está encendido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "wood stove"
msgstr "cocina de madera"

#. ~ Description for wood stove
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple metal stove for hosting wood-fueled fires.  Good for cooking or "
"heating food, and safe to have indoors."
msgstr ""
"Una sencilla estufa de metal para hacer fuego con leña. Buena para cocinar o"
" calentar alimentos, y segura para tener en el interior."

#. ~ Description for brazier
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A raised metal dish in which to safely burn things."
msgstr "Un plato de metal elevado en el que quemar cosas de forma segura."

#. ~ Description for fire barrel (200L)
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes "
"punched in the walls for air supply."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme barril de metal utilizado para contener de forma segura un fuego. "
"Tiene múltiples agujeros perforados en las paredes para el suministro de "
"aire."

#. ~ Description for fire barrel (100L)
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large metal barrel used to safely contain a fire.  It has multiple holes "
"punched in the walls for air supply."
msgstr ""
"Un gran barril de metal utilizado para contener de forma segura un fuego. "
"Tiene múltiples agujeros perforados en las paredes para el suministro de "
"aire."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fire ring"
msgstr "anillo de fuego"

#. ~ Description for fire ring
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A ring of stones to safely contain a fire."
msgstr "Un anillo de piedras para contener el fuego de forma segura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mutated poppy flower"
msgstr "flor de amapola mutada"

#. ~ Description for mutated poppy flower
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These strange flowers have appeared in the wake of the Cataclysm, and their "
"buds can be used for medicinal purposes, like the seeds of the mundane poppy"
" they're named after.  The dirt around them gently churns as their roots "
"writhe beneath the soil, and it's surrounded by an overwhelming floral smell"
" that makes you feel sleepy."
msgstr ""
"Estas extrañas flores han aparecido tras el cataclismo, y sus brotes pueden "
"ser utilizados con fines medicinales, como las semillas de la amapola "
"mundana de la que reciben el nombre. La tierra a su alrededor se agita "
"suavemente mientras sus raíces se retuercen bajo el suelo, y está rodeada de"
" un abrumador olor floral que te hace sentir somnoliento."

#. ~ Description for dandelion
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A common weed with a yellow flower.  Produces seeds that get carried on the "
"wind by thin, gray filaments."
msgstr ""
"Una hierba común con una flor amarilla. Produce semillas que son "
"transportadas por el viento por finos filamentos grises."

#. ~ Description for burdock
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A common weed with a purple thistle-like flower.  Its seeds tend to stick to"
" clothing and fur."
msgstr ""
"Una hierba común con una flor púrpura parecida al cardo. Sus semillas "
"tienden a pegarse a la ropa y al pelaje."

#. ~ Description for chamomile
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Ahh, soothing chamomile tea."
msgstr "Ahh, té de manzanilla relajante."

#. ~ Description for tulip
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A bright, colorful flower with petals forming a small cup at its top."
msgstr ""
"Una flor brillante y colorida con pétalos que forman una pequeña copa en su "
"parte superior."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "spurge flower"
msgstr "flor de espolones"

#. ~ Description for spurge flower
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A yellow-green flower that grows in densely packed bushes."
msgstr "Una flor verde-amarilla que crece en arbustos densamente poblados."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cattails"
msgstr "espadañas"

#. ~ Description for cattails
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This useful plant is available all year round.  Many parts of the plant are "
"edible."
msgstr ""
"Esta útil planta está disponible durante todo el año. Muchas partes de la "
"planta son comestibles."

#. ~ Description for black eyed susan
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A yellow flower that has a dark ball in the middle.  Sometimes known as an "
"ox-eye daisy."
msgstr ""
"Una flor amarilla que tiene una bola oscura en el medio. A veces conocida "
"como margarita de ojo de buey."

#. ~ Description for lily
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A pretty flower that comes in a variety of colors."
msgstr "Una bonita flor que viene en una variedad de colores."

#. ~ Description for sunflower
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall, wide-headed flower with a large dark center.  Produces many "
"nutritious seeds."
msgstr ""
"Una flor alta, de cabeza ancha, con un gran centro oscuro. Produce muchas "
"semillas nutritivas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "lilypad"
msgstr "nenúfar"

#. ~ Description for lilypad
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These lilypads don't look they'd support the weight of the things you've "
"heard croaking in the swamp."
msgstr ""
"Estos nenúfares no parece que vayan a poder soportar el peso de las cosas "
"que escuchaste croando en el pantano."

#. ~ Description for bluebell
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A common bluebell flower.  Pretty."
msgstr "Una flor de campanilla común. Bonita."

#. ~ Description for dahlia
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A puffy flower with many tightly layered petals."
msgstr "Una flor hinchada con muchos pétalos de capas apretadas."

#. ~ Description for chicory
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A blue flower imported from Europe, also known as a Cornflower."
msgstr "Una flor azul importada de Europa, también conocida como aciano."

#. ~ Description for datura
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A pretty moonflower."
msgstr "Una bonita flor de luna."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pile of leaves"
msgstr "pila de hojas"

#. ~ Description for pile of leaves
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sizable pile of leaves.  You could sleep on it if you don't care about "
"comfort or warmth."
msgstr ""
"Una gran pila de hojas. Podrías dormir en ella si no te importa la comodidad"
" o el calor."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py src/iuse.cpp
msgid "crunch!"
msgstr "¡crunch!"

#. ~ Description for mustard
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Yellow flower known as Brassica Nigra.  Known for its seeds that can be used"
" for making table mustard."
msgstr ""
"Flor amarilla conocida como Brassica Nigra. Conocida por sus semillas que se"
" pueden utilizar para hacer mostaza de mesa."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "short hedge"
msgstr "seto corto"

#. ~ Description for short hedge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a squared shape."
msgstr "Arbusto de pequeñas hojas verdes, recortadas en forma de cuadrado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "tall hedge"
msgstr "seto alto"

#. ~ Description for tall hedge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a squared shape.  You "
"can't see past this thick hedgerow."
msgstr ""
"Un arbusto alto con pequeñas hojas verdes, recortado en forma de cuadrado. "
"No se puede ver más allá de este espeso seto."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "abstract topiary"
msgstr "topiario abstracto"

#. ~ Description for abstract topiary
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a fanciful abstract "
"shape."
msgstr ""
"Un arbusto alto con pequeñas hojas verdes, recortadas en una fantasiosa "
"forma abstracta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "animal topiary"
msgstr "topiario animal"

#. ~ Description for animal topiary
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into an animal shape."
msgstr ""
"Un arbusto alto con pequeñas hojas verdes, recortadas en forma de animal."

#. ~ Description for animal topiary
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A tall shrub with small green leaves, trimmed into a dragon shape."
msgstr ""
"Un arbusto alto con pequeñas hojas verdes, recortadas en forma de drogón."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "marloss flower"
msgstr "flor de marloss"

#. ~ Description for marloss flower
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This flower is like the other flowers taken by the mushrooms, but its bulb "
"is colored a brilliant cyan color.  It emits an aroma both overwhelming and "
"strangely alluring."
msgstr ""
"Esta flor es como las otras flores tomadas por los hongos, pero su bulbo es "
"de un color cian brillante. Emite un aroma a la vez abrumador y extrañamente"
" seductor."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "poof."
msgstr "puf."

#. ~ Description for fungal flower
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This flower has been overgrown by gray, sinewy tendrils of fungus, and the "
"color has been leached from its petals and stem.  It gently sways of its own"
" volition, maintaining an unsettling rhythm."
msgstr ""
"Esta flor ha sido cubierta por zarcillos grises y fibrosos de hongos, y el "
"color se ha desprendido de sus pétalos y su tallo. Se balancea suavemente "
"por voluntad propia, manteniendo un ritmo inquietante."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fungal mass"
msgstr "masa fúngica"

#. ~ Description for fungal mass
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick ropes of mycal matter have covered the ground here completely.  It's "
"soft to the touch, but not firm enough to hold any weight."
msgstr ""
"Gruesas cuerdas de materia micótica han cubierto el suelo por completo. Es "
"suave al tacto, pero no lo suficientemente firme como para sostener "
"cualquier peso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fungal clump"
msgstr "grumo fúngico"

#. ~ Description for fungal clump
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alien mold and stems mingle tightly here, swaying around and weaving "
"together, creating a sort of fungal bush."
msgstr ""
"El moho y los tallos alienígenas se mezclan con fuerza aquí, balanceándose y"
" entrelazándose, creando una especie de arbusto de hongos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fungal tangle"
msgstr "enredo fúngico"

#. ~ Description for fungal tangle
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick, ropy tendrils of fungus have risen from the ground and gathered into "
"an impenetrable clump."
msgstr ""
"Gruesos zarcillos de hongos se han levantado del suelo y se han reunido en "
"un grupo impenetrable."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "squelch."
msgstr "silenciador"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "stone slab"
msgstr "escalón de piedra"

#. ~ Description for stone slab
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A slab of heavy stone, with a reasonably flat surface."
msgstr "Una losa de piedra pesada, con una superficie razonablemente plana."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "headstone"
msgstr "lápida"

#. ~ Description for headstone
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large slab of stone, engraved with information on the deceased individual "
"buried beneath.  While only a solemn reminder of the uncountable losses of "
"the Cataclysm, a proper final resting place grants an odd sense of peace."
msgstr ""
"Una gran losa de piedra, grabada con información sobre el individuo "
"fallecido enterrado debajo. Aunque sólo es un solemne recordatorio de las "
"incontables pérdidas del Cataclismo, un lugar de descanso final adecuado "
"otorga una extraña sensación de paz."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py src/map.cpp
#: src/mapdata.cpp
msgid "thump!"
msgstr "¡pum!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "gravestone"
msgstr "tumba"

#. ~ Description for gravestone
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An upright slab of stone with information engraved on the face about whoever"
" lies beneath.  While only a solemn reminder of the countless casualties of "
"the Cataclysm, a proper final resting place grants an odd sense of peace."
msgstr ""
"Una losa vertical de piedra con información grabada en la cara sobre quien "
"yace debajo. Aunque sólo es un solemne recordatorio de las innumerables "
"víctimas del Cataclismo, un lugar de descanso final adecuado otorga una "
"extraña sensación de paz."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "worn gravestone"
msgstr "tumba desgastada"

#. ~ Description for worn gravestone
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An aged and eroded gravestone, damaged to the point of rendering the "
"inscription illegible.  Whoever's buried here was probably lucky enough to "
"pass before all this chaos began."
msgstr ""
"Una lápida envejecida y erosionada, dañada hasta el punto de hacer ilegible "
"la inscripción. Quienquiera que esté enterrado aquí probablemente tuvo la "
"suerte de pasar antes de que empezara todo este caos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "obelisk"
msgstr "obelisco"

#. ~ Description for obelisk
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A magnificent carved statue with an engraved plaque fixed to the base.  It "
"serves to honor the passing of somebody significant, something one wishes "
"was still a practical goal."
msgstr ""
"Una magnífica estatua tallada con una placa grabada fijada en la base. Sirve"
" para honrar el fallecimiento de alguien significativo, algo que uno "
"desearía que siguiera siendo un objetivo práctico."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "thunk!"
msgstr "thunk!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "robotic assembler"
msgstr "ensamblador robótico"

#. ~ Description for robotic assembler
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A durable and versatile robotic arm with a tool fitted to the end, for "
"working on an assembly line.  Despite its specialized purpose being all but "
"lost now, it could provide a plethora of useful parts if disassembled."
msgstr ""
"Un brazo robótico duradero y versátil con una herramienta instalada en el "
"extremo, para trabajar en una cadena de montaje. A pesar de que su propósito"
" específico ya casi se ha perdido, podría proporcionar una plétora de piezas"
" útiles si se desmonta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "chemical mixer"
msgstr "mezclador químico"

#. ~ Description for chemical mixer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large vat with a motorized mixing device for combining large quantities of"
" chemicals."
msgstr ""
"Una gran cuba con un dispositivo de mezcla motorizado para combinar grandes "
"cantidades de productos químicos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken generator"
msgstr "generador roto"

#. ~ Description for broken generator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This generator is broken and will not help you produce usable electricity."
msgstr ""
"Este generador está roto y no te ayudará a producir electricidad útil."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope Generator"
msgstr "Generador de Radioisótopos Sterling Avanzado y Compacto"

#. ~ Description for Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope Generator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This hefty lump of steel and lead is the housing unit for a small nuclear "
"reactor.  It is plastered with warning signs.  You could probably ignore "
"those and salvage the steel and lead shielding, what could possibly go "
"wrong?"
msgstr ""
"Este enorme bloque de acero y plomo es la carcasa de un pequeño reactor "
"nuclear. Está lleno de señales de advertencia. Probablemente podrías "
"ignorarlas y salvar el blindaje de acero y plomo, ¿qué podría salir mal?"

#. ~ Description for Compact Advanced Sterling Radioisotope Generator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some insane fool has removed the outer containment on this small-scale "
"nuclear reactor.  It is still fairly safe as it is: the reactor has "
"considerable built-in containment as well.  Nevertheless, you probably don't"
" want to stand too close for too long."
msgstr ""
"Algún loco ha eliminado la contención exterior de este reactor nuclear a "
"pequeña escala. Sigue siendo bastante seguro tal y como está: el reactor "
"tiene también una considerable contención incorporada. No obstante, "
"probablemente no quieras estar demasiado cerca de él durante mucho tiempo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mobile antenna"
msgstr "antena móvil"

#. ~ Description for mobile antenna
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stark black directional antenna, seemingly part of a monitoring setup.  A "
"led mounted on its back lights up with a lazy and irregular rhythm."
msgstr ""
"Una antena direccional de color negro, que parece formar parte de un sistema"
" de vigilancia. Un led montado en su parte trasera se ilumina con un ritmo "
"perezoso e irregular."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "light machinery"
msgstr "maquinaria ligera"

#. ~ Description for light machinery
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Assorted light machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "Maquinaria ligera variada. Podrías buscar piezas en la basura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "ting."
msgstr "ting."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "heavy machinery"
msgstr "maquinaria pesada"

#. ~ Description for heavy machinery
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Assorted heavy machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "Maquinaria pesada variada. Podrías buscar piezas en la basura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "old machinery"
msgstr "maquinaria antigua"

#. ~ Description for old machinery
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Assorted old, rusty machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "Una variedad de maquinaria vieja y oxidada. Podrías buscar piezas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "electronic machinery"
msgstr "maquinaria eléctrica"

#. ~ Description for electronic machinery
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Assorted electronic machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "Maquinaria electrónica variada. Podrías buscar piezas en la basura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "robotic arm"
msgstr "brazo robótico"

#. ~ Description for robotic arm
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An automated robotic arm used in assembly lines, which appears to be more "
"general-purpose than specially designed assemblers.  Despite being "
"functionless now, the parts could be useful."
msgstr ""
"Un brazo robótico automatizado utilizado en las cadenas de montaje, que "
"parece ser más de uso general que los ensambladores especialmente diseñados."
" A pesar de no ser funcional ahora, las piezas podrían ser útiles."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "thunk."
msgstr "tonk,"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "ground cable"
msgstr "cable de tierra"

#. ~ Description for ground cable
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A bunch of loose cables snake along the floor."
msgstr "Un montón de cables sueltos serpentean por el suelo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "shred!"
msgstr "¡triturado!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "thud!"
msgstr "¡golpes secos!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "capacitor bank"
msgstr "banco condensador"

#. ~ Description for capacitor bank
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A bank of heavy metal cylinders connected by large wires."
msgstr ""
"Un banco de pesados cilindros metálicos conectados por grandes cables."

#. ~ Description for control station
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Assorted electronic interfaces and screens.  You could scavenge it for "
"parts."
msgstr ""
"Surtido de interfaces electrónicas y pantallas. Podrías buscar piezas en la "
"basura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Autodoc Mk. XI"
msgstr "Autodoc Mk. XI"

#. ~ Description for Autodoc Mk. XI
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A surgical apparatus used for installation and removal of bionics.  The term"
" name 'Autodoc' is something of a misnomer, as it can only operate if "
"programmed beforehand, something that a plethora of labels warn against "
"doing without expertise."
msgstr ""
"Un aparato quirúrgico utilizado para la instalación y retirada de biónicos. "
"El nombre de \"Autodoc\" es un poco erróneo, ya que sólo puede funcionar si "
"se programa de antemano, algo que una plétora de etiquetas advierten que no "
"se debe hacer sin experiencia."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Autodoc operation couch"
msgstr "Camilla de operación autodoc"

#. ~ Description for Autodoc operation couch
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plush red sofa made less comfortable by the medical machinery directly "
"above it.  It has a single leather strap on the right armrest."
msgstr ""
"Es un sofá rojo de felpa que se ha vuelto menos cómodo por las máquinas "
"médicas que tiene arriba. Tiene una correa de cuero en el apoyabrazos "
"derecho."

#. ~ Description for autoclave
#. ~ Description for filled autoclave
#. ~ Description for autoclave
#. ~ Description for filled autoclave
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A device that can steam its contents at high enough tempuratures to "
"completely sterilize them, killing any possible contaminants."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo que puede vaporizar su contenido a temperaturas lo "
"suficientemente altas como para esterilizarlo completamente, matando "
"cualquier posible contaminante."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "filled autoclave"
msgstr "autoclave lleno"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sample freezer"
msgstr "congelador de muestras"

#. ~ Description for sample freezer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A specialized freezer capable of maintaining tempuratures of -80 Celsieus, "
"and is often used only for the preservation of delicate scientific samples."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un congelador especializado capaz de mantener temperaturas de "
"-80 grados centígrados y que suele utilizarse únicamente para la "
"conservación de muestras científicas delicadas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "lab workbench"
msgstr "banco de trabajo de laboratorio"

#. ~ Description for lab workbench
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal storage cabinet topped by a durable resin countertop resistant to "
"most chemical spills and burns.  It has wired in electrical and gas "
"fittings."
msgstr ""
"Un gabinete de almacenamiento de metal coronado por una encimera de resina "
"duradera resistente a la mayoría de los derrames y quemaduras químicas. "
"Tiene cableado en los accesorios eléctricos y de gas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fume hood"
msgstr "campana extractora"

#. ~ Description for fume hood
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal hood overtop of a lab workspace, with durable glass shutters.  A fan"
" in the hood draws fumes and smoke from dangerous chemicals up into a "
"ventilation duct."
msgstr ""
"Una capucha de metal sobre el espacio de trabajo de un laboratorio, con "
"duras persianas de vidrio. Un ventilador en la campana atrae los vapores y "
"el humo de los productos químicos peligrosos hacia un conducto de "
"ventilación."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "shaker incubator"
msgstr "incubadora vibratoria"

#. ~ Description for shaker incubator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tool for keeping chemical broth nicely mixed, at just the right "
"temperature to grow bacteria.  Although, more bacteria is probably the last "
"thing you need, considering the circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta para mantener el caldo químico bien mezclado, a la "
"temperatura justa para cultivar bacterias. Aunque, probablemente, más "
"bacterias es lo último que necesitas, teniendo en cuenta las circunstancias."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "emergency wash station"
msgstr "estación de lavado de emergencia"

#. ~ Description for emergency wash station
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A standing sink with a pair of nozzles, along with a large and brightly-"
"colored handle.  It is specially designed to quickly remove contaminants "
"from the eyes, and is easily usable without being able to see very well.  A "
"sizable notice warns against drinking the water it uses."
msgstr ""
"Un lavabo de pie con un par de boquillas, junto con un mango grande y de "
"color brillante. Está especialmente diseñado para eliminar rápidamente los "
"contaminantes de los ojos, y es fácilmente utilizable sin poder ver muy "
"bien. Un aviso de tamaño considerable advierte que no se debe beber el agua "
"que utiliza."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "IV pole"
msgstr "Polo IV"

#. ~ Description for IV pole
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall wire frame on a set of small wheels used for holding an IV bag, "
"useful for unattended administration."
msgstr ""
"Un marco de alambre alto sobre un conjunto de ruedas pequeñas utilizado para"
" sostener una bolsa intravenosa, útil para la administración desatendida."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "high performance liquid chromatographer"
msgstr "cromatógrafo de líquidos de alto rendimiento"

#. ~ Description for high performance liquid chromatographer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This high-tech tool would, with electricity and an experienced user, be a "
"very useful way to separate chemicals in a liquid or aqueous phase, based on"
" their affinity, to the stationary phase in a tube.  At least, that's what "
"the label says."
msgstr ""
"Esta herramienta de alta tecnología sería, con electricidad y un usuario "
"experimentado, una forma muy útil de separar sustancias químicas en una fase"
" líquida o acuosa, en función de su afinidad, a la fase estacionaria en un "
"tubo. Al menos, eso es lo que dice la etiqueta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "gas chromatographer"
msgstr "cromatógrafo de gases"

#. ~ Description for gas chromatographer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This high-tech tool would, with electricity and an experienced user, be a "
"very useful way to separate chemicals in a gaseous phase, based on their "
"affinity, to a stationary phase in a tube.  At least, that's what the label "
"says."
msgstr ""
"Esta herramienta de alta tecnología sería, con electricidad y un usuario "
"experimentado, una forma muy útil de separar los productos químicos en una "
"fase gaseosa, en función de su afinidad, a una fase estacionaria en un tubo."
" Al menos, eso es lo que dice la etiqueta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mass spectrometer"
msgstr "espectrómetro de masas"

#. ~ Description for mass spectrometer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside this large white box is a carefully balanced set of electric field "
"generators that can precisely separate ionized particles based on their "
"charge-to-mass ratio, firing them into a detector that measures the exact "
"mass of the particle hitting it.  Invaluable for chemical analysis and other"
" advanced sciences, it's not as useful anymore."
msgstr ""
"Dentro de esta gran caja blanca hay un conjunto cuidadosamente equilibrado "
"de generadores de campo eléctrico que pueden separar con precisión las "
"partículas ionizadas en función de su relación carga-masa, disparándolas a "
"un detector que mide la masa exacta de la partícula que choca con él. "
"Inestimable para el análisis químico y otras ciencias avanzadas, ya no es "
"tan útil."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "nuclear magnetic resonance spectrometer"
msgstr "espectrómetro de resonancia magnética nuclear"

#. ~ Description for nuclear magnetic resonance spectrometer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a giant electromagnet with carefully tuned measurement equipment "
"used to observe how magnetic fields affect nuclear spins.  It is a common "
"workhorse for the discovery and study of chemical structures."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un electroimán gigante con un equipo de medición cuidadosamente "
"ajustado que se utiliza para observar cómo los campos magnéticos afectan a "
"los espines nucleares. Es un caballo de batalla habitual para el "
"descubrimiento y el estudio de las estructuras químicas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "electron microscope"
msgstr "microscopio electrónico"

#. ~ Description for electron microscope
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An enormous observational tool for studying the details of samples on an "
"immensely small scale."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme herramienta de observación para estudiar los detalles de las "
"muestras a una escala inmensamente pequeña."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "CT scanner"
msgstr "Escáner CT"

#. ~ Description for CT scanner
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive piece of machinery used to take hundreds of X-ray images from 360 "
"degrees, often used for medical examinations of patients."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme maquinaria utilizada para tomar cientos de imágenes de rayos X de"
" 360 grados, a menudo utilizada para los exámenes médicos de los pacientes."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "MRI machine"
msgstr "Máquina de resonancia magnética"

#. ~ Description for MRI machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive tool used to take NMR images of a patient placed inside, providing"
" invaluable medical insight."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta masiva utilizada para tomar imágenes de Resonancia Magnética"
" de un paciente colocado en su interior, proporcionando una visión médica "
"inestimable."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "scanner bed"
msgstr "cama de escáner"

#. ~ Description for scanner bed
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a narrow, flat, and frankly uncomfortable bed for putting someone "
"into an imaging machine for medical observations."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una cama estrecha, plana y francamente incómoda para meter a "
"alguien en una máquina de imágenes para observaciones médicas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "anesthetic machine"
msgstr "máquina anestésica"

#. ~ Description for anesthetic machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large machine with various tanks, tubes, and monitoring devices used to "
"maintain precise levels of anesthesia in a patient to ensure they, at least "
"ideally, remain asleep, unfeeling, but alive."
msgstr ""
"Una gran máquina con varios tanques, tubos y dispositivos de monitorización "
"utilizados para mantener niveles precisos de anestesia en un paciente para "
"asegurar que, al menos idealmente, permanezca dormido, sin sentir, pero "
"vivo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "dialysis machine"
msgstr "máquina de diálisis"

#. ~ Description for dialysis machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large machine for pumping and filtering the blood of somebody without the "
"function of their kidneys.  Largely obsolete for those with access to "
"bionics, but a lifeline to those that need it."
msgstr ""
"Una gran máquina para bombear y filtrar la sangre de alguien sin la función "
"de sus riñones. En gran medida obsoleta para los que tienen acceso a la "
"biónica, pero un salvavidas para los que la necesitan."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "medical ventilator"
msgstr "ventilador médico"

#. ~ Description for medical ventilator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sizable box on a set of wheels that will pump air in and out of a "
"patient's lungs when they are incapable of breathing, though often only "
"needed temporarily."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de tamaño considerable sobre un conjunto de ruedas que bombea aire "
"dentro y fuera de los pulmones de un paciente cuando éste es incapaz de "
"respirar, aunque a menudo sólo se necesita temporalmente."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "privacy curtain"
msgstr "cortina de privacidad"

#. ~ Description for privacy curtain
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "No peeking!"
msgstr "¡No mires!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "swish!"
msgstr "¡Swish!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "clattering metal!"
msgstr "¡Un metal que hace ruido!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open privacy curtain"
msgstr "abrir la cortina de privacidad"

#. ~ Description for open privacy curtain
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Stop peeking!"
msgstr "¡Deja de mirar!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "centrifuge"
msgstr "centrifugadora"

#. ~ Description for centrifuge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyzer "
"unit.  For some reason, this one has an attached battery pack.  It could be "
"used to analyze a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if a test tube was "
"placed in it."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una centrífugadora, un dispositivo de separación de líquidos con una"
" unidad de análisis automatizada. Por alguna razón, éste tiene una batería "
"adjunta. Podría utilizarse para analizar una muestra de fluido médico, como "
"la sangre, si se colocara un tubo de ensayo en él."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bathtub"
msgstr "bañera"

#. ~ Description for bathtub
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ordinary ceramic tub, with a now-functionless steel faucet and a plug "
"fixed over the drain.  Watertight and relatively clean, it would make for a "
"good water trough."
msgstr ""
"Una bañera de cerámica ordinaria, con un grifo de acero que ya no funciona y"
" un tapón fijado sobre el desagüe. Hermética y relativamente limpia, sería "
"un buen abrevadero."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "porcelain breaking!"
msgstr "¡porcelana rompiéndose!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "whunk!"
msgstr "¡whunk!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "shower"
msgstr "ducha"

#. ~ Description for shower
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small enclosed ceramic room with a glass door and plumbing fixtures for "
"cleaning oneself.  Before it was a commonplace amenity, but now it's hard to"
" imagine wasting that much water."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño cuarto de cerámica cerrado con una puerta de cristal y con "
"instalaciones de fontanería para limpiarse. Antes era una comodidad "
"habitual, pero ahora es difícil imaginar que se desperdicie tanta agua."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sink"
msgstr "lavabo"

#. ~ Description for sink
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A porcelain water basin with a water tap and drain, designed to be fitted "
"into an opening on a countertop."
msgstr ""
"Lavabo de porcelana con grifo y desagüe, diseñado para encajar en un hueco "
"de la encimera."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "toilet"
msgstr "inodoro"

#. ~ Description for toilet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An invaluable fixture in any home, it would be a miracle to have one that "
"works.  The standing tank may hold a moderate amount of water, but while "
"better than anything that would be in the bowl, it would not be the "
"cleanest."
msgstr ""
"Un accesorio invaluable en cualquier hogar, sería un milagro tener uno que "
"funcione. El depósito horizontal puede contener una cantidad moderada de "
"agua, pero aunque es mejor que todo lo que habría en la taza, no sería lo "
"más limpio."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "water heater"
msgstr "calentador de agua"

#. ~ Description for water heater
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An insulated metal tank with a small fire used to maintain near-boiling "
"temperatures.  Now that there's no way to power it, the large tank could "
"still be used to store large amounts of clean water."
msgstr ""
"Un tanque metálico aislado con un pequeño fuego utilizado para mantener "
"temperaturas cercanas al punto de ebullición. Ahora que no hay forma de "
"alimentarlo, el gran tanque podría seguir utilizándose para almacenar "
"grandes cantidades de agua limpia."

#. ~ Description for water purifier
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This device effectively sterilizes water, though without power source, like "
"UPS, it's only good for parts."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo esteriliza eficazmente el agua, aunque sin fuente de "
"alimentación, como el SAI, sólo sirve para piezas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "exercise machine"
msgstr "máquina de ejercicio"

#. ~ Description for exercise machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy set of weightlifting equipment for strength training, with a pair of"
" heavy weights affixed to opposite ends of a sturdy pipe.  You can adjust "
"the set by hand-picking the weights you wish to use."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto pesado de equipos de levantamiento de pesas para el "
"entrenamiento de fuerza, con un par de pesas pesadas fijadas en los extremos"
" opuestos de un tubo resistente. Puedes ajustar el conjunto eligiendo a mano"
" las pesas que desees utilizar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "ball machine"
msgstr "máquina lanzapelotas"

#. ~ Description for ball machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple machine for launching sports balls of various types, with a pair of"
" motorized wheels that, if spun up, would fling the ball at moderate speeds."
"  Probably not the most effective ranged weapon against the undead."
msgstr ""
"Una sencilla máquina para lanzar pelotas deportivas de varios tipos, con un "
"par de ruedas motorizadas que, si se hacen girar, lanzan la pelota a "
"velocidades moderadas. Probablemente no sea el arma a distancia más eficaz "
"contra los muertos vivientes."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pool table"
msgstr "mesa de billar"

#. ~ Description for pool table
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large wooden table with green felt carpeting on top, and a set of "
"symmetrical holes that carry billiards balls to an opening on one side.  "
"While not the most useful as a normal table, there is a substantial amount "
"of wood."
msgstr ""
"Una gran mesa de madera con un tapete de fieltro verde en la parte superior,"
" y un conjunto de agujeros simétricos que llevan las bolas de billar a una "
"abertura en un lado. Aunque no es lo más útil como mesa normal, hay una "
"cantidad considerable de madera."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "diving block"
msgstr "podio de salida de natación"

#. ~ Description for diving block
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A chunky plastic stool bolted onto the ground, intended as a safe way of "
"diving forward into a body of water."
msgstr ""
"Un grueso taburete de plástico atornillado al suelo, pensado como una forma "
"segura de sumergirse en una masa de agua."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "target"
msgstr "diana"

#. ~ Description for target
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long sheet of metal held upright by a pipe frame, the sheet is cut in a "
"roughly human shape.  There are two bullseye targets painted onto it, a "
"large one on the torso, and a smaller one on the head.  It is peppered with "
"small dents and holes, and a large amount of the paint has flaked or chipped"
" off."
msgstr ""
"Una larga plancha de metal sostenida por un marco de tubos, cortada en forma"
" de hombre. Hay dos dianas pintadas en ella, una grande en el torso y otra "
"más pequeña en la cabeza. Está salpicada de pequeñas abolladuras y agujeros,"
" y gran parte de la pintura se ha descascarillado o desconchado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "arcade machine"
msgstr "máquina de juego"

#. ~ Description for arcade machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bulky upright arcade cabinet, brightly painted and slightly worn with age."
"  Useless for its intended purpose, it's bound to have valuable parts."
msgstr ""
"Un voluminoso armario arcade vertical, brillantemente pintado y ligeramente "
"desgastado por la edad. Inútil para su propósito original, seguro que tiene "
"piezas valiosas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pinball machine"
msgstr "pinball"

#. ~ Description for pinball machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An iconic game, this machine has a brightly decorated background on its "
"intricate obstacle course, which is covered by a long sheet of glass.  While"
" inoperable without power, it's still impressive to look at, though probably"
" more useful if disassembled."
msgstr ""
"Esta máquina, un juego icónico, tiene un fondo brillantemente decorado en su"
" intrincada pista de obstáculos, que está cubierta por una larga hoja de "
"vidrio. Aunque es inoperable sin energía, sigue siendo impresionante de ver,"
" aunque probablemente sea más útil si se desmonta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "ergometer"
msgstr "ergómetro"

#. ~ Description for ergometer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An exercise machine with a set of handles and plates meant to emulate rowing"
" a boat.  Without power it can't be operated, but it might have useful parts"
" to be scavenged."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina de ejercicios con un conjunto de asas y placas que pretende "
"emular el remo de un barco. Sin energía no puede funcionar, pero puede tener"
" piezas útiles que se pueden recuperar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mechanical ergometer"
msgstr "ergómetro mecánico"

#. ~ Description for mechanical ergometer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An exercise machine with a set of handles and plates meant to emulate rowing"
" a boat.  This an older model with mechanical resistance adjustments, but it"
" works without power."
msgstr ""
"Una máquina de ejercicios con un conjunto de asas y placas que pretende "
"emular el remo de una embarcación. Se trata de un modelo antiguo con ajustes"
" de resistencia mecánica, pero que funciona sin energía."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "treadmill"
msgstr "cinta para correr"

#. ~ Description for treadmill
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A motorized conveyor belt with a control panel for running in place.  "
"Without power, it's an immense challenge to move the belt.  Regardless, "
"you're probably getting enough cardio on your own."
msgstr ""
"Una cinta transportadora motorizada con un panel de control para su "
"funcionamiento en el lugar. Sin energía, es un reto inmenso mover la cinta. "
"A pesar de ello, es probable que estés haciendo suficiente cardio por tu "
"cuenta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "gravity treadmill"
msgstr "cinta de correr por gravedad"

#. ~ Description for gravity treadmill
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gravity driven conveyor belt with a mechanical control panel for running "
"in place.  Conveyor belt is positioned in a steep, but adjustable incline, "
"so it slides back under your weight."
msgstr ""
"Una cinta transportadora impulsada por la gravedad con un panel de control "
"mecánico para correr en el lugar. La cinta transportadora está colocada en "
"una inclinación pronunciada, pero ajustable, para que se deslice hacia atrás"
" bajo tu peso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "heavy punching bag"
msgstr "bolsa de boxeo grande"

#. ~ Description for heavy punching bag
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hefty leather bag in an oblong shape, suspended from a ceiling mount with "
"a steel chain.  It can be used for exercise and combat training, with the "
"notable advantage that it doesn't fight back."
msgstr ""
"Una bolsa de cuero de forma oblonga, suspendida de un soporte de techo con "
"una cadena de acero. Puede utilizarse para hacer ejercicio y entrenar el "
"combate, con la notable ventaja de que no se defiende."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "whud."
msgstr "whud."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "piano"
msgstr "piano"

#. ~ Description for piano
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An elegant piano, capable of producing beautiful music if used by a skilled "
"player.  A set of off-white and black keys all linked to a set of hammers, "
"which strike their corresponding tightly-coiled wire to produce sound."
msgstr ""
"Un elegante piano, capaz de producir una bella música si es utilizado por un"
" intérprete hábil. Un conjunto de teclas blancas y negras unidas a un "
"conjunto de martillos, que golpean su correspondiente alambre tensado para "
"producir el sonido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "a suffering piano!"
msgstr "un piano sufrido"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "kerchang."
msgstr "kerchang."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "speaker cabinet"
msgstr "gabinete de altavoz"

#. ~ Description for speaker cabinet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An upright wood-panel case of large speakers, built to produce a potentially"
" deafening volume level.  While this is a terrible idea to use now, it could"
" hold useful parts."
msgstr ""
"Una caja vertical de paneles de madera con grandes altavoces, construida "
"para producir un nivel de volumen potencialmente ensordecedor. Aunque es una"
" idea terrible usarlo ahora, podría contener piezas útiles."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "dancing pole"
msgstr "Barra de baile"

#. ~ Description for dancing pole
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall steel pipe mounted vertically, securely fastened to the ceiling and "
"floor.  Usually used for various forms of dancing, often in adult-oriented "
"venues."
msgstr ""
"Una barra de acero alta montada verticalmente, fijado de forma segura al "
"techo y al suelo. Suele utilizarse para diversas formas de baile, a menudo "
"en locales orientados a los adultos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "roulette table"
msgstr "mesa de ruleta"

#. ~ Description for roulette table
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge table specially made for a specific form of gambling, with a grid "
"painted onto the felt top, and a concave spinning wheel intended to give a "
"random selection of the inscribed possibilities."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme mesa hecha especialmente para una forma específica de juego, con "
"una cuadrícula pintada en el tablero de fieltro, y una rueda giratoria "
"cóncava destinada a dar una selección aleatoria de las posibilidades "
"inscritas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "this should never actually show up, it's a pseudo furniture"
msgstr "esto nunca debería aparecer, es un pseudo-mueble"

#. ~ Description for this should never actually show up, it's a pseudo
#. furniture
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is pseudo-furniture and should never actually show up.  Please report "
"this bug."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un pseudo-mueble y no debería aparecer nunca. Por favor, informa de "
"este error."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cell phone signal booster"
msgstr "un potenciador de la señal de los teléfonos celulares"

#. ~ Description for cell phone signal booster
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A specialized piece of equipment that receives phone signals and amplifies "
"them to reach further destinations with more clarity.  Now that there's no "
"longer signals for them to boost, they're only good for parts."
msgstr ""
"Son equipos especializados que reciben las señales telefónicas y las "
"amplifican para llegar a destinos más lejanos con mayor claridad. Ahora que "
"ya no hay señales que puedan amplificar, solo sirven para piezas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "womp!"
msgstr "¡womp!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "satellite dish"
msgstr "antena parabólica"

#. ~ Description for satellite dish
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small sheet metal disc designed to receive radio waves from orbital "
"satellites.  Satellites that will assuredly continue to orbit, with nothing "
"to broadcast."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño disco de chapa diseñado para recibir las ondas de radio de los "
"satélites orbitales. Satélites que seguramente seguirán en órbita, sin nada "
"que emitir."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "chimney crown"
msgstr "corona de chimenea"

#. ~ Description for chimney crown
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The top of a brick chimney, the opening is stained black with soot.  "
"Definitely too narrow to fit in."
msgstr ""
"La parte superior de una chimenea de ladrillo, la apertura está manchada de "
"negro con hollín. Definitivamente es demasiado estrecho para entrar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "TV antenna"
msgstr "Antena de TV"

#. ~ Description for TV antenna
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple metal antenna to increase the reception of non-cable television "
"broadcasts.  Almost wholly obsolete for years, only being good for parts "
"isn't new for this item."
msgstr ""
"Una simple antena metálica para aumentar la recepción de las emisiones de "
"televisión no por cable. Casi totalmente obsoleta desde hace años, sólo "
"sirve para piezas nada nuevo para este artículo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "vent pipe"
msgstr "conducto de ventilación"

#. ~ Description for vent pipe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sort of chimney spout for a building's internal ventilation system, this "
"can be used for circulation, venting fumes, and other such functions."
msgstr ""
"Una especie de chimenea para el sistema de ventilación interna de un "
"edificio, que puede utilizarse por la circulación, la salida de humos y "
"otras funciones similares."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "roof turbine vent"
msgstr "turbina de ventilación de techo"

#. ~ Description for roof turbine vent
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rotary wind turbine that will catch the wind and pull out air from inside."
"  It is most commonly used for improving air circulation, particularly in "
"poorly-ventilated areas like attics."
msgstr ""
"Una turbina eólica rotativa que capta el viento y extrae el aire de su "
"interior. Se utiliza sobre todo para mejorar la circulación del aire, "
"especialmente en zonas poco ventiladas como los áticos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bale of hay"
msgstr "fardo de heno"

#. ~ Description for bale of hay
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive packed-together block of hay, it makes for easy storage of straw "
"for livestock.  If your only other option is the floor, it makes a tolerable"
" bed."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme bloque de heno empaquetado, facilita el almacenamiento de paja "
"para el ganado. Si tu única opción es el suelo, constituye una cama "
"tolerable."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "whish!"
msgstr "¡frufrú!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pile of woodchips"
msgstr "pila de astillas de madera"

#. ~ Description for pile of woodchips
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large mound of piled wood chips.  Unpleasant to lay on, hard to walk "
"through, and a large fire hazard, it's probably best to shovel it out of the"
" way."
msgstr ""
"Un gran montículo de astillas apiladas. Desagradable de pisar, difícil de "
"atravesar y un gran peligro de incendio, probablemente sea mejor quitarla "
"con una pala."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bench"
msgstr "banco"

#. ~ Description for bench
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple bench with wood slats nailed to a frame.  While uncomfortably flat "
"and just as cold as the ground, it could serve as a bed if needed."
msgstr ""
"Un simple banco con listones de madera clavados en un marco. Aunque era "
"incómodo y tan frío como el suelo, puede servir de cama si es necesario."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "arm chair"
msgstr "sillón"

#. ~ Description for arm chair
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple upholstered chair with armrests.  Soft and fairly warm, it "
"definitely beats the ground for sleeping on, though not by much."
msgstr ""
"Una simple silla tapizada con reposabrazos. Suave y bastante cálida, "
"definitivamente es mejor que el suelo para dormir, aunque no por mucho."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "airplane seat"
msgstr "asiento del avión"

#. ~ Description for airplane seat
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A cheaply upholstered folding airplane seat, it has a simple across-the-lap "
"seatbelt.  You likely wouldn't be the first to sleep in this."
msgstr ""
"Un asiento de avión plegable y barato, con un simple cinturón de seguridad "
"cruzado. Probablemente no serías el primero en dormir en él."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "chair"
msgstr "silla"

#. ~ Description for chair
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple wooden chair, with four legs, a seat, and a back.  It's nice to "
"rest your feet for once, and if coupled with a suitable table, you could eat"
" a meal properly and almost pretend that things were normal again."
msgstr ""
"Una simple silla de madera, con cuatro patas, un asiento y un respaldo. Es "
"agradable para descansar los pies por una vez, y si se combina con una mesa "
"adecuada, se podría comer una comida como es debido y casi fingir que las "
"cosas vuelven a ser normales."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sofa"
msgstr "sofá"

#. ~ Description for sofa
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wide upholstered bench, large enough for two people to comfortably sit "
"alongside one another, or one person to lay back on.  It's not quite a bed, "
"but it's a hell of a lot more comfortable than the floor."
msgstr ""
"Un amplio banco tapizado, lo suficientemente grande como para que dos "
"personas se sienten cómodamente una al lado de la otra, o una persona se "
"recueste en él. No es exactamente una cama, pero es mucho más cómodo que el "
"suelo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "stool"
msgstr "taburete"

#. ~ Description for stool
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple stool, with four legs and a seat.  While it's a touch more "
"maneuverable to sit on, the lack of back support means it's significantly "
"less comfortable than a normal chair."
msgstr ""
"Un simple taburete, con cuatro patas y un asiento. Aunque es un poco más "
"maniobrable para sentarse, la falta de un apoyo para la espalda significa "
"que es significativamente menos cómodo que una silla normal."

#. ~ Description for camp chair
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A somewhat uncomfortable folding chair, with fabric strung across a metal "
"frame.  Not the best, but better than nothing, and a lot easier to pack up."
msgstr ""
"Una silla plegable algo incómoda, con tela ensartada en un marco de metal. "
"No es lo mejor, pero es mejor que nada, y es mucho más fácil de empaquetar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "log stool"
msgstr "taburete de madera"

#. ~ Description for log stool
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short section from a tree trunk with one of the flat ends smoothed down.  "
"Makes for a decent place to sit, but not quite a real chair."
msgstr ""
"Una sección corta de un tronco de árbol con uno de los extremos planos "
"alisados. Es un lugar decente para sentarse, pero no es una verdadera silla."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "deck chair"
msgstr "silla de terraza"

#. ~ Description for deck chair
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A folding deck chair with fabric sheets mounted to a wooden frame.  While "
"it's built to take outdoor conditions and is an improvement over the ground,"
" it's not particularly comfortable."
msgstr ""
"Una tumbona plegable con láminas de tela montadas en un marco de madera. "
"Aunque está construida para soportar las condiciones de la intemperie y es "
"una mejora respecto al suelo, no es especialmente cómoda."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "metal bench"
msgstr "banco de metal"

#. ~ Description for metal bench
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bench made of scrap metal.  Not the most comfortable furniture you've ever"
" seen."
msgstr ""
"Un banco hecho de chatarra. No es el mueble más cómodo que hayas visto."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bulletin board"
msgstr "tablón de anuncios"

#. ~ Description for bulletin board
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wide wooden frame with a sheet of corkboard inside.  Good for pinning "
"various notices for other survivors to read."
msgstr ""
"Un amplio marco de madera con una hoja de corcho en su interior. Sirve para "
"fijar diversos avisos para que los lean otros supervivientes."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sign"
msgstr "cartel"

#. ~ Description for sign
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple signpost made of wood.  Basically two planks alongside each other "
"nailed to another plank that holds them up."
msgstr ""
"Un simple poste de señalización hecho de madera. Básicamente son dos "
"tablones uno al lado del otro clavados a otro tablón que los sostiene."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "warning sign"
msgstr "señal de advertencia"

#. ~ Description for warning sign
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A triangular signpost painted white with a red border.  Designed to easily "
"catch the eye, signs of this nature seldom display anything but bad news."
msgstr ""
"Un poste indicador triangular pintado de blanco con un borde rojo. Diseñados"
" para captar fácilmente la atención, los carteles de esta naturaleza rara "
"vez muestran algo que no sean malas noticias."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "bed"
msgstr "cama"

#. ~ Description for bed
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A standard mattress on a sturdy wooden frame.  Even without blankets or "
"pillows, and despite being a completely ordinary mattress, it's a sight for "
"sore, tired eyes."
msgstr ""
"Un colchón estándar sobre un robusto marco de madera. Incluso sin mantas ni "
"almohadas, y a pesar de ser un colchón completamente normal, es un "
"espectáculo para los ojos cansados y doloridos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "bunk bed"
msgstr "litera"

#. ~ Description for bunk bed
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bunk bed with a sturdy wooden frame built to hold two single-person "
"mattresses above one another.  While these usually mean sleeping closer than"
" you'd like to somebody you wouldn't normally want to share a mattress with,"
" a bed's a bed."
msgstr ""
"Una litera con un robusto armazón de madera construido para sostener dos "
"colchones de una persona encima de otro. Aunque suelen suponer dormir más "
"cerca de lo que te gustaría de alguien con quien normalmente no querrías "
"compartir colchón, una cama es una cama."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bed frame"
msgstr "marco de la cama"

#. ~ Description for bed frame
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sturdy wooden bed frame built to hold most standard mattresses.  Despite "
"being one half of a bed, it's just about impossible to lay on by itself."
msgstr ""
"Un robusto marco de cama de madera construido para sostener la mayoría de "
"los colchones estándar. A pesar de ser una mitad de la cama, es casi "
"imposible acostarse en ella sola."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "whack."
msgstr "porrazo."

#. ~ Description for mattress
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ordinary mattress left on the floor.  While it's not as comfortable as an"
" entire bed without the mattress, it's pretty close.  If it's someplace "
"actually safe to sleep, it's practically a luxury in of itself."
msgstr ""
"Un colchón normal dejado en el suelo. Aunque no es tan cómodo como una cama "
"entera sin el colchón, se acerca bastante. Si este lugar es seguro para "
"dormir, esto es un lujo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "rrrrip!"
msgstr "¡rrrrip!"

#. ~ Description for down mattress
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A squishy feather-stuffed mattress left on the floor.  While it's not as "
"comfortable as an entire bed without the mattress, it's pretty close.  If "
"it's someplace actually safe to sleep, it's practically a luxury in of "
"itself."
msgstr ""
"Un colchón acolchado de plumas abandonado en el suelo. Aunque no es tan "
"cómodo como una cama entera sin el colchón, está bastante cerca. Si este "
"lugar es seguro para dormir, esto es un lujo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift bed"
msgstr "cama improvisada"

#. ~ Description for makeshift bed
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improvised mattress on a flimsy wooden frame.  Almost as good as a normal"
" bed, albeit with a slightly lumpy mattress.  Considering the circumstances,"
" it's not too bad at all."
msgstr ""
"Un colchón improvisado sobre un endeble marco de madera. Casi tan bueno como"
" una cama normal, aunque con un colchón ligeramente abultado. Teniendo en "
"cuenta las circunstancias, no está nada mal."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "straw bed"
msgstr "cama de paja"

#. ~ Description for straw bed
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improvised bedding pile made of hay.  Better than nothing, but not "
"particularly comfortable, and quite itchy."
msgstr ""
"Una pila de cama improvisada hecha de heno. Mejor que nada, pero no es "
"especialmente cómodo y pica bastante."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "bookcase"
msgstr "Estantería"

#. ~ Description for bookcase
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple wooden shelf for storing dozens of books.  While designed for "
"books, it does a decent job of storing anything else that'll fit."
msgstr ""
"Una simple estantería de madera para almacenar decenas de libros. Aunque "
"está diseñada para libros, sirve para guardar cualquier otra cosa que quepa."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "entertainment center"
msgstr "centro de entretenimiento"

#. ~ Description for entertainment center
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While not quite as cool by itself as the name might imply, this large wooden"
" cabinet can store a variety of things, like a TV and media systems, with "
"shelving space and cupboards for anything that'll fit."
msgstr ""
"Aunque no es tan genial por sí mismo como el nombre podría implicar, este "
"gran armario de madera puede almacenar una variedad de cosas, como un "
"televisor y sistemas multimedia, con espacio de estanterías y armarios para "
"cualquier cosa que quepa."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "coffin"
msgstr "ataúd"

#. ~ Description for coffin
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A humble wooden casket for the respectful burial of the dead.  While a "
"standard practice before this all happened, it is now a rare honor for one "
"to be given a proper final resting place.  An honor that countless many will"
" likely never receive."
msgstr ""
"Un humilde ataúd de madera para el respetuoso entierro de los muertos. Si "
"bien era una práctica habitual antes de que ocurriera todo esto, ahora es un"
" raro honor que uno reciba un lugar de descanso final adecuado. Un honor que"
" muchos probablemente nunca recibirán."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "wham!"
msgstr "¡catapum!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open coffin"
msgstr "ataúd abierto"

#. ~ Description for open coffin
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A humble wooden casket for the respectful burial of the dead.  While a "
"standard practice before this all happened, it is now a rare honor for one "
"to be given a proper final resting place.  This one is open and unoccupied, "
"and gazing inside fills you with a sense of melancholic weariness."
msgstr ""
"Un humilde ataúd de madera para el respetuoso entierro de los muertos. Si "
"bien era una práctica habitual antes de que ocurriera todo esto, ahora es un"
" raro honor que uno reciba un lugar de descanso final adecuado. Éste está "
"abierto y desocupado, y mirar dentro te llena de una sensación de cansancio "
"melancólico."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "crate"
msgstr "caja"

#. ~ Description for crate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sealed wooden storage container.  Lacking any labels, it could hold just "
"about anything inside.  If you don't have a proper tool to pry it open, "
"smashing it is an option, albeit one that risks destroying the contents."
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor de madera sellado. Al carecer de etiquetas, podría contener "
"casi cualquier cosa. Si no tienes una herramienta adecuada para abrirlo, "
"romperlo es una opción, aunque se corre el riesgo de destruir el contenido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open crate"
msgstr "caja abierta"

#. ~ Description for open crate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An open wooden storage box, capable of holding any number of things.  The "
"lid has been pried off and is leaned adjacent to it, and with a fresh set of"
" nails, could be sealed back shut."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de madera abierta, capaz de albergar cualquier cosa. La tapa ha "
"sido arrancada y está apoyada junto a ella, y con un nuevo juego de clavos, "
"podría volver a cerrarse."

#. ~ Description for large cardboard box
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large box made of a brown paper-based material.  Could contain a number of"
" things, or even be hidden inside.  Considering it only has two small flaps "
"for carrying, it's very hard to see out of, and won't do anything to protect"
" you if you're found."
msgstr ""
"Una caja grande hecha de un material a base de papel marrón. Puede contener "
"varias cosas, o incluso estar escondida en su interior. Teniendo en cuenta "
"que sólo tiene dos pequeñas solapas para transportarla, es muy difícil ver "
"fuera de ella, y no hará nada para protegerte si te encuentran."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "crumple!"
msgstr "¡se desmoronan!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py src/ballistics.cpp
msgid "thud."
msgstr "golpe seco."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "dresser"
msgstr "cómoda"

#. ~ Description for dresser
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple wooden cabinet with a column of short drawers.  While intended for "
"storing clothes, there's nothing stopping you from storing whatever fits."
msgstr ""
"Un sencillo armario de madera con una columna de cajones cortos. Aunque está"
" pensado para guardar la ropa, nada te impide guardar lo que quepa."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "glass front cabinet"
msgstr "gabinete de cristal"

#. ~ Description for glass front cabinet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall metal cabinet with a sheet of glass across the front for viewing the "
"contents.  Often used for displaying rare, visually pleasing, or otherwise "
"valuable goods, it's odd that it doesn't have a lock."
msgstr ""
"Un armario metálico alto con una hoja de cristal en la parte delantera para "
"ver el contenido. A menudo se utiliza para exponer bienes raros, visualmente"
" agradables o de otro tipo de valor, es extraño que no tenga cerradura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py src/ballistics.cpp src/iuse.cpp
msgid "glass breaking!"
msgstr "¡cristal rompiéndose!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open gun safe"
msgstr "caja fuerte de armas abierta"

#. ~ Description for open gun safe
#. ~ Description for closed gun safe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large and heavy container with thick metal walls and a rotary combination "
"lock, this is designed to securely store firearms, weapon mods, and "
"ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor grande y pesado con gruesas paredes metálicas y una cerradura "
"de combinación giratoria, diseñado para almacenar de forma segura armas de "
"fuego, mods de armas y munición."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "screeching metal!"
msgstr "¡chirrido de metal!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "closed gun safe"
msgstr "caja fuerte de armas cerrada"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "locked gun safe"
msgstr "caja fuerte de armas cerrada con llave"

#. ~ Description for locked gun safe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large and heavy container with thick metal walls and a rotary combination "
"lock, this is designed to securely store firearms, weapon mods, and "
"ammunition.  If you had something to pick its lock with, you could probably "
"open it."
msgstr ""
"Este es un contenedor grande y pesado con gruesas paredes metálicas y una "
"cerradura de combinación giratoria, diseñado para almacenar de forma segura "
"armas de fuego, modificaciones de armas y munición. Si tuvieras algo con lo "
"que forzar su cerradura, probablemente podrías abrirlo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "jammed gun safe"
msgstr "caja fuerte trabada de armas"

#. ~ Description for jammed gun safe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy and durable metal safe for storing firearms and ammunition.  "
"Unfortunately, the lock is completely broken, and short of some pretty "
"serious machinery, you have no possible way of opening it."
msgstr ""
"Una caja fuerte metálica pesada y duradera para almacenar armas de fuego y "
"munición. Desgraciadamente, la cerradura está completamente rota y, a falta "
"de una maquinaria bastante seria, no tienes forma posible de abrirla."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "electronic gun safe"
msgstr "caja fuerte electrónica de armas"

#. ~ Description for electronic gun safe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large and heavy container with thick metal walls and an electronic locking"
" system, this is designed to securely store firearms, weapon mods, and "
"ammunition.  If you had some way of hacking into it, you could probably "
"crack it open."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un contenedor grande y pesado con gruesas paredes de metal y un "
"sistema de cierre electrónico, diseñado para almacenar de forma segura armas"
" de fuego, modificaciones de armas y munición. Si tuvieras alguna forma de "
"hackearlo, probablemente podrías abrirlo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "locker"
msgstr "armario"

#. ~ Description for locker
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall sheet metal cabinet, useful for storing just about anything that'll "
"fit."
msgstr ""
"Un armario alto de chapa, útil para guardar casi cualquier cosa que quepa."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mailbox"
msgstr "buzón"

#. ~ Description for mailbox
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small metal box on top of a wooden post, designed to receive mail "
"deliveries.  Although considering the circumstances, it will likely never "
"see proper use again."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña caja de metal en la parte superior de un poste de madera, "
"diseñada para recibir las entregas de correo. Aunque, dadas las "
"circunstancias, es probable que nunca vuelva a tener un uso adecuado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "clothing rail"
msgstr "baranda para ropa"

#. ~ Description for clothing rail
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal frame on a set of wheels used for hanging large amounts of clothes."
"  Usually used in theater or retail environments, it's easy to use and quick"
" to access."
msgstr ""
"Un marco metálico sobre un conjunto de ruedas utilizado para colgar grandes "
"cantidades de ropa. Suele utilizarse en teatros o comercios, es fácil de "
"usar y de rápido acceso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "display rack"
msgstr "estante"

#. ~ Description for display rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sheet metal shelving unit, with the storage surfaces angled in such a way "
"as to show off the items stored."
msgstr ""
"Una estantería de chapa, con las superficies de almacenamiento inclinadas de"
" forma que se vean los artículos almacenados."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "wooden rack"
msgstr "El estante de madera"

#. ~ Description for wooden rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wooden shelving unit with angled storage surfaces designed to show off "
"whatever is stored on it."
msgstr ""
"Una estantería de madera con superficies de almacenamiento en ángulo "
"diseñadas para mostrar lo que se almacena en ella."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "coat rack"
msgstr "perchero"

#. ~ Description for coat rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tall wooden pole with a set of hooks used to store outdoor jackets and "
"hats to allow easy access."
msgstr ""
"Un poste alto de madera con un conjunto de ganchos que se utiliza para "
"guardar las chaquetas y los sombreros de exterior para facilitar el acceso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "recycle bin"
msgstr "papelera de reciclaje"

#. ~ Description for recycle bin
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large plastic bin painted green with a 'recycle' symbol emblazoned on it."
"  While intended to store discarded things to be processed back into a "
"factory, the drastic change in priorities as of late means that these may "
"hold valuable materials."
msgstr ""
"Un gran contenedor de plástico pintado de verde con el símbolo de "
"\"reciclaje\". Aunque su finalidad es almacenar los desechos que se van a "
"procesar en una fábrica, el cambio drástico de prioridades de los últimos "
"tiempos significa que pueden contener materiales valiosos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "safe"
msgstr "caja fuerte"

#. ~ Description for safe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with a rotary combination "
"lock.  Although, this isn't actually locked, just closed."
msgstr ""
"Una caja metálica pequeña, pesada y casi infranqueable con una cerradura de "
"combinación giratoria. Aunque, en realidad, esto no está cerrado, sólo "
"cerrado."

#. ~ Description for safe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with a rotary combination "
"lock.  With something to listen really closely and a hell of a lot of time, "
"you might be able to crack it."
msgstr ""
"Una caja metálica pequeña, pesada y casi infranqueable con una cerradura de "
"combinación giratoria. Con algo para escuchar muy de cerca y un montón de "
"tiempo, podrías ser capaz de descifrarla."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open safe"
msgstr "caja fuerte abierta"

#. ~ Description for open safe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, heavy, and near-unbreachable metal box with a rotary combination "
"lock, albeit significantly less secure with the door open."
msgstr ""
"Una caja metálica pequeña, pesada y casi infranqueable con una cerradura de "
"combinación giratoria, aunque bastante menos segura con la puerta abierta."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "trash can"
msgstr "cubo de basura"

#. ~ Description for trash can
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A plastic bin for storing discarded waste as to be disposed of later.  "
"Although, considering the circumstances, it might be worth seeing what's "
"inside."
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor de plástico para almacenar los residuos que se desechan "
"después. Aunque, teniendo en cuenta las circunstancias, podría valer la pena"
" ver lo que hay dentro."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "wardrobe"
msgstr "armario"

#. ~ Description for wardrobe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A very large wooden cabinet for storing clothes, effectively an upright "
"closet.  Could technically be used to store anything else that would fit, "
"though."
msgstr ""
"Un armario de madera muy grande para guardar la ropa, efectivamente un "
"armario vertical. Aunque técnicamente podría utilizarse para guardar "
"cualquier otra cosa que cupiera."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "filing cabinet"
msgstr "fichero"

#. ~ Description for filing cabinet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rack of metal drawers designed to hold various files and paperwork.  "
"Paperwork that has more than likely lost all worth or value by now."
msgstr ""
"Una estantería de cajones metálicos diseñada para guardar varios archivos y "
"papeles. Papeles que probablemente ya han perdido todo su valor por ahora."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "utility shelf"
msgstr "estante de utilería"

#. ~ Description for utility shelf
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple heavy-duty plastic and metal shelving unit, intended to store tools"
" and materials for easy access to workers."
msgstr ""
"Una sencilla estantería de plástico y metal de alta resistencia, destinada a"
" almacenar herramientas y materiales para facilitar el acceso de los "
"trabajadores."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "warehouse shelf"
msgstr "estantería del almacén"

#. ~ Description for warehouse shelf
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge, sturdy steel shelf for storing pallets of crates in warehouses."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme y robusta estantería de acero para almacenar palés de cajas en "
"los almacenes."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "wooden keg"
msgstr "barril de madera"

#. ~ Description for wooden keg
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large standing wooden barrel, completely watertight.  Good for storing "
"liquids of all kinds."
msgstr ""
"Un gran barril de madera de pie, completamente hermético. Sirve para "
"almacenar líquidos de todo tipo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "display case"
msgstr "vitrina"

#. ~ Description for display case
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass panelling on the top."
"  Useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off.  Not "
"actually as secure as it looks, as the display windows are easily broken."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de madera segura a la altura de la cintura, con paneles de cristal "
"en la parte superior. Es útil para guardar cosas valiosas y al mismo tiempo "
"mostrarlas. En realidad no es tan seguro como parece, ya que los cristales "
"se rompen con facilidad."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "broken display case"
msgstr "vitrina rota"

#. ~ Description for broken display case
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A secure wooden case at about waist-height, with glass panelling on the top."
"  Would be useful for storing valuable things while still showing them off, "
"if the glass hadn't been shattered.  Careful not to cut yourself when "
"looting."
msgstr ""
"Una caja de madera segura a la altura de la cintura, con paneles de cristal "
"en la parte superior. Sería útil para guardar cosas valiosas sin dejar de "
"mostrarlas, si el cristal no se hubiera roto. Cuidado con cortarse al "
"saquear."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "standing tank"
msgstr "depósito horizontal"

#. ~ Description for standing tank
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A huge metal tank that can be used to safely store large amounts of liquid."
msgstr ""
"Un enorme tanque de metal que puede utilizarse para almacenar de forma "
"segura grandes cantidades de líquido."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "fuel tank"
msgstr "tanque de gasolina"

#. ~ Description for fuel tank
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A tank filled with gasoline."
msgstr "Un tanque lleno de gasolina."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken fuel tank"
msgstr "tanque de combustible roto"

#. ~ Description for broken fuel tank
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A broken tank which was filled with gasoline."
msgstr "Un tanque roto que estaba lleno de gasolina."

#. ~ Description for fuel tank
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A tank filled with diesel."
msgstr "Un depósito lleno de gasoil."

#. ~ Description for broken fuel tank
#. ~ Description for broken diesel tank
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A broken tank which was filled with diesel."
msgstr "Un tanque roto que estaba lleno de diesel."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "dumpster"
msgstr "contenedor"

#. ~ Description for dumpster
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large metal dumpster that will likely not be getting picked up by the "
"city's waste management any time soon.  Despite the unpleasant nature of "
"climbing inside, it could make for a viable hiding spot."
msgstr ""
"Un gran contenedor de metal que probablemente no será recogido por la "
"administración de residuos de la ciudad en un futuro próximo. A pesar de lo "
"desagradable que resulta trepar por su interior, podría ser un buen "
"escondite."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "butter churn"
msgstr "mantequera"

#. ~ Description for butter churn
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal tube with a built-in mixer for making butter.  Rather than needing "
"electricity, it is pedal-driven, allowing use without power."
msgstr ""
"Un tubo de metal con un mezclador incorporado para hacer mantequilla. En "
"lugar de necesitar electricidad, se acciona con un pedal, lo que permite su "
"uso sin energía."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "riveted metal crate"
msgstr "caja metálica remachada"

#. ~ Description for riveted metal crate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This huge box is made of a dull metal, riveted together.  There is no "
"obvious opening mechanism, and the rivets don't match any of your tools.  "
"The only way in would be to smash it."
msgstr ""
"Esta enorme caja está hecha de un metal opaco, remachado. No hay ningún "
"mecanismo de apertura evidente, y los remaches no coinciden con ninguna de "
"sus herramientas. La única forma de entrar sería rompiéndola."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sealed metal crate"
msgstr "caja metálica sellada"

#. ~ Description for sealed metal crate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a huge, tightly sealed storage crate made from welded and riveted "
"sheet metal.  The sealing mechanism is too tight to open bare-handed and "
"would need some kind of prying instrument to release."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un enorme cajón de almacenamiento hermético hecho de chapa "
"soldada y remachada. El mecanismo de sellado es demasiado hermético para "
"abrirlo con la mano y se necesitaría algún tipo de instrumento de palanca "
"para liberarlo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open metal crate"
msgstr "caja metálica abierta"

#. ~ Description for open metal crate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This large metal crate’s lid is unsealed, and hinges open easily to reveal a"
" number of storage shelves inside.  Once open, the side panels also swing "
"wider for easy access."
msgstr ""
"La tapa de este gran cajón metálico no está sellada y se abre fácilmente con"
" bisagras para revelar una serie de estantes de almacenamiento en el "
"interior. Una vez abierta, los paneles laterales también se abren para "
"facilitar el acceso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "wooden chest"
msgstr "cofre de madera"

#. ~ Description for wooden chest
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sealed wooden storage container.  Lacking any labels, it could hold just "
"about anything inside.  It has a simple metal latch."
msgstr ""
"Un contenedor de madera sellado. Sin etiquetas, podría contener casi "
"cualquier cosa en su interior. Tiene un simple cierre de metal."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "metal foot locker"
msgstr "baul pequeño de metal"

#. ~ Description for metal foot locker
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal storage box, capable of holding any number of things.  The lid has a"
" small lock."
msgstr ""
"Una caja metálica de almacenamiento, capaz de contener cualquier cosa. La "
"tapa tiene una pequeña cerradura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "counter"
msgstr "mostrador"

#. ~ Description for counter
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Affixed to the wall or found in kitchens or stores."
msgstr "Fijado a la pared o encontrado en las cocinas o en las tiendas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cupboard"
msgstr "alacena"

#. ~ Description for cupboard
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Store your cups."
msgstr "Para guardar tus vasos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "closed counter gate"
msgstr "puerta del mostrador cerrada"

#. ~ Description for closed counter gate
#. ~ Description for open counter gate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A commercial quality swinging door made of wood that allows passage behind "
"counters."
msgstr ""
"Una puerta giratoria de calidad comercial hecha de madera que permite el "
"paso detrás de los mostradores."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open counter gate"
msgstr "abrir la puerta del mostrador"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "desk"
msgstr "escritorio"

#. ~ Description for desk
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Sit down at it or work on it."
msgstr "Siéntese o trabaje en ello."

#. ~ Description for leather tarp
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large sheet of sewn leather that can be used instead of a picnic blanket, "
"but it's more valuable as a butchery appliance as it does not soak in blood."
msgstr ""
"Una gran hoja de cuero cosido que puede usarse en lugar de una manta de "
"picnic, pero es más valiosa como aparato de carnicería ya que no se empapa "
"de sangre."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "plastic groundsheet"
msgstr "hoja de tierra de plástico"

#. ~ Description for plastic groundsheet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large sheet of thick plastic has been tossed on the ground here.  It would"
" be a useful place to do some butchery, perhaps."
msgstr ""
"Una gran hoja de plástico grueso ha sido arrojada al suelo aquí. Sería un "
"lugar útil para para descuartizar algo, tal vez."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "whuff!"
msgstr "¡whuff!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "crinkle."
msgstr "arruga."

#. ~ Description for fiber mat
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large mat woven from fibrous material that can be used instead of a picnic"
" blanket, but it's more valuable as a butchery appliance.  Too thin to be a "
"comfortable sleeping place."
msgstr ""
"Una gran alfombra tejida de material fibroso que puede ser utilizada en "
"lugar de una manta de picnic, pero es más valiosa como un aparato de "
"carniceria. Demasiado delgada para ser un lugar cómodo para dormir."

#. ~ Description for tourist table
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small metal folding table, ideal for off-road trips into the wild.  Can be "
"used as a workbench in a pinch."
msgstr ""
"Pequeña mesa plegable de metal, ideal para viajes fuera de la carretera en "
"la naturaleza. Puede ser usada como un banco de trabajo en un apuro."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "table"
msgstr "mesa"

#. ~ Description for table
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Sit down when you eat!"
msgstr "¡Siéntate cuando comas!"

#. ~ Description for table
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "a low table for livingrooms."
msgstr "una mesa baja para las salas de estar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "metal table"
msgstr "mesa de metal"

#. ~ Description for metal table
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A serviceable but simple table made of scrap metal."
msgstr "Una mesa útil pero sencilla hecha de chatarra."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "tatami mat"
msgstr "tatami"

#. ~ Description for tatami mat
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tatami is a type of mat used as a flooring material in traditional "
"Japanese-style rooms."
msgstr ""
"Un tatami es un tipo de alfombra que se utiliza como material para el suelo "
"en las habitaciones de estilo tradicional japonés."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pillow fort"
msgstr "fortaleza de la almohada"

#. ~ Description for pillow fort
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A comfy place to hide from the world.  Not very defensible, though."
msgstr ""
"Un lugar cómodo para esconderse del mundo. Aunque no es muy defendible."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "paf!"
msgstr "¡paf!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cardboard fort"
msgstr "fuerte de cartón"

#. ~ Description for cardboard fort
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A fort built by tipping a cardboard box on its side, lining it with "
"blankets, and partly weather sealing it with a plastic sheet."
msgstr ""
"Un fuerte construido inclinando una caja de cartón a su lado, forrándola con"
" mantas, y en parte sellándola con una lámina de plástico."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cardboard wall"
msgstr "pared de cartón"

#. ~ Description for cardboard wall
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a pile of cardboard boxes that have been filled with rags and junk "
"and stacked together like bricks to form a wall."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pila de cajas de cartón que han sido llenadas con trapos y "
"basura y apiladas como ladrillos para formar una pared."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "beaded curtain"
msgstr "cortina de cuentas"

#. ~ Description for beaded curtain
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This beaded curtain could be pulled aside."
msgstr "Esta cortina de cuentas podría hacerse a un lado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "clickity clack… clack… clack"
msgstr "clickity clack… clack… clack"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "clickity clack… clack"
msgstr "clickity clack… clack"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open beaded curtain"
msgstr "cortina de cuentas abierta"

#. ~ Description for open beaded curtain
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This beaded curtain has been pulled aside."
msgstr "Esta cortina de cuentas ha sido apartada."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "clickity clack… clack… clack!"
msgstr "¡clickity clack… clack… clack!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "canvas floor"
msgstr "piso de tela"

#. ~ Description for canvas floor
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Flooring made out of stretched, waterproof cloth.  Helps keep the dirt out "
"of the tent."
msgstr ""
"Pisos hechos de tela estirada e impermeable. Ayuda a mantener la suciedad "
"fuera de la tienda."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "canvas wall"
msgstr "pared de tela"

#. ~ Description for canvas wall
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A wall made of stretched, waterproof cloth."
msgstr "Una pared hecha de tela estirada e impermeable."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "slap!"
msgstr "¡slap!"

#. ~ Description for canvas wall
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A wall made of stretched, heavy-duty, waterproof cloth."
msgstr "Una pared hecha de tela estirada, resistente e impermeable."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "canvas flap"
msgstr "solapa de tela"

#. ~ Description for canvas flap
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This canvas flap door could be pulled aside."
msgstr "Esta puerta de lona podría ser tirada a un lado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open canvas flap"
msgstr "solapa abierta de tela"

#. ~ Description for open canvas flap
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This canvas flap door has been pulled aside."
msgstr "Esta puerta de lona ha sido apartada."

#. ~ Description for canvas flap
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This heavy canvas flap door could be pulled aside."
msgstr "Esta pesada puerta de lona podría hacerse a un lado."

#. ~ Description for open canvas flap
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This heavy canvas flap door has been pulled aside."
msgstr "Esta pesada puerta de lona ha sido apartada."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "groundsheet"
msgstr "lona impermeable"

#. ~ Description for groundsheet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This plastic groundsheet could keep you dry."
msgstr "Esta lámina de plástico podría mantenerte seco."

#. ~ Description for groundsheet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This large plastic groundsheet could keep you dry."
msgstr "Esta gran hoja de plástico podría mantenerte seco."

#. ~ Description for groundsheet
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This plastic government-issue groundsheet could keep you dry, but was made "
"by the lowest bidder."
msgstr ""
"Esta lámina de plástico emitida por el gobierno podría mantenerte seco, pero"
" fue hecha por el mejor postor."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "animalskin wall"
msgstr "pared de piel de animal"

#. ~ Description for animalskin wall
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Wall made out of animal skin.  Either an amazing or horrifying sight."
msgstr "Pared hecha de piel de animal. Es una vista asombrosa u horrorosa."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "animalskin flap"
msgstr "solapa de piel de animal"

#. ~ Description for animalskin flap
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This animal skin flap could be pulled aside."
msgstr "Este colgajo de piel de animal podría ser retirado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "open animalskin flap"
msgstr "solapa abierta de piel de animal"

#. ~ Description for open animalskin flap
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This animal skin flap has been pulled aside."
msgstr "Este colgajo de piel de animal ha sido retirado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "animalskin floor"
msgstr "piso de piel de animal"

#. ~ Description for animalskin floor
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "This animal skin groundsheet could keep you dry."
msgstr "Esta capa de piel de animal podría mantenerte seco."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pile of rubble"
msgstr "pila de escombros"

#. ~ Description for pile of rubble
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pile of various metals, bricks, and other building materials.  You could "
"clear it with a shovel."
msgstr ""
"Pila de varios metales, ladrillos y otros materiales de construcción. "
"Podrías limpiarlo con una pala."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pile of rocky rubble"
msgstr "pila de escombros de piedra"

#. ~ Description for pile of rocky rubble
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Pile of rocks.  Useless?"
msgstr "Un montón de rocas. ¿Inútil?"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pile of trashy rubble"
msgstr "pila de escombros de basura"

#. ~ Description for pile of trashy rubble
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Trash topped with dirt and grass, it smells gross, but another man's trash…"
msgstr ""
"La basura cubierta con tierra y hierba, huele asquerosa, pero la basura de "
"otro hombre..."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "metal wreckage"
msgstr "restos de metal"

#. ~ Description for metal wreckage
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Pile of various bent and twisted metals."
msgstr "Es una pila de distintos metales doblados y torcidos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "radioactive slag"
msgstr "desecho radioactivo"

#. ~ Description for radioactive slag
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A pile of melted slag from a destroyed nuclear reactor.  What are you doing "
"looking at this?  Get the hell out of here, you nutcase!"
msgstr ""
"Un montón de escoria fundida de un reactor nuclear destruido. ¿Qué haces "
"mirando esto? ¡Lárgate de aquí, chiflado!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pile of ash"
msgstr "pila de ceniza"

#. ~ Description for pile of ash
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Some ash, from wood or possibly bodies."
msgstr "Es un poco de ceniza, de madera o de cadáver."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "small boulder"
msgstr "roca pequeña"

#. ~ Description for small boulder
#. ~ Description for small rock candy boulder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Blocking your path.  Should be easy to move.  It can be used as a primitive "
"anvil."
msgstr ""
"Bloqueando tu camino. Debería ser fácil de mover. Puede ser usado como un "
"yunque primitivo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "medium boulder"
msgstr "roca mediana"

#. ~ Description for medium boulder
#. ~ Description for medium rock candy boulder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Blocking your path.  It'll be a struggle to move.  It can be used as a "
"primitive anvil."
msgstr ""
"Bloqueando tu camino. Será una lucha para moverse. Puede ser usado como un "
"yunque primitivo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "large boulder"
msgstr "roca grande"

#. ~ Description for large boulder
#. ~ Description for large rock candy boulder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Now how are you going to move this?"
msgstr "¿Cómo vas a hacer para mover esto?"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "street light"
msgstr "luz de la calle"

#. ~ Description for street light
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Raised source of light which used to illuminate streets and their "
"surrounding area, but it's useless without electricity."
msgstr ""
"Fuente de luz elevada que solía iluminar las calles y sus alrededores, pero "
"es inútil sin electricidad."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "traffic light"
msgstr "luz de tráfico"

#. ~ Description for traffic light
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Signaling device positioned at road intersections and pedestrian crossings "
"to control flows of traffic, but it's useless without electricity."
msgstr ""
"Dispositivo de señalización ubicado en las intersecciones de carreteras y "
"cruces peatonales para controlar los flujos de tráfico, pero es inútil sin "
"electricidad."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "utility pole"
msgstr "poste de utilidades"

#. ~ Description for utility pole
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long wooden post which used to support overhead power lines and other "
"public utilities, but it doesn't work anymore."
msgstr ""
"Un largo poste de madera que solía soportar las líneas eléctricas aéreas y "
"otros servicios públicos, pero ya no funciona."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "scrap metal bridge"
msgstr "puente de chatarra"

#. ~ Description for scrap metal bridge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A simple bridge made of riveted sheet metal."
msgstr "Un simple puente de hojas de metal remachadas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken console"
msgstr "consola rota"

#. ~ Description for broken console
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a standalone computer terminal.  It doesn't seem to be working.  "
"It's the broken screen and shattered circuit boards that's telling you that."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una terminal de computadora independiente. No parece funcionar. Es "
"la pantalla rota y los circuitos rotos lo que te dice eso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "computer console"
msgstr "consola de computadora"

#. ~ Description for computer console
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a standalone computer terminal.  It can be used to view contents and"
" perform any allowed functions.  It might even be possible to hack it, given"
" the skills."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una terminal de computadora independiente. Se puede utilizar para "
"ver el contenido y realizar cualquier función permitida. Incluso podría ser "
"posible hackearlo, si tienes las habilidades."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "forge"
msgstr "forja"

#. ~ Description for forge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Metalworking station typically used in combination with an anvil."
msgstr ""
"Es una estación para trabajar los metales, comúnmente utilizada en "
"combinación con un yunque."

#. ~ Description for anvil
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Used in metalworking."
msgstr "Se utiliza para trabajar el metal."

#. ~ Description for still
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An essential component for brewing and chemistry that allows for refining "
"liquid mixtures."
msgstr ""
"Es un componente esencial para la destilación y procesos químicos. Permite "
"refinar mezclas de líquidos."

#. ~ Description for charcoal kiln
#. ~ Description for filled charcoal kiln
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rock kiln designed to burn wood and organic material into charcoal in "
"absence of oxygen."
msgstr ""
"Una carbonera de piedra fabricada para convertir la madera y la materia "
"orgánica en carbón en ausencia de oxígeno."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "metal charcoal kiln"
msgstr "carbonera de metal"

#. ~ Description for metal charcoal kiln
#. ~ Description for filled metal charcoal kiln
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal kiln designed to burn wood and organic material into charcoal in "
"absence of oxygen."
msgstr ""
"Una carbonera de metal fabricada para convertir la madera y la materia "
"orgánica en carbón en ausencia de oxígeno."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "filled metal charcoal kiln"
msgstr "carbonera de metal llena"

#. ~ Description for arc furnace
#. ~ Description for filled arc furnace
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An arc furnace designed to burn a powdery mix of coke and limestone to "
"create calcium carbide."
msgstr ""
"Un horno de arco diseñado para quemar una mezcla polvorienta de coque y "
"piedra caliza para crear carburo de calcio."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "filled arc furnace"
msgstr "horno de arco lleno"

#. ~ Description for smoking rack
#. ~ Description for metal smoking rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A special rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  "
"Works as a charcoal smoker in crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"Un estante especial diseñado para ahumar la comida para una mejor "
"conservación y sabor. Funciona como un ahumador de carbón en la elaboración "
"de recetas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "active smoking rack"
msgstr "estante de ahumado activo"

#. ~ Description for active smoking rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A special rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  It"
" is lit and smoking."
msgstr ""
"Un estante especial diseñado para ahumar comida y mejorar la preservación y "
"sabor. Está encendido y humeando."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "active metal smoking rack"
msgstr "estante metálico de ahumado activo"

#. ~ Description for active metal smoking rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A special rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste."
msgstr ""
"Es un estante diseñado para ahumar comida para que se conserve más y tenga "
"mejor sabor."

#. ~ Description for rock forge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Metalworking station made of rock, typically used in combination with an "
"anvil.  Works as a charcoal forge in crafting recipes."
msgstr ""
"Estación de trabajo de metal hecho de roca, típicamente usado en combinación"
" con un yunque. Funciona como una forja de carbón en la elaboración de "
"recetas."

#. ~ Description for clay kiln
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A kiln designed to bake clay pottery and bricks."
msgstr "Un horno fabricado para cocer ladrillos y hacer alfarería."

#. ~ Description for stepladder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short, foldable ladder.  Can help you climb to a rooftop, or maybe slow "
"something down."
msgstr ""
"Una escalera corta y plegable. Puede ayudarte a subir a un tejado, o tal vez"
" a reducir la velocidad de algo."

#. ~ Description for electric arc furnace
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Not the kind of furnace you'd heat your house with, this is a device for "
"heating things to extreme temperatures as part of industrial fabrication "
"processes.  Can be used in recipes instead of forge, when supplied with "
"power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"No es el tipo de horno con el que calentarías tu casa, es un dispositivo "
"para calentar cosas a temperaturas extremas como parte de los procesos de "
"fabricación industrial. Se puede utilizar para recetas en lugar de la "
"fragua, cuando se alimenta con energía de un SAI."

#. ~ Description for drill press
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  "
"Useful in all kinds of projects from industrial fabrication to home "
"woodworking, if supplied with power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un potente taladro montado sobre una corredera que le permite descender con "
"precisión. Útil en todo tipo de proyectos, desde la fabricación industrial "
"hasta la carpintería doméstica, necesita extraer energía de un SAI para "
"funcionar."

#. ~ Description for tablesaw
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A rotating saw blade set into a large flat table, for making straight "
"measured cuts, if supplied with power from UPS.  One of the key tools in a "
"carpenter's arsenal."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra giratoria colocada en una gran mesa plana, para realizar "
"cortes rectos medidos, necesita extraer energía de un SAI para funcionar.. "
"Una de las herramientas clave en el arsenal de un carpintero."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mitre saw"
msgstr "sierra de inglete"

#. ~ Description for mitre saw
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A circular saw blade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry, if supplied with"
" power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra circular en un brazo que puede deslizarse y girar en "
"varias direcciones, es una herramienta básica para casi cualquier "
"carpintería, necesita extraer energía de un SAI para funcionar."

#. ~ Description for bandsaw
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing "
"precise cuts at almost any angle, if supplied with power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra en forma de cinta que se desplaza en una sola dirección "
"en esta herramienta, lo que le permite realizar cortes precisos en casi "
"cualquier ángulo, necesita extraer energía de un SAI para funcionar."

#. ~ Description for router table
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade "
"head for cutting specific profiles and grooves and stuff, if supplied with "
"power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Una hoja de sierra en forma de cinta que se desplaza en una sola dirección "
"en esta herramienta, lo que le permite realizar cortes precisos en casi "
"cualquier ángulo, necesita extraer energía de un SAI para funcionar."

#. ~ Description for planer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a "
"specific width, if supplied with power from UPS.  Particularly great if "
"working with raw lumber stock, but also good just for shaving wood down to "
"size."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta considerable que toma una tabla y la corta lisa y plana a "
"una anchura específica, necesita extraer energía de un SAI para funcionar. "
"Es especialmente útil si se trabaja con madera en bruto, pero también es "
"buena para cortar madera a medida."

#. ~ Description for jointer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, "
"and square off a board to make it very smooth and nice indeed, if supplied "
"with power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta en forma de mesa con una cuchilla giratoria que cortará, "
"alisará y cuadrará una tabla para dejarla muy suave y bonita, necesita "
"extraer energía de un SAI para funcionar."

#. ~ Description for hydraulic press
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"If you really want to squash something a lot, this would be exactly the "
"right industrial tool for you, if supplied with power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Si realmente quiere aplastar algo mucho, esta sería exactamente la "
"herramienta industrial adecuada para ello, necesita extraer energía de un "
"SAI para funcionar."

#. ~ Description for power lathe
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An industrial-grade lathe, for turning chunks of metal and other hard things"
" into round chunks of metal and other hard things, if supplied with power "
"from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un torno industrial, para convertir trozos de metal y otras cosas duras en "
"trozos redondos de metal y otras cosas duras, necesita extraer energía de un"
" SAI para funcionar."

#. ~ Description for air compressor
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the"
" tank as possible, if supplied with power from UPS."
msgstr ""
"Este duradero depósito está rematado con un motor que introducirá la mayor "
"cantidad de aire posible en el depósito, necesita extraer energía de un SAI "
"para funcionar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "fermenting vat"
msgstr "tanque de fermentación"

#. ~ Description for fermenting vat
#. ~ Description for filled fermenting vat
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A sealable vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr ""
"Una cuba sellada para fermentar vinagre y varios brebajes alcohólicos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "filled fermenting vat"
msgstr "tanque de fermentación lleno"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "butchering rack"
msgstr "estantería de carnicería"

#. ~ Description for butchering rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air."
msgstr "Un estante de carnicería diseñado para colgar un cadáver en el aire."

#. ~ Description for metal butchering rack
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Metal butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air.  It can be "
"deconstructed and folded for easy transportation."
msgstr ""
"Una estantería de carnicería de metal diseñada para colgar un cadáver en el "
"aire. Puede ser deconstruido y doblado para facilitar el transporte."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "hanging meathook"
msgstr "gancho de carne colgante"

#. ~ Description for hanging meathook
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A hefty hook suspended from a chain for stringing up corpses."
msgstr "Un gran gancho suspendido de una cadena para colgar cadáveres."

#. ~ Description for wind mill
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño molino de viento que puede convertir productos con almidón en "
"harina."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "active wind mill"
msgstr "molino de viento activo"

#. ~ Description for active wind mill
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  Its"
" brake has been removed and it is turning."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño molino de viento que puede convertir productos con almidón en "
"harina. Se le ha quitado el freno y está girando."

#. ~ Description for water mill
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño molino de agua que puede convertir productos con almidón en "
"harina."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "active water mill"
msgstr "molino de agua activo"

#. ~ Description for active water mill
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  "
"Its brake has been removed and it is turning."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeño molino de agua que puede convertir productos con almidón en "
"harina. Se le ha quitado el freno y está girando."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "automated gas console"
msgstr "consola automática de gases"

#. ~ Description for automated gas console
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Automated gas flow control console."
msgstr "Consola de control de flujo de gas automatizada."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "broken automated gas console"
msgstr "consola automática de gases rota"

#. ~ Description for broken automated gas console
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Automated gas flow control console.  Broken.  This is not a good thing."
msgstr ""
"Consola de control de flujo de gas automatizada. Rota. Esto no es algo "
"bueno."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "reinforced vending machine"
msgstr "máquina expendedora reforzada"

#. ~ Description for reinforced vending machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bit tougher to crack open than regular vending machines.  That just makes "
"it all the sweeter a target, doesn't it?"
msgstr ""
"Un poco más difícil de abrir que las máquinas expendedoras normales. Eso lo "
"convierte en un objetivo más dulce, ¿no?"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "vending machine"
msgstr "máquina expendedora"

#. ~ Description for vending machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Buy stuff with a cash card."
msgstr "Puedes comprar cosas con una tarjeta de crédito."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "broken vending machine"
msgstr "máquina expendedora rota"

#. ~ Description for broken vending machine
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ponder if you could buy stuff, as it's broken.  Maybe if you broke it more, "
"you wouldn't need to pay at all!"
msgstr ""
"Piensa si puedes comprar cosas, ya que están rotas. Tal vez si lo rompieras "
"más, no tendrías que pagar nada."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "rope leading up"
msgstr "soga para subir"

#. ~ Description for rope leading up
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A rope.  You could climb it up."
msgstr "Una soga. Podrías escalar por ella."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "illuminating plant bulb"
msgstr "bulbo de planta iluminada"

#. ~ Description for illuminating plant bulb
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small plant grows among the roots here, its green onion-like bulb "
"illuminating the area around it."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña planta crece aquí entre las raíces, su bulbo verde como una "
"cebolla ilumina la zona que la rodea."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "brambles"
msgstr "zarzas"

#. ~ Description for brambles
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wall of tangled roots blocks the path here, you'd have destroy it to get "
"past."
msgstr ""
"Un muro de raíces enmarañadas bloquea el camino aquí, tendrías que "
"destruirlo para pasar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "composting midden"
msgstr "basurero de compostaje"

#. ~ Description for composting midden
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A hole that has been dug into the roots here, and a pretty unpleasant smell "
"emits from it."
msgstr ""
"Un agujero que ha sido cavado en raíces aquí, y un olor bastante "
"desagradable que se emite de él."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "atomic butter churn on a stand"
msgstr "mantequera atómica en un soporte"

#. ~ Description for atomic butter churn on a stand
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Rivtech Atomic Butter Churn in deployed state.  It hums menacingly.  "
"Ready to add raw milk and salt.  It will churn till the earth is a cinder."
msgstr ""
"La mantequera atómica Rivtech en estado de despliegue. Tararea amenazante. "
"Listo para añadir leche cruda y sal. Se agitará hasta que la tierra sea una "
"ceniza."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "diamond press on a stand"
msgstr "prensa de diamantes sobre un soporte"

#. ~ Description for diamond press on a stand
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics Diamond Press deployed and ready to crush some "
"things on a molecular level.  DO NOT INSERT ANY PART OF YOUR ANATOMY."
msgstr ""
"Prensa de Diamante Matrioshka Fabritechnics desplegada y lista para aplastar"
" algunas cosas a nivel molecular. NO INTRODUZCA NINGUNA PARTE DE SU "
"ANATOMÍA."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "deployed nano forge rig"
msgstr "equipo de nano forja desplegado"

#. ~ Description for deployed nano forge rig
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics nano forge looks like a solid black box.  Apertures"
" for ingredients open with a hum as the console commands are entered.  DO "
"NOT INSERT ANY PART OF YOUR ANATOMY."
msgstr ""
"La nano forja de Matrioshka Fabritechnics parece una sólida caja negra. Las "
"aberturas para los ingredientes se abren con un zumbido cuando se introducen"
" los comandos de la consola. NO INTRODUZCA NINGUNA PARTE DE SU ANATOMÍA."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "escape pod seat"
msgstr "asiento de la cápsula de escape"

#. ~ Description for escape pod seat
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The cushioned and upright facing seat of a single-seater escape pod.  A "
"storage space beneath it holds survival supplies."
msgstr ""
"El asiento acolchado y orientado hacia arriba de la cápsula de escape "
"monoplaza. Un espacio de almacenamiento debajo de él contiene suministros de"
" supervivencia."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "chirurgic suite"
msgstr "suite quirúrgica"

#. ~ Description for chirurgic suite
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A multitude of surgical arms seamlessly meld with the chromed ceiling.  They"
" expectantly unravel with your approach, animated by an AI whose "
"performances blur the lines between medicine and art."
msgstr ""
"Una multitud de brazos quirúrgicos se funden a la perfección con el techo "
"cromado. Se desenvuelven con expectación cuando te acercas, animados por una"
" IA cuyas actuaciones desdibujan los límites entre la medicina y el arte."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Autodoc Mk. XVI"
msgstr "Autodoc Mk. XVI"

#. ~ Description for Autodoc Mk. XVI
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A commercial surgical robot often found within licensed clinics and "
"corporate hospitals.  Its various AI routines assist during surgery, but "
"they are no replacement for the actual operator's skill."
msgstr ""
"Un robot quirúrgico comercial que suele encontrarse en clínicas autorizadas "
"y hospitales corporativos. Sus diversas rutinas de IA ayudan durante la "
"cirugía, pero no sustituyen a la habilidad del operador real."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "salvaged autodoc"
msgstr "autodoc recuperado"

#. ~ Description for salvaged autodoc
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The kind of worn-down and dubiously safe surgical device that is perfectly "
"at home in a back alley clinic.  It would take great skill to safely operate"
" this."
msgstr ""
"El tipo de dispositivo quirúrgico desgastado y de dudosa seguridad que se "
"encuentra perfectamente en una clínica de callejón. Se necesitaría una gran "
"habilidad para operar esto con seguridad."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sleep pod"
msgstr "capsula de sueño"

#. ~ Description for sleep pod
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a climate controlled sleep pod.  An easy way to reduce energy costs "
"in dense urban environments."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una cápsula para dormir con control climático. Una forma sencilla de"
" reducir los costes energéticos en entornos urbanos densos."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cryo pod"
msgstr "capsula criogénica"

#. ~ Description for cryo pod
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a long term sleep pod.  Cryo pods are mostly used by people waiting "
"a short term for organs or criminals avoiding heat right after a crime."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una capsula para dormir un largo tiempo. Las capsulas criogénicas "
"son usadas principalmente por personas que esperan un corto plazo para "
"obtener órganos o criminales que evitan el peligro después de un crimen."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "cryo pylon"
msgstr "pilón criogénico"

#. ~ Description for cryo pylon
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This super chilled pylon is so cold it seems to pull in warmth towards "
"itself and create a light breeze of freezing air."
msgstr ""
"Este pilón superfrío es tan frío que parece atraer el calor hacia sí mismo y"
" crear una ligera brisa de aire helado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "CRISPR Biolab"
msgstr "Biolaboratorio CRISPR"

#. ~ Description for CRISPR Biolab
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A boxy looking device of arms, droppers, and pipettes.  It was used pre-"
"Cataclysm to do gene-editing experiments."
msgstr ""
"Un dispositivo de aspecto cuadrado con brazos, goteros y pipetas. Se "
"utilizaba antes del cataclismo para hacer experimentos de edición genética."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "nano forge"
msgstr "nano forja"

#. ~ Description for nano forge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics created this portable nanotech forge for when "
"expeditions are setting up a basecamp far from population centers.  Once "
"deployed it can be used to craft ultratech marvels that otherwise are too "
"minute for human crafting.  Often used in combination with a diamond press."
msgstr ""
"Matrioshka Fabritechnics ha creado esta forja nanotecnológica portátil para "
"cuando las expediciones establezcan un campamento base lejos de los centros "
"de población. Una vez desplegada, puede utilizarse para fabricar maravillas "
"ultratécnicas que, de otro modo, serían demasiado diminutas para la "
"fabricación humana. A menudo se utiliza en combinación con una prensa de "
"diamante."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "3D printer"
msgstr "impresora 3D"

#. ~ Description for 3D printer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This box was used for rapid prototyping of products and for general "
"entertainment purposes in the masses."
msgstr ""
"Esta caja se utilizaba para la creación rápida de prototipos de productos y "
"para el entretenimiento general de las masas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "neural net inserter"
msgstr "insertador de red neuronal"

#. ~ Description for neural net inserter
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This device looks like a cross between some kind of nightmare dentistry "
"equipment and socketing tool mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely "
"down.  Useful for those projects that require putting delicate items into "
"hard to reach spaces."
msgstr ""
"Este dispositivo parece un cruce entre una especie de equipo de odontología "
"de pesadilla y una herramienta de encaje montada en una corredera que le "
"permite descender con precisión. Útil para aquellos proyectos que requieren "
"colocar elementos delicados en espacios de difícil acceso."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "monomolecular saw"
msgstr "sierra monomolécular"

#. ~ Description for monomolecular saw
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A wire the size of a cheescutter runs in a single direction in this tool, "
"allowing atomically precise cuts at almost any angle.  Even unpowered it "
"gives off a visual distortion for several inches around it to prevent you "
"from losing a hand.  It is impossible to deconstruct this device without the"
" wire self destructing."
msgstr ""
"Un cable del tamaño de un cortador de queso corre en una sola dirección en "
"esta herramienta, lo que permite realizar cortes atómicamente precisos en "
"casi cualquier ángulo. Incluso sin alimentación, emite una distorsión visual"
" durante varios centímetros a su alrededor para evitar que se pierda una "
"mano. Es imposible deconstruir este dispositivo sin que el cable se "
"autodestruya."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "military SICC terminal"
msgstr "terminal SICC militar"

#. ~ Description for military SICC terminal
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Console interface for a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  With "
"the machine connected to it broken, it can only be salvaged for parts."
msgstr ""
"Interfaz de Consola para un Grupo de Comunicaciones Interestelar Estándar. "
"Con la máquina conectada a ella rota, sólo puede ser desguazada por piezas."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "military SICC master computing array"
msgstr "array de computación maestra SICC militar"

#. ~ Description for military SICC master computing array
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive metal construct reaching as high as the ceiling, this Master "
"Computing Array of a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster used to be"
" the pinnacle of quantum waveform manipulation technology.  Now, though, "
"it's nothing more than a box full of delicious electronics."
msgstr ""
"Una enorme construcción metálica que llega hasta el techo, esta array de "
"computación maestra de un clúster de comunicaciones interestelar estándar "
"solía ser el pináculo de la tecnología de manipulación de la forma de onda "
"cuántica. Ahora, sin embargo, no es más que una caja llena de deliciosa "
"electrónica."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "sabotaged military SICC master computing array"
msgstr "array de computación maestra SICC militar saboteada"

#. ~ Description for sabotaged military SICC master computing array
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Vandalized remains of a Standard Interstellar Communications Cluster.  Wires"
" and connectors spill out from a torn side panel, revealing the mangled "
"carcass of a century-old beast.  Although stripped of its core components, "
"careful searching may reveal useful electronics for scavengers like you."
msgstr ""
"Restos vandalizados de un grupo de Comunicaciones Interestelares Estándar. "
"Los cables y los conectores se desprenden de un panel lateral desgarrado, "
"revelando la carcasa destrozada de una bestia centenaria. Aunque está "
"desprovista de sus componentes principales, una búsqueda cuidadosa puede "
"revelar componentes electrónicos útiles para los carroñeros como tú."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "military SICC satellite link"
msgstr "lenlace por satélite SICC militar"

#. ~ Description for military SICC satellite link
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large satellite dish mounted on a towering amplification platform, linked "
"to an orbital satellite that probably doesn't exist anymore.  Although the "
"satellite dish is of little use due to the unorthodox geometry, the "
"amplifier circuitry will prove invaluable for high-energy gadgets."
msgstr ""
"Una gran antena parabólica montada en una altísima plataforma de "
"amplificación, conectada a un satélite orbital que probablemente ya no "
"existe. Aunque la antena parabólica es poco útil debido a su geometría poco "
"ortodoxa, los circuitos de amplificación resultarán muy valiosos para los "
"artilugios de alta energía."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "military SICC power supply"
msgstr "fuente de energía SICC militar"

#. ~ Description for military SICC power supply
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Dedicated power supply module for a Standard Interstellar Communications "
"Cluster.  Capable of drawing thousands of watts during operation, it "
"requires a dedicated heat dissipation array to function normally."
msgstr ""
"Módulo de suministro de energía dedicado a un Grupo de Comunicaciones "
"Interestelares Estándar. Capaz de consumir miles de vatios durante su "
"funcionamiento, requiere una matriz de disipación de calor específica para "
"funcionar con normalidad."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "destroyed military SICC power supply"
msgstr "fuente de energía SICC militar destruida"

#. ~ Description for destroyed military SICC power supply
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An incoherent mess of molten polymer and charred metamaterial, this badly "
"damaged module used to be the power supply for a Standard Interstellar "
"Communications Cluster.  It seems to have undergone a catastrophic overload "
"event, which is weird considering the array of failsafes these things are "
"equipped with."
msgstr ""
" Una lio incoherente de polímero fundido y metamaterial carbonizado, este "
"módulo tan dañado solía ser la fuente de alimentación de un Grupo de "
"Comunicaciones Interestelares Estándar. Parece haber sufrido una sobrecarga "
"catastrófica, lo que resulta extraño si se tiene en cuenta la serie de "
"dispositivos de seguridad con los que están equipados."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "military SICC heat dissipation array"
msgstr "array de disipación de calor SICC militar"

#. ~ Description for military SICC heat dissipation array
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A miniature forest of metallic fins and sparkling panels, this is a "
"dedicated heat dissipation module for a Standard Interstellar Communications"
" Cluster.  It is installed outside to utilize the frigid air for maximum "
"cooling."
msgstr ""
"Es un bosque miniatura de aletas metálicas y paneles brillantes pero es en "
"realidad un módulo dedicado de disipación de calor para el Equipo Estándar "
"de Comunicaciones Interestelares. Está instalado afuera para utilizar el "
"aire frío para un enfriamiento máximo."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "DIRT data interface"
msgstr "interfaz de datos DIRT"

#. ~ Description for DIRT data interface
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"All-in-one integrated console for a Driving Intelligent Realtime Topography "
"rover-mounted vehicular terrain scanner system.  In other words, a useless "
"display monitor."
msgstr ""
"Consola integrada todo en uno para un sistema de escáner de terreno "
"vehicular montado en un rover de Conducción Inteligente de Topografía en "
"Tiempo Real. En otras palabras, una pantalla inútil."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "DIRT computation core"
msgstr "núcleo de computación DIRT"

#. ~ Description for DIRT computation core
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Data analysis and computing core for a DIRT terrain scanner system.  Rugged "
"design and internal shock absorbers help this hefty metal box withstand "
"extreme cold and harsh driving conditions."
msgstr ""
"Núcleo de análisis de datos y computación para un sistema de escáner de "
"terreno DIRT. El diseño robusto y los amortiguadores internos ayudan a esta "
"robusta caja metálica a soportar el frío extremo y las duras condiciones de "
"conducción."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "dismantled DIRT computation core"
msgstr "núcleo de computación DIRT desmantelado"

#. ~ Description for dismantled DIRT computation core
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It seems that you are not the first one to think of dismantling this "
"precious metal box for the goodies inside - The top lid of this DIRT "
"computational core is missing, and the hollowed-out insides are clearly "
"visible from the opening."
msgstr ""
"Parece que no es usted el primero que piensa en desmontar esta preciosa caja"
" de metal para encontrar las golosinas de su interior - La tapa superior de "
"este núcleo computacional DIRT ha desaparecido, y las entrañas huecas son "
"claramente visibles desde la apertura."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "DIRT scanner array"
msgstr "array de escáner DIRT"

#. ~ Description for DIRT scanner array
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mounted on a self-stabilizing gymbal, this high-tech sphere is full of "
"various sensors and scanners that automatically map out the surrounding "
"terrain with an amazing accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Montada en un artilugio autoestabilizador, esta esfera de alta tecnología "
"está repleta de diversos sensores y escáneres que cartografían "
"automáticamente el terreno circundante con una precisión asombrosa."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "moss bush"
msgstr "arbusto de musgo"

#. ~ Description for moss bush
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A mound of moss, with large colorful stems protruding out of it."
msgstr ""
"Un montón de musgo, con grandes tallos de colores que sobresalen de él."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "squish."
msgstr "aplastado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "geothermal bladder"
msgstr "vejiga geotérmica"

#. ~ Description for geothermal bladder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Black veins support a large formation of bleached coral as it grows around "
"the rim of this geothermal vent.  Above it, red and purple tentacles caress "
"a balloon-shaped organ as it breathes."
msgstr ""
"Unas venas negras sostienen una gran formación de coral blanqueado mientras "
"crece alrededor del borde de este respiradero geotérmico. Sobre ella, "
"tentáculos rojos y púrpuras acarician un órgano con forma de globo mientras "
"respira."

#. ~ Description for breather
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On the ground here lays several colorless coral reefs, the black veins are "
"noticeably more engorged as they breathe."
msgstr ""
"En el suelo se encuentran varios arrecifes de coral incoloros, cuyas venas "
"negras están notablemente más hinchadas al respirar."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "overgrown vent"
msgstr "respirador de gran tamaño"

#. ~ Description for overgrown vent
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The coral and veins on the ground here have fused into a sea anemone-like "
"structure; pufts of smoke and hot air emit from its mouth."
msgstr ""
"El coral y las venas del suelo se han fundido en una estructura parecida a "
"un anémona marina; de su boca salen bocanadas de humo y aire caliente."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "geothermal vent"
msgstr "respirador geotérmico"

#. ~ Description for geothermal vent
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A basalt column stands here, perpetually emitting foul-smelling gas, similar"
" to rotten eggs.  It is very warm to the touch, hot enough to burn you if "
"you aren't careful."
msgstr ""
"Aquí se encuentra una columna de basalto que emite constantemente un gas "
"maloliente, similar al de los huevos podridos. Está muy caliente al tacto, "
"tanto como para quemarte si no tienes cuidado."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "basalt rocks"
msgstr "rocas de basalto"

#. ~ Description for basalt rocks
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Various sharp rocks jut out of the ground here."
msgstr " Varias rocas afiladas sobresalen del suelo aquí."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "small snow mound"
msgstr "pequeño montículo de nieve"

#. ~ Description for small snow mound
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A small pile of snow."
msgstr "Un pequeño montón de nieve."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "flump!"
msgstr "¡déjalo!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "snow mound"
msgstr "montículo de nieve"

#. ~ Description for snow mound
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A large pile of snow"
msgstr "Una gran pila de nieve."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "large snow mound"
msgstr "gran montículo de nieve"

#. ~ Description for large snow mound
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A large pile of snow blocks your path here."
msgstr "Un gran montón de nieve bloquea tu camino aquí."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "small ice boulder"
msgstr "pequeña roca de hielo"

#. ~ Description for small ice boulder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A small chunk of ice sits in the ground here."
msgstr "Un pequeño trozo de hielo se asienta en el suelo aquí."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "ice boulder"
msgstr "roca de hielo"

#. ~ Description for ice boulder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A large chunk of ice juts out of the ground here."
msgstr "Un gran trozo de hielo sobresale del suelo aquí."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "large ice boulder"
msgstr "gran roca de hielo"

#. ~ Description for large ice boulder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "A large piece of glacial ice stands here, blocking your path."
msgstr ""
"Un gran trozo de hielo glacial se encuentra aquí, bloqueando tu camino."

#. ~ Description for vehicle refrigerator
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This fridge has been converted to run off of a vehicle's power supply.  "
"You'll need to take it down first."
msgstr ""
"Este refrigerador ha sido convertido para funcionar sin la fuente de "
"alimentación de un vehículo. Tendrás que desmontarlo primero."

#. ~ Description for vehicle freezer
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This fridge has been further refurbished, and runs at a much lower "
"temperature.  You'll need to take it down first."
msgstr ""
"Este frigorífico ha sido renovado y funciona a una temperatura mucho más "
"baja. Tendrás que desmontarlo primero."

#. ~ Description for dresser
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Dress yourself!"
msgstr "¡Vístete!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "poppy bush"
msgstr "arbusto de amapola"

#. ~ Description for poppy bush
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An invasive species brought to Earth by the invaders and found it quite to "
"its liking.  It spiny, writhing fronds make it look more like a jungle bush "
"than a conventional poppy except for its red petals, but is named after such"
" due to its similar medicinal properties.  It exudes a potent, sleep "
"inducing aroma."
msgstr ""
"Una especie invasora traída a la Tierra por los invasores y que le encontró "
"bastante a su gusto. Sus frondas espinosas y retorcidas la hacen parecer más"
" un arbusto de la selva que una amapola convencional, salvo por sus pétalos "
"rojos, pero recibe ese nombre por sus propiedades medicinales similares. "
"Desprende un potente aroma que induce al sueño."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Translocator Gate"
msgstr "La puerta del translocalizador"

#. ~ Description for Translocator Gate
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A gate for translocation.  Cast the translocation spell or use a "
"translocator to choose this gate as a destination."
msgstr ""
"Una puerta para la translocalización. Lanza el hechizo de translocación o "
"usa un translocalizador para elegir esta puerta como destino."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Magic Circle"
msgstr "Círculo Mágico"

#. ~ Description for Magic Circle
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a rough magic circle, carved into the ground and decorated with "
"blood, candles, and other small knick-knacks."
msgstr ""
"Este es un círculo mágico tosco, tallado en la tierra y decorado con sangre,"
" velas y otras pequeñas chucherías."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "large glowing boulder"
msgstr "una gran roca brillante"

#. ~ Description for large glowing boulder
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Something about this doesn't look right."
msgstr "Algo de esto no se ve bien."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "enchanter's workbench"
msgstr "mesa de trabajo del hechicero"

#. ~ Description for enchanter's workbench
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ornate oak cabinet topped by a durable resin countertop resistant to most"
" alchemical spills and burns.  It has wired in electrical and gas fittings, "
"and has been decorated with several protection runes - mostly ornamental."
msgstr ""
"Un gabinete de roble adornado con una encimera de resina resistente a la "
"mayoría de los derrames y quemaduras alquímicas. Está cableado con "
"accesorios eléctricos y de gas, y ha sido decorado con varias runas de "
"protección, en su mayoría ornamentales."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "standing alembic"
msgstr ""
"Un gabinete de roble adornado, coronado por una resistente encimera de "
"resina "

#. ~ Description for standing alembic
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large glass and copper alembic for distilling alchemical concoctions.  It "
"consists of a copper pot with rising spires of twisted glass draining into "
"various removable bottles."
msgstr ""
"Un gran alambique de vidrio y cobre para destilar brebajes alquímicos. "
"Consiste en un pote de cobre con espirales ascendentes de vidrio retorcido "
"que drena en varias botellas extraíbles."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "orrery"
msgstr "Planetario mecánico"

#. ~ Description for orrery
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a beautiful, non-scale model of the solar system.  A complex series "
"of gears allows the relative motions of the planets to be studied at the "
"turn of a crank.  This more modern version also has bluetooth and could have"
" been controlled with an app, if there was any power anymore."
msgstr ""
"Este es un hermoso modelo no a escala del sistema solar. Una compleja serie "
"de engranajes permite estudiar los movimientos relativos de los planetas al "
"girar una manivela. Esta versión más moderna también tiene bluetooth y "
"podría haber sido controlado con una aplicación, si hubiera habido más "
"potencia."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "huge mana crystal"
msgstr "un enorme cristal de maná"

#. ~ Description for huge mana crystal
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a mana crystal that juts from the ground as if it had sprouted up "
"like a weed.  It pulses with a delicate yellow energy, occasionally bursting"
" with flashes of pent-up light."
msgstr ""
"Este es un cristal de maná que sobresale del suelo como si hubiera brotado "
"como una hierba. Pulsa con una delicada energía amarilla, ocasionalmente "
"estallando con destellos de luz acumulada."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "glass shattering!"
msgstr "¡pisadas de cristales!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "mana crackling!"
msgstr "¡mana crepitante!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "stone altar"
msgstr "altar de piedra"

#. ~ Description for stone altar
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a big stone altar.  Most commonly used in morally questionable "
"rituals."
msgstr ""
"Este es un gran altar de piedra. Más comúnmente utilizado en rituales "
"moralmente cuestionables."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/overmap_terrain_from_json.py
msgid "attunement altar"
msgstr "altar de sintonización"

#. ~ Description for attunement altar
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ancient stone plinth covered in symbols that appear to be combinations "
"and variations of the eight magic classes.  Eight depressions are on the top"
" with the original symbols of the classes, each look as though they can hold"
" an item."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo zócalo de piedra cubierto de símbolos que parecen ser "
"combinaciones y variaciones de las ocho clases mágicas. En la parte superior"
" hay ocho depresiones con los símbolos originales de las clases, cada una de"
" las cuales parece poder contener un objeto."

#. ~ Description for demon forge
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a forge made of the chitin of a huge, red spider that has a penchant"
" for flames.  Custom made to withstand the heat from alumentum, this forge "
"can resmelt the magical metals into their workable, ingot form."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una forja hecha con la quitina de una enorme araña roja que tiene "
"predilección por las llamas. Hecha a medida para soportar el calor del "
"alumento, esta forja puede refundir los metales mágicos en su forma de "
"lingote viable."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "candelabra of everlasting candles"
msgstr "candelabro de velas eternas"

#. ~ Description for candelabra of everlasting candles
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A candelabra, strangely the candles never seem to burn down.  Smashing it "
"doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr ""
"Un candelabro, extrañamente las velas nunca parecen consumirse. Romperlo no "
"parece que vaya a producir ningún salvamento que valga la pena."

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "SMASH!"
msgstr "¡CLONC!"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "pile of rock candy rubble"
msgstr "pila de escombros de caramelo de roca"

#. ~ Description for pile of rock candy rubble
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "Pile of rock candy shards.  Useless?"
msgstr "Un montón de fragmentos de caramelo de roca. ¿Inútil?"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "small rock candy boulder"
msgstr "roca pequeña de caramelo"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "medium rock candy boulder"
msgstr "roca mediana de caramelo"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "large rock candy boulder"
msgstr "roca grande de caramelo"

#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid "tank trap"
msgstr "trampa de tanque"

#. ~ Description for fungal mass
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick ropes of mycal matter have covered the ground here completely.  It's "
"soft to the touch, but you sink into it, making moving across it difficult."
msgstr ""
"Gruesas cuerdas de materia micácea han cubierto el suelo aquí completamente."
" Es suave al tacto, pero te hundes en él, haciendo difícil el movimiento a "
"través de él."

#. ~ Description for fungal clump
#: lang/json/furniture_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Alien mold and stems mingle tightly here, creating a sort of fungal bush."
msgstr ""
"El moho extraterrestre y los tallos se mezclan fuertemente aquí, creando una"
" especie de arbusto de hongos."

#. ~ 'close' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "The gate is closed!"
msgstr "¡La verja está cerrada!"

#. ~ 'fail' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "The gate can't be closed!"
msgstr "¡No se puede cerrar la verja!"

#. ~ 'open' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "The gate is opened!"
msgstr "¡La verja está abierta!"

#. ~ 'pull' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "You turn the handle…"
msgstr "Giras la manilla..."

#. ~ 'close' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "The barn doors closed!"
msgstr "¡Las puertas del granero se cierran!"

#. ~ 'fail' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "The barn doors can't be closed!"
msgstr "¡No se pueden cerrar las puertas del granero!"

#. ~ 'open' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "The barn doors opened!"
msgstr "¡Las puertas del granero se abren!"

#. ~ 'pull' action message of some gate object.
#: lang/json/gates_from_json.py
msgid "You pull the rope…"
msgstr "Tiras de la soga..."

#. ~ 'close' action message of some gate object.
