msgstr[1] "escopetas básicas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pump action shotgun"
msgid_plural "pump action shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de acción de bombeo"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de acción de bombeo"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "chuk chuk."
msgstr "chak chak."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "base race shotgun, pump"
msgid_plural "base race shotguns, pump"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de carreras de base, de bombeo"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de carreras de base, de bombeo"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "base SMG"
msgid_plural "base SMGs"
msgstr[0] "subfusil básico"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles básicos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "smg"
msgstr "subfusil"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "10mm/.40 revolver"
msgid_plural "10mm/.40 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "revólver 10mm/.40"
msgstr[1] "revólveres 10mm/.40"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A classic six-shooter revolver chambered for 10mm and .40 rounds."
msgstr ""
"Un revólver clásico de seis tiros con cámara para munición 10mm y .40."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "S&W 610"
msgid_plural "S&W 610"
msgstr[0] "S&W 610"
msgstr[1] "S&W 610"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Smith and Wesson 610 is a classic six-shooter revolver chambered for "
"10mm rounds, or for S&W's own .40 round."
msgstr ""
"La Smith & Wesson 610 es un revólver clásico de seis disparos para balas "
"calibre 10mm, o para las propias de la marca S$W, el calibre .40."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "compact Glock pistol"
msgid_plural "compact Glock pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola compacta Glock"
msgstr[1] "pistolas compactas Glock"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small pistol accepting Glock magazines and chambered in 10mm.  Because of "
"it size, it is easy to carry, but it has rather fierce recoil."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola pequeña que acepta cargadores Glock y que tiene recámara de 10 "
"mm. Debido a su tamaño, es fácil de llevar, pero tiene un retroceso bastante"
" fuerte."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 29"
msgid_plural "Glock 29s"
msgstr[0] "Glock 29"
msgstr[1] "Glocks 29"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modestly sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  It is easy to carry because of its small size, but also "
"recoils fiercely."
msgstr ""
"Una versión de tamaño modesto de la exitosa Glock, con recámara de 10mm "
"Auto. Es fácil de llevar debido a su pequeño tamaño, pero también retrocede "
"ferozmente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock pistol"
msgid_plural "Glock pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola Glock"
msgstr[1] "pistolas Glock"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm, and accepting Glock "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola semiautomática con recámara de 10 mm que acepta "
"cargadores Glock."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 20"
msgid_plural "Glock 20s"
msgstr[0] "Glock 20"
msgstr[1] "Glocks 20"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full-sized version of the highly successful Glock, chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  The third model of Glock designed, all other full-sized,"
" large framed Glocks are adaptations of this one."
msgstr ""
"Una versión de tamaño completo de la exitosa Glock, con recámara de 10mm "
"Auto. El tercer modelo de Glock diseñado, todas las demás Glock de tamaño "
"completo y armazón grande son adaptaciones de esta."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 40 MOS"
msgid_plural "Glock 40 MOSs"
msgstr[0] "Glock 40 SOM"
msgstr[1] "Glocks 40 SOM"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full-sized, long-slide version of the highly successful Glock, chambered "
"in hard-hitting 10mm Auto.  The extra barrel length makes for slightly even "
"harder hitting ammo, and the extra slide length means the sights are a "
"little easier to use.  It also features Glock's Modular Optic System, making"
" aftermarket optics much easier to mount."
msgstr ""
"Una versión de tamaño completo y con corredera larga de la exitosa Glock, "
"con recámara de 10mm Auto. La longitud adicional del cañón hace que la "
"munición sea aún más potente, y la longitud adicional de la corredera "
"significa que las miras son un poco más fáciles de usar. También cuenta con "
"el Sistema Óptico Modular de Glock, lo que facilita el montaje de ópticas "
"del mercado secundario."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "BA10 rifle"
msgid_plural "BA10 rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle BA10"
msgstr[1] "rifles BA10"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A semi-automatic rifle, chambered in 10mm, accepting BA10 magazines."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle semiautomático, con recámara de 10mm, que acepta cargadores BA10."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "BA10"
msgid_plural "BA10s"
msgstr[0] "BA10"
msgstr[1] "BA10s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The MP5/10 served the FBI briefly alongside their 10mm Auto pistols, adding "
"to the caliber's overall mystique.  Though the guns' usage was shortlived, a"
" handful of clones were made and sold occasionally.  This semi-automatic "
"clone manufactured by Brethren Arms features a welded on M1913 rail and a "
"collapsible arm brace."
msgstr ""
"La MP5/10 sirvió brevemente al FBI junto con sus pistolas Auto de 10 mm, lo "
"que aumentó la mística general del calibre. Aunque su uso fue breve, se "
"fabricaron algunos clones que se vendieron ocasionalmente. Este clon "
"semiautomático fabricado por Brethren Arms cuenta con un raíl M1913 soldado "
"y un soporte de brazo plegable."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Colt Delta Elite pistol"
msgid_plural "Colt Delta Elite pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola Colt Delta Elites"
msgstr[1] "pistolas Colt Delta Elites"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm.  It accepts Colt Delta Elite "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola semiautomática con recámara de 10mm. Acepta cargadores Colt "
"Delta Elite."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Colt Delta Elite"
msgid_plural "Colt Delta Elites"
msgstr[0] "Colt Delta Elite"
msgstr[1] "Colt Delta Elites"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modernized, match-grade variant of the venerable M1911 chambered in hard-"
"hitting 10mm Auto.  Early variants were known to crack frames; modern "
"1911's, like this one, are slotted to prevent such crack formation."
msgstr ""
"Una variante modernizada de la venerable M1911 con recámara de 10mm Auto. "
"Las primeras variantes tenían fama de agrietar los armazones; las 1911 "
"modernas, como ésta, están ranuradas para evitar la formación de grietas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "EAA Witness pistol"
msgid_plural "EAA Witness pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola EAA Witness"
msgstr[1] "pistolas EAA Witness"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm, and accepting EAA Witness "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola semiautomática con recámara de 10mm que acepta cargadores EAA "
"Witness."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "EAA Witness 10mm"
msgid_plural "EAA Witness 10mms"
msgstr[0] "EAA Witness 10mm"
msgstr[1] "EAA Witness 10mms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The EAA Witness is a modified variant of the CZ-75, produced in Italy by "
"Tanfoglio.  This is the standard steel framed version chambered in 10mm "
"Auto."
msgstr ""
"La EAA Witness es una variante modificada de la CZ-75, producida en Italia "
"por Tanfoglio. Esta es la versión estándar con armazón de acero y recámara "
"de 10mm Auto."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG pistol"
msgid_plural "SIG pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola SIG"
msgstr[1] "pistolas SIG"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mmm, and accepting SIG magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola semiautomática con recámara de 10mm que acepta cargadores EAA "
"Witness."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG P220 10mm"
msgid_plural "SIG P220 10mms"
msgstr[0] "SIG P220 10mm"
msgstr[1] "SIG P220 10mms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Sig Sauer P220 was developed for the Swiss military in 1975, and its "
"simplified action was later used in most other Sig Sauer designs, including "
"the P226.  The all-steel construction adds heft to this model, which is "
"chambered in hard-hitting 10mm Auto."
msgstr ""
"La Sig Sauer P220 se desarrolló para el ejército suizo en 1975, y su acción "
"simplificada se utilizó posteriormente en la mayoría de los demás diseños de"
" Sig Sauer, incluida la P226. La construcción totalmente de acero añade peso"
" a este modelo, que tiene la recámara de 10mm Auto."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "XD(M) pistol"
msgid_plural "XD(M) pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola XD(M)"
msgstr[1] "pistolas XD(M)"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in 10mm, and accepting XD(M) magazines"
msgstr ""
"Una pistola semiautomática con recámara de 10mm que acepta cargadores XD(M)"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "XD(M) Competition 10mm"
msgid_plural "XD(M) Competition 10mms"
msgstr[0] "XD(M) Competition 10mm"
msgstr[1] "XD(M) Competition 10mms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed by HS Produkt in Croatia, the HS2000 has become a commercial "
"success for Springfield Armory, who imports and markets it as the eXtreme "
"Duty.  The XD has since been offered in a variety of chamberings and sizes, "
"including this full-sized match grade variant in 10mm Auto."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada por HS Produkt en Croacia, la HS2000 se ha convertido en un éxito "
"comercial para Springfield Armory, que la importa y comercializa como "
"eXtreme Duty. Desde entonces, el XD se ha ofrecido en una variedad de "
"recámaras y tamaños, incluyendo esta variante de tamaño completo en 10mm "
"Auto."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock SMG"
msgid_plural "Glock SMGs"
msgstr[0] "SMG Glock"
msgstr[1] "SMGs Glock"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "This is a submachine gun chambered in 10mm, accepting Glock magazines."
msgstr "Este es un subfusil con recámara de 10mm que acepta cargadores Glock."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Vector SDP 10mm"
msgid_plural "Vector SDP 10mms"
msgstr[0] "Vector SDP 10mm"
msgstr[1] "Vector SDP 10mms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Vector SDP is a delayed blowback \"pistol\" with a unique, downward "
"reciprocating bolt that helps combat muzzle climb.  This one is chambered in"
" 10mm Auto."
msgstr ""
"La Vector SDP es una \"pistola\" de retroceso retardado con un cerrojo único"
" de vaivén hacia abajo que ayuda a combatir la subida de la boca del cañón. "
"Esta tiene la recámara de 10mm Auto."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K G80 railgun"
msgid_plural "H&K G80 railguns"
msgstr[0] "cañón de riel H&K G80"
msgstr[1] "cañones de riel H&K G80"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Developed by Heckler & Koch, this railgun magnetically propels a "
"ferromagnetic projectile using an alternating current.  Powered by UPS."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollado por Heckler & Koch, este cañón de riel propulsa magnéticamente "
"un proyectil ferromagnético usando una corriente alterna. Alimentado por "
"SAI."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM120c shotgun"
msgid_plural "RM120c shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta RM120c"
msgstr[1] "escopetas RM120c"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM120c caseless pump-"
"action shotgun was designed for hunting big game, with durability and ease "
"of use as priorities."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando un poderoso e inusual calibre, la escopeta de acción de bombeo "
"Rivtech RM120c fue diseñada para cazar grandes animales, con la durabilidad "
"y facilidad de uso como prioridades."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM20 autoshotgun"
msgid_plural "RM20 autoshotguns"
msgstr[0] "autoescopeta RM20"
msgstr[1] "autoescopetas RM20"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM20 caseless "
"automatic combat shotgun was designed with durability and overwhelming power"
" in mind."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando un poderoso e inusual calibre, la escopeta automática de combate "
"Rivtech RM20 fue diseñada para ser duradera y tener un poder avasallador."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM228 PDW"
msgid_plural "RM228 PDWs"
msgstr[0] "RM228 PDW"
msgstr[1] "RM228 PDW"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Chambering the powerful 20x66mm caseless shotgun cartridge, the Rivtech "
"RM228 PDW was designed for the civilian personal defense market with "
"durability and ease of use as priorities.  While lauded for its small size "
"and light weight, its hefty price tag kept it out of the reach of casual "
"collectors."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando el poderoso cartucho de escopeta 20x66mm sin casquillo, la "
"Rivtech RM228 PDW fue diseñada para el mercado de defensa personal civil con"
" la durabilidad y la facilidad de uso como prioridades. Aunque elogiada por "
"su pequeño tamaño y peso ligero, su elevado precio la mantuvo fuera del "
"alcance de los coleccionistas ocasionales."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "American-180"
msgid_plural "American-180"
msgstr[0] "American-180"
msgstr[1] "American-180"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The American-180 is a submachine gun developed in the 1960's that fires .22 "
"LR, unusual for an SMG.  Though the round is low-powered, the high rate of "
"fire and large magazine makes the 180 a formidable weapon."
msgstr ""
"El American-180 es un subfusil desarrollado en la década de 1960. Dispara "
"calibre .22 LR, lo que es inusual para un subfusil. Aunque esa bala es de "
"bajo poder, el ritmo alto de disparo y el cargador grande hace que el 180 "
"sea un arma formidable."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Marlin 39A"
msgid_plural "Marlin 39A"
msgstr[0] "Marlin 39A"
msgstr[1] "Marlin 39A"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The oldest and longest-produced shoulder firearm in the world.  Though it "
"fires the weak .22 round, it is highly accurate and damaging, and has "
"essentially no recoil."
msgstr ""
"La más antigua y más producida de las armas de fuego del mundo. Aunque "
"dispara el débil calibre .22, es muy precisas y hace mucho daño, y casi que "
"no posee retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mossberg Brownie"
msgid_plural "Mossberg Brownie"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg Brownie"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg Brownie"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The first gun produced by O.F. Mossberg & Sons.  A small pocket pistol, "
"marketed to trappers during the early 20th century.  Its four barrels can "
"accept .22 Short and .22 LR cartridges."
msgstr ""
"La primera pistola producida por O.F. Mossberg & Sons. Una pequeña pistola "
"de bolsillo, comercializada a los tramperos a principios del siglo XX. Sus "
"cuatro cañones pueden aceptar cartuchos de .22 Short y .22 LR."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe rifle: .22"
msgid_plural "pipe rifles: .22"
msgstr[0] "rifle de tubo: .22"
msgstr[1] "rifles de tubo: .22"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A home-made rifle.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer "
"to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle hecho en casa. Es simplemente un tubo con una culata y un percutor "
"para golpear la bala que contiene."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ruger 10/22"
msgid_plural "Ruger 10/22"
msgstr[0] "Ruger 10/22"
msgstr[1] "Ruger 10/22"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A combination of negligible recoil, high customization, and inexpensive "
"ammunition made the Ruger 10/22 a popular choice among enthusiasts and small"
" game hunters.  Even though it fires the weak .22 round, it's perfectly "
"capable of killing."
msgstr ""
"La combinación de un retroceso insignificante, mucha personalización y "
"munición barata, hace del Ruger 10/22 una elección popular entre los "
"entusiastas y los cazadores de animales pequeños. Aunque dispara el débil "
"calibre .22, es perfectamente capaz de matar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ruger LCR .22"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCR .22"
msgstr[0] "Ruger LCR .22"
msgstr[1] "Ruger LCR .22"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG Mosquito"
msgid_plural "SIG Mosquito"
msgstr[0] "SIG Mosquito"
msgstr[1] "SIG Mosquito"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A popular, small .22 LR pistol.  One of the many polymer frame pistols "
"produced during the latter 20th-early 21st centuries; it has an underbarrel "
"rail."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola pequeña popular de calibre .22 LR. Una de las muchas pistolas de"
" armazón de polímero producidas durante los siglos 20 y 21; tiene un bajo "
"barril."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "S&W 22A"
msgid_plural "S&W 22A"
msgstr[0] "S&W 22A"
msgstr[1] "S&W 22A"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A popular .22 pistol."
msgstr "Una pistola popular de calibre .22"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Jennings J-22"
msgid_plural "Jennings J-22s"
msgstr[0] "Jennings J-22"
msgstr[1] "Jennings J-22s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the quintessential 'saturday night specials', the Jennings J-22 was "
"very affordably priced with its injection molded zinc slide and frame.  "
"Intended to fill the void left after small pocket pistols were banned from "
"import, these were more commonly used by criminals unfazed by their glaring "
"safety issues."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los \"especiales del sábado por la noche\" por excelencia, el "
"Jennings J-22 tenía un precio muy asequible con su tobogán y marco de zinc "
"moldeado por inyección. Con la intención de llenar el vacío dejado por las "
"pistolas de bolsillo prohibidas para la importación, estas fueron usadas más"
" comúnmente por criminales que no se preocupaban por sus evidentes problemas"
" de seguridad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Walther P22"
msgid_plural "Walther P22s"
msgstr[0] "Walther P22"
msgstr[1] "Walther P22s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Walther P22 is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol.  It is about "
"half the size of most Walthers.  It is made mostly with plastic, with the "
"slide and key components being made of die-cast zinc alloy"
msgstr ""
"La Walther P22 es una pistola semiautomática operada por retroceso. Es "
"aproximadamente la mitad del tamaño de la mayoría de los Walthers. Está "
"hecha principalmente de plástico, con la corredera y los componentes clave "
"hechos de aleación de zinc fundido a presión."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "NATO assault rifle"
msgid_plural "NATO assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de asalto OTAN"
msgstr[1] "rifles de asalto OTAN"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An assault rifle used by a NATO member state.  As per NATO's STANAG "
"agreement, it is chambered in 5.56x45mm."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de asalto utilizado por un estado miembro de la OTAN. Según el "
"acuerdo STANAG de la OTAN, su cámara es de 5,56x45mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington ACR"
msgid_plural "Remington ACRs"
msgstr[0] "Remington ACR"
msgstr[1] "Remington ACRs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This carbine was developed for military use in the early 21st century.  It "
"is damaging and accurate, though its rate of fire is a bit slower than "
"competing .223 carbines."
msgstr ""
"Esta carabina fue desarrollada para el uso militar a principios del siglo "
"XXI. Es precisa y causa mucho daño, aunque su velocidad de disparo es un "
"poco lenta comparándola con las carabinas .223."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "HK416 A5"
msgid_plural "HK416 A5s"
msgstr[0] "HK416 A5"
msgstr[1] "HK416 A5s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed to replace the M4A1, the Heckler and Koch 416A5 features most of "
"the former's strengths, while being considerably more durable."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado para reemplazar el M4A1, el Heckler and Koch 416A5 mantiene la "
"mayoría de las ventajas de su predecesor, y es considerablemente más "
"duradero."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M27 IAR"
msgid_plural "M27 IARs"
msgstr[0] "M27 IAR"
msgstr[1] "M27 IAR"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A H&K416 carbine outfitted with a heavier barrel to enable higher amounts of"
" suppressive fire while retaining a good degree of mobility."
msgstr ""
"Es la carabina H&K 416 equipada con un cañón más pesado, para permitir "
"mayores cantidades de disparo supresivo manteniendo un buen grado de "
"movilidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M4A1"
msgid_plural "M4A1s"
msgstr[0] "M4A1"
msgstr[1] "M4A1s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A popular carbine, long used by the US military.  Though accurate, small, "
"and lightweight, it is infamous for its unreliability when not properly "
"maintained."
msgstr ""
"Es una carabina popular, muy utilizada por el Ejército de Estados Unidos. "
"Aunque es precisa, pequeña y liviana, se la conoce por su falta de "
"fiabilidad si no se la mantiene en buenas condiciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M16A3"
msgid_plural "M16A3s"
msgstr[0] "M16A3"
msgstr[1] "M16A3s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M16 is a very common assault rifle descended from the AR-15, used by "
"militaries across the world for over 50 years.  It is a gas operated, "
"rotating bolt rifle known for its accuracy and controllable recoil.  This "
"one is a relatively rare M16A3, with full auto capability."
msgstr ""
"El M16 es un rifle de asalto muy común que desciende del AR-15, utilizado "
"por los militares de todo el mundo durante más de 50 años. Es un rifle de "
"cerrojo giratorio accionado por gas, conocido por su precisión y su "
"retroceso controlable. Este es un M16A3 relativamente raro, con capacidad de"
" funcionamiento totalmente automático."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "FN SCAR-L"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR-Ls"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR-L"
msgstr[1] "FN SCAR-L"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular assault rifle specially designed for the "
"United States Special Operations Command.  The 'L' in its name stands for "
"light, as it uses the lightweight .223 round."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de asalto modular y muy preciso, especialmente diseñado para el "
"Comando de Operaciones Especiales de Estados Unidos. La 'L' (light) en el "
"nombre significa liviana, porque utiliza la liviana bala .223."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M38 DMR"
msgid_plural "M38 DMRs"
msgstr[0] "M38 DMR"
msgstr[1] "M38 DMRs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M38 Designated Marksman Rifle is an M27 IAR, itself derived from a "
"H&K416, selected for accuracy, and outfitted with a variable power scope and"
" a QDSS suppressor."
msgstr ""
"El M38 Designated Marksman Rifle es un M27 IAR, derivado a su vez de un "
"H&K416, seleccionado por su precisión, y equipado con un visor de potencia "
"variable y un supresor QDSS."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MK 18 CQBR"
msgid_plural "MK 18 CQBRs"
msgstr[0] "MK 18 CQBR"
msgstr[1] "MK 18 CQBRs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a shorter M4 carbine with a 10.3 inch barrel, intended for confined "
"spaces and close quarters battle situations."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una carabina M4 más corta con un cañón de 10,3 pulgadas, pensada "
"para espacios reducidos y situaciones de combate cuerpo a cuerpo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AR-15"
msgid_plural "AR-15s"
msgstr[0] "AR-15"
msgstr[1] "AR-15s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This ubiquitous rifle is the forefather of M16 rifle series.  It is "
"lightweight and accurate, but will malfunction if not properly maintained.  "
"This one is a semi-automatic civilian version."
msgstr ""
"Este ubicuo rifle es el antepasado de la serie de rifles M16. Es ligero y "
"preciso, pero funcionará mal si no se le da el mantenimiento adecuado. Este "
"es una versión civil semiautomática."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AR pistol"
msgid_plural "AR pistols"
msgstr[0] "Pistola AR"
msgstr[1] "Pistolas AR"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A compact, 7.5 inch barrel version of the classic AR-15 design, commercially"
" marketed as a home defense weapon."
msgstr ""
"Una versión compacta con cañón de 7,5 pulgadas del diseño clásico del AR-15,"
" comercializada como arma de defensa doméstica."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MAS .223"
msgid_plural "MAS .223"
msgstr[0] "MAS .223"
msgstr[1] "MAS .223"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bullpup assault rifle that was used by French armed forces only until "
"recently.  While the FAMAS was famous for its high fire rate, the MAS .223 "
"is a semi-auto only variation imported to the US in the late eighties.  It "
"retains the integral bipod, though."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de asalto bullpup que fue utilizado por las fuerzas armadas "
"francesas sólo hasta hace poco. Mientras que el FAMAS era famoso por su alta"
" cadencia de fuego, el MAS .223 es una variante sólo semiautomática "
"importada a Estados Unidos a finales de los años ochenta. Sin embargo, "
"conserva el bípode integral."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "FS2000"
msgid_plural "FS2000s"
msgstr[0] "FS2000"
msgstr[1] "FS2000s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sleek bullpup carbine designed by FN Herstal, complete with an integrated "
"sight accessory rail.  The forward ejecting action and ambidextrous controls"
" make firing comfortable for both left and right-handed shooting.  The whole"
" rifle is well sealed from mud and dust for reliability, but this makes it "
"incompatible with many aftermarket magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una elegante carabina bullpup diseñada por FN Herstal, completa con un "
"carril para accesorios de mira integrado. La acción de expulsión hacia "
"delante y los controles ambidiestros hacen que el disparo sea cómodo tanto "
"para zurdos como para diestros. Todo el rifle está bien sellado contra el "
"barro y el polvo para mayor fiabilidad, pero esto lo hace incompatible con "
"muchos cargadores del mercado de accesorios."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "G36 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "G36 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de asalto G36"
msgstr[1] "rifles de asalto G36"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "An assault rifle chamber in 5.56x45mm and accepting G36 magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una rifle de asalto con camara de 5.56x45mm y que acepta cargadores G36."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K G36"
msgid_plural "H&K G36s"
msgstr[0] "H&K G36"
msgstr[1] "H&K G36s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed as a replacement for the early H&K G3 battle rifle, the G36 is more"
" accurate, and uses the much-lighter .223 round, allowing for a higher ammo "
"capacity."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado como reemplazo del rifle de combate H&K G3, el G36 es más preciso y"
" utiliza la bala .223 que es mucho más liviana, lo que le permite una mayor "
"capacidad para la munición."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M249"
msgid_plural "M249s"
msgstr[0] "M249"
msgstr[1] "M249s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M249 is a mountable machine gun used by the US military and SWAT teams."
"  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the M249 is designed to fire "
"many rounds very quickly."
msgstr ""
"La M249 es una ametralladora montable utilizada por el Ejército de Estados "
"Unidos y los equipos SWAT. Bastante poco precisa y difícil de controlar, la "
"M249 está diseñada para disparar rápidamente muchas balas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "burst"
msgstr "ráfaga"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M249S"
msgid_plural "M249Ss"
msgstr[0] "M249S"
msgstr[1] "M249Ss"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic civilian variant of the M249 machine gun, "
"manufactured for sport shooting and collectors market.  Notably, it retains "
"the ability to be belt fed, an uncommon feature in civilian firearms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una variante civil semiautomática de la ametralladora M249, "
"fabricada para el tiro deportivo y el mercado de coleccionistas. En "
"particular, conserva la capacidad de ser alimentada por el cinturón, una "
"característica poco común en las armas de fuego civiles."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "NATO burst rifle"
msgid_plural "NATO burst rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de ráfaga OTAN"
msgstr[1] "rifles de ráfaga OTAN"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An assault rifle used by a NATO member state.  Unlike other assault rifles, "
"this one does not have an auto-fire mode, and instead has a burst fire mode."
"  As per NATO's STANAG agreement, it is chambered in 5.56x45mm."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de asalto utilizado por un estado miembro de la OTAN. A diferencia "
"de otros fusiles de asalto, éste no tiene un modo de disparo automático, y "
"en su lugar tiene un modo de disparo en ráfaga. Según el acuerdo STANAG de "
"la OTAN, tiene una recámara de 5,56x45mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M16A4"
msgid_plural "M16A4s"
msgstr[0] "M16A4"
msgstr[1] "M16A4s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M16 is a very common assault rifle descended from the AR-15, used by "
"militaries across the world for over 50 years.  It is a gas operated, "
"rotating bolt rifle known for its accuracy and controllable recoil."
msgstr ""
"El M16 es un rifle de asalto muy común que desciende del AR-15, usado por "
"los militares de todo el mundo durante más de 50 años. Es un rifle de "
"cerrojo giratorio operado por gas, conocido por su precisión y control de "
"retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "3 rd."
msgstr "3 rd."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M231 Port Firing Weapon"
msgid_plural "M231 Port Firing Weapons"
msgstr[0] "Arma de Tiro con Puerto M231"
msgstr[1] "Armas de Tiro con Puerto M231"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M231 PFW is an adaptation of the M16 assault rifle, designed to be used "
"in the firing ports of the M2 Bradley Infantry Fighting Vehicle.  It does "
"not have a buttstock or front sight post, and the smooth front hand guard "
"makes it slighly less ergonomic.  It fires from an open bolt.  The fire "
"selector says only 'SAFE' and 'AUTO'.  You can't help but wonder which one "
"is preferable."
msgstr ""
"El M231 PFW es una adaptación del fusil de asalto M16, diseñado para ser "
"utilizado en las bocas de fuego del Vehículo de Combate de Infantería M2 "
"Bradley. No tiene culata ni punto de mira, y el guardamanos delantero liso "
"lo hace ligeramente menos ergonómico. Dispara con el cerrojo abierto. El "
"selector de tiro sólo dice \"SAFE\" y \"AUTO\". Uno no puede evitar "
"preguntarse cuál es preferible."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "OA-93"
msgid_plural "OA-93s"
msgstr[0] "OA-93"
msgstr[1] "OA-93s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An AR-15 derivative pistol manufactured by Olympic Arms in the nineties.  "
"The main difference compared to the AR-15 is that the recoil spring has been"
" moved to the top of the gun, circumventing the necessity for a solid "
"buttstock."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola derivada del AR-15 fabricada por Olympic Arms en los años "
"noventa. La principal diferencia con el AR-15 es que el muelle recuperador "
"se ha trasladado a la parte superior del arma, evitando la necesidad de una "
"culata sólida."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ruger Mini-14"
msgid_plural "Ruger Mini-14s"
msgstr[0] "Ruger Mini-14"
msgstr[1] "Ruger Mini-14"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, lightweight semi-auto carbine designed for civilian and police use."
"  Its superb accuracy and low recoil makes it more suitable than full-auto "
"rifles for some situations."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeña y ligera carabina semiautomática diseñada para uso civil y "
"policial. Su excelente precisión y bajo retroceso hace que sea más adecuada "
"que los rifles completamente automáticos para algunas situaciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "NATO assault rifle with burst"
msgid_plural "NATO assault rifles with burst"
msgstr[0] "rifle de asalto OTAN con ráfaga"
msgstr[1] "rifles de asalto OTAN con ráfaga"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An assault rifle used by a NATO member state.  Unlike other assault rifles, "
"this one has a burst fire mode in addition to semi-automatic and fully-"
"automatic modes.  As per NATO's STANAG agreement, it is chambered in "
"5.56x45mm."
msgstr ""
"Un fusil de asalto utilizado por un estado miembro de la OTAN. A diferencia "
"de otros fusiles de asalto, éste tiene un modo de disparo en ráfaga además "
"de los modos semiautomático y totalmente automático. Según el acuerdo STANAG"
" de la OTAN, tiene una recámara de 5,56x45mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG 552"
msgid_plural "SIG 552s"
msgstr[0] "SIG 552"
msgstr[1] "SIG 552"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A compact selective fire automatic rifle designed for the Swiss military.  "
"It features a three-round burst mode and an integrated folding stock."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle automático de fuego selectivo compacto diseñado para el ejército "
"suizo. Cuenta con un modo de ráfaga de tres balas y una culata plegable "
"integrada."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AUG assault rifle"
msgid_plural "AUG assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de asalto AUG"
msgstr[1] "rifles de asalto AUG"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "An assault rifle chambered in 5.56x45mm and accepting AUG magazines"
msgstr ""
"Una rifle de asalto con camara de 5.56x45mm y que acepta cargadores AUG."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Steyr AUG"
msgid_plural "Steyr AUGs"
msgstr[0] "Steyr AUG"
msgstr[1] "Steyr AUG"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Steyr AUG is an Austrian assault rifle that uses a bullpup design.  It "
"is used in the armed forces and police forces of many nations, and enjoys "
"low recoil and high accuracy."
msgstr ""
"El Steyr AUG es un rifle de asalto austríaco que utiliza el diseño bullpup. "
"Es usado por las fuerzas armadas y policiales de muchos países, y tiene poco"
" retroceso y mucha precisión."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington 700 .270 Win"
msgid_plural "Remington 700 .270 Win"
msgstr[0] "Remington 700 .270 Win"
msgstr[1] "Remington 700 .270 Win"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A classic bolt action rifle chambered for .270 Winchester, very popular "
"among hunters.  This is a CDL SF model with a forged, fluted, 416 stainless "
"steel barrel threaded into the receiver and a recessed bolt face.  It has "
"checkered walnut furniture and a recoil pad to reduce perceived recoil."
msgstr ""
"Un clásico rifle de cerrojo con cámara para Winchester .270, muy popular "
"entre los cazadores. Es un modelo CDL SF con un cañón de acero inoxidable "
"416 forjado y estriado, roscado en el cañón y con una cara del cerrojo "
"empotrada. Tiene muebles de nogal a cuadros y una almohadilla de retroceso "
"para reducir el retroceso percibido."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M2010 ESR"
msgid_plural "M2010 ESR"
msgstr[0] "M2010 ESR"
msgstr[1] "M2010 ESR"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bolt-action, box-magazine-fed, sniper rifle chambered in the powerful .300"
" Winchester Magnum round.  The M2010 had completely replaced the M24 rifle "
"series by 2017."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de francotirador de acción de bombeo y alimentado con cargador de "
"caja con la poderosa bala Winchester Magnum .300. El M2010 fue reemplazado "
"por la serie M24 en 2017."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Weatherby Mark V"
msgid_plural "Weatherby Mark V"
msgstr[0] "Weatherby Mark V"
msgstr[1] "Weatherby Mark V"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Weatherby Mark V is one of the finest bolt action rifles.  Designed in "
"1955 by Roy Weatherby and Fred Jennie, it has a strong action designed to "
"safely fire high-pressure cartridges.  These rifles were presented to "
"celebrities as part of a marketing campaign."
msgstr ""
"El Weatherby Mark V es uno de los mejores rifles de cerrojo. Diseñado en "
"1955 por Roy Weatherby y Fred Jennie, tiene un fuerte funcionamiento "
"diseñado para disparar con seguridad los cartuchos de alta presión. Estos "
"fusiles fueron presentados a celebridades como parte de una campaña de "
"marketing."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Winchester Model 70"
msgid_plural "Winchester Model 70"
msgstr[0] "Winchester Model 70"
msgstr[1] "Winchester Model 70"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Winchester Model 70 is a bolt action sporting rifle.  It has an iconic "
"place in American sporting culture and has been held in high regard by "
"shooters since it was introduced in 1936."
msgstr ""
"El Winchester Model 70 es un rifle de cerrojo para tiro deportivo. Ocupa un "
"lugar icónico en la cultura deportiva estadounidense, y ha sido tenida en "
"gran consideración por los tiradores desde que fue presentada en 1936."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Browning BLR"
msgid_plural "Browning BLR"
msgstr[0] "Browning BLR"
msgstr[1] "Browning BLR"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A highly accurate lever-action hunting rifle chambered for the powerful "
".30-06 round.  Notable for using a detachable magazine instead of a "
"traditional tube."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de caza de acción de palanca, con muy buena precisión y calibre "
"para la poderosa .30-06. Conocido por utilizar un cargador extraíble en "
"lugar de la tradicional cámara."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1 Garand"
msgid_plural "M1 Garands"
msgstr[0] "M1 Garand"
msgstr[1] "M1 Garand"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic .30-06 battle rifle, developed to replace the M1903 "
"Springfield.  It didn't completely supplant the older bolt-action until "
"after World War II."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de combate semiautomático de calibre .30-06, desarrollado para "
"reemplazar el M1903 Springfield. No llegó a reemplazarlo completamente hasta"
" después de la Segunda Guerra Mundial."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1903 Springfield"
msgid_plural "M1903 Springfields"
msgstr[0] "M1903 Springfield"
msgstr[1] "M1903 Springfield"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful military rifle chambered in .30-06, developed to replace the US "
"Army's older Krag rifle.  Served as the main American rifle in World War I, "
"was used alongside the M1 Garand in World War II, and was used as a sniper "
"rifle as late as the Vietnam War."
msgstr ""
"Un poderoso rifle militar calibre .30-06, desarrollado para reemplazar el "
"viejo rifle Krag del ejército de Estados Unidos. Fue el arma principal de "
"los estadounidenses durante la Primera Guerra Mundial, fue usado junto al M1"
" Garand durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial, y llegó a ser usado como rifle de"
" francotirador incluso en la guerra de Vietnam."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Browning Automatic Rifle"
msgid_plural "Browning Automatic Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Rifle Automático Browning"
msgstr[1] "Rifles Automáticos Browning"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed near the end of World War I, the BAR provided fire support for the "
"US Army from World War II all the way to the Vietnam War.  Too much "
"firepower to serve as a battle rifle, but not enough to be an ideal light "
"machine gun, it still found a niche on the battlefield."
msgstr ""
"Diseñado a fines de la Primera Guerra Mundial, el BAR (por sus siglas en "
"inglés) brindó apoyo al ejército de Estados Unidos desde la Segunda Guerra "
"Mundial hasta la guerra de Vietnam. Posee demasiada potencia como para ser "
"un rifle de combate, pero no la suficiente para ser una ametralladora "
"liviana ideal. De todas maneras, tiene su funcionalidad en el campo de "
"batalla."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington 700 .30-06"
msgid_plural "Remington 700 .30-06"
msgstr[0] "Remington 700 .30-06"
msgstr[1] "Remington 700 .30-06"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A very popular and durable hunting or sniping rifle.  Popular among SWAT and"
" US Marine snipers.  Highly damaging, but perhaps not as accurate as the "
"competing Browning BLR."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de caza o francotirador muy popular y duradero. Popular entre los "
"francotiradores de SWAT y de la Marina de Estados Unidos. Causa mucho daño, "
"pero tal vez no sea tan preciso como su competidor, el Browning BLR."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington ACR .300BLK"
msgid_plural "Remington ACR .300BLKs"
msgstr[0] "Remington ACR .300BLK"
msgstr[1] "Remington ACR .300BLKs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This carbine was developed for military use in the early 21st century.  It "
"is damaging and accurate, though its rate of fire is a bit slower than "
"competing carbines.  This version is chambered for the .300 AAC Blackout "
"round."
msgstr ""
"Esta carabina fue desarrollada para uso militar a principios del siglo XXI. "
"Es dañina y precisa, aunque su velocidad de disparo es un poco más lenta que"
" la de las carabinas de la competencia. Esta versión está preparada para la "
"ronda de .300 AAC Blackout round."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK"
msgid_plural "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLKs"
msgstr[0] "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLK"
msgstr[1] "IWI Tavor X95 .300BLKs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The IWI Tavor X95 (also called Micro-Tavor or MTAR) is an Israeli bullpup "
"assault rifle designed and produced by Israel Weapon Industries.  This is "
"the civilian version chambered for .300 AAC Blackout."
msgstr ""
"El IWI Tavor X95 (también llamado Micro-Tavor o MTAR) es un rifle de asalto "
"israelí diseñado y producido por Israel Weapon Industries. Esta es la "
"versión civil con cámara para un .300 AAC Blackout."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG MCX Rattler SBR"
msgid_plural "SIG MCX Rattler SBRs"
msgstr[0] "SIG MCX Rattler SBR"
msgstr[1] "SIG MCX Rattler SBRs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a short-barreled, gas operated rifle, with a 5.5 inch barrel, built-"
"in thin folding stock, and full rail mount on the upper receiver.  This "
"particular one is a select-fire military version."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un rifle de cañón corto, accionado por gas, con un cañón de 5,5 "
"pulgadas, con una culata plegable incorporada y un montaje de riel completo "
"en el receptor superior. Esta en particular es una versión militar de fuego "
"seleccionable."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "FN FAL"
msgid_plural "FN FAL"
msgstr[0] "FN FAL"
msgstr[1] "FN FAL"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Originally designed during the Cold War, the FN FAL is probably the most "
"successful battle rifle ever designed.  Even though often labeled as "
"obsolete, its high rate of fire and powerful ammunition make it perfectly "
"capable of holding its ground against modern competitors."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente diseñado durante la Guerra Fría, el FN FAL probablemente sea "
"el rifle de combate más exitoso que se haya diseñado. Incluso aunque a veces"
" se lo tilda de obsoleto, su alta velocidad de disparo y munición poderosa "
"lo hacen perfectamente capaz de mantenerse entre los competidores modernos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K G3"
msgid_plural "H&K G3"
msgstr[0] "H&K G3"
msgstr[1] "H&K G3"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An early battle rifle developed after the end of WWII.  The G3 is designed "
"to unload large amounts of deadly ammunition, but it is less suitable over "
"long ranges."
msgstr ""
"Es un viejo rifle que fue desarrollado a fines de la Segunda Guerra Mundial."
" El G3 está diseñado para descargar cantidades de munición mortal, pero es "
"poco fiable a grandes distancias."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M134D-H Minigun"
msgid_plural "M134D-H Miniguns"
msgstr[0] "Minigun M134D-H"
msgstr[1] "Minigun M134D-H"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M134D-H Minigun is a (relatively) lightweight heavy rotary machine gun."
"  Its six barrels are rotated by an electric motor, powered by UPS or "
"vehicle.  If you could find enough ammo for it, it would become a "
"devastating weapon.  It must be mounted on a vehicle before use."
msgstr ""
"El Minigun M134D-H es una ametralladora rotativa (relativamente) ligera y "
"pesada. Sus seis cañones giran con un motor eléctrico, impulsado por un SAI "
"o un vehículo. Si pudieras encontrar suficiente munición para ella, se "
"convertiría en un arma devastadora. Debe ser montada en un vehículo antes de"
" su uso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "low auto"
msgstr "bajo auto"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "high auto"
msgstr "alto auto"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M14 EBR-RI"
msgid_plural "M14 EBR-RI"
msgstr[0] "M14 EBR-RI"
msgstr[1] "M14 EBR-RI"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A highly modified version of the M14 rifle designed to cover both CQB and "
"designated marksman roles.  A very powerful and versatile rifle, if somewhat"
" heavy."
msgstr ""
"Una versión modificada del rifle M14, diseñado para cubrir tanto el combate "
"cercano como lejano. Un rifle muy poderoso y versátil, aunque un poco "
"pesado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1A"
msgid_plural "M1A"
msgstr[0] "M1A"
msgstr[1] "M1As"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The child of the M1 Garand World War 2 rifle, the M1A is a semi-automatic "
"variant of the M14, favored for its accuracy and modular use."
msgstr ""
"Es el descendiente del M1 Garand de la Segunda Guerra Mundial. El M1A es una"
" variante semiautomática del M14, reconocido por su precisión y uso modular."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M240"
msgid_plural "M240s"
msgstr[0] "M240"
msgstr[1] "M240"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M240 is a medium machine gun used by the US military, replacing the "
"older M60.  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the M240 is designed "
"to fire many rounds very quickly."
msgstr ""
"La M240 es una ametralladora mediana utilizada por el Ejército de Estados "
"Unidos, y reemplaza la vieja M60. Bastante poco precisa y difícil de "
"controlar, la M240 está diseñada para disparar rápidamente muchas balas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M60"
msgid_plural "M60s"
msgstr[0] "M60"
msgstr[1] "M60s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M60 is a general-purpose machine gun developed to replace the "
".30-caliber M1918 and M1919.  Heavy and difficult to handle fired from the "
"shoulder, as most people aren't action-movie heroes."
msgstr ""
"La M60 es una ametralladora de varios usos, desarrollada para reemplazar la "
"M1918 y M1919 de calibre .30. Pesada y difícil de controlar aguantándola con"
" el hombro, ya que casi nadie es un héroe de película de acción."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M60 Semi Auto"
msgid_plural "M60 Semi Autos"
msgstr[0] "M60 Semi Auto"
msgstr[1] "M60 Semi Autos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic civilian variant of the M60 machine gun, retaining "
"the ability to be belt fed, an uncommon feature in civilian firearms."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una variante civil semiautomática de la ametralladora M60, que "
"conserva la capacidad de ser alimentada por el cinturón, una característica "
"poco común en las armas de fuego civiles."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Savage 111F"
msgid_plural "Savage 111F"
msgstr[0] "Savage 111F"
msgstr[1] "Savage 111F"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A very accurate rifle chambered for the powerful .308 round.  Its very low "
"ammo capacity is offset by its accuracy and near-complete lack of recoil."
msgstr ""
"Es un rifle muy preciso con el poderoso calibre .308. El precio que hay que "
"pagar por su precisión y casi ausencia de retroceso es su capacidad muy "
"limitada para la munición."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "FN SCAR-H"
msgid_plural "FN SCAR-H"
msgstr[0] "FN SCAR-H"
msgstr[1] "FN SCAR-H"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A highly accurate and modular battle rifle specially designed for the United"
" States Special Operations Command.  The 'H' in its name stands for heavy, "
"as it uses the powerful .308 round."
msgstr ""
"Es un rifle de combate modular y muy preciso, especialmente diseñado para el"
" Comando de Operaciones Especiales de Estados Unidos. La 'H' en el nombre "
"significa pesado (heavy), porque utiliza la poderosa bala .308."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M24"
msgid_plural "M24"
msgstr[0] "M24"
msgstr[1] "M24"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M24 Sniper is the military and police version of the Remington Model 700"
" rifle, M24 being the model name assigned by the United States Army after "
"adoption as their standard sniper rifle in 1988.  The M24 is referred to as "
"a 'weapon system' because it consists of not only a rifle, but also a "
"detachable telescopic sight and other accessories."
msgstr ""
"El francotirador M24 es la versión militar y policial del rifle Remington "
"Modelo 700, siendo M24 el nombre del modelo asignado por el Ejército de los "
"Estados Unidos tras su adopción como su rifle de francotirador estándar en "
"1988. El M24 se denomina \"sistema de armas\" porque no sólo consiste en un "
"rifle, sino también en una mira telescópica desmontable y otros accesorios."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "HK417 A2"
msgid_plural "HK417 A2s"
msgstr[0] "HK417 A2"
msgstr[1] "HK417 A2s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A German battle rifle with a 13\" barrel and telescopic stock.  It is a gas "
"operated, rotating bolt rifle with a short-stroke piston design similar to "
"that of the G36."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de batalla alemán con un cañón de 13\" y un telescopio. Es un rifle"
" de cerrojo giratorio operado por gas con un diseño de pistón de carrera "
"corta similar al del G36."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M110A1"
msgid_plural "M110A1s"
msgstr[0] "M110A1"
msgstr[1] "M110A1s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A derivative of H&K's G28 with an aluminum upper receiver to meet US Army "
"weight requirements.  It is a gas operated, rotating bolt rifle accurate to "
"1.5 MOA with standard ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Un derivado del G28 de H&K con un receptor superior de aluminio para cumplir"
" con los requisitos de peso del ejército de EE.UU. Es un rifle de cerrojo "
"giratorio operado por gas con una precisión de 1,5 MOA con munición "
"estándar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AR-10"
msgid_plural "AR-10s"
msgstr[0] "AR-10"
msgstr[1] "AR-10s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Somewhat similar to the later AR-15, the AR-10 is a gas operated, rotating "
"bolt rifle chambered for 7.62x51mm rounds."
msgstr ""
"Algo similar al posterior AR-15, el AR-10 es un rifle de cerrojo giratorio "
"operado por gas con cámara para balas de 7,62x51 mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG Sauer P230"
msgid_plural "SIG Sauer P230"
msgstr[0] "SIG Sauer P230"
msgstr[1] "SIG Sauer P230"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The SIG Sauer P230 is a small, semi-automatic handgun chambered in .32 ACP."
"  Due to its small dimensions, it was often carried as a backup weapon."
msgstr ""
"La SIG Sauer P320 es una pistola pequeña semi-automática con calibre .32 "
"ACP. Debido a su pequeño tamaño, a menudo se la lleva como arma de apoyo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Skorpion Vz. 61"
msgid_plural "Skorpion Vz. 61s"
msgstr[0] "Skorpion Vz. 61"
msgstr[1] "Skorpion Vz. 61"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Skorpion Vz. 61 is a Czechoslovak submachine gun from the 1950s, "
"chambered in .32 ACP."
msgstr ""
"La Skorpion Vz. 61 es un subfusil checoslovaco de los años 50, de calibre "
".32 ACP."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Walther PPK"
msgid_plural "Walther PPK"
msgstr[0] "Walther PPK"
msgstr[1] "Walther PPK"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the most famous handguns of the 20th century.  Your name is not Bond,"
" but you might find this little gun still useful."
msgstr ""
"Es una de las pistolas más famosas del siglo XX. Tu nombre no es Bond, pero "
"igual vas a encontrarle utilidad a esta pequeña pistola."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Kel-Tec P32"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec P32s"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec P32"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec P32s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of Kel-tec's oldest designs, the P32 is a popular option for deep "
"concealment and backup usage.  Despite its extreme light weight and small "
"size, its .32 ACP chambering makes for good handling and recoil control."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los diseños más antiguos de Kel-tec, el P32 es una opción popular "
"para el ocultamiento profundo y el uso de respaldo. A pesar de su peso "
"extremadamente ligero y su pequeño tamaño, su cámara de .32 ACP permite un "
"buen manejo y control de retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG P226"
msgid_plural "SIG P226s"
msgstr[0] "SIG P226"
msgstr[1] "SIG P226s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A SIG Sauer P226 chambered for .357 SIG.  The P226 is a DA/SA, short-recoil "
"operated semi-automatic pistol."
msgstr ""
"Es una SIG Sauer P226 calibre .357 SIG. La P226 es una DA/SA, una pistola "
"semiautomática con poco retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 31"
msgid_plural "Glock 31s"
msgstr[0] "Glock 31"
msgstr[1] "Glock 31s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full size .357 SIG Glock pistol.  It is extremely similar to the Glock 22,"
" and could be converted to fire .40 S&W by switching the barrel."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola Glock .357 SIG de tamaño completo. Es extremadamente similar a "
"la Glock 22, y podría ser convertida en una pistola de .40 S&W cambiando el "
"cañón."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG P320 Compact"
msgid_plural "SIG P320 Compacts"
msgstr[0] "SIG P320 Compact"
msgstr[1] "SIG P320 Compacts"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The P320 Compact is a semi-automatic, short recoil operated pistol.  This "
"one is chambered for .357 SIG."
msgstr ""
"La P320 Compact es una pistola semiautomática de retroceso corto. Esta tiene"
" recámara para .357 SIG."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Colt M1861 Navy"
msgid_plural "Colt M1861 Navy"
msgstr[0] "Colt M1861 Navy"
msgstr[1] "Colt M1861 Navy"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Colt Model 1861 Navy cap & ball .36-caliber revolver was a six-shot, "
"single-action percussion weapon produced by Colt's Manufacturing Company "
"from 1861 until 1873."
msgstr ""
"El Colt Model 1861 Navy, revólver de llave de percusión, calibre .36, era un"
" arma de percusión de una sola acción, con seis disparos, producida por "
"Colt's Manufacturing Company desde 1861 hasta 1873."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "2 Shot Special"
msgid_plural "2 Shot Specials"
msgstr[0] "2 Tiros Especial"
msgstr[1] "2 Tiros Especial"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crudely made double barrel pistol firing 38 special ammo.  Unfortunately, "
"the name is less about the double barrels and more about the number of shots"
" you'll get before it breaks down on you."
msgstr ""
"Es una pistola de doble cañón hecha toscamente, que dispara munición "
"especial .38. Lamentablemente, el nombre tiene que ver más con el número de "
"disparos que podrás hacer."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "COP .357 Derringer"
msgid_plural "COP .357 Derringers"
msgstr[0] "COP .357 Derringer"
msgstr[1] "COP .357 Derringers"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small, chubby derringer pistol bearing a slight resemblance to the "
"Mossberg Brownie.  It uses a rotating firing pin to fire the individual "
"hammers of the four barrels arranged in a square formation."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña y regordeta pistola Derringer con un ligero parecido a la "
"Brownie de Mossberg. Utiliza un percutor giratorio para disparar los "
"martillos individuales de los cuatro barriles dispuestos en una formación "
"cuadrada."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "S&W Model 10"
msgid_plural "S&W Model 10"
msgstr[0] "S&W Model 10"
msgstr[1] "S&W Model 10"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A six-shot revolver, produced since 1899 and known as the most popular "
"handgun of the 20th century.  It has a swing-out cylinder for ease of "
"reloading."
msgstr ""
"Un revólver de seis disparos, producido desde 1899 y conocido como el arma "
"de mano más popular del siglo XX. Tiene un cilindro giratorio para facilitar"
" su recarga."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe rifle: .38 Special"
msgid_plural "pipe rifles: .38 Special"
msgstr[0] "rifle de tubo: .38 Especial"
msgstr[1] "rifles de tubo: .38 Especial"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ruger LCR .38"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCR .38"
msgstr[0] "Ruger LCR .38"
msgstr[1] "Ruger LCR .38"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A compact, double-action-only revolver designed for easy concealment, with a"
" stainless steel cylinder and aluminum frame."
msgstr ""
"Es un revólver compacto de doble acción, diseñado para ser fácil de ocultar,"
" con cilindro de acero inoxidable y estructura de aluminio."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "S&W 619"
msgid_plural "S&W 619"
msgstr[0] "S&W 619"
msgstr[1] "S&W 619"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A seven-round .38 revolver sold by Smith & Wesson.  It features a fixed rear"
" sight and a reinforced frame."
msgstr ""
"Un revólver de siete disparos calibre .38, vendida por Smith & Wesson. Posee"
" una mira trasera fija y una estructura reforzada."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MAC-11"
msgid_plural "MAC-11s"
msgstr[0] "MAC-11"
msgstr[1] "MAC-11s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A lesser known variant of the MAC-10, this machine pistol is chambered in "
".380 ACP for a smaller overall size while remaining inherently subsonic.  "
"Smaller in almost every dimension, this inexpensive automatic weapon was "
"declared 'fit only for combat in a phone booth' due to its low weight and "
"absurd fire rate ranging from 1200 to 1400 rounds per minute."
msgstr ""
"Una variante menos conocida de la MAC-10, esta pistola de máquina está "
"alojada en una cámara de .380 ACP para un tamaño general más pequeño, "
"mientras que sigue siendo inherentemente subsónica. Más pequeña en casi "
"todas las dimensiones, esta arma automática barata fue declarada \"apta sólo"
" para el combate en una cabina telefónica\" debido a su bajo peso y a su "
"absurda velocidad de disparo que va de 1200 a 1400 disparos por minuto."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Kel-Tec P3AT"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec P3ATs"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec P3AT"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec P3ATs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Essentially a slightly scaled up Kel-tec P32 in .380 ACP, the ever popular "
"P3AT offers better ballistics in a small, concealable lightweight package.  "
"Handling leaves something to be desired due to snappier recoil and "
"diminutive controls."
msgstr ""
"Esencialmente una Kel-tec P32 ligeramente escalada en .380 ACP, la siempre "
"popular P3AT ofrece una mejor balística en un paquete pequeño y ligero que "
"se puede ocultar. El manejo deja algo que desear debido a un retroceso más "
"rápido y a unos controles más reducidos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "FN 1910 .380"
msgid_plural "FN 1910 .380s"
msgstr[0] "FN 1910 .380"
msgstr[1] "FN 1910 .380s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Made infamous in Sarajevo in 1914, the FN1910 was a popular pocket pistol, "
"albeit in .32 ACP.  Collectors value the .380 model for its notoriety and "
"more modern terminal performance.  If such a humble firearm could start a "
"world war, could it perhaps protect you from the undead?"
msgstr ""
"Hecha infame en Sarajevo en 1914, la FN1910 era una popular pistola de "
"bolsillo, aunque en .32 ACP. Los coleccionistas valoran el modelo .380 por "
"su notoriedad y su rendimiento terminal más moderno. Si un arma de fuego tan"
" humilde pudiera iniciar una guerra mundial, ¿podría quizás protegerte de "
"los no-muertos?"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ruger LCP"
msgid_plural "Ruger LCPs"
msgstr[0] "Ruger LCP"
msgstr[1] "Ruger LCPs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the best-selling modern day 'pocket pistol's, the LCP is an "
"affordable, polymer framed pistol chambered in .380 ACP.  Despite the "
"round's relatively low power, the pistol's low weight and short sight radius"
" make for a moderately poor handling pistol."
msgstr ""
"Una de las pistolas de bolsillo más vendidas en la actualidad, la LCP es una"
" pistola de marco polimérico asequible, con una cámara de .380 ACP. A pesar "
"de la potencia relativamente baja del cartucho, el bajo peso de la pistola y"
" su corto radio de visión hacen que sea una pistola de manejo moderadamente "
"pobre."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Hi-Point CF-380"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point CF-380s"
msgstr[0] "Hi-Point CF-380"
msgstr[1] "Hi-Point CF-380s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Hi-Point CF-380 is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol designed by"
" Hi-Point Firearms, which is known for making inexpensive firearms, and for "
"making said firearms bulky and uncomfortable.  Hi-Points have slides made "
"with a zinc pot-metal which is relatively fragile compared to steel slides."
msgstr ""
"La Hi-Point CF-380 es una pistola semiautomática operada por retroceso "
"diseñada por Hi-Point Firearms, conocida por fabricar armas de fuego baratas"
" y por hacer dichas armas voluminosas e incómodas. Las Hi-Point tienen "
"correderas hechas con una aleación de zinc que es relativamente frágil "
"comparada con las correderas de acero."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Taurus Spectrum"
msgid_plural "Taurus Spectrum"
msgstr[0] "Taurus Spectrum"
msgstr[1] "Taurus Spectrum"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A .380 subcompact pistol.  Designed for concealed carry and built from high-"
"quality, durable materials."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola subcompacta del calibre 380. Diseñada para llevarla oculta y "
"construida con materiales de alta calidad y durabilidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AF2011A1 .38 Super"
msgid_plural "AF2011A1 .38 Super"
msgstr[0] "AF2011A1 .38 Super"
msgstr[1] "AF2011A1 .38 Super"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A double-barrel semi-automatic pistol of Italian origin, firing two bullets "
"per shot, a derivative of the M1911 pistol."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola semiautomática de doble cañón de origen italiano, que dispara "
"dos balas por disparo, un derivado de la pistola M1911."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1911A1"
msgid_plural "M1911A1s"
msgstr[0] "M1911A1"
msgstr[1] "M1911A1s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M1911A1 is an extremely popular pistol known for its reliability.  This "
"one is chambered for .38 Super."
msgstr ""
"La M1911A1 es una pistola extremadamente popular conocida por su fiabilidad."
" Esta tiene una cámara para el .38 Super."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Beretta 90-two .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Beretta 90-two .40 S&Ws"
msgstr[0] "Beretta 90-two .40 S&W"
msgstr[1] "Beretta 90-two .40 S&Ws"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A more modern version of Beretta's popular 92 series of handguns, the 90-two"
" performs largely the same.  The main difference is a sleeker, almost "
"futuristic-looking design owed in large parts to the polymer underbarrel "
"rail cover.  This one is chambered in .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"Una versión más moderna de la popular serie de pistolas 92 de Beretta, la "
"90-two tiene prácticamente el mismo rendimiento. La principal diferencia es "
"un diseño más elegante, casi futurista, debido en gran parte a la cubierta "
"de polímero bajo el cañón. Este modelo tiene la recámara en .40 S&W."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 22"
msgid_plural "Glock 22"
msgstr[0] "Glock 22"
msgstr[1] "Glock 22"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A .40 S&W variant of the popular Glock 17 pistol.  The standard-issue "
"firearm of the FBI and of countless other law enforcement agencies "
"worldwide."
msgstr ""
"Una variante .40 S&W de la popular pistola Glock 17. Es el arma de mano "
"estándar del FBI y de otras innumerables agencias en todo el mundo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&Ws"
msgstr[0] "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&W"
msgstr[1] "Beretta Px4 Storm .40 S&Ws"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lighter than Beretta's iconic 92 series of guns, the Px4 Storm was built by "
"utilizing light-weight polymer construction with steel inserts.  Its shape "
"was also optimized for concealed carry.  This one is chambered in .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"Más ligera que la icónica serie de pistolas 92 de Beretta, la Px4 Storm se "
"construyó utilizando una estructura de polímero ligero con inserciones de "
"acero. Su forma también fue optimizada para el porte oculto. Esta pistola "
"tiene recámara en .40 S&W."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe rifle: .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "pipe rifles: .40 S&W"
msgstr[0] "rifle de tubo: .40 S&W"
msgstr[1] "rifles de tubo: .40 S&W"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG Pro .40"
msgid_plural "SIG Pro .40"
msgstr[0] "SIG Pro .40"
msgstr[1] "SIG Pro .40"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Originally marketed as a lightweight and compact alternative to older SIG "
"handguns, the Pro .40 is popular among European police forces."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente pensada para el mercado de las compactas ligeras como "
"alternativa a las viejas pistolas SIG, la Pro .40 es popular entre las "
"fuerzas policiales europeas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Luty SMG: .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Luty SMGs: .40 S&W"
msgstr[0] "Luty SMG: .40 S&W"
msgstr[1] "Luty SMGs: .40 S&W"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Luty pattern makeshift smoothbore SMG crudely constructed out of various "
"steel parts using some of the more advanced powered hand tools; likely one "
"of the most complex guns that are feasible to make outside of a machine "
"shop, but still very unreliable.  This one is chambered for .40 S&W "
"cartridges and accepts custom-made makeshift magazines."
msgstr ""
"Un patrón de Luty hace que el SMG de cañón liso sea construido crudamente "
"con varias piezas de acero usando algunas de las herramientas manuales más "
"avanzadas; probablemente una de las armas más complejas que son factibles de"
" hacer fuera de un taller de máquinas, pero aún así muy poco fiable. Esta "
"tiene una cámara para cartuchos de .40 S&W y acepta cargadores improvisados "
"hechos a medida."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "handmade six-shooter"
msgid_plural "handmade six-shooters"
msgstr[0] "seis disparos hecho a mano"
msgstr[1] "seis disparos hechos a mano"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A homemade 6-shot revolver.  While it's not as good as the pre-Cataclysm "
"manufactured weapons, it's a decent piece of work, all things considered."
msgstr ""
"Es un revólver de 6 disparos hecho en casa. Aunque no es tan buena como las "
"armas fabricadas antes del Cataclismo, es una pieza decente considerando la "
"situación."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&Ws"
msgstr[0] "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&W"
msgstr[1] "Browning Hi-Power .40 S&Ws"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Browning Hi-Power is a semi-automatic handgun developed shortly before "
"the second world war.  Widely issued since then, it remains in use by India,"
" Canada and Australia.  This is a commercial variant produced by Browning "
"Arms in .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"El Browning Hi-Power es una pistola semiautomática desarrollada poco antes "
"de la segunda guerra mundial. Ampliamente emitida desde entonces, sigue "
"siendo utilizada por la India, Canadá y Australia. Esta es una variante "
"comercial producida por Browning Arms en .40 S&W."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Walther PPQ .40 S&W"
msgid_plural "Walther PPQ .40 S&Ws"
msgstr[0] "Walther PPQ .40 S&W"
msgstr[1] "Walther PPQ .40 S&Ws"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Walther PPQ is a semi-automatic pistol originating from the Walther "
"P99QA, and maintains compatibility with some of its predecessor's "
"accessories.  This model is chambered in .40 S&W."
msgstr ""
"La Walther PPQ es una pistola semiautomática originada en la Walther P99QA, "
"y mantiene la compatibilidad con algunos de los accesorios de su "
"predecesora. Este modelo está alojado en una cámara de .40 S&W."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Hi-Point Model JCP"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point Model JCPs"
msgstr[0] "Hi-Point Model JCP"
msgstr[1] "Hi-Point Model JCPs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Hi-Point Model JCP is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol designed"
" by Hi-Point Firearms, which is known for making inexpensive firearms, and "
"for making said firearms bulky and uncomfortable.  Hi-Points have slides "
"made with a zinc pot-metal which is relatively fragile compared to steel "
"slides."
msgstr ""
"El modelo Hi-Point JCP es una pistola semiautomática operada por retroceso "
"diseñada por Hi-Point Firearms, que es conocida por hacer armas de fuego "
"baratas, y por hacer dichas armas de fuego voluminosas e incómodas. Las Hi-"
"Point tienen correderas hechas con correderas de zinc que es relativamente "
"frágil en comparación con las correderas de acero."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "tube 40mm launcher"
msgid_plural "tube 40mm launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de tubo de 40mm"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de tubo de 40mm"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple, home-made grenade launcher.  Basically a tube with a pin firing "
"mechanism to activate the grenade."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzagranadas simple, hecho en casa. Básicamente, es un tubo con un "
"mecanismo para activar las granadas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M320 standalone launcher"
msgid_plural "M320 standalone launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador independiente M320"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores independientes M320"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Heckler & Koch's M320 grenade launcher offers the functionality of larger "
"launchers in a very small package at the cost of decreased accuracy.  This "
"one is combined with a buttstock for standalone operation."
msgstr ""
"El lanzagranadas M320 de Heckler & Koch ofrece la funcionalidad de los "
"lanzadores más grandes en un paquete muy pequeño a costa de una menor "
"precisión. Este se combina con un culatazo para operar de forma "
"independiente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M79 launcher"
msgid_plural "M79 launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador M79"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores M79"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A widely-used grenade launcher that first saw use by American forces in the "
"Vietnam War.  Though mostly replaced by more modern launchers, the M79 still"
" sees use with many units worldwide."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzagranadas muy usado que fue utilizado por primera vez por las fuerzas"
" americanas en la guerra de Vietnam. Aunque fue reemplazado en su mayoría "
"por lanzadores más modernos, el M79 todavía se usa con muchas unidades en "
"todo el mundo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Milkor MGL"
msgid_plural "Milkor MGL"
msgstr[0] "Milkor MGL"
msgstr[1] "Milkor MGL"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Milkor Multi-Grenade Launcher is designed to compensate for the drawback"
" of single-shot grenade launchers by allowing sustained heavy firepower.  "
"However, it is still slow to reload and must be used with careful planning."
msgstr ""
"El Multi-Lanzagranadas Milkor está diseñado para compensar la desventaja de "
"los lanzagranadas de un solo disparo, permitiendo poder de fuego sostenido. "
"Sin embargo, sigue siendo lento para recargar y debe ser usado con una buena"
" planificación previa."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM802 grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "RM802 grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranadas RM802"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas RM802"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Rivtech RM802 pump-action 40mm grenade launcher was designed to be a "
"step ahead of single-shot grenade launchers by allowing sustained heavy "
"firepower.  However, its capacity is fairly limited so it must be used with "
"careful planning."
msgstr ""
"El lanzagranadas de 40mm de acción de bombeo Rivtech RM802, fue diseñado "
"para ser un avance en los lanzagranadas de un solo disparo, permitiendo "
"poder de fuego sostenido. Sin embargo, su capacidad es bastante limitada así"
" que debe ser usado con una buena planificación previa."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "triple-barrel 40mm launcher"
msgid_plural "triple-barrel 40mm launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador 40mm de triple cañón"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores 40mm de triple cañón"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A homemade triple-barrel 40mm grenade launcher.  Capable of launching all "
"three grenades at once, it is extremely powerful for a homemade weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es un lanzador de granadas de 40mm con triple tubo, hecho en casa. Es capaz "
"de lanzar tres granadas a la vez, y es extremadamente poderosa para ser un "
"arma casera."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "multi"
msgstr "multi"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M203 array"
msgid_plural "M203 arrays"
msgstr[0] "conjunto de M203"
msgstr[1] "conjuntos de M203"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An array of six M203 grenade launchers for use on the TALON UGV platform."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de seis lanzagranadas M203 para su uso en la plataforma del "
"TALON UGV."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mark 19 grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "Mark 19 grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranadas Mark 19"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas Mark 19"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy, tripod-mounted belt-fed grenade launcher used by the US Military "
"since the start of the Cold War all the way to the cataclysm, and if you can"
" find some 40mm grenades, maybe even beyond."
msgstr ""
"Un pesado lanzagranadas de cinturón montado en un trípode usado por el "
"ejército de EE.UU. desde el comienzo de la Guerra Fría hasta el cataclismo, "
"y si puedes encontrar algunas granadas de 40 mm, tal vez incluso más allá."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Saiga-410"
msgid_plural "Saiga-410s"
msgstr[0] "Saiga-410"
msgstr[1] "Saiga-410s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Saiga-410 is a semi-automatic shotgun designed on the same Kalashnikov "
"pattern as the AK47 rifle.  It reloads with a magazine, rather than one "
"shell at a time like most shotguns."
msgstr ""
"El Saiga-410 es una escopeta semiautomática diseñada con el mismo patrón de "
"Kalashnikov que el rifle AK47. Se recarga con un cargador, en lugar de un "
"cartucho a la vez como la mayoría de las escopetas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Winchester M37 .410"
msgid_plural "Winchester M37 .410s"
msgstr[0] "Winchester M37 .410"
msgstr[1] "Winchester M37 .410s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single-shot break-action shotgun, chambered in .410 bore.  Designed as a "
"lower-recoil alternative to 12 gauge shotguns, it is light and easy to "
"manufacture."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta de un solo tiro, con un calibre de .410. Diseñada como una "
"alternativa de bajo retroceso a las escopetas de calibre 12, es ligera y "
"fácil de fabricar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Desert Eagle .44"
msgid_plural "Desert Eagle .44"
msgstr[0] "Desert Eagle .44"
msgstr[1] "Desert Eagle .44"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the most recognizable handguns due to its popularity in movies and "
"video games, the Desert Eagle is better known for its menacing appearance "
"than its performance.  It's a large pistol, but its heavy weight reduces "
"recoil."
msgstr ""
"Una de las pistolas más reconocibles debido a su popularidad en el cine y "
"los videojuegos, la Desert Eagle es más conocida por su aspecto amenazante "
"en su ejecución. Es una pistola grande, pero su elevado peso reduce el "
"retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Henry Big Boy .44"
msgid_plural "Henry Big Boy .44"
msgstr[0] "Henry Big Boy .44"
msgstr[1] "Henry Big Boy .44"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This fine lever action rifle is chambered in the powerful .44 magnum "
"cartridge and features a sleek octagonal barrel with a tube fed magazine.  "
"Go get 'em cowboy!"
msgstr ""
"Este excelente rifle de acción de palanca utiliza el poderoso calibre .44 "
"magnum, y posee un elegante cañón octogonal con cargador de tubo. "
"¡Atrápalos, vaquero!"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe rifle: .44 Magnum"
msgid_plural "pipe rifles: .44 Magnum"
msgstr[0] "rifle de caño: .44 Magnum"
msgstr[1] "rifles de caño: .44 Magnum"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ruger Redhawk"
msgid_plural "Ruger Redhawk"
msgstr[0] "Ruger Redhawk"
msgstr[1] "Ruger Redhawk"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the most powerful handguns in the world when it was released in 1979,"
" the Redhawk offers very sturdy construction, with an appearance that is "
"reminiscent of \"Wild West\" revolvers."
msgstr ""
"Una de las pistolas más poderosas del mundo cuando fue presentada en 1979. "
"La Redhawk ofrece una estructura muy resistente, con la apariencia de los "
"revólveres del Lejano Oeste."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "S&W 629"
msgid_plural "S&W 629"
msgstr[0] "S&W 629"
msgstr[1] "S&W 629"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stainless steel, six-shot, double-action revolver with a matte black "
"plastic handle manufactured by Smith & Wesson.  Though hardly the most "
"powerful handgun in the world any more, it could still blow a zombie's head "
"clean off."
msgstr ""
"Un revolver de doble acción, de seis disparos, de acero inoxidable con mango"
" de plástico negro mate fabricado por Smith & Wesson. Aunque ya no sea la "
"pistola más poderosa del mundo, todavía puede volarle la cabeza a un zombi."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Colt M1860 Army"
msgid_plural "Colt M1860 Army"
msgstr[0] "Colt M1860 Army"
msgstr[1] "Colt M1860 Army"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Colt Army Model 1860 is a cap & ball .44-caliber revolver.  It was used "
"during the American Civil War, and made by Colt's Manufacturing Company."
msgstr ""
"El Colt Model 1860 Army, revólver de llave de percusión, calibre .44. Fue "
"usada durante la Guerra de Secesión, y fue producida por Colt's "
"Manufacturing Company."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "LeMat revolver"
msgid_plural "LeMat revolvers"
msgstr[0] "revólver LeMat"
msgstr[1] "revólveres LeMat"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Pietta reproduction of the civil war era LeMat revolver, a rare and "
"unusual cap & ball .44-caliber revolver.  While its original non-standard "
".42 or .35 caliber curbed its usefulness for the CSA army, this reproduction"
" is offered in more prevalent .44 caliber.  Despite modern quality "
"materials, the design is still rather delicate."
msgstr ""
"Una reproducción Pietta del revólver LeMat de la era de la guerra civil, un "
"raro e inusual revólver de calibre 44. Mientras que su calibre original no "
"estándar de .42 o .35 disminuyó su utilidad para el ejército CSA, esta "
"reproducción se ofrece en el calibre .44 más común. A pesar de la calidad de"
" los materiales modernos, el diseño sigue siendo bastante delicado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a submachine gun chambered in .45 ACP, accepting Glock magazines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un subfusil con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta cargadores Glock."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Vector SMG .45"
msgid_plural "Vector SMG .45s"
msgstr[0] "Vector SMG .45"
msgstr[1] "Vector SMG .45s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Vector SMG is a delayed blowback submachine gun with a unique, in-line "
"design that places both the shooter's hand and shoulder in line with the "
"bore axis, reducing muzzle climb during bursts.  This one is chambered in "
".45 ACP."
msgstr ""
"El Vector SMG es un subfusil de retroceso lento con un diseño único, en "
"línea, que coloca la mano y el hombro del tirador en línea con el eje del "
"cañón, reduciendo la subida de la boca durante las ráfagas. Esta arma tiene "
"la recámara en .45 ACP."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "UMP45 SMG"
msgid_plural "UMP45 SMGs"
msgstr[0] "SMG UMP45"
msgstr[1] "SMGs UMP45"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a submachine gun, chambered in .45 ACP, and accepting UMP45 "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un subfusil con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta cargadores UMP45."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K UMP45"
msgid_plural "H&K UMP45s"
msgstr[0] "H&K UMP45"
msgstr[1] "H&K UMP45"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Developed as a successor to the MP5 submachine gun, the UMP45 retains the "
"earlier model's supreme accuracy and low recoil, but in the higher .45 "
"caliber."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollado como sucesor del subfusil MP5, el UMP45 conserva la precisión "
"suprema del modelo anterior y su bajo retroceso, pero en calibre .45."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1911 pistol"
msgid_plural "M1911 pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola M1911"
msgstr[1] "pistolas M1911"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol, chambered in .45 ACP and accepting M1991 "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola semiautomática con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta "
"cargadores M1911."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1911"
msgid_plural "M1911s"
msgstr[0] "M1911"
msgstr[1] "M1911s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M1911 was the US Military standard-issue sidearm for most of the 20th "
"Century.  It remains one of the most popular .45 pistols today."
msgstr ""
"La M1911 fue el arma de apoyo del Ejército de los Estados Unidos por la "
"mayor parte del siglo XX. Aún hoy, sigue siendo una de las más populares "
"pistolas calibre .45."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M45A1"
msgid_plural "M45A1s"
msgstr[0] "M45A1"
msgstr[1] "M45A1s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M45A1 supplanted earlier M45 MEUSOC pistols in use by Force Recon "
"elements of Marine Expeditionary Units.  Where the original M45 pistols were"
" gutted M1911A1's hand-fitted by USMC armorers, the updated M45A1's are "
"hardly different from any other commercial 1911 design save for their dual "
"recoil springs.  Most were replaced in 2016 with Glock 19's due to logistics"
" issues."
msgstr ""
"El M45A1 sustituyó a las anteriores pistolas M45 MEUSOC que usaban los "
"elementos de reconocimiento de la fuerza de las unidades expedicionarias de "
"los marines. Mientras que las pistolas M45 originales fueron destripadas por"
" los blindados del USMC, las M45A1 actualizadas apenas difieren de cualquier"
" otro diseño comercial de 1911, excepto por sus muelles de doble retroceso. "
"La mayoría fueron reemplazadas en 2016 por Glock 19 debido a problemas de "
"logística."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MAC-10 SMG"
msgid_plural "MAC-10 SMGs"
msgstr[0] "SMG MAC-10"
msgstr[1] "SMGs MAC-10"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a submachine gun chambered in .45 ACP, and accepting MAC-10 "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un subfusil con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta cargadores MAC-10."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MAC-10"
msgid_plural "MAC-10s"
msgstr[0] "MAC-10"
msgstr[1] "MAC-10"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The MAC-10 is a popular machine pistol originally designed for military use."
"  For many years they were the most inexpensive automatic weapon in the US, "
"and enjoyed great popularity among criminals less concerned with quality "
"firearms."
msgstr ""
"La MAC-10 es una pistola ametralladora popular, diseñada originalmente para "
"uso militar. Por muchos años, era el arma automática más barata de Estados "
"Unidos, y disfrutó de gran popularidad entre los criminales que no les "
"importaba la calidad del arma."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe rifle: .45"
msgid_plural "pipe rifles: .45"
msgstr[0] "rifle de tubo: .45"
msgstr[1] "rifles de tubo: .45"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Luty SMG: .45"
msgid_plural "Luty SMGs: .45"
msgstr[0] "Luty SMG: .45"
msgstr[1] "Luty SMGs: .45"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Luty pattern makeshift smoothbore SMG crudely constructed out of various "
"steel parts using some of the more advanced powered hand tools; likely one "
"of the most complex guns that are feasible to make outside of a machine "
"shop, but still very unreliable.  This one is chambered for .45 ACP "
"cartridges and accepts MAC-10 compatible magazines."
msgstr ""
"Un patrón de Luty hace que el subfusil de cañón liso sea construido "
"toscamente con varias piezas de acero usando algunas de las herramientas "
"manuales más avanzadas; probablemente una de las armas más complejas que son"
" factibles de hacer fuera de un taller de máquinas, pero aún así muy poco "
"fiable. Esta tiene una cámara para cartuchos de .45 ACP y acepta cargadores "
"compatibles con MAC-10."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "homemade hand cannon"
msgid_plural "homemade hand cannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón de mano casero"
msgstr[1] "cañones de mano caseros"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large and heavy pistol evidently welded from scrap.  It's not pretty, but "
"the .45 it's chambered with packs a serious punch.  Just watch out for the "
"kick."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola grande y pesada, evidentemente fabricada con chatarra. No es "
"linda, pero el calibre .45 la hace ser muy potente. Pero ten cuidado con el "
"culatazo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Thompson SMG"
msgid_plural "Thompson SMGs"
msgstr[0] "SMG Thompson"
msgstr[1] "SMGs Thompson"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a submachine gun chambered in .45 ACP, and accepting Thompson "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un subfusil con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta cargadores Thompson."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Thompson M1928A1"
msgid_plural "Thompson M1928A1s"
msgstr[0] "Thompson M1928A1"
msgstr[1] "Thompson M1928A1s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An American-made submachine gun developed during the very end of World War "
"I, too late to see action.  Infamous during the 1920s for its use by "
"gangsters, and was used during World War II before being mostly replaced "
"with less-expensive alternatives."
msgstr ""
"Un subfusil de fabricación estadounidense, desarrollado durante el fin de la"
" Primera Guerra Mundial, un poco tarde para ver acción. Famoso durante la "
"década de 1920 como arma de los mafiosos, también fue utilizado en la "
"Segunda Guerra Mundial antes de ser reemplazado por alternativas más "
"económicas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "USP pistol"
msgid_plural "USP pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola USP"
msgstr[1] "pistolas USP"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol chambered in .45 ACP, and accepting USP magazines."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola semiautomática con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta cargadores "
"USP."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "USP .45"
msgid_plural "USP .45s"
msgstr[0] "USP .45"
msgstr[1] "USP .45s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A popular pistol, widely used among law enforcement.  Extensively tested for"
" durability, it has been found to stay accurate even after being subjected "
"to extreme abuse."
msgstr ""
"Es una pistola popular, muy utilizada por las fuerzas de la ley. Su "
"durabilidad ha sido extensivamente probada, se sabe que puede mantener su "
"precisión incluso luego de sufir maltrato extremo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MK 23 MOD 0"
msgid_plural "MK 23 MOD 0s"
msgstr[0] "MK 23 MOD 0"
msgstr[1] "MK 23 MOD 0s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Jokingly referred to as \"The World's Only Crew-Served Pistol\", this "
"massive pistol was designed as a primary weapon for select \"special "
"operators\".  Its cumbersome nature, the introduction of the derivative HK "
"USP series and the logistics of getting .45 ACP ammunition in theater doomed"
" this behemoth to US SOCOM armories.  Like the USP, the Mk 23 is a "
"remarkably reliable gun; someone could probably take out a nuclear equipped "
"walking tank with this in their holster."
msgstr ""
"Conocida en broma como \"La única pistola para tripulantes del mundo\", esta"
" enorme pistola fue diseñada como arma principal para selectos \"operadores "
"especiales\". Su naturaleza engorrosa, la introducción de la serie derivada "
"HK USP y la logística de conseguir munición de .45 ACP en el teatro de "
"operaciones condenó a este gigante a las armerías del US SOCOM. Al igual que"
" la USP, el Mk 23 es un arma notablemente fiable; alguien podría "
"probablemente sacar un tanque de paseo equipado con armas nucleares con esto"
" en su funda."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "PPQ pistol"
msgid_plural "PPQ pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola PPQ"
msgstr[1] "pistolas PPQ"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol chambered in .45 ACP, and accepting PPQ "
"magazines"
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola semiautomática con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta "
"cargadores PPQ."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Walther PPQ 45"
msgid_plural "Walther PPQ 45s"
msgstr[0] "Walther PPQ 45"
msgstr[1] "Walther PPQ 45s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Walther PPQ is a semi-automatic pistol originating from the Walther "
"P99QA, and maintains compatibility with some of its predecessor's "
"accessories.  This model is chambered in .45 ACP."
msgstr ""
"The Walther PPQ is a semi-automatic pistol originating from the Walther "
"P99QA, and maintains compatibility with some of its predecessor's "
"accessories. This model is chambered in .45 ACP."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Hi-Point pistol"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola Hi-Point"
msgstr[1] "pistolas Hi-Point"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol chambered in .45 ACP, and accepting Hi-Point"
" magazines."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola semiautomática con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta "
"cargadores Hi-Point."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Hi-Point Model JHP"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point Model JHPs"
msgstr[0] "Hi-Point Model JHP"
msgstr[1] "Hi-Point Model JHPs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Hi-Point Model JHP is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol designed"
" by Hi-Point Firearms, which is known for making inexpensive firearms, and "
"for making said firearms bulky and uncomfortable.  Hi-Points have slides "
"made with a zinc pot-metal which is relatively fragile compared to steel "
"slides."
msgstr ""
"El modelo Hi-Point JHP es una pistola semiautomática operada por retroceso "
"diseñada por Hi-Point Firearms, conocida por fabricar armas de fuego "
"baratas, y por hacer dichas armas de fuego voluminosas e incómodas. Hi-Point"
" tiene correderas hechas con una aleación de zinc que es relativamente "
"frágil en comparación con las correderas de acero."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic pistol chambered in .45 ACP, and accepting Glock "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola semiautomática con recámara de .45 ACP que acepta "
"cargadores Glock."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 21"
msgid_plural "Glock 21s"
msgstr[0] "Glock 21"
msgstr[1] "Glock 21s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A full-sized version of the highly successful Glock.  This model is "
"chambered in .45 ACP."
msgstr ""
"Una versión de tamaño completo de la exitosa Glock. Este modelo tiene la "
"recámara en .45 ACP."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Taurus Raging Bull"
msgid_plural "Taurus Raging Bull"
msgstr[0] "Taurus Raging Bull"
msgstr[1] "Taurus Raging Bull"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Taurus Raging Bull is a 5-shot revolver chambered in .454 Casull.  It "
"has impressive stopping power."
msgstr ""
"El Taurus Raging Bull es un revólver de 5 disparos con calibre .454 Casull."
"  Tiene una potencia de parada impresionante."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Taurus Raging Judge Magnum"
msgid_plural "Taurus Raging Judge Magnum"
msgstr[0] "Taurus Raging Judge Magnum"
msgstr[1] "Taurus Raging Judge Magnum"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Taurus Raging Judge Magnum is a 6-shot revolver chambered in .454 "
"Casull.  It can fire .410 shotshells and .45 Colt cartridges as well."
msgstr ""
"El Taurus Raging Judge Magnum es un revólver de 6 disparos con cámara en el "
".454 Casull. Puede disparar cartuchos de .410 y .45 Colt también."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Marlin 1895 SBL"
msgid_plural "Marlin 1895 SBLs"
msgstr[0] "Marlin 1895 SBL"
msgstr[1] "Marlin 1895 SBLs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A handy but powerful lever-action rifle chambered for .45-70 Government.  "
"Designed for wilderness guides for defense against large predators such as "
"grizzly bears, moose, and dinosaurs."
msgstr ""
"Un práctico pero poderoso rifle de acción de palanca con cámara para .45-70 "
"Government. Diseñado para los guías de la naturaleza para la defensa contra "
"grandes depredadores como osos pardos, alces y dinosaurios."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Magnum Research BFR"
msgid_plural "Magnum Research BFRs"
msgstr[0] "Magnum Research BFR"
msgstr[1] "Magnum Research BFRs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A massive single-action revolver.  While the .45-70 rifle round loses "
"significant velocity in its short pistol barrel, it still competes with "
"other large magnum handguns in terms of power."
msgstr ""
"Un revólver masivo de una sola acción. Mientras que la bala de un rifle "
"45-70 pierde una velocidad significativa en su corto cañón de pistola, "
"todavía compite con otras grandes armas de mano magnum en términos de "
"potencia."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "1874 Sharps"
msgid_plural "1874 Sharps"
msgstr[0] "1874 Sharp"
msgstr[1] "1874 Sharps"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A reproduction of an antique single-shot .45-70 rifle once used to hunt "
"buffalo and other large game in the late 19th Century.  Highly accurate and "
"powerful for the time, this one is made to handle modern smokeless "
"ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Una reproducción de un antiguo rifle de un solo tiro .45-70 usado una vez "
"para cazar búfalos y otros animales de caza mayor a finales del siglo XIX. "
"Altamente preciso y poderoso para la época, este está hecho para manejar "
"munición moderna sin humo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Bond Arms Derringer"
msgid_plural "Bond Arms Derringers"
msgstr[0] "Bond Arms Derringers"
msgstr[1] "Bond Arms Derringers"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Bond Arms Derringer is a series of multi-barrel compact pistols.  Most "
"commonly chambered for .45 Colt, with chambers long enough to accept .410 "
"shotgun shells."
msgstr ""
"El Bond Arms Derringer es una serie de pistolas compactas de varios cañones."
" Comúnmente con cámara para un Colt .45, con cámaras lo suficientemente "
"largas para aceptar cartuchos de escopeta .410."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Colt Lightning .45 Carbine"
msgid_plural "Colt Lightning .45 Carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina Colt Lightning .45"
msgstr[1] "carabinas Colt Lightning .45"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern reproduction of a Colt pump-action rifle.  Originally chambered in "
".44-40, modern versions most commonly use .45 Colt, complementing the Single"
" Action Army as a Cowboy Action Shooting firearm."
msgstr ""
"Una reproducción moderna de un rifle de acción de bombeo Colt. Originalmente"
" con cámara en .44-40, las versiones modernas usan más comúnmente un Colt "
".45, complementando al Colt Single Action Army como un arma de fuego de "
"competición vaquera."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "chik chik."
msgstr "pollito pollito."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Uberti Cattleman"
msgid_plural "Uberti Cattleman"
msgstr[0] "Uberti Cattleman"
msgstr[1] "Uberti Cattleman"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This 7.5\" barreled Uberti Cattleman is a modern reproduction of the "
"legendary Colt Single Action Army, or Colt Peacemaker, one of the first "
"revolvers to use a modern self-contained cartridge.  Made famous by "
"westerns, it is still in demand for Cowboy Action Shooting, reenactors and "
"collectors.  Unlike modern revolvers, the cylinder cannot swing out for "
"loading, and spent brass must be ejected one at a time."
msgstr ""
"Este Uberti Cattleman de cañón 7.5 es una reproducción moderna del "
"legendario Colt Single Action Army, o Colt Peacemaker, uno de los primeros "
"revólveres en utilizar un moderno cartucho autónomo. Famoso por los "
"westerns, todavía es solicitado por Cowboy Action Shooting (competición de "
"vaqueros), recreadores y coleccionistas. A diferencia de los revólveres "
"modernos, el cilindro no puede oscilar hacia fuera para la carga, y el latón"
" gastado debe ser expulsado de uno en uno."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K MP7A2"
msgid_plural "H&K MP7A2s"
msgstr[0] "H&K MP7A2"
msgstr[1] "H&K MP7A2s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed as a personal defense weapon, the MP7 fires the high-powered "
"4.6x30mm round while being lightweight, compact in size, and practically "
"recoil free."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada como un arma de defensa personal, la MP7 dispara la balas de alta "
"potencia de 4,6 x 30 mm, siendo ligera, de tamaño compacto y prácticamente "
"sin retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "1911-460"
msgid_plural "1911-460s"
msgstr[0] "1911-460"
msgstr[1] "1911-460s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This 1911 has been customized to chamber powerful .460 Rowland ammunition.  "
"It now sports a large, integral compensator to aid in taming recoil and "
"reducing slide velocity.  Notably, normal .45ACP can also be fired through "
"the weapon."
msgstr ""
"Este 1911 ha sido personalizado para albergar la poderosa munición .460 "
"Rowland. Ahora lleva un gran compensador integral para ayudar a domar el "
"retroceso y reducir la velocidad de deslizamiento. Notablemente, el .45ACP "
"normal también puede ser disparado a través del arma."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Barrett M107A1"
msgid_plural "Barrett M107A1"
msgstr[0] "Barrett M107A1"
msgstr[1] "Barrett M107A1"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large, shoulder-fired, .50 caliber anti-materiel rifle.  Its large size, "
"recoil, and noise is offset by its damage and range."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle antimaterial grande y portátil, con calibre .50. Su gran tamaño, "
"retroceso y ruido son las desventajas de su gran daño y alcance."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M2HB Browning HMG"
msgid_plural "M2HB Browning HMG"
msgstr[0] "M2HB Browning HMG"
msgstr[1] "M2HB Browning HMG"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy machine gun used by the US Military from its inception to the "
"Cataclysm, and even rarely by Cataclysm survivors.  Its massive size and "
"design make it impossible to use unless deployed or mounted to a vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Una ametralladora pesada usada por el ejército de los EE.UU. desde su inicio"
" hasta el cataclismo, e incluso raramente por los sobrevivientes del "
"cataclismo. Su enorme tamaño y diseño la hacen imposible de usar a menos que"
" sea desplegada o montada en un vehículo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ".50 caliber rifle"
msgid_plural ".50 caliber rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle calibre .50"
msgstr[1] "rifles calibre .50"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Modified from the massive M2 Browning, this pared down rifle has been "
"altered to be fired unmounted.  The burst fire has been disabled, and its "
"belt fed mechanism has been modified into a much smaller single round "
"chamber."
msgstr ""
"Es una modificación del enorme M2 Browning, un rifle reducido al mínimo y "
"alterado para ser disparado sin montar. El disparo en ráfaga ha sido "
"desactivado, y el mecanismo de alimentación con cinta fue modificado para "
"tener una cámara pequeña de una sola bala."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py src/item_factory.cpp
msgid "manual"
msgstr "manual"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AI AS50"
msgid_plural "AI AS50s"
msgstr[0] "AI AS50"
msgstr[1] "AI AS50"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
".50 caliber anti-materiel rifle made by Accuracy International.  With high "
"accuracy for long range target and high fire rate, this weapon is still "
"being used by Greek national guard."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle anti-materia de calibre .50 hecho por Accuracy International. Con "
"alta precisión para objetivos de largo alcance y alta velocidad de fuego, "
"esta arma sigue siendo utilizada por la guardia nacional griega."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "McMillan TAC-50"
msgid_plural "McMillan TAC-50s"
msgstr[0] "McMillan TAC-50"
msgstr[1] "McMillan TAC-50s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long-range anti-materiel and anti-personnel sniper rifle made by McMillan "
"Firearms, serving the Canadian Army since 2000 as the C15, and the Navy "
"Seals as the Mk 15 Mod 0.  This .50 caliber bolt-action rifle is capable of "
"defeating light vehicles, radar installations and crew served weapons at "
"extreme distances.  It notably holds the longest range confirmed sniper "
"kill, as well as the 4th and 5th longest."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de francotirador de largo alcance anti-materia y anti-personal "
"fabricado por McMillan Firearms, que sirve al ejército canadiense desde 2000"
" como el C15, y a los Navy Seals como el Mk 15 Mod 0. Este rifle de cerrojo "
"de calibre .50 es capaz de derrotar a vehículos ligeros, instalaciones de "
"radar y armas de servicio de la tripulación a distancias extremas. Es "
"notablemente el francotirador de mayor alcance confirmado, así como el 4º y "
"5º más largo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Serbu BFG-50"
msgid_plural "Serbu BFG-50s"
msgstr[0] "Serbu BFG-50"
msgstr[1] "Serbu BFG-50s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single-shot, bolt-action rifle made by Serbu Firearms, the BFG-50 is a "
"very affordable firearm for those wishing to shoot .50 BMG."
msgstr ""
"El BFG-50 es un rifle de un solo tiro y acción de perno hecho por Serbu "
"Firearms, es un arma de fuego muy asequible para aquellos que desean "
"disparar .50 BMG."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Big Horn Model 89"
msgid_plural "Big Horn Model 89"
msgstr[0] "Big Horn Model 89"
msgstr[1] "Big Horn Model 89"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Built in the image of the venerable Winchester Model 1886, Big Horn Armory's"
" Model 89 rifle packs all the power of the .500 S&W Magnum cartridge in to a"
" package less likely to break one's wrist."
msgstr ""
"Construido en la imagen de la venerable Winchester modelo 1886, el rifle "
"modelo 89 de la Armería Big Horn posee toda la potencia del cartucho.500 S &"
" W Magnum en un paquete y hace menos probable que se le rompa la muñeca."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "S&W 500"
msgid_plural "S&W 500"
msgstr[0] "S&W 500"
msgstr[1] "S&W 500"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The 5-shot Smith and Wesson 500 revolver fires the comparably-named .500 S&W"
" Magnum.  It's an impressive weapon."
msgstr ""
"El revólver de cinco disparos Smith & Wesson 500 usa la bala .500 S&W "
"Magnum. Es un arma impresionante."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AK-74M"
msgid_plural "AK-74Ms"
msgstr[0] "AK-74M"
msgstr[1] "AK-74M"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The successor to the well-known AK-47 rifle.  It combines the reliability of"
" the AK series with the high-velocity, lightweight 5.45x39mm cartridge."
msgstr ""
"El sucesor del conocido rifle AK-47.  Combina la fiabilidad de la serie de "
"AK con el cartucho de alta velocidad ligero de 5.45x39mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "FN Five-Seven"
msgid_plural "FN Five-Sevens"
msgstr[0] "FN Five-Seven"
msgstr[1] "FN Five-Sevens"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed to work with FN's proprietary 5.7x28mm round, the Five-Seven is a "
"lightweight pistol with a very high capacity, best used against armored "
"opponents."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada para trabajar con la bala 5.7x28mm de FN, la Five-Seven es una "
"pistola ligera con muy buena capacidad, y buen desempeño contra oponentes "
"con armadura."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "FN P90"
msgid_plural "FN P90s"
msgstr[0] "FN P90"
msgstr[1] "FN P90"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The first in a new genre of guns, termed \"personal defense weapons.\"  FN "
"designed the P90 to use their proprietary 5.7x28mm ammunition.  It is made "
"for firing bursts manageably."
msgstr ""
"El primero en un nuevo género de armas, denominado \"armas de defensa "
"personal\". FN diseñó el P90 para usar su munición 5.7x28mm. Está hecho para"
" disparar ráfagas de manera controlada."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM216 SPIW"
msgid_plural "RM216 SPIWs"
msgstr[0] "RM216 SPIW"
msgstr[1] "RM216 SPIW"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This light carbine fires 5x50mm armor-piercing flechette cartridges.  "
"Classified as a special purpose individual weapon, this advanced firearm was"
" developed by Rivtech for the US military shortly before the end of the "
"world.  Designed to be fired in bursts, it excels in close combat."
msgstr ""
"Esta carabina ligera dispara cartuchos 5x50mm de dardos perforantes de "
"blindaje. Clasificada como arma individual de propósito especial, esta arma "
"de fuego avanzada fue desarrollada por Rivtech para el Ejército de Estados "
"Unidos poco antes de que el mundo se terminara. Diseñada para disparar en "
"ráfaga, es excelente en el combate cercano."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "5 rd."
msgstr "5 rd."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM232 IDW"
msgid_plural "RM232 IDWs"
msgstr[0] "RM232 IDW"
msgstr[1] "RM232 IDW"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This lightweight machine pistol fires 5x50mm armor-piercing flechette "
"cartridges.  Classified as an individual defense weapon, this advanced "
"firearm was developed by Rivtech for the US military shortly before the end "
"of the world.  Designed to be fired in bursts, it excels in close combat."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola ametralladora liviana dispara cartuchos 5x50mm de dardos "
"perforantes de blindaje. Clasificada como arma de defensa personal, esta "
"arma de fuego avanzada fue desarrollada por Rivtech para el Ejército de "
"Estados Unidos poco antes de que el mundo se terminara. Diseñada para "
"disparar en ráfaga, es excelente en el combate cercano."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M202A1 FLASH"
msgid_plural "M202A1 FLASH"
msgstr[0] "M202A1 FLASH"
msgstr[1] "M202A1 FLASH"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An American rocket launcher designed in the 1970s to replace WW2 era "
"flamethrowers still in use in Vietnam.  It has four barrels sharing the 66mm"
" caliber of the M72 LAW."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzacohetes americano diseñado en los años 70 para reemplazar a los "
"lanzallamas de la segunda guerra mundial que aún se usan en Vietnam. Tiene "
"cuatro barriles que comparten el calibre 66mm de M72 LAW."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "all barrels"
msgstr "todos los cañones"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Elephant gun"
msgid_plural "Elephant guns"
msgstr[0] "Rifle para Elefantes"
msgstr[1] "Rifles para Elefantes"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A custom-made single shot rifle specially designed for the hunting of huge "
"game.  You could obviously kill everything with this, EVERYTHING.  If you "
"ever find enough ammo of course."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de disparo único hecho a medida diseñado especialmente para la caza"
" del gran juego. Se podría, obviamente, matar todo con esto, TODO. Si alguna"
" vez encuentra munición suficiente, por supuesto."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AKM"
msgid_plural "AKMs"
msgstr[0] "AKM"
msgstr[1] "AKM"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the most recognizable assault rifles ever made, the AKM is renowned "
"for its durability even under the worst conditions."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los rifles de asalto más reconocibles que se haya fabricado. El AKM "
"es reconocido por su durabilidad incluso bajo las peores condiciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Beretta ARX-160"
msgid_plural "Beretta ARX-160"
msgstr[0] "Beretta ARX-160"
msgstr[1] "Beretta ARX-160"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Beretta ARX-160 was a Phase II contender in the United States Army "
"Individual Carbine competition to replace the M4 carbine.  It failed to "
"replace it, but it is widely used by military all around the world.  This "
"version is chambered for 7.62x39mm."
msgstr ""
"La Beretta ARX-160 era una competidora de la Phase II en la competición de "
"Carabina Individual del Ejército de Estados Unidos, para reemplazar la "
"carabina M4. No logró reemplazarla, pero es usada por ejércitos de todo el "
"mundo. Esta versión utiliza balas 7.62x39mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SKS"
msgid_plural "SKSs"
msgstr[0] "SKS"
msgstr[1] "SKS"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Developed by the Soviets in 1945, this rifle was quickly replaced by the "
"full-auto AK47.  However, due to its superb accuracy, low recoil and "
"deployable integrated bayonet, this gun maintains immense popularity."
msgstr ""
"Desarrollado por los soviéticos en 1945, este rifle fue rápidamente "
"reemplazado por la automática AK47. Sin embargo, debido a su magnífica "
"precisión, poco retroceso y bayoneta integrada retráctil, esta arma mantiene"
" una inmensa popularidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AK-47"
msgid_plural "AK-47s"
msgstr[0] "AK-47"
msgstr[1] "AK-47s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Civilian-legal clones of the iconic Kalashnikov, like this one, were "
"manufactured and imported by many different firms.  Even without full-auto "
"function, their solid firepower and reliability in harsh conditions make "
"them valuable weapons in this new world."
msgstr ""
"Los clones civiles del emblemático Kalashnikov, como éste, fueron fabricados"
" e importados por muchas empresas diferentes. Incluso sin la función full-"
"auto, su sólida potencia de fuego y su fiabilidad en condiciones adversas "
"las convierten en armas valiosas en este nuevo mundo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mini Draco"
msgid_plural "Mini Dracos"
msgstr[0] "Mini Draco"
msgstr[1] "Mini Dracos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Essentially a semi-auto AK with a short barrel and no stock, this unwieldy "
"\"pistol\" has seen some popularity with civilian shooters and gangbangers "
"alike."
msgstr ""
"Esencialmente un AK semiautomático con un cañón corto y sin culata, esta "
"\"pistola\" poco manejable ha visto cierta popularidad entre los tiradores "
"civiles y los pandilleros por igual."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mosin-Nagant M44"
msgid_plural "Mosin-Nagant M44"
msgstr[0] "Mosin-Nagant M44"
msgstr[1] "Mosin-Nagant M44"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Model 44 is the carbine sized variant of the standard 1891/30.  It has a"
" shorter barrel, therefore it is weaker than the 1891/30, but easier to "
"carry."
msgstr ""
"El Model 44 es la variante tamaño carabine del estándar 1891/30. Tiene un "
"cañón más corto, y por lo tanto es más débil que el 1891/30, pero más fácil "
"de llevar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mosin-Nagant M44-EBR"
msgid_plural "Mosin-Nagant M44-EBR"
msgstr[0] "Mosin-Nagant M44-EBR"
msgstr[1] "Mosin-Nagant M44-EBR"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This carbine packs the classic Mosin-Nagant model 44 action in a modern-day "
"stock capable of accepting modifications."
msgstr ""
"Esta carabina posee el accionar del clásico Mosin-Nagant M44, con una culata"
" moderna que acepta modificaciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30"
msgid_plural "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30"
msgstr[0] "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30"
msgstr[1] "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Mosin-Nagant 1891/30 is a bolt action, internal magazine-fed, military "
"rifle, developed by the Russian Empire, and later used and perfected by the "
"Soviet Union."
msgstr ""
"El Mosin-Nagant 1891/30 es un rifle de cerrojo, militar, con cargador "
"interno, desarrollado por el Imperio Ruso, y luego utilizado y perfeccionado"
" por la Unión Soviética."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30-EBR"
msgid_plural "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30-EBR"
msgstr[0] "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30-EBR"
msgstr[1] "Mosin-Nagant 1891/30-EBR"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This Mosin-Nagant has exchanged the classic wooden stock for a modern "
"synthetic model, carefully balanced to the same weight and handling yet "
"offering support for modern accessories."
msgstr ""
"El Mosin-Nagant cambió su clásica culata de madera por un modelo sintético "
"moderno, cuidadosamente balanceado y con capacidad para añadirle accesorios "
"modernos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "PPSh-41"
msgid_plural "PPSh-41s"
msgstr[0] "PPSh-41"
msgstr[1] "PPSh-41"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Soviet-made PPSh-41 is a mass-produced selective-fire submachine gun.  "
"It has a relatively high rate of fire."
msgstr ""
"La fabricación soviética PPSh-41 es una ametralladora de fuego selectiva "
"producida en masa. Tiene una relativamente alta tasa de fuego."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Tokarev TT-33"
msgid_plural "Tokarev TT-33"
msgstr[0] "Tokarev TT-33"
msgstr[1] "Tokarev TT-33"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Tokarev TT-33 is an antique Russian semiautomatic pistol, famous for its"
" durability, accuracy, and uncomfortable grip angle.  It was chambered for "
"the 7.62x25mm due to the popularity of the C96 pistol among Russian "
"revolutionaries."
msgstr ""
"La Tokarev TT-33 es una pistola antigua semiautomática rusa, famosa por su "
"durabilidad, precisión y agarre del ángulo incómodo. Usa el calibre "
"7.62x25mm debido a la popularidad de la pistola C96 entre los "
"revolucionarios rusos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M3 recoilless rifle"
msgid_plural "M3 recoilless rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle sin retroceso M3"
msgstr[1] "rifles sin retroceso M3"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Manufactured in Sweden, the Carl Gustav M3 is a breech-loading 84 millimeter"
" man-portable, reusable, multi-role recoilless rifle commonly used by the US"
" military."
msgstr ""
"Fabricado en Suecia, la Carl Gustav M3 es un rifle sin retroceso, de "
"retrocarga, 84 milímetros, portátil, reutilizable, multi-función, comúnmente"
" usado por el Ejército de Estados Unidos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M3E1 recoilless rifle"
msgid_plural "M3E1 recoilless rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle sin retroceso M3E1"
msgstr[1] "rifles sin retroceso M3E1"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Carl Gustav M3E1 is a breech-loading 84 millimeter man-portable, "
"reusable, multi-role recoilless rifle.  This is a lighter, shorter, and more"
" advanced development of the M3."
msgstr ""
"El Carl Gustav M3E1 es un fusil sin retroceso de 84 milímetros, portátil y "
"reutilizable. Se trata de un desarrollo más ligero, más corto y más avanzado"
" del M3."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "AT4"
msgid_plural "AT4s"
msgstr[0] "AT4"
msgstr[1] "AT4s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mil-Spec rocket launcher.  An 84-mm unguided, portable, single-shot "
"recoilless smoothbore weapon used primarily by the US military."
msgstr ""
"Lanzador de cohetes Mil-Spec. Un arma de 84 mm sin guía, portátil, de un "
"solo disparo y sin retroceso, utilizada principalmente por el ejército de "
"los EE.UU."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM103A automagnum"
msgid_plural "RM103A automagnums"
msgstr[0] "RM103A automagnum"
msgstr[1] "RM103A automagnums"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Considered overkill by many, the Rivtech M103A remains one of the most "
"powerful sidearms ever developed.  Accepts stick magazines."
msgstr ""
"Aunque algunos lo consideran una exageración, el Rivtech M103A sigue siendo "
"una de las armas de apoyo más poderosas que se hayan desarrollado. Acepta "
"cargadores rectos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM11B scout rifle"
msgid_plural "RM11B scout rifles"
msgstr[0] "Rifle de reconocimiento RM11B"
msgstr[1] "Rifles de reconocimiento RM11B"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Intended to function as a long-range sharpshooter support weapon for the "
"military, the Rivtech RM11B scout rifle was designed for durability and "
"accuracy under less than ideal circumstances.  Its bullpup layout, "
"integrated suppressor and digital scope, and two round burst mode allows it "
"to deliver precise long-range takedowns, utilizing the proprietary Rivtech "
"8mm caseless round.  Accepts stick magazines."
msgstr ""
"Pensado para funcionar como arma de apoyo para los francotiradores "
"militares, el rifle scout Rivtech RM11B fue diseñado para ser duradero y "
"preciso bajo circunstancias poco ideales. Su diseño bullpup, silenciador "
"integrado, mira digital y modo de disparo en ráfaga de dos balas le permite "
"derribar objetivos a larga distancia, utilizando la bala sin casquillo de "
"Rivtech 8mm. Acepta cargadores rectos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM2000 submachine gun"
msgid_plural "RM2000 submachine guns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil RM2000"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles RM2000"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM2000 submachine gun "
"was designed for durability and ease of carrying under less than ideal "
"circumstances.  Accepts stick magazines."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando un poderoso e inusual calibre, el subfusil Rivtech RM2000 fue "
"diseñado para ser duradero y fácil de llevar bajo condiciones poco ideales. "
"Acepta cargadores rectos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM298 HMG"
msgid_plural "RM298 HMGs"
msgstr[0] "RM298 HMG"
msgstr[1] "RM298 HMGs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM298 heavy machine "
"gun was designed for durability and extreme volume of sustained fire under "
"the worst possible circumstances.  Accepts RMXB500 box and RMGD250 drum "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando un poderoso e inusual calibre, la ametralladora pesada Rivtech "
"RM298 fue diseñada para ser duradera y poseer un volumen extremo de disparo "
"sostenido, incluso bajo las peores condiciones posibles. Acepta cargadores "
"de caja RMXB500 y cargadores de tambor RMGD250."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM51 assault rifle"
msgid_plural "RM51 assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de asalto RM51"
msgstr[1] "rifles de asalto RM51"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Originally produced for military use, the Rivtech RM51 assault rifle was "
"designed for durability and ease of use under less than ideal circumstances,"
" with its considerable bulk minimized by a compact and ergonomic layout.  "
"Accepts box magazines."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente producido para uso militar, el rifle de asalto Rivtech RM51 "
"fue diseñado para ser duradero y fácil de usar bajo condiciones poco "
"ideales, ya que su incomodidad ha sido minimizada por su diseño compacto y "
"ergonómico. Acepta cargadores de caja."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM614 LMG"
msgid_plural "RM614 LMGs"
msgstr[0] "RM614 LMG"
msgstr[1] "RM614 LMGs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Utilizing a powerful and unusual caliber, the Rivtech RM614 light machine "
"gun was designed for durability and extreme volume of sustained fire under "
"the worst possible circumstances.  Accepts RMXB500 box and RMGD250 drum "
"magazines."
msgstr ""
"Utilizando un poderoso e inusual calibre, la ametralladora ligera Rivtech "
"RM614 fue diseñada para ser duradera y poseer un volumen extremo de disparo "
"sostenido, incluso bajo las peores condiciones posibles. Acepta cargadores "
"de caja RMXB500 y cargadores de tambor RMGD250."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "4 rd."
msgstr "4 rd."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM88 battle rifle"
msgid_plural "RM88 battle rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de combate RM88"
msgstr[1] "rifles de combate RM88"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Originally produced for military use, the Rivtech RM88 battle rifle was "
"designed for durability and extreme firepower under less than ideal "
"circumstances, with a heavy ported barrel for maximum controllability.  "
"Accepts box and RMGD250 drum magazines."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente producido para uso militar, el rifle de combate Rivtech RM88 "
"fue diseñado para ser duradero y tener mucho poder de fuego bajo condiciones"
" poco ideales, con un caño pesada para tener máxima controlabilidad. Acepta "
"cargadores de caja y cargadores de tambor RMGD250."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Beretta 90-two"
msgid_plural "Beretta 90-twos"
msgstr[0] "Beretta 90-two"
msgstr[1] "Beretta 90-twos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A more modern version of Beretta's popular 92 series of handguns, the 90-two"
" performs largely the same.  The main difference is a sleeker, almost "
"futuristic-looking design owed in large parts to the polymer underbarrel "
"rail cover."
msgstr ""
"Una versión más moderna de la popular serie de pistolas 92 de Beretta, la "
"90-two tiene prácticamente el mismo rendimiento. La principal diferencia es "
"un diseño más elegante, casi futurista, debido en gran parte a la cubierta "
"de polímero bajo el cañón."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Calico M960"
msgid_plural "Calico M960"
msgstr[0] "Calico M960"
msgstr[1] "Calico M960"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Calico M960 is an automatic carbine with a unique circular magazine that"
" allows for high capacities and reduced recoil."
msgstr ""
"La Calico M960 es una carabina automática con un cargador único circular que"
" permite gran capacidad de carga y bajo retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Cx4 Storm"
msgid_plural "Cx4 Storms"
msgstr[0] "Cx4 Storm"
msgstr[1] "Cx4 Storms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small pistol caliber carbine designed for police use and civilian self-"
"defense, the Cx4 Storm uses magazines that are interchangeable with other "
"Beretta 9x19mm handguns."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña carabina con calibre de pistola, diseñada para uso policial y la"
" defensa personal de los civiles. El Cx4 Storm usa cargadores que son "
"intercambiables con las pistolas Beretta 9x19mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 19"
msgid_plural "Glock 19s"
msgstr[0] "Glock 19"
msgstr[1] "Glock 19"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Possibly the most popular pistol in existence.  The Glock 19 is often "
"derided for its plastic construction, but it is easy to shoot."
msgstr ""
"Posiblemente sea la pistola más popular que existe. La Glock 19 es a menudo "
"ridiculizada por su estructura plástica, pero es fácil de usar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K MP5A2"
msgid_plural "H&K MP5A2s"
msgstr[0] "H&K MP5A2"
msgstr[1] "H&K MP5A2s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Heckler & Koch MP5 is one of the most widely-used submachine guns in the"
" world, and has been adopted by special police forces and militaries alike."
"  Its high degree of accuracy and low recoil are universally praised."
msgstr ""
"El Heckler & Koch MP5 es uno de los subfusiles más utilizados en el mundo, y"
" ha sido adoptado por las fuerzas policiales y militares especiales. Su alto"
" grado de precisión y su poco retroceso son elogiados universalmente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K MP5SD"
msgid_plural "H&K MP5SDs"
msgstr[0] "H&K MP5SD"
msgstr[1] "H&K MP5SD"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The H&K MP5SD offers subsonic performance in almost the same footprint as "
"the H&K MP5, retaining its handiness.  The large suppressor cuts down on "
"muzzle flash greatly, aiding in night operations.  It has also seen some "
"popularity with SWAT teams, as it lowers the risk of fire and explosions in "
"illegal laboratories.  With body armor in more common use, the MP5SD has "
"waned in popularity among special forces due to its decreased terminal "
"performance."
msgstr ""
"El H&K MP5SD ofrece un rendimiento subsónico en casi la misma huella que el "
"H&K MP5, manteniendo su manejabilidad. El gran supresor reduce en gran "
"medida el flash de la boca, ayudando en las operaciones nocturnas. También "
"ha tenido cierta popularidad entre los equipos SWAT, ya que reduce el riesgo"
" de incendios y explosiones en laboratorios ilegales. Con los chalecos "
"antibalas de uso más común, el MP5SD ha disminuido su popularidad entre las "
"fuerzas especiales debido a su menor rendimiento terminal."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K MP5K-PDW"
msgid_plural "H&K MP5K-PDWs"
msgstr[0] "H&K MP5K-PDW"
msgstr[1] "H&K MP5K-PDWs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Heckler & Koch MP5 is one of the most widely-used submachine guns in the"
" world, and has been adopted by special police forces and militaries alike."
"  Its high degree of accuracy and low recoil are universally praised.  The "
"MP5K-PDW model features a shorter barrel, a built-in foregrip, and a side "
"folding stock for vehicle or aircraft crew use."
msgstr ""
"La Heckler & Koch MP5 es una de las metralletas más utilizadas en el mundo, "
"y ha sido adoptada tanto por las fuerzas especiales de la policía como por "
"los militares. Su alto grado de precisión y bajo retroceso son "
"universalmente elogiados. El modelo MP5K-PDW tiene un cañón más corto, una "
"pinza integrada y una culata lateral plegable para uso de la tripulación de "
"vehículos o aeronaves."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "PTR 603"
msgid_plural "PTR 603s"
msgstr[0] "PTR 603"
msgstr[1] "PTR 603s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The PTR 603 is a semi-automatic copy of the famous MP5 series, domestically "
"produced for the US market on original Heckler and Koch tooling by PTR "
"Industries.  Like the MP5, its roller delayed blowback action offers smooth "
"shooting and precision, setting it apart from other submachine guns and "
"pistol caliber carbines.  This model is configured as a pistol to avoid "
"inconvenient and costly NFA regulations.  A welded on section of M1913 rail "
"offers convenient mounting for aftermarket optics, but precludes the use of "
"claw mounts."
msgstr ""
"El PTR 603 es una copia semiautomática de la famosa serie MP5, producida "
"nacionalmente para el mercado estadounidense en herramientas originales "
"Heckler y Koch de PTR Industries. Al igual que el MP5, su acción de "
"retroceso con rodillo retardado ofrece un disparo suave y preciso, lo que lo"
" diferencia de otras subfusiles y carabinas de calibre pistola. Este modelo "
"está configurado como una pistola para evitar las incómodas y costosas "
"regulaciones de la NFA. Una sección soldada del carril M1913 ofrece un "
"montaje conveniente para la óptica del mercado de accesorios, pero excluye "
"el uso de montajes de garras."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "H&K operational briefcase"
msgid_plural "H&K operational briefcases"
msgstr[0] "maletín de operaciones de H&K"
msgstr[1] "maletines de operaciones de H&K"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a hard-sided briefcase with a trigger in the handle and a concealed "
"hole in the side.  To fire the internally mounted MP5K-PDW, one braces the "
"briefcase at the waist, ensures the briefcase is pointed at the enemy, and "
"squeezes the trigger.  Precision and handling are severely hampered all "
"around, however if you need to 'hand over the goods' or look low profile "
"while bodyguarding, this is your gun.  When the briefcase is open the MP5 "
"may be reloaded or dismounted."
msgstr ""
"Este es un maletín de tapa dura con un gatillo en el mango y un agujero "
"oculto en el lateral. Para disparar el MP5K-PDW montado internamente, se "
"sujeta el maletín en la cintura, se asegura de que el maletín apunte al "
"enemigo y se aprieta el gatillo. La precisión y el manejo se ven severamente"
" obstaculizados por todos lados, sin embargo si necesitas \"entregar la "
"mercancía\" o mirar de bajo perfil mientras estás de guardaespaldas, esta es"
" tu arma. Cuando el maletín está abierto, el MP5 puede ser recargado o "
"desmontado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Luger P08"
msgid_plural "Luger P08s"
msgstr[0] "Luger P08"
msgstr[1] "Luger P08s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic 9x19mm pistol with an unusual toggle-lock action, well-"
"known for its use by Germans during both World Wars.  Notably accurate even "
"by modern standards."
msgstr ""
"Pistola semiautomática de 9x19mm con una inusual acción de cierre de "
"palanca, conocida por su uso por los alemanes durante las dos guerras "
"mundiales. Muy precisa, incluso para los estándares modernos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MP 18"
msgid_plural "MP 18s"
msgstr[0] "MP 18"
msgstr[1] "MP 18s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An early German submachine gun with wooden stock chambered for 9x19mm, "
"introduced near the end of First World War."
msgstr ""
"Uno de las primeras subfusiles alemanes con culata de madera con recámara de"
" 9x19 mm, introducida cerca del final de la Primera Guerra Mundial."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Broomhandle Mauser"
msgid_plural "Broomhandle Mausers"
msgstr[0] "Mauser C96"
msgstr[1] "Mauser C96"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A semi-automatic pistol with an integral magazine loaded from the top.  Red "
"'9' number burned and painted into the grip marks it as a variant chambered "
"for 9x19mm."
msgstr ""
"Pistola semiautomática con cargador integrado que se carga por la parte "
"superior. El número \"9\" rojo grabado y pintado en la empuñadura indica que"
" se trata de una variante con recámara de 9x19 mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "detachable-magazine Mauser"
msgid_plural "detachable-magazine Mausers"
msgstr[0] "Mauser con cargador extraíble"
msgstr[1] "Mausers con cargador extraíble"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a variant of the Mauser C96 pistol chambered for 9x19mm, which uses "
"a detachable magazine rather than an integral one."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una variante de la pistola Mauser C96 con recámara de 9x19mm, que "
"utiliza un cargador desmontable en lugar de uno integral."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MP 40"
msgid_plural "MP 40s"
msgstr[0] "MP 40"
msgstr[1] "MP 40"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a 9x19mm submachine gun with a folding stock, which was used "
"extensively during Second World War."
msgstr ""
"Este es un subfusil de 9x19mm con culata plegable, que fue muy utilizado "
"durante la Segunda Guerra Mundial."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "MP 40 Semi Auto"
msgid_plural "MP 40 Semi Autos"
msgstr[0] "MP 40 Semi Auto"
msgstr[1] "MP 40 Semi Autos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a modern semi-automatic replica of MP 40 SMG, without a stock, to "
"make it legally be considered a pistol.  It actually bears only a visual "
"resemblance to the original, differing substantially from originally "
"manufactured MP 40s in internal operations."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una réplica moderna semiautomática de la MP 40 SMG, sin culata, para"
" que sea considerada legalmente como una pistola. En realidad sólo tiene un "
"parecido visual con el original, difiriendo sustancialmente de los MP 40 "
"fabricados originalmente en su funcionamiento interno."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Kel-Tec SUB-2000"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec SUB-2000"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec SUB-2000"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec SUB-2000"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A uniquely designed pistol caliber carbine with an integral folding stock.  "
"It makes use of 9x19mm Glock magazines."
msgstr ""
"Es una carabina de diseño único con calibre de pistola y una culata "
"integrada plegable, que utiliza cargadores 9x19mm Glock."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Beretta M9A1"
msgid_plural "Beretta M9A1"
msgstr[0] "Beretta M9A1"
msgstr[1] "Beretta M9A1"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An iconic 9x19mm pistol, the M9 was the standard issue sidearm of US armed "
"force from 1985 only until recently.  It was formerly popular amongst law "
"enforcement before the advent of commercially available polymer-framed "
"handguns and the FBI's adoption of .40S&W."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola icónica de 9x19mm, la M9 fue el arma lateral estándar de las "
"fuerzas armadas de EE.UU. desde 1985 hasta hace poco. Fue muy popular entre "
"las fuerzas del orden antes de la llegada de las pistolas con armazón de "
"polímero disponibles en el mercado y la adopción por parte del FBI de la "
".40S&W."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Beretta Px4 Storm"
msgid_plural "Beretta Px4 Storms"
msgstr[0] "Beretta Px4 Storm"
msgstr[1] "Beretta Px4 Storms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lighter than Beretta's iconic 92 series of guns, the Px4 Storm was built by "
"utilizing light-weight polymer construction with steel inserts.  Its shape "
"was also optimized for concealed carry, while maintaining the reliability "
"the 92 series is known for."
msgstr ""
"Más ligera que la emblemática serie de pistolas 92 de Beretta, la Px4 Storm "
"se ha construido utilizando un polímero ligero con inserciones de acero. Su "
"forma también fue optimizada para el transporte oculto, manteniendo la "
"fiabilidad por la que es conocida la serie 92."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe rifle: 9x19mm"
msgid_plural "pipe rifles: 9x19mm"
msgstr[0] "rifle de tubo: 9x19mm"
msgstr[1] "rifles de tubo: 9x19mm"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Luty SMG: 9x19mm"
msgid_plural "Luty SMGs: 9x19mm"
msgstr[0] "Luty SMG: 9x19mm"
msgstr[1] "Luty SMG: 9x19mm"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Luty pattern makeshift smoothbore SMG crudely constructed out of various "
"steel parts using some of the more advanced powered hand tools; likely one "
"of the most complex guns that are feasible to make outside of a machine "
"shop, but still very unreliable.  This one is chambered for 9x19mm "
"cartridges and accepts STEN compatible magazines."
msgstr ""
"Un patrón de Luty hace que el SMG de cañón liso toscamente construido con "
"varias piezas de acero usando algunas de las herramientas manuales más "
"avanzadas; probablemente una de las armas más complejas que son factibles de"
" hacer fuera de un taller de máquinas, pero aún así muy poco fiable. Esta "
"tiene una cámara para cartuchos de 9x19mm y acepta cargadores compatibles "
"con STEN."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "STEN"
msgid_plural "STENs"
msgstr[0] "STEN"
msgstr[1] "STENs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A British submachine gun developed during World War II, to make up for "
"shortages of supplies.  Designed to be made using unskilled labor and not "
"known for reliability, its main advantages were low cost and being able to "
"use German 9mm ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Un subfusil británico desarrollado durante la II Guerra Mundial, para "
"compensar la escasez de suministros.  Diseñado para ser hecho con mano de "
"obra no cualificada y no conocido por su fiabilidad, sus principales "
"ventajas fueron su bajo coste y ser capaz de usar munición alemana de 9mm."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "TEC-9"
msgid_plural "TEC-9"
msgstr[0] "TEC-9"
msgstr[1] "TEC-9"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The TEC-9 is a machine pistol made of cheap polymers and machine stamped "
"parts.  Its rise in popularity among criminals is largely due to its "
"intimidating looks and low cost."
msgstr ""
"La TEC-9 es una pistola ametralladora hecha con polímeros baratos y con "
"partes troqueladas de metal. La popularidad entre los criminales fue a causa"
" de su apariencia intimidante y su bajo costo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "USP 9x19mm"
msgid_plural "USP 9x19mm"
msgstr[0] "USP 9x19mm"
msgstr[1] "USP 9x19mm"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Uzi 9x19mm"
msgid_plural "Uzi 9x19mm"
msgstr[0] "Uzi 9x19mm"
msgstr[1] "Uzi 9x19mm"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Uzi 9x19mm has enjoyed immense popularity, selling more units than any "
"other submachine gun.  It is widely used as a personal defense weapon, or as"
" a primary weapon by elite frontline forces."
msgstr ""
"La Uzi 9x19mm ha disfrutado de una popularidad inmensa, vendiendo más "
"unidades que cualquier otro subfusil. Es muy usada como arma de defensa "
"personal, o como arma primaria en las fuerzas fronterizas de elite."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 17"
msgid_plural "Glock 17s"
msgstr[0] "Glock 17"
msgstr[1] "Glock 17s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Designed for all shooters, the Glock 17 is marketed towards law-enforcement "
"and military."
msgstr ""
"Diseñada para los tiradores, la Glock 17 está orientada para uso de las "
"fuerzas de la ley y militares."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Glock 18C"
msgid_plural "Glock 18Cs"
msgstr[0] "Glock 18C"
msgstr[1] "Glock 18Cs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A selective fire variation on the Glock 17, originally designed for "
"Austria's EKO Cobra unit.  It has compensator cuts along its barrel to make "
"recoil more manageable."
msgstr ""
"Una variación de fuego selectivo en la Glock 17, originalmente diseñada para"
" la unidad Cobra EKO de Austria. Tiene cortes compensatorios a lo largo de "
"su cañón para hacer el retroceso más manejable."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Kel-Tec PF-9"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec PF-9s"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec PF-9"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec PF-9s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Kel-Tec PF-9 remains one of the most popular backup pistols due to its "
"history of reliability, affordability, and concealability.  Chambered in "
"9x19mm, recoil is best described as unpleasant, and follow-up shots are "
"difficult to place quickly."
msgstr ""
"La Kel-Tec PF-9 sigue siendo una de las pistolas de reserva más populares "
"debido a su historial de fiabilidad, asequibilidad y capacidad de "
"ocultamiento. Con una cámara de 9x19mm, el retroceso se describe mejor como "
"desagradable, y los disparos de seguimiento son difíciles de realizar "
"rápidamente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M11"
msgid_plural "M11s"
msgstr[0] "M11"
msgstr[1] "M11s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M11 is a compact semi-automatic, short recoil operated pistol, also "
"known as the P228."
msgstr ""
"La M11 es una pistola compacta semiautomática de retroceso corto, también "
"conocida como P228."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M17"
msgid_plural "M17s"
msgstr[0] "M17"
msgstr[1] "M17s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M17 is a semi-automatic, short recoil operated pistol derived from the "
"SIG Sauer P320."
msgstr ""
"La M17 es una pistola semiautomática, de retroceso corto, derivada de la SIG"
" Sauer P320."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M18"
msgid_plural "M18s"
msgstr[0] "M18"
msgstr[1] "M18s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The M18 is a compact, semi-automatic, short recoil operated pistol derived "
"from the SIG Sauer P320 Carry, used by US Armed Forces."
msgstr ""
"La M18 es una pistola compacta, semiautomática y de retroceso corto, "
"derivada de la SIG Sauer P320 Carry, utilizada por las Fuerzas Armadas "
"estadounidenses."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG P226 MK25"
msgid_plural "SIG P226 MK25s"
msgstr[0] "SIG P226 MK25"
msgstr[1] "SIG P226 MK25s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The P226 MK25 is a full-size semi-automatic DA/SA, short-recoil operated "
"pistol with corrosion resitant internal coating, and an engraved anchor on "
"the side of the slide."
msgstr ""
"La P226 MK25 es una pistola semiautomática DA/SA de tamaño completo, de "
"retroceso corto, con revestimiento interno resistente a la corrosión y un "
"ancla grabada en el lateral de la corredera."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "SIG Pro SP2022 9mm"
msgid_plural "SIG Pro SP2022 9mms"
msgstr[0] "SIG Pro SP2022 9mm"
msgstr[1] "SIG Pro SP2022 9mms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a polymer-frame, semi-automatic, DA/SA operated pistol, featuring a "
"Picatinny rail, and a Nitron stainless steel slide."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pistola con armazón de polímero, semiautomática, de "
"funcionamiento DA/SA, con carril Picatinny y corredera de acero inoxidable "
"Nitron."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Browning Hi-Power 9x19mm"
msgid_plural "Browning Hi-Power 9x19mms"
msgstr[0] "Browning Hi-Power 9x19mm"
msgstr[1] "Browning Hi-Power 9x19mms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Browning Hi-Power is a semi-automatic handgun developed shortly before "
"the second world war.  Widely issued since then, it remains in use by India,"
" Canada and Australia.  This is a commercial variant produced by Browning "
"Arms in 9x19mm Parabellum."
msgstr ""
"El Browning Hi-Power es una pistola semiautomática desarrollada poco antes "
"de la segunda guerra mundial. Ampliamente emitida desde entonces, sigue "
"siendo utilizada por la India, Canadá y Australia. Esta es una variante "
"comercial producida por Browning Arms en 9x19mm Parabellum."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Walther P38"
msgid_plural "Walther P38s"
msgstr[0] "Walther P38"
msgstr[1] "Walther P38s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Walther P38 is a semi-automatic handgun adopted shortly before the "
"second world war.  Developed due to the high production costs of its "
"predecessor, the Luger P08, the P38 is also chambered in 9mm Parabellum.  "
"This early DA/SA locked-breech design would introduce features later seen on"
" more modern firearms such as the Beretta 92 series, and served Germany "
"until 2004."
msgstr ""
"La Walther P38 es una pistola semiautomática adoptada poco antes de la "
"segunda guerra mundial. Desarrollada debido a los altos costos de producción"
" de su predecesora, la Luger P08, la P38 también está alojada en una "
"Parabellum de 9 mm. Este temprano diseño de cierre DA/SA introduciría "
"características que más tarde se verían en armas de fuego más modernas como "
"la serie Beretta 92, y sirvió a Alemania hasta 2004."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Walther PPQ 9mm"
msgid_plural "Walther PPQ 9mms"
msgstr[0] "Walther PPQ 9mm"
msgstr[1] "Walther PPQ 9mms"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Walther PPQ is a semi-automatic pistol originating from the Walther "
"P99QA, and maintains compatibility with some of its predecessor's "
"accessories.  This model is chambered in 9x19mm Parabellum."
msgstr ""
"La Walther PPQ es una pistola semiautomática originada en la Walther P99QA, "
"y mantiene la compatibilidad con algunos de los accesorios de su "
"predecesora. Este modelo tiene una cámara de 9x19mm Parabellum."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Hi-Point C-9"
msgid_plural "Hi-Point C-9s"
msgstr[0] "Hi-Point C-9"
msgstr[1] "Hi-Point C-9s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Hi-Point C-9 is a blowback operated semi-automatic pistol designed by "
"Hi-Point Firearms, which is known for making inexpensive firearms, and for "
"making said firearms bulky and uncomfortable.  Hi-Points have slides made "
"with a zinc pot-metal which is relatively fragile compared to steel slides."
msgstr ""
"La Hi-Point C-9 es una pistola semiautomática operada por retroceso diseñada"
" por Hi-Point Firearms, conocida por fabricar armas de fuego baratas y por "
"hacer dichas armas voluminosas e incómodas. Hi-Point tiene correderas hechos"
" con una aleación de zinc que es relativamente frágil comparado con las "
"correderas de acero."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CZ 75 B"
msgid_plural "CZ 75 Bs"
msgstr[0] "CZ 75 B"
msgstr[1] "CZ 75 Bs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The CZ 75 B is a semi-automatic pistol developed in Czechoslovakia, and is "
"one of the original wonder nines.  Though designed for export to western "
"countries, it was declared a state secret; lack of international patent "
"protection meant that many clones and variants were produced and distributed"
" around the world, with Česká zbrojovka only joining in the 90's.  This "
"pistol remains wildly popular among competition shooters."
msgstr ""
"La CZ 75 B es una pistola semiautomática desarrollada en Checoslovaquia, y "
"es una de las wonder nines originales. Aunque se diseñó para su exportación "
"a los países occidentales, fue declarada secreto de Estado; la falta de "
"protección internacional de patentes hizo que se produjeran y distribuyeran "
"muchos clones y variantes en todo el mundo, a los que sólo se sumó Česká "
"zbrojovka en los años 90. Esta pistola sigue siendo muy popular entre los "
"tiradores de competición."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Walther CCP"
msgid_plural "Walther CCPs"
msgstr[0] "Walther CCP"
msgstr[1] "Walther CCPs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Walther CCP is a gas-delayed blowback semi-automatic pistol intended for"
" the concealed carry consumer market.  Internally, it is nearly identical to"
" the cult classic H&K P7.  Its fixed barrel design makes it potentially more"
" accurate than many other pistols, though this may difficult to realize with"
" its average trigger and short sight radius."
msgstr ""
"La Walther CCP es una pistola semiautomática de retroceso retardado por gas "
"destinada al mercado de consumidores de transporte oculto. Internamente, es "
"casi idéntica al clásico de culto H&K P7. Su diseño de cañón fijo la hace "
"potencialmente más precisa que muchas otras pistolas, aunque esto puede ser "
"difícil de realizar con su gatillo medio y su radio de visión corto."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Colt Model 635"
msgid_plural "Colt Model 635s"
msgstr[0] "Colt Model 635"
msgstr[1] "Colt Model 635s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a 9x19mm submachine gun based on the M16 rifle design.  It is a "
"closed bolt, blowback operated gun.  There is a large plastic brass "
"deflector mounted by the ejection port, and there is no forward assist.  It "
"looks very similar to an M4 carbine, except for the magazine well that "
"accepts Uzi-style magazines."
msgstr ""
"Este es un subfusil de 9x19mm basado en el diseño del fusil M16. Es un arma "
"de cerrojo cerrado, operada por retroceso. Hay un gran deflector de latón "
"montado junto al puerto de eyección y no hay asistencia de avance. Su "
"aspecto es muy similar al de una carabina M4, excepto por el hueco del "
"cargador, que acepta cargadores de tipo Uzi."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "B&T APC9 PRO K"
msgid_plural "B&T APC9 PRO Ks"
msgstr[0] "B&T APC9 PRO K"
msgstr[1] "B&T APC9 PRO Ks"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Brügger & Thomet APC9 PRO K is a closed bolt blowback submachine gun in "
"9x19mm Parabellum.  It has a collapsible shoulder stock, and a red dot "
"sight."
msgstr ""
"La Brügger & Thomet APC9 PRO K es una subfusil de cerrojo cerrado y blowback"
" en 9x19mm Parabellum. Tiene una culata plegable y una mira de punto rojo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Makarov PM"
msgid_plural "Makarov PMs"
msgstr[0] "Makarov PM"
msgstr[1] "Makarov PM"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Pistolet Makarova was developed by the Soviet Union to replace the WWII-"
"era TT-33 pistol.  It uses the 9x18mm cartridge, which remains in use among "
"various former Soviet countries."
msgstr ""
"La Pistolet Makarova fue desarrollada por la Unión Soviética para reemplazar"
" la pistola TT-33 de la Segunda Guerra Mundial. Utiliza el cartucho de "
"9x18mm, que sigue siendo utilizado por varios países de la antigua Unión "
"Soviética."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Skorpion Vz. 82"
msgid_plural "Skorpion Vz. 82s"
msgstr[0] "Skorpion Vz. 82"
msgstr[1] "Skorpion Vz. 82s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A version of the Skorpion submachine gun chambered in 9x18mm Makarov, with a"
" slightly longer barrel than the original design."
msgstr ""
"Una versión del subfusil Skorpion de calibre 9x18mm Makarov, con un cañón "
"ligeramente más largo que el diseño original."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "BGM-71F TOW"
msgid_plural "BGM-71F TOW"
msgstr[0] "BGM-71F TOW"
msgstr[1] "BGM-71F TOW"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A launcher for anti-tank guided missiles, capable of being deployed as a "
"crew-served weapon or mounted on vehicles.  While fairly accurate, it isn't "
"fire-and-forget."
msgstr ""
"Es un lanzador de misiles anti-tanque guiados, capaz de ser desplegado como "
"arma de manejo en equipo, o montado en un vehículo. Aunque es bastante "
"preciso, no es cuestión de un disparo y listo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "bionic shotgun"
msgid_plural "bionic shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta biónica"
msgstr[1] "escopetas biónicas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic one-shot retracting shotgun integrated with your arm."
msgstr "Escopeta biónica de un solo disparo retráctil integrada en tu brazo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "laser finger"
msgid_plural "laser fingers"
msgstr[0] "dedo láser"
msgstr[1] "dedos láser"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Assault barbs"
msgid_plural "Assault barbs"
msgstr[0] "Púas de asalto"
msgstr[1] "Púas de asalto"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A homemade version of a crude precursor to the shotgun.  Able to fire just "
"about anything you put down the barrel, but it will degrade pretty quick."
msgstr ""
"Es una versión casera del precursor de la escopeta. Es capaz de disparar "
"casi cualquier cosa que le pongas por el tubo, pero se estropea rápidamente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "3-inch ordnance rifle"
msgid_plural "3-inch ordnance rifles"
msgstr[0] "fusiles de artillería de 3 pulgadas"
msgstr[1] "fusiles de artillería de 3 pulgadas"

#. ~ Description for 3-inch ordnance rifle
#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light cannon widely used in the American Civil War, noted for its "
"reliability."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón ligero muy utilizado en la Guerra de Secesión Estadounidense, que "
"destacó por su fiabilidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift chemical thrower"
msgid_plural "makeshift chemical throwers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador químico improvisado"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores químicos improvisados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bulky, self-made chemical sprayer with an internal conversion mechanism "
"that allows all sorts of chemicals to be dispersed to your surroundings."
msgstr ""
"Un voluminoso rociador químico, con un mecanismo de conversión interno que "
"permite rociar toda clase de químicos a tu alrededor."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "combination gun"
msgid_plural "combination guns"
msgstr[0] "pistola combinada"
msgstr[1] "pistolas combinadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A break action firearm comprised of a .30-06 barrel over two 12 gauge smooth"
" bore barrels.  Historically used by egomaniac hunters in Africa, now used "
"by their egomaniac descendants in New England."
msgstr ""
"Arma de cañón rompedora compuesta por un cañón .30-06 sobre dos cañones "
"suaves de calibre 12 gauge. Históricamente usada por los cazadores "
"egocéntricos en África, ahora es usada por los descendientes egocéntricos en"
" Nueva Inglaterra."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "PA md. 68 Battle Rifle"
msgid_plural "PA md. 68 Battle Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Rifle de Batalla 68 PA md."
msgstr[1] "Rifles de Batalla 68 PA md."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The most popular gun to use the 12.3ln cartridge was, of course, the PA md. "
"71.  Its predecessor, the md. 68, was viewed by many as a sort of failure: "
"although it was reliable and powerful, it was too heavy to be used as a good"
" infantry weapon, and not really heavy enough to be a good support gun.  "
"Enough were made, though, that during the zombie apocalypse, it gained a "
"great deal of resurgent popularity as a light emplacement gun that used "
"readily available ammunition.  It perfectly served the purposes of the "
"Exodii, who had far less concern about its unwieldiness."
msgstr ""
"El arma más popular que utilizaba el cartucho de 12,3ln era, por supuesto, "
"la PA md. 71. Su predecesor, el md. 68, fue visto por muchos como una "
"especie de fracaso: aunque era fiable y potente, era demasiado pesado para "
"ser utilizado como un buen arma de infantería, y no lo suficientemente "
"pesado para ser un buen arma de apoyo. Sin embargo, se fabricó lo suficiente"
" como para que, durante el apocalipsis zombi, ganara una gran popularidad "
"como arma ligera de emplazamiento que utilizaba munición fácilmente "
"disponible. Servía perfectamente a los propósitos de los Exodii, a quienes "
"les preocupaba mucho menos su falta de manejo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "PA md. 71 zombie hunting rifle"
msgid_plural "PA md. 71 zombie hunting rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de caza zombi 71 PA md."
msgstr[1] "rifles de caza zombi 71 PA md."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This extremely popular Romanian assault rifle, made famous in the third "
"Carpachian War, has been redesigned slightly by the Exodii to serve as a "
"sniper weapon.  It is well suited to precision shots against high-priority "
"targets.  This modified design fires an extremely rapid 5-shot burst, with "
"the goal of shredding the target and preventing revivification."
msgstr ""
"Este popularísimo fusil de asalto rumano, que se hizo famoso en la tercera "
"guerra de los Cárpatos, ha sido rediseñado ligeramente por los Exodii para "
"servir como arma de francotirador. Es muy adecuado para realizar disparos de"
" precisión contra objetivos de alta prioridad. Este diseño modificado "
"dispara una ráfaga extremadamente rápida de 5 disparos, con el objetivo de "
"destrozar el objetivo y evitar la revivificación."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "flamethrower"
msgid_plural "flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "lanzallamas"
msgstr[1] "lanzallamas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large flamethrower with substantial gas reserves.  Very menacing and "
"deadly."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzallamas grande con grandes reservas de combustible. Muy amenazante y "
"mortal."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM451 flamethrower"
msgid_plural "RM451 flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "lanzallama RM451"
msgstr[1] "lanzallamas RM451"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A military-grade combat flamethrower designed by Rivtech, the RM451 "
"flamethrower incorporates a cycling pressure rapid-feed fuel system with a "
"high-speed piezoelectric igniter.  Solidly built with durability in mind, it"
" serves as an incredibly destructive weapon in the right hands."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzallamas de combate de grado militar diseñado por Rivtech. El "
"lanzallamas RM451 incorpora un sistema de alimentación de combustible rápida"
" por presión cíclica, con un encendedor piezoeléctrico de alta velocidad. De"
" construcción sólida, en las manos adecuadas es una increíble arma de "
"destrucción."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "flintlock carbine"
msgid_plural "flintlock carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina de chispa"
msgstr[1] "carabinas de chispa"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This short rifle design once dominated the battlefields of ancient Europe, "
"and may yet re-earn its feared status due to its ease of handling and "
"ability to use easily-crafted ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Este rifle corto alguna vez dominó los campos de batalla en la antigua "
"Europa, y aún puede volver a ganarse el respeto debido a su fácil "
"manejabilidad y el uso de munición fácil de fabricar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "handmade double-barrel flintlock"
msgid_plural "handmade double-barrel flintlocks"
msgstr[0] "llave de chispa de doble cañón hechas a mano"
msgstr[1] "llaves de chispa de doble cañón hechas a mano"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a compact muzzle-loading rifle combining a pair of rudimentary "
"flintlock actions and two barrels.  Whereas an antique multiple-barrel "
"flintlock is an intricate work of gunsmithing, this weapon is simpler yet "
"still serviceable."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un rifle de avancarga compacto fruto de una combinación de un "
"par de acciones de chispa rudimentaria y dos barriles.  Mientras que una "
"chispa del múltiple barril antiguo es un intrincado trabajo de fabricantes "
"de armas, esta arma es más sencilla pero todavía útil."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "flintlock pistol"
msgid_plural "flintlock pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola de chispa"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de chispa"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A beautifully decorated flintlock pistol.  If using this doesn't make you "
"feel a pirate, nothing will."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola de chispas bellamente decorada. Si usar esto no te hace sentir "
"un pirata, nada lo hará."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "flintlock musket"
msgid_plural "flintlock muskets"
msgstr[0] "mosquete de chispa"
msgstr[1] "mosquetes de chispa"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For once, something *good* came back from the dead.  This ancient design "
"lacks the fire-rate of modern weapons, but packs as much punch as the best "
"of 'em and rewards the skilled shooter with easily-crafted ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Por una vez, algo *bueno* nos llegó de los muertos. Este diseño antiguo "
"carece del ritmo de disparo de las armas modernas, pero causa tanto daño "
"como la mejor, y premia al tirador habilidoso con una munición fácil de "
"fabricar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "flintlock rifle"
msgid_plural "flintlock rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de chispa"
msgstr[1] "rifles de chispa"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also called a Pennsylvania rifle, this long-barreled rifled flintlock gun "
"has significantly increased accuracy at the cost of taking even longer to "
"reload."
msgstr ""
"También llamado rifle Pennsylvania, este arma de cañón largo y rayado de "
"pedernal tiene una precisión significativamente mayor a costa de tardar aún "
"más en recargar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "barb launching organ"
msgid_plural "barb launching organs"
msgstr[0] "órgano lanzador de púas"
msgstr[1] "órganos lanzadores de púas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A mutated organ capable of launching bony barbs at great speed."
msgstr "Un órgano mutado capaz de lanzar púas óseas a gran velocidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "electric alien frond"
msgid_plural "electric alien fronds"
msgstr[0] "fronda eléctrica alienígena"
msgstr[1] "frondas eléctricas alienígenas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Electricity unnaturally arcs from the tips of this alien frond."
msgstr ""
"La electricidad se curva de forma antinatural desde las puntas de esta "
"fronda alienígena."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "hurled rubble"
msgid_plural "hurled rubbles"
msgstr[0] "escombro arrojado"
msgstr[1] "escombros arrojados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Stone at the ready to crush that which isn't part of the blob."
msgstr "Piedra lista para aplastar lo que no forma parte del glóbulo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "throw"
msgstr "tirar"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "mounted_laser"
msgid_plural "mounted_lasers"
msgstr[0] "laser_montado"
msgstr[1] "laseres_montados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "nail gun"
msgid_plural "nail guns"
msgstr[0] "pistola de clavos"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de clavos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tool used to drive nails into wood or other material.  It could also be "
"used as an ad-hoc weapon."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta utilizada para clavar clavos en la madera u otro material. "
"También puede ser usada como un arma ad-hoc."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "coilgun"
msgid_plural "coilguns"
msgstr[0] "cañón Gauss"
msgstr[1] "cañones Gauss"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A homemade gun, using electromagnets to accelerate a ferromagnetic "
"projectile to high velocity.  Powered by UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un arma casera que utiliza electromagnetos para acelerar el proyectil "
"ferromagnético a grandes velocidades. Se alimenta con un UPS."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Paintball gun"
msgid_plural "Paintball guns"
msgstr[0] "Pistola de paintball"
msgstr[1] "Pistolas de paintball"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A fairly harmless gun that shoots small paintballs."
msgstr "Un arma bastante inofensiva que dispara pequeñas bolas de pintura."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "12 gauge pistol"
msgid_plural "12 gauge pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola 12 gauge"
msgstr[1] "pistolas 12 gauge"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single shot pistol that loads 12 gauge shotgun shells, handcrafted from "
"scrap."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola de un disparo solo que utiliza los cartuchos de escopeta 12 "
"gauge. Está hecha a mano y con chatarra."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "12-gauge gatling gun"
msgid_plural "12-gauge gatling guns"
msgstr[0] "Ametralladora Gatling del 12-gauge"
msgstr[1] "Ametralladoras Gatling del 12-gauge"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An electrically driven six barrel gatling shotgun, fed from handmade cloth "
"belts.  Even properly mounted, this seems like an unwieldy beast, and the "
"six separate barrels make for difficult zeroing.  The externally driven "
"action means this is much less likely to jam."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta eléctrica de seis cañones, alimentada por cinturones de tela "
"hechos a mano. Incluso montada correctamente, parece una bestia poco "
"manejable, y los seis cañones separados hacen difícil la puesta a cero. La "
"acción externa significa que es mucho menos probable que se atasque."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "handmade lever shotgun"
msgid_plural "handmade lever shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de palanca casera"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de palanca caseras"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short, homemade lever-action shotgun with a small internal tube magazine."
"  While still a primitive design - made from a pipe and a plank - it is a "
"formidable shotgun in its own right with room for improvement."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta corta de palanca de fabricación casera con un pequeño cargador "
"de tubo interno. Aunque sigue siendo un diseño primitivo -hecho con un tubo "
"y un tablón-, es una escopeta formidable por derecho propio con margen de "
"mejora."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "14-round tube shotgun"
msgid_plural "14-round tube shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de tubo de 14"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de tubo de 14"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shotgun uses a system of 2 tube magazines to carry 14 rounds of 12 "
"gauge shot.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but this offers the "
"option of loading different ammunition for different situations."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta utiliza un sistema de cargadores de 2 tubos para cargar 14 "
"cartuchos de calibre 12. Cada tubo tiene que ser cargado por separado, pero "
"esto ofrece la opción de cargar diferentes municiones para diferentes "
"situaciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Kel-Tec KSG"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec KSG"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec KSG"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec KSG"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG uses a pair of magazine tubes"
" to increase its capacity.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but this "
"offers the option of loading different ammunition for different situations."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta bullpup de acción de bombeo, la Kel-Tec KSG utiliza un par "
"de tubos cargadores para aumentar su capacidad. Cada tubo debe ser cargado "
"por separado, pero esto brinda la posibilidad de cargar diferente munición "
"para diferentes situaciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "24-round tube shotgun"
msgid_plural "24-round tube shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de tubo de 24"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de tubo de 24"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shotgun uses a system of 2 tube magazines to carry 24 rounds of 12 "
"gauge shot.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but this offers the "
"option of loading different ammunition for different situations."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta utiliza un sistema de cargadores de 2 tubos para cargar 24 "
"cartuchos de calibre 12. Cada tubo tiene que ser cargado por separado, pero "
"esto ofrece la opción de cargar diferentes municiones para diferentes "
"situaciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
msgid_plural "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
msgstr[0] "Kel-Tec KSG-25"
msgstr[1] "Kel-Tec KSG-25"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bullpup pump-action shotgun, the Kel-Tec KSG-25 uses a pair of magazine "
"tubes to increase its capacity.  Each tube has to be loaded separately, but "
"this offers the option of loading different ammunition for different "
"situations.  The big brother of the KSG, it has a longer barrel and longer "
"magazine tubes."
msgstr ""
"La Kel-Tec KSG-25, una escopeta de acción de bomba, utiliza un par de tubos "
"de cargador para aumentar su capacidad. Cada tubo tiene que ser cargado por "
"separado, pero esto ofrece la opción de cargar diferentes municiones para "
"diferentes situaciones. El hermano mayor de la KSG, tiene un cañón más largo"
" y tubos de cargador más largos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "6-round shotgun"
msgid_plural "6-round shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de 6"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de 6"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "This is a shotgun with capacity for 6 rounds of 12 gauge shot."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una escopeta con capacidad para 6 cartuchos de disparo del calibre "
"12."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mossberg 500 Field"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 500 Field"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 500 Field"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 500 Field"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 500 is a popular series of pump-action shotguns, often acquired"
" for military use.  It is noted for its high durability and low recoil.  "
"This one is fitted with a 28 inch barrel with sight rib."
msgstr ""
"La Mossberg 500 es una popular serie de escopetas de acción de bombeo, a "
"menudo adquirida para uso militar. Se destaca por su alta durabilidad y bajo"
" retroceso. Esta está equipada con un cañón de 28 pulgadas con una mira."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mossberg 500 Security"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 500 Security"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 500 Security"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 500 Security"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 500 is a popular series of pump-action shotguns, often acquired"
" for military use.  It is noted for its high durability and low recoil.  "
"This one is fitted with an 18.5 inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"La Mossberg 500 es una popular serie de escopetas de acción de bombeo, a "
"menudo adquirida para uso militar. Se destaca por su alta durabilidad y bajo"
" retroceso. Esta está equipada con un cañón de 18,5 pulgadas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "9-round shotgun"
msgid_plural "9-round shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de 9"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de 9"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "This is a shotgun with capacity for 9 rounds of 12 gauge shot"
msgstr ""
"Esta es una escopeta con capacidad para 9 cartuchos de disparo del calibre "
"12."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mossberg 590A1"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 590A1"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 590A1"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 590A1"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Mossberg 590A1 is a military and police oriented version of the Mossberg"
" 500.  It features a heavier barrel, a bayonet lug, and a different magazine"
" tube for easier cleaning and maintenance."
msgstr ""
"El Mossberg 590A1 es una versión orientada a la policía y al ejército del "
"Mossberg 500. Tiene un cañón más pesado, un cierre de bayoneta y un tubo de "
"cargador diferente para facilitar la limpieza y el mantenimiento."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Franchi SPAS-12"
msgid_plural "Franchi SPAS-12s"
msgstr[0] "Franchi SPAS-12"
msgstr[1] "Franchi SPAS-12s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mean and intimidating looking, the SPAS 12 has the dubious honor of being "
"declared a destructive device and being banned from import by name, adding "
"to its already considerable appeal.  It is a combination pump-action and "
"semi-automatic firearm, with an arm stabilizing hook for one handed "
"shooting."
msgstr ""
"De aspecto mezquino e intimidante, el SPAS 12 tiene el dudoso honor de ser "
"declarado un dispositivo destructivo y de que se le prohíba su importación "
"por su nombre, lo que se añade a su ya considerable atractivo. Es una "
"combinación de bomba de acción y arma de fuego semi-automática, con un "
"gancho estabilizador de brazo para disparar con una sola mano."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "8-round shotgun"
msgid_plural "8-round shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de 8"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de 8"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "This is a shotgun with capacity for 8 rounds of 12 gauge shot"
msgstr ""
"Esta es una escopeta con capacidad para 8 cartuchos de disparo del calibre "
"12."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mossberg 930 SPX"
msgid_plural "Mossberg 930 SPXs"
msgstr[0] "Mossberg 930 SPX"
msgstr[1] "Mossberg 930 SPXs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This semi-automatic offering from Mossberg features a recoil reducing gas "
"system, rifle style sights and a factory-installed picatinny rail.  "
"Affordable pricing and decent ergonomics make this a popular entry-level "
"3-gun shotgun."
msgstr ""
"Esta oferta semiautomática de Mossberg cuenta con un sistema de gas reductor"
" de retroceso, miras tipo rifle y un riel picatinny instalado de fábrica. Un"
" precio asequible y una ergonomía decente la convierten en una popular "
"escopeta de 3 cañones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1014 shotgun"
msgid_plural "M1014 shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta M1014"
msgstr[1] "escopetas M1014"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Benelli's first gas-operated shotgun, featuring dual pistons for enhanced "
"reliability with various loads and a collapsible buttstock that reduces "
"length by almost 8 inches.  Adopted in 1999 as the M1014 Joint Service "
"Combat Shotgun, the Benelli M4 is one of the finest combat shotguns "
"available."
msgstr ""
"La primera escopeta de gas de Benelli, con pistones dobles para una mayor "
"fiabilidad con varias cargas y una culata plegable que reduce la longitud en"
" casi 8 pulgadas. Adoptada en 1999 como la Escopeta de Combate de Servicio "
"Conjunto M1014, la Benelli M4 es una de las mejores escopetas de combate "
"disponibles."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "double-barrel pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "double-barrel pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de caño de doble cañón"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de caño de doble cañón"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A home-made double-barreled shotgun.  It is simply two pipes attached to a "
"stock, with a pair of hammers to strike the two rounds it holds."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta de doble cañón hecha en casa. Son simplemente dos tubos con una"
" culata y un par de percutores para golpear las dos balas que contiene."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de tubo"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de tubo"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A home-made shotgun.  It is simply a pipe attached to a stock, with a hammer"
" to strike the single round it holds."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta hecha en casa. Es simplemente un tubo con una culata y un "
"percutor para golpear la bala que contiene."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "5-round shotgun"
msgid_plural "5-round shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de 5"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de 5"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "This is a shotgun with capacity for 5 rounds of 12 gauge shot."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una escopeta con capacidad para 5 cartuchos de disparo del calibre "
"12."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington 870 Wingmaster"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 Wingmaster"
msgstr[0] "Remington 870 Wingmaster"
msgstr[1] "Remington 870 Wingmaster"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is"
" a 28 inch barreled model for hunting fowl and game."
msgstr ""
"Con más de 10 millones de unidades fabricadas, la Remington 870 es una de "
"las escopetas más populares del mercado, y se utiliza tanto para cazadores "
"como para las fuerzas del orden gracias a su gran precisión y velocidad de "
"cañón. Este es un modelo con cañón de 28 pulgadas para la caza de aves y "
"animales de caza."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington 1100 competition"
msgid_plural "Remington 1100 competitions"
msgstr[0] "Remington 1100 competition"
msgstr[1] "Remington 1100 competitions"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This semi-automatic shotgun features a self compensating gas system that "
"will feed a wide array of shells while also reducing recoil.  Introduced in "
"1963, it is favored by law enforcement, hunters and competition shooters, "
"and has been the best-selling autoloading shotgun in U.S. history.  This is "
"the nickel finished, teflon coated competition model, with a full length "
"magazine tube and 30 inch barrel."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta semiautomática cuenta con un sistema de gas autocompensado que"
" alimentará una amplia gama de proyectiles y reducirá el retroceso. "
"Introducida en 1963, es la favorita de las fuerzas del orden, los cazadores "
"y los tiradores de competición, y ha sido la escopeta de carga automática "
"más vendida en la historia de los Estados Unidos. Este es el modelo de "
"competición con acabado de níquel y recubrimiento de teflón, con un tubo de "
"cargador de longitud completa y un cañón de 30 pulgadas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Browning Auto 5"
msgid_plural "Browning Auto 5s"
msgstr[0] "Browning Auto 5"
msgstr[1] "Browning Auto 5s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This humble looking shotgun was the earliest successful semi-automatic "
"shotgun, and the second most successful in U.S. history, with over 2.7 "
"million made between 1902 and 1998.  The recoil tuning mechanism under the "
"handguard and long dwell time of the action make for pleasant shooting."
msgstr ""
"Esta humilde escopeta fue la primera escopeta semiautomática exitosa, y la "
"segunda más exitosa en la historia de los EE.UU., con más de 2,7 millones "
"fabricadas entre 1902 y 1998. El mecanismo de ajuste de retroceso bajo el "
"guardamanos y el largo tiempo de permanencia de la acción hacen que el "
"disparo sea agradable."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "breaching shotgun"
msgid_plural "breaching shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de brecha"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de brecha"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shotgun has a short barrel and no stock, and is set up for breaching "
"doors.  It is small enough to carry as a secondary weapon, but has fairly "
"unpleasant recoil and no sights."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta tiene un cañón corto y no tiene culata, y está preparada para "
"abrir puertas. Es lo suficientemente pequeña como para llevarla como arma "
"secundaria, pero tiene un retroceso bastante desagradable y no tiene miras."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington 870 MCS"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 MCSs"
msgstr[0] "Remington 870 MCS"
msgstr[1] "Remington 870 MCSs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This Remington 870 Modular Combat System shotgun is currently setup for "
"breaching operations, with a 10 inch barrel and no stock.  It is small "
"enough to carry as a secondary weapon, specifically to pop open any pesky "
"doors you might come across.  The grip's design makes for controllable yet "
"unpleasant recoil, and the barrel lacks any sights."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta del Sistema Modular de Combate Remington 870 está actualmente "
"preparada para operaciones de brecha, con un cañón de 10 pulgadas y sin "
"culata. Es lo suficientemente pequeña como para llevarla como arma "
"secundaria, específicamente para abrir cualquier puerta molesta con la que "
"te encuentres. El diseño de la empuñadura hace que el retroceso sea "
"controlable pero desagradable, y el cañón no tiene ninguna mira."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "7-round shotgun"
msgid_plural "7-round shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de 7"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de 7"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "This is a shotgun with capacity for 7 rounds of 12 gauge shot."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una escopeta con capacidad para 7 cartuchos de disparo del calibre "
"12."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Remington 870 express"
msgid_plural "Remington 870 expresses"
msgstr[0] "Remington 870 express"
msgstr[1] "Remington 870 expresses"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With over 10 million made, the Remington 870 is one of the most popular "
"shotguns on the market, and finds use with hunters and law enforcement "
"agencies alike thanks to its high accuracy and muzzle velocity.  This one is"
" an 18.5 inch barreled defensive model."
msgstr ""
"Con más de 10 millones de unidades fabricadas, la Remington 870 es una de "
"las escopetas más populares del mercado, y se utiliza tanto para cazadores "
"como para las fuerzas del orden gracias a su gran precisión y velocidad de "
"cañón. Esta es un modelo defensivo con cañón de 18,5 pulgadas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "shotgun revolver"
msgid_plural "shotgun revolvers"
msgstr[0] "revólver escopeta"
msgstr[1] "revólveres escopeta"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shotgun modified to use a revolver cylinder mechanism, it can hold 6 "
"cartridges."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta modificada para usar el mecanismo de cilindro de un "
"revólver, puede almacenar 6 cartuchos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Saiga shotgun"
msgid_plural "Saiga shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta Saiga"
msgstr[1] "escopetas Saiga"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "This shotgun is chambered in 12 gauge, and accepting Saiga magazines."
msgstr "Esta escopeta tiene cámara de calibre 12, y acepta cargadores Saiga."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Saiga-12"
msgid_plural "Saiga-12s"
msgstr[0] "Saiga-12"
msgstr[1] "Saiga-12"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Saiga-12 is a semi-automatic shotgun designed on the same Kalashnikov "
"pattern as the AK47 rifle.  It reloads with a magazine, rather than one "
"shell at a time like most shotguns.  It is one of the last designs of "
"Mikhail Kalashnikov, and was popular in open division shotgun competitions "
"prior to its ban from import via executive order."
msgstr ""
"El Saiga-12 es una escopeta semiautomática diseñada con el mismo patrón de "
"Kalashnikov que el rifle AK47. Se recarga con un cargador, en lugar de un "
"cartucho a la vez como la mayoría de las escopetas. Es uno de los últimos "
"diseños de Mikhail Kalashnikov, y fue popular en las competiciones de "
"escopeta de división abierta antes de su prohibición de importación por "
"orden ejecutiva."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "double barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "double barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de doble cañón"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de doble cañón"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An old shotgun, possibly antique.  It is little more than a pair of barrels,"
" a wood stock, and a hammer to strike the cartridges."
msgstr ""
"Una vieja escopeta, posiblemente una antigüedad. Es prácticamente un par de "
"cañones, una culata de madera y un percutor para pegarle a los cartuchos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "single barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "single barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de un cañón"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de un cañón"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An old shotgun, possibly antique.  It is little more than a barrel, a wood "
"stock, and a hammer to strike the cartridge.  Its simple design keeps it "
"both light and accurate."
msgstr ""
"Una vieja escopeta, posiblemente una antigüedad. Es prácticamente un cañón, "
"una culata de madera y un percutor para pegarle al cartucho. Su diseño "
"simple la hace ligera y precisa."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "automatic shotgun"
msgid_plural "automatic shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta automática"
msgstr[1] "escopetas automáticas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shotgun, deemed a destructive device, resembles a comically oversized "
"revolver.  It can hold 12 rounds of 12 gauge shot, and fire all of them in "
"under 3 seconds"
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta, considerada un artefacto destructivo, se asemeja a un "
"revólver cómicamente sobredimensionado. Puede contener 12 balas de calibre "
"12 y dispararlas todas en menos de 3 segundos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Cobray Streetsweeper"
msgid_plural "Cobray Streetsweepers"
msgstr[0] "Cobray Streetsweeper"
msgstr[1] "Cobray Streetsweepers"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Less shotgun and more comically oversized revolver, the Cobray Streetsweeper"
" sold poorly before it was deemed a destructive device.  The cylinder is "
"driven by a clockspring, cannot be indexed by hand, and must be ejected with"
" an ejector rod.  Its unique design allows for all 12 shells to be fired in "
"under 3 seconds, as demonstrated by the ATF technical branch."
msgstr ""
"Menos escopeta y más revólver cómicamente sobredimensionado, el Cobray "
"Streetsweeper se vendió mal antes de ser considerado un dispositivo "
"destructivo. El cilindro es impulsado por un resorte de reloj, no puede ser "
"indexado a mano, y debe ser expulsado con una varilla eyectora. Su diseño "
"único permite que los 12 proyectiles se disparen en menos de 3 segundos, "
"como lo demuestra la rama técnica de la ATF."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "15-round tube fed shotgun"
msgid_plural "15-round tube fed shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de tubo alimentado de 15"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de tubo alimentado de 15"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shotgun uses a system of 3 tube magazines to hold 15 rounds of 12 gauge"
" shots, in a relatively small firearm.  Each tube has to be loaded "
"separately, but this offers the option of loading different ammunition for "
"different situations."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta utiliza un sistema de cargadores de 3 tubos para contener 15 "
"cartuchos de calibre 12, en un arma relativamente pequeña. Cada tubo tiene "
"que ser cargado por separado, pero esto ofrece la opción de cargar "
"diferentes municiones para diferentes situaciones."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Tavor TS12"
msgid_plural "Tavor TS12s"
msgstr[0] "Tavor TS12"
msgstr[1] "Tavor TS12s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a triple tube magazine fed, gas-operated bullpup shotgun of Israeli "
"Weapon Industries make.  It is capable of loading 15 shells, all in a "
"relatively small package.  Like many other modern IWI designs, this looks "
"more like a sci-fi prop gun than a firearm.  An integral top rail is "
"provided for mounting sights."
msgstr ""
"Es un cargador de triple tubo alimentado por gas de la marca de Israel "
"Weapon Industries. Es capaz de cargar 15 proyectiles, todos en un paquete "
"relativamente pequeño. Como muchos otros diseños modernos de IWI, esto "
"parece más un arma de ciencia ficción que un arma de fuego. Se proporciona "
"un riel superior integral para montar las miras."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "6-round lever-action shotgun"
msgid_plural "6-round lever-action shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de palanca de 6"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de palanca de 6"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a lever-action shotgun with a very short barrel, and no stock, "
"accepting 6 rounds of 12 gauge shot.  It would pair nicely with a motorcycle"
" jacket and a Harley Davidson."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una escopeta de palanca con un cañón muy corto y sin culata, que "
"acepta 6 cartuchos de calibre 12. Quedaría muy bien con una chaqueta de moto"
" y una Harley Davidson."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "1887 bootleg shotgun"
msgid_plural "1887 bootleg shotguns"
msgstr[0] "réplica de escopeta 1887"
msgstr[1] "réplicas de escopetas 1887"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the first commercially successful repeating shotguns, the Winchester "
"1887 was specifically made lever-action at Winchester's request.  Though "
"later overshadowed in success by pump designs, the 1887 remains popular "
"today.  This one has a very short barrel, no stock, and would pair nicely "
"with a motorcycle jacket and a Harley Davidson."
msgstr ""
"Una de las primeras escopetas de repetición de éxito comercial, la "
"Winchester 1887 se hizo específicamente de palanca a petición de Winchester."
" Aunque más tarde se vio eclipsada en su éxito por los diseños de bombas, la"
" 1887 sigue siendo popular hoy en día. Esta tiene un cañón muy corto, sin "
"culata, y se combinaría muy bien con una chaqueta de motocicleta y una "
"Harley Davidson."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "trench shotgun"
msgid_plural "trench shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de trinchera"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de trinchera"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This shotgun comes attached with a large bayonet, as though it comes "
"straight from the trenches of World War 1.  There aren't any more trenches "
"to clear, so the next zombie-infested town will have to suffice."
msgstr ""
"Esta escopeta viene acoplada con una gran bayoneta, como si viniera "
"directamente de las trincheras de la Primera Guerra Mundial. No hay más "
"trincheras que limpiar, así que la próxima ciudad infestada de zombis tendrá"
" que ser suficiente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M1897 Trench Gun"
msgid_plural "M1897 Trench Guns"
msgstr[0] "Escopeta de trinchera M1897"
msgstr[1] "Escopetas de trinchera M1897"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Winchester 1897 was one of the first commercially-successful pump-action"
" shotguns.  In its 'trench' configuration it has become a heavily-"
"romanticized American icon of World War 1.  With its barrel shroud, bayonet "
"lug, and 17 inch bayonet, this shotgun is undeniably fearsome in appearance."
"  There aren't any more trenches to clear, so the next zombie-infested town "
"will have to suffice."
msgstr ""
"La Winchester 1897 fue una de las primeras escopetas de acción de bombeo "
"exitosas. En esta configuración 'de trinchera' ha sido romantizada como un "
"ícono estadounidense de la Primera Guerra Mundial. Con su cubierta de cañón,"
" agarradera para bayoneta y bayoneta de 43 centímetros, esta escopeta es "
"innegablemente temida por su apariencia. No hay más trincheras que limpiar, "
"así que la próxima ciudad infestada de zombis tendrá que ser suficiente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "slam-fire pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "slam-fire pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de cañón de disparo rápido"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de cañón de disparo rápido"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crude shotgun, composed of two thick steel pipes, an end cap and a nail.  "
"The lack of sights make this weapon only useful at point-blank range."
msgstr ""
"Una tosca escopeta, compuesta por dos gruesos tubos de acero, una tapa y un "
"clavo. La falta de miras hace que esta arma sólo sea útil a quemarropa."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "double slam-fire pipe shotgun"
msgid_plural "double slam-fire pipe shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de cañón de doble tiro"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de cañón de doble tiro"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crude shotgun, composed of four thick steel pipes, two end caps and two "
"nails.  The lack of sights make this weapon only useful at point-blank "
"range."
msgstr ""
"Una tosca escopeta, compuesta por cuatro gruesos tubos de acero, dos tapones"
" y dos clavos. La falta de miras hace que esta arma sólo sea útil a "
"quemarropa."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "flaregun"
msgid_plural "flareguns"
msgstr[0] "pistola de bengalas"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de bengalas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A plastic single shot pistol that can be loaded with signal flares."
msgstr ""
"Es una pistola de plástico de un disparo solo que puede ser cargada con "
"bengalas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "XM34 EMP projector"
msgid_plural "XM34 EMP projectors"
msgstr[0] "proyector XM34 PEM"
msgstr[1] "proyectores XM34 PEM"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful electrolaser developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\".  "
"Especially effective against electronic targets."
msgstr ""
"Es un poderoso electroláser desarrollado por R&D \"Aerial Labs\". Es "
"especialmente efectivo contra objetivos electrónicos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CMES laser cannon"
msgid_plural "CMES laser cannons"
msgstr[0] "Cañón láser CMES"
msgstr[1] "Cañones láser CMES"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is the integral weapon system for the CMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a "
"rotating-barrel actively-cooled rapid-fire laser system."
msgstr ""
"Este es el sistema de armamento integral del exoesqueleto CMES, un sistema "
"láser de cañón giratorio y refrigeración activa de disparo rápido."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RMES marksman system"
msgid_plural "RMES marksman systems"
msgstr[0] "Sistema de puntería RMES"
msgstr[1] "Sistemas de puntería RMES"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is the integral weapon system for the RMES exoskeleton mech-suit, a "
"quiet and accurate marksman laser rifle."
msgstr ""
"Este es el sistema integral de armas para el exoesqueleto RMES mech-suit, un"
" silencioso y preciso rifle láser para tiradores."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A7 laser rifle"
msgid_plural "A7 laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle láser A7"
msgstr[1] "rifles láser A7"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art laser rifle developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\"."
"  Initial performance rivaled Rivtech's finest, with rumors flying about "
"corporate skulduggery.  Though the Cataclysm put that on the ash heap of "
"history, this weapon can still do the same to your foes."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle láser de última generación desarrollado por el equipo de I+D "
"\"Aerial Labs\". El rendimiento inicial rivalizaba con el mejor de Rivtech, "
"con rumores de trampas corporativas. Aunque el Cataclismo lo puso en el "
"montón de cenizas de la historia, esta arma puede hacer lo mismo con sus "
"enemigos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "hm12 dazzle rifle"
msgid_plural "hm12 dazzle rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle deslumbrante hm12"
msgstr[1] "rifles deslumbrantes hm12"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This prototype 'energy weapon' was apparently manufactured by Hub 01.  It "
"somewhat resembles an oversize radar gun, mounted on a rectangular frame of "
"white sheet metal.  It will temporarily stun robots, if you manage to hit "
"their sensors with a clean shot."
msgstr ""
"Este prototipo de \"arma de energía\" fue aparentemente fabricado por el Hub"
" 01. Se parece a una pistola de radar de gran tamaño, montada en un marco "
"rectangular de chapa blanca. Aturde temporalmente a los robots, si consigues"
" impactar en sus sensores con un disparo limpio."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "V29 laser pistol"
msgid_plural "V29 laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola láser V29"
msgstr[1] "pistolas láser V29"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This V29 laser pistol was one of the first handheld laser weapons.  It is "
"larger than most traditional handguns, but has no recoil whatsoever."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola láser V29 fue una de las primeras armas láser de mano. Es más "
"grande que la mayoría de las armas de mano tradicionales, pero no tiene "
"ningún tipo de retroceso."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "survival bow"
msgid_plural "survival bows"
msgstr[0] "arco de supervivencia"
msgstr[1] "arcos de supervivencia"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A weak bow crudely crafted from a single uncured wood stave.  Weak and "
"wildly inaccurate, but easy to make."
msgstr ""
"Un arco débil fabricado toscamente con una sola duela de madera sin curar. "
"Débil y tremendamente impreciso, pero fácil de fabricar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "short bow"
msgid_plural "short bows"
msgstr[0] "arco corto"
msgstr[1] "arcos cortos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Emphasizing portability and agility over power, this all-wood bow is "
"suitable for small game and harassing enemies."
msgstr ""
"Haciendo hincapié en la portabilidad y la agilidad por encima de la "
"potencia, este arco totalmente de madera es adecuado para la caza menor y "
"para acosar a los enemigos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "compound hunting bow"
msgid_plural "compound hunting bows"
msgstr[0] "arco de caza compuesto"
msgstr[1] "arcos de caza compuestos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A high-powered bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots"
" that can be used effectively by fairly strong archers.  Currently set to a "
"medium weight."
msgstr ""
"Un arco de alta potencia con levas perfiladas y cables adicionales para "
"disparos de alta velocidad que pueden ser utilizados eficazmente por "
"arqueros bastante fuertes. Actualmente está ajustado a un peso medio."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "compound hunting bow (high)"
msgid_plural "compound hunting bows (high)"
msgstr[0] "arco de caza compuesto (peso alto)"
msgstr[1] "arcos de caza compuestos (peso alto)"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A high-powered bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots"
" that can be used effectively by very strong archers.  Currently set to a "
"high weight, and ready to cause some real damage - if you can draw it."
msgstr ""
"Un arco de gran potencia con levas moldeadas y cables adicionales para "
"disparos de alta velocidad que pueden ser utilizados eficazmente por "
"arqueros muy fuertes. Actualmente está ajustado a un peso elevado, y está "
"preparado para causar un daño real... si puedes tensarlo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "compound hunting bow (low)"
msgid_plural "compound hunting bows (low)"
msgstr[0] "arco de caza compuesto (peso bajo)"
msgstr[1] "arcos de caza compuestos (peso bajo)"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A high-powered bow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-velocity shots"
" that can be used effectively by average archers.  Currently set to a low "
"weight, making it much easier to draw."
msgstr ""
"Un arco de gran potencia con levas perfiladas y cables adicionales para "
"disparos de alta velocidad que pueden ser utilizados eficazmente por "
"arqueros medios. Actualmente está ajustado a un peso bajo, lo que facilita "
"mucho el tiro."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "composite bow (heavy)"
msgid_plural "composite bows (heavy)"
msgstr[0] "arco compuesto (peso alto)"
msgstr[1] "arcos compuestos (peso alto)"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A traditionally-constructed bow made from wood, horn and sinew.  It has a "
"rather high draw weight."
msgstr ""
"Arco de construcción tradicional, hecho de madera, cuerno y tendones. Tiene "
"un peso elevado de tiro."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "composite bow (light)"
msgid_plural "composite bows (light)"
msgstr[0] "arco compuesto (peso bajo)"
msgstr[1] "arcos compuestos (peso bajo)"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A traditionally-constructed bow made from wood, horn and sinew.  It has a "
"moderate draw weight."
msgstr ""
"Un arco de construcción tradicional, hecho de madera, cuerno y tendón. Tiene"
" un peso de tiro moderado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "modern recurve bow"
msgid_plural "modern recurve bows"
msgstr[0] "arco recurvo moderno"
msgstr[1] "arcos recurvos modernos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern fiberglass bow that can be used effectively by those of somewhat "
"above-average strength."
msgstr ""
"Un arco moderno de fibra de vidrio que puede ser utilizado eficazmente por "
"quienes tienen una fuerza algo superior a la media."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "longbow"
msgid_plural "longbows"
msgstr[0] "arco largo"
msgstr[1] "arcos largos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A six-foot wooden hunting bow in the English style.  It can be used "
"effectively by those of above-average strength."
msgstr ""
"Un arco moderno de fibra de vidrio que puede ser utilizado eficazmente por "
"quienes tienen una fuerza algo superior a la media."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "wooden greatbow"
msgid_plural "wooden greatbows"
msgstr[0] "gran arco de madera"
msgstr[1] "grandes arcos de madera"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An extremely large, stiff longbow, made with enormous limbs and a thick "
"string to take an immense amount of energy.  Takes incredible strength to "
"draw."
msgstr ""
"Un arco largo extremadamente grande y rígido, fabricado con extremidades "
"enormes y una cuerda gruesa para soportar una inmensa cantidad de energía. "
"Requiere una fuerza increíble para tensarlo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "compound greatbow"
msgid_plural "compound greatbows"
msgstr[0] "gran arco de poleas"
msgstr[1] "grandes arcos de poleas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An extremely large, powerful compound bow, made with enormous limbs and a "
"thick string to take an immense amount of energy.  Takes incredible strength"
" to draw."
msgstr ""
"Un arco largo extremadamente grande y rígido, fabricado con extremidades "
"enormes y una cuerda gruesa para soportar una inmensa cantidad de energía. "
"Requiere una fuerza increíble para tensarlo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Olympic style target bow"
msgid_plural "Olympic style target bows"
msgstr[0] "Arco de tiro olímpico"
msgstr[1] "Arcos de tiro olímpico"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A highly refined, modern bow, but not all that useful, as the draw weight is"
" very low."
msgstr ""
"Un arco muy refinado y moderno, pero no tan útil, ya que el peso de tiro es "
"muy bajo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "bullet crossbow"
msgid_plural "bullet crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta de bala"
msgstr[1] "ballestas de bala"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modified version of the classic crossbow which utilizes stones as "
"projectiles instead of the traditional quarrel.  Primarily intended for "
"hunting small game."
msgstr ""
"Una versión modificada de la ballesta clásica que utiliza piedras como "
"proyectiles en lugar de la tradicional saeta. Destinada principalmente a la "
"caza menor."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pistol crossbow"
msgid_plural "pistol crossbows"
msgstr[0] "pistola ballesta"
msgstr[1] "pistolas ballesta"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small concealable pistol-like crossbow.  It's weak due to its small size "
"and draw, so it is best suited for hunting small game."
msgstr ""
"Una pequeña ballesta ocultable, similar a una pistola. Es débil debido a su "
"pequeño tamaño y a su tiro, por lo que es más adecuada para la caza menor."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "wood crossbow"
msgid_plural "wood crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta de madera"
msgstr[1] "ballestas de madera"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A moderately powerful all-wood hunting crossbow."
msgstr "Una ballesta de caza de madera moderadamente potente."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "composite crossbow"
msgid_plural "composite crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta compuesta"
msgstr[1] "ballestas compuestas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A modern moderately powerful hunting crossbow with fiberglass limbs."
msgstr ""
"Una ballesta de caza moderna, moderadamente potente, con exttremos de fibra "
"de vidrio."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "compound crossbow"
msgid_plural "compound crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta compuesta"
msgstr[1] "ballestas compuestas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A high-power crossbow with shaped cams and extra cables for high-power "
"shots.  Takes less time to reload due to a modern string-pulling system."
msgstr ""
"Una ballesta de alta potencia con levas en forma y cables adicionales para "
"disparos de alta potencia. Se tarda menos tiempo en recargar debido a un "
"moderno sistema de tiro con cuerda."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "heavy crossbow"
msgid_plural "heavy crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta pesada"
msgstr[1] "ballestas pesadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A HUGE medieval crossbow from Germany with a very slow, difficult reloading "
"process.  Its tension is so powerful that you feel it shake after firing."
msgstr ""
"Una ENORME ballesta medieval de Alemania con un proceso de recarga muy lento"
" y difícil. Su tensión es tan potente que se siente que tiembla después de "
"disparar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "repeating crossbow"
msgid_plural "repeating crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta de repetición"
msgstr[1] "ballestas de repetición"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A custom-made crossbow with a clever mechanism that loads and fires bolts in"
" a single motion, it has a wooden magazine that holds 10 bolts."
msgstr ""
"Una ballesta hecha a medida con un mecanismo inteligente que carga y dispara"
" los pernos en un solo movimiento, tiene un cargador de madera con capacidad"
" para 10 saetas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "PPA-5"
msgid_plural "PPA-5s"
msgstr[0] "PPA-5"
msgstr[1] "PPA-5s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Portable Plasma Accelerator Model Five, developed by Lockheed Martin "
"Corporation.  This device uses highly advanced capacitor banks to create a "
"torus of superheated hydrogen plasma and accelerate it to incredible speed."
"  It was designed to take down heavy vehicles, and was expected to fully "
"enter US Army service not long before the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"Acelerador de Plasma Portátil Modelo Cinco, desarrollado por la Corporación "
"Lockheed Martin. Este dispositivo utiliza un banco de condensador muy "
"avanzados para crear un toro de plasma de hidrógeno sobrecalentado y "
"acelerarlo a una velocidad increíble. Fue diseñado para derribar vehículos "
"pesados, y se esperaba que entrara plenamente en el servicio del ejército de"
" los EE.UU. no mucho antes del Cataclismo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Boeing XM-P plasma rifle"
msgid_plural "Boeing XM-P plasma rifles"
msgstr[0] "rilfe de plasma Boeing XM-P"
msgstr[1] "rilfes de plasma Boeing XM-P"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Boeing developed the focused plasma weaponry together with DARPA.  It heats "
"solid hydrogen to create plasma and envelops it with polymers to reduce "
"blooming.  While powerful, it suffers from short range.  Powered by UPS."
msgstr ""
"Boeing desarrolló armas de plasma concentrado junto con DARPA. Calienta "
"hidrógeno sólido para crear plasma y lo envuelve con polímeros para reducir "
"el brote. Aunque es poderoso, no es adecuada para distancias largas. Se "
"alimenta con un UPS."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M72 LAW"
msgid_plural "M72 LAW"
msgstr[0] "M72 LAW"
msgstr[1] "M72 LAW"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A disposable light anti-tank rocket launcher.  Once fired, it cannot be "
"reloaded and must be disposed of."
msgstr ""
"Un lanza misiles ligero desechable antitanque. Una vez que es disparado, no "
"puede ser recargado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RPG-7"
msgid_plural "RPG-7"
msgstr[0] "RPG-7"
msgstr[1] "RPG-7"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The emblematic RPG-7 launcher.  Its simple, inexpensive, and reliable design"
" made it a popular choice among armies and insurgent groups worldwide."
msgstr ""
"El emblemático lanzador RPG-7. Su diseño simple, barato y confiable lo "
"hicieron popular entre los ejércitos y los grupos insurgentes en todo el "
"mundo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "crude rocket launcher"
msgid_plural "crude rocket launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzacohetes simple"
msgstr[1] "lanzacohetes simples"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improvised, direct ignition launcher for home-made rockets.  Essentially,"
" a thick-walled steel pipe, equipped with a pilot light, several batteries "
"and a simple circuit board.  Effective only at medium range, barely."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzador improvisado para misiles hechos en casa, de ignición directa. "
"Esencialmente, un tubo grueso de acero, equipado con un piloto, varias "
"baterías y una simple placa de circuitos. Solo es eficaz a una distancia "
"media del objetivo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py lang/json/vehicle_part_from_json.py
msgid "water cannon"
msgid_plural "water cannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón de agua"
msgstr[1] "cañones de agua"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A water cannon from a fire truck.  Mounted on a vehicle, it could be used to"
" stop fires or \"protesters\"."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón de agua que pertenecía a un camión de bomberos. Si lo montás en un "
"vehículo, puede ser usado para apagar fuegos o \"manifestantes\"."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "BB gun"
msgid_plural "BB guns"
msgstr[0] "rifle de balines"
msgstr[1] "rifles de balines"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Popular among children.  It's fairly accurate, but BBs deal nearly no "
"damage."
msgstr ""
"Son populares entre los niños. Es bastante preciso pero los balines casi que"
" no causan ningún daño."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgctxt "weapon"
msgid "sling"
msgid_plural "slings"
msgstr[0] "honda"
msgstr[1] "hondas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A leather sling, can launch rocks much further and faster than throwing them"
" by hand."
msgstr ""
"Una honda de cuero, puede lanzar las rocas mucho más lejos y más rápido que "
"lanzarlas a mano."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "slingshot"
msgid_plural "slingshots"
msgstr[0] "tirachinas"
msgstr[1] "tirachinas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A forked piece of wood with an elastic band stretched between two of its "
"tips.  Can launch tiny pebbles and similar things at high speeds."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de madera bifurcado con una banda elástica estirada entre dos de "
"sus puntas. Puede lanzar piedrecitas y cosas similares a gran velocidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "staff sling"
msgid_plural "staff slings"
msgstr[0] "honda de bastón"
msgstr[1] "hondas de bastón"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This staff can launch rocks with a whipping motion that sends them flying "
"much further and faster than throwing them."
msgstr ""
"Este bastón puede lanzar rocas con un movimiento de látigo que las hace "
"volar mucho más lejos y más rápido que al lanzarlas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "brace slingshot"
msgid_plural "brace slingshots"
msgstr[0] "refuerzo de tirachinas"
msgstr[1] "refuerzos de tirachinas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern slingshot with a wrist brace, allowing it to fire tiny objects "
"slightly more forcefully than a simple wooden slingshot."
msgstr ""
"Un moderno tirachinas con una muñequera que permite disparar pequeños "
"objetos con algo más de fuerza que un simple tirachinas de madera."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pneumatic speargun"
msgid_plural "pneumatic spearguns"
msgstr[0] "arpón neumático"
msgstr[1] "arpones neumáticos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sophisticated underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized "
"type of spear using a hand-pump pressure system.  While highly effective "
"when used underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta sofisticada de pesca submarina, diseñada para disparar un "
"tipo especial de lanza usando un sistema de presión bombeada a mano. Aunque "
"es muy efectiva debajo del agua, es casi inútil usarla en tierra."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "double speargun"
msgid_plural "double spearguns"
msgstr[0] "arpón doble"
msgstr[1] "arpones dobles"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A double-loading underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized"
" type of spear using tension in a rubber band.  While highly effective when "
"used underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de pesca submarina de doble carga, diseñada para disparar un"
" tipo especial de lanza usando tensión con una cinta elástica. Aunque es muy"
" efectiva debajo del agua, es casi inútil usarla en tierra."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "mini speargun"
msgid_plural "mini spearguns"
msgstr[0] "miniarpón"
msgstr[1] "miniarpones"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized type of "
"spear using tension in a rubber band.  While highly effective when used "
"underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña herramienta de pesca submarina, diseñada para disparar un "
"tipo especial de lanza usando tensión con una cinta elástica. Aunque es muy "
"efectiva debajo del agua, es casi inútil usarla en tierra."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "speargun"
msgid_plural "spearguns"
msgstr[0] "arpón"
msgstr[1] "arpones"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An underwater fishing implement designed to fire a specialized type of spear"
" using tension in a rubber band.  While highly effective when used "
"underwater, it is nearly useless on dry land."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta de pesca submarina, diseñada para disparar un tipo especial "
"de lanza usando tensión con una cinta elástica. Aunque es muy efectiva "
"debajo del agua, es casi inútil usarla en tierra."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "acid dart volley"
msgid_plural "acid dart volleys"
msgstr[0] " descarga de dardos acidos"
msgstr[1] "descargas de dardos acidos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "acid dart gun"
msgid_plural "acid dart guns"
msgstr[0] "pistola de dardos de ácido"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de dardos de ácido"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "vibrating bioblaster"
msgid_plural "vibrating bioblasters"
msgstr[0] "bioblaster vibratorio"
msgstr[1] "bioblasters vibratorios"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You ripped this from a mi-go abomination.  You think you should wear gloves "
"to reload it.  "
msgstr ""
"Arrancaste esto de una abominación mi-go. Crees que deberías usar guantes "
"para recargarlo. "

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Alien lune"
msgid_plural "Alien lunes"
msgstr[0] "luna Alien"
msgstr[1] "lunas Alien"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A delicate strand of light links the antipodes of this crescent-shaped "
"device.  If the strand is interrupted, the device clanks and shudders before"
" violently emitting a bolt of plasma from its apex."
msgstr ""
"Un delicado hilo de luz une las antípodas de este dispositivo en forma de "
"media luna. Si el hilo se interrumpe, el dispositivo choca y se estremece "
"antes de emitir violentamente un rayo de plasma desde su vértice."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "deployed grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "deployed grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranada desplegable"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas desplegable"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A grenade launcher mounted onto your right-hand wrist.  Less powerful than a"
" proper grenade launcher, but infinitely more portable, and quick to reload."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzagranadas montado en su muñeca derecha. Menos potente que un "
"verdadero lanzagranadas, pero infinitamente más portátil y rápido de "
"recargar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "aztlani bow"
msgid_plural "aztlani bows"
msgstr[0] "arco aztlani"
msgstr[1] "arcos aztlani"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ornate bow used by Aztlani nobility during hunting rituals.  Designed to fell the plated creatures of Aztlan, its articulated and power assisted limbs allow it to fire projectiles with a strength comparable to modern assault rifles.  .\n"
"\n"
"With its drawing aid system currently disabled, firing it will require truly superhuman strength.  It can be activated to toggle it drawing assist functionality."
msgstr ""
"Un arco ornamentado utilizado por la nobleza aztlaní durante los rituales de caza. Diseñado para abatir a las criaturas acorazadas de Aztlán, sus extremidades articuladas y asistidas le permiten disparar proyectiles con una fuerza comparable a la de los modernos rifles de asalto. \n"
"\n"
"Con su sistema de ayuda a la tracción actualmente desactivado, dispararlo requerirá una fuerza verdaderamente sobrehumana. Puede activarse para activar la función de ayuda al tensado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "aztlani bow (active)"
msgid_plural "aztlani bows (active)"
msgstr[0] "arco aztlani (activo)"
msgstr[1] "arcos aztlani (activos)"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ornate bow used by Aztlani nobility during hunting rituals.  Designed to fell the plated creatures of Aztlan, its articulated and power assisted limbs allow it to fire projectiles with a strength comparable to modern assault rifles.  .\n"
"\n"
"With its drawing aid system enabled, it can be much more easily drawn, at the cost of a modest amount of UPS power consumption per arrow.  It can be activated to toggle it drawing assist functionality."
msgstr ""
"Un arco ornamentado usado por la nobleza Aztlani durante los rituales de caza. Diseñado para atacar las criaturas chapadas de Aztlan, sus extremidades articuladas y asistidas por potencia le permiten disparar proyectiles con una fuerza comparable a la de un rifle de asalto moderno.\n"
"\n"
"Con su sistema de ayuda de tensado habilitado, se puede tensar facilmente, a costa de un consumo moderado de energia de una SAI por flecha. Puede ser activado para encender su funcionalidad de tensado rapido."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "salvage bow"
msgid_plural "salvage bows"
msgstr[0] "arco recuperado"
msgstr[1] "arcos recuperados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bow made from readily-available materials, and quickly and cheaply put "
"together.  It is not made to be pretty, but to get a job done.  Its nocks "
"and string are made of shape-memory alloy that help increase string tension "
"in the string.  The memory alloy requires a UPS source to be activated."
msgstr ""
"Un arco creado con materiales facilmente disponibles, y facil y barato de "
"crear. No fue creado para ser bonito, pero hace su trabajo. Su culatin y "
"cuerdas estan hechos de una aleación con forma de memoria que ayuda a "
"incrementar su tensión de cuerda. La aleación requiere una fuente SAI para "
"ser activada."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "salvage crossbow"
msgid_plural "salvage crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta recuperada"
msgstr[1] "ballestas recuperadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crossbow constructed of readily available materials, and quickly and "
"cheaply put together.  While it isn't very pretty, it gets the job done, and"
" its drawing mechanism is motorized allowing quick reloading."
msgstr ""
"Una ballesta construida con materiales fáciles de conseguir y montada de "
"forma rápida y barata. Aunque no es muy bonita, cumple su función, y su "
"mecanismo de tiro está motorizado, lo que permite una recarga rápida."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Seyfert 84K"
msgid_plural "Seyfert 84Ks"
msgstr[0] "Seyfert 84K"
msgstr[1] "Seyferts 84K"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Commonly carried by shipping crews that can afford it, Seyfert Armistice's "
"84K pistol doesn't particularly shine or show anything special but it keeps "
"you safe on long journeys in the vast dark of Orion's Arm."
msgstr ""
"La pistola 84K de Seyfert Armistice, que suelen llevar las tripulaciones que"
" pueden permitírselo, no brilla ni muestra nada especial, pero te mantiene a"
" salvo en los largos viajes por la vasta oscuridad del Brazo de Orión."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Gibson S86"
msgid_plural "Gibson S86s"
msgstr[0] "Gibson S86"
msgstr[1] "Gibsons S86"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Manufactured by Gibson Armory, the S86 is a light-weight grenade launcher "
"designed to take care of moderately armored opponents.  While the S86 "
"firepower is nothing to truly gawk at, it still packs quite a punch both for"
" the target and user and is usually mounted as it is impossible to fire with"
" average strength."
msgstr ""
"Fabricado por Gibson Armory, el S86 es un lanzagranadas ligero diseñado para"
" encargarse de oponentes moderadamente blindados. Aunque la potencia de "
"fuego del S86 no es nada del otro mundo, sigue siendo muy potente, tanto "
"para el objetivo como para el usuario, y suele montarse, ya que es imposible"
" de disparar con una fuerza media."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "DOUBLE"
msgstr "DOBLE"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "eidolon derringer"
msgid_plural "eidolon derringers"
msgstr[0] "derringer eidolon"
msgstr[1] "derringers eidolon"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A slick, miniature derringer designed as a backup weapon for covert "
"operations and close range assassination.  It will fire up to four 5x50mm "
"penetrators simultaneously, to devastating effect."
msgstr ""
"Una elegante miniatura derringer diseñada como arma de apoyo para "
"operaciones encubiertas y asesinatos a corta distancia. Disparará hasta "
"cuatro penetradores de 5x50mm simultáneamente, con un efecto devastador."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "landfall survival gun"
msgid_plural "landfall survival guns"
msgstr[0] "arma de aterrizaje de supervivencia"
msgstr[1] "armas de aterrizaje de supervivencia"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A lightweight, bolt-action gun that is barely more than a 6.55mm barrel "
"mounted within a flimsy metal assembly.  Cheaply made and outdated in all "
"respects, it's only useful in the most extenuating of circumstances."
msgstr ""
"Un arma ligera de cerrojo que apenas es más que un cañón de 6.55 mm montado "
"dentro de un endeble conjunto metálico. De fabricación barata y anticuada en"
" todos los aspectos, solo es útil en las circunstancias más extenuantes."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Accipiter Hawk-00"
msgid_plural "Accipiter Hawk-00s"
msgstr[0] "Accipiter Hawk-00"
msgstr[1] "Accipiters Hawk-00"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A light machine gun manufactured by Accipiter Firearms and distributed by "
"Wraitheon.  The Hawk-00's high rate of fire makes it ideally suited to lay "
"down suppressive fire; but also makes it exceedingly hard to control while "
"unmounted."
msgstr ""
"Una ametralladora ligera fabricada por Accipiter Firearms y distribuida por "
"Wraitheon. La alta cadencia de fuego del Hawk-00 lo hace ideal para matener "
"fuego de supresión, pero también lo hace muy difícil de controlar cuando no "
"está montado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "G&W SR-P9"
msgid_plural "G&W SR-P9s"
msgstr[0] "G&W SR-P9"
msgstr[1] "G&Ws SR-P9"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An eminently sturdy and reliable bullpup rifle issued by UICA's military "
"during early reclamation expeditions.  Although its been out of service for "
"nearly two decades, many a private military and contractor has found a use "
"for the SR-P9, and it remains common long past its initial introduction into"
" service."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle bullpup eminentemente robusto y fiable emitido por los militares de"
" UICA durante las primeras expediciones de recuperación. Aunque ha estado "
"fuera de servicio durante casi dos décadas, muchos militares y contratistas "
"privados han encontrado un uso para el SR-P9, y sigue siendo común mucho "
"tiempo después de su introducción inicial en servicio."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "RM99 revolver"
msgid_plural "RM99 revolvers"
msgstr[0] "revólver RM99"
msgstr[1] "revólveres RM99"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Considered overkill by some, the Rivtech M99 remains an exceedingly powerful"
" addition to the arsenal of any gunslinger."
msgstr ""
"Aunque algunos lo consideran una exageración, el Rivtech M99 sigue siendo "
"una adición extremadamente poderosa al arsenal de cualquier pistolero."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "base robogun"
msgid_plural "base roboguns"
msgstr[0] "robogun de base"
msgstr[1] "roboguns de base"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a pseudo item for monster attacks.  If you see this, it's a bug."
msgstr ""
"Este es un pseudo objeto para ataques de monstruos. Si ves esto, es un "
"error."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "mounted 1kg plasma railgun"
msgid_plural "mounted 1kg plasma railguns"
msgstr[0] "cañón de riel de plasma de 1kg montado"
msgstr[1] "cañones de riel de plasma de 1kg montados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "integral railgun"
msgid_plural "integral railguns"
msgstr[0] "arma de riel integral"
msgstr[1] "armas de riel integral"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "foam gun"
msgid_plural "foam guns"
msgstr[0] "arma de espuma"
msgstr[1] "armas de espuma"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stubby industrial tool used to shoot expanding foam.  Using it as a weapon"
" might require some creative thinking."
msgstr ""
"Una herramienta industrial rechoncha utilizada para disparar espuma "
"expansiva. Utilizarla como arma puede requerir un poco de creatividad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "1s."
msgstr "1s."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "3s."
msgstr "3s."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pshht"
msgstr "pshht"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "wrist-stunner"
msgid_plural "wrist-stunners"
msgstr[0] "aturdidor de muñeca"
msgstr[1] "aturdidores de muñeca"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A severed robotic hand from a Wraitheon Sentinel.  The powerful electro-"
"laser stun gun embed on its wrist is still functional, and can be used when "
"connected to an UPS."
msgstr ""
"Una mano robótica cortada de un Centinela Wraitheon. La potente pistola "
"aturdidora electro-láser incrustada en su muñeca sigue funcionando, y puede "
"ser usada cuando se conecta a un SAI."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "wrist-trilaser"
msgid_plural "wrist-trilasers"
msgstr[0] "trilaser de muñeca"
msgstr[1] "trilasers de muñeca"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful tri-barreled laser weapon, still mounted to the robotic hand of "
"the wraitheon drone it originally belonged to.  Can still be fired when "
"connected to an UPS."
msgstr ""
"Una potente arma láser de tres cañones, todavía montada en la mano robótica "
"del dron Wraitheon al que pertenecía originalmente. Aún se puede disparar "
"cuando se conecta a un SAI."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "trilaser"
msgstr "trilaser"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "handheld x-ray cannon"
msgid_plural "handheld x-ray cannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón de rayos x de mano"
msgstr[1] "cañones de rayos x de mano"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an x-ray laser stripped a TX-5LR Cerberus laser turret that has been"
" modified to use UPS power for firing.  Single shot then requires reloading."
"  Nicknamed the 'Tin Can Killer' for it's ability to destroy power armor."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un láser de rayos-X despojado de una torreta láser TX-5LR Cerberus "
"que ha sido modificado para usar enegía del SAI al disparar. Se necesita "
"recargar después de disparar. Apodado \"Asesino De Hojalata\" por su "
"habilidad de destrucción de armaduras."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "mounted x-ray cannon"
msgid_plural "mounted x-ray cannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón de rayos x montado"
msgstr[1] "cañones de rayos x montados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "shoddy laser rifle"
msgid_plural "shoddy laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle láser de mala calidad"
msgstr[1] "rifles láser de mala calidad"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cheap laser rifle made from common components.  Weak, but can be "
"powered with rechargeable batteries."
msgstr ""
"Es un rifle láser barato hecho de componentes comunes. Es frágil, pero puede"
" ser alimentado por baterías recargables."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Av-22"
msgid_plural "Av-22s"
msgstr[0] "Av-22"
msgstr[1] "Av-22s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A common pulse-laser pistol cleared for civilian use.  Recoilless, energy-"
"efficient, and easy to use, the av-22 is often carried as a defense weapon "
"by those who lack the practice required to effectively use ballistic "
"weaponry.  Due to its low power, it must be fired in sequence mode to stand "
"a chance against hardened foes."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola láser de pulso común autorizada para uso civil. Sin retroceso, "
"de bajo consumo y fácil de usar, la av-22 suele ser llevada como arma de "
"defensa por aquellos que carecen de la práctica necesaria para utilizar "
"eficazmente el armamento balístico. Debido a su baja potencia, debe ser "
"disparada en modo secuencial para tener una oportunidad contra enemigos "
"duros."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Pulse "
msgstr "Pulso"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "2s Sequence "
msgstr "Secuencia de 2s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "3s Sequence "
msgstr "Secuencia 3s"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "E-150b"
msgid_plural "E-150bs"
msgstr[0] "E-150b"
msgstr[1] "E-150bs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A silver, elegantly-wrought laser pistol that fires armor-piercing bolts of "
"golden light.  A now-irreplaceable historical artifact built by the "
"engineering AIs of the late Hyperspace Era, it is as precious as it is "
"deadly."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola láser plateada, elegantemente forjada, que dispara rayos de luz "
"dorada que perforan la armadura. Se trata de un artefacto histórico ya "
"insustituible, construido por las IAs de ingeniería de finales de la Era "
"Hiperespacial, y es tan valioso como mortífero."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "V14 laser pistol"
msgid_plural "V14 laser pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola láser V14"
msgstr[1] "pistolas láser V14"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An incredibly ancient and outdated laser pistol design with origins "
"traceable to Earth's early Space Age.  One of the few 'open-hardware' guns, "
"its leaked and widely-circulated design specifications allow this weapon to "
"retain some popularity within backwater worlds."
msgstr ""
"Un diseño de pistola láser increíblemente antiguo y anticuado cuyos orígenes"
" se remontan a la primera Edad Espacial de la Tierra. Es una de las pocas "
"pistolas de \"hardware abierto\", y sus especificaciones de diseño filtradas"
" y ampliamente difundidas permiten que esta arma conserve cierta popularidad"
" en los mundos atrasados."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "xm34 EMP projector"
msgid_plural "xm34 EMP projectors"
msgstr[0] "proyector PEM xm34"
msgstr[1] "proyectores PEM xm34"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "plasma gun"
msgid_plural "plasma guns"
msgstr[0] "arma de plasma"
msgstr[1] "armas de plasma"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A plasma gun."
msgstr "Una pistola de plasma."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "PAM-41 2g"
msgid_plural "PAM-41 2gs"
msgstr[0] "PAM-41 2g"
msgstr[1] "PAM-41 2gs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short and stubby 2 gram plasma railgun occasionally used by espatiers as a"
" hull breaching tool.  Like larger plasma weapons, it propels toroids of "
"plasma that detonate on contact, but its reduced size heavily hampers its "
"range and damage output.  Fired within an atmosphere, its very low range "
"makes it dangerous to shooter and target alike."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón de riel de plasma de 2 gramos, corto y rechoncho, utilizado "
"ocasionalmente por los espaciadores como herramienta para romper el casco. "
"Al igual que las armas de plasma más grandes, propulsa toroides de plasma "
"que detonan al contacto, pero su reducido tamaño dificulta en gran medida su"
" alcance y su producción de daños. Si se dispara dentro de una atmósfera, su"
" escaso alcance lo hace peligroso tanto para el tirador como para el "
"objetivo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "bionic skullgun"
msgid_plural "bionic skullguns"
msgstr[0] "pistola calavera biónica"
msgstr[1] "pistolas calavera biónica"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic one-shot subdermal .40 pistol integrated with your head."
msgstr "Pistola biónica subdérmica del .40 integrada en la cabeza."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "makeshift rail rifle"
msgid_plural "makeshift rail rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de rail improvisado"
msgstr[1] "rifles de rail improvisados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single-shot, break-action, electrically propelled, steel rail launcher "
"handcrafted from scrap.  The hypervelocity metal stake that it fires is "
"accelerated to the point of spontaneous combustion by a Lorentz force "
"generated by electromagnetic induction, powered by a standard UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un lanzador de rieles de acero, hecho a mano y con chatarra, de disparo "
"único, de acción-de-ruptura y propulsado electricamente. La estaca de metal "
"a hipervelocidad que dispara está acelerada al punto de llegar a la "
"combustión espontánea por la fuerza de Lorentz generada por la inducción "
"electromagnética. Se alimenta de un SAI estandar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "modified Marlin 39A"
msgid_plural "modified Marlin 39A"
msgstr[0] "Marlin 39A modificada"
msgstr[1] "Marlin 39A modificadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "A Marlin 39A, modified for use in a vehicle turret."
msgstr "Un Marlin 39A, modificado para su uso en la torreta de un vehículo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "modified SKS"
msgid_plural "modified SKSs"
msgstr[0] "modified SKS"
msgstr[1] "modified SKSs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "An SKS, modified to be suitable for use in a vehicle turret."
msgstr "Una SKS, modificada para ser utilizada en la torreta de un vehículo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT .5 LP"
msgid_plural "CRIT .5 LPs"
msgstr[0] "CRIT .5 LP"
msgstr[1] "CRIT .5 LPs"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Experimental low power sidearm under development in C.R.I.T R&D, the .5 LP "
"is a relatively weak but accurate laser pistol.  The double-barrel design "
"compensates for the lack of raw power and yet the gun manages to be "
"relatively easy to aim and lightweight due to the superalloy construction."
msgstr ""
"El arma experimental de baja potencia que se está desarrollando en I+D del "
"C.R.I.T., la .5 LP es una pistola láser relativamente débil pero precisa. El"
" diseño de doble cañón compensa la falta de potencia bruta y, sin embargo, "
"el arma consigue ser relativamente fácil de apuntar y ligera debido a la "
"construcción de superaleación."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT Chain Laser"
msgid_plural "CRIT Chain Lasers"
msgstr[0] "Láser en cadena CRIT"
msgstr[1] "Láseres en cadena CRIT"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A tried and true favorite from the bowels of R&D hell.  Based off of a "
"researcher's video on three taped-together .5 LPs on a hand held power "
"drill, this gun is a relatively light weapon for the amount of UPS it eats "
"and destruction it can cause."
msgstr ""
"Un favorito de R&D del infierno de la investigación y el desarrollo. Basado "
"en el video de un investigador en tres 0.5 LPs en un taladro de mano, esta "
"arma es relativamente ligera por la cantidad de SAI que come y la "
"destrucción que puede causar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT Laser Carbine"
msgid_plural "CRIT Laser Carbines"
msgstr[0] "Carabina láser CRIT"
msgstr[1] "Carabinas láser CRIT"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A short-barrel lightweight laser gun developed by C.R.I.T R&D.  Mainly "
"developed to test out a new breakthrough in laser weapons."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón láser ligero de cañón corto desarrollado por C.R.I.T R&D. "
"Principalmente desarrollado para probar un nuevo avance en armas láser."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT Energy Rifle"
msgid_plural "CRIT Energy Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Rifle de energía CRIT"
msgstr[1] "Rifles de energía CRIT"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A heavy energy gun developed by C.R.I.T R&D.  Mainly developed to test out a"
" new breakthrough in hybrid weaponry."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de energía pesada desarrollada por C.R.I.T R&D. Principalmente "
"desarrollada para probar un nuevo avance en armamento híbrido."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT CQB Standard Issue"
msgid_plural "CRIT CQB Standard Issues"
msgstr[0] "Edición estándar CRIT CQB "
msgstr[1] "Ediciones estándar CRIT CQB "

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple combination gun.  This military-grade semi-auto carbine couples the"
" mid-range versatility of the 9mm with the power of the 12 gauge shotgun.  "
"To further compliment the CQB aspect, the stock is built to amplify the "
"user's force and the rugged construction with tonfa-like grip can handle "
"bashing in enemy heads."
msgstr ""
"Un arma combinada sencilla. Esta carabina semiautomática de grado militar "
"combina la versatilidad de rango medio de la 9 mm con la potencia de la "
"escopeta de calibre 12. Para complementar aún más el aspecto CQB, la culata "
"está construida para amplificar la fuerza del usuario y la robusta "
"construcción con empuñadura tipo tonfa puede soportar los golpes en las "
"cabezas del enemigo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT Fire Glove"
msgid_plural "CRIT Fire Gloves"
msgstr[0] "Guante de Fuego del CRIT"
msgstr[1] "Guantes de Fuego del CRIT"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Experimental CQB weapon system under development in C.R.I.T R&D."
msgstr "Sistema experimental de armas CQB en desarrollo en C.R.I.T R&D."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "blast"
msgstr "explosión"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pellet gun"
msgid_plural "pellet guns"
msgstr[0] "pistola de perdigón"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de perdigones"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A surprisingly powerful airgun that can reliably hunt small game.  The small"
" lead or alloy pellets that can be chambered provide it decent power in "
"every shot.  It's fairly accurate and can be somewhat as damaging as a .22 "
"short, but the break action charging system requires some arm strength to "
"load a pellet."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de aire sorprendentemente poderosa que puede cazar de forma fiable "
"la caza menor. Los pequeños perdigones de plomo o de aleación que pueden ser"
" introducidos en la cámara le proporcionan una potencia decente en cada "
"disparo. Es bastante precisa y puede ser tan dañina como una .22 corta, pero"
" el sistema de carga de acción de ruptura requiere cierta fuerza en el brazo"
" para cargar un perdigón."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Plasma Cutter"
msgid_plural "Plasma Cutters"
msgstr[0] "Cortador de Plasma"
msgstr[1] "Cortadores de Plasma"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Experimental cutting tool under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  It fires an "
"extremely hot wave of plasma that slices into materials."
msgstr ""
"Herramienta de corte experimental en desarrollo en C.R.I.T R&D. Dispara una "
"ola de plasma extremadamente caliente que corta los materiales."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Rivet Driver"
msgid_plural "Rivet Drivers"
msgstr[0] "Conductor de Rivet"
msgstr[1] "Conductores de Rivet"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Experimental double purpose tool under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  It takes"
" a regular nail and then elongates it within a fraction of a second before "
"firing it out, upon reaching a target, the fragile stake explodes into "
"shards inside the target."
msgstr ""
"Herramienta experimental de doble propósito que está bajo desarrollo en "
"C.R.I.T R&D. Toma un clavo normal y lo alarga en una fracción de segundo "
"antes de dispararlo, al alcanzar un objetivo, la frágil estaca explota en "
"fragmentos dentro del objetivo."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Line Gun"
msgid_plural "Line Guns"
msgstr[0] "Arma de línea"
msgstr[1] "Armas de línea"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Experimental high power cutting tool under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  It "
"fires plasma in a wide line for slicing into dense materials."
msgstr ""
"Herramienta de corte experimental de alta potencia en desarrollo en C.R.I.T "
"R&D. Dispara plasma en una amplia línea para cortar en materiales densos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Pulse Rifle"
msgid_plural "Pulse Rifles"
msgstr[0] "Rifle de pulso"
msgstr[1] "Rifles de pulso"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Experimental tri-barrel sub-sonic rifle under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  "
"Great for enclosed spaces and mobs of enemies.  Shoots alloy rounds which "
"instantly mushroom out upon impact."
msgstr ""
"Rifle experimental subsónico de tres cañones en desarrollo en el C.R.I.T "
"R&D. Genial para espacios cerrados y multitudes de enemigos. Dispara balas "
"de aleación que instantáneamente se disparan al impactar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ripper"
msgid_plural "Rippers"
msgstr[0] "Destripador"
msgstr[1] "Destripadores"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Experimental EM saw under development in C.R.I.T R&D.  Great for distance "
"cutting of material."
msgstr ""
"El EM experimental se está desarrollando en el I+D del C.R.I.T. Genial para "
"el corte a distancia de material."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "em field saw"
msgstr "sierra de campo electromagnético"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A powerful ion energy generator is implanted on your chest.  Fires a "
"powerful, ever-expanding energy blast that goes through various targets.  "
"The energy shot ignites oxygen creating fires as it moves and an explosion "
"on impact."
msgstr ""
"Es un poderoso generador de energía iónica que se implanta en tu pecho. "
"Dispara un poderoso y continuo rayo de energía que puede atravesar varios "
"objetivos. La energía disparada incendia el oxígeno creando fuego mientras "
"se va moviendo y explotando al impactar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Yeet Cannon"
msgid_plural "Yeet Cannons"
msgstr[0] "Cañón de Propulsión"
msgstr[1] "Cañones de Propulsión"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can YEET all the bullets with this baby.  YEET them right into all of "
"the zombies in your path, all the hulks, the spiders, and those damned mole "
"rats."
msgstr "Cañones de Propulsión"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "fake flamesword"
msgid_plural "fake flameswords"
msgstr[0] "espada flamígera falsa"
msgstr[1] "espadas flamígeras falsas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"a fake gun used by the consecrator.  it's a bug if you find this in the wild"
msgstr ""
"un arma falsa utilizada por el consagrador. Es un error si se encuentra esto"
" en la naturaleza"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "fake firecannon"
msgid_plural "fake firecannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón de fuego falso"
msgstr[1] "cañones de fuego falsos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Fires an explosive bolt of fiery energy.  If you're seeing this, it's a bug."
msgstr ""
"Dispara un rayo explosivo de energía ardiente. Si ves esto, es un error."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "fake smokegun"
msgid_plural "fake smokeguns"
msgstr[0] "pistola de humo falsa"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de humo falsas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Shoots dangerous radioactive gas.  If you're seeing this, it's a bug."
msgstr "Dispara gas radiactivo peligroso. Si ves esto, es un error."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "fake gasgun"
msgid_plural "fake gasguns"
msgstr[0] "arma de gas falsa"
msgstr[1] "armas de gas falsas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Shoots pacification gas.  If you're seeing this, it's a bug."
msgstr "Dispara gas pacificador. Si ves esto, es un error."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A six-foot wooden bow that takes a fair amount of strength to draw.  It can "
"be used effectively by those of somewhat above-average strength.  Used "
"mainly in medieval England in wartime, but pierces hide just as well as "
"chainmail."
msgstr ""
"Un arco de madera de dos metros que requiere bastante fuerza para tensarse. "
"Puede ser utilizado con eficacia por personas con una fuerza superior a la "
"media. Se utilizaba principalmente en la Inglaterra medieval en tiempos de "
"guerra, pero atraviesa la piel tan bien como la cota de malla."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This ancient firearm lacks the fire-rate of modern weapons, but packs as "
"much punch as the best of 'em and rewards the skilled shooter with easily-"
"crafted ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Esta antigua arma de fuego carece de la cadencia de fuego de las armas "
"modernas, pero tiene tanta fuerza como las mejores y recompensa al tirador "
"hábil con munición fácil de fabricar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "2-DINO-A7 laser rifle"
msgid_plural "2-DINO-A7 laser rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle láser 2-DINO-A7"
msgstr[1] "rifles láser 2-DINO-A7"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A state-of-the-art laser rifle developed by the R&D outfit \"Aerial Labs\"."
"  Initial performance rivaled Rivtech's finest, with rumors flying about "
"corporate skulduggery.  Fitted with a large internal plutonium cell for "
"CyberDinos."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle láser de última generación desarrollado por el equipo de I+D "
"\"Aerial Labs\". El rendimiento inicial rivalizaba con lo mejor de Rivtech, "
"con rumores de trampas corporativas. Equipado con una gran célula interna de"
" plutonio por CyberDinos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "antique pistol"
msgid_plural "antique pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola antigua"
msgstr[1] "pistolas antiguas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This antiquated single shot pistol would complete a pirate's outfit nicely."
"  While its loading may be slow, it does not require brass casings to fire, "
"and is theoretically sustainable.  Range and accuracy are hampered by lack "
"of rifling, but this old design is still plenty lethal."
msgstr ""
"Esta anticuada pistola de un solo disparo completaría muy bien el equipo de "
"un pirata. Aunque su carga puede ser lenta, no requiere casquillos de latón "
"para disparar, y es teóricamente sostenible. El alcance y la precisión se "
"ven obstaculizados por la falta de rifle, pero este viejo diseño es todavía "
"bastante letal."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "antique revolver"
msgid_plural "antique revolvers"
msgstr[0] "revólver antiguo"
msgstr[1] "revólveres antiguos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an old revolver designed during the period of westward expansion.  "
"Black powder paper cartridges must be loaded for each shot, which is a "
"fairly lengthy process.  Despite its age, this type of weapon would perform "
"adequately against most two-legged threats."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un antiguo revólver diseñado durante el período de expansión "
"hacia el oeste. Hay que cargar los cartuchos de papel de pólvora negra para "
"cada disparo, lo que supone un proceso bastante largo. A pesar de su "
"antigüedad, este tipo de arma funcionaría adecuadamente contra la mayoría de"
" las amenazas de dos patas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "antique musket"
msgid_plural "antique muskets"
msgstr[0] "mosquete antiguo"
msgstr[1] "mosquetes antiguos"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An antique design, this smoothbore long arm would look more at home on a "
"pre-1850's battlefield than in your hands in the cataclysm.  Its loading may"
" be slow, but it does not require brass casings to fire, and is "
"theoretically sustainable to fire.  Range and accuracy are hampered by lack "
"of rifling, but this time-tested design is plenty lethal."
msgstr ""
"Un diseño antiguo, este largo brazo de calibre liso se vería más cómodo en "
"el campo de batalla de antes de 1850 que en tus manos en el cataclismo. Su "
"carga puede ser lenta, pero no requiere de casquillos de latón para "
"disparar, y es teóricamente sostenible para disparar. El alcance y la "
"precisión se ven obstaculizados por la falta de rifle, pero este diseño "
"probado es bastante letal."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranada"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An older single shot grenade launcher, looking something like a sawn off "
"shotgun.  Though it's mostly been replaced by underbarrel launchers, "
"dedicated models like this have seen use by law enforcement and riot "
"personnel.  Still deadly against hard or soft targets, depending on what "
"cartridges are available."
msgstr ""
"Un viejo lanzagranadas de un solo disparo, que parece una escopeta "
"recortada. Aunque ha sido reemplazado en su mayor parte por lanzadores de "
"bajo cañón, los modelos dedicados como este han sido utilizados por las "
"fuerzas de la ley y el personal antidisturbios. Sigue siendo mortal contra "
"objetivos duros o blandos, dependiendo de los cartuchos disponibles."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "automatic grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "automatic grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranada automática"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas automáticas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This large, clumsy looking launcher looks like the offspring of a machine "
"gun and a mortar; its bore is huge, and its action is just as massive.  A "
"huge belt of grenade cartridges loads into its tray, allowing several "
"grenades to be launched in rapid succession.  If one grenade fired from this"
" isn't enough to solve your problems, surely a dozen more are.  This must be"
" mounted on a frame to be fired, and reloading is a bit slow."
msgstr ""
"Este gran lanzador de aspecto torpe se parece a la descendencia de una "
"ametralladora y un mortero; su diámetro es enorme, y su acción es igual de "
"masiva. Un enorme cinturón de cartuchos de granadas se carga en su bandeja, "
"permitiendo que varias granadas sean lanzadas en rápida sucesión. Si una "
"granada disparada desde aquí no es suficiente para resolver sus problemas, "
"seguro que una docena más lo son. Esto debe ser montado en un bastidor para "
"ser disparado, y la recarga es un poco lenta."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "grenade pistol"
msgid_plural "grenade pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola de granada"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de granadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stubby single shot pistol with a large bore barrel, suitable for launching"
" grenades or flares.  This is a slightly more convenient way to transport a "
"grenade launcher than mounted to one's rifle, a practice more common among "
"special forces.  In more recent years, variants were sold commercially to "
"ostensibly launch flares.  With the right cartridges, this would be "
"devastating against hard or soft targets.  This could be attached to a "
"suitable rifle, if so desired."
msgstr ""
"Una pistola de un solo disparo con un gran cañón, adecuada para lanzar "
"granadas o bengalas. Es una forma ligeramente más conveniente de transportar"
" un lanzagranadas que montado en el propio rifle, una práctica más común "
"entre las fuerzas especiales. En años más recientes, se han vendido "
"variantes comerciales para lanzar ostensiblemente bengalas. Con los "
"cartuchos adecuados, esto sería devastador contra objetivos duros o blandos."
" Esto se podría acoplar a un rifle adecuado, si así se desea."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "revolver grenade launcher"
msgid_plural "revolver grenade launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzagranada  revólver"
msgstr[1] "lanzagranadas revólveres"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Looking something like a large revolver from a cartoon this launcher is "
"capable of firing six grenades in rapid succession.  Its huge cylinder is "
"wound by a clock spring, which hastens firing, but slows reloading, as it "
"must be re-wound.  Needless to say, six well placed shots is an incredible "
"amount of firepower, depending on the cartridges loaded."
msgstr ""
"Parecido a un revólver grande de un dibujo animado, este lanzador es capaz "
"de disparar seis granadas en rápida sucesión. Su enorme cilindro está "
"enrollado por un resorte de reloj, que acelera el disparo, pero retrasa la "
"recarga, ya que debe ser rebobinado. No hace falta decir que seis disparos "
"bien colocados es una cantidad increíble de potencia de fuego, dependiendo "
"de los cartuchos cargados."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "cowboy carbine"
msgid_plural "cowboy carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina de vaquero"
msgstr[1] "carabinas de vaquero"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Since the early days of western expansion, when ammunition supply was "
"infrequent, shooters sought to share ammo between their sidearms and long "
"arms.  This tube magazine lever action carbine allows the shooter to reduce "
"the number of calibers carried and squeeze more power from their pistol "
"ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Desde los primeros días de la expansión occidental, cuando el suministro de "
"municiones era poco frecuente, los tiradores buscaban compartir municiones "
"entre sus armas largas y las armas de lado. Esta carabina de acción de "
"palanca de cargador de tubo permite al tirador reducir el número de calibres"
" transportados y exprimir más potencia de la munición de su pistola."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "machine pistol"
msgid_plural "machine pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola ametralladora"
msgstr[1] "pistolas ametralladoras"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This pistol is a tiny machinegun you can stuff into a holster, with which "
"you could dump its magazine at a blistering rate into any close range foes."
"  Machine pistols mostly see use by vehicle crewmen or bodyguards of VIPs.  "
"Due to its preposterous rate of fire it is difficult to control."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola es una pequeña ametralladora que se puede meter en una funda, "
"con la que puedes descargar su cargador a una velocidad vertiginosa contra "
"cualquier enemigo a corta distancia. Las pistolas ametralladoras son "
"utilizadas principalmente por los tripulantes de vehículos o los "
"guardaespaldas de personalidades. Debido a su absurda cadencia de fuego, es "
"difícil de controlar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "defensive pistol"
msgid_plural "defensive pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola defensiva"
msgstr[1] "pistolas defensivas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern pistol fit for duty, military service, or personal defense, with a "
"detachable box magazine and a reliable action.  Though its chambering is "
"capable of meeting FBI penetration minimums, the lack of a shoulder stock "
"limits its utility."
msgstr ""
"Una moderna pistola apta para el servicio, el servicio militar o la defensa "
"personal, con un cargador de caja desmontable y una acción fiable. Aunque su"
" recámara es capaz de cumplir con los mínimos de penetración del FBI, la "
"falta de un cargador de hombro limita su utilidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "survivalist carbine"
msgid_plural "survivalist carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina de supervivencialista"
msgstr[1] "carabinas de supervivencialistas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These small carbines share ammunition and magazines with common pistols, "
"offering a more controllable carbine than a normal rifle, while also "
"reducing ammunition costs.  Because of their compatibility, they pair well "
"with duty pistols, allowing one to transition to a more stable weapon "
"without carrying extra ammo or magazines."
msgstr ""
"Estas pequeñas carabinas comparten municiones y cargadores con pistolas "
"comunes, ofreciendo una carabina más controlable que un rifle normal, a la "
"vez que reducen los costes de munición. Debido a su compatibilidad, se "
"emparejan bien con las pistolas de servicio, permitiendo la transición a un "
"arma más estable sin llevar munición o cargadores adicionales."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "police revolver"
msgid_plural "police revolvers"
msgstr[0] "revólver de la policía"
msgstr[1] "revólveres de la policía"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Revolvers like this, chambered for standard defensive calibers, were a "
"favorite of police departments for nearly a century, up until the 1986 Miami"
" shootout.  Afterwards, the slow reloading and shooting of revolvers were "
"considered liabilities; still, this model's accuracy and moderate recoil "
"make for a serviceable sidearm, and there are no magazines for you to lose "
"or damage."
msgstr ""
"Revólveres como este, con calibres defensivos estándar, fueron los favoritos"
" de los departamentos de policía durante casi un siglo, hasta el tiroteo de "
"Miami en 1986. Después, la lenta recarga y el disparo de los revólveres se "
"consideraron pasivos; aún así, la precisión y el moderado retroceso de este "
"modelo hacen que sea un arma lateral útil, y no hay cargadores que se puedan"
" perder o dañar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "submachine gun"
msgid_plural "submachine guns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Chambered in common pistol ammunition, this compact long arm is perfect for "
"trench raiders, vehicular crewmen, SWAT teams and special forces.  Though "
"not as accurate as a proper rifle, especially at longer ranges, it is very "
"controllable in automatic fire.  It feeds from detachable box magazines, "
"which are easy to unload into close range targets."
msgstr ""
"Con munición de pistola común, este brazo largo y compacto es perfecto para "
"asaltantes de trincheras, tripulantes de vehículos, equipos SWAT y fuerzas "
"especiales. Aunque no es tan preciso como un rifle de verdad, especialmente "
"a grandes distancias, es muy controlable en el fuego automático. Se alimenta"
" de cargadores de caja desmontables, que son fáciles de descargar en "
"objetivos a corta distancia."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "survivor subgun"
msgid_plural "survivor subguns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil de superviviente"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles de superviviente"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crudely constructed fully automatic submachinegun, accepting standard "
"pistol and submachine gun magazines.  The heavy bolt makes accurate fire "
"difficult, and its questionable construction makes for poor reliability and "
"longevity.  Similar designs of desperation from the Second World War served "
"their nations well enough, so this should be good for zombies… right?  "
"Accepts standard pistol ammunition."
msgstr ""
"Un subfusil totalmente automática de construcción rudimentaria, que acepta "
"cargadores estándar de pistola y subfusil. El pesado cerrojo dificulta el "
"disparo preciso, y su cuestionable construcción hace que su fiabilidad y "
"longevidad sean escasas. Diseños similares de desesperación de la Segunda "
"Guerra Mundial sirvieron bastante bien a sus naciones, así que esto debería "
"servir para los zombis... ¿no? Acepta munición de pistola estándar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "hand cannon"
msgid_plural "hand cannons"
msgstr[0] "cañón de mano"
msgstr[1] "cañones de mano"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This large pistol is almost as heavy as a small carbine, and just about as "
"powerful too.  Chambered in hard hitting magnum calibers, it is suitable for"
" hunting medium game, humans, or offsetting any of one's perceived "
"deficiencies.  Though traditionally such magnums are revolvers, this one is "
"a magazine fed semi-automatic."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola de gran tamaño es casi tan pesada como una carabina pequeña, y "
"casi tan potente también. Con cámaras de calibres magnum de gran impacto, es"
" adecuada para la caza de animales medianos, humanos o para compensar "
"cualquiera de las deficiencias percibidas. Aunque tradicionalmente estos "
"magnum son revólveres, esta es un arma semiautomática con cargador."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "magnum levergun"
msgid_plural "magnum leverguns"
msgstr[0] "arma de palanca mágnum"
msgstr[1] "armas de palanca mágnum"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern re-imagining of the classic western lever-action, this larger rifle"
" accepts powerful magnum pistol ammunition as well as weaker pistol ammo.  "
"Carrying this along side a magnum pistol would allow one to reduce the "
"number of calibers carried, and allow you to squeeze more power from "
"ammuntion."
msgstr ""
"Una moderna reimaginación de la clásica acción de palanca occidental, este "
"rifle más grande acepta poderosas municiones de pistola magnum así como "
"municiones de pistola más débiles. Llevar esto a lo largo de una pistola "
"magnum permitiría reducir el número de calibres transportados, y le "
"permitiría exprimir más poder de la munición."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "handmade magnum carbine"
msgid_plural "handmade magnum carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina magnum hecha a mano"
msgstr[1] "carabinas magnum hechas a mano"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crudely constructed carbine, chambered for magnum pistol ammo and standard"
" pistol ammo.  It feeds from commercial magnum pistol magazines, and locks "
"with a rudimentary lever action system.  Its powerful cartridge and relative"
" precision should serve well against zombies and medium game."
msgstr ""
"Una carabina de construcción rudimentaria, con recámara para munición de "
"pistola magnum y munición de pistola estándar. Se alimenta de cargadores de "
"pistola magnum comerciales y se bloquea con un rudimentario sistema de "
"palanca. Su potente cartucho y su relativa precisión deberían ser útiles "
"contra los zombis y la caza media."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "pipe magnum"
msgid_plural "pipe magnums"
msgstr[0] "tubo magnum"
msgstr[1] "tubos magnums"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A firearm made from a stout pipe, reinforced at the chamber.  It holds a "
"single a round of standard or magnum pistol ammunition, and has a crude "
"assembly to fire it.  There's no extractor, so it might be slow to reload, "
"and its construction makes for poor reliability and longevity."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de fuego hecha de un tubo robusto, reforzado en la cámara. Contiene "
"un solo cartucho de munición de pistola estándar o mágnum, y tiene un "
"ensamblaje rudimentario para dispararla. No tiene extractor, por lo que "
"puede ser lento de recargar, y su construcción hace que la fiabilidad y la "
"longevidad sean pobres."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "hunting magnum"
msgid_plural "hunting magnums"
msgstr[0] "magnum de caza"
msgstr[1] "magnums de caza"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Early handgun hunters helped develop this revolver's magnum ammunition from "
"standard calibers, which needed heavier revolvers to safely fire it.  These "
"revolvers' cylinders can thus chamber both magnum and standard pistol "
"ammunition.  You could take medium to large game with this hefty piece."
msgstr ""
"Los primeros cazadores de armas ayudaron a desarrollar la munición magnum de"
" este revólver a partir de calibres estándar, que necesitaban revólveres más"
" pesados para disparar con seguridad. Los cilindros de estos revólveres "
"pueden por lo tanto alojar tanto la munición magnum como la de las pistolas "
"estándar. Se puede tomar un juego mediano o grande con esta pieza pesada."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "plinker carbine"
msgid_plural "plinker carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina de práctica"
msgstr[1] "carabinas de práctica"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With near non-existent recoil and inexpensive ammunition, rifles like this "
"one are popular introductory firearms.  It has a built in magazine, capable "
"of holding an impressive amount of its small cartridges.  You could take "
"small game with this, but anything bigger might not even notice."
msgstr ""
"Con un retroceso casi inexistente y munición barata, los rifles como éste "
"son armas de fuego de introducción muy populares. Tiene un cargador "
"incorporado, capaz de contener una cantidad impresionante de sus pequeños "
"cartuchos. Podrías llevarte caza menor con esto, pero cualquier cosa más "
"grande podría no notarse."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "target pistol"
msgid_plural "target pistols"
msgstr[0] "pistola de tiro al blanco"
msgstr[1] "pistolas de tiro al blanco"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This medium sized pistol fires cheap and plentiful plinking ammo, and is "
"exceptionally popular for practice or target shooting.  This pistol is "
"unsuited for taking on anything but small game, as it is meant to poke holes"
" in paper.  Accepts box magazines."
msgstr ""
"Esta pistola de tamaño medio dispara munición barata y abundante, y es "
"excepcionalmente popular para la práctica del tiro al blanco. Esta pistola "
"no es apropiada para tomar cualquier cosa excepto caza menor, ya que está "
"pensada para hacer agujeros en el papel. Acepta cargadores de caja."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "zip gun"
msgid_plural "zip guns"
msgstr[0] "arma improvisada"
msgstr[1] "armas improvisadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crude single shot firearm made from improvised or homemade components, "
"chambered for tiny plinking ammunition.  Zip guns like these often turned up"
" in the hands of criminals and insurgents.  There's no extractor, so it "
"might be slow to reload, and its construction leaves its longevity in "
"question."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de fuego de un solo disparo hecha de componentes improvisados o "
"caseros, con cámara para municiones diminutas. Armas de fuego como estas a "
"menudo aparecen en las manos de criminales e insurgentes. No hay extractor, "
"por lo que puede ser lento de recargar, y su construcción deja su longevidad"
" en duda."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "assault rifle"
msgid_plural "assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de asalto"
msgstr[1] "rifles de asalto"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The products of decades of improvement, rifle such as this are handy, "
"reliable, and adaptable.  An 'assault rifle', it is capable of providing "
"both accurate semi-automatic fire and bursts of automatic fire.  Short of "
"large creatures and light vehicles, this should take care of most of your "
"problems out to several hundred meters."
msgstr ""
"Los productos de décadas de mejora, rifles como éste son prácticos, fiables "
"y adaptables. Un \"rifle de asalto\", es capaz de proporcionar tanto fuego "
"semiautomático preciso como ráfagas de fuego automático. A falta de grandes "
"criaturas y vehículos ligeros, esto debería resolver la mayoría de sus "
"problemas a varios cientos de metros."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "light machine gun"
msgid_plural "light machine guns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil ligero"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles ligeros"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The light machine gun is a formidable implement for suppressive fire, an "
"important part of squad tactics.  Its belt feed allows for hundreds of "
"rounds to be loaded, and its heavy components can withstand long bursts of "
"fire.  While perhaps not as precise as a service rifle, a light machinegun "
"does allow for a considerable amount of energy to be sent down range.  Slow "
"to reload."
msgstr ""
"La ametralladora ligera es un implemento formidable para el fuego de "
"supresión, una parte importante de las tácticas del escuadrón. Su cinturón "
"de alimentación permite cargar cientos de balas, y sus pesados componentes "
"pueden soportar largas ráfagas de fuego. Aunque tal vez no sea tan precisa "
"como un rifle de servicio, una ametralladora ligera permite enviar una "
"cantidad considerable de energía a distancia. Lenta para recargar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "sniper rifle"
msgid_plural "sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de francotirador"
msgstr[1] "rifles de francotirador"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sniper rifles fill military, police and civilian needs for precise, accurate"
" fire.  Modern examples feature detachable magazines and various mounting "
"interfaces for optics and supports.  With care and practice, all should be "
"quite capable of eliminating bipedal threats from very safe ranges."
msgstr ""
"Los rifles de francotirador satisfacen las necesidades militares, policiales"
" y civiles de disparar con precisión y exactitud. Los ejemplos modernos "
"cuentan con cargadores desmontables y varias interfaces de montaje para "
"ópticas y soportes. Con cuidado y práctica, todos deberían ser bastante "
"capaces de eliminar amenazas bípedas desde rangos muy seguros."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "sporter carbine"
msgid_plural "sporter carbines"
msgstr[0] "carabina deportiva"
msgstr[1] "carabinas deportivas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Though often mislabeled an assault rifle, this common, cheap magazine fed "
"carbine isn't capable of automatic fire.  While almost as effective as a "
"proper rifle, the wider variety of components and varying levels of "
"maintenance make these less reliable than their military brethren.  These "
"rifles are just as adequate for taking on anything smaller than large game, "
"however."
msgstr ""
"Aunque a menudo se le llama erróneamente fusil de asalto, esta carabina "
"común y barata alimentada por cargador no es capaz de disparar "
"automáticamente. Aunque son casi tan eficaces como un rifle de verdad, la "
"mayor variedad de componentes y los distintos niveles de mantenimiento hacen"
" que sean menos fiables que sus hermanos militares. Sin embargo, estos "
"rifles son igual de adecuados para enfrentarse a cualquier cosa que no sea "
"caza mayor."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "foreign assault rifle"
msgid_plural "foreign assault rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle extranjero de asalto"
msgstr[1] "rifles extranjeros de asalto"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A battle rifle popular among the Exodii.  Reliable and powerful, though "
"slightly unwieldy to use as an infantry weapon.  Just different enough from "
"local weaponry that the same ammunition cannot be shared between them."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de combate popular entre los Exodii. Fiable y potente, aunque un "
"poco difícil de manejar como arma de infantería. Es lo suficientemente "
"diferente del armamento local como para que no se pueda compartir la misma "
"munición entre ellos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "foreign sniper rifle"
msgid_plural "foreign sniper rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle francotirador extranjero"
msgstr[1] "rifles francotirador extranjeros"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sniper rifle popular among the Exodii.  Just different enough from local "
"weaponry that the same ammunition cannot be shared between them."
msgstr ""
"Un rifle de francotirador popular entre los Exodii. Lo suficientemente "
"diferente del armamento local como para no compartir la misma munición entre"
" ellos."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "railgun rifle"
msgid_plural "railgun rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de cañón de riel"
msgstr[1] "rifles de cañón de riel"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A handheld railgun which magnetically propels a ferromagnetic projectile "
"using an alternating current.  Powered by UPS."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón de riel de mano que propulsa magnéticamente un proyectil "
"ferromagnético usando corriente alterna. Alimentado por SAI."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "combination rifle shotgun"
msgid_plural "combination rifle shotguns"
msgstr[0] "rifle escopeta combinada"
msgstr[1] "rifle escopetas combinadas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A break action firearm comprised of a rifle barrel over two smooth bore "
"shotgun barrels.  Historically used by egomaniac hunters in Africa, now used"
" by their egomaniac descendants in New England."
msgstr ""
"Un arma de fuego de acción rápida compuesta por un cañón de rifle sobre dos "
"cañones de escopeta de ánima lisa. Históricamente usada por cazadores "
"ególatras en África, ahora usada por sus descendientes ególatras en Nueva "
"Inglaterra."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "anti-materiel rifle"
msgid_plural "anti-materiel rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle antimateria"
msgstr[1] "rifles antimateria"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Large, intimidating, and overbuilt, this hefty rifle fires huge projectiles "
"with relative precision.  Though it resembles a sniper rifle, this anti-"
"material weapon is best suited for blinding tanks, shooting at aircraft, or "
"destroying explosives.  It feeds from comically oversized magazines."
msgstr ""
"Grande, intimidante y sobredimensionado, este robusto rifle dispara enormes "
"proyectiles con relativa precisión. Aunque se asemeja a un rifle de "
"francotirador, esta arma anti-materia es más adecuada para cegar tanques, "
"disparar a aviones o destruir explosivos. Se alimenta de cargadores "
"cómicamente de gran tamaño."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "elephant rifle"
msgid_plural "elephant rifles"
msgstr[0] "rifle de elefante"
msgstr[1] "rifles de elefante"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Elegantly engraved, with deep glossy blued steel and figured wood, this "
"break-action double rifle is almost too nice to shoot.  Your shoulder might "
"beg you not to; the chambers are almost wide enough for two fingers and the "
"recoil is monstrous.  You could probably kill anything with this, especially"
" if you were to fire both barrels at once."
msgstr ""
"Elegantemente grabada, con acero azulado brillante y madera labrada, este "
"rifle de doble acción es casi demasiado bonito para disparar. Su hombro "
"podría rogarle que no lo haga; las recámaras son casi lo suficientemente "
"anchas para dos dedos y el retroceso es monstruoso. Probablemente podría "
"matar cualquier cosa con esto, especialmente si disparara los dos cañones a "
"la vez."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "heavy machine gun"
msgid_plural "heavy machine guns"
msgstr[0] "subfusil pesado"
msgstr[1] "subfusiles pesados"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This large, ungainly  belt-fed machine gun fires huge projectiles, "
"originally intended for turn of the century anti-vehicular use.  While no "
"longer suitable for modern tanks or aircraft, thinner skinned vehicles or "
"drones are just as susceptible, as are any other 'smaller' threats.  Slow to"
" reload, incredibly loud, and must be mounted to be fired."
msgstr ""
"Esta gran y desgarbada ametralladora de cinturón dispara enormes "
"proyectiles, originalmente destinados a un uso antiestático a principios de "
"siglo. Aunque ya no son adecuados para los tanques o aviones modernos, los "
"vehículos de piel más fina o los drones son tan susceptibles, como cualquier"
" otra amenaza \"más pequeña\". Son lentos para recargar, increíblemente "
"ruidosos, y deben ser montados para ser disparados."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "disposable rocket launcher"
msgid_plural "disposable rocket launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de cohete desechable"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de cohetes desechables"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Constructed of fiberglass, with crude plastic sights and a titanium barrel, "
"this is a launcher for a single rocket.  Though not as effective as other "
"anti-armor weapons, the true value in this disposable rocket launcher is its"
" portability and lack of dead weight once expended.  Has a backblast, so "
"make sure nothing you mind destroying is behind you."
msgstr ""
"Construido de fibra de vidrio, con miras de plástico crudo y un barril de "
"titanio, es un lanzador para un solo cohete. Aunque no es tan efectivo como "
"otras armas anti-blindaje, el verdadero valor de este lanzador de cohetes "
"desechable es su portabilidad y la falta de peso muerto una vez gastado. "
"Tiene un retroceso, así que asegúrate de que nada que te importe destruir "
"quede atrás."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "recoilless rocket launcher"
msgid_plural "recoilless rocket launchers"
msgstr[0] "lanzador de cohete sin retroceso"
msgstr[1] "lanzadores de cohetes sin retroceso"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This heavy, gigantic rifled tube features a complex optical sight and can "
"launch a wide variety of payloads, including rockets or laser guided "
"missiles.  Depending on the warhead loaded, such weapons are effective "
"against older tanks, most vehicles, bunkers and personnel.  These are meant "
"to be operated by a two-man crew, so reloading might be a bit slow.  Its "
"recoilless design allows for superior range and damage, but it produces "
"tremendous backblast, so make sure nothing you mind destroying is behind "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Este pesado y gigantesco tubo estriado cuenta con una compleja mira óptica y"
" puede lanzar una amplia variedad de cargas útiles, incluyendo cohetes o "
"misiles guiados por láser. Dependiendo de la ojiva cargada, estas armas son "
"efectivas contra tanques antiguos, la mayoría de los vehículos, bunkers y "
"personal. Están pensadas para ser operadas por una tripulación de dos "
"hombres, por lo que la recarga puede ser un poco lenta. Su diseño sin "
"retroceso permite un alcance y un daño superiores, pero produce una tremenda"
" explosión de retroceso, así que asegúrate de que nada de lo que te importe "
"destruir quede atrás."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "double-barrel shotgun"
msgid_plural "double-barrel shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de doble cañón"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de doble cañón"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned double barreled shotgun, with a trigger for each barrel.  "
"Follow up shots are incredibly quick with this, but reloading is a bit slow."
"  Shotshells come in many varieties, and shotguns are suitable for anything "
"from some large game to small birds."
msgstr ""
"Una antigua escopeta de doble cañón, con un gatillo para cada cañón. Los "
"disparos de seguimiento son increíblemente rápidos con esto, pero la recarga"
" es un poco lenta. Los cartuchos vienen en muchas variedades, y las "
"escopetas son adecuadas para cualquier cosa, desde una caza grande hasta "
"aves pequeñas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A crudely handmade double barreled shotgun, with a trigger for each barrel."
"  Follow up shots are incredibly quick with this, but reloading is slow, as "
"there are no extractors or ejectors.  Shotshells come in many varieties, and"
" shotguns are suitable for anything from some large game to small birds."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta de doble cañón hecha a mano, con un gatillo para cada cañón. "
"Los disparos de seguimiento son increíblemente rápidos con esto, pero la "
"recarga es lenta, ya que no hay extractores o eyectores. Las escopetas "
"vienen en muchas variedades, y las escopetas son adecuadas para cualquier "
"cosa, desde alguna caza grande hasta aves pequeñas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "sporting shotgun"
msgid_plural "sporting shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta deportiva"
msgstr[1] "escopetas deportivas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple, popular design, sporting shotguns are used by law enforcement, "
"civilians and occasionally militaries.  Its internal magazine is small by "
"modern standards, and reloading can be quite slow.  Shotshells come in many "
"varieties, and shotguns are suitable for anything from some large game to "
"small birds."
msgstr ""
"Un diseño simple y popular, las escopetas deportivas son utilizadas por las "
"fuerzas del orden, civiles y ocasionalmente militares. Su cargador interno "
"es pequeño para los estándares modernos, y la recarga puede ser bastante "
"lenta. Las escopetas vienen en muchas variedades, y las escopetas son "
"adecuadas para cualquier cosa, desde alguna caza grande hasta aves pequeñas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "tactical shotgun"
msgid_plural "tactical shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta táctica"
msgstr[1] "escopetas tácticas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A detachable magazine fed shotgun, mostly oriented towards overly "
"enthusiastic civilians.  Featuring rails and a menacing black appearance, "
"this sort of shotgun doesn't really look like it has a sporting use.  The "
"magazines reduce lengthy reloading times associated with shotguns.  Though "
"known for being somewhat finicky, these can be tuned to run with some "
"reliability."
msgstr ""
"Un cargador desmontable alimentado por una escopeta, orientado "
"principalmente a civiles demasiado entusiastas. Con rieles y una apariencia "
"negra amenazante, este tipo de escopeta no parece tener un uso deportivo. "
"Los cargadores reducen los largos tiempos de recarga asociados a las "
"escopetas. Aunque son conocidas por ser algo quisquillosas, pueden ser "
"ajustadas para funcionar con cierta fiabilidad."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Ichaival"
msgid_plural "Ichaivals"
msgstr[0] "Ichaival"
msgstr[1] "Ichaivals"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ichaival, the bow of Odin.  Rumored to fire 10 arrows with every pull of the"
" string.  It has gold and silver ornaments on it, as well as an ornate "
"Raven."
msgstr ""
"Ichaival, el arco de Odín. Se rumorea que dispara 10 flechas con cada tirón "
"de la cuerda. Tiene adornos de oro y plata, así como un cuervo ornamentado."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Druid composite bow"
msgid_plural "Druid composite bows"
msgstr[0] "arco compuesto druida"
msgstr[1] "arcos compuestos druidas"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bow made of multiple materials to maximize energy efficiency.  There are "
"two Druid runes embedded at the tips."
msgstr ""
"Un arco hecho de múltiples materiales para maximizar la eficiencia "
"energética. Hay dos runas druidas incrustadas en las puntas."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "M47A1 Techno-Medusa"
msgid_plural "M47A1 Techno-Medusae"
msgstr[0] "M47A1 Techno-Medusa"
msgstr[1] "M47A1 Techno-Medusae"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A magically-enhanced update to the Phillips & Rodgers' M47 Medusa, a  multi-"
"caliber revolver aimed at survivalists.  While Technomancy improves the "
"reliability with smaller cartridges, it is not as accurate as dedicated "
"caliber revolvers due to freebore."
msgstr ""
"Una actualización mejorada mágicamente de la Medusa M47 de Phillips & "
"Rodgers, un revólver de calibre múltiple dirigido a los supervivencialistas."
" Aunque la tecnomancia mejora la fiabilidad con cartuchos más pequeños, no "
"es tan precisa como los revólveres de calibre dedicado debido al freebore."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "gunblade"
msgid_plural "gunblades"
msgstr[0] "hoja de pistola"
msgstr[1] "hojas de pistola"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Constructed similarly to a falcata, this forward-sloping blade has a short-"
"barrel pump shotgun attached to the blade's spine for finishing blows or a "
"first strike."
msgstr ""
"Construida de manera similar a una falcata, esta hoja inclinada hacia "
"adelante tiene una escopeta de bomba de cañón corto unida a la columna "
"vertebral de la hoja para los golpes finales o el primer golpe."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Mosin-Nagant 91/30 Boreal"
msgid_plural "Mosin-Nagant 91/30 Boreal"
msgstr[0] "Mosin-Nagant 91/30 Boreal"
msgstr[1] "Mosin-Nagant 91/30 Boreal"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modernized version of the Mosin-Nagant 1891/30 by Cannith Industries, "
"chambered in 7.62x51 NATO.  The barrel is enchanted to give bullets a minor "
"freezing property."
msgstr ""
"Una versión modernizada del Mosin-Nagant 1891/30 de Cannith Industries, con "
"cámara de 7,62x51 NATO. El cañón está encantado para dar a las balas una "
"propiedad de congelación menor."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "shotcestus"
msgid_plural "shotcestuses"
msgstr[0] "cestus de disparo"
msgstr[1] "cestuses de disparo"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sawn-off double-barrel shotgun mounted on a metal cestus.  The lack of a "
"stock to absorb recoil means some strength is required to fire."
msgstr ""
"Una escopeta de doble cañón aserrada montada en un cesto de metal. La falta "
"de una culata para absorber el retroceso significa que se requiere cierta "
"fuerza para disparar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Woodbow"
msgid_plural "Woodbows"
msgstr[0] "arco de madera"
msgstr[1] "Woodbows"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A magically conjured ornate recurve bow of solid flexible wood.  A matching "
"conjured wooden arrow appears when you draw the string back for firing."
msgstr ""
"Un arco recurvo ornamentado mágicamente conjurado de madera maciza y "
"flexible. Una flecha de madera conjurada a juego aparece cuando se retira la"
" cuerda para disparar."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "impact sling"
msgid_plural "impact slings"
msgstr[0] "honda de impacto"
msgstr[1] "hondas de impacto"

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A leather sling, quivering with energy when in your palm to the point of "
"almost tearing.  A pebble appears when you begin spinning it."
msgstr ""
"Una honda de cuero, que tiembla de energía cuando está en la palma de la "
"mano hasta casi desgarrarse. Cuando empiezas a hacerla girar, aparece un "
"guijarro."

#: lang/json/gun_from_json.py
msgid "Fake gun that fires barbed javelins."
msgstr "Pistola falsa que dispara jabalinas de púas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "pipe combination gun shotgun"
msgid_plural "pipe combination gun shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta de cañón de combinación de tubo"
msgstr[1] "escopetas de cañón de combinación de tubos"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The integrated underbarrel shotgun of a pipe combination gun which holds two"
" shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta integrada bajo cañón de un arma combinada de tubo que solo "
"tiene dos disparos. No se puede quitar."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "underbarrel"
msgstr "bajocañón"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "barrel extension"
msgid_plural "barrel extensions"
msgstr[0] "extensión de cañón"
msgstr[1] "extensiones de cañón"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A longer barrel increases the muzzle velocity of a firearm, contributing to "
"both accuracy and damage but reduces portability and slows aiming."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón más largo aumenta la velocidad inicial de un arma de fuego, lo que "
"contribuye a la precisión y daño pero reduce la portabilidad y ralentiza el "
"objetivo."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "barrel"
msgstr "cañón"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "rifled barrel"
msgid_plural "rifled barrels"
msgstr[0] "cañón estriado"
msgstr[1] "cañones estriados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Rifling a shotgun barrel is mainly done in order to improve its accuracy "
"when firing slugs.  The rifling makes the gun less suitable for shot, "
"however."
msgstr ""
"El estriado del cañón de una escopeta se hace para mejorar su precisión al "
"disparar cartuchos. Sin embargo, el estriado hace que el arma sea menos "
"apropiada para el disparo."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "rapid blowback"
msgid_plural "rapid blowbacks"
msgstr[0] "retroceso rápido"
msgstr[1] "retrocesos rápidos"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An improved blowback mechanism makes your firearm's automatic fire faster, "
"at the cost of reduced accuracy and increased noise."
msgstr ""
"Un mecanismo mejorado de blowback hace que el disparo automático del arma "
"sea más rápido, pero reduce la precisión e incrementa el ruido."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "mechanism"
msgstr "mecanismo"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "auto-fire mechanism"
msgid_plural "auto-fire mechanisms"
msgstr[0] "mecanismo de auto-disparo"
msgstr[1] "mecanismos de auto-disparo"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple mechanism that converts a pistol to a selective fire weapon with a "
"burst size of three rounds.  However it reduces accuracy and increases "
"noise."
msgstr ""
"Un mecanismo simple que convierte una pistola en un arma de fuego selectiva "
"con un tamaño de ráfaga de tres balas. Sin embargo esto reduce la precisión "
"y aumenta el ruido."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "handmade auto-fire mechanism"
msgid_plural "handmade auto-fire mechanisms"
msgstr[0] "mecanismo de auto-disparo hecho a mano"
msgstr[1] "mecanismos de auto-disparo hechos a mano"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Mechanism that allows your CW-24 rifle to fire in fully automatic mode.  It "
"is handmade."
msgstr ""
"Es un mecanismo que le permite al rifle CW-24 disparar en modo completamente"
" automático. Está hecho a mano."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ".22 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".22 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "conversivo a calibre .22"
msgstr[1] "conversivos a calibre .22"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x19mm, .38, .40, 5.7mm, 4.6mm, 7.62x39mm "
"or .223 firearm converts it to a .22 firearm.  The conversion results in a "
"slight reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Reemplazando varias partes fundamentales de un arma calibre 9x19mm, .38, "
".40, 5.7mm, 4.6mm, 7.62x39mm o .223, lo convierte en un .22. Esta conversión"
" reduce un poco la precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bore"
msgstr "calibre"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ".223 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".223 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "conversivo a calibre .223"
msgstr[1] "conversivos a calibre .223"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This kit is used to convert a shotgun, 5.45x39mm, 7.62x39mm, .30-06, or .308"
" rifle to the popular, accurate, and lighter .223 caliber.  The conversion "
"results in slight reductions to both accuracy and ammo capacity."
msgstr ""
"Este equipo es usado para convertir una escopeta, 5.45x39mm, 7.62x39mm, "
".30-06 o el rifle calibre .308 al calibre popular, preciso y ligero .223. "
"Esta conversión reduce un poco tanto la precisión como la capacidad de "
"munición."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ".308 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".308 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "Kit de conversión a calibre .308"
msgstr[1] "Kits de conversión a calibre .308"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This kit is used to convert a shotgun or 7.62x39mm, .223 or .30-06 rifle to "
"the popular and powerful .308 caliber.  The conversion results in reduced "
"ammo capacity and a slight reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Este equipo es usado para convertir una escopeta o el calibre de rifle "
"7.62x39mm, .223 o .30-06, al calibre popular y poderoso .308. Esta "
"conversión reduce la capacidad de munición y también reduce un poco la "
"precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ".45 caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".45 caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de conversión del calibre .45"
msgstr[1] "kits de conversión del calibre .45"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x19mm, .38, .40 or .44 firearm converts it"
" to a .45 firearm.  The conversion results in a slight reduction to "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Reemplazando varias partes fundamentales de un arma calibre 9x19mm, .38, .40"
" o .44, la convierte en una .45. Esta conversión reduce un poco la "
"precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "4.6mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "4.6mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "conversivo a calibre 4.6mm"
msgstr[1] "conversivos a calibre 4.6mm"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A conversion kit produced by Heckler and Koch, used to convert .22, 9x19mm, "
"or .38 firearms to their proprietary 4.6x30mm, a round designed for accuracy"
" and armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"Un kit de conversión producido por Heckler y Koch, usado para convertir "
"armas de fuego de .22, 9x19mm, o .38 a su propia 4.6x30mm, una bala diseñada"
" para la precisión y la penetración de la armadura."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "5.7mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "5.7mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "kits de conversión a calibre 5.7mm"
msgstr[1] "kits de conversión a calibre 5.7mm"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A conversion kit produced by FN Herstal, used to convert .22, 9x19mm, or .38"
" firearms to their proprietary 5.7x28mm, a round designed for accuracy and "
"armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"Un kit de conversión producido por FN Herstal, usado para convertir armas de"
" fuego de .22, 9x19mm, o .38 a su marca registrada 5.7x28mm, una bala "
"diseñada para la precisión y la penetración de la armadura."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "9x19mm caliber conversion kit"
msgid_plural "9x19mm caliber conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "conversivo a calibre 9x19mm"
msgstr[1] "conversivos a calibre 9x19mm"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Replacing several key parts of a 9x18mm, .38, .40, .44 or .45 firearm "
"converts it to a 9x19mm firearm.  The conversion results in a slight "
"reduction to accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Reemplazando varias partes fundamentales de un arma calibre 9x18mm, .38, "
".40, .44 o .45, la convierte en una 9x19mm. Esta conversión reduce un poco "
"la precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "belt feed adapter"
msgid_plural "belt feed adapters"
msgstr[0] "adaptador de cinta cargadora"
msgstr[1] "adaptadores de cinta cargadora"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A kit providing the necessary parts for permanently converting a firearm "
"from magazine to belt-feed.  Guaranteed to void your warranty."
msgstr ""
"Es un equipo que provee las partes necesarias para convertir de manera "
"permanente la alimentación por cargador de un arma de fuego, al sistema de "
"cinta cargadora. Se garantiza la nulidad de la garantía."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "magazine"
msgstr "cargador"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "tuned mechanism"
msgid_plural "tuned mechanisms"
msgstr[0] "mecanismo calibrado"
msgstr[1] "mecanismos calibrados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of finely tuned internal components which increase the precision and "
"reliably of a firearm."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de componentes internos calibrados que incrementan la precisión "
"y fiabilidad de un arma de fuego."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "Leadworks magazine adapter"
msgid_plural "Leadworks magazine adapters"
msgstr[0] "Adaptador de cargador Leadworks"
msgstr[1] "Adaptadores de cargadores Leadworks"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bootleg adapter for permanently converting a firearm to accept proprietary"
" Leadworks magazines.  Guaranteed to void your warranty."
msgstr ""
"Un adaptador réplica para permanentemente convertir un arma de fuego de para"
" que funcione con los cargadores de la marca Leadworks. Se garantiza la "
"anulación de la garantía."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "LW barrel extension"
msgid_plural "LW barrel extensions"
msgstr[0] "Extensión de cañón de LW"
msgstr[1] "Extensiones de cañón de LW"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Leadworks built in longer barrel increases the muzzle velocity of a "
"firearm, contributing to both accuracy and damage."
msgstr ""
"Es un cañón Leadworks más largo que incrementa la velocidad inicial del arma"
" de fuego, contribuyendo tanto a la precisión como al daño."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "LW heavy duty barrel"
msgid_plural "LW heavy duty barrels"
msgstr[0] "Cañón de alta resistencia LW"
msgstr[1] "Cañones de alta resistencia LW"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A Leadworks built in heavy duty barrel especially designed for prolonged "
"shooting.  Increases damage output and weapon range."
msgstr ""
"Un Leadworks fabricado en un barril de alta resistencia especialmente "
"diseñado para disparos prolongados. Incrementa la producción de daño y el "
"alcance del arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "aux flamethrower"
msgid_plural "aux flamethrowers"
msgstr[0] "lanzallamas auxiliar"
msgstr[1] "lanzallamas auxiliares"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This custom-built miniature flamethrower is made to be attached to almost "
"any sort of firearm, greatly expanding its lethality."
msgstr ""
"Este lanzallamas miniatura está hecho para ser adjuntado a casi cualquier "
"tipo de arma de fuego, lo que aumenta mucho su capacidad letal."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py src/item.cpp
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "crossbow"
msgstr "ballesta"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "arrow rest"
msgid_plural "arrow rests"
msgstr[0] "resto de flecha"
msgstr[1] "restos de flecha"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small extension above the grip which an arrow rests upon while being "
"aimed.  Improves accuracy with no drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña extensión sobre el agarre que permite apoyar la flecha "
"mientras se está apuntando. Mejora la precisión y no tiene desventajas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "accessories"
msgstr "accesorios"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py src/item.cpp
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "bow"
msgstr "arco"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bow stabilizer"
msgid_plural "bow stabilizers"
msgstr[0] "estabilizador de arco"
msgstr[1] "estabilizadores de arco"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A counterweight placed forward of the bow's grip allows for greater "
"accuracy.  Aside from increased weight and size, there are no drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Un contrapeso puesto delante del agarre del arco, que permite mejorar la "
"precisión. La única desventaja que tiene es el incremento del peso."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "stabilizer"
msgstr "estabilizador"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bow stabilizer system"
msgid_plural "bow stabilizer systems"
msgstr[0] "sistema de estabilización de arco"
msgstr[1] "sistemas de estabilización de arco"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of three stabilizing, dampened rods with a spring-loaded bracket to "
"mount on modern bows.  Takes extra time to set up when wielding, but doesn't"
" take much extra space."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de tres estabilizadores, varillas amortiguadas con soportes "
"con resortes para ser montados en arcos modernos. Lleva un tiempo poder "
"armarlo cuando empuñás el arco, pero no te ocupa mucho más espacio."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bow dampening kit"
msgid_plural "bow dampening kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de amortiguación de arco"
msgstr[1] "kits de amortiguación de arco"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of simple pads and strips of fur or rubber with adhesive backing, "
"designed to stick on the limbs and string of a bow to absorb vibrations.  "
"This substantially reduces noise during firing and can help with accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de almohadillas y correas de piel o goma adhesiva, diseñado "
"para pegarse en las palas y cuerda del arco para absorber las vibraciones. "
"Esto reduce sustancialmente el ruido al disparar y puede ayudar en la "
"precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "dampening"
msgstr "amortiguando"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "belt clip"
msgid_plural "belt clips"
msgstr[0] "clip de cinturón"
msgstr[1] "clips de cinturón"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a belt clip that attaches to the grip or slide of a pistol so as to "
"facilitate 'Mexican carry', the practice of carrying without a holster.  It "
"does not offer any protection for the trigger, so users are strongly advised"
" to carry with the chamber empty or select a firearm with a very heavy "
"trigger pull."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de un cargador para el cinturón que se sujeta a la empuñadura o "
"deslizamiento de una pistola para facilitar la \"carga mexicana\", la "
"práctica de llevarla sin funda. No ofrece ninguna protección para el "
"gatillo, por lo que se aconseja encarecidamente a los usuarios que lleven la"
" recámara vacía o que seleccionen un arma de fuego con un tirón muy fuerte "
"del gatillo."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "rugerlcp"
msgstr "rugerlcp"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "kp32"
msgstr "kp32"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "kp3at"
msgstr "kp3at"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "kpf9"
msgstr "kpf9"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "cop_38"
msgstr "cop_38"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "moss_brownie"
msgstr "moss_brownie"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "ported barrel"
msgid_plural "ported barrels"
msgstr[0] "cañón agujereado"
msgstr[1] "cañones agujereados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A ported barrel redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, "
"improves recoil but increases noise and reduces accuracy slightly."
msgstr ""
"El cañón agujereado permite liberar los gases de la combustión de la pólvora"
" para compensar el levantamiento de la bocacha. Disminuye el retroceso pero "
"aumenta el ruido y reduce un poco la precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "shortened barrel"
msgid_plural "shortened barrels"
msgstr[0] "cañón recortado"
msgstr[1] "cañones recortados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shortened barrel results in markedly reduced accuracy, and a minor "
"increase in noise, but also greatly improves the ease with which the weapon "
"can be carried and wielded."
msgstr ""
"Un cañón recortado reduce marcadamente la precisión, y un pequeño aumento "
"del ruido, pero también mejora mucho la facilidad de llevar y empuñar el "
"arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "upstest"
msgid_plural "upstests"
msgstr[0] "upstest"
msgstr[1] "upstests"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Testmod for UPS drain on mods, this should never spawn, if you see this, "
"it's a bug.  50x more UPS drain."
msgstr ""
"Mods de prueba para el drenaje de SAI en los mods, esto nunca debería "
"aparecer, si ves esto, es un error. 50 veces más drenaje SAI."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "Power shot"
msgid_plural "Power shots"
msgstr[0] "Disparo de energía"
msgstr[1] "Disparos de energía"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a pseudo item -- the builtin part of a fusion blaster for the "
"maximum power firing mode."
msgstr ""
"Este es un pseudo-artículo... la parte construida de un explosivo de fusión "
"para el modo de disparo de máxima potencia."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "brass catcher"
msgid_plural "brass catchers"
msgstr[0] "recogedores de plomo"
msgstr[1] "recogedores de plomo"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A bag that hangs off the side of your gun and catches ejected casings so you"
" don't have to pick them up."
msgstr ""
"Es una bolsa que cuelga a un costado del arma y recolecta los casquillos "
"eyectadas, así no tienes que levantarlas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ".300 AAC Blackout AR-15 conversion kit"
msgid_plural ".300 AAC Blackout AR-15 conversion kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de conversión AR-15 .300 AAC Blackout"
msgstr[1] "kits de conversión AR-15 .300 AAC Blackout"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "A complete AR-15 upper assembly with a .300 AAC Blackout barrel."
msgstr ""
"Un ensamblaje superior completo de AR-15 con un cañón de Blackout de .300 "
"AAC."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "ar15"
msgstr "ar15"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "m4a1"
msgstr "m4a1"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "m16a4"
msgstr "m16a4"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "h&k416a5"
msgstr "h&k416a5"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "m27iar"
msgstr "m27iar"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "lightweight replacement furniture"
msgid_plural "lightweight replacement furnitures"
msgstr[0] "parte ligera de reemplazo"
msgstr[1] "partes ligeras de reemplazo"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of lightweight composite grips and furniture that reduces a firearm's "
"weight, and as a consequence, its handling and melee damage."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de mordazas compuestas ligeras que reduce el peso de un arma de "
"fuego, y como consecuencia de ello, la manipulación y el daño cuerpo a "
"cuerpo."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "grip"
msgstr "agarre"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "ergonomic grip"
msgid_plural "ergonomic grips"
msgstr[0] "agarre ergonómico"
msgstr[1] "agarres ergonómicos"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of ergonomic replacement furniture for a firearm improving handling."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de muebles de reemplazo ergonómico para un arma de fuego que "
"mejora el manejo."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "breacher grip"
msgid_plural "breacher grips"
msgstr[0] "agarre del infractor(breacher grips)"
msgstr[1] "agarres del infractor(breacher grips)"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A very uncomfortable straight grip.  Clearly not intended for regular use."
msgstr ""
"Un agarre recto muy incómodo. Claramente no está destinado a un uso regular."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "beam scatterer"
msgid_plural "beam scatterers"
msgstr[0] "dispersor de rayo"
msgstr[1] "dispersores de rayo"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of optics made to fit on laser weapons, which will diffract the laser "
"beam into several lower powered beams.  This increases point-blank damage, "
"but greatly reduces range."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de ópticas hechas para encajar en armas láser, que difractará el"
" rayo láser en varios rayos de menor potencia. Esto aumenta el daño a "
"quemarropa, pero reduce enormemente el alcance."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "lens"
msgstr "lente"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "focusing lens"
msgid_plural "focusing lenses"
msgstr[0] "lente de enfoque"
msgstr[1] "lentes de enfoque"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of optics to concentrate the laser beam on a smaller focus point.  "
"This increases range and damage output, but complicates targeting."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de ópticas para concentrar el rayo láser en un punto de enfoque "
"más pequeño. Esto aumenta el alcance y la salida de los daños, pero complica"
" el apuntado."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "electrolaser conversion"
msgid_plural "electrolaser conversions"
msgstr[0] "conversivo electroláser"
msgstr[1] "conversivos electroláser"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of high-tech electronics and optics.  These converts a laser pistol "
"into a less-lethal electrolaser capable of stunning targets, at the cost of "
"a decreased damage output and increased power consumption."
msgstr ""
"Es un equipo de electrónicos y ópticas de alta tecnología. Convierte una "
"pistola láser en una electroláser de menor potencia, capaz de aturdir al "
"objetivo, con menor daño de salida y mayor consumo de energía."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "effective emitter"
msgid_plural "effective emitters"
msgstr[0] "emisor efectivo"
msgstr[1] "emisores efectivos"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of electronics to optimize emitter workcycle and increase overall "
"energy efficiency.  Decreases power consumption."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de electrónica para optimizar el ciclo de trabajo del emisor y "
"aumentar la eficiencia energética general. Disminuye el consumo de energía."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "emitter"
msgstr "emisor"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "high density capacitor"
msgid_plural "high density capacitors"
msgstr[0] "condensador de alta densidad"
msgstr[1] "condensadores de alta densidad"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A capacitor with a higher energy density increases range and damage; at the "
"cost of a markedly increased power consumption."
msgstr ""
"Un condensador con una mayor densidad de energía aumenta el alcance y los "
"daños; a costa de un consumo de energía notablemente mayor."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "speedloader chute"
msgid_plural "speedloader chutes"
msgstr[0] "cargador de velocidad de caida"
msgstr[1] "cargadores de velocidad de caida"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metal ramp that is installed near a shotgun's feeding port to index "
"speedloader tubes."
msgstr ""
"Una rampa metálica que se instala cerca del puerto de alimentación de una "
"escopeta para insertar cartuchos de cargadores de velocidad."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "loading port"
msgstr "puerto de carga"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "match trigger"
msgid_plural "match triggers"
msgstr[0] "gatillo de competición"
msgstr[1] "gatillos de competición"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A precision weighted trigger assembly that slightly improves a firearm's "
"accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de gatillo con peso de precisión que mejora ligeramente la "
"precisión de un arma de fuego."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "drop-in auto sear"
msgid_plural "drop-in auto sears"
msgstr[0] "drop-in auto sear"
msgstr[1] "drop-in auto sears"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a vaguely 'U' shaped piece of metal with a vaguely 'T' shaped "
"flapper on a pin.  Once tucked into an AR-15's lower receiver, the rifle "
"will become selective fire-capable.  The handcrafted-sear surface isn't as "
"good as actual full-auto parts, so precision and reliability suffer "
"slightly."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una pieza de metal con forma de \"U\" y una aleta con forma de \"T\""
" en un alfiler. Una vez metido en el receptor inferior de un AR-15, el rifle"
" será capaz de disparar selectivamente. La superficie de la caja no es tan "
"buena como la de las piezas automáticas, por lo que la precisión y la "
"fiabilidad se ven ligeramente afectadas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "ar15_retool_300blk"
msgstr "ar15_retool_300blk"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "ar_pistol"
msgstr "ar_pistol"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "oa93"
msgstr "oa93"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "lightning link"
msgid_plural "lightning links"
msgstr[0] "lightning link"
msgstr[1] "lightning links"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Originally designed for the Colt SP-1, this 'reproduction' is intended to "
"convert an AR-15 into a full-auto only rifle.  Once the necessary "
"modifications are made and the link is in place, semi-auto is disabled and "
"full-auto is enabled.  Reliability and precision suffer greatly due to "
"questionable craftsmanship and lack of unobtainium SP-1 parts."
msgstr ""
"Originalmente diseñado para el Colt SP-1, esta \"reproducción\" está "
"destinada a convertir un AR-15 en un rifle automático. Una vez que se hacen "
"las modificaciones necesarias y se establece el enlace, se desactiva el "
"semi-automático y se activa el automático completo. La fiabilidad y la "
"precisión sufren enormemente debido a la cuestionable artesanía y a la falta"
" de piezas de unobtainium SP-1."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "firearm waterproofing"
msgid_plural "firearm waterproofings"
msgstr[0] "impermeabilizador de arma"
msgstr[1] "impermeabilizadores de arma"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of seals and gaskets that will allow a firearm to operate reliably "
"while submerged in water."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de juntas y burletes que permiten utilizar un arma de fuego "
"estando sumergida en el agua."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "replaceable furniture kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable furniture kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de reemplazo de muebles"
msgstr[1] "kits de reemplazo de muebles"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a kit consisting of various steel and plastic parts; when installed,"
" it would permanently modify and partially replace some of the weapon's "
"furniture so that it could be easily changed if needed.  This allows "
"installing any kind of more advanced grips or other furniture."
msgstr ""
"Este es un kit que consta de varias piezas de acero y partes de plástico; "
"una vez instalado, modificaría permanentemente y sustituiría parcialmente "
"algunos de los partes del arma para poder cambiarlos fácilmente si fuera "
"necesario. Esto permite instalar cualquier tipo de empuñaduras más avanzadas"
" u otros partes."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "grip mount"
msgstr "montar agarre"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "side mount"
msgid_plural "side mounts"
msgstr[0] "montaje lateral"
msgstr[1] "montajes laterales"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a rail accessory, designed to be "
"permanently installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners.  "
"Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una montura de plástico para fijar un accesorio de riel, "
"diseñada para ser instalada permanentemente en casi cualquier arma, junto "
"con algunos ajustadores. Ideal para sacar a relucir su táctica interna en "
"armas antiguas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "rail mount"
msgstr "montaje en el riel"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "sights mount"
msgid_plural "sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "montura de mira"
msgstr[1] "monturas de miras"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any weapon other than launchers and pistols, along "
"with some fasteners.  Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older "
"guns."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una montura de plástico para fijar una mira, diseñada para ser "
"instalada permanentemente en casi cualquier arma que no sean lanzadores y "
"pistolas, junto con algunos ajustadores. Ideal para sacar a relucir su "
"táctica interna en armas antiguas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "launcher sights mount"
msgid_plural "launcher sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "montura de miras de lanzador"
msgstr[1] "monturas de miras de lanzador"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any launcher, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for "
"bringing out your inner tacticool on rocket launchers."
msgstr ""
"Es un soporte de plástico para fijar una mira, diseñado para ser instalado "
"permanentemente en casi cualquier lanzador, junto con algunos ajustadores. "
"Ideal para sacar su táctica interna en los lanzadores de cohetes."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "pistol sights mount"
msgid_plural "pistol sights mounts"
msgstr[0] "montura de miras de pistola"
msgstr[1] "monturas de miras de pistola"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching a sight, designed to be permanently "
"installed onto almost any pistol, along with some fasteners.  Ideal for "
"bringing out your inner tacticool on pocket pistols."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una montura de plástico para fijar una mira, diseñada para ser "
"instalada de forma permanente en casi cualquier pistola, junto con algunos "
"ajustadores. Ideal para sacar su táctica interior en pistolas de bolsillo."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "replaceable stock kit"
msgid_plural "replaceable stock kits"
msgstr[0] "kit de culata reemplazable"
msgstr[1] "kits de culata reemplazable"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a kit consisting of various steel parts; when installed, it would "
"remove the weapon's original fixed stock, install a new stock mount on its "
"place, modify original stock to fit it and then reattach it to the gun, or "
"simply attach a stock mount if gun had no stock to start with.  This allows "
"easy installation of any kind of more advanced stocks."
msgstr ""
"Este es un kit que consiste en varias partes de acero; una vez instalado, "
"retiraría la culata original del arma, instalaría una nueva montura en su "
"lugar, modificaría la culata original para ajustarla y luego la volvería a "
"colocar en el arma, o simplemente colocaría una montura si el arma no "
"tuviera culata para empezar. Esto permite una fácil instalación de cualquier"
" tipo de culatas más avanzadas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "stock mount"
msgstr "montura culata"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bottom mount"
msgid_plural "bottom mounts"
msgstr[0] "montura inferior"
msgstr[1] "monturas inferiores"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a plastic mount for attaching an underbarrel accessory, designed to "
"be permanently installed onto almost any weapon, along with some fasteners."
"  Ideal for bringing out your inner tacticool on older guns."
msgstr ""
"Se trata de una montura de plástico para sujetar un accesorio bajo el cañón,"
" diseñada para ser instalada permanentemente en casi cualquier arma, junto "
"con algunos ajustadores. Ideal para sacar a relucir su táctica interna en "
"armas antiguas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "underbarrel mount"
msgstr "montaje bajo el cañón"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "muzzle brake"
msgid_plural "muzzle brakes"
msgstr[0] "freno de boca"
msgstr[1] "frenos de boca"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A muzzle brake redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, "
"improving recoil but increasing bulk, noise, and reducing accuracy slightly."
msgstr ""
"El freno de boca redirige los gases de la combustión de la pólvora para "
"compensar el levantamiento de la bocacha. Disminuye el retroceso pero "
"aumenta el tamaño y el ruido, y reduce un poco la precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "muzzle"
msgstr "bocacha"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified muzzle brake"
msgid_plural "modified muzzle brakes"
msgstr[0] " compensador de retroceso modificado"
msgstr[1] " compensadores de retroceso modificado"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A muzzle brake redirects exhaust gases to compensate for muzzle climb, "
"improving recoil but increasing bulk, noise, and reducing accuracy slightly."
"  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any firearm "
"other than launchers, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Un compesador de retroceso redirige los gases de escape para compensar el "
"ascenso de la boca, mejorando el retroceso pero aumentando el volumen y el "
"ruido, y reduciendo ligeramente la precisión. Este fue modificado y "
"personalizado para montarlo en casi cualquier arma de fuego que no sean "
"lanzadores, si así lo desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "homemade suppressor"
msgid_plural "homemade suppressors"
msgstr[0] "silenciador casero"
msgstr[1] "silenciadores caseros"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A homemade suppressor made from a pipe and improvised wipe media.  For as "
"long as the wipes hold up, it will reduce the amount of noise and muzzle "
"flash generated by the report of a firearm.  Gunfire is extremely loud and "
"can damage your hearing without protection; a suppressor will bring the "
"loudness of a report down to generally safe levels, as well as slightly "
"reducing recoil and muzzle velocity.  This simple suppressor is large and, "
"when attached, will interfere with your ability to aim down the base sights "
"of the gun."
msgstr ""
"Un supresor casero hecho de un tubo y medios de limpieza improvisados. "
"Mientras las toallitas se mantengan en pie, reducirá la cantidad de ruido y "
"el destello del bozal generado por el informe de un arma de fuego. Los "
"disparos son extremadamente fuertes y pueden dañar el oído sin protección; "
"un supresor reducirá la intensidad de un informe a niveles generalmente "
"seguros, así como también reducirá ligeramente la velocidad de retroceso y "
"del compensador. Este simple supresor es grande y, cuando se coloca, "
"interferirá con su capacidad de apuntar a las miras de la base del arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "'solvent trap' suppressor"
msgid_plural "'solvent trap' suppressors"
msgstr[0] "supresor 'trampa de disolvente'"
msgstr[1] "supresores 'trampa de disolventes'"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is an automotive filter crudely adapted to mate up with a firearm's "
"barrel, generating an illegal, unregistered suppressor.  Good thing there "
"don't seem to be any ATF agents around to arrest you.  While close in design"
" to a real suppressor, it was not designed for high pressures involved and "
"will eventually lose effectiveness.  The installed filter is large and, when"
" attached, will interfere with your ability to aim down the base sights of "
"the gun."
msgstr ""
"Este es un filtro automotriz crudamente adaptado para acoplarse al cañón de "
"un arma de fuego, generando un supresor ilegal y no registrado. Lo bueno es "
"que no parece haber ningún agente de la ATF cerca para arrestarte. Aunque "
"está muy cerca de un supresor real, no fue diseñado para altas presiones y "
"eventualmente perderá efectividad. El filtro instalado es grande y, cuando "
"se coloca, interferirá con su capacidad de apuntar a las miras de la base "
"del arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "soda bottle silencer"
msgid_plural "soda bottle silencers"
msgstr[0] "silenciador de botella de refresco"
msgstr[1] "silenciadores de botellas de refresco"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a 'silencer' made from a 2 liter soda bottle, some smaller bottles "
"for baffles, and a generous length of duct tape.  Gunfire is extremely loud "
"and can damage your hearing without protection and you can be certain that "
"this will not save your ears whatsoever.  What it might do is allow you to "
"get a shot or two off with a slightly quieter report.  This simple "
"suppressor is large and, when attached, will interfere with your ability to "
"aim down the base sights of the gun."
msgstr ""
"Este es un \"silenciador\" hecho de una botella de refresco de 2 litros, "
"algunas botellas más pequeñas para los deflectores, y un generoso cantidad "
"de cinta americana. Los disparos son extremadamente fuertes y pueden dañar "
"tu oído sin protección y puedes estar seguro de que esto no salvará tus "
"oídos en absoluto. Lo que podría hacer es permitirte hacer un disparo o dos "
"con un informe ligeramente más silencioso. Este simple supresor es grande y,"
" cuando se coloca, interferirá con su capacidad de apuntar a la base de la "
"mira del arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "RK6S34 suppressor"
msgid_plural "RK6S34 suppressors"
msgstr[0] "Supresor RK6S34"
msgstr[1] "Supresores RK6S34"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A suppressor reduces the amount of noise and muzzle flash generated by the "
"report of a firearm.  This RK6S34 Mustela is a rather advanced version "
"integral to the RM11B rifle system."
msgstr ""
"Un supresor reduce la cantidad de ruido y el fogonazo generado por el estado"
" de un arma de fuego. Este RK6S34 Mustela es una versión más avanzada del "
"sistema integral del rifle RM11B."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "shotgun suppressor"
msgid_plural "shotgun suppressors"
msgstr[0] "silenciador de escopeta"
msgstr[1] "silenciadores de escopeta"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A large suppressor designed to work with shotguns.  It's a lot more complex "
"than a suppressor for a pistol or rifle."
msgstr ""
"Un gran supresor diseñado para trabajar con escopetas. Es mucho más complejo"
" que un supresor para una pistola o un rifle."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "suppressor"
msgid_plural "suppressors"
msgstr[0] "supresor"
msgstr[1] "supresores"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A suppressor reduces the amount of noise and muzzle flash generated by the "
"report of a firearm.  Gunfire is extremely loud and can damage your hearing "
"without protection; a suppressor will bring the loudness of a report down to"
" generally safe levels."
msgstr ""
"Un silenciador reduce la cantidad de ruido y luz de la bocacha que genera un"
" arma de fuego. Las armas de fuego son extremadamente ruidosas y pueden "
"dañar tu audición si no usas protección. Un silenciador reducirá el ruido a "
"niveles seguros."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "MP5SD integral suppressor"
msgid_plural "MP5SD integral suppressors"
msgstr[0] "Supresor integral MP5SD"
msgstr[1] "Supresores integrales MP5SD"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is the integrated suppressor for the H&K MP5SD.  Its large expansion "
"chamber decelerates ammunition via several ports in the barrel, rendering "
"most ammo subsonic at the cost of terminal performance.  It is not as "
"effective as modern designs."
msgstr ""
"Este es el supresor integrado para el H&K MP5SD. Su gran cámara de expansión"
" desacelera la munición a través de varios puertos del barril, haciendo que "
"la mayoría de las municiones sean subsónicas a costa del rendimiento de la "
"terminal. No es tan efectivo como los diseños modernos."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "compact suppressor"
msgid_plural "compact suppressors"
msgstr[0] "silenciador compacto"
msgstr[1] "silenciadores compactos"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A compact suppressor designed for pistols and best used with smaller "
"calibers."
msgstr ""
"Es un silenciador compacto diseñado para pistolas, y para funcionar mejor "
"con calibres pequeños."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "rail-mounted crossbow"
msgid_plural "rail-mounted crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta montada sobre riel"
msgstr[1] "ballestas montadas sobre rieles"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A kit to attach a pair of crossbow arms and a firing rail to the barrel of a"
" long firearm.  It allows crossbow bolts to be fired."
msgstr ""
"Es un equipo para adjuntar un par de brazos de ballesta y el riel de disparo"
" al cañón de un arma de fuego larga. Permite disparar pernos de ballesta."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "rail"
msgstr "riel"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified rail-mounted crossbow"
msgid_plural "modified rail-mounted crossbows"
msgstr[0] "ballesta de riel modificada"
msgstr[1] "ballestas de rieles modificadas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A kit to attach a pair of crossbow arms and a firing rail to the barrel of a"
" long firearm.  It allows crossbow bolts to be fired.  This one was modified"
" and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other than pistols and "
"SMGs, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Un kit para sujetar un par de brazos de ballesta y un riel de disparo al "
"cañón de un arma de fuego larga. Permite que se disparen las saetas de la "
"ballesta. Este fue modificado y personalizado para montarlo en casi "
"cualquier arma que no sean pistolas y SMGs, si así lo deseas."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "offset iron sights"
msgid_plural "offset iron sights"
msgstr[0] "mirilla metálica de compensación"
msgstr[1] "mirillas metálicas de compensación"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An alternative set of iron sights mounted at 45° for use when a scope or "
"other modification prevents use of the primary sights."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto alternativo de miras de hierro montado a 45 ° para su uso cuando"
" una mira telescópica u otra modificación impide el uso de los lugares de "
"interés principales."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified offset iron sights"
msgid_plural "modified offset iron sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de hierro compensada modificada"
msgstr[1] "miras de hierro compensado modificadas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An alternative set of iron sights mounted at 45° for use when a scope or "
"other modification prevents use of the primary sights.  This one was "
"modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto alternativo de miras de hierro montadas a 45° para su uso cuando"
" una mira u otra modificación impida el uso de las miras primarias. Esta fue"
" modificada y personalizada para montarla en casi cualquier arma, si así lo "
"desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "offset sight rail"
msgid_plural "offset sight rails"
msgstr[0] "riel de visión desplazada"
msgstr[1] "rieles de visión desplazada"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "An additional rail set at 45° for attaching a secondary optic."
msgstr ""
"Es un conjunto de ranuras adicionales a 45º para poner una óptica "
"secundaria."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified offset sight rail"
msgid_plural "modified offset sight rails"
msgstr[0] "riel de visión desplazado modificado"
msgstr[1] "rieles de visión desplazado modificados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An additional rail set at 45° for attaching a secondary optic.  This one was"
" modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Un riel adicional fijado a 45° para fijar una óptica secundaria. Este fue "
"modificado y personalizado para montarlo en casi cualquier arma, si así lo "
"desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "rail laser sight"
msgid_plural "rail laser sights"
msgstr[0] "mira láser de riel"
msgstr[1] "miras láser de riel"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small visible-light laser that mounts on a firearm's accessory rail to "
"enhance ease and speed of target acquisition.  Aside from increased weight, "
"there are no drawbacks."
msgstr ""
"Es una pequeña mira láser visible que se monta sobre el riel de accesorios "
"del arma de fuego para mejorar la facilidad y velocidad para apuntar. La "
"única desventaja que tiene es el incremento del peso."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "gyroscopic stabilizer"
msgid_plural "gyroscopic stabilizers"
msgstr[0] "estabilizador giroscópico"
msgstr[1] "estabilizadores giroscópicos"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An advanced unit that straps onto the side of your firearm and reduces "
"vibration, greatly reducing recoil and slightly increasing accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Es una unidad avanzada que se ata con una correa al costado del arma de "
"fuego y reduce la vibración, lo que reduce mucho el retroceso e incrementa "
"levemente la precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified gyroscopic stabilizer"
msgid_plural "modified gyroscopic stabilizers"
msgstr[0] "estabilizador giroscópico modificado"
msgstr[1] "estabilizadores giroscópicos modificados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An advanced unit that straps onto the side of your firearm and reduces "
"vibration, greatly reducing recoil and slightly increasing accuracy.  This "
"one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon other "
"than pistols, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Una unidad avanzada que se sujeta al lado de su arma de fuego y reduce la "
"vibración, reduciendo enormemente el retroceso y aumentando ligeramente la "
"precisión. Esta fue modificada y personalizada para montarla en casi "
"cualquier arma que no sea una pistola, si así lo desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "five pin bow sight"
msgid_plural "five pin bow sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de arco de cinco centros"
msgstr[1] "miras de arco de cinco centros"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A set of adjustable optic fiber aiming pins with a bracket to mount on "
"modern bows.  Improves accuracy substantially, but takes a bit longer to "
"line up."
msgstr ""
"Un conjunto de clavijas de puntería de fibra óptica ajustable con un soporte"
" para montar en arcos modernos. Mejora sustancialmente la precisión, pero "
"tarda un poco más en alinearse."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "sights"
msgstr "miras"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "single pin bow sight"
msgid_plural "single pin bow sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de arco de un solo centro"
msgstr[1] "miras de arco de un solo centro"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single aluminum pin with a bracket to mount on modern bows.  Quick to use,"
" but not very accurate."
msgstr ""
"Un solo centro de aluminio con un soporte para montar en arcos modernos. "
"Rápido de usar, pero no muy preciso."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bow scope"
msgid_plural "bow scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira para arco"
msgstr[1] "miras para arco"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A single magnifying scope mounted on an adjustable bracket, with "
"accompanying clarifier peep sight.  Designed for extra long shots, but "
"easily adjusted for short range.  Spectacularly accurate."
msgstr ""
"Es una mira de aumento montada sobre un soporte ajustable, y con una mirilla"
" con clarificador. Diseñada para disparos muy distantes, pero fácil de "
"ajustar para el corto alcance. Excepcionalmente precisa."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "holographic sight"
msgid_plural "holographic sights"
msgstr[0] "mira holográfica"
msgstr[1] "miras holográficas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Used extensively by military forces, it increases accuracy and weight.  This"
" is a step up from a red dot sight."
msgstr ""
"Es de uso extensivo en las fuerzas militares. Incrementa la precisión y el "
"peso. Es mejor que la mira de punto rojo."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "iron sights"
msgid_plural "iron sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de hierro"
msgstr[1] "miras de hierro"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "A basic set of iron sights"
msgstr "Un conjunto básico de miras de hierro"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "pistol scope"
msgid_plural "pistol scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira para pistola"
msgstr[1] "miras para pistola"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A small scope intended for use on a handgun.  Increases weight but improves "
"accuracy greatly."
msgstr ""
"Un pequeña mira telescópica diseñada para su uso en un arma de fuego. "
"Aumenta de peso, pero mejora la precisión en gran medida."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "red dot sight"
msgid_plural "red dot sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de punto rojo"
msgstr[1] "miras de punto rojo"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Adds a red dot optic to the top of your gun, replacing the iron sights.  "
"Increases accuracy and weight."
msgstr ""
"Agrega un punto rojo óptico a la parte superior del arma, reemplazando la "
"mira metálica del arma. Incrementa la precisión y el peso."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "rifle scope"
msgid_plural "rifle scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira para rifle"
msgstr[1] "miras para rifle"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A 3-18x44 rifle scope.  It is adjustable for windage and elevation in 1/10th"
" mrad increments and is remarkably small and light for its magnification."
msgstr ""
"Un visor de rifle de 3-18x44. Es ajustable en cuanto al viento y la "
"elevación en incrementos de 1/10 de mrad y es notablemente pequeño y ligero "
"para su magnificación."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified rifle scope"
msgid_plural "modified rifle scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira de rifle modificada"
msgstr[1] "miras de rifles modificadas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A 3-18x44 rifle scope.  It is adjustable for windage and elevation in 1/10th"
" mrad increments and is remarkably small and light for its magnification.  "
"This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon "
"other than pistols and SMGs, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Una mira de rifle de 3-18x44. Es ajustable en cuanto al viento y la "
"elevación en incrementos de 1/10 de mrad y es notablemente pequeño y ligero "
"para su aumento. Este fue modificado y personalizado para montarlo en casi "
"cualquier arma que no sean pistolas y SMGs, si así lo desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "ACOG scope"
msgid_plural "ACOG scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira para ACOG"
msgstr[1] "miras para ACOG"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A 4x32 TA01 Advanced Combat Optical Gunsight with a tritium illuminated "
"crosshair."
msgstr ""
"Una mira óptica de combate avanzada 4x32 TA01 con una retícula iluminada con"
" tritio."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified ACOG scope"
msgid_plural "modified ACOG scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira ACOG modificada"
msgstr[1] "miras ACOG modificadas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A 4x32 TA01 Advanced Combat Optical Gunsight with a tritium illuminated "
"crosshair.  This one was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any"
" weapon other than pistols, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Una mira óptica de combate avanzada(ACOG) 4x32 TA01 con una retícula "
"iluminada con tritio. Este fue modificado y personalizado para montarlo en "
"casi cualquier arma que no sean pistolas, si así lo desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "RS1219 scope"
msgid_plural "RS1219 scopes"
msgstr[0] "mira para RS1219"
msgstr[1] "miras para RS1219"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An integral component of the RM11B rifle system, the RS1219 Accipiter "
"digital scope provides auto-adjusting focal length, a user-selectable "
"reticle, and an offset reflex sight for close objectives."
msgstr ""
"Un componente integral del sistema de rifle RM11B, el alcance digital de "
"Accipiter RS1219 proporciona longitud focal de auto-ajuste, una retícula "
"seleccionable por el usuario, y una compensación en la mira para objetivos "
"cercanos."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "telescopic sight"
msgid_plural "telescopic sights"
msgstr[0] "mira telescópica"
msgstr[1] "miras telescópicas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple hand-crafted telescopic sight, essentially a small telescope with "
"crosshairs.  Not as good as the ones made before the Cataclysm.  Increases "
"weight but improves accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Una simple mira telescópica hecha a mano, esencialmente un pequeño "
"telescopio con retículas. No tan bueno como los que se hicieron antes del "
"Cataclismo. Aumenta el peso pero mejora la precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "telescopic pistol sight"
msgid_plural "telescopic pistol sights"
msgstr[0] "mira de pistola telescópica"
msgstr[1] "miras de pistola telescópica"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A simple telescopic sight intended for use on a handgun.  Increases weight "
"but improves accuracy greatly."
msgstr ""
"Es una simple mira telescópica diseñada para usar en pistolas. Incrementa el"
" peso pero mejora mucho la precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "shoulder strap"
msgid_plural "shoulder straps"
msgstr[0] "correa de hombro"
msgstr[1] "correas de hombro"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A shoulder strap allows the rifle to be worn over your shoulders like a "
"piece of clothing.  However, it offers no protection."
msgstr ""
"Es una correa para el hombro que permite ponerse un rifle sobre los hombros."
" Sin embargo, no ofrece ninguna protección."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "sling"
msgstr "honda"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "adjustable stock"
msgid_plural "adjustable stocks"
msgstr[0] "culata ajustable"
msgstr[1] "culatas ajustables"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "An adjustable replacement stock improving both recoil and accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Un reemplazo de culata ajustable que mejora tanto el retroceso como la "
"precisión."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "stock"
msgstr "culata"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "folding stock"
msgid_plural "folding stocks"
msgstr[0] "culata plegable"
msgstr[1] "culatas plegables"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A folding stock which reduces volume but needs unfolding before use.  "
"Increases the time needed to wield the weapon."
msgstr ""
"Es una culata plegable que reduce su tamaño pero necesita ser desplegada "
"antes de utilizarse. Por esto, aumenta el tiempo necesario para empuñar el "
"arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "folding wire stock"
msgid_plural "folding wire stocks"
msgstr[0] "stock de cableado doblado"
msgstr[1] "stocks de cableado doblado"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A folding wire stock which folds up very compactly but needs unfolding "
"before use.  It's somewhat wobbly but is better than nothing at all.  "
"Increases the time needed to wield the weapon."
msgstr ""
"Un alambre plegable que se pliega de forma muy compacta pero que necesita "
"ser desplegado antes de su uso. Se tambalea un poco pero es mejor que nada. "
"Aumenta el tiempo necesario para manejar el arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "pistol stock"
msgid_plural "pistol stocks"
msgstr[0] "culata para pistola"
msgstr[1] "culatas para pistola"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "An add-on stock for handguns considerably improving control of recoil."
msgstr ""
"Un complemento para las armas de fuego que mejora considerablemente el "
"control del retroceso."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "recoil stock"
msgid_plural "recoil stocks"
msgstr[0] "culata de retroceso"
msgstr[1] "culatas de retroceso"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "A replacement stock designed to absorb perceived recoil."
msgstr "Un reemplazo diseñado para absorber el retroceso percibido."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "cheek pad"
msgid_plural "cheek pads"
msgstr[0] "almohadilla de mejilla"
msgstr[1] "almohadillas de mejillas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A stock accessory for sniper rifles and even DMRs considerably improving eye"
" relief efficiency, prevents slipping, and reduces recoil to the neck and "
"cheek."
msgstr ""
"Un accesorio de stock para rifles de francotirador e incluso DMR que mejora "
"considerablemente la eficiencia del alivio de los ojos, evita el "
"deslizamiento y reduce el retroceso al cuello y la mejilla."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "butt hook"
msgid_plural "butt hooks"
msgstr[0] "gancho de culata"
msgstr[1] "ganchos de culata"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An attachment to the butt of the gun that is put under the armpit allowing "
"for greater stability."
msgstr ""
"Un accesorio para la culata del arma que se coloca bajo la axila permitiendo"
" una mayor estabilidad."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "butt hook stock"
msgid_plural "butt hook stocks"
msgstr[0] "stock de gancho de trasero"
msgstr[1] "stocks de gancho de trasero"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A replacement stock that partially encloses arm allowing for greater "
"stability.  Good fit and padding also helps with recoil control."
msgstr ""
"Una culata de reemplazo que encierra parcialmente el brazo permitiendo una "
"mayor estabilidad. El buen ajuste y el acolchado también ayudan a controlar "
"el retroceso."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "tail hook stock"
msgid_plural "tail hook stocks"
msgstr[0] "culata de ganchos de cola"
msgstr[1] "culata de ganchos de cola"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A foldable add-on stock for handguns and machine guns with pivoting hook "
"that latches onto forearm allowing for greater stability."
msgstr ""
"Una culata adicional plegable para pistolas y ametralladoras con un gancho "
"pivotante que se engancha al antebrazo y permite una mayor estabilidad."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bipod"
msgid_plural "bipods"
msgstr[0] "bípode"
msgstr[1] "bípodes"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bipods are commonly used on rifles and machine guns to provide a forward "
"rest and reduce motion.  Although they greatly improve handling of recoil "
"they are usable only on certain surfaces and are slow to equip."
msgstr ""
"Los bípodes se utilizan comúnmente en los fusiles y ametralladoras para "
"proporcionar un reposo hacia adelante y reducir el movimiento. A pesar de "
"que mejoran en gran medida la manipulación del retroceso son utilizables "
"sólo en ciertas superficies y son lentos para equipar."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified bipod"
msgid_plural "modified bipods"
msgstr[0] "bípode modificado"
msgstr[1] "bípodes modificados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Bipods are commonly used on rifles and machine guns to provide a forward "
"rest and reduce motion.  Although they greatly improve handling of recoil "
"they are usable only on certain surfaces and are slow to equip.  This one "
"was modified and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so "
"want."
msgstr ""
"Los bípodes se utilizan comúnmente en los rifles y las ametralladoras para "
"proporcionar un descanso delantero y reducir el movimiento. Aunque mejoran "
"enormemente el manejo del retroceso, sólo son utilizables en ciertas "
"superficies y son lentos de equipar. Este fue modificado y personalizado "
"para montarlo en casi cualquier arma, si así lo desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "combination gun shotgun"
msgid_plural "combination gun shotguns"
msgstr[0] "escopeta combinada"
msgstr[1] "escopetas combinadas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The integrated underbarrel shotgun of a combination gun which holds two "
"shots.  It's irremovable."
msgstr ""
"Es una escopeta integrada bajo cañón de un arma combinada que solo tiene dos"
" disparos. No se puede quitar."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "factory handguard"
msgid_plural "factory handguards"
msgstr[0] "guardamano de fábrica"
msgstr[1] "guardamanos de fábrica"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A removable molded grip that comes standard on guns without rails.  It's not"
" as efficient as a proper forward grip or bipod at controlling recoil, but "
"it's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"Una empuñadura moldeada extraíble que viene de serie en las armas sin "
"raíles. No es tan eficiente como una empuñadura delantera adecuada o un "
"bípode para controlar el retroceso, pero es mejor que nada."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgctxt "gun_type_type"
msgid "fs2000"
msgstr "fs2000"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "forward grip"
msgid_plural "forward grips"
msgstr[0] "agarre delantero"
msgstr[1] "agarres delanteros"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A grip placed forward on the barrel allows for greater control.  Not as "
"effective as a bipod but usable under all conditions."
msgstr ""
"Una empuñadura colocada hacia delante en el barril que permite un mayor "
"control. No es tan eficaz como un bípode pero utilizable en todas las "
"condiciones."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "modified forward grip"
msgid_plural "modified forward grips"
msgstr[0] "agarre delantero modificado"
msgstr[1] "agarres delanteros modificados"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A grip placed forward on the barrel allows for greater control.  Not as "
"effective as a bipod but usable under all conditions.  This one was modified"
" and customized to mount on pretty much any weapon, if you so want."
msgstr ""
"Un agarre colocado hacia adelante en el cañón permite un mayor control. No "
"es tan efectivo como un bípode, pero se puede usar en todas las condiciones."
" Este fue modificado y personalizado para montarlo en casi cualquier arma, "
"si así lo desea."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "integrated bayonet"
msgid_plural "integrated bayonets"
msgstr[0] "bayoneta integrada"
msgstr[1] "bayonetas integradas"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "This is the bayonet integrated in the firearm."
msgstr "Es una bayoneta integrada en el arma."

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "bayonet"
msgstr "bayoneta"

#: lang/json/gunmod_from_json.py
msgid "KSG second magazine"
msgid_plural "KSG second magazines"
msgstr[0] "cargador secundario KSG"
msgstr[1] "cargadores secundarios KSG"

