msgstr ""
"Puedes instalar un cinturón de seguridad o un arnés de cinco partes aquí "
"para ayudarte a mantenerte en tu asiento durante una colisión."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid "You can store items here."
msgstr "Puedes guardar objetos aquí."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can 'e'xamine the tile to access the controls, or use the vehicle "
"control key (default '^')."
msgstr ""
"Puedes 'e'xaminar el cuadro para acceder a los controles, o usar la llave de"
" control del vehículo (por defecto '^')."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With a seat or saddle, you drive from here.  You can 'e'xamine the tile to "
"access the controls, or use the vehicle control key (default '^')."
msgstr ""
"Con un asiento o una silla de montar, se conduce desde aquí. Puedes "
"'e'xaminar el cuadro para acceder a los controles, o usar la llave de "
"control del vehículo (por defecto '^')."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid "When active, turns engines on and off automatically."
msgstr "Cuando está activo, enciende y apaga los motores automáticamente."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid "Illuminated items in this space will not illuminate nearby squares."
msgstr ""
"Los objetos iluminados en este espacio no iluminarán los cuadros cercanos."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Closed, it prevents people from seeing through the curtain.  A door motor "
"allows you to remotely open or close it from the vehicle controls."
msgstr ""
"Cerrado, impide que la gente vea a través de la cortina. El motor de la "
"puerta permite abrirla o cerrarla a distancia desde los controles del "
"vehículo."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When open, this part lets you move from inside the vehicle to outside or "
"vice versa.  When closed, it prevents people from entering or leaving the "
"vehicle."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se abre, esta parte permite pasar del interior del vehículo al "
"exterior o viceversa. Cuando está cerrada, impide que la gente entre o salga"
" del vehículo."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"When turned on, this device drains <color_red>%sW</color> from the vehicle's"
" batteries."
msgstr ""
"Cuando está encendido, este aparato consume <color_red>%sW</color> de "
"energía de las baterías del vehículo."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Provides up to <color_green>%sW</color> of electrical power to the vehicle "
"when exposed to the sun.  Weather and clouds will affect power generation."
msgstr ""
"Proporciona hasta <color_green>%sW</color> de energía eléctrica al vehículo "
"cuando está expuesto al sol. El clima y las nubes afectarán a la generación "
"de energía."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Provides motive power to move the vehicle if the vehicle has sufficient "
"wheels.  Requires controls to turn on.  If it drains power, also requires a "
"charged battery to start."
msgstr ""
"Brinda energía motora para mover el vehículo si este posee suficientes "
"ruedas. Necesita tener los controles encendidos. Si utiliza energía, también"
" necesita una batería cargada para arrancar."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An alternator can be attached, and it will generate electrical power while "
"the engine is on at the cost of some motive power."
msgstr ""
"Se puede poner un alternador que generará energía eléctrica mientras el "
"motor está encendido a costa de energía motora."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When turned on, it will stop the vehicle unless it has a strong engine."
msgstr ""
"Cuando se enciende, detendrá el vehículo a menos que tenga un motor fuerte."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Each boat hull will reduce the draft of your vehicle and increase the height"
" sealed against water.  If the draft is less than the sealed height, your "
"vehicle will float if placed in water."
msgstr ""
"El casco de cada barco reducirá el calado de su vehículo y aumentará la "
"altura sellada contra el agua. Si el calado es menor que la altura sellada, "
"su vehículo flotará si se coloca en el agua."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's no place to attach a seat belt, so you get thrown from the vehicle "
"in a crash."
msgstr ""
"No hay lugar para abrochar el cinturón de seguridad, así que saldrás volando"
" del vehículo en un choque."

#. ~ Please leave anything in <angle brackets> unchanged.
#: lang/json/json_flag_from_json.py
