#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "No style"
msgstr "Sin estilo"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'No style'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Not a martial art, this is just plain old punching and kicking."
msgstr "No es un arte marcial, es el viejo y conocido pegar piñas y patadas."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'No style'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You decide to not use any martial arts."
msgstr "Decides no usar ningun arte marcial."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'No style'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s enters a generic combat stance."
msgstr "%s se pone en una postura de combate genérica."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Force unarmed"
msgstr "Forzar ir desarmado"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Force unarmed'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Not a martial art, setting this style will prevent weapon attacks and force "
"punches (with free hand) or kicks."
msgstr ""
"No es un arte marcial, establecer este estilo evitará ataques de armas y "
"golpes de fuerza (con mano libre) o patadas."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Force unarmed'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You force yourself to fight unarmed."
msgstr "Te obligas a luchar desarmado."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Force unarmed'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s decides to fight unarmed."
msgstr "%s decide luchar desarmado."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Aikido"
msgstr "Aikido"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Aikido is a Japanese martial art focused on self-defense, while minimizing "
"injury to the attacker.  It uses defensive throws and disarms but lacks "
"offensive techniques."
msgstr ""
"El aikido es un arte marcial japonés centrado en la defensa personal, al "
"tiempo que minimiza las lesiones al atacante. Utiliza lanzamientos "
"defensivos y desarma al rival, pero carece de técnicas ofensivas."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You enter the hamni stance."
msgstr "Te posicionas en la postura hamni"

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s changes into a relaxed combat posture."
msgstr "%s cambia a una posición de combate relajado."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Aikido Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Aikido"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Aikido Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"By disregarding offensive in favor of self-defense, you are better at protecting.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Al ignorar la ofensiva a favor de la autodefensa, eres mejor en la protección.\n"
"\n"
"Daño bloqueado reducido en un 100%% de Destreza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Intermediate Aikido"
msgstr "Aikido intermedio"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Intermediate Aikido' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Aikido'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"An intermediate aikido practitioner can protect themselves against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked Damage reduced by 100% of Dexterity.\n"
"+1 Block attempts, +1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""
"Un practicante de aikido intermedio puede protegerse contra múltiples oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"Daño bloqueado reducido en un 100%% de Destreza.\n"
"+1 intentos de Bloqueo, +1 intentos de Esquivar."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Advanced Aikido"
msgstr "Aikido avanzado"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Advanced Aikido' for martial art '{'str': 'Aikido'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An advanced aikido practitioner can protect themselves against even more opponents than normal.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, +1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""
"Un practicante de aikido avanzado puede protegerse contra aún más oponentes de lo normal.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intentos de bloqueo, +1 intentos de esquivar."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Boxing"
msgstr "Boxeo"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sport of the true gentleman, modern boxing has evolved from the prizefights "
"of the Victorian era.  Strength reduces blocked damage and moving increase "
"dodge skill."
msgstr ""
"Deporte del verdadero caballero, el boxeo moderno ha evolucionado a partir "
"de los combates profesionales de la época victoriana. La fuerza reduce el "
"daño bloqueado y el movimiento aumenta la habilidad de esquivar."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You lower your chin and raise your fists to eye level."
msgstr "Bajas la barbilla y sube los puños a la altura de los ojos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s prepares to fight with raised fists."
msgstr "%sse prepara para pelear con los puños en alto."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Boxing Stance"
msgstr "Postura de boxeo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Boxing Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"A solid stance allows you block more damage than normal and deliver better punches.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Bash damage, Blocked damge reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Una postura sólida te permite bloquear más daño de lo normal y dar mejores puños.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Daño de impacto, Daño bloqueado reducido en un 50%% de Fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Footwork"
msgstr "Juego de pies"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Footwork' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are make yourself harder to hit by bobbing and weaving as you move.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts for 1 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"Te harás más difícil de golpear balanceándote y evadiendo mientras te mueves.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 de habilidad de esquivar.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Counter Chance"
msgstr "Contra Ataque"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Counter Chance' for martial art '{'str': 'Boxing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You've seen your chance.  Now strike back!\n"
"\n"
"+25% Bash damage.\n"
"Lasts for 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Has visto tu oportunidad. ¡Ahora contraataca!\n"
"\n"
"+25 %% daño de impacto.\n"
"Dura un turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Brawling"
msgstr "Peleador"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Brawling'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're used to hand-to-creature fighting.  You know how to fight when "
"unarmed or with any weapon to a certain extent.  It's not stylish or "
"sporting, but it gets the job done."
msgstr ""
"Estás acostumbrado a la lucha cuerpo a cuerpo. Sabes cómo luchar cuando "
"estás desarmado o con cualquier arma hasta cierto punto. No es elegante ni "
"deportivo, pero hace el trabajo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Brawling'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You grit your teeth and prepare for a good fight."
msgstr "Aprietas los dientes y te preparas para una buena lucha."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Brawling'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s gets ready to brawl."
msgstr " %sse prepara para el combate."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Enhanced Blocking"
msgstr "Bloqueo Mejorado"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Enhanced Blocking' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Brawling'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Combat experience has led to you being able to block multiple attacks at a time.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts."
msgstr ""
"La experiencia en el combate te ha llevado a ser capaz de bloquear varios ataques a la vez.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intentos de Bloqueo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Capoeira"
msgstr "Capoeira"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A dance-like style with its roots in Brazilian slavery, Capoeira is focused "
"on fluid movement and sweeping kicks.  Moving briefly enables stronger "
"techniques.  Missing an attack grants bonus damage for a short time."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo de baile con sus raíces en la esclavitud brasileña, la Capoeira se"
" centra en el movimiento fluido y las patadas de barrido. Los movimientos "
"breves permiten técnicas más fuertes. Perder un ataque otorga un daño extra "
"por un corto tiempo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You begin performing the ginga."
msgstr "Comienzas a realizar la ginga."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s begins to rhythmically rock back and forth."
msgstr " %scomienza a mecerse rítmicamente de un lado a otro."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Capoeira Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Capoeira"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Capoeira Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You never stop moving while performing the ginga.  This makes you very mobile while fighting.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill, +1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""
"Nunca dejas de moverte mientras haces el ginga. Esto te hace muy móvil mientras luchas.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 habilidad de Esquivar, +1 intentos de Esquivar."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Capoeira Momentum"
msgstr "Momentum Capoeira"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Capoeira Momentum' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can feel the rhythm as you move.  Not only are you harder to hit, but your kicks are even more amazing!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Enables \"Spin Kick\" and \"Sweep Kick\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Puedes sentir el ritmo mientras te mueves. No sólo eres más difícil de golpear, sino que tus patadas son aún más sorprendentes.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de esquivar +1.0.\n"
"Habilita las técnicas de \"Spin Kick\" y \"Sweep Kick\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Capoeira Tempo"
msgstr "Capoeira Tempo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Capoeira Tempo' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Capoeira'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You didn't miss, it's just part of the dance and the best part is about to start!\n"
"\n"
"+15% Bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"No has fallado, es sólo parte del baile y ¡la mejor parte está a punto de empezar!\n"
"\n"
"+15% de daño por golpe.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Crane Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu de la Grulla"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Crane uses intricate hand "
"techniques and jumping dodges.  Dexterity determines your damage, rather "
"than Strength; you also receive a dodge bonus move or dodge an attack."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos de animales Shaolin. La Grulla utiliza intrincadas "
"técnicas de mano y esquivas de salto. La destreza determina su daño, en "
"lugar de la fuerza; también recibe un movimiento de bonificación de esquivar"
" o esquivar un ataque."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You raise your leg slightly and balance like a crane."
msgstr "Levanta la pierna ligeramente y se equilibra como una grúa."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a crane-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura de la grulla."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Crane's Precision"
msgstr "Precisión de Grulla"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Precision' for martial art '{'str': 'Crane
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your attacks strike at your opponents weakness with speed and precision instead of brute force.\n"
"Dexterity increases melee damage instead of Strength.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 75% of Dexterity but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Tus ataques atacan los puntos débiles de tus oponentes con velocidad y precisión en lugar de fuerza bruta.\n"
"La destreza aumenta el daño cuerpo a cuerpo en lugar de la fuerza.\n"
"\n"
"El daño de los golpes aumenta en un 75% de la Destreza pero disminuye en un 75% de la Fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Crane's Flight"
msgstr "Vuelo de Crane"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Flight' for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Just like a bird, you take to the air to avoid danger.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que un pájaro, te levantas al aire para evitar el peligro.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de esquivar +1.0.\n"
"Dura 2 vueltas."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Crane's Grace"
msgstr "Gracia de la Grulla"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Crane's Grace' for martial art '{'str': 'Crane Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Much like the crane, you a quick to avoid danger.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, +1.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que la grulla, eres rápido para evitar el peligro.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de esquivar, +1.0 habilidad de esquivar.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Dragón"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Dragon uses fluid movements and "
"hard strikes.  Intelligence improves your accuracy instead of Dexterity.  "
"Your attacks lead to counterattacks which disable your opponents and set "
"them up for a powerful finishing move."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos de animales Shaolin. El Dragón usa movimientos "
"fluidos y golpes fuertes. La inteligencia mejora su precisión en lugar de la"
" destreza. Sus ataques conducen a contraataques que incapacitan a sus "
"oponentes y los preparan para un poderoso movimiento final."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You relax and patiently await conflict like the great dragon."
msgstr "Te relajas y esperas pacientemente el conflicto como el gran dragón."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a dragon-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del dragón."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon's Flight"
msgstr "Vuelo del Dragón"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Dragon's Flight' for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Life and combat are a circle.  An attack leads to a counter and to an attack once again.  Seek to complete this loop.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, +2 bash Damage.\n"
"Enables \"Dragon Vortex Block\" and \"Dragon Wing Dodge\"\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"La vida y el combate son un círculo. Un ataque lleva a una contra y a un ataque una vez más. Busca completar este círculo.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Exactitud, +2 golpe de daño.\n"
"Habilita \"Bloqueo del vórtice del dragón\" y \"Esquivar el ala del dragón\"\n"
"Dura un turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon's Knowledge"
msgstr "Conocimiento de Dragon"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Dragon's Knowledge' for martial art '{'str': 'Dragon
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You plan your attack far in advance relying on your intuition instead of your speed to strike true.\n"
"Intelligence increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Intelligence but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Planificas tu ataque con mucha antelación confiando en tu intuición en lugar de en tu velocidad para golpear con acierto.\n"
"La inteligencia aumenta la precisión en lugar de la destreza.\n"
"\n"
"La precisión aumenta un 25% de la Inteligencia pero disminuye un 25% de la Destreza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Eskrima"
msgstr "Eskrima"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Eskrima, also known as Kali, is a Filipino martial art.  It emphasizes rapid"
" strikes with knife and baton weapons, along with a variety of improvised "
"substitutes."
msgstr ""
"El Eskrima, también conocido como Kali, es un arte marcial filipino. Destaca"
" por sus golpes rápidos con armas de cuchillo y bastón, junto con una "
"variedad de sustitutos improvisados."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You enter an open guard stance and prepare to strike."
msgstr "Entras en una posición de guardia abierta y te preparas para golpear."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s enters an open stance."
msgstr "%s entra en una postura abierta."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Eskrima Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Eskrima"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Eskrima Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Eskrima'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are skilled at getting the most out of your weapons.  The term 'weapon' might be very subjective,\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Eres hábil para sacar el máximo provecho de tus armas. El término \"arma\" puede ser muy subjetivo,\n"
"\n"
"Precisión +2."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Eskrima Combination"
msgstr "Combinación de Eskrima"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Eskrima Combination' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Eskrima'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You can follow up a critical hit with a stronger attack if the opportunity presents itself.\n"
"\n"
"+15% bonus to all damage.\n"
"Enables \"Combination Strike\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Puedes seguir un golpe crítico con un ataque más fuerte si se presenta la oportunidad.\n"
"\n"
"Bonificación de +15% a todo el daño.\n"
"Activa la técnica \"Golpe combinado\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Fencing"
msgstr "Esgrima"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The noble art of fencing is taught with flexible competition blades, but the"
" techniques are derived from (and applicable to) more functional examples.  "
"Skilled fencers can take advantage of blocks and feints to deliver accurate "
"strikes."
msgstr ""
"El noble arte de la esgrima se enseña con hojas de competición flexibles, "
"pero las técnicas se derivan de (y son aplicables a) ejemplos más "
"funcionales. Los esgrimistas hábiles pueden aprovechar los bloqueos y fintas"
" para dar golpes precisos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You move into the en-garde stance."
msgstr "Te posicionas en la postura en-garde."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s moves into a fencing stance."
msgstr "%sse pone en posición de esgrima."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Fencing Stance"
msgstr "Posición de esgrima"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Fencing Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your side stance minimizes the chances you will be harmed in a combat.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Tu postura lateral minimiza las posibilidades de que sea dañado en un combate.\n"
"\n"
"El daño bloqueado se reduce en un 50% de Destreza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py lang/json/technique_from_json.py
msgid "Parry"
msgstr "Parada"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Parry' for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your next strike will find its mark much easier from your parry.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tu siguiente golpe encontrará su objetivo mucho más fácilmente desde tu parada.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Remise"
msgstr "Restaurar"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Remise' for martial art '{'str': 'Fencing'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your feint is the perfect setup for a devastating followup attack!\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy.\n"
"Enables \"Compound Attack\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tu finta es la preparación perfecta para un ataque de seguimiento devastador.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión.\n"
"Activas la técnica \"Ataque compuesto\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Medieval Europe's martial techniques for fighting with polearms.  The "
"\"Flower of Battle\" places great focus on countering one's opponent and "
"knocking them down before landing a killing blow"
msgstr ""
"Las técnicas marciales de la Europa medieval para luchar con armas de asta. "
"La \"Flor de la Batalla\" se centra en contrarrestar al oponente y "
"derribarlo antes de dar un golpe mortal."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You hold your weapon in a firm grip, ready to block any attack."
msgstr ""
"Sostienes tu arma con un agarre firme, preparado para bloquear cualquier "
"ataque."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s grips their weapon tightly."
msgstr "%s agarra su arma con fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stand Your Ground"
msgstr "Mantente firme"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stand Your Ground' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di
#. Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are stalwart and will not budge against any threat.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Block attempts, -1.0 Dodge skill, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Eres un hombre fuerte y no cederás ante ninguna amenaza.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Intentos de Bloqueo, -1.0 Habilidad de Esquiva, daño bloqueado reducido por 50% de Fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tactical Retreat"
msgstr "Retirada Táctica"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tactical Retreat' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di
#. Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You moved and nullified the effects of Stand Your Ground!\n"
"\n"
"-2 Block attempts, +1.0 Dodge skill, blocked damaged increased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Te has movido y has anulado los efectos de Mantente Firme.\n"
"\n"
"-2 intentos de Bloqueo, +1.0 habilidad de Esquivar, el daño bloqueado aumenta en un 50% de la Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Defense Break"
msgstr "Ruptura de Defensa"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Defense Break' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di
#. Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Each successful block reveals an opening in your opponent's guard.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada bloqueo exitoso revela una apertura en la guardia de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tactical Feinting"
msgstr "Fintas Tácticas"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tactical Feinting' for martial art '{'str': 'Fior Di
#. Battaglia'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"They fell for your feint!\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"Hook and Drag\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Cayeron en tu finta!\n"
"\n"
"Activa la técnica de \"Enganche y Arrastre\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Judo"
msgstr "Judo"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Judo is a martial art that focuses on grabs and throws, both defensive and "
"offensive.  You are resistant to most effects that can knock you down and "
"can counter grab and takedown attacks with strong judo throw."
msgstr ""
"El judo es un arte marcial que se centra en los agarres y los lanzamientos, "
"tanto defensivos como ofensivos. Eres resistente a la mayoría de los efectos"
" que pueden derribarte y puedes contrarrestar los ataques de agarre y "
"derribo con fuertes lanzamientos de judo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You prepare yourself for a grapple."
msgstr "Te preparas para un forcejeo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s prepares for a grapple."
msgstr "%s se prepara para un forcejeo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Judo Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Judo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Judo Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Judo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your knowledge of grappling allows you to recover from knock down effects instantly.\n"
"In addition, you can counter grabs and takedown attacks with a judo throw."
msgstr ""
"Su conocimiento de la lucha te permite recuperarte de los efectos del derribo al instante.\n"
"Además, puedes contrarrestar los ataques de agarre y derribo con un lanzamiento de judo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Karate"
msgstr "Karate"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Karate is a popular martial art, originating from Japan.  It focuses on "
"rapid, precise attacks, blocks, and fluid movement.  A successful hit allows"
" you an extra dodge and two extra blocks on the following round."
msgstr ""
"El karate es un arte marcial popular, originario de Japón. Se focaliza en "
"los ataques rápidos y precisos, bloqueos y movimientos fluidos. Un golpe "
"exitoso te permite esquivar un golpe más y dos bloqueos extra para el "
"siguiente turno."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You adopt a classic karate stance."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura clásica de karate."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s adopts a classic karate stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura clásica de karate."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Karate Strike"
msgstr "Golpe de karate"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Karate Strike' for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Landing a hit allows you to perfectly position yourself for maximum defense against multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Block attempts, +1 Dodges attempts, blocked damge reduced by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Dar un golpe te permite posicionarte perfectamente para defenderte al máximo de varios oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"+2 intentos de Bloqueo, +1 intentos de Esquivar, el daño bloqueado se reduce en un 50% de la Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Karate Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Karate"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Karate Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Karate'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your no nonsense stance allows you hit more accurately.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Tu postura sin tonterías te permite golpear con más precisión.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión +2."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Krav Maga"
msgstr "Krav Maga"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Krav Maga'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Originating in Israel, Krav Maga is based on taking down an enemy quickly "
"and effectively.  It focuses on applicable attacks rather than showy or "
"complex moves.  Popular among police and armed forces everywhere."
msgstr ""
"Originario de Israel, el Krav Maga está basado en derribar al enemigo rápida"
" y eficazmente. Se focaliza en ataques aplicables más que en movimientos "
"complejos o llamativos. Es popular entre la policía y las fuerzas armadas en"
" todo el mundo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Krav Maga'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You assume a practical combat stance."
msgstr "Adopta una postura de combate práctico."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Krav Maga'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a practical combat stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura de combate práctico."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Krav Maga Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Krav Maga"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Krav Maga Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Krav
#. Maga'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your training makes it easier to land hits and fight multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, +1 Block attempts."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrenamiento facilita los golpes de tierra y la lucha contra múltiples oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión +1, intentos de Bloqueo +1."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Leopard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Leopardo"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Leopard focuses on rapid, "
"strategically planned strikes.  Dexterity determines your damage, rather "
"than Strength.  Moving increases dodge skill and accuracy further; attacking"
" after moving increases damage."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos de animales Shaolin. El leopardo se centra en "
"ataques rápidos y estratégicamente planeados. La Destreza determina el daño,"
" más que la Fuerza. Moverse aumenta la habilidad de esquivar y la precisión "
"aún más; atacar después de moverse aumenta el daño."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You prepare to pounce like a leopard."
msgstr "Te preparas para abalanzarte como un leopardo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a leopard-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una posición de leopardo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Leopard's Strategy"
msgstr "La Estrategia del Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Strategy' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Leopard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You fight by overwhelming your opponents with speedy strikes that are much harder to defend against.\n"
"Dexterity increases melee damage instead of Strength.\n"
"\n"
"Bash damage increased by 75% of Dexterity but decreased by 75% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Luchás abrumando a tus oponentes con golpes rápidos que son mucho más difíciles de defender.\n"
"La Destreza aumenta el daño en el cuerpo a cuerpo en lugar de la Fuerza.\n"
"\n"
"El daño de Impacto aumenta en un 75% de Destreza pero disminuye en un 75% de Fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Leopard's Agility"
msgstr "Agilidad del Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Agility' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Just like a cat, you are quick, agile, and hard to pin down.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill."
msgstr ""
"Al igual que un gato, eres rápido, ágil, y difícil de precisar.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar +1.0."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Leopard's Stalk"
msgstr "Acecho de Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Stalk' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You proudly stalk the shadows and preparing to pounce with unrelenting fury.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy.\n"
"Enables \"Leopard's Pounce\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Acecha con orgullo a las sombras y te preparas para atacar con furia implacable.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión +2.\n"
"Activa el \"Salto del Leopardo\" buff.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Leopard's Pounce"
msgstr "Salto del Leopardo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Leopard's Pounce' for martial art '{'str': 'Leopard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are ready.  Attack and claim your prey!\n"
"\n"
"+25% bonus to all damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Estás listo. ¡Ataca y reclama tu presa!\n"
"\n"
"Bonificación de +25% a todo el daño.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Medieval Swordsmanship"
msgstr "Manejo de Espada Medieval"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The art of the longsword and sword & shield, preceding the later development"
" of fencing.  Designed for combat both unarmored and in armor, it includes "
"grappling as well as defensive and offensive sword techniques.  This "
"treatise compares the Italian and German traditions of medieval combat with "
"detailed step-by-step pictures."
msgstr ""
"El arte de la espada larga y la espada y el escudo, precediendo al "
"desarrollo posterior de la esgrima. Diseñado para el combate tanto sin "
"armadura como con armadura, incluye técnicas de agarre y de espada defensiva"
" y ofensiva. Este tratado compara las tradiciones Italianas y Alemanas de "
"combate medieval con imágenes detalladas paso a paso."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You take on a knightly stance."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura de caballero."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s takes on a knightly stance."
msgstr "%s adoptas una postura de caballero."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Swordsman's Stance"
msgstr "Posición del Espadachín"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Swordsman's Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Medieval Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Through chivalry and vigilance, your defense with a blade has increased.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, blocked damage decreased by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"A través de la caballerosidad y la vigilancia, tu defensa con una espada ha aumentado.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de Esquivar, el daño bloqueado disminuye en un 50% de Fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Deflection"
msgstr "Desviación"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Deflection' for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval
#. Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You deflected your enemy's attack and now they are open to a counterattack!\n"
"Enables \"Sweeping Strike\" and \"Deathblow\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Has desviado el ataque de tu enemigo y ahora está abierto a un contraataque.\n"
"Activa las técnicas \"Golpe de Barrido\" y \"Golpe Mortal\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Manslayer"
msgstr "Asesino de hombres"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Manslayer' for martial art '{'str': 'Medieval
#. Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your powerful attack has given you the chance to end this fight right now!\n"
"Enables \"Vicious Strike\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Tu poderoso ataque te ha dado la oportunidad de terminar este combate ahora mismo!\n"
"Activa las técnicas de \"Golpe Vicioso\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Muay Thai"
msgstr "Muay Thai"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Muay Thai'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Also referred to as the \"Art of 8 Limbs,\" Muay Thai is a popular fighting "
"technique from Thailand that uses powerful strikes.  Your strength decreases"
" blocked damage.  Blocking attacks or getting hit will increase your damage "
"and blocked damage further."
msgstr ""
"También conocido como el \"Arte de las 8 extremidades\", el Muay Thai es una"
" popular técnica de lucha de Tailandia que utiliza poderosos golpes. Su "
"fuerza disminuye el daño bloqueado. Bloquear los ataques o recibir un golpe "
"incrementará su daño y bloqueará el daño aún más."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Muay Thai'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You perform a short wai khru in honor of your teachers."
msgstr "Realizas un corto wai khru en honor a tus maestros."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Muay Thai'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s performs a short war-dance."
msgstr "%s realiza una breve danza de guerra."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Muay Thai Stance"
msgstr "Posición Muay Thai"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Muay Thai Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Muay
#. Thai'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Strength is everything in Muay Thai and you know how to make the most of yours.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage decreased by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"La fuerza lo es todo en el Muay Thai y tú sabes cómo sacar el máximo provecho de la tuya.\n"
"\n"
"El daño bloqueado disminuyó en un 50% de Fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Determination"
msgstr "Determinación"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Determination' for martial art '{'str': 'Muay
#. Thai'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Taking a hit will not slow you down.  You will outlast your opponent and win this fight.\n"
"\n"
"+Bash damage increased by 25% of Strength, blocked damage decreased by 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"Recibir un golpe no te retrasará. Sobrevivirás a tu oponente y ganarás este combate.\n"
"\n"
"El daño de Impacto aumenta un 25% de la Fuerza, el daño bloqueado disminuye un 50% de la Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 5 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Ninjutsu"
msgstr "Ninjutsu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Ninjutsu is a martial art and set of tactics used by ninja in feudal Japan."
"  It focuses on rapid, precise, silent strikes.  Ninjutsu is almost entirely"
" silent and does extra damage on the first attack.  It also provides small "
"combat bonuses every time you move."
msgstr ""
"Ninjutsu es un arte marcial y un conjunto de tácticas utilizadas por los "
"ninja en el Japón feudal. Se centra en ataques rápidos, precisos y "
"silenciosos. El Ninjutsu es casi completamente silencioso y hace daño extra "
"en el primer ataque. También proporciona pequeñas bonificaciones de combate "
"cada vez que te mueves."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You perform a kuji-in mantra with your hands.  Rin, Kai, Jin!"
msgstr "Realizas un mantra kuji-in con tus manos. ¡Rin, Kai, Jin!"

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s performs a series of intricate hand signs."
msgstr "%s emite una serie de intrincados signos con las manos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Ninjutsu Stance"
msgstr "Posición del Ninjutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Ninjutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your training allows you to make no noise when attacking and less noise when moving around.\n"
"\n"
"Melee and unarmed attacks generate 0 noise.  Moving generates 1/2 as much noise."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrenamiento te permite no hacer ruido al atacar y menos ruido al moverte.\n"
"\n"
"Los ataques cuerpo a cuerpo y sin armas generan 0 ruido. Moverse genera la mitad de ruido."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Sneak Attack"
msgstr "Ataque Sorpresa"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Sneak Attack' for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"To a true shinobi, the first strike and the last strike are one in the same.\n"
"\n"
"+50% all damage."
msgstr ""
"Para un verdadero shinobi, el primer golpe y el último golpe son uno mismo.\n"
"\n"
"+50% a todo el daño."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Momentum Shift"
msgstr "Cambio de Momentum"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Momentum Shift' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Ninjas are training to be extremely agile and mobile.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill, Accuracy increased by 20% of Dexterity.\n"
"Last 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Los ninjas se entrenan para ser extremadamente ágiles y móviles.\n"
"\n"
"+1,0 de habilidad en Esquivar, Precisión aumentada en un 20% de Destreza.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Loss of Surprise"
msgstr "Perdida de Sorpresa"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Loss of Surprise' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You intentions are known!  It will take you a few moments to sneak attack again.\n"
"\n"
"-50% all damage.\n"
"Last 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"¡Sus intenciones son conocidas! Tardarás unos momentos en volver a atacar furtivamente.\n"
"\n"
"-50% a todo el daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Escape Plan"
msgstr "Plan de Escape"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Escape Plan' for martial art '{'str': 'Ninjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your target has perished.  It is time to leave and plan your next attack.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Dodge attempts, +10 movement speed.\n"
"Last 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Su objetivo ha muerto. Es hora de marcharse y planear tu próximo ataque.\n"
"\n"
"+2 intentos de Esquivar, +10 velocidad de movimiento.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Niten Ichi-Ryu"
msgstr "Niten Ichi-Ryu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Niten Ichi-Ryu is an ancient school of combat, transmitting a style of "
"classical Japanese swordsmanship conceived by the warrior Miyamoto Musashi."
"  Perception increases damage and reduces blocked damage.  Moving and "
"attacking reduces dodging and damage until you pause.  Pausing for a moment "
"increases Dodge skill."
msgstr ""
"Niten Ichi-Ryu es una antigua escuela de combate, que transmite un estilo de"
" esgrima clásica japonesa concebida por el guerrero Miyamoto Musashi. La "
"percepción aumenta el daño y reduce el daño bloqueado. Moverse y atacar "
"reduce la esquiva y el daño hasta que se hace una pausa. Pausar por un "
"momento aumenta la habilidad de Esquivar."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You clear your mind as you prepare yourself for combat."
msgstr "Despejas tu mente mientras te preparas para el combate."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s relaxes and prepares for combat."
msgstr "%s se relaja y se prepara para el combate."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Niten Ichi-Ryu Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Niten Ichi-Ryu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Niten Ichi-Ryu Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Niten Ichi-Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Cautious watchful eyes\n"
"measure and display your skill.\n"
"Practice makes perfect.\n"
"\n"
"Bash and Cut armor penetration increased by 50% of Perception, blocked damage reduced by 100% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"Ojos vigilantes y cautelosos\n"
"miden y muestran tu habilidad.\n"
"La práctica hace la perfección.\n"
"\n"
"La penetración de la armadura de Impacto y Corte aumentó en un 50% de Percepción, el daño bloqueado se reduce en un 100% de Percepción."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Waning Moon"
msgstr "Luna menguante"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Waning Moon' for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-
#. Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Blackened like darkness,\n"
"nightmares approach from all sides.\n"
"Flee at any cost!\n"
"\n"
"-5.0 Dodge skill.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Ennegrecido como la oscuridad,\n"
"Las pesadillas se acercan por todos lados.\n"
"¡Huye a cualquier precio!\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar -5.0.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Moonlight"
msgstr "Luz de la Luna"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Moonlight' for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-
#. Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Luck be the light,\n"
"on a dark and cloudy night\n"
"as the moon shines down\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"In-One Timing\".\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"La suerte es la luz,\n"
"en una noche oscura y nublada\n"
"mientras la luna brilla\n"
"\n"
"Activa \"En un Tiempo\".\n"
"Dura un turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Falling Leaf"
msgstr "Hoja que Cae"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Falling Leaf' for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-
#. Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sharp sword cuts true.\n"
"Although, all things fade with time.\n"
"Restraint hones your skills.\n"
"\n"
"-1.0 Dodge skill, -1 bash damage, -1 cut damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Una espada afilada corta la verdad.\n"
"Aunque, todas las cosas desaparecen con el tiempo.\n"
"La restricción pule tus habilidades.\n"
"\n"
"-1.0 habilidad Esquivar, -1 de daño de impacto, -1 de daño de corte.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 5 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stillness"
msgstr "Quietud"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stillness' for martial art '{'str': 'Niten Ichi-
#. Ryu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The eye of the storm,\n"
"a fleeting moment of peace,\n"
"gone without a trace.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy, Dodge skill increased by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"El ojo de la tormenta,\n"
"un fugaz momento de paz,\n"
"ido sin huella.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Puntería, habilidad de Esquivar incrementada un 50% de Percepción.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Pankration"
msgstr "Pancracio"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Pankration'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An ancient Greek martial art once used by the Spartans.  It combines boxing "
"and wrestling techniques to create a brutal sport, though modern revival of "
"the art is less of no-holds-barred in nature."
msgstr ""
"Un antiguo arte marcial griego que una vez usaron los espartanos. Combina "
"técnicas de boxeo y lucha para crear un deporte brutal, aunque el "
"renacimiento moderno de este arte que no tiene limite en la naturaleza."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Pankration'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You crouch slightly and prepare to rush forward."
msgstr "Te agachas ligeramente y te preparas para correr hacia adelante."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Pankration'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s crouches slightly, ready to rush forward."
msgstr "%s se agacha ligeramente, preparado para correr hacia adelante."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Close Combat"
msgstr "Combate Cerrado"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Close Combat' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Pankration'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You got your opponent right where you want them!\n"
"\n"
"+20% bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"¡Tienes a tu oponente justo donde quieres!\n"
"\n"
"+20% de daño de impacto.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#. ~ Description of buff 'Counter Chance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Pankration'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The enemy has presented an opening in their defense.\n"
"+10% bash damage.  Enables \"Close Combat\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"El enemigo ha presentado una apertura en su defensa.\n"
"+10% de daño de impacto. Activa la mejora de \"Combate Cerrado\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Silat"
msgstr "Silat"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pentjak Silat, of Indonesian origin, is a fighting style that covers the use"
" of short blades and bludgeons.  Fighters stay low and mobile to avoid "
"attacks, then unleash deadly critical hits."
msgstr ""
"El Pentjak Silat, originario de Indonesia, es un estilo de combate que usa "
"armas blancas cortas y mazas. Los luchadores se mantienen agachados y "
"moviéndose para evitar los ataques, y luego sueltan golpes mortales."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You give a salute of respect as you prepare to combat."
msgstr "Das un saludo de respeto mientras te preparas para el combate."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s gives a combat salute."
msgstr "%s da un saludo de combate."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Silat Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Silat"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You try to stay loose as possible when fighting to have more chances to dodge.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts."
msgstr ""
"Intenta mantenerte lo más suelto posible cuando luchas para tener más oportunidades de esquivar.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de Esquivar."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Silat Evasion"
msgstr "Evasión de Silat"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Evasion' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You stay low as you move, making it harder for enemies to pin you down.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts.\n"
"Lasts 2 turn."
msgstr ""
"Te mantienes agachado mientras te mueves, haciendo más difícil que los enemigos te atrapen.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Silat Appraisal"
msgstr "Evaluación de Silat"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Silat Appraisal' for martial art '{'str': 'Silat'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Each time you dodge an attack, you learn a bit more about your opponents' fighting style.  This allows you to make more precise attacks against them.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 15% of Dexterity.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que evades un ataque, aprendes un poco más sobre el estilo de lucha de tus oponentes. Esto te permite hacer ataques más precisos contra ellos.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión aumentada en 15% de Destreza.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Snake Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu de la Serpiente"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Snake focuses on sinuous "
"movement and precision strikes.  Perception determines your Accuracy, rather"
" than Dexterity.  Standing still will increases your accuracy and damage of "
"your next attack."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos de animales Shaolin. La Serpiente se centra en el "
"movimiento sinuoso y los golpes de precisión. La Percepción determina tu "
"Precisión, más que la Destreza. Quedarse quieto aumentará su precisión y el "
"daño de su próximo ataque."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You adopt a fluid stance, ready to strike like a snake."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura fluida, listo para atacar como una serpiente."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a snake-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una posición de serpiente."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Snake's Sight"
msgstr "Vista de Serpiente"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Snake's Sight' for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are patient and know where to hit your opponent for the best results.\n"
"\n"
"Perception increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.  Accuracy increased by 25% of Perception but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"Eres paciente y sabes dónde golpear a tu oponente para obtener los mejores resultados.\n"
"\n"
"La Percepción aumenta la Precisión en lugar de la Destreza. La Precisión aumentó en un 25% de Percepción pero disminuyó en un 25% de Destreza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Snake's Coil"
msgstr "Serpiente Enroscada"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Snake's Coil' for martial art '{'str': 'Snake Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Every snake wait for the perfect moment to strike.  Aim as your opponents approve and attack their weakness without mercy!\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, gain armor penetration equal to 50% of Perceptions.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada serpiente espera el momento perfecto para atacar. ¡Apunta cuando tus oponentes lo aprueban y atacas su debilidad sin piedad!\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión, gana penetración de armadura igual al 50% de Percepción.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Sōjutsu"
msgstr "Sōjutsu"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Sōjutsu, \"The Way of the Spear\", is the Japanese martial art of fighting "
"with a spear.  Sōjutsu focuses on keeping opponents at a distance in order "
"to maintain advantage in combat.  Standing still gives you an extra block "
"attempt but moving will briefly increase your damage."
msgstr ""
"Sōjutsu, \"El camino de la lanza\", es el arte marcial japonés de luchar con"
" una lanza. Sōjutsu se enfoca en mantener a los oponentes a distancia para "
"mantener la ventaja en el combate. Quedarse quieto te da un intento de "
"bloqueo extra, pero moverse aumentará brevemente tu daño."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You prepare to defend against all that approach you."
msgstr "Te preparas para defenderte de todo lo que se te acerque."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a wide, defensive stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una posición defensiva amplia."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Sōjutsu Stance"
msgstr "Posición Sōjutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Sōjutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your training grants better defense while using a polearm.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempt."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrenamiento te da una mejor defensa mientras usas un arma de asta.\n"
"\n"
"Intento de Bloqueo +1."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Superior Positioning"
msgstr "Posicionamiento Superior"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Superior Positioning' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Sōjutsu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You have given up your defenses for a moment to increase the damage of your attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, -1 Block attempts.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Ha renunciado a tus defensas por un momento para aumentar el daño de tus ataques.\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño, -1  intentos de Bloqueo.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Taekwondo"
msgstr "Taekwondo"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Taekwondo is the national sport of Korea, and was used by the South Korean "
"army in the 20th century.  Focused on kicks and so it does not benefit from "
"wielded weapons.  It also includes strength training; your blocks absorb "
"extra damage and your attacks do more damage if you are not holding "
"anything."
msgstr ""
"El taekwondo es el deporte nacional de Corea, y fue utilizado por el "
"ejército de Corea del Sur en el siglo XX. Se centra en las patadas, por lo "
"que no se beneficia de las armas blandas. También incluye entrenamiento de "
"fuerza; tus bloqueos absorben el daño extra y tus ataques hacen más daño si "
"no estás sujetando nada."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You adopt a narrow fighting stance."
msgstr "Adopta una postura de lucha rígida."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You adopts a narrow fighting stance."
msgstr "Adoptas una postura rígida de combate."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Taekwondo Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Taekwondo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Taekwondo Stance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Taekwondo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Using your legs to attack allows your hands to be free for better defense.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage decreased by 50% of Strength."
msgstr ""
"Usando tus piernas para atacar permite que tus manos estén libres para una mejor defensa.\n"
"\n"
"El daño Bloqueado disminuye en un 50% de Fuerza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Unhindered"
msgstr "Sin obstáculos"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Unhindered' for martial art '{'str': 'Taekwondo'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your attacks are stronger if you are not holding anything in your hands.\n"
"\n"
"+33% bash damage when not using a weapon."
msgstr ""
"Tus ataques son más fuertes si no tienes nada en tus manos.\n"
"\n"
"+33 % de daño por impacto cuando no se usa un arma."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tai Chi"
msgstr "Tai Chi"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Though Tai Chi is often seen as a form of mental and physical exercise, it "
"is a legitimate martial art, focused on self-defense.  Its ability to absorb"
" the force of an attack makes your Perception decrease damage further on a "
"block.  Pausing for a moment enables powerful palm strike techniques."
msgstr ""
"Aunque el Tai Chi se considera a menudo una forma de ejercicio mental y "
"físico, es un arte marcial legítimo, centrado en la defensa personal. Su "
"habilidad para absorber la fuerza de un ataque hace que su percepción "
"disminuya el daño más allá de un bloque. Hacer una pausa por un momento "
"permite técnicas poderosas de golpe con la palma de la mano."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You settle into a gentle stance and prepare to defend yourself."
msgstr "Te acomodas en una postura suave y te preparas para defenderte."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s settles into a gentle stance."
msgstr "%s se acomoda en una posición suave"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tai Chi Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Tai Chi"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tai Chi Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are focused of defense and predicting your opponents attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Block attempts, blocked damage reduced by 100% Perception."
msgstr ""
"Estás enfocado en la defensa y en predecir los ataques de tus oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de Bloqueo, daño bloqueado reducido en 100% de Percepción."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Repulse the Monkey"
msgstr "Repeler al mono"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Repulse the Monkey' for martial art '{'str': 'Tai
#. Chi'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"By perfectly positioning yourself and your opponent, you have become more accurate and can bypass your opponent's defenses.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception, gain bash Armor Penetration equal to 50% of Perception.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al posicionarte perfectamente a tí mismo y a tu oponente, te has vuelto más preciso y puedes evitar las defensas de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"Precisión incrementada en 20% de Percepción, ganas una Penetración de armadura de golpe igual a 50% de Percepción.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Cross Hands"
msgstr "Manos Cruzadas"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Cross Hands' for martial art '{'str': 'Tai Chi'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"By taking a moment to prepare yourself, you are able to use your entire body fully for attacking and defending.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill, blocked damage reduced by 50% of Perception.\n"
"Enables \"Palm Strike\" and \"Double Palm Strike\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al tomarte un momento para prepararte, eres capaz de utilizar todo tu cuerpo para atacar y defenderse.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar +1,0, el daño bloqueado se reduce en un 50% de la Percepción.\n"
"Activa las técnicas \"Golpe de Palma\" y \"Golpe de Palma Doble\".\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Tigre"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the five Shaolin animal styles.  The Tiger focuses on relentless "
"attacks above all else.  Your Strength determines your accuracy, and your "
"attacks do increasing damage as you continue attacking."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los cinco estilos animales Shaolin. El Tigre se focaliza más que nada"
" en ataques implacables. Tu fuerza determina tu precisión, y tus ataques "
"causan mayor daño mientras sigas atacando."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You clench your hands into ferocious, tiger-like claws."
msgstr "Aprietas las manos para convertirlas en feroces garras de tigre."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a tiger-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una posición de tigre."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger Fury"
msgstr "Furia del Tigre"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger Fury' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You attack with an endless barrage of strikes.  The more you hit, the stronger you become.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""
"Atacas con un aluvión interminable de golpes. Cuanto más golpeas, más fuerte te vuelves.\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 4 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger's Strength"
msgstr "Fuerza del Tigre"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger's Strength' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You do not need defense.  You do not need a plan.  You need strength.  Strength will break your opponents' defenses and overwhelm them completely.\n"
"Strength increases Accuracy instead of Dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 25% of Strength but decreased by 25% of Dexterity."
msgstr ""
"No necesitas defensa. No necesitas un plan. Necesitas fuerza. La Fuerza romperá las defensas de tus oponentes y los abrumará completamente.\n"
"La Fuerza aumenta la Precisión en lugar de la Destreza.\n"
"\n"
"La Precisión aumenta en 25% de Fuerza pero disminuye en 25% de Destreza."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger Rampage"
msgstr "Embestida de Tigre"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tiger Rampage' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your opponent's lose is your gain.  Your next attack will break through your opponent's guard.\n"
"\n"
"Gain Armor Penetration equal to 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 1 turns.  Stacks 2 times."
msgstr ""
"La pérdida de tu oponente es tu ganancia. Tu próximo ataque atravesará la guardia de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"Obtiene una Penetración de Armadura igual al 50% de la Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Wing Chun"
msgstr "Wing Chun"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Wing Chun is a Chinese martial art that began by selecting the easiest-to-"
"learn effective techniques from the various Shaolin animal forms.  It has a "
"high stance, with weight entirely on the rear leg.  Wing Chun focuses on "
"sensitivity to the opponent's direction of force, and flowing around it to "
"get back to hitting."
msgstr ""
"El Wing Chun es un arte marcial chino que comenzó seleccionando las técnicas"
" más efectivas y fáciles de aprender de las diversas formas de animales "
"Shaolin. Tiene una postura alta, con el peso enteramente en la pierna "
"trasera. El Wing Chun se centra en la sensibilidad a la dirección de la "
"fuerza del oponente, y fluye a su alrededor para volver a golpear."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You take your stance and prepare to receive the gift of violence."
msgstr ""
"Adoptas tu postura y te preparas para recibir el regalo de la violencia."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s patiently assumes a curiously pigeon-toed stance."
msgstr " %sasume pacientemente una curiosa postura de paloma."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Chain Punch"
msgstr "Puño de Cadena"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Chain Punch' for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your punches are properly timed to give your opponent no rest from your strikes.\n"
"\n"
"-10% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Tus puños están bien sincronizados para que tu oponente no descanse de tus golpes.\n"
"\n"
"-10% coste de movimiento\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Chi-Sao Sensitivity"
msgstr "Sensibilidad Chi-Sao"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Chi-Sao Sensitivity' for martial art '{'str': 'Wing
#. Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You have a greater understanding of balance and technique.  This gives you a better chance to avoid your opponent's attacks.\n"
"\n"
" Dodging Skill increased by 15% of Perception.  Blocked damage reduced by 50% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una mayor comprensión del equilibrio y la técnica. Esto te da una mejor oportunidad de evitar los ataques de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"La habilidad de Esquivar aumentó en un 15% de Percepción. El daño Bloqueado se reduce en un 50% de Percepción."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Biu Ji"
msgstr "Biu Ji"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Biu Ji' for martial art '{'str': 'Wing Chun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Through the perfect application of the Thrusting Fingers form, you can strike your opponents' weak points, force them away, and follow!\n"
"\n"
"Accuracy increased by 20% of Perception, Enables \"Straight Punch (Knockback)\" and \"L-Hook (Knockback)\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Mediante la aplicación perfecta de la forma de los Dedos Punzantes, puedes golpear los puntos débiles de tus oponentes, forzarlos a alejarse y ¡seguir!\n"
"\n"
"Precisión aumentada en un 20% de Percepción, Habilita las técnicas \"Puñetazo directo (Noqueado)\" y \"Gancho Izquierdo (Noqueado)\".\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Zui Quan"
msgstr "Zui Quan"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"AKA \"drunken boxing,\" Zui Quan imitates the movement of a drunk to confuse"
" the enemy.  You gain a passive dodge bonus and accuracy bonus based on your"
" intelligence.  Moving gives you additional dodge attempts and each time you"
" dodge, you inflict more damage with your counterattack for until the end of"
" your next turn."
msgstr ""
"También conocido como \"boxeo de borrachos\", Zui Quan imita el movimiento "
"de un borracho para confundir al enemigo. Obtienes un bono de esquiva pasiva"
" y un bono de precisión basado en tu inteligencia. El movimiento te da "
"intentos adicionales de esquivar y cada vez que esquivas, infliges más daño "
"con tu contraataque hasta el final de tu próximo turno."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You begin to sway to and fro with a confident swagger."
msgstr "Comienzas a balancearte de un lado a otro con un contoneo seguro."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Zui Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s stumbles as if pretending to be drunk."
msgstr "%s tropieza como si fingiera estar borracho."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Zui Quan Stance"
msgstr "Posición de Zui Quan"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Zui Quan Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Others might think you stumble about at random but you know better.  Each movement is calculated to make evading harm easier.\n"
"\n"
"Dodging Skill increased by 15% of Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Otros pueden pensar que te tropiezas al azar pero tú sabes más. Cada movimiento está calculado para facilitar la evasión del daño.\n"
"\n"
"La habilidad de Esquivar se incrementa en un 15% de Inteligencia."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Advanced Zui Quan"
msgstr "Zui Quan avanzado"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Advanced Zui Quan' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You have a greater understanding of Zui Quan.  Your skills at dodging and landing attacks are much better as a result.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts, Accuracy increased by 15% of Intelligence."
msgstr ""
"Tienes una mayor comprensión de Zui Quan. Sus habilidades para esquivar y aterrizar ataques son mucho mejores como resultado.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Intentos de Esquivar, la Precisión aumentó en un 15% de Inteligencia."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Drunken Stumble"
msgstr "Tropiezo de Borracho"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Drunken Stumble' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With a few quick steps, you can completely change your orientation and dodge additional attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Dodge attempts.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Con unos pocos pasos rápidos, puedes cambiar completamente tu orientación y esquivar ataques adicionales.\n"
"\n"
"+2 intentos de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Drunken Dodging"
msgstr "Esquiva de Borracho"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Drunken Dodging' for martial art '{'str': 'Zui
#. Quan'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Each time you dodge, your positional advantage increases against your opponents.  This makes your attacks hit harder with each successful dodge.\n"
"\n"
"Gain Armor Penetration equal to 25% of Intelligence.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada vez que esquivas, tu ventaja posicional aumenta contra tus oponentes. Esto hace que tus ataques sean más fuertes con cada esquiva exitosa.\n"
"\n"
"Gana una Penetración de Armadura igual a 25% de inteligencia.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 4 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Mastery"
msgstr "Depurar Maestrías"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "A secret martial art used only by developers and cheaters."
msgstr ""
"Es un arte marcial secreto solamente utilizado por los desarrolladores y los"
" tramposos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You get ready pwn some zeds!"
msgstr "¡Prepárate para destrozar a algunos zeds!"

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s prepares to cheat at martial arts!"
msgstr " ¡%sse prepara para hacer trampa en las artes marciales!"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Elemental resistance"
msgstr "Resistencia elemental"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Elemental resistance' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"+Strength bash armor, +Dexterity acid armor, +Intelligence electricity "
"armor, +Perception fire armor."
msgstr ""
"+Fuerza armardura contra golpe, +Destreza armadura contra ácido, "
"+Inteligencia armadura contra electricidad, +Percepción armadura contra "
"fuego."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Getting Angry"
msgstr "Enfadarse"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Getting Angry' for martial art '{'str': 'Debug
#. Mastery'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"When I get my hands on you…  +2 bash damage for 2 turns.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Cuando te ponga las manos encima... +2 de daño por impacto durante 2 turnos."
" Se acumula hasta 5 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Lightning Strike"
msgstr "Golpe Rayo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lightning Strike' for martial art '{'str': 'Debug
#. Mastery'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Lightning strikes twice.  +Perception electric damage for 3 turns.  Stacks 2"
" times."
msgstr ""
"El rayo cae dos veces. Daño eléctrico de Percepción durante 3 turnos. Se "
"acumula hasta 2 veces."

#. ~ Description of buff 'On Fire' for martial art '{'str': 'Debug Mastery'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "YOU ARE ON FIRE!  +5 fire damage for 5 turns."
msgstr "¡ESTAS QUE ARDES! +5 de daño de fuego por 5 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Bionic Combatives"
msgstr "Combativo Biónico"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic Combatives'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A modern combat style for the post-modern human.  Nicknamed \"Biojutsu\", "
"Bionic Combatives combines integrated weaponry, armor and augments into an "
"consolidated fighting discipline."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo de combate moderno para el humano posmoderno. Apodado "
"\"Biojutsu\", el Combativo Biónico combina armamento integrado, armadura y "
"aumentos en una disciplina de combate consolidada."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic Combatives'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "BEGINNING BIONIC COMBATIVES PROGRAM.  INITIATING COMBAT PROTOCOLS."
msgstr ""
"INICIO DEL PROGRAMA DE COMBATIVIDAD BIÓNICA. INICIACIÓN DE LOS PROTOCOLOS DE"
" COMBATE."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic Combatives'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s starts moving with swift robotic precision."
msgstr "%s comienza a moverse con una rápida precisión robótica."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Biojutsu Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Biojutsu"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Biojutsu Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic
#. Combatives'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"void player::ApplyBiojutsuStatic() {\n"
"    blocks_left += 2;\n"
"    set_hit_bonus( get_hit_bonus() + 1 );\n"
"}\n"
"\n"
"+2 Blocks attempts, +1 Accuracy."
msgstr "La Biojutsu otorga + 2 de Intento de Bloqueo y +1 de Punteria."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Optimization"
msgstr "Optimización"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Optimization' for martial art '{'str': 'Bionic
#. Combatives'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
">10 LOCATE TARGET\n"
">20 EXECUTE TARGET\n"
">30 GOTO 10\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, +2 all damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
">10 LOCALIZAR EL OBJETIVO\n"
">20 EJECUTAR OBJETIVO\n"
">30 GOTO 10\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión, +2 todo el daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Centipede Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Ciempiés"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Zhang Yiaotian.  Centipede Style uses"
" an onslaught of rapid strikes.  Each attack you land increases your attack "
"speed.  Critical hits increase your damage further."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Zhang Yiaotian. El estilo de "
"los ciempiés utiliza un ataque de golpes rápidos. Cada ataque que realiza "
"aumenta su velocidad de ataque. Los golpes críticos aumentan tu daño aún "
"más."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You ready yourself to attack as fast as possible."
msgstr "Te preparas para atacar lo más rápido posible."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a centipede-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del ciempiés."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Centipede's Frenzy"
msgstr "Frenesí del Ciempiés"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Centipede's Frenzy' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your attacks are a blur of hands and legs that become faster as your strike your opponents without rest.\n"
"\n"
"-4 move cost.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns.  Stacks 4 times."
msgstr ""
"Sus ataques son un borrón de manos y piernas que se vuelven más rápidos al golpear a sus oponentes sin descanso.\n"
"\n"
"El coste de un movimiento es - 4.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos. Se acumula hasta 4 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Centipede's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Ciempiés"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Centipede's Venom' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Centipede Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom burns your opponents at the worst of times.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bashing damage.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno quema a tus oponentes en los peores momentos.\n"
"\n"
"+2 de daño por impacto.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Lizard Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Lagarto"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Meng Tianxia.  Lizard Style focuses "
"on using walls to your advantage.  Standing near a wall provides a large "
"bonus to Dodge skill and moving near a wall gives a large bonus to accuracy."
"  Stronger techniques are enabled when near a wall."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Meng Tianxia. El estilo lagarto"
" se centra en usar las paredes a su favor. Estar cerca de una pared "
"proporciona un gran bono a la habilidad de Esquivar y moverse cerca de una "
"pared proporciona un gran bono a la precisión. Las técnicas más fuertes se "
"habilitan cuando se está cerca de una pared."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You ready yourself to attack from any angle."
msgstr "Te preparas para atacar desde cualquier ángulo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a lizard-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del lagarto."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Lizard's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lizard's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom is a long lasting pain that your opponents will never forget.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 4 turns."
msgstr ""
"Su veneno es un dolor duradero que sus oponentes nunca olvidarán.\n"
"\n"
"+2 de daño por golpe.\n"
"Dura 4 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Lizard's Cunning"
msgstr "Astucia de Lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lizard's Cunning' for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By briefly scaling, leaping, or pushing off a nearby wall, you can avoid the worst of your opponents attacks.\n"
"\n"
"+3.0 Dodge skill when near a wall.\n"
"Enables \"Lizard Tail\" and \"Lizard Wall Counter\" techniques when near a wall."
msgstr ""
"Al escalar, saltar o empujar brevemente una pared cercana, puedes evitar el peor de los ataques de tu oponente.\n"
"\n"
"+3.0 Habilidad de Esquivar cuando se está cerca de una pared.\n"
"Habilita las técnicas \"Cola de lagarto\" y \"Contador de Pared de Lagarto\" cuando está cerca de una pared."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Lizard's Leap"
msgstr "Salto de Lagarto"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Lizard's Leap' for martial art '{'str': 'Lizard Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By briefly scaling, leaping, or pushing off a nearby wall, can attack downward at unsuspecting opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+3 Accuracy when near a wall.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al escalar brevemente, saltar o empujar una pared cercana, puede atacar hacia abajo a oponentes desprevenidos.\n"
"\n"
"+3 Precisión cuando se está cerca de una pared.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Scorpion Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Escorpión"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Gao Ji.  Scorpion Style is a "
"mysterious art which uses pincer-like hands and a stinger kick.  Moving "
"enables a stunning pincer attack.  Critical hits do massive damage and knock"
" your opponent back along with anyone your opponent comes in contact with."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Gao Ji. El Estilo Escorpión es "
"un arte misterioso que utiliza manos como pinzas y una patada con aguijón. "
"El movimiento permite un ataque de pinza impresionante. Los golpes críticos "
"hacen un daño masivo y hacen retroceder a tu oponente junto con cualquiera "
"con el que el oponente entre en contacto."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You prepare to capture and sting your foes."
msgstr "Te preparas para capturar y picar a tus enemigos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a scorpion-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura del escorpión."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Scorpion's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Escorpión"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Scorpion's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Scorpion
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom is a constant threat that nothing can escape from.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bashing damage."
msgstr ""
"Su veneno es una amenaza constante de la que nada puede escapar.\n"
"\n"
"+2 daño de golpeo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Scorpion's Charge"
msgstr "Carga de Escorpión"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Scorpion's Charge' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Rush forward and catch your prey!\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Enables \"Pincer Strike\" technique.\n"
"Stacks 2 times.  Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"¡Apúrense y atrapen a su presa!\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño.\n"
"Permite la técnica del \"Golpe de pinza\".\n"
"Se acumula hasta 2 veces. Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Scorpion's Intimidation"
msgstr "Intimidación del Escorpión"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Scorpion's Intimidation' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Scorpion Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Nothing is scarier than an angry scorpion.  Your attacks can keep others at bay.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempts.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Nada da más miedo que un escorpión enfadado. Sus ataques pueden mantener a raya a los demás.\n"
"\n"
"+1 a los intentos de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu del Sapo"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"One of the Five Deadly Venoms, used by Liang Shen.  Masters of Toad Style "
"can focus themselves to protect against all attacks.  You have powerful "
"armor against physical attacks, though you will lose focus when you move.  "
"You can meditate by pausing, giving yourself more armor for a short time."
msgstr ""
"Uno de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Liang Shen. Los Maestros del "
"Estilo del Sapo pueden concentrarse para protegerse contra todos los "
"ataques. Tiene una poderosa armadura contra los ataques físicos, aunque "
"perderá la concentración cuando se mueva. Puedes meditar haciendo una pausa,"
" dándote más armadura por un corto tiempo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You pause for a moment and focus on your invincible body."
msgstr "Te detienes un momento y te concentras en tu cuerpo invencible."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a toad-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una posición de sapo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad's Iron Skin"
msgstr "Piel de Hierro de Sapo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Toad's Iron Skin' for martial art '{'str': 'Toad
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your body is as strong as iron but only if you don't move.\n"
"\n"
"+6 bash, cut, and stab armor."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo es tan fuerte como el hierro, pero sólo si no te mueves.\n"
"\n"
"+6 golpe, corte y penetración de armadura."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Iron Skin Dissipation"
msgstr "Disipación de Hierro en la Piel"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Iron Skin Dissipation' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Toad Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Moving causes you to lose your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"-1 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 6 turns.  Stacks 6 times."
msgstr ""
"Moverse hace que pierdas tu piel de hierro.\n"
"\n"
"-1 golpear, cortar y apuñalar armaduras.\n"
"Dura 6 vueltas. Se acumula hasta 6 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad's Meditation"
msgstr "Meditación de Sopa"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Toad's Meditation' for martial art '{'str': 'Toad
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By concentrating for a moment, you can bolster the strength of your iron skin.\n"
"\n"
"+3 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"Al concentrarte un momento, puedes reforzar la fuerza de su piel de hierro.\n"
"\n"
"+3 armadura de impacto, corte y penetración.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Toad's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Sapo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Toad's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Toad Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom is just another lesson about the strength of your iron body.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 5 turns."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno es una lección más sobre la fuerza de tu cuerpo de hierro.\n"
"\n"
"+2 de daño de impacto.\n"
"Dura 5 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Viper Kung Fu"
msgstr "Kung Fu de la Víbora"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A legacy of the Five Deadly Venoms, use by Qi Dong.  Viper Style (originally"
" called Snake Style) has a unique three-part combo, which initiates on a "
"dodge, then follows up with a stunning Viper Bite and then finishes with the"
" legendary Viper Strike."
msgstr ""
"Un legado de los Cinco Venenos Mortales, usado por Qi Dong. El Estilo Víbora"
" (originalmente llamado Estilo Serpiente) tiene un combo único de tres "
"partes, que comienza con un esquivo, luego sigue con una impresionante "
"Mordida Víbora y luego termina con el legendario Golpe Víbora."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You prepare to strike your foes' weaknesses."
msgstr "Te preparas para atacar los puntos débiles de tus enemigos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes a viper-like stance."
msgstr "%s adopta la postura de una víbora."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Viper's Patience"
msgstr "Paciencia de la Víbora"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Patience' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper
#. Kung Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Every snake waits for the perfect moment to strike.  Turn your opponents' mistakes into your opportunity to strike!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodge skill."
msgstr ""
"Toda serpiente espera el momento perfecto para atacar. ¡Convierte los errores de tus oponentes en tu oportunidad de golpear!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Habilidad de Esquivar."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Viper's Ambush"
msgstr "Emboscada de Víbora"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Ambush' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your evasiveness has left your opponent wide open to painful bite.\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"Viper Bite\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tu evasión ha dejado a tu oponente abierto a una dolorosa mordedura.\n"
"\n"
"Permite la técnica de \"Mordida de Víbora\".\n"
"Dura un turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Viper's Venom"
msgstr "Veneno de Víbora"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Viper's Venom' for martial art '{'str': 'Viper Kung
#. Fu'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your venom is a harsh reminder to never tease a predator.\n"
"\n"
"+2 bash damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tu veneno es un duro recordatorio para no molestar nunca a un depredador.\n"
"\n"
"+2 de daño de golpe.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT Blade-work"
msgstr "Trabajo-espada CRIT"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An offensive style centered around rapid slashes and prodding.  Each attack "
"landed increases combat ability but leaves you increasingly vulnerable"
msgstr ""
"Un estilo ofensivo centrado en los golpes rápidos y punzantes. Cada ataque "
"acertado incrementa la habilidad de combate pero te va dejando más "
"vulnerable."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You prepare to whittle down your enemies."
msgstr "Te preparas para reducir a tus enemigos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s initiates blade-work."
msgstr "%s inicia el trabajo-espada"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Unwavering Edge"
msgstr "Filo Inquebrantable"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Unwavering Edge' for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Gain minor Accuracy, Cutting and Stabbing Arpen per stack.  Greatly reduces "
"dodge skill.  2 stacks max"
msgstr ""
"Gana Precisión menor, Corte y Penetración de Armadura por acumulado. Reduce "
"en gran medida la habilidad de Esquivar. Se acumula hasta 2 veces"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Ruthlessness"
msgstr "Temeridad"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Ruthlessness' for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Additional Stabbing and Cutting damage per stack.  Reduces dodge attempts.  "
"4 stacks max."
msgstr ""
"Daño adicional por Penetración y Corte por apilado. Reduce los intentos de "
"esquivar. Se acumula hasta 4 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Rending Strikes"
msgstr "Golpes Desgarradores"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Rending Strikes' for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Additional Armor penetration per stack.  Further reduces dodge attempts.  3 "
"stacks max."
msgstr ""
"Penetración Adicional de Armadura por apilado. Reduce aún más los intentos "
"de Esquivar. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Calculating Eyes"
msgstr "Ojos Calculadores"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Calculating Eyes' for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have been taught how to properly utilize small to medium-sized sharp "
"weaponry.  Gain great Cutting and Stabbing Armor Penetration on top of minor"
" Accuracy"
msgstr ""
"Se te ha enseñado a utilizar correctamente las armas afiladas de tamaño "
"pequeño y mediano. Consigue una gran Penetración de Armadura de Corte y "
"Apuñalamiento además de una Precisión menor"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Honed Movements"
msgstr "Movimientos Perfeccionados"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Honed Movements' for martial art 'CRIT Blade-work'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your skill with handling sharp weaponry has improved.  Gain extra Cutting "
"and Stabbing damage."
msgstr ""
"Tu habilidad para manejar armas afiladas ha mejorado. Ganas daño adicional "
"por Corte y Apuñalamiento."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "C.R.I.T Enforcement"
msgstr "Cumplimiento C.R.I.T."

#. ~ Description for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A defensive style that is centered around stunning swings, knockback and "
"grounding enemies.  Each attack landed increases your armor and offers other"
" combat bonuses based on stats."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo defensivo que se centra en impresionantes golpes, noqueados y "
"caidas de los enemigos. Cada ataque aterrizado aumenta tu armadura en y "
"ofrece otras bonificaciones de combate basadas en los atributos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You ready yourself to stand your ground."
msgstr "Te preparas para mantenerte firme."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s draws a line in the sand."
msgstr "%s traza una línea en la arena."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Bulwark"
msgstr "Baluarte"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Bulwark' for martial art 'C.R.I.T Enforcement'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "+1 armor and other small bonuses per stack.  Max of 2 stacks"
msgstr ""
"+1 de armadura y otros pequeños bonos apilables. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Unyielding Front"
msgstr "Frente Inquebrantable"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Unyielding Front' for martial art 'C.R.I.T
#. Enforcement'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Stand strong in the face of adversity.  +1 armor.  STR provides accuracy and"
" minor bash arpen."
msgstr ""
"Mantente fuerte ante la adversidad. +1 armadura. FUE proporciona precisión y"
" menor penetración de impacto."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "CRIT CQB"
msgstr "CQB CRIT"

#. ~ Description for martial art 'CRIT CQB'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A style centered around rapid strikes and piercing jabs.  Each attack landed"
" adds a plethora of combat bonuses."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo centrado en golpes rápidos y los golpes penetrantes. Cada ataque "
"que se realiza añade una plétora de bonificaciones de combate."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art 'CRIT CQB'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You shift your weight for the oncoming fight."
msgstr "Cambias tu peso para la lucha que se avecina."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art 'CRIT CQB'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s prepares for hand-to-hand battle."
msgstr "%s se prepara para la batalla cuerpo a cuerpo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Fluid Tenacity"
msgstr "Tenacidad Fluida"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Fluid Tenacity' for martial art 'CRIT CQB'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"+Atk Speed and other small bonuses based on DEX per stack.  Max of 5 stacks"
msgstr ""
"+ Atk Velocidad y otros pequeños bonos basados en la DEX por pila. Se "
"acumula hasta 5 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tactful Initiative"
msgstr "Iniciativa con Tacto"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Tactful Initiative' for martial art 'CRIT CQB'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have gained an advantage by always remaining mindful of common "
"weaknesses.  DEX provides dodge ability, accuracy and armor penetration."
msgstr ""
"Has ganado una ventaja al permanecer siempre atento a las debilidades "
"comunes. La DES proporciona capacidad de esquivar, precisión y penetración "
"de armadura."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Desert Wind"
msgstr "Viento del Desierto"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Desert Wind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Followers of the Desert Wind discipline learn to channel their inner "
"strength into powerful spirals of fire.  Always on the move, Desert Wind "
"students use their weapons as a conduit to burn their opponents with searing"
" flames.  Furthermore, these flames expand outward with explosive force, "
"damaging anyone nearby."
msgstr ""
"Seguidores de la disciplina Viento del Desierto aprenden a canalizar su "
"fuerza interior en poderosas espirales de fuego. Siempre en movimiento, los "
"estudiantes de Viento del Desierto utilizan sus armas como conducto para "
"quemar a sus oponentes con llamas abrasadoras. Además, estas llamas se "
"expanden hacia fuera con una fuerza explosiva, dañando a cualquiera que esté"
" cerca."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Desert Wind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You feel a wave of heat wash over you as you assume a running combat stance."
msgstr ""
"Sientes una oleada de calor que te invade mientras adoptas una postura de "
"combate corriendo."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Desert Wind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s assumes into a running combat stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura de combate en carrera."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Wind Stride"
msgstr "Zancada de Viento"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Wind Stride' for martial art '{'str': 'Desert
#. Wind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your movement is hastened as if a strong wind is always at your back.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tu movimiento se acelera como si un fuerte viento estuviera siempre a tu espalda.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Habilidad de Esquivar.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Zephyr Dance"
msgstr "Danza del Céfiro"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Zephyr Dance' for martial art '{'str': 'Desert
#. Wind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your graceful and fluid movements allow you to avoid attacks with ease.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill, +1 Dodge attempt\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Tus elegantes y fluidos movimientos te permiten evadir los ataques con facilidad.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 habilidad de Esquivar, +1 intento de Esquivar\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Diamond Mind"
msgstr "Mente Diamante"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Diamond Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A student of the Diamond Mind discipline has honed their mind to defeat any "
"opponent.  With quick reflexes and surgical percision, they are able to move"
" so fast that their opponents are unable react.  Marked by unparrelled "
"confidence, those that hesitate for even a moment will fall before them in "
"the blink of an eye."
msgstr ""
"Un estudiante de la disciplina Mente de Diamante ha perfeccionado su mente "
"para derrotar a cualquier oponente. Con rápidos reflejos y una precisión "
"quirúrgica, son capaces de moverse tan rápido que sus oponentes son "
"incapaces de reaccionar. Marcados por una confianza sin parangón, los que "
"dudan aunque sea un momento caerán ante ellos en un abrir y cerrar de ojos."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Diamond Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You concentrate and become very still for a moment."
msgstr "Te concentras y te quedas muy quieto por un momento."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Diamond Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s becomes very still for a moment."
msgstr "%s se queda muy quieto por un momento."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stance of Alacrity"
msgstr "Postura de Presteza"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stance of Alacrity' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Diamond Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Your mind is clearer than normal.  This clarity allows you to move slightly faster in combat.\n"
"\n"
"-10% move cost"
msgstr ""
"Tu mente está más clara de lo normal. Esta claridad te permite moverte ligeramente más rápido en combate.\n"
"\n"
"-10% de coste de movimiento"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Pearl of Black Doubt"
msgstr "Perla de Duda Negra"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Pearl of Black Doubt' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Diamond Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Each attack that misses you casts doubt on your opponents' skill.  It becomes more obvious with each failed attack how untouchable you are.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attempt\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 2 times"
msgstr ""
"Cada ataque que esquivas pone en duda la habilidad de tus oponentes. Con cada ataque evitado se hace más evidente lo intocable que eres.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intento de Esquivar\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 2 veces"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Quicksilver Motion"
msgstr "Movimiento PlataRápida"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Quicksilver Motion' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Diamond Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Taking a moment to concentrate, you surge foward with incredible speed and act in the blink of an eye.\n"
"\n"
"+50 Speed.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Te tomas un momento para concentrarte, avanzas con una velocidad increíble y actúas en un abrir y cerrar de ojos.\n"
"\n"
"+50 de velocidad.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Mind over Body"
msgstr "Mente sobre Cuerpo"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Mind over Body' for martial art '{'str': 'Diamond
#. Mind'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your well trained mind allows you to briefly shrug off the effects of pain while in combat.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 2 times"
msgstr ""
"Tu mente bien entrenada te permite por un breve instante ignorar los efectos del dolor durante el combate.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Precisión.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 2 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Hylian Swordsmanship"
msgstr "Manejo de Espada Hylian"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Hylian Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This rare form of combat has been practiced by many legendary heroes "
"throughout the ages.  Hylian Swordsmanship favors mobility for offense and "
"defense by using spins, jumps, and flips to confuse enemies and strike from "
"unexpected angles."
msgstr ""
"Esta rara forma de combate ha sido practicada por muchos héroes legendarios "
"a lo largo de los tiempos. El Manejo de Espada Hylian favorece la movilidad "
"en la ofensiva y la defensa mediante el uso de giros, saltos y volteretas "
"para confundir a los enemigos y golpear desde ángulos inesperados."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Hylian Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You begin to step lightly from side to side."
msgstr "Comienza a dar pasos ligeros de un lado a otro."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Hylian Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s begins to step lightly from side to side."
msgstr "%s comienza a dar pasos ligeros de un lado a otro."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Combat Acrobat"
msgstr "Acróbata de Combate"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Combat Acrobat' for martial art '{'str': 'Hylian
#. Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Always stay light on your feet.  It is better to evade than be hit.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"Mantente siempre ligero en tus pies. Es mejor evadir que ser golpeado.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Habilidad de Esquivar."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Intermediate Combat Acrobat"
msgstr "Acróbata de Combate Intermedio"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Intermediate Combat Acrobat' for martial art
#. '{'str': 'Hylian Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"After a great deal of practice, you have become even more nimble in a battle.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"Después de mucha práctica, te has vuelto aún más ágil en una batalla.\n"
"\n"
"+1,0 Habilidad de Esquivar"

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Master Combat Acrobat"
msgstr "Acróbata de Combate Maestro"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Master Combat Acrobat' for martial art '{'str':
#. 'Hylian Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have seen so much combat that your dodging skills have become top notch!\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Dodging skill."
msgstr ""
"Has visto tantos combates que tu habilidad para esquivar se ha convertido en la más avanzada.\n"
"\n"
"+1.0 Habilidad para Esquivar."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Dash Attack"
msgstr "Ataque de Lanzamiento"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Dash Attack' for martial art '{'str': 'Hylian
#. Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Taking advantage of momentum, you rush towards foes to deliver a powerful strike.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 3 times."
msgstr ""
"Aprovechando el impulso, te precipitas hacia los enemigos para asestar un poderoso golpe.\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta 3 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Flurry Rush"
msgstr "Ráfaga Apresurada"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Flurry Rush' for martial art '{'str': 'Hylian
#. Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"When you perfectly dodge an attack, you can attack rapidly for a short time.\n"
"\n"
"-25% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Cuando esquivas perfectamente un ataque, puedes atacar rápidamente durante un breve periodo de tiempo.\n"
"\n"
"-25% de coste de movimiento.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Charge Up"
msgstr "Cargar"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Charge Up' for martial art '{'str': 'Hylian
#. Swordsmanship'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"By taking a moment to prepare, you can unleash a strong, spinning slash!\n"
"\n"
"+20% damage, enables \"Spin Attack\" technique.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Si te tomas un momento para prepararte, puedes soltar un fuerte tajo giratorio.\n"
"\n"
"+20% de daño, activa la técnica de \"Ataque giratorio\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Iron Heart"
msgstr "Corazón de Hierro"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Iron Heart'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Iron Heart discipline is the study of combat.  Nothing more but also "
"nothing less.  Iron Heart students practice endlessly to achieve a complete "
"and absolute mastery of their weapon.  Users of Iron Heart are easily able "
"to disable and dispatch opponents with superior skill and technique.  Only "
"the fool would attempt to fight an Iron Heart student head-on."
msgstr ""
"La disciplina Corazón de Hierro es el estudio del combate. Nada más pero "
"también nada menos. Los estudiantes de Corazón de Hierro practican sin cesar"
" para lograr un dominio completo y absoluto de su arma. Los usuarios de "
"Corazón de Hierro son capaces de inutilizar y despachar fácilmente a sus "
"oponentes con una habilidad y una técnica superiores. Sólo los tontos "
"intentarían luchar contra un estudiante de Corazón de Hierro de frente."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Iron Heart'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You push away your fear and stand tall."
msgstr "Alejas el miedo y mantente firme."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Iron Heart'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s takes a bold and fearless stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura audaz y sin miedo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Panzer Kunst"
msgstr "Panzer Kunst"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Panzer Kunst'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Panzer Kunst or \"Armor Art\" is a futuristic martial art devised for "
"cyborgs fighting in zero-gravity environments."
msgstr ""
"Panzer Kunst  o 'Arte de armadura' es un arte marcial futurista diseñado "
"para los cyborgs que luchan en entornos de gravedad cero."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Panzer Kunst'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You adopt a panzer kunst stance."
msgstr "Adopta una postura panzer kunst."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Panzer Kunst'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s adopts a panzer kunst stance."
msgstr "%s adopta una postura panzer kunst."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Schatten Folgen"
msgstr "Rastreo de la Sombra"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Schatten Folgen' for martial art '{'str': 'Panzer
#. Kunst'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"\"Shadow Tracking\"\n"
"As a künstler, you are trained to stay in your target's blind spot.\n"
"\n"
"+1 Dodge attemps, Dodge Skill increased by 12%% of Perception."
msgstr ""
"\"Rastreo de sombras\"\n"
"Como un künstler, estás entrenado para permanecer en el punto ciego de tu objetivo.\n"
"\n"
"+1 a los intentos de esquivar, la habilidad de esquivar aumenta en 12 %% de Percepción."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Einzug Rüstungen"
msgstr "Einzug Rüstungen"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Einzug Rüstungen' for martial art '{'str': 'Panzer
#. Kunst'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"\"Armor Penetration\"\n"
"By attuning to the rhythm of your opponent, you can strike where their guard is the weakest.\n"
"+5 bash Armor Penetration.\n"
"Lasts 2 turns."
msgstr ""
"\"Penetración de la armadura\"\n"
"Al sintonizar con el ritmo de tu oponente, puedes golpear donde su guardia es más débil.\n"
"+5 golpe de Penetración de Armadura.\n"
"Dura 2 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Pokken"
msgstr "Pokken"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Pokken'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Pokken or \"Pocket Fist\" is a strange martial art developed from the famous"
" Pokemon video game series.  Somehow, a group of dedicated fans managed to "
"combine the moves used by various pokemon with multiple existing martial "
"arts such as boxing and karate.  Amazingly, it actually works.  Some might "
"even say it's a super effective way to fight."
msgstr ""
"Pokkén o \"Puño Bolsillo\" es un extraño arte marcial desarrollado a partir "
"de la famosa serie de videojuegos Pokemon. De alguna manera, un grupo de "
"fans dedicados logró combinar los movimientos utilizados por varios pokemon "
"con múltiples artes marciales existentes, como el boxeo y el karate. "
"Sorprendentemente, funciona. Algunos incluso dirían que es una forma súper "
"efectiva de luchar."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Pokken'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You get ready to battle."
msgstr "Te preparas para la batalla."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Pokken'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s is about to challenge someone to a battle."
msgstr "%s está a punto de desafiar a alguien a una batalla."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stamina"
msgstr "Vigor"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stamina' for martial art '{'str': 'Pokken'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Boosts your defense after you get hit.\n"
"\n"
"Gain bash, cut, stab armor equal to 50% of Strength.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta tu defensa después de ser golpeado.\n"
"\n"
"Gana una armadura de Impacto, Corte y Penetración igual al 50% de Fuerza.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Sniper"
msgstr "Francotirador"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Sniper' for martial art '{'str': 'Pokken'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Powers up your techniques after you score a critical hit.\n"
"\n"
"+50% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Potencia tus técnicas después de conseguir un golpe crítico.\n"
"\n"
"+50% de daño.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Moxie"
msgstr "Moxie"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Moxie' for martial art '{'str': 'Pokken'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Boosts your damage after defeating an opponent.\n"
"\n"
"+50% damage.\n"
"Lasts 3 turns."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta tu daño tras derrotar a un oponente.\n"
"\n"
"+50% de daño.\n"
"Dura 3 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Setting Sun"
msgstr "Sol Poniente"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Setting Sun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Setting Sun discipline teaches its initiates to turn their opponents' "
"advantages into disadvantages.  Students of this discipline are able to able"
" to fool their opponents and then turn their strength against them with a "
"powerful throw."
msgstr ""
"La disciplina Sol Poniente enseña a sus iniciados a convertir las ventajas "
"de tus oponentes en desventajas. Los estudiantes de esta disciplina son "
"capaces de engañar a tus oponentes y luego volver su fuerza contra ellos con"
" un poderoso lanzamiento."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Setting Sun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You shift your weight and prepare to defend yourself."
msgstr "Cambias tu peso y te preparas para defenderte."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Setting Sun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s shifts their weight and assumes a new stance."
msgstr "%s cambia su peso y asume una nueva postura."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Baffling Defense"
msgstr "Defensa Desconcertante"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Baffling Defense' for martial art '{'str': 'Setting
#. Sun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You ready yourself for your opponent attack while preparing to send them flying!\n"
"\n"
"Dodging Skill increased by 20% of Intelligence, enables \"Mighty Throw\" and \"Ballista Throw\" techniques.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Te preparas para el ataque de tu oponente mientras te preparas para mandarlo a volar.\n"
"\n"
"Habilidad de Esquivar aumentada en un 20% de la Inteligencia, habilita las técnicas \"Lanzamiento Poderoso\" y \"Lanzamiento de Balista\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Feigned Opening"
msgstr "Apertura Simulada"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Feigned Opening' for martial art '{'str': 'Setting
#. Sun'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By faking an opening, you able to throw your opponent off balance and act quicker for a short time.\n"
"\n"
"+20 Speed.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Al fingir una apertura, puedes desequilibrar a tu oponente y actuar con mayor rapidez durante un breve periodo de tiempo.\n"
"\n"
"+20 de velocidad.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Shii-Cho"
msgstr "Shii-Cho"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Shii-Cho'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Shii-Cho, \"The way of the Sarlacc\" was the first form lightsaber combat "
"developed by the Jedi during their transition from metal weaponry to "
"lightsabers.  Shii-Cho is regarded as a training form that all Jedi learn to"
" understand the basics of armed combat.  Shii-Cho excels at fighting against"
" groups but lacks the offensive power of the other lightsaber forms."
msgstr ""
"El Shii-Cho, \"El camino del Sarlacc\", fue la primera forma de combate con "
"sable láser desarrollada por los Jedi durante su transición del armamento "
"metálico al sable láser. El Shii-Cho se considera una forma de entrenamiento"
" que todos los Jedi aprenden para comprender los fundamentos del combate "
"armado. El Shii-Cho destaca en la lucha contra grupos, pero carece del poder"
" ofensivo de las otras formas de sable láser."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Shii-Cho'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You place one foot back and hold your weapon vertically on your dominant "
"side."
msgstr ""
"Colocas un pie atrás y sostienes tu arma verticalmente en tu lado dominante."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Shii-Cho'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s places one foot back and hold their weapon vertically."
msgstr "%s coloca un pie atrás y sostiene su arma verticalmente."

#. ~ Description of buff 'Determination' for martial art '{'str': 'Shii-Cho'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are a determined warrior.  Your inner calm aids you in landing your strikes and protecting yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Blocked damage reduced by 100% of Strength, +1 Accuracy."
msgstr ""
"Eres un guerrero determinado. Tu calma interior te ayuda a asestar tus golpes y a protegerte.\n"
"\n"
"El daño bloqueado se reduce en un 100% de la Fuerza, +1 Precisión."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Apprentice Training"
msgstr "Entrenamiento de Aprendiz"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Apprentice Training' for martial art '{'str': 'Shii-
#. Cho'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your training in Shii-Cho teaches you how to combat multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempts, +1 block effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Tu entrenamiento en Shii-Cho te enseña a combatir a varios oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"+1 a los intentos de Bloqueo, +1 a la eficacia del Bloqueo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Knight Training"
msgstr "Entrenamiento de Caballero"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Knight Training' for martial art '{'str': 'Shii-
#. Cho'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Further training in Shii-Cho improves your ability to combat multiple opponents.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempts, +1 block effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Un mayor entrenamiento en Shii-Cho mejora tu capacidad para combatir a varios oponentes.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intentos de Bloqueo, +1 efectividad de Bloqueo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Master Training"
msgstr "Entrenamiento Maestro"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Master Training' for martial art '{'str': 'Shii-
#. Cho'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As a master of Shii-Cho, your ability to fight against groups is second to none.\n"
"\n"
"+1 block attempts, +1 block effectiveness."
msgstr ""
"Como maestro de Shii-Cho, tu capacidad para luchar contra grupos es insuperable.\n"
"\n"
"+1 intentos de Bloqueo, +1 efectividad de Bloqueo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stone Dragon"
msgstr "Dragón de Piedra"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Stone Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Strength, endurance, and patience are the cornerstones of the Stone Dragon "
"discipline.  Stone Dragon students are taught to end battles with a single, "
"powerful blow.  By standing still for a moment, the user can fortify "
"themselves with the power of stone."
msgstr ""
"Fuerza, resistencia y paciencia son las piedras angulares de la disciplina "
"del Dragón de Piedra. A los estudiantes del Dragón de Piedra se les enseña a"
" terminar las batallas con un único y poderoso golpe. Al quedarse quieto un "
"momento, el usuario puede fortalecerse con el poder de la piedra."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Stone Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You dig your heels into the ground and steady yourself."
msgstr "Clavas los talones en el suelo y te estabilizas."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Stone Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s digs their heels into the ground."
msgstr "%s clava sus talones en el suelo."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stone Bones"
msgstr "Huesos de Piedra"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stone Bones' for martial art '{'str': 'Stone
#. Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Each attack against your opponents slowly steels your defenses.\n"
"\n"
"+1 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn.  Stacks 5 times."
msgstr ""
"Cada ataque contra tus oponentes refuerza lentamente tus defensas.\n"
"\n"
"+1 armadura de impacto, corte y apuñalamiento.\n"
"Dura 1 turno. Se acumula hasta  5 veces."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stonefoot Stance"
msgstr "Postura de Pie de Piedra"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stonefoot Stance' for martial art '{'str': 'Stone
#. Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You maintain a steady stance that improves your combat prowless.  However, moving too much will break your stance.\n"
"\n"
"+10% damage, +2 bash, cut, and stab armor."
msgstr ""
"Mantienes una postura firme que mejora tu destreza en el combate. Sin embargo, si te mueves demasiado, romperás tu postura.\n"
"\n"
"+10% de daño, +2 de armadura de impacto, corte y penetración."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Cracked Stone"
msgstr "Piedra Agrietada"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Cracked Stone' for martial art '{'str': 'Stone
#. Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Moving too much will negate the effects of Surefoot Stance.  Stay still to avoid shattering your stance!\n"
"\n"
"Enables \"Shattered Stone\" buff.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Moverse demasiado anulará los efectos de la Postura Pie Seguro. Quédate quieto para evitar que se rompa tu postura.\n"
"\n"
"Activa el potenciador \"Piedra Destrozada\".\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Stattered Stone"
msgstr "Piedra Destrozada"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Stattered Stone' for martial art '{'str': 'Stone
#. Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You are unable to maintain your Surefoot Stance and must stop moving for a short time to regain its benefits.\n"
"\n"
"-10% damage, -2 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 4 turn."
msgstr ""
"No puedes mantener tu postura de Pies Seguros y debes dejar de moverte durante un breve periodo de tiempo para recuperar sus beneficios.\n"
"\n"
"-10% de daño, -2 de armadura de impacto, corte y penetración.\n"
"Dura 4 turnos."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Iron Bones"
msgstr "Huesos de Hierro"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Iron Bones' for martial art '{'str': 'Stone
#. Dragon'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With a powerful strike, you further fortify yourself again counterattacks!\n"
"\n"
"+5 bash, cut, and stab armor.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Con un poderoso golpe, te fortaleces aún más en los contraataques.\n"
"\n"
"+5 armadura de impactos, cortes y penetración.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Tiger Claw"
msgstr "Garra de Tigre"

#. ~ Description for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Claw'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The Tiger Claw discipline embraces the fury and power of a wild beast.  "
"Attacks from a Tiger Claw student are vicious and very few can stand against"
" the might of a frenzied animal."
msgstr ""
"La disciplina Garra de Tigre abarca la furia y el poder de una bestia "
"salvaje. Los ataques de un estudiante de Garra de Tigre son despiadados y "
"muy pocos pueden resistir el poder de un animal frenético."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Claw'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "You emit a low growl as you prepare for battle."
msgstr "Emites un gruñido bajo mientras te preparas para la batalla."

#. ~ initiate message for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger Claw'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, python-format
msgid "%s hunkers down like a wild animal."
msgstr "%s se agacha como un animal salvaje."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Improved Critical"
msgstr "Crítico Mejorado"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Improved Critical' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger
#. Claw'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"Always strike with full force.  Never hold back anything unless you want to die.\n"
"\n"
"+5% critical hit chance."
msgstr ""
"Golpea siempre con la fuerza máxima. Nunca retengas nada a menos que quieras morir.\n"
"\n"
"+5% prob. golpe crítico."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Pounching Charge"
msgstr "Carga de Golpes"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Pounching Charge' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger
#. Claw'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"You recklessly throw yourself into battle to overpower your prey.  Strike first and strike hard.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Accuracy, +10% damage.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Te lanzas temerariamente a la batalla para dominar a tu presa. Golpea primero y golpea fuerte.\n"
"\n"
"+2 Precisión, +10% de daño.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Cornered Predator"
msgstr "Depredador Acorralado"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Cornered Predator' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger
#. Claw'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"A cornered animal is a terrifying and dangerous creature.  You are no different.\n"
"\n"
"-20% move cost.\n"
"Lasts 1 turn."
msgstr ""
"Un animal acorralado es una criatura aterradora y peligrosa. Tú no eres diferente.\n"
"\n"
"-20% de coste de movimiento.\n"
"Dura 1 turno."

#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
msgid "Blood In The Water"
msgstr "Sangre En El Agua"

#. ~ Description of buff 'Blood In The Water' for martial art '{'str': 'Tiger
#. Claw'}'
#: lang/json/martial_art_from_json.py
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The scent of blood is near.  You want more.  NOW!\n"
"\n"
"+1 Accuracy, +15% damage.\n"
