#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Venom Mob Protege"
msgstr "Protegido Mafia Veneno"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Venom Mob Protege'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are a pupil of the Venom Clan.  You start with one of the five deadly "
"venoms: Centipede, Viper, Scorpion, Lizard, or Toad."
msgstr ""
"Eres un pupilo del Clan del Veneno. Empiezas con uno de estos cinco venenos "
"mortales: Ciempiés, Víbora, Escorpión, Lagarto o Sapo."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Inconspicuous"
msgstr "Discreto"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Inconspicuous'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"While sleeping or staying still, it is less likely that monsters will wander"
" close to you."
msgstr ""
"Mientras duermas o estes quieto,la probabilidad de que se te acerque algun "
"monstruo es mucho menor."

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Savings"
msgstr "Ahorros"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Savings'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You had some money stashed at the bank for a rainy day.  Now that the storm "
"is raging, it's a last call to use it maybe?"
msgstr ""
"Tenías algo de dinero ahorrado en el banco para un día de lluvia. Ahora que "
"la tormenta está en marcha, ¿última oportunidad de usarlo?"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debt"
msgstr "Deuda"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debt'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You needed money and had a big loan in a bank.  Good thing nobody will come "
"to collect it now, right?  Right?"
msgstr ""
"Necesitabas dinero y tomaste un gran préstamo de un banco. Menos mal que "
"ahora nadie vendrá a echar cuentas, ¿verdad? ¿Verdad?"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Millionaire"
msgstr "Millonario"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Millionaire'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid ""
"At the time of Cataclysm you were an owner of a fortune stashed in a bank.  "
"Does that have any meaning now?"
msgstr ""
"En la época del Cataclismo eras dueño de una fortuna escondida en un banco. "
"¿Eso tiene algún significado ahora?"

#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Debug Very Strong Back"
msgstr "Depurar Mandibula Muy Fuerte"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'Debug Very Strong Back'}
#: lang/json/mutation_from_json.py
msgid "Lets you carry 15 bugs worth of your body weight in your mandibles."
msgstr "Te permite llevar 15 insectos de tu mismo peso en tus mandíbulas."

