"sobrevivido, y eso es más de lo que la mayoría podría decir ahora mismo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sheltered Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente en Refugio"

#. ~ Profession (male Sheltered Survivor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter.  You've "
"spent the past months eating canned food, reading books, and tinkering with "
"stuff in the bunker.  Now it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"Al comienzo del Cataclismo, te escondiste en un refugio antiaéreo. Has "
"pasado los últimos meses comiendo comida enlatada, leyendo libros y "
"trasteando con cosas en el búnker. Ahora es invierno: es hora de enfrentarte"
" al mundo de arriba."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sheltered Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente en Refugio"

#. ~ Profession (female Sheltered Survivor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter.  You've "
"spent the past months eating canned food, reading books, and tinkering with "
"stuff in the bunker.  Now it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"Al comienzo del Cataclismo, te escondiste en un refugio antiaéreo. Has "
"pasado los últimos meses comiendo comida enlatada, leyendo libros y jugando "
"con cosas en el búnker. Ahora es invierno: es hora de enfrentarse al mundo "
"de arriba."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sheltered Militia"
msgstr "Miliciano Refugiado"

#. ~ Profession (male Sheltered Militia) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At the start of the Cataclysm, you hunkered down in a bomb shelter with your"
" collection of guns.  You've spent the past months eating canned food and "
"practicing your aim.  Now it is winter - time to face the world above."
msgstr ""
"Al comienzo del Cataclismo, te has refugiado en un refugio antiaéreo con tu "
"colección de armas. Has pasado los últimos meses comiendo comida enlatada y "
"practicando tu puntería. Ahora es invierno: es hora de enfrentarse al mundo "
"de arriba."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
