#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Churl"
msgstr "Grosero"

#. ~ Profession (male Churl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"What the deuyl?  Ye ne wist noo thing of this straunge plaas nor what wycked"
" enchauntment brought ye hidder.  Wyth this accoustrement ye must needs "
"underfongen to find newe lyflode in the most hidous Cataclysm man hath "
"witnessed sithen that deluge Noe rood out in his greet schippe."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué demonios? No sabías nada de este extraño lugar ni de lo que el malvado "
"embrujo te trajo a tu escondite. Con este hallazgo debes necesitar "
"financiación para encontrar una nueva vida en el Cataclismo más horroroso "
"que el hombre ha conocido desde el diluvio que Noé escapó en su gran nave."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Churl"
msgstr "Grosera"

#. ~ Profession (female Churl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"What the deuyl?  Ye ne wist noo thing of this straunge plaas nor what wycked"
" enchauntment brought ye hidder.  Wyth this accoustrement ye must needs "
"underfongen to find newe lyflode in the most hidous Cataclysm man hath "
"witnessed sithen that deluge Noe rood out in his greet schippe."
msgstr ""
"¿Qué demonios? No sabías nada de este extraño lugar ni de lo que el malvado "
"embrujo te trajo a tu escondite. Con este hallazgo debes necesitar "
"financiación para encontrar una nueva vida en el Cataclismo más horroroso "
"que el hombre ha conocido desde el diluvio que Noé escapó en su gran nave."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lab Technician"
msgstr "Técnico de Laboratorio"

#. ~ Profession (male Lab Technician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you undo the "
"very Cataclysm your colleagues helped create?"
msgstr ""
"Gracias a los años de estudio y al duro trabajo en el laboratorio, estás "
"familiarizado con los fundamentos de la investigación científica. Sólo queda"
" una pregunta: ¿puedes deshacer el mismo Cataclismo que tus colegas ayudaron"
" a crear?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lab Technician"
msgstr "Técnica de Laboratorio"

#. ~ Profession (female Lab Technician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you undo the "
"very Cataclysm your colleagues helped create?"
msgstr ""
"Gracias a los años de estudio y al duro trabajo en el laboratorio, estás "
"familiarizada con los fundamentos de la investigación científica. Sólo queda"
" una pregunta: ¿puedes deshacer el mismo cataclismo que tus colegas ayudaron"
" a crear?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Home Mechanic"
msgstr "Mecánico casero"

#. ~ Profession (male Home Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always loved cars, and there's nothing like getting under the hood "
"and fixing it yourself.  You've kept hold of some handy tools for the job, "
"and at least now you'll never want for parts."
msgstr ""
"Siempre te han gustado los coches, y no hay nada como meterse bajo el capó y"
" arreglarlo uno mismo. Te has hecho con algunas herramientas útiles para el "
"trabajo, y al menos ahora nunca te faltarán piezas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Home Mechanic"
msgstr "Mecánica casera"

#. ~ Profession (female Home Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always loved cars, and there's nothing like getting under the hood "
"and fixing it yourself.  You've kept hold of some handy tools for the job, "
"and at least now you'll never want for parts."
msgstr ""
"Siempre te han gustado los coches, y no hay nada como meterse bajo el capó y"
" arreglarlo uno mismo. Te has hecho con algunas herramientas útiles para el "
"trabajo, y al menos ahora nunca te faltarán piezas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Scoundrel"
msgstr "Canalla"

#. ~ Profession (male Scoundrel) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your flexible outlook on the law, the scuffles you've been in (and avoided) "
"at the bar, and your impressive ability to weasel your way out of the "
"consequences of your actions - all these skills have helped ensure your "
"survival.  How much longer will they hold out?"
msgstr ""
"Tienes una perspectiva flexible de las leyes. Los altercados de los que "
"participaste (y evitaste) en bares, y tu impresionante habilidad para eludir"
" las consecuencias de tus actos, te ayudaron a sobrevivir. ¿Cuánto tiempo te"
" harán resistir?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Scoundrel"
msgstr "Canalla"

#. ~ Profession (female Scoundrel) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your flexible outlook on the law, the scuffles you've been in (and avoided) "
"at the bar, and your impressive ability to weasel your way out of the "
"consequences of your actions - all these skills have helped ensure your "
"survival.  How much longer will they hold out?"
msgstr ""
"Tienes una perspectiva flexible de las leyes. Los altercados de los que "
"participaste (y evitaste) en bares, y tu impresionante habilidad para eludir"
" las consecuencias de tus actos, te ayudaron a sobrevivir. ¿Cuánto tiempo te"
" harán resistir?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Beekeeper"
msgstr "Apicultor"

#. ~ Profession (male Beekeeper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to be a professional apiarist, building and maintaining beehives.  "
"You had to abandon your precious bees when the Cataclysm struck, but at "
"least you managed to grab some utensils and honey."
msgstr ""
"Antes eras un apicultor profesional que construía y mantenía colmenas. "
"Tuviste que abandonar a tus preciadas abejas cuando se produjo el "
"Cataclismo, pero al menos conseguiste hacerte con algunos utensilios y miel."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Beekeeper"
msgstr "Apicultora"

#. ~ Profession (female Beekeeper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to be a professional apiarist, building and maintaining beehives.  "
"You had to abandon your precious bees when the Cataclysm struck, but at "
"least you managed to grab some utensils and honey."
msgstr ""
"Antes eras una apicultora profesional que construía y mantenía colmenas. "
"Tuviste que abandonar a tus preciadas abejas cuando se produjo el "
"Cataclismo, pero al menos conseguiste hacerte con algunos utensilios y miel."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Baseball Player"
msgstr "Jugador de Béisbol"

#. ~ Profession (male Baseball Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were playing at the local team.  With no one left to play baseball, you "
"can eventually use your best friend for another purpose.  Home run!"
msgstr ""
"Jugabas en el equipo local. Al no haber nadie que juegue al béisbol, al "
"final puedes utilizar a tu mejor amigo para otro propósito. ¡Home run!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Baseball Player"
msgstr "Jugadora de Béisbol"

#. ~ Profession (female Baseball Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were playing at the local team.  With no one left to play baseball, you "
"can eventually use your best friend for another purpose.  Home run!"
msgstr ""
"Jugabas en el equipo local. Al no haber nadie que juegue al béisbol, al "
"final puedes utilizar a tu mejor amigo para otro propósito. ¡Home run!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Basketball Player"
msgstr "Jugador de Baloncesto"

#. ~ Profession (male Basketball Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your first major game was abruptly cancelled when zombies stormed the court."
"  Quick feet and good reflexes meant you were among the lucky few to escape "
"the stadium alive."
msgstr ""
"Tu primer partido importante se canceló abruptamente cuando los zombis "
"irrumpieron en la cancha. La rapidez de pies y los buenos reflejos hicieron "
"que estuvieras entre los pocos afortunados que escaparon del estadio con "
"vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Basketball Player"
msgstr "Jugadora de Baloncesto"

#. ~ Profession (female Basketball Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your first major game was abruptly cancelled when zombies stormed the court."
"  Quick feet and good reflexes meant you were among the lucky few to escape "
"the stadium alive."
msgstr ""
"Tu primer partido importante se canceló abruptamente cuando los zombis "
"irrumpieron en la cancha. La rapidez de pies y los buenos reflejos hicieron "
"que estuvieras entre los pocos afortunados que escaparon del estadio con "
"vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "True Foodperson"
msgstr "Comidapersona Verdadero"

#. ~ Profession (male True Foodperson) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson.  Some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  The mask has become your face, you are real, and the "
"only thing standing between this world and oblivion is you."
msgstr ""
"Eres el verdadero Personacomida, algunos podrían pensar que Personacomida es"
" sólo una mascota, pero tú lo sabes mejor. La máscara se ha convertido en tu"
" cara, eres real, y lo único que se interpone entre este mundo y el olvido "
"eres tú."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "True Foodperson"
msgstr "Comidapersona Verdadero"

#. ~ Profession (female True Foodperson) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the true Foodperson.  Some might think Foodperson is just a mascot, "
"but you know better.  The mask has become your face, you are real, and the "
"only thing standing between this world and oblivion is you."
msgstr ""
"Eres el verdadero Personacomida, algunos podrían pensar que Personacomida es"
" sólo una mascota, pero tú lo sabes mejor. La máscara se ha convertido en tu"
" cara, eres real, y lo único que se interpone entre este mundo y el olvido "
"eres tú."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Professional Cyclist"
msgstr "Ciclista Profesional"

#. ~ Profession (male Professional Cyclist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a promising young cyclist with a bright career in front of you "
"before this all happened.  Perhaps you'll never get to participate in the "
"grand tours now, but as the saying goes, life is like riding a bicycle: "
"you've got to keep moving."
msgstr ""
"Eras un joven ciclista que prometía tener una carrera brillante por delante "
"antes de que esto pasara. Tal vez ya no vas a poder participar en un gran "
"tour, pero como dice el dicho: La vida es como andar en bicicleta, tienes "
"que seguir moviéndote."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Professional Cyclist"
msgstr "Ciclista Profesional"

#. ~ Profession (female Professional Cyclist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a promising young cyclist with a bright career in front of you "
"before this all happened.  Perhaps you'll never get to participate in the "
"grand tours now, but as the saying goes, life is like riding a bicycle: "
"you've got to keep moving."
msgstr ""
"Eras una joven ciclista que prometía tener una carrera brillante por delante"
" antes de que esto pasara. Tal vez ya no vas a poder participar en un gran "
"tour, pero como dice el dicho: La vida es como andar en bicicleta, tienes "
"que seguir moviéndote."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "General de División"

#. ~ Profession (male Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you barely escaped your aides."
msgstr ""
"Te abriste camino a través de los rangos, desde un soldado raso sin nombre, "
"hasta un importante General de División. Ahora, sin embargo, hace años que "
"no disparas un arma con rabia, y casi no te escapas de tus ayudantes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Major General"
msgstr "General de División"

#. ~ Profession (female Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you barely escaped your aides."
msgstr ""
"Te abriste camino a través de los rangos, desde una soldada rasa sin nombre,"
" hasta una importante General de División. Ahora, sin embargo, hace años que"
" no disparas un arma con rabia, y casi no te escapas de tus ayudantes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta Militar"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente entrastes, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por una "
"especie de emergencia nacional. Por lo que puedes ver, el mando militar te "
"abandonó en este agujero infernal cuando te perdiste la evacuación de "
"emergencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Recruit"
msgstr "Recluta Militar"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  As far as you can tell, military command abandoned you in this "
"hellhole when you missed the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente entrastes, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por una "
"especie de emergencia nacional. Por lo que puedes ver, el mando militar te "
"abandonó en este agujero infernal cuando te perdiste la evacuación de "
"emergencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Combat Mechanic"
msgstr "Mecánico de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (male Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and the dead men "
"are marching again…"
msgstr ""
"No superaste el bachillerato y te alistaste en el ejército. Pronto te "
"eligieron para un entrenamiento extra en el oficio de mecánica, manteniendo "
"el armamento en funcionamiento. Han pasado años desde que tocaste un rifle "
"por última vez, y los hombres muertos están marchando de nuevo..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Combat Mechanic"
msgstr "Mecánica de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (female Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and the dead men "
"are marching again…"
msgstr ""
"No superaste el bachillerato y te alistaste en el ejército. Pronto te "
"eligieron para un entrenamiento extra en el oficio de mecánica, manteniendo "
"el armamento en funcionamiento. Han pasado años desde que tocaste un rifle "
"por última vez, y los hombres muertos están marchando de nuevo..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Combat Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniero de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (male Combat Engineer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your job was simple.  Keep the army moving.  You built bridges, you built "
"roads, you destroyed fortifications, and you cleared mines.  It has been "
"years since you last handled a rifle in basic training, now might be the "
"time to dust off those skills."
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo era simple. Mantener al ejército en movimiento. Construistes "
"puentes, carreteras, destruistes fortificaciones y limpiastes minas. Han "
"pasado años desde la última vez que manejaste un rifle en el entrenamiento "
"básico, ahora podría ser el momento de desempolvar esas habilidades."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Combat Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniera de Combate"

#. ~ Profession (female Combat Engineer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your job was simple.  Keep the army moving.  You built bridges, you built "
"roads, you destroyed fortifications, and you cleared mines.  It has been "
"years since you last handled a rifle in basic training, now might be the "
"time to dust off those skills."
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo era simple. Mantener al ejército en movimiento. Construistes "
"puentes, carreteras, destruistes fortificaciones y limpiastes minas. Han "
"pasado años desde la última vez que manejaste un rifle en el entrenamiento "
"básico, ahora podría ser el momento de desempolvar esas habilidades."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Non Comissioned Officer"
msgstr "Oficial No Comisionado"

#. ~ Profession (male Non Comissioned Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"your squad are shambling and want to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Eres un veterano de varias misiones de pacificación. Diriges tu escuadrón "
"como una especie de figura paterna, ofreciendo consejos útiles sobre cómo no"
" morir. Ahora tu escuadrón se tambalea y quiere comerte tu cerebro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Non Comissioned Officer"
msgstr "Oficial No Comisionada"

#. ~ Profession (female Non Comissioned Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a veteran of several peace keeping missions.  You lead your squad as "
"a sort of parental figure, offering helpful advice on how not to die.  Now "
"your squad are shambling and want to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Eres una veterana de varias misiones de pacificación. Diriges tu escuadrón "
"como una especie de figura materna, ofreciendo consejos útiles sobre cómo no"
" morir. Ahora tu escuadrón se tambalea y quiere comerte tu cerebro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "Fusilero"

#. ~ Profession (male Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought that it would happen like this."
msgstr ""
"Cuando eras joven, soñabas con ser un soldado. La guerra es el infierno y el"
" infierno es la guerra, pero nunca pensaste que ocurriría así."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rifleman"
msgstr "Fusilero"

#. ~ Profession (female Rifleman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When you were young, you dreamed of being a soldier.  War is hell and hell "
"is war, but you never thought that it would happen like this."
msgstr ""
"Cuando eras joven, soñabas con ser una soldada. La guerra es el infierno y "
"el infierno es la guerra, pero nunca pensaste que ocurriría así."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "Operador Especial"

#. ~ Profession (male Special Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you"
" can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed "
"the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Eras lo mejor de lo mejor, lo más selecto del ejército. Por eso sigues vivo,"
" incluso después de que todos tus compañeros cayeran ante los muertos "
"vivientes. Por lo que sabes, el mando militar te abandonó en este infierno "
"cuando te perdiste la evacuación de emergencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Special Operator"
msgstr "Operadora Especial"

#. ~ Profession (female Special Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the best of the best, the military's finest.  That's why you're "
"still alive, even after all your comrades fell to the undead.  As far as you"
" can tell, military command abandoned you in this hellhole when you missed "
"the emergency evac."
msgstr ""
"Eras la mejor de lo mejor, lo más selecto del ejército. Por eso sigues vivo,"
" incluso después de que todos tus compañeros cayeran ante los muertos "
"vivientes. Por lo que sabes, el mando militar te abandonó en este infierno "
"cuando te perdiste la evacuación de emergencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Butler"
msgstr "Mayordomo"

#. ~ Profession (Butler) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hired to take care of the housekeeping for a wealthy family.  "
"Naturally, when things got bad, they all took off on a family vacation to "
"somewhere unknown, leaving you to your fate."
msgstr ""
"Te contrataron para encargarte de las tareas domésticas de una familia "
"adinerada. Naturalmente, cuando las cosas se pusieron feas, todos se fueron "
"de vacaciones familiares a algún lugar desconocido, dejándote a tu destino."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Maid"
msgstr "Sirvienta"

#. ~ Profession (Maid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hired to take care of the housekeeping for a wealthy family.  "
"Naturally, when things got bad, they all took off on a family vacation to "
"somewhere unknown, leaving you to your fate."
msgstr ""
"Te contrataron para encargarte de las tareas domésticas de una familia "
"adinerada. Naturalmente, cuando las cosas se pusieron feas, todos se fueron "
"de vacaciones familiares a algún lugar desconocido, dejándote a tu destino."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Captive"
msgstr "Cautivo"

#. ~ Profession (Captive) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were following a road at night, trying to get away from the horrors of "
"the city, when you heard a voice calling out in the dark.  You followed, "
"hoping they were friendly, but suddenly felt a searing pain in your head and"
" blacked out.  You just woke up in this strange place… are you even on Earth"
" anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Estabas siguiendo un camino de noche, intentando alejarte de los horrores de"
" la ciudad, cuando oíste una voz que te llamaba en la oscuridad. La "
"seguiste, esperando que fueran amistosas, pero de repente sentiste un dolor "
"punzante en la cabeza y te desmayaste. Acabas de despertar en un lugar "
"extraño... ¿estás en la Tierra todavía?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Captive"
msgstr "Cautivo"

#. ~ Profession (Captive) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were following a road at night, trying to get away from the horrors of "
"the city, when you heard a voice calling out in the dark.  You followed, "
"hoping they were friendly, but suddenly felt a searing pain in your head and"
" blacked out.  You just woke up in this strange place… are you even on Earth"
" anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Estabas siguiendo un camino de noche, intentando alejarte de los horrores de"
" la ciudad, cuando oíste una voz que te llamaba en la oscuridad. La "
"seguiste, esperando que fueran amistosas, pero de repente sentiste un dolor "
"punzante en la cabeza y te desmayaste. Acabas de despertar en un lugar "
"extraño... ¿estás en la Tierra todavía?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Salvador"

#. ~ Profession (Rescuer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"Now the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't "
"feel quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Estabas preparado. Entrastes decidido a encontrar y rescatar a tus amigos. "
"Ahora la atmósfera en estos pasillos retorcidos se vuelve pesada, y ya no te"
" sientes tan seguro. Puede que pronto seas tú quien necesite un rescate "
"pronto."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rescuer"
msgstr "Salvadora"

#. ~ Profession (Rescuer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were ready.  You went in determined to find and rescue your friends.  "
"Now the atmosphere in these twisting corridors grows heavy, and you don't "
"feel quite so confident anymore.  You might be the one in need of a rescue "
"soon."
msgstr ""
"Estabas preparado. Entrastes decidido a encontrar y rescatar a tus amigos. "
"Ahora la atmósfera en estos pasillos retorcidos se vuelve pesada, y ya no te"
" sientes tan seguro. Puede que pronto seas tú quien necesite un rescate "
"pronto."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Medical Resident"
msgstr "Médico Residente"

#. ~ Profession (male Medical Resident) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of med school, you've got little in the way of practical "
"experience and just a handful of first-aid supplies.  You just hope it will "
"be enough if 'physician, heal thyself' turns out to be more literal than you"
" expected."
msgstr ""
"Recién salido de la facultad de medicina, tienes poca experiencia práctica y"
" sólo un puñado de material de primeros auxilios. Sólo esperas que sea "
"suficiente si el \"médico, cúrate a ti mismo\" resulta ser más literal de lo"
" que esperabas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Medical Resident"
msgstr "Médica Residente"

#. ~ Profession (female Medical Resident) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Fresh out of med school, you've got little in the way of practical "
"experience and just a handful of first-aid supplies.  You just hope it will "
"be enough if 'physician, heal thyself' turns out to be more literal than you"
" expected."
msgstr ""
"Recién salida de la facultad de medicina, tienes poca experiencia práctica y"
" sólo un puñado de material de primeros auxilios. Sólo esperas que sea "
"suficiente si el \"médico, cúrate a ti mismo\" resulta ser más literal de lo"
" que esperabas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Gangster"
msgstr "Mafioso"

#. ~ Profession (male Gangster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs."
"  Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place "
"for someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"El jefe siempre decía que podía confiar en ti para los trabajos difíciles. "
"Es una pena que no lo haya logrado. No hay problema; el mundo siempre tiene "
"un lugar para alguien con tus talentos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Gangster"
msgstr "Mafiosa"

#. ~ Profession (female Gangster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The boss always said he could rely on you to pull through on the tough jobs."
"  Shame he got himself smoked.  No problem; the world's always got a place "
"for someone with your kind of talents."
msgstr ""
"El jefe siempre decía que podía confiar en ti para los trabajos difíciles. "
"Es una pena que no lo haya logrado. No hay problema; el mundo siempre tiene "
"un lugar para alguien con tus talentos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Security Guard"
msgstr "Guardia de Seguridad"

#. ~ Profession (male Security Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had a boring, underpaid job watching cameras and patrolling hallways, "
"but things have suddenly gotten a lot more dangerous.  You have some useful "
"equipment, but you've never had any call to use it until now."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un trabajo aburrido y mal pagado vigilando cámaras y patrullando "
"pasillos, pero de repente las cosas se han vuelto mucho más peligrosas. "
"Tienes un equipo muy útil, pero nunca te han llamado para usarlo hasta "
"ahora."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Security Guard"
msgstr "Guardia de Seguridad"

#. ~ Profession (female Security Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had a boring, underpaid job watching cameras and patrolling hallways, "
"but things have suddenly gotten a lot more dangerous.  You have some useful "
"equipment, but you've never had any call to use it until now."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un trabajo aburrido y mal pagado vigilando cámaras y patrullando "
"pasillos, pero de repente las cosas se han vuelto mucho más peligrosas. "
"Tienes un equipo muy útil, pero nunca te han llamado para usarlo hasta "
"ahora."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Landscaper"
msgstr "Jardinero"

#. ~ Profession (male Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the zombies came, but now you've got nothing left"
" except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Solías cortar el césped y los setos de los ricos. El trabajo por contrato "
"escaseaba incluso antes de que llegaran los zombis, pero ahora no te queda "
"nada más que tus herramientas y  tu experiencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Landscaper"
msgstr "Jardinera"

#. ~ Profession (female Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
