msgstr ""
"Solías cortar el césped y los setos de los ricos. El trabajo por contrato "
"escaseaba incluso antes de que llegaran los zombis, pero ahora no te queda "
"nada más que tus herramientas y tu experiencia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Nursing Assistant"
msgstr "Auxiliar de enfermería"

#. ~ Profession (male Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among the walking dead…"
msgstr ""
"Seguiste proporcionando cuidados a domicilio a los ancianos incluso cuando "
"el mundo entero se desmoronaba a tu alrededor. Sólo puedes rezar para no ver"
" a tus antiguos clientes entre los muertos vivientes..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Nursing Assistant"
msgstr "Auxiliar de enfermería"

#. ~ Profession (female Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among the walking dead…"
msgstr ""
"Seguiste proporcionando cuidados a domicilio a los ancianos incluso cuando "
"el mundo entero se desmoronaba a tu alrededor. Sólo puedes rezar para no ver"
" a tus antiguos clientes entre los muertos vivientes..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Survivalist"
msgstr "Supervivencialista"

#. ~ Profession (male Survivalist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Living off the land, far from civilization, is nothing new to you.  The only"
" difference is all the monsters that suddenly want you dead.  Your equipment"
" is basic, but versatile… except that your canteen's run out!"
msgstr ""
"Vivir de la tierra, lejos de la civilización, no es nada nuevo para ti. La "
"única diferencia son los monstruos que de repente te quieren matar. Tu "
"equipo es básico, pero versátil... ¡excepto que tu cantimplora se ha "
"agotado!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Survivalist"
msgstr "Supervivencialista"

#. ~ Profession (female Survivalist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Living off the land, far from civilization, is nothing new to you.  The only"
" difference is all the monsters that suddenly want you dead.  Your equipment"
" is basic, but versatile… except that your canteen's run out!"
msgstr ""
"Vivir de la tierra, lejos de la civilización, no es nada nuevo para ti. La "
"única diferencia son los monstruos que de repente te quieren matar. Tu "
"equipo es básico, pero versátil... ¡excepto que tu cantimplora se ha "
"agotado!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Chain Smoker"
msgstr "Fumador Compulsivo"

#. ~ Profession (male Chain Smoker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your coworkers always muttered when you had to duck outside every hour for a"
" smoke, but it ended up saving your life when things got bad.  Now you're "
"down to your last pack.  You start out with a strong nicotine addiction."
msgstr ""
"Tus compañeros de trabajo siempre murmuraban cuando tenías que escabullirte "
"fuera cada hora para fumar, pero acabó salvándote la vida cuando las cosas "
"se pusieron feas. Ahora te queda el último paquete. Empiezas con una fuerte "
"adicción a la nicotina."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Chain Smoker"
msgstr "Fumadora Compulsiva"

#. ~ Profession (female Chain Smoker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your coworkers always muttered when you had to duck outside every hour for a"
" smoke, but it ended up saving your life when things got bad.  Now you're "
"down to your last pack.  You start out with a strong nicotine addiction."
msgstr ""
"Tus compañeros de trabajo siempre murmuraban cuando tenías que escabullirte "
"fuera cada hora para fumar, pero acabó salvándote la vida cuando las cosas "
"se pusieron feas. Ahora te queda el último paquete. Empiezas con una fuerte "
"adicción a la nicotina."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Crackhead"
msgstr "Adicto al Crack"

#. ~ Profession (male Crackhead) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Cocaine.  It is, indeed, a helluva drug.  You blew your money on some dust, "
"and before you knew it you were turning tricks behind the local CVS just to "
"score one more line.  Where are you going to get your next fix now?"
msgstr ""
"La cocaína. Es, en efecto, una droga infernal. Te has gastado el dinero en "
"un poco de polvo y, antes de darte cuenta, estabas haciendo trucos detrás "
"del CVS local sólo para conseguir una línea más. ¿Dónde vas a conseguir "
"ahora tu próxima dosis?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Crackhead"
msgstr "Adicta al Crack"

#. ~ Profession (female Crackhead) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Cocaine.  It is, indeed, a helluva drug.  You blew your money on some dust, "
"and before you knew it you were turning tricks behind the local CVS just to "
