" suelo y todo se ha ido completamente a la mierda. Lo único que pasa por tu "
"cabeza, sin embargo, es dónde vas a encontrar tu próximo subidón."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Pillhead"
msgstr "Pastillero"

#. ~ Profession (male Pillhead) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers turned undead, "
"satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
"Tras un accidente en tu juventud, te hiciste adicto a los opiáceos que "
"trataban tu dolor. Con las farmacias cerradas y tus traficantes convertidos "
"en muertos vivientes, satisfacer esos antojos se hizo mucho más difícil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Pillhead"
msgstr "Pastillera"

#. ~ Profession (female Pillhead) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
