"en muertos vivientes, satisfacer esos antojos se hizo mucho más difícil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Helicopter Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto de Helicóptero"

#. ~ Profession (male Helicopter Pilot) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You got your pilot's license, and earned a living ferrying businessmen and "
"tourists around.  The Cataclysm has grounded you for now, but the sky still "
"calls to you…"
msgstr ""
"Te has sacado la licencia de piloto y te has ganado la vida transportando a "
"empresarios y turistas. El Cataclismo te ha dejado en tierra por ahora, pero"
" el cielo te sigue llamando..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Helicopter Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto de Helicóptero"

#. ~ Profession (female Helicopter Pilot) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You got your pilot's license, and earned a living ferrying businessmen and "
"tourists around.  The Cataclysm has grounded you for now, but the sky still "
"calls to you…"
msgstr ""
