" el cielo te sigue llamando..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "K9 Officer"
msgstr "Oficial del K9"

#. ~ Profession (male K9 Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent your career busting drug smugglers with your faithful canine "
"companion.  Now the world has ended, and none of that matters anymore.  Your"
" loyal dog is still at your side, though, ready to face the Cataclysm with "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado tu carrera persiguiendo a los traficantes de drogas con tu fiel "
"compañero canino. Ahora el mundo se ha acabado, y nada de eso importa ya. "
"Sin embargo, tu fiel perro sigue a tu lado, dispuesto a enfrentarse al "
"Cataclismo contigo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "K9 Officer"
msgstr "Oficial del K9"

#. ~ Profession (female K9 Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent your career busting drug smugglers with your faithful canine "
"companion.  Now the world has ended, and none of that matters anymore.  Your"
" loyal dog is still at your side, though, ready to face the Cataclysm with "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado tu carrera persiguiendo a los traficantes de drogas con tu fiel "
"compañero canino. Ahora el mundo se ha acabado, y nada de eso importa ya. "
"Sin embargo, tu fiel perro sigue a tu lado, dispuesto a enfrentarse al "
"Cataclismo contigo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Crazy Cat Dude"
msgstr "Loco de los gatos"

#. ~ Profession (Crazy Cat Dude) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Everyone is dead?  Oh well, it doesn't matter; it's not like you got along "
"with people much anyway.  Your beloved cats are all the friends you need!"
msgstr ""
"¿Todo el mundo está muerto? Oh, bueno, no importa; no es que te lleves muy "
"bien con la gente de todos modos. Tus queridos gatos son todos los amigos "
"que necesitas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Crazy Cat Lady"
msgstr "Loca de los gatos"

#. ~ Profession (Crazy Cat Lady) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Everyone is dead?  Oh well, it doesn't matter; it's not like you got along "
"with people much anyway.  Your beloved cats are all the friends you need!"
msgstr ""
"¿Todo el mundo está muerto? Oh, bueno, no importa; no es que te lleves muy "
"bien con la gente de todos modos. Tus queridos gatos son todos los amigos "
"que necesitas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Police Officer"
msgstr "Agente de Policía"

#. ~ Profession (male Police Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to come to the "
"rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape "
"with your life.  Who's going to respect your authority when the government "
"this badge represents might not even exist anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Un simple ayudante del sheriff de un pequeño pueblo, recibistes la llamada y"
" estabas listo para acudir al rescate. Pronto fuiste tú quien necesitó ser "
"rescatado, y tuviste suerte de escapar con vida. ¿Quién va a respetar tu "
"autoridad cuando el gobierno al que representa esta placa puede que ya no "
"exista?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Police Officer"
msgstr "Agente de Policía"

#. ~ Profession (female Police Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Just a small-town deputy, you got the call and were ready to come to the "
"rescue.  Soon it was you who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape "
"with your life.  Who's going to respect your authority when the government "
"this badge represents might not even exist anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Una simple ayudante del sheriff de un pequeño pueblo, recibistes la llamada "
"y estabas listo para acudir al rescate. Pronto fuiste tú quien necesitó ser "
"rescatado, y tuviste suerte de escapar con vida. ¿Quién va a respetar tu "
"autoridad cuando el gobierno al que representa esta placa puede que ya no "
"exista?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Police Detective"
msgstr "Detective de Policía"

#. ~ Profession (male Police Detective) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were on the brink of a major breakthrough in your latest homicide case "
"when the Cataclysm struck.  Now your prime suspect is dead.  Everyone's "
"dead.  You could really use a smoke."
msgstr ""
"Estabas a punto de lograr un gran avance en tu último caso de homicidio "
"cuando se produjo el Cataclismo. Ahora tu principal sospechoso está muerto. "
"Todos están muertos. Te vendría bien un cigarro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
