#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Day Driver"
msgstr "Conductor Diurno"

#. ~ Profession (male Day Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving and making a living with it.  On your way to pick up "
"someone with your car, you start to notice all the chaos happening around "
"you.  Not wanting to be a part of it, you took a long detour to safety, only"
" to find yourself in a different place.  All that's left is your car."
msgstr ""
"Te encanta conducir y ganarte la vida con ello. De camino a recoger a "
"alguien con tu coche, empezaste a notar todo el caos que ocurría a tu "
"alrededor. Al no querer formar parte de él, distes un gran rodeo para "
"ponerte a salvo, sólo para encontrarte en un lugar diferente. Todo lo que "
"queda es tu coche."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Day Driver"
msgstr "Conductora Diurna"

#. ~ Profession (female Day Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving and making a living with it.  On your way to pick up "
"someone with your car, you start to notice all the chaos happening around "
"you.  Not wanting to be a part of it, you took a long detour to safety, only"
