#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombero TEM"

#. ~ Profession (male EMT Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You love driving as much as you love extinguishing fire and helping the "
"wounded, where every second counts.  On your way to respond to an emergency "
"call with your firetruck, you encounter chaos in the city, recklessness and "
"violence are plentiful.  Not wanting to use of the streets covered in "
"burning trash and debris, you took a long detour to your fire station, only "
"to find yourself unsure of the route back.  Looks like the only emergency "
"you will respond to will be your own."
msgstr ""
"Te encanta conducir tanto como apagar el fuego y ayudar a los heridos, donde"
" cada segundo cuenta. De camino a responder a una llamada de emergencia con "
"tu camión de bomberos, te encuentras con el caos en la ciudad, imprudencia y"
" violencia en abundancia. Como no quieres utilizar las calles cubiertas de "
"basura y escombros en llamas, das un largo rodeo hasta tu parque de "
"bomberos, sólo para encontrarte con la incertidumbre de que ruta tomar de "
"vuelta. Parece que la única emergencia a la que responderás será la tuya "
"propia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "EMT Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombera TEM"

#. ~ Profession (female EMT Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You love driving as much as you love extinguishing fire and helping the "
"wounded, where every second counts.  On your way to respond to an emergency "
"call with your firetruck, you encounter chaos in the city, recklessness and "
"violence are plentiful.  Not wanting to use of the streets covered in "
"burning trash and debris, you took a long detour to your fire station, only "
"to find yourself unsure of the route back.  Looks like the only emergency "
"you will respond to will be your own."
msgstr ""
