"wifi, finalmente pudiste empezar a regresar a tu compañía, y en el camino de"
" vuelta notaste el caos a tu alrededor. Como no querías cruzarte con los "
"manifestantes de aspecto furioso, fuiste por un camino viejo y olvidado solo"
" para quedarte sin combustible en un lugar verdaderamente desierto. ¿No "
"podría haberte pasado esto antes de haber acabado tu horario laboral?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "Conductor de Autobus"

#. ~ Profession (male Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are making a living with delivering noisy brats to their schools, where "
"you wish with every delivery, that they don't break a seat or window for "
"you.  On your way to pick up the first row of brats, you start to notice all"
" the chaos happening around you.  By the time you arrive at the station, all"
" the brats look like zombies, so you took a long detour to safety, only to "
"find yourself in a different place.  At last you have been freed of the "
"hellish noises they release, but new ones are on the merge."
msgstr ""
"Te ganas la vida con la entrega de niñatos ruidosos a sus escuelas, donde "
"deseas con cada reparto, que no te rompan un asiento o una ventana. De "
"camino a recoger la primera fila de malcriados, empiezas a notar todo el "
"caos que ocurre a tu alrededor. Cuando llegas a la estación, todos los "
"mocosos parecen zombis, así que das un largo rodeo para ponerte a salvo, "
"sólo para encontrarte en un lugar diferente. Por fin te has librado de los "
"ruidos diabólicos que sueltan, pero hay otros nuevos que se están juntando."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bus Driver"
msgstr "Conductora de Autobus"

#. ~ Profession (female Bus Driver) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are making a living with delivering noisy brats to their schools, where "
"you wish with every delivery, that they don't break a seat or window for "
"you.  On your way to pick up the first row of brats, you start to notice all"
