#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Police Interceptor"
msgstr "Interceptor de la Policia"

#. ~ Profession (male Police Interceptor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As on-duty officer, you received the call and got ready to respond to the "
"robbery with your patrol car.  After arriving at the scene, it was soon you "
"who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape with your life and car.  "
"No one responds on the radio anymore either.  Who's going to respect your "
"authority when the government this badge represents might not even exist "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Como oficial fuera de servicio, recibiste una llamada y te preparaste para "
"acudir al robo con tu coche patrulla. Trás llegar a la escena, fuiste tu "
"quien necesitaste ayuda y tuviste suerte de escapar con vida y con tu coche."
" Ya nadie responde en la radio. ¿Quién respetará tu autoridad ahora que el "
"gobierno al que representa esta placa ya no existe?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Police Interceptor"
msgstr "Interceptora de la Policia"

#. ~ Profession (female Police Interceptor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As on-duty officer, you received the call and got ready to respond to the "
"robbery with your patrol car.  After arriving at the scene, it was soon you "
"who needed rescuing, and you were lucky to escape with your life and car.  "
"No one responds on the radio anymore either.  Who's going to respect your "
"authority when the government this badge represents might not even exist "
"anymore?"
msgstr ""
"Como oficial fuera de servicio, recibiste una llamada y te preparaste para "
"acudir al robo con tu coche patrulla. Trás llegar a la escena, fuiste tu "
