" Ya nadie responde en la radio. ¿Quién respetará tu autoridad ahora que el "
"gobierno al que representa esta placa ya no existe?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Militia"
msgstr "Miliciano"

#. ~ Profession (male Militia) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You’ve long since prepared yourself for this outcome.  You, alongside a band"
" of compatriots, started a hideout in the woods from which to launch looting"
" raids on a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went poorly, leaving you last "
"alive amongst your former comrades.  Every breath you take now is an act of "
"rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo que te has preparado para este desenlace. Junto con una banda de"
" compatriotas, has creado un escondite en el bosque desde el que lanzar "
"incursiones de saqueo en una camioneta improvisada. La última incursión "
"salió mal, dejándote el último vivo entre tus antiguos camaradas. Cada "
"respiración que haces ahora es un acto de rebelión contra la crueldad de "
"este mundo condenado. No dejes que esa llama de esperanza perezca en tu "
"interior."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Militia"
msgstr "Miliciana"

#. ~ Profession (female Militia) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You’ve long since prepared yourself for this outcome.  You, alongside a band"
" of compatriots, started a hideout in the woods from which to launch looting"
" raids on a jury-rigged pickup.  The last run went poorly, leaving you last "
"alive amongst your former comrades.  Every breath you take now is an act of "
"rebellion against the cruelty of this doomed world.  Do not let that flame "
"of hope perish inside you."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo que te has preparado para este desenlace. Junto con una banda de"
" compatriotas, has creado un escondite en el bosque desde el que lanzar "
"incursiones de saqueo en una camioneta improvisada. La última incursión "
"salió mal, dejándote la última viva entre tus antiguos camaradas. Cada "
"respiración que haces ahora es un acto de rebelión contra la crueldad de "
"este mundo condenado. No dejes que esa llama de esperanza perezca en tu "
"interior."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Park Ranger"
msgstr "Guardabosques"

#. ~ Profession (male Park Ranger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a park ranger, most things you usually do is maintain the park, teach "
"people how to not start a fire in the forest, patrol, and check out stuff on"
" your daily to-do list.  After arriving at a deserted camp with notes left "
"from survivors, you took upon heeding their warning, and packed at your "
"station with some supplies alongside your pickup, just before the station "
"was overrun as well."
msgstr ""
"Como guardabosques, la mayoría de las cosas que normalmente haces es "
"mantener el parque, enseñar a la gente cómo no provocar un incendio en el "
"bosque, patrullar y comprobar las cosas de tu lista de tareas diarias. "
"Después de llegar a un campamento abandonado con notas dejadas por los "
"supervivientes, hiciste caso a su advertencia, y llenaste tu puesto con "
"algunas provisiones junto a tu camioneta, justo antes de que el puesto fuera"
" invadido."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Park Ranger"
msgstr "Guardabosques"

#. ~ Profession (female Park Ranger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a park ranger, most things you usually do is maintain the park, teach "
"people how to not start a fire in the forest, patrol, and check out stuff on"
" your daily to-do list.  After arriving at a deserted camp with notes left "
"from survivors, you took upon heeding their warning, and packed at your "
"station with some supplies alongside your pickup, just before the station "
"was overrun as well."
msgstr ""
