"mantener el parque, enseñar a la gente cómo no provocar un incendio en el "
"bosque, patrullar y comprobar las cosas de tu lista de tareas diarias. "
"Después de llegar a un campamento abandonado con notas dejadas por los "
"supervivientes, hiciste caso a su advertencia, y llenaste tu puesto con "
"algunas provisiones junto a tu camioneta, justo antes de que el puesto fuera"
" invadido."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "Leñador"

#. ~ Profession (male Lumberjack) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"Eres leñador y estás bien. Talabas árboles antes de que el mundo se "
"terminara, y sospechas que los muertos vivientes no serán tan resistentes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lumberjack"
msgstr "Leñadora"

#. ~ Profession (female Lumberjack) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect the undead aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"Eres leñadora y estás bien. Talabas árboles antes de que el mundo se "
"terminara, y sospechas que los muertos vivientes no serán tan resistentes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Backpacker"
msgstr "Mochilero"

#. ~ Profession (male Backpacker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and "
"living off your parents' trust fund.  You came home to find the world in "
"ruins, and the only thing between you and death is the open road and your "
"backpack."
msgstr ""
"Durante los últimos años has estado viajando por el mundo, haciendo turismo "
"y viviendo del fondo fiduciario de tus padres. Al volver a casa, el mundo "
"está en ruinas y lo único que te separa de la muerte es la carretera y tu "
"mochila."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Backpacker"
msgstr "Mochilera"

#. ~ Profession (female Backpacker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For the past few years you've been traveling the world, sightseeing and "
"living off your parents' trust fund.  You came home to find the world in "
"ruins, and the only thing between you and death is the open road and your "
"backpack."
msgstr ""
"Durante los últimos años has estado viajando por el mundo, haciendo turismo "
"y viviendo del fondo fiduciario de tus padres. Al volver a casa, el mundo "
"está en ruinas y lo único que te separa de la muerte es la carretera y tu "
"mochila."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Fast Food Cook"
msgstr "Cocinero Com. Rápida"

#. ~ Profession (male Fast Food Cook) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The diners at the fancy burger joint where you work seem even more irritable"
" and unreasonable than usual today.  Time to show the meaning of fast food… "
"by running for your life!"
msgstr ""
"Los comensales de la elegante hamburguesería en la que trabajas parecen hoy "
"aún más irritables y poco razonables que de costumbre. Es hora de demostrar "
"el significado de la comida rápida... ¡corriendo por tu vida!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Fast Food Cook"
msgstr "Cocinera Com. Rápida"

#. ~ Profession (female Fast Food Cook) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
