"aún más irritables y poco razonables que de costumbre. Es hora de demostrar "
"el significado de la comida rápida... ¡corriendo por tu vida!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Electrician"
msgstr "Electricista"

#. ~ Profession (male Electrician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Small businesses often hired you for electrical work.  You were halfway "
"through your latest job when the whole power grid went dead."
msgstr ""
"Las pequeñas empresas te contrataban a menudo para trabajos de electricidad."
" Estabas a medio camino de tu último trabajo cuando toda la red eléctrica se"
" quedó sin suministro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Electrician"
msgstr "Electricista"

#. ~ Profession (female Electrician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Small businesses often hired you for electrical work.  You were halfway "
