#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Shower Victim"
msgstr "Víctima en la Ducha"

#. ~ Profession (male Shower Victim) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You just stepped out of a nice, hot shower to find the world had ended.  "
"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr ""
"Acabas de salir de una buena ducha caliente y te encuentras con que el mundo"
" se ha acabado. Tienes un poco de jabón, junto con la cosa más masivamente "
"útil de la historia... una toalla."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Shower Victim"
msgstr "Víctima en la Ducha"

#. ~ Profession (female Shower Victim) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You just stepped out of a nice, hot shower to find the world had ended.  "
"You've got some soap, along with the most massively useful thing ever… a "
"towel."
msgstr ""
"Acabas de salir de una buena ducha caliente y te encuentras con que el mundo"
" se ha acabado. Tienes un poco de jabón, junto con la cosa más masivamente "
"útil de la historia... una toalla."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Biker"
msgstr "Motero"

#. ~ Profession (male Biker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life on a Harley, out on the open road with your "
"club.  Now they're all dead.  Time to ride or die."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado la mayor parte de tu vida en una Harley, en la carretera con tu "
"club. Ahora están todos muertos. Es hora de montar o morir."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Biker"
msgstr "Motera"

#. ~ Profession (female Biker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life on a Harley, out on the open road with your "
"club.  Now they're all dead.  Time to ride or die."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado la mayor parte de tu vida en una Harley, en la carretera con tu "
"club. Ahora están todos muertos. Es hora de montar o morir."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ballroom Dancer"
msgstr "Bailarín de Salón"

#. ~ Profession (male Ballroom Dancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Zombies "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se han puesto un poco raras de camino a tu clase de baile semanal."
" Parece que los zombis no saben bailar, pero no vas a dejar que te pisen tus"
" dedos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Ballroom Dancer"
msgstr "Bailarina de Salón"

#. ~ Profession (female Ballroom Dancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Zombies "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se han puesto un poco raras de camino a tu clase de baile semanal."
" Parece que los zombis no saben bailar, pero no vas a dejar que te pisen tus"
" dedos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Patient"
msgstr "Paciente"

#. ~ Profession (male Patient) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el diagnóstico fue positivo, hicistes una promesa: luchar por tu vida"
" y no ceder nunca a la desesperación. Ahora es el momento de renovar ese "
"voto."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Patient"
msgstr "Paciente"

#. ~ Profession (female Patient) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you made a vow: to fight for your "
"life, and to never give in to despair.  Now is the time to renew that vow."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el diagnóstico fue positivo, hicistes una promesa: luchar por tu vida"
" y no ceder nunca a la desesperación. Ahora es el momento de renovar ese "
"voto."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Unwilling Mutant"
msgstr "Mutante Involuntario"

#. ~ Profession (male Unwilling Mutant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a human guinea pig, used by laboratory technicians to understand "
"the immense power of mutation.  You are determined to live on, if only to "
"spite them for what they did to you."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste un conejillo de indias humano, utilizado por los técnicos de "
"laboratorio para comprender el inmenso poder de la mutación. Estás decidido "
"a seguir viviendo, aunque solo sea para fastidiarles por lo que te hicieron."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Unwilling Mutant"
msgstr "Mutante Involuntaria"

#. ~ Profession (female Unwilling Mutant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a human guinea pig, used by laboratory technicians to understand "
"the immense power of mutation.  You are determined to live on, if only to "
"spite them for what they did to you."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste una conejilla de indias humana, utilizada por los técnicos de "
"laboratorio para comprender el inmenso poder de la mutación. Estás decidida "
"a seguir viviendo, aunque solo sea para fastidiarles por lo que te hicieron."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Volunteer Mutant"
msgstr "Mutante Voluntario"

#. ~ Profession (male Volunteer Mutant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your dreams of becoming a super-human mutant through genetic alteration may "
"have fallen a bit short, but the scientists say you're ready.  It's time for"
" a field test."
msgstr ""
"Tus sueños de convertirte en un mutante superhumano a través de la "
"alteración genética pueden haberse quedado un poco cortos, pero los "
"científicos dicen que estás listo. Es hora de una prueba de campo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Volunteer Mutant"
msgstr "Mutante Voluntaria"

#. ~ Profession (female Volunteer Mutant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your dreams of becoming a super-human mutant through genetic alteration may "
"have fallen a bit short, but the scientists say you're ready.  It's time for"
" a field test."
msgstr ""
"Tus sueños de convertirte en una mutante superhumana a través de la "
"alteración genética pueden haberse quedado un poco cortos, pero los "
"científicos dicen que estás lista. Es hora de una prueba de campo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hitchhiker"
msgstr "Autoestopista"

#. ~ Profession (male Hitchhiker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your house has been demolished and your planet destroyed, but at least you "
"still have your towel."
msgstr ""
"Lo tuyo era viajar, te dedicabas a hacer dedo en la ruta. Ahora, tu casa fue"
" demolida y tu planeta destruido, pero por lo menos todavía tienes tu "
"toalla."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hitchhiker"
msgstr "Autoestopista"

#. ~ Profession (female Hitchhiker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your house has been demolished and your planet destroyed, but at least you "
"still have your towel."
msgstr ""
"Lo tuyo era viajar, te dedicabas a hacer dedo en la ruta. Ahora, tu casa fue"
" demolida y tu planeta destruido, pero por lo menos todavía tienes tu "
"toalla."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Trapper"
msgstr "Trampero"

#. ~ Profession (male Trapper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life trapping with your father.  Both of you made a "
"decent living selling your catches and running trapping tutorials.  "
"Hopefully, your skills will come in useful against less conventional game."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste la mayor parte de tu vida trampeando con tu padre. Ambos os "
"ganasteis la vida decentemente vendiendo vuestras capturas y impartiendo "
"clases de trampeo. Con suerte, tus habilidades serán útiles contra la caza "
"menos convencional."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Trapper"
msgstr "Trampera"

#. ~ Profession (female Trapper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent most of your life trapping with your father.  Both of you made a "
"decent living selling your catches and running trapping tutorials.  "
"Hopefully, your skills will come in useful against less conventional game."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste la mayor parte de tu vida trampeando con tu padre. Ambos os "
"ganasteis la vida decentemente vendiendo vuestras capturas y impartiendo "
"clases de trampeo. Con suerte, tus habilidades serán útiles contra la caza "
"menos convencional."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "Herrero"

#. ~ Profession (male Blacksmith) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of"
" some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Te has metido en un lío al salir de clase en el programa de metalurgia de tu"
" colegio universitario, pero a pesar de los estragos has conseguido "
"conservar parte del equipo que llevabas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr "Herrera"

#. ~ Profession (female Blacksmith) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You ran into trouble coming out of class at your community college's "
"metalsmithing program, but despite the havoc you've managed to keep ahold of"
" some of the equipment you were carrying."
msgstr ""
"Te has metido en un lío al salir de clase en el programa de metalurgia de tu"
" colegio universitario, pero a pesar de los estragos has conseguido "
"conservar parte del equipo que llevabas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Clown"
msgstr "Payaso"

#. ~ Profession (male Clown) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Lo único que querías era hacer reír a la gente. Dejar la escuela y actuar en"
" fiestas infantiles era tu sueño hecho realidad hasta que el mundo se acabó."
" Hay muy pocos globos de animales en tu futuro actual."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Clown"
msgstr "Payasa"

#. ~ Profession (female Clown) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All you ever wanted was to make people laugh.  Dropping out of school and "
"performing at kids' parties was a dream come true until the world ended.  "
"There are precious few balloon animals in your future now."
msgstr ""
"Lo único que querías era hacer reír a la gente. Dejar la escuela y actuar en"
" fiestas infantiles era tu sueño hecho realidad hasta que el mundo se acabó."
" Hay muy pocos globos de animales en tu futuro actual."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lost Submissive"
msgstr "Sumiso Perdido"

#. ~ Profession (male Lost Submissive) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"In the rush to safety, you were separated from your master by cruel fate.  "
"Now you are on your own, with nothing to your name but a suit of really "
"kinky black leather.  Unfortunately, there are no safewords in the "
"apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"En la carrera hacia la seguridad, fuiste separado por el cruel destino. "
"Ahora estás solo, sin nada más que un traje de cuero negro muy pervertido. "
"Por desgracia, en el apocalipsis no hay palabras de seguridad."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lost Submissive"
msgstr "Sumisa Perdida"

#. ~ Profession (female Lost Submissive) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"In the rush to safety, you were separated from your master by cruel fate.  "
"Now you are on your own, with nothing to your name but a suit of really "
"kinky black leather.  Unfortunately, there are no safewords in the "
"apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"En la carrera hacia la seguridad, fuiste separada por el cruel destino. "
"Ahora estás sola, sin nada más que un traje de cuero negro muy pervertido. "
"Por desgracia, en el apocalipsis no hay palabras de seguridad."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Senior Citizen"
msgstr "Jubilado"

#. ~ Profession (male Senior Citizen) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay "
"for what they've done."
msgstr ""
"No habías visto tanta sangre desde la guerra. ¡El mundo entero se ha vuelto "
"loco! ¡Se comieron a tus nietos! ¡Mecachis! Los vas a tener que hacer pagar "
"por lo que hicieron."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Senior Citizen"
msgstr "Jubilada"

#. ~ Profession (female Senior Citizen) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You haven't seen this much blood since the war.  The whole world's gone "
"crazy!  They ate your grandkids!  But dagnabbit, you'll make them all pay "
"for what they've done."
msgstr ""
"No habías visto tanta sangre desde la guerra. ¡El mundo entero se ha vuelto "
"loco! ¡Se comieron a tus nietos! ¡Mecachis! Los vas a tener que hacer pagar "
"por lo que hicieron."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Otaku"

#. ~ Profession (male Otaku) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Después de muchas noches con amigos viendo anime y comiendo bocadillos, "
"decidiste hacer el viaje a la principal convención de anime del noreste. "
"Ahora los zombis se están comiendo a todo el mundo, y lo que es peor, ¡la "
"convención se ha cancelado! Al menos estabas preparado por si tu disfraz se "
"rompía."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Otaku"
msgstr "Otaku"

#. ~ Profession (female Otaku) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now zombies are eating everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Después de muchas noches con amigos viendo anime y comiendo bocadillos, "
"decidiste hacer el viaje a la principal convención de anime del noreste. "
"Ahora los zombis se están comiendo a todo el mundo, y lo que es peor, ¡la "
"convención se ha cancelado! Al menos estabas preparado por si tu disfraz se "
"rompía."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Groom"
msgstr "Novio"

#. ~ Profession (Groom) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm struck on the big day and you escaped with nothing but your "
"wedding attire.  Cold feet?  You'd just like to keep your feet attached!"
msgstr ""
"El Cataclismo golpeó en el gran día y escapaste con nada más que tu atuendo "
"de boda. ¿Pies fríos? ¡Te preocupa más mantenerlos unidos!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bride"
msgstr "Novia"

#. ~ Profession (Bride) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm struck on the big day and you escaped with nothing but your "
"wedding attire.  Cold feet?  You'd just like to keep your feet attached!"
msgstr ""
"El Cataclismo golpeó en el gran día y escapaste con nada más que tu atuendo "
"de boda. ¿Pies fríos? ¡Te preocupa más mantenerlos unidos!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Punk Rock Dude"
msgstr "Rockero"

#. ~ Profession (Punk Rock Dude) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"All those wicked songs about the apocalypse have come to life.  Brutal!  Now"
" that the system is dead, it's time to party among the bones of the world!"
msgstr ""
"Todas esas canciones perversas sobre el apocalipsis han cobrado vida. "
"¡Brutal! Ahora que el sistema ha muerto, ¡es hora de festejar entre los "
"huesos del mundo!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Punk Rock Girl"
msgstr "Tía PunkRocker"

#. ~ Profession (Punk Rock Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"All those wicked songs about the apocalypse have come to life.  Brutal!  Now"
" that the system is dead, it's time to party among the bones of the world!"
msgstr ""
"Todas esas canciones perversas sobre el apocalipsis han cobrado vida. "
"¡Brutal! Ahora que el sistema ha muerto, ¡es hora de festejar entre los "
"huesos del mundo!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombero"

#. ~ Profession (male Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a first responder, you were direct witness to the gut-wrenching horrors "
"of the apocalypse.  Separated from most of your equipment and your unit "
"while on call, you were forced to fight your way to safety with little more "
"than your trusty iron and your bunker gear to protect you."
msgstr ""
"Como primer auxiliador, fuiste testigo directo de los horrores desgarradores"
" del apocalipsis. Separado de la mayor parte de tu equipo y de tu unidad "
"mientras estabas de guardia, te vistes obligado a luchar por ponerte a salvo"
" con poco más que tu fiel hierro y tu equipo de protección."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombera"

#. ~ Profession (female Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a first responder, you were direct witness to the gut-wrenching horrors "
"of the apocalypse.  Separated from most of your equipment and your unit "
"while on call, you were forced to fight your way to safety with little more "
"than your trusty iron and your bunker gear to protect you."
msgstr ""
"Como primera auxiliadora, fuiste testigo directo de los horrores "
"desgarradores del apocalipsis. Separado de la mayor parte de tu equipo y de "
"tu unidad mientras estabas de guardia, te viste obligada a luchar por "
"ponerte a salvo con poco más que tu fiel hierro y tu equipo de protección."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rude Boy"
msgstr "Chico Rudo"

#. ~ Profession (Rude Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer became a zombie.  Now you're alone "
"in the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""
"Tu banda de ska se disolvió después de que el batería se convirtiera en "
"zombi. Ahora estás solo en el Cataclismo con unos cigarrillos y tu "
"reproductor mp3."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rude Girl"
msgstr "Chica Ruda"

#. ~ Profession (Rude Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer became a zombie.  Now you're alone "
"in the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""
"Tu banda de ska se disolvió después de que el batería se convirtiera en "
"zombi. Ahora estás sola en el Cataclismo con unos cigarrillos y tu "
"reproductor mp3."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Mail Carrier"
msgstr "Cartero"

#. ~ Profession (male Mail Carrier) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Neither snow nor rain nor heat nor dark of night stays you from delivering "
"the mail, but nobody said anything about aliens."
msgstr ""
"Ni la nieve, ni la lluvia, ni el calor, ni la oscuridad de la noche te "
"impiden repartir el correo, pero nadie dijo nada sobre extraterrestres."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Mail Carrier"
msgstr "Cartera"

#. ~ Profession (female Mail Carrier) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Neither snow nor rain nor heat nor dark of night stays you from delivering "
"the mail, but nobody said anything about aliens."
msgstr ""
"Ni la nieve, ni la lluvia, ni el calor, ni la oscuridad de la noche te "
"impiden repartir el correo, pero nadie dijo nada sobre extraterrestres."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Convict"
msgstr "Convicto"

#. ~ Profession (male Convict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your trial was contentious, but inevitably you found yourself behind bars.  "
"The Cataclysm has offered you a chance to escape, but freedom may come with "
"a steep price."
msgstr ""
"Tu juicio fue polémico, pero inevitablemente te encontraste entre rejas. El "
"Cataclismo te ha ofrecido una oportunidad de escapar, pero la libertad puede"
" tener un precio muy alto."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Convict"
msgstr "Convicta"

#. ~ Profession (female Convict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your trial was contentious, but inevitably you found yourself behind bars.  "
"The Cataclysm has offered you a chance to escape, but freedom may come with "
"a steep price."
msgstr ""
"Tu juicio fue polémico, pero inevitablemente te encontraste entre rejas. El "
"Cataclismo te ha ofrecido una oportunidad de escapar, pero la libertad puede"
" tener un precio muy alto."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Death Row Convict"
msgstr "Condenado a muerte"

#. ~ Profession (male Death Row Convict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a serial killer, ready to walk the green mile, but in a twist of "
"fate you're one of the few still alive.  True death comes only from your "
"hands, so you're in for a job."
msgstr ""
"Eras un asesino en serie, dispuesto a recorrer la milla verde, pero en un "
"giro del destino eres uno de los pocos que siguen vivos. La verdadera muerte"
" sólo viene de tus manos, así que te toca trabajar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Death Row Convict"
msgstr "Condenada a muerte"

#. ~ Profession (female Death Row Convict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a serial killer, ready to walk the green mile, but in a twist of "
"fate you're one of the few still alive.  True death comes only from your "
"hands, so you're in for a job."
msgstr ""
"Eras un asesina en serie, dispuesto a recorrer la milla verde, pero en un "
"giro del destino eras una de los pocos que siguen vivos. La verdadera muerte"
" sólo viene de tus manos, así que te toca trabajar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Embezzler"
msgstr "Malversador"

#. ~ Profession (male Embezzler) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had a genius plan to skim fractions of cents out of your company's "
"accounts.  This plan immediately failed and got you arrested.  They said you"
" were too soft for prison, but guess what?  They're dead, and you're not."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un plan genial para sustraer fracciones de céntimos de las cuentas de"
" tu empresa. Este plan fracasó inmediatamente y te arrestaron. Dijeron que "
"eras demasiado blando para ir a la cárcel, pero ¿adivina qué? Ellos están "
"muertos, y tú no."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Embezzler"
msgstr "Malversadora"

#. ~ Profession (female Embezzler) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had a genius plan to skim fractions of cents out of your company's "
"accounts.  This plan immediately failed and got you arrested.  They said you"
" were too soft for prison, but guess what?  They're dead, and you're not."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un plan genial para sustraer fracciones de céntimos de las cuentas de"
" tu empresa. Este plan fracasó inmediatamente y te arrestaron. Dijeron que "
"eras demasiado blanda para ir a la cárcel, pero ¿adivina qué? Ellos están "
"muertos, y tú no."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Meth Cook"
msgstr "Cocinero de anfeta"

#. ~ Profession (male Meth Cook) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You clawed your way out of poverty by selling products everyone wanted, and "
"they had the nerve to put you in jail for it.  Too bad you can't sell drugs "
"to zombies or aliens."
msgstr ""
"Saliste de la pobreza vendiendo productos que todos querían, y tuvieron el "
"descaro de meterte en la cárcel por ello. Lástima que no puedas vender "
"drogas a zombis o extraterrestres."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Meth Cook"
msgstr "Cocinera de anfeta"

#. ~ Profession (female Meth Cook) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You clawed your way out of poverty by selling products everyone wanted, and "
"they had the nerve to put you in jail for it.  Too bad you can't sell drugs "
"to zombies or aliens."
msgstr ""
"Saliste de la pobreza vendiendo productos que todos querían, y tuvieron el "
"descaro de meterte en la cárcel por ello. Lástima que no puedas vender "
"drogas a zombis o extraterrestres."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Political Prisoner"
msgstr "Prisionero político"

#. ~ Profession (male Political Prisoner) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You did your best to expose what was going on in those labs, but they caught"
" you and threw you in prison on trumped-up charges to silence you.  Clearly,"
" they should have listened."
msgstr ""
"Hiciste todo lo posible por sacar a la luz lo que ocurría en esos "
"laboratorios, pero te pillaron y te metieron en la cárcel con cargos "
"inventados para silenciarte. Claramente, deberían haberte escuchado."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Political Prisoner"
msgstr "Prisionera política"

#. ~ Profession (female Political Prisoner) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You did your best to expose what was going on in those labs, but they caught"
" you and threw you in prison on trumped-up charges to silence you.  Clearly,"
" they should have listened."
msgstr ""
"Hiciste todo lo posible por sacar a la luz lo que ocurría en esos "
"laboratorios, pero te pillaron y te metieron en la cárcel con cargos "
"inventados para silenciarte. Claramente, deberían haberte escuchado."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rat Prince"
msgstr "Príncipe rata"

#. ~ Profession (Rat Prince) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least"
" your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente necesitabas ayuda psiquiátrica en lugar de una sentencia de "
"prisión. Al menos tus leales súbditos han accedido a mantener la línea "
"mientras haces tu arriesgado escape."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rat Princess"
msgstr "Princesa rata"

#. ~ Profession (Rat Princess) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You probably needed psychiatric help instead of a prison sentence.  At least"
" your loyal subjects have agreed to hold the line as you make your daring "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Probablemente necesitabas ayuda psiquiátrica en lugar de una sentencia de "
"prisión. Al menos tus leales súbditos han accedido a mantener la línea "
"mientras haces tu arriesgado escape."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Burglar"
msgstr "Ladrón"

#. ~ Profession (male Burglar) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"This could be your lucky break.  Plenty of loot to be pilfered, and no cops "
"to be seen.  Does it count as breaking and entering if everyone in town is "
"undead?"
msgstr ""
"Este podría ser tu golpe de suerte. Un montón de botín para ser robado, y "
"ningún policía para ser visto. ¿Cuenta como allanamiento de morada si todos "
"en la ciudad son muertos vivientes?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Burglar"
msgstr "Ladrona"

#. ~ Profession (female Burglar) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"This could be your lucky break.  Plenty of loot to be pilfered, and no cops "
"to be seen.  Does it count as breaking and entering if everyone in town is "
"undead?"
msgstr ""
"Este podría ser tu golpe de suerte. Un montón de botín para ser robado, y "
"ningún policía para ser visto. ¿Cuenta como allanamiento de morada si todos "
"en la ciudad son muertos vivientes?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Lawyer"
msgstr "Abogado"

#. ~ Profession (male Lawyer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat"
" your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"El jurado estaba en la palma de tu mano, pero después de que el acusado "
"intentara comerte tu cerebro, te viste obligado a huir de la sala en "
"desacato. Ahora parece que a nadie le importan tus objeciones."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Lawyer"
msgstr "Abogada"

#. ~ Profession (female Lawyer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the defendant tried to eat"
" your brain, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"El jurado estaba en la palma de tu mano, pero después de que el acusado "
"intentara comerte tu cerebro, te viste obligado a huir de la sala en "
"desacato. Ahora parece que a nadie le importan tus objeciones."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Priest"
msgstr "Cura"

#. ~ Profession (male Priest) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Armageddon has come!  You did everything you could to protect your parish "
"faithful, but it appears that prayers were not enough.  Now that they are "
"all dead, you should probably find something more tangible to protect you."
msgstr ""
"¡El Armagedón ha llegado! Hiciste todo lo que pudiste para proteger a tus "
"fieles de la parroquia, pero parece que las oraciones no fueron suficientes."
" Ahora que están todos muertos, probablemente deberías encontrar algo más "
"tangible para protegerte."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Priest"
msgstr "Diaconisa"

#. ~ Profession (female Priest) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Armageddon has come!  You did everything you could to protect your parish "
"faithful, but it appears that prayers were not enough.  Now that they are "
"all dead, you should probably find something more tangible to protect you."
msgstr ""
