" pizza. ¡Y ni siquiera te han dejado una propina!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Archaeologist"
msgstr "Arqueólogo"

#. ~ Profession (male Archaeologist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Following a clue from your dead grandfather's journal, you made your way to "
"a long-lost temple, but then the ground started to shake uncontrollably.  "
"You had a bad feeling about that, so you got out of there quickly."
msgstr ""
"Siguiendo una pista del diario de tu abuelo muerto, te dirigiste a un templo"
" perdido hace tiempo, pero entonces el suelo empezó a temblar sin control. "
"Tuviste un mal presentimiento, así que saliste de allí rápidamente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Archaeologist"
msgstr "Arqueóloga"

#. ~ Profession (female Archaeologist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Following a clue from your dead grandfather's journal, you made your way to "
"a long-lost temple, but then the ground started to shake uncontrollably.  "
"You had a bad feeling about that, so you got out of there quickly."
msgstr ""
"Siguiendo una pista del diario de tu abuelo muerto, te dirigiste a un templo"
" perdido hace tiempo, pero entonces el suelo empezó a temblar sin control. "
"Tuviste un mal presentimiento, así que saliste de allí rápidamente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Paperboy"
msgstr "Repartidor de periódicos"

#. ~ Profession (Paperboy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The undead "
"hordes don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle"
" is still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Esta mañana te has puesto en marcha para dar la noticia del apocalipsis. Las"
" hordas de muertos vivientes no parecen valorar las últimas noticias, pero "
"al menos tu fiel bicicleta sigue funcionando."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Papergirl"
msgstr "Repartidora de periódicos"

#. ~ Profession (Papergirl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The undead "
"hordes don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle"
" is still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Esta mañana te has puesto en marcha para dar la noticia del apocalipsis. Las"
" hordas de muertos vivientes no parecen valorar las últimas noticias, pero "
"al menos tu fiel bicicleta sigue funcionando."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Roller Derby Player"
msgstr "Jugador Roller Derby"

#. ~ Profession (male Roller Derby Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hell on wheels.  Now the rest of your team is dead, and you "
"probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your penchant for high-"
"speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around "
"the undead before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr ""
"Eras un infierno sobre ruedas. Ahora el resto de tu equipo está muerto, y "
"probablemente no habrías vivido tanto si no fuera por tu afición a la "
"violencia de alta velocidad. Las cosas se ponen feas; ¿cuánto tiempo puedes "
"dar vueltas alrededor de los muertos vivientes antes de que te bloqueen "
"definitivamente?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Roller Derby Player"
msgstr "Jugadora Roller Derby"

#. ~ Profession (female Roller Derby Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hell on wheels.  Now the rest of your team is dead, and you "
"probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your penchant for high-"
"speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around "
"the undead before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr ""
"Eras un infierno sobre ruedas. Ahora el resto de tu equipo está muerto, y "
"probablemente no habrías vivido tanto si no fuera por tu afición a la "
"violencia de alta velocidad. Las cosas se ponen feas; ¿cuánto tiempo puedes "
"dar vueltas alrededor de los muertos vivientes antes de que te bloqueen "
"definitivamente?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Farmer"
msgstr "Granjero"

#. ~ Profession (male Farmer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A patch of soil, some water, and sunlight were all you ever needed; why "
"should things be any different now?  With a handful of seeds and your trusty"
" hoe, it's time to rebuild the Earth, one plant at a time."
msgstr ""
"Una parcela de tierra, un poco de agua y la luz del sol era todo lo que "
"necesitabas; ¿por qué iban a ser las cosas diferentes ahora? Con un puñado "
"de semillas y tu fiel azada, es hora de reconstruir la Tierra, de planta en "
"planta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Farmer"
msgstr "Granjera"

#. ~ Profession (female Farmer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A patch of soil, some water, and sunlight were all you ever needed; why "
"should things be any different now?  With a handful of seeds and your trusty"
" hoe, it's time to rebuild the Earth, one plant at a time."
msgstr ""
"Una parcela de tierra, un poco de agua y la luz del sol era todo lo que "
"necesitabas; ¿por qué iban a ser las cosas diferentes ahora? Con un puñado "
"de semillas y tu fiel azada, es hora de reconstruir la Tierra, de planta en "
"planta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "National Guard"
msgstr "Guardia Nacional"

#. ~ Profession (male National Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all"
" communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para hacer frente a la "
"creciente epidemia. A pesar de tus esfuerzos, no pudiste organizarte antes "
"de que cesaran las comunicaciones y te encontraste solo entre los muertos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "National Guard"
msgstr "Guardia Nacional"

#. ~ Profession (female National Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"epidemics.  Despite your best efforts, you were unable to form up before all"
" communications ceased and you found yourself alone amongst the dead."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para hacer frente a la "
"creciente epidemia. A pesar de tus esfuerzos, no pudiste organizarte antes "
"de que cesaran las comunicaciones y te encontraste solo entre los muertos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Hardened Scavenger"
msgstr "Carroñero Endurecido"

#. ~ Profession (male Hardened Scavenger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"One of the lucky few who escaped the Cataclysm, you made a life for yourself"
" amidst the ruins of civilization.  Whether through force, guile, or luck, "
"you've obtained the best gear you could find."
msgstr ""
"Como uno de los pocos afortunados que escaparon del Cataclismo, te hiciste "
"una vida entre las ruinas de la civilización. Ya sea por la fuerza, la "
"astucia o la suerte, has conseguido el mejor equipo que has podido "
"encontrar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Hardened Scavenger"
msgstr "Carroñera Endurecida"

#. ~ Profession (female Hardened Scavenger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"One of the lucky few who escaped the Cataclysm, you made a life for yourself"
" amidst the ruins of civilization.  Whether through force, guile, or luck, "
"you've obtained the best gear you could find."
msgstr ""
"Como uno de las pocas afortunadas que escaparon del Cataclismo, te hiciste "
"una vida entre las ruinas de la civilización. Ya sea por la fuerza, la "
"astucia o la suerte, has conseguido el mejor equipo que has podido "
"encontrar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Holdout"
msgstr "Militar Rezagado"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Holdout) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You must have paid attention to your survival training in boot camp; "
"otherwise, you would never have lived long enough to outlast the chain of "
"command and find yourself in this predicament.  The only mission left now is"
" to survive."
msgstr ""
"Debes haber prestado atención a tu entrenamiento de supervivencia en el "
"campamento de entrenamiento; de lo contrario, nunca habrías vivido lo "
"suficiente como para sobrevivir a la cadena de mando y encontrarte en esta "
"situación. La única misión que queda ahora es sobrevivir."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Holdout"
msgstr "Militar Rezagada"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Holdout) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You must have paid attention to your survival training in boot camp; "
"otherwise, you would never have lived long enough to outlast the chain of "
"command and find yourself in this predicament.  The only mission left now is"
" to survive."
msgstr ""
"Debes haber prestado atención a tu entrenamiento de supervivencia en el "
"campamento de entrenamiento; de lo contrario, nunca habrías vivido lo "
"suficiente como para sobrevivir a la cadena de mando y encontrarte en esta "
"situación. La única misión que queda ahora es sobrevivir."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Mall Security"
msgstr "Seguridad de Supermercado"

#. ~ Profession (male Mall Security) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent dull nights guarding the local mall against teen hooligans and "
"petty thieves.  Your job training didn't provide any terribly useful skills,"
" but you do have your trusty tazer, baton, and pocket knife."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste noches aburridas vigilando el centro comercial local contra "
"gamberros adolescentes y ladrones de poca monta. Tu formación laboral no te "
"proporcionó ninguna habilidad terriblemente útil, pero tienes tu fiel tazer,"
" tu porra y tu navaja."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Mall Security"
msgstr "Seguridad de Supermercado"

#. ~ Profession (female Mall Security) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
