#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Camper"
msgstr "Campista"

#. ~ Profession (male Camper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always enjoyed hiking and camping in the wilderness, so it was a no-"
"brainer to grab your bag and run when the sirens sounded.  The cities are "
"overrun, but you're prepared to make a home wherever you may find yourself."
msgstr ""
"Siempre te ha gustado ir de excursión y acampar en la naturaleza, así que no"
" te costó nada coger la mochila y salir corriendo cuando sonaron las "
"sirenas. Las ciudades están invadidas, pero estás preparado para crear un "
"hogar dondequiera que te encuentres."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Camper"
msgstr "Campista"

#. ~ Profession (female Camper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always enjoyed hiking and camping in the wilderness, so it was a no-"
"brainer to grab your bag and run when the sirens sounded.  The cities are "
"overrun, but you're prepared to make a home wherever you may find yourself."
msgstr ""
"Siempre te ha gustado ir de excursión y acampar en la naturaleza, así que no"
" te costó nada coger la mochila y salir corriendo cuando sonaron las "
"sirenas. Las ciudades están invadidas, pero estás preparada para crear un "
"hogar dondequiera que te encuentres."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Miner"
msgstr "Minero"

#. ~ Profession (male Miner) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your canteen is dry, your jackhammer is out of"
" gas, and you're on your last pair of batteries for your mining helmet…"
msgstr ""
"Eres un minero, no un menor. Tu cantimplora está seca, tu martillo neumático"
" se ha quedado sin gasolina y te queda el último par de pilas para tu casco "
"de minero..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Miner"
msgstr "Minera"

#. ~ Profession (female Miner) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a miner, not a minor!  Your canteen is dry, your jackhammer is out of"
" gas, and you're on your last pair of batteries for your mining helmet…"
msgstr ""
"Eres una minera, no un menor. Tu cantimplora está seca, tu martillo "
"neumático se ha quedado sin gasolina y te queda el último par de pilas para "
"tu casco de minera..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Demolition Expert"
msgstr "Experto en Demolición"

#. ~ Profession (male Demolition Expert) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Before this all began, you were having the time of your life at your dream "
"job: blowing stuff up.  The Cataclysm means you're finally allowed to do it "
"full time."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que todo esto empezara, te lo estabas pasando como nunca en el "
"trabajo de tus sueños: hacer explotar cosas. El Cataclismo significa que por"
" fin puedes hacerlo a tiempo completo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Demolition Expert"
msgstr "Experta en Demolición"

#. ~ Profession (female Demolition Expert) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Before this all began, you were having the time of your life at your dream "
"job: blowing stuff up.  The Cataclysm means you're finally allowed to do it "
"full time."
msgstr ""
"Antes de que todo esto empezara, te lo estabas pasando como nunca en el "
"trabajo de tus sueños: hacer explotar cosas. El Cataclismo significa que por"
" fin puedes hacerlo a tiempo completo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Traceur"
msgstr "Traceur"

#. ~ Profession (Traceur) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground."
"  It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr ""
"Practicaste parkour por muchos años y convertiste al mundo en tu parque de "
"juegos. No sería mentira decir que correr es tu vida. Y está muy bien, "
"porque ahora que llegó el fin, vas a correr por tu vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Traceuse"
msgstr "Traceuse"

#. ~ Profession (Traceuse) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've practiced parkour for many years, and made the world your playground."
"  It wouldn't be a lie to say that running is your life.  Which is good, "
"because now that the end has come, you're running for your life."
msgstr ""
"Practicaste parkour por muchos años y convertiste al mundo en tu parque de "
"juegos. No sería mentira decir que correr es tu vida. Y está muy bien, "
"porque ahora que llegó el fin, vas a correr por tu vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Tourist"
msgstr "Turista"

#. ~ Profession (male Tourist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"This seemed like a great place for a holiday, but you're starting to regret "
"ever leaving home.  You came here to get a taste of New England, but New "
"England keeps trying to get a taste of you!"
msgstr ""
"Este parecía un lugar estupendo para unas vacaciones, pero estás empezando a"
" arrepentirte de haber salido de casa. ¡Has venido a probar algo de Nueva "
"Inglaterra, pero Nueva Inglaterra sigue intentando probarte a ti!."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Tourist"
msgstr "Turista"

#. ~ Profession (female Tourist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"This seemed like a great place for a holiday, but you're starting to regret "
"ever leaving home.  You came here to get a taste of New England, but New "
"England keeps trying to get a taste of you!"
msgstr ""
"Este parecía un lugar estupendo para unas vacaciones, pero estás empezando a"
" arrepentirte de haber salido de casa. ¡Has venido a probar algo de Nueva "
"Inglaterra, pero Nueva Inglaterra sigue intentando probarte a ti!."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Naked and Afraid"
msgstr "Desnudo y asustado"

#. ~ Profession (male Naked and Afraid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were out filming a reality TV show, naked in the woods.  Strangely, the "
"cast and crew all seem to have turned into zombies, which is pretty bad "
"timing for you.  Looks like it's for real this time…"
msgstr ""
"Estabas filmando un reality show, desnudo en el bosque. Extrañamente, el "
"elenco y el equipo parecen haberse convertido en zombis, lo cual es bastante"
" inoportuno para ti. Parece que esta vez es de verdad..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Naked and Afraid"
msgstr "Desnuda y asustada"

#. ~ Profession (female Naked and Afraid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were out filming a reality TV show, naked in the woods.  Strangely, the "
"cast and crew all seem to have turned into zombies, which is pretty bad "
"timing for you.  Looks like it's for real this time…"
msgstr ""
"Estabas filmando un reality show, desnuda en el bosque. Extrañamente, el "
"elenco y el equipo parecen haberse convertido en zombis, lo cual es bastante"
" inoportuno para ti. Parece que esta vez es de verdad..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Game Master"
msgstr "Game Master"

#. ~ Profession (male Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two tried to eat you, you ditched."
"  Maybe you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"Intentar reunir a gente cada semana te ha enseñado algo: normalmente es "
"mejor retirarse tempranamente y confiar en tu instinto. Por eso, cuando dos "
"de ellos no se presentaron y los otros dos trataron de comerte, lo dejaste. "
"Quizá puedas encontrar nuevos jugadores en las ruinas del mundo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Game Master"
msgstr "Game Master"

#. ~ Profession (female Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two tried to eat you, you ditched."
"  Maybe you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"Intentar reunir a gente cada semana te ha enseñado algo: normalmente es "
"mejor retirarse tempranamente y confiar en tu instinto. Por eso, cuando dos "
"de ellos no se presentaron y los otros dos trataron de comerte, lo dejaste. "
"Quizá puedas encontrar nuevos jugadores en las ruinas del mundo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "Trabajador de zoológico"

#. ~ Profession (male Zoo Keeper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some"
" reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Te han llamado en tu día libre para alimentar a los animales del zoo. Por "
"alguna razón, ninguno de tus compañeros se ha molestado en ir a trabajar "
"hoy."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Zoo Keeper"
msgstr "Trabajadora de zoológico"

#. ~ Profession (female Zoo Keeper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were called in on your day off to feed the animals at the zoo.  For some"
" reason, none of your coworkers bothered showing up for work today."
msgstr ""
"Te han llamado en tu día libre para alimentar a los animales del zoo. Por "
"alguna razón, ninguno de tus compañeros se ha molestado en ir a trabajar "
"hoy."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Golfer"
msgstr "Golfista"

#. ~ Profession (male Golfer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You decided to get away from the family for the day, so you headed to the "
"fairway for a nice relaxing round of golf."
msgstr ""
"Decidiste alejarte de la familia por un día, así que te dirigiste al campo "
"para una relajante ronda de golf."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Golfer"
msgstr "Golfista"

#. ~ Profession (female Golfer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You decided to get away from the family for the day, so you headed to the "
"fairway for a nice relaxing round of golf."
msgstr ""
"Decidiste alejarte de la familia por un día, así que te dirigiste al campo "
"para una relajante ronda de golf."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Urban Samurai"
msgstr "Samurái urbano"

#. ~ Profession (male Urban Samurai) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were always an inexplicable sight in town, with your funny hair and odd "
"Japanese clothes.  Some claimed you were a visiting Shinto god.  Little of "
"this concerns you, but last week the grocery service stopped coming and now "
"the TV no longer turns on.  This displeases you."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste una visión inexplicable en la ciudad, con tu pelo raro y tus "
"extrañas ropas japonesas. Algunos decían que eras un dios Sintoísta de "
"visita. Poco de esto te preocupa, pero la semana pasada dejó de venir el "
"servicio de supermercado y ahora la televisión ya no se enciende. Esto te "
"disgusta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Urban Samurai"
msgstr "Samurái urbano"

#. ~ Profession (female Urban Samurai) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were always an inexplicable sight in town, with your funny hair and odd "
"Japanese clothes.  Some claimed you were a visiting Shinto god.  Little of "
"this concerns you, but last week the grocery service stopped coming and now "
"the TV no longer turns on.  This displeases you."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste una visión inexplicable en la ciudad, con tu pelo raro y tus "
"extrañas ropas japonesas. Algunos decían que eras una diosa Sintoísta de "
"visita. Poco de esto te preocupa, pero la semana pasada dejó de venir el "
"servicio de supermercado y ahora la televisión ya no se enciende. Esto te "
"disgusta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Competitive Fencer"
msgstr "Esgrimista Experto"

#. ~ Profession (male Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when zombies invaded the piste.  The "
"referee was eaten, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo se vio interrumpido cuando los zombis invadieron la "
"pista. El árbitro fue devorado, así que no estás seguro de que las reglas "
"sigan vigentes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Competitive Fencer"
msgstr "Esgrimista Experta"

#. ~ Profession (female Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when zombies invaded the piste.  The "
"referee was eaten, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo se vio interrumpido cuando los zombis invadieron la "
"pista. El árbitro fue devorado, así que no estás seguro de que las reglas "
"sigan vigentes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Career Politician"
msgstr "Político"

#. ~ Profession (male Career Politician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base "
"wants to eat you alive, winning hearts and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Has dedicado tu vida a ganar la confianza de las personas, persuadiendo y "
"prometiendo mucho en tu tiempo en la oficina. Ahora que tus votantes te "
"quieren comer vivo, ganar corazones y mentes se volvió aun mas difícil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Career Politician"
msgstr "Política"

#. ~ Profession (female Career Politician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base "
"wants to eat you alive, winning hearts and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""
"Has dedicado tu vida a ganar la confianza de las personas, persuadiendo y "
"prometiendo mucho en tu tiempo en la oficina. Ahora que tus votantes te "
"quieren comer vivo, ganar corazones y mentes se volvió aun mas difícil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Rancher"
msgstr "Ranchero"

#. ~ Profession (male Rancher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Taking care of cows, horses, and other animals is your passion, but the ways"
" things are going, this isn't going to be just another day at the ranch."
msgstr ""
"Cuidar de las vacas, los caballos y otros animales es tu pasión, pero tal y "
"como van las cosas, esto no va a ser un día más en el rancho."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Rancher"
msgstr "Ranchera"

#. ~ Profession (female Rancher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Taking care of cows, horses, and other animals is your passion, but the ways"
" things are going, this isn't going to be just another day at the ranch."
msgstr ""
"Cuidar de las vacas, los caballos y otros animales es tu pasión, pero tal y "
"como van las cosas, esto no va a ser un día más en el rancho."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Roadie"
msgstr "Asistente"

#. ~ Profession (male Roadie) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've always worked just outside of the limelight, carrying and fixing the "
"equipment and ensuring that the performers got what they needed.  The show "
"must go on."
msgstr ""
"Siempre has trabajado fuera de los focos, llevando y arreglando el equipo y "
"asegurándote de que los artistas tengan lo que necesitan. El espectáculo "
"debe continuar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Roadie"
msgstr "Asistente"

#. ~ Profession (female Roadie) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've always worked just outside of the limelight, carrying and fixing the "
"equipment and ensuring that the performers got what they needed.  The show "
"must go on."
msgstr ""
"Siempre has trabajado fuera de los focos, llevando y arreglando el equipo y "
"asegurándote de que los artistas tengan lo que necesitan. El espectáculo "
"debe continuar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Musician"
msgstr "Músico "

#. ~ Profession (male Musician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your loaded six string on your back."
msgstr ""
"Clavaste tu solo, pero el público estalló en gritos en lugar de aplausos. No"
" pudiste agarrar mucho durante el pánico, pero al menos tienes tu seis "
"cuerdas cargado en la espalda."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Musician"
msgstr "Música "

#. ~ Profession (female Musician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You nailed your solo, but the audience erupted into screams instead of "
"applause.  You weren't able to grab much during the panic, but at least you "
"have your loaded six string on your back."
msgstr ""
"Clavaste tu solo, pero el público estalló en gritos en lugar de aplausos. No"
" pudiste agarrar mucho durante el pánico, pero al menos tienes tu seis "
"cuerdas cargado en la espalda."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Kitted Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente Equipado"

#. ~ Profession (male Kitted Survivor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"At the local mall, you saw a sign advertising a discount on survival kits.  "
"You bought one, more for show than for actual use.  Now it's all you have."
msgstr ""
"En el centro comercial local, viste un cartel que anunciaba un descuento en "
"kits de supervivencia. Compraste uno, más para mostrar que para usarlo "
"realmente. Ahora es lo único que tienes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Kitted Survivor"
msgstr "Superviviente Equipada"

#. ~ Profession (female Kitted Survivor) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"At the local mall, you saw a sign advertising a discount on survival kits.  "
"You bought one, more for show than for actual use.  Now it's all you have."
msgstr ""
"En el centro comercial local, viste un cartel que anunciaba un descuento en "
"kits de supervivencia. Compraste uno, más para mostrar que para usarlo "
"realmente. Ahora es lo único que tienes."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wild West Gunslinger"
msgstr "Pistolero"

#. ~ Profession (male Wild West Gunslinger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You made your living on Wild West exhibitions and shows, impressing tourists"
" with your displays of marksmanship.  But that world has ended, so you took "
"your trusty six-shooter and wandered into a world where it's always high "
"noon."
msgstr ""
"Te ganabas la vida en exhibiciones y espectáculos del Salvaje Oeste, "
"impresionando a los turistas con tus demostraciones de puntería. Pero ese "
"mundo se ha acabado, así que cogiste tu fiel pistola de seis tiros y te "
"adentraste en un mundo en el que siempre es mediodía."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wild West Gunslinger"
msgstr "Pistolera"

#. ~ Profession (female Wild West Gunslinger) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You made your living on Wild West exhibitions and shows, impressing tourists"
" with your displays of marksmanship.  But that world has ended, so you took "
"your trusty six-shooter and wandered into a world where it's always high "
"noon."
msgstr ""
"Te ganabas la vida en exhibiciones y espectáculos del Salvaje Oeste, "
"impresionando a los turistas con tus demostraciones de puntería. Pero ese "
"mundo se ha acabado, así que cogiste tu fiel pistola de seis tiros y te "
"adentraste en un mundo en el que siempre es mediodía."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Frat Boy"
msgstr "Chico De Fraternidad"

#. ~ Profession (Frat Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, the guests became hungry "
"for more than drugs and booze, but you still have a chance to use the last "
"symbol of your luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la gran vida, gastando el dinero de tus padres sin ninguna "
"preocupación. En una de tus habituales fiestas locas, los invitados se "
"quedaron con ganas de algo más que de drogas y alcohol, pero aún tienes la "
"oportunidad de utilizar el último símbolo de tu vida lujosa -tu coche "
"deportivo- y llegar lejos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sorority Girl"
msgstr "Chica De Fraternidad"

#. ~ Profession (Sorority Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, the guests became hungry "
"for more than drugs and booze, but you still have a chance to use the last "
"symbol of your luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la gran vida, gastando el dinero de tus padres sin ninguna "
"preocupación. En una de tus habituales fiestas locas, los invitados se "
"quedaron con ganas de algo más que de drogas y alcohol, pero aún tienes la "
"oportunidad de utilizar el último símbolo de tu vida lujosa -tu coche "
"deportivo- y llegar lejos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Military Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Militar"

#. ~ Profession (male Military Pilot) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You got to see things fall apart from the sky, transporting soldiers and "
"survivors from one holdout to the next.  You knew it was only a matter of "
"time before the horrors patrolling the skies shot you down."
msgstr ""
"Tu pudiste ver el mundo colapsar desde los cielos, transportando soldados y "
"supervivientes de un lugar a otro. Sabias que solo era cuestión de tiempo "
"antes que los horrores que rondan el cielo te derribaran."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Military Pilot"
msgstr "Piloto Militar"

#. ~ Profession (female Military Pilot) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You got to see things fall apart from the sky, transporting soldiers and "
"survivors from one holdout to the next.  You knew it was only a matter of "
"time before the horrors patrolling the skies shot you down."
msgstr ""
"Tu pudiste ver el mundo colapsar desde los cielos, transportando soldados y "
"supervivientes de un lugar a otro. Sabias que solo era cuestión de tiempo "
"antes que los horrores que rondan el cielo te derribaran."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "EMT"
msgstr "EMT"

#. ~ Profession (male EMT) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were responding to a call with your partner before you got separated.  "
"Now all you have is your trusty ambulance, ready to transport patients "
"through the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Estabas respondiendo a una llamada con tu compañero antes de separaros. "
"Ahora solo tienes tu fiel ambulancia, preparada para transportar a los "
"pacientes durante el apocalipsis."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "EMT"
msgstr "EMT"

#. ~ Profession (female EMT) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were responding to a call with your partner before you got separated.  "
"Now all you have is your trusty ambulance, ready to transport patients "
"through the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"Estabas respondiendo a una llamada con tu compañero antes de separaros. "
"Ahora solo tienes tu fiel ambulancia, preparada para transportar a los "
"pacientes durante el apocalipsis."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Paramedic"
msgstr "Paramédico"

#. ~ Profession (male Paramedic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were separated from your partner while out on a call.  You managed to "
"hang onto some medical supplies, but it's looking like the only life that "
"needs saving now is yours."
msgstr ""
"Estabas respondiendo a una llamada con tu compañero antes de separaros. "
"Ahora solo tienes tu fiel ambulancia, preparada para transportar a los "
"pacientes durante el apocalipsis."

