"local. Entonces la gente empezó a comerse entre si. Esto no se parece a un "
"sueño febril."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Relief Volunteer"
msgstr "Voluntario de Ayuda"

#. ~ Profession (male Relief Volunteer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the riots happened, you were eager to lend a "
"hand.  But you had to cut your plans short when everyone was less interested"
" in handouts, and more interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin ánimo de lucro que se dedicaba a ayudar"
" donde se necesitaba ayuda. Cuando se produjeron los disturbios, estabas "
"deseando echar una mano. Pero tuviste que interrumpir tus planes cuando todo"
" el mundo estaba menos interesado en las limosnas y más en comerte."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Relief Volunteer"
msgstr "Voluntario de Ayuda"

#. ~ Profession (female Relief Volunteer) description
