#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Atomic Pitchman"
msgstr "Vendedor de Juguetes Atómicos"

#. ~ Profession (Atomic Pitchman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hired to market Rivtech's products through TV and were on your way "
"to the studio when the bombs hit.  You now enter the end of the world with "
"nothing but the snazzy clothes on your back and a bunch of plutonium-powered"
" toys."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste contratado para comercializar los productos de Rivtech a través de la"
" televisión y estabas de camino al estudio cuando estallaron las bombas. "
"Ahora entras en el fin del mundo sin nada más que la ropa elegante que "
"llevas puesta y un montón de juguetes con plutonio."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Atomic Pitchwoman"
msgstr "Vendedora de Juguetes Atómicos"

#. ~ Profession (Atomic Pitchwoman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hired to market Rivtech's products through TV and were on your way "
"to the studio when the bombs hit.  You now enter the end of the world with "
"nothing but the snazzy clothes on your back and a bunch of plutonium-powered"
" toys."
msgstr ""
"Fuiste contratada para comercializar los productos de Rivtech a través de la"
" televisión y estabas de camino al estudio cuando estallaron las bombas. "
"Ahora entras en el fin del mundo sin nada más que la ropa elegante que "
"llevas puesta y un montón de juguetes con plutonio."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Planar Frontiersman"
msgstr "Explorador Planar"

#. ~ Profession (Planar Frontiersman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm came, you were getting into your gear, prepared for the "
"first manned entrance through a stabilized portal in the lab - just a quick "
"five-minute scouting trip.  You were the last one left in the room when the "
"portal snapped shut and all hell broke loose.  Now that you know what was on"
" the other end, maybe that was a mercy."
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegó el Cataclismo, te estabas poniendo tu equipo, preparado para la"
" primera entrada tripulada a través de un portal estabilizado en el "
"laboratorio - sólo un rápido viaje de exploración de cinco minutos. Eras el "
"último que quedaba en la habitación cuando el portal se cerró y se desató el"
" infierno. Ahora que sabes lo que había en el otro extremo, tal vez fue una "
"misericordia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Planar Frontierswoman"
msgstr "Exploradora Planar"

#. ~ Profession (Planar Frontierswoman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the Cataclysm came, you were getting into your gear, prepared for the "
"first manned entrance through a stabilized portal in the lab - just a quick "
"five-minute scouting trip.  You were the last one left in the room when the "
