#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Commanding Officer"
msgstr " Oficial al Mando CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Commanding Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a top-ranking CO, you didn't see much in the way of combat other than "
"when you felt like it.  Your charisma and sharp intellect helped you climb "
"up the ranks and provided support to allies in need.  Now that everything "
"went down the drain, will it help you again?"
msgstr ""
"Como un CO de alto rango, no veías mucho en el camino del combate más que "
"cuando te apetecía. Tu carisma y tu agudo intelecto te ayudaron a subir de "
"rango y proporcionaron apoyo a los aliados que lo necesitaban. Ahora que "
"todo se fue por el desagüe, ¿te servirá de nuevo?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Commanding Officer"
msgstr " Oficial al Mando CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Commanding Officer) description
