#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniero CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Engineer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were scheduled to fix the several of the lab facilities in New England "
"and show other researchers the new weapons you were working on.  When the "
"Cataclysm broke out, it made it so testing was easier to do, but then again "
"nothing seems to making that much sense.  Time to bug-out!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas programado para arreglar las instalaciones de varios laboratorios en"
" Nueva Inglaterra y mostrar a otros investigadores las nuevas armas en las "
"que estaba trabajando. Cuando el cataclismo estalló, lo hizo para que las "
"pruebas fueran más fáciles de hacer, pero de nuevo nada parece tener tanto "
"sentido. ¡Hora de irse!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Engineer"
msgstr "Ingeniero CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Engineer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were scheduled to fix the several of the lab facilities in New England "
"and show other researchers the new weapons you were working on.  When the "
"Cataclysm broke out, it made it so testing was easier to do, but then again "
"nothing seems to making that much sense.  Time to bug-out!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas programado para arreglar las instalaciones de varios laboratorios en"
" Nueva Inglaterra y mostrar a otros investigadores las nuevas armas en las "
"que estaba trabajando. Cuando el cataclismo estalló, lo hizo para que las "
"pruebas fueran más fáciles de hacer, pero de nuevo nada parece tener tanto "
"sentido. ¡Hora de irse!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "CRIT Night Walker"
msgstr "Caminante Nocturno CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (male CRIT Night Walker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your base in New England fell to the unholy onslaught of the Cataclysm.  "
"However, as a top researcher in the R&D department, you had chosen to slowly"
" mutate yourself into something more than human.  Even if the concoction was"
" less than perfect, your old flimsy body feels empowered.  With the new "
"flesh that is now your own, bare your fangs and fight until the next dawn."
msgstr ""
"Tu base en Nueva Inglaterra cayó ante la impía embestida del Cataclismo. Sin"
" embargo, como investigador principal del departamento de I+D, habías optado"
" por mutar lentamente en algo más que humano. Aunque el brebaje no fuera "
"perfecto, tu antiguo y endeble cuerpo se siente fortalecido. Con la nueva "
"carne que ahora es tuya, muestra tus colmillos y lucha hasta el próximo "
"amanecer."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "CRIT Night Walker"
msgstr "Caminante Nocturno CRIT"

#. ~ Profession (female CRIT Night Walker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
