"próximo amanecer."

#. ~ Profession (male Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
"Then the skies opened up and fire rained forth.  This doesn't feel like a "
"fever dream."
msgstr ""
"Lo último que recuerdas es haberte encontrado con Dios detrás del "
"Lugarcomida. Entonces los cielos se abrieron y llovió fuego. Esto no parece "
"un sueño febril."

#. ~ Profession (female Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The last thing you remember was meeting God behind the local Foodplace.  "
"Then the skies opened up and fire rained forth.  This doesn't feel like a "
"fever dream."
msgstr ""
"Lo último que recuerdas es haberte encontrado con Dios detrás del "
"Lugarcomida. Entonces los cielos se abrieron y llovió fuego. Esto no parece "
"un sueño febril."

#. ~ Profession (male Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers started growing "
"crystals, satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
"Tras un accidente en tu juventud, te hiciste adicto a los opiáceos que "
"trataban tu dolor. Cuando las farmacias cerraron y tus traficantes empezaron"
" a cultivar cristales, satisfacer esos antojos se hizo mucho más difícil."

#. ~ Profession (female Heroin Addict) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After an accident in your youth, you got addicted to the opiates treating "
"your pain.  With the pharmacies shut down and your dealers started growing "
"crystals, satisfying those cravings just got a lot more difficult."
msgstr ""
"Tras un accidente en tu juventud, te hiciste adicta a los opiáceos que "
"trataban tu dolor. Cuando las farmacias cerraron y tus traficantes empezaron"
" a cultivar cristales, satisfacer esos antojos se hizo mucho más difícil."

#. ~ Profession (male Naked and Afraid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were out filming a reality TV show, naked in the woods.  The cast and "
"crew fled when the aliens came, which is pretty bad timing for you.  Looks "
"like it's for real this time…"
msgstr ""
"Estabas filmando un reality show, desnudo en el bosque. El elenco y el "
"equipo huyeron cuando los alienígenas llegaron, lo cual es muy mala suerte "
"para ti. Parece que esta vez es de verdad..."

#. ~ Profession (female Naked and Afraid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were out filming a reality TV show, naked in the woods.  The cast and "
"crew fled when the aliens came, which is pretty bad timing for you.  Looks "
"like it's for real this time…"
msgstr ""
"Estabas filmando un reality show, desnuda en el bosque. El elenco y el "
"equipo huyeron cuando los alienígenas llegaron, lo cual es muy mala suerte "
"para ti. Parece que esta vez es de verdad..."

#. ~ Profession (male Lumberjack) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect those crystal ghouls aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"Eres un leñador y está bien. Derribaste árboles antes de que se acabara el "
"mundo, pero sospechas que esos engendros de cristal no son tan duros."

#. ~ Profession (female Lumberjack) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a lumberjack, and you're okay.  You felled trees before the world "
"ended, but suspect those crystal ghouls aren't nearly as tough."
msgstr ""
"Eres una leñadora y está bien. Derribaste árboles antes de que se acabara el"
" mundo, pero sospechas que esos engendros de cristal no son tan duros."

#. ~ Profession (male Ballroom Dancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Aliens "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se pusieron un poco raras de camino a tu clase de baile semanal. "
"Parece que los extraterrestres no saben bailar, pero no vas a dejar que te "
"pisen tus pies."

#. ~ Profession (female Ballroom Dancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Things got a little weird on your way to your weekly dance class.  Aliens "
"don't seem to know how to dance, but you're not about to let them step on "
"your toes."
msgstr ""
"Las cosas se pusieron un poco raras de camino a tu clase de baile semanal. "
"Parece que los extraterrestres no saben bailar, pero no vas a dejar que te "
"pisen tus pies."

#. ~ Profession (Rude Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer got vaporized.  Now you're alone in"
" the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""
"Tu banda de ska se disolvió después de que el batería fuera vaporizado. "
"Ahora estás solo en el Cataclismo con unos cigarrillos y tu reproductor de "
"mp3."

#. ~ Profession (Rude Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your ska band broke up after the drummer got vaporized.  Now you're alone in"
" the Cataclysm with some cigarettes and your mp3 player."
msgstr ""
"Tu banda de ska se disolvió después de que el batería fuera vaporizado. "
"Ahora estás sola en el Cataclismo con unos cigarrillos y tu reproductor de "
"mp3."

#. ~ Profession (Imam) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community "
"in prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you; now they"
" come to tear you apart."
msgstr ""
"Antes del apocalipsis pasabas gran parte de tu tiempo en la mezquita local, "
"estudiando las palabras del Profeta y el Corán y guiando a tu comunidad en "
"la oración. Entonces venían de muy lejos a escucharte; ahora vienen a "
"destrozarte."

#. ~ Profession (Mourchida) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community "
"in prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you; now they"
" come to tear you apart."
msgstr ""
"Antes del apocalipsis pasabas gran parte de tu tiempo en la mezquita local, "
"estudiando las palabras del Profeta y el Corán y guiando a tu comunidad en "
"la oración. Entonces venían de muy lejos a escucharte; ahora vienen a "
"destrozarte."

#. ~ Profession (male Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If aliens have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"Llevas toda la vida enseñando a los niños, experimentando la alegría y el "
"agobio de impartir conocimientos a las mentes jóvenes. Si los "
"extraterrestres tienen algún interés en la educación, no lo demuestran."

#. ~ Profession (female Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've been teaching kids all your life, experiencing the joy and "
"aggravation of imparting knowledge to young minds.  If aliens have any "
"interest in education, they're not showing it."
msgstr ""
"Llevas toda la vida enseñando a los niños, experimentando la alegría y el "
"agobio de impartir conocimientos a las mentes jóvenes. Si los "
"extraterrestres tienen algún interés en la educación, no lo demuestran."

#. ~ Profession (male Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the aliens came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Solías cortar el césped y recortar los setos para los ricos. El trabajo "
"contratado escaseaba incluso antes de que llegaran los alienígenas, pero "
"ahora no te queda nada más que tus herramientas y tu experiencia."

#. ~ Profession (female Landscaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You used to mow lawns and trim hedges for the wealthy.  Contract work was "
"getting scarce even before the aliens came, but now you've got nothing left "
"except your tools and expertise."
msgstr ""
"Solías cortar el césped y recortar los setos para los ricos. El trabajo "
"contratado escaseaba incluso antes de que llegaran los alienígenas, pero "
"ahora no te queda nada más que tus herramientas y tu experiencia."

#. ~ Profession (male Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among those crystal things…"
msgstr ""
"Seguiste proporcionando cuidados a domicilio a los ancianos incluso cuando "
"el mundo entero se desmoronaba a tu alrededor. Sólo puedes rezar para no ver"
" a tus antiguos clientes entre esas cosas de cristal..."

#. ~ Profession (female Nursing Assistant) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You went on providing in-home care for the elderly even as the whole world "
"fell apart around you.  You can only pray that you don't see your former "
"clients among those crystal things…"
msgstr ""
"Seguiste proporcionando cuidados a domicilio a los ancianos incluso cuando "
"el mundo entero se desmoronaba a tu alrededor. Sólo puedes rezar para no ver"
" a tus antiguos clientes entre esas cosas de cristal..."

#. ~ Profession (male Otaku) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now aliens are killing everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Después de muchas noches con amigos viendo anime y comiendo bocadillos, "
"decidiste hacer el viaje a la principal convención de anime del noreste. "
"Ahora los alienígenas están matando a todo el mundo, y lo que es peor, ¡la "
"convención se ha cancelado! Al menos estabas preparado por si tu disfraz se "
"rompía."

#. ~ Profession (female Otaku) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After many late nights with friends watching anime and eating snacks, you "
"decided to make the trip to the premier anime convention in the Northeast.  "
"Now aliens are killing everyone, and even worse, the convention is "
"cancelled!  At least you were ready in case your costume tore."
msgstr ""
"Después de muchas noches con amigos viendo anime y comiendo bocadillos, "
"decidiste hacer el viaje a la principal convención de anime del noreste. "
"Ahora los alienígenas están matando a todo el mundo, y lo que es peor, ¡la "
"convención se ha cancelado! Al menos estabas preparado por si tu disfraz se "
"rompía."

#. ~ Profession (male Lawyer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the aliens started "
"invading, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"El jurado estaba en la palma de tu mano, pero después de que los "
"extraterrestres empezaran a invadir, te viste obligado a huir de la sala en "
"desacato. Ahora a nadie parece importarle tus objeciones."

#. ~ Profession (female Lawyer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The jury were in the palm of your hand, but after the aliens started "
"invading, you were forced to flee the courtroom in disgrace.  Now nobody "
"seems to care about your objections."
msgstr ""
"El jurado estaba en la palma de tu mano, pero después de que los "
"extraterrestres empezaran a invadir, te viste obligada a huir de la sala en "
"desacato. Ahora a nadie parece importarle tus objeciones."

#. ~ Profession (Pizza Delivery Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to the local cryogenics lab "
"when hungry aliens attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety,"
" you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas entregando la última pizza de la noche en el laboratorio criogénico "
"local cuando unos hambrientos alienígenas intentaron hacer de ti una comida."
" Huyendo por seguridad, te encuentras con sólo tu ingenio y algunas sobras "
"de pizza. ¡Y ni siquiera han dejado propina!."

#. ~ Profession (Pizza Delivery Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were delivering the last pizza of the night to the local cryogenics lab "
"when hungry aliens attempted to make a meal out of you.  Fleeing for safety,"
" you find yourself with only your wits and some leftover pizza.  And they "
"didn't even leave a tip!"
msgstr ""
"Estabas entregando la última pizza de la noche en el laboratorio criogénico "
"local cuando unos hambrientos alienígenas intentaron hacer de ti una comida."
" Huyendo por seguridad, te encuentras con sólo tu ingenio y algunas sobras "
"de pizza. ¡Y ni siquiera han dejado propina!."

#. ~ Profession (male Relief Volunteer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the storms picked up and the first bombs "
"dropped, you were eager to lend a hand.  But you had to cut your plans short"
" when the aliens arrived: they seem less interested in handouts, and more "
"interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin ánimo de lucro que se dedicaba a ayudar"
" donde se necesitaba ayuda. Cuando arreciaron las tormentas y cayeron las "
"primeras bombas, estabas ansioso por echar una mano. Pero tuviste que "
"truncar tus planes cuando llegaron los alienígenas: parecen menos "
"interesados en las limosnas y más en comerte."

#. ~ Profession (female Relief Volunteer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a member of a non-profit organization dedicated to helping out "
"where help was needed.  When the storms picked up and the first bombs "
"dropped, you were eager to lend a hand.  But you had to cut your plans short"
" when the aliens arrived: they seem less interested in handouts, and more "
"interested in eating you."
msgstr ""
"Eras miembro de una organización sin ánimo de lucro que se dedicaba a ayudar"
" donde se necesitaba ayuda. Cuando arreciaron las tormentas y cayeron las "
"primeras bombas, estabas ansiosa por echar una mano. Pero tuviste que "
"truncar tus planes cuando llegaron los alienígenas: parecen menos "
"interesados en las limosnas y más en comerte."

#. ~ Profession (male Guru) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned."
"  Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure "
"what to do about the ravenous aliens."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado muchos años viajando por el mundo, volviéndote sabio y erudito. "
"Normalmente, puedes responder a cualquier pregunta, pero ni siquiera tú "
"estás muy seguro de qué hacer con los voraces alienígenas."

#. ~ Profession (female Guru) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling through the world, becoming wise and learned."
"  Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure "
"what to do about the ravenous aliens."
msgstr ""
"Has pasado muchos años viajando por el mundo, volviéndote sabia y erudita. "
"Normalmente, puedes responder a cualquier pregunta, pero ni siquiera tú "
"estás muy seguro de qué hacer con los voraces alienígenas."

#. ~ Profession (male Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the aliens don't seem particularly moved by "
"your sermons."
msgstr ""
"Dedicaste tu vida a difundir la buena palabra, siempre en la carretera, "
"viajando de pueblo en pueblo. Ahora todo se ha ido al garete, no puedes "
"presentar tu podcast diario, y los extraterrestres no parecen especialmente "
"conmovidos por tus sermones."

#. ~ Profession (female Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word, always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the aliens don't seem particularly moved by "
"your sermons."
msgstr ""
"Dedicaste tu vida a difundir la buena palabra, siempre en la carretera, "
"viajando de pueblo en pueblo. Ahora todo se ha ido al garete, no puedes "
"presentar tu podcast diario, y los extraterrestres no parecen especialmente "
"conmovidos por tus sermones."

#. ~ Profession (male Roller Derby Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were hell on wheels.  Now the rest of your team is dead, and you "
"probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your penchant for high-"
"speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around "
"the aliens before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr ""
"Fuiste un infierno sobre ruedas. Ahora el resto de tu equipo está muerto, y "
"probablemente no habrías vivido tanto si no fuera por tu afición a la "
"violencia a alta velocidad. Las cosas se ven mal; ¿cuánto tiempo puedes dar "
"vueltas alrededor de los alienígenas antes de que te bloqueen "
"definitivamente?"

#. ~ Profession (female Roller Derby Player) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were hell on wheels.  Now the rest of your team is dead, and you "
"probably wouldn't have lived this long if not for your penchant for high-"
"speed violence.  Things are looking grim; how long can you race laps around "
"the aliens before you get blocked for good?"
msgstr ""
"Fuiste una infierno sobre ruedas. Ahora el resto de tu equipo está muerto, y"
" probablemente no habrías vivido tanto si no fuera por tu afición a la "
"violencia a alta velocidad. Las cosas se ven mal; ¿cuánto tiempo puedes dar "
"vueltas alrededor de los alienígenas antes de que te bloqueen "
"definitivamente?"

#. ~ Profession (male Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two got eaten, you ditched.  Maybe "
"you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"Intentar reunir a los gente cada semana te ha enseñado algo: normalmente es "
"mejor cortar por lo sano y confiar en tu instinto. Por eso, cuando dos de "
"ellos no se presentaron y los otros dos fueron devorados, lo dejaste. Quizá "
"puedas encontrar nuevos jugadores en las ruinas del mundo."

#. ~ Profession (female Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Trying to herd cats into meeting up every week has taught you something: "
"it's usually better to cut your losses and trust your gut.  For that reason,"
" when you had two no-shows and the other two got eaten, you ditched.  Maybe "
"you can find some new players in the ruins of the world."
msgstr ""
"Intentar reunir a los gente cada semana te ha enseñado algo: normalmente es "
"mejor cortar por lo sano y confiar en tu instinto. Por eso, cuando dos de "
"ellos no se presentaron y los otros dos fueron devorados, lo dejaste. Quizá "
"puedas encontrar nuevos jugadores en las ruinas del mundo."

#. ~ Profession (Frat Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, a bomb landed right in "
"the hot tub, but you still have a chance to use the last symbol of your "
"luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la buena vida, gastando el dinero de tus padres sin ninguna"
" preocupación en el mundo. En una de tus usuales fiestas locas, una bomba "
"cayó justo en el jacuzzi pero todavía te queda la posibilidad de usar el "
"último símbolo de una vida de lujos - tu coche deportivo - e irte bien "
"lejos."

#. ~ Profession (Sorority Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life, spending your parents' money without a care "
"in the world.  At one of your usual crazy parties, a bomb landed right in "
"the hot tub, but you still have a chance to use the last symbol of your "
"luxurious life - your sports car - and get far away."
msgstr ""
"Estabas viviendo la buena vida, gastando el dinero de tus padres sin ninguna"
" preocupación en el mundo. En una de tus usuales fiestas locas, una bomba "
"cayó justo en el jacuzzi pero todavía te queda la posibilidad de usar el "
"último símbolo de una vida de lujos - tu coche deportivo - e irte bien "
"lejos."

#. ~ Profession (male Lab Technician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you avoid "
"getting experimented on in return?"
msgstr ""
"Gracias a los años de estudio y al duro trabajo en el laboratorio, estás "
"familiarizado con los fundamentos de la investigación científica. Sólo queda"
" una pregunta: ¿puedes evitar que te hagan experimentos a cambio?"

#. ~ Profession (female Lab Technician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Thanks to years of study and hard work in the lab, you're familiar with the "
"basics of scientific inquiry.  Only one question remains: can you avoid "
"getting experimented on in return?"
msgstr ""
"Gracias a los años de estudio y al duro trabajo en el laboratorio, estás "
"familiarizado con los fundamentos de la investigación científica. Sólo queda"
" una pregunta: ¿puedes evitar que te hagan experimentos a cambio?"

#. ~ Profession (Paperboy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The aliens "
"don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle is "
"still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Esta mañana has salido a dar las noticias del apocalipsis. Los alienígenas "
"no parecen valorar las últimas noticias, pero al menos tu fiel bicicleta "
"sigue funcionando."

#. ~ Profession (Papergirl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You set out this morning to deliver the news of the apocalypse.  The aliens "
"don't seem to value the latest news, but at least your trusty bicycle is "
"still in working order."
msgstr ""
"Esta mañana has salido a dar las noticias del apocalipsis. Los alienígenas "
"no parecen valorar las últimas noticias, pero al menos tu fiel bicicleta "
"sigue funcionando."

#. ~ Profession (male National Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"storms and the following bombings.  Despite your best efforts, you were "
"unable to form up before all communications ceased and you found yourself "
"alone amongst the enemy."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para hacer frente a las "
"crecientes tormentas y a los siguientes bombardeos. A pesar de tus mejores "
"esfuerzos, no pudiste constituirte antes de que cesaran todas las "
"comunicaciones y te encontraste solo entre el enemigo."

#. ~ Profession (female National Guard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The government activated your National Guard unit to deal with the growing "
"storms and the following bombings.  Despite your best efforts, you were "
"unable to form up before all communications ceased and you found yourself "
"alone amongst the enemy."
msgstr ""
"El gobierno activó tu unidad de la Guardia Nacional para hacer frente a las "
"crecientes tormentas y a los siguientes bombardeos. A pesar de tus mejores "
"esfuerzos, no pudiste constituirte antes de que cesaran todas las "
"comunicaciones y te encontraste solo entre el enemigo."

#. ~ Profession (male Gym Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"It was hard enough getting kids to run laps without having to worry about "
"doing it in a warzone.  Aliens won't even line up when you blow your "
"whistle."
msgstr ""
"Ya es bastante difícil conseguir que los niños corran sin tener que "
"preocuparse por hacerlo en una zona de guerra. Los extraterrestres ni "
"siquiera se alinean cuando tocas el silbato."

#. ~ Profession (female Gym Teacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"It was hard enough getting kids to run laps without having to worry about "
"doing it in a warzone.  Aliens won't even line up when you blow your "
"whistle."
msgstr ""
"Ya es bastante difícil conseguir que los niños corran sin tener que "
"preocuparse por hacerlo en una zona de guerra. Los extraterrestres ni "
"siquiera se alinean cuando tocas el silbato."

#. ~ Profession (male Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you've somehow ended up deep behind enemy lines."
msgstr ""
"Te abriste camino a través de los rangos, desde un soldado raso sin nombre, "
"hasta un importante General de División. Sin embargo, hace años que no "
"disparas un arma con rabia y, de alguna manera, has acabado en lo más "
"profundo de las líneas enemigas."

#. ~ Profession (female Major General) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You worked your way up through the ranks, from a no-name private, to a big "
"shot Major General.  Now however, it is years since you last fired a weapon "
"in anger, and you've somehow ended up deep behind enemy lines."
msgstr ""
"Te abriste camino a través de los rangos, desde una soldada rasa sin nombre,"
" hasta una importante General de División. Sin embargo, hace años que no "
"disparas un arma con rabia y, de alguna manera, has acabado en lo más "
"profundo de las líneas enemigas."

#. ~ Profession (male Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  After a hot deployment, as far as you can tell you're one of the"
" last active personnel in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente entraste, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por algún "
"tipo de emergencia nacional. Tras un caluroso despliegue, por lo que puedes "
"ver eres uno de los últimos efectivos en activo en este infierno."

#. ~ Profession (female Military Recruit) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Joining the military has been your dream for years.  You finally got in, "
"just in time for your training to get interrupted by some sort of national "
"emergency.  After a hot deployment, as far as you can tell you're one of the"
" last active personnel in this hellhole."
msgstr ""
"Entrar en el ejército ha sido tu sueño durante años. Finalmente entraste, "
"justo a tiempo para que tu entrenamiento se viera interrumpido por algún "
"tipo de emergencia nacional. Tras un caluroso despliegue, por lo que puedes "
"ver eres una de los últimos efectivos en activo en este infierno."

#. ~ Profession (male Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and now the sky is"
" falling…"
msgstr ""
"No superaste el bachillerato y te alistaste en el ejército. Pronto te "
"eligieron para un entrenamiento extra en el oficio de mecánico, para "
"mantener las armaduras en funcionamiento. Hacía años que no tocabas un "
"fusil, y ahora el cielo se está cayendo..."

#. ~ Profession (female Combat Mechanic) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You failed out of high school, and joined the army.  You were soon hand "
"picked for extra training in the mechanics trade, keeping the armour "
"running.  It's been years since you last touched a rifle, and now the sky is"
" falling…"
msgstr ""
"No superaste el bachillerato y te alistaste en el ejército. Pronto te "
"eligieron para un entrenamiento extra en el oficio de mecánica, para "
"mantener las armaduras en funcionamiento. Hacía años que no tocabas un "
"fusil, y ahora el cielo se está cayendo..."

#. ~ Profession (male Riot Control Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were keeping the peace at a local climate change protest when the bombs "
"started dropping and aliens started appearing in the streets.  It was only "
"by luck that you manage to survive the crowd in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Estabas manteniendo la paz en una protesta local contra el cambio climático "
"cuando empezaron a caer las bombas y a aparecer alienígenas en las calles. "
"Sólo por suerte lograste sobrevivir a la multitud en una pieza, y lo peor "
"está por llegar."

#. ~ Profession (female Riot Control Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were keeping the peace at a local climate change protest when the bombs "
"started dropping and aliens started appearing in the streets.  It was only "
"by luck that you manage to survive the crowd in one piece, and the worst is "
"yet to come."
msgstr ""
"Estabas manteniendo la paz en una protesta local contra el cambio climático "
"cuando empezaron a caer las bombas y a aparecer alienígenas en las calles. "
"Sólo por suerte lograste sobrevivir a la multitud en una pieza, y lo peor "
"está por llegar."

#. ~ Profession (male Trucker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the bombs hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Una vez gobernaste la carretera en tu gran camión. Cuando las bombas "
"cayeron, te subiste y condujiste hasta un lugar seguro. Ahora sólo estas tú "
"y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Profession (female Trucker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You once ruled the road in your big rig.  When the bombs hit, you hopped in "
"and drove it to safety.  Now it's just you and your truck against the world."
msgstr ""
"Una vez gobernaste la carretera en tu gran camión. Cuando las bombas "
"cayeron, te subiste y condujiste hasta un lugar seguro. Ahora sólo estas tú "
"y tu camión contra el mundo."

#. ~ Profession (male Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when aliens invaded the piste.  The referee"
" was blown away, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo se vio interrumpido cuando unos alienígenas "
"invadieron la pista. El árbitro salió volando, así que no estás seguro de "
"que las reglas sigan vigentes."

#. ~ Profession (female Competitive Fencer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Years of training prepared you for the competitive fencing circuit, but your"
" latest tournament was cut short when aliens invaded the piste.  The referee"
" was blown away, so you're not sure if the rules are still in play."
msgstr ""
"Años de entrenamiento te prepararon para el circuito competitivo de esgrima,"
" pero tu último torneo se vio interrumpido cuando unos alienígenas "
"invadieron la pista. El árbitro salió volando, así que no estás seguro de "
"que las reglas sigan vigentes."

#. ~ Profession (male Career Politician) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent your life appealing to the people, persuading many and "
"promising much throughout your time in office.  Now that your voting base is"
" dead or worse and hostile forces are in America's heartland, winning hearts"
" and minds just got that much harder."
msgstr ""

