#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Pyromaniac Kelvinist"
msgstr "Pirómano Kelvinista"

#. ~ Profession (male Pyromaniac Kelvinist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You have loved fire all of your life.  You have now discovered your inner "
"fire, and want to exercise that upon the world."
msgstr ""
"Has amado el fuego toda tu vida. Ahora has descubierto tu fuego interior y "
"deseas ejercerlo sobre el mundo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Pyromaniac Kelvinist"
msgstr "Pirómana Kelvinista"

#. ~ Profession (female Pyromaniac Kelvinist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You have loved fire all of your life.  You have now discovered your inner "
"fire, and want to exercise that upon the world."
msgstr ""
"Has amado el fuego toda tu vida. Ahora has descubierto tu fuego interior y "
"deseas ejercerlo sobre el mundo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "Druida"

#. ~ Profession (male Druid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The ancient circle of druids is gone with the Cataclysm.  Nature must "
"thrive."
msgstr ""
"El antiguo círculo de druidas se ha ido con el Cataclismo. La naturaleza "
"debe prosperar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Druid"
msgstr "Druida"

#. ~ Profession (female Druid) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The ancient circle of druids is gone with the Cataclysm.  Nature must "
"thrive."
msgstr ""
"El antiguo círculo de druidas se ha ido con el Cataclismo. La naturaleza "
"debe prosperar."

#. ~ Profession (male Priest) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the apocalypse struck you did everything you could to protect your "
"parish faithful, but it appears that prayers were not enough.  Now that they"
" are all dead, you should probably find something more tangible to protect "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegó el apocalipsis, hiciste todo lo posible para proteger a los "
"fieles de tu parroquia, pero parece que las oraciones no fueron suficientes."
" Ahora que están todos muertos, probablemente deberías encontrar algo más "
"tangible para protegerte."

#. ~ Profession (female Priest) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the apocalypse struck you did everything you could to protect your "
"parish faithful, but it appears that prayers were not enough.  Now that they"
" are all dead, you should probably find something more tangible to protect "
"you."
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegó el apocalipsis, hiciste todo lo posible para proteger a los "
"fieles de tu parroquia, pero parece que las oraciones no fueron suficientes."
" Ahora que están todos muertos, probablemente deberías encontrar algo más "
"tangible para protegerte."

#. ~ Profession (Imam) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community "
"in prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you, now they"
" come to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste mucho tiempo antes del apocalipsis en la mezquita local, estudiando "
"las palabras del Profeta y el Corán y guiando a tu comunidad en la oración. "
"En aquel entonces venían de todas partes para escucharte, ahora vienen a "
"comerte los sesos."

#. ~ Profession (Mourchida) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent much of your time prior to the apocalypse at the local mosque, "
"studying the words of the Prophet and the Quran and guiding your community "
"in prayer.  Back then they came from far and wide to listen to you, now they"
" come to eat your brains."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste mucho tiempo antes del apocalipsis en la mezquita local, estudiando "
"las palabras del Profeta y el Corán y guiando a tu comunidad en la oración. "
"En aquel entonces venían de todas partes para escucharte, ahora vienen a "
"comerte los sesos."

#. ~ Profession (male Guru) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling the world, becoming wise and learned.  "
"Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure what "
"to do about the ravenous undead."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste muchos años viajando por el mundo, volviéndote sabio y culto. "
"Normalmente, puedes responder a cualquier pregunta, pero incluso tú no estás"
" seguro de qué hacer con los muertos vivientes."

#. ~ Profession (female Guru) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You spent many years traveling the world, becoming wise and learned.  "
"Normally, you can answer any question, but even you are not quite sure what "
"to do about the ravenous undead."
msgstr ""
"Pasaste muchos años viajando por el mundo, volviéndote sabio y culto. "
"Normalmente, puedes responder a cualquier pregunta, pero incluso tú no estás"
" seguro de qué hacer con los muertos vivientes."

#. ~ Profession (male Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word; always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the undead listening to your sermons don't seem"
" particularly moved."
msgstr ""
"Dedicó su vida a difundir la buena palabra; siempre en el camino, viajando "
"de ciudad en ciudad. Ahora todo se ha ido al infierno, no puedes presentar "
"tu podcast diario, y los no-muertos que escuchan tus sermones no parecen "
"particularmente conmovidos."

#. ~ Profession (female Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You devoted your life to spreading the good word; always on the road, "
"traveling from town to town.  Now everything has gone to hell, you can't "
"host your daily podcast, and the undead listening to your sermons don't seem"
" particularly moved."
msgstr ""
"Dedicó su vida a difundir la buena palabra; siempre en el camino, viajando "
"de ciudad en ciudad. Ahora todo se ha ido al infierno, no puedes presentar "
"tu podcast diario, y los no-muertos que escuchan tus sermones no parecen "
"particularmente conmovidos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Necromancer"
msgstr "Nigromante Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Necromancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable "
"type of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to "
"pull every trick out of the book."
msgstr ""
"Siempre tuviste que esconder tu magia, ya que generalmente no era un tipo de"
" magia aceptable en el mundo de los magos, pero con el Cataclismo tienes que"
" sacar todos los trucos del libro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Necromancer"
msgstr "Nigromante Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Necromancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always had to hide your magic, as it was generally not an acceptable "
"type of magic in the wizarding world, but with the Cataclysm you need to "
"pull every trick out of the book."
msgstr ""
"Siempre tuviste que esconder tu magia, ya que generalmente no era un tipo de"
" magia aceptable en el mundo de los magos, pero con el Cataclismo tienes que"
" sacar todos los trucos del libro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Stormshaper"
msgstr "Moldeador de Tormentas Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Stormshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  "
"Recently you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself "
"through arcane means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your "
"power, as events unfolded…"
msgstr ""
"Hijo de un meteorólogo, siempre te interesó el clima. ¡Recientemente "
"descubriste que era posible manipular el clima por ti mismo a través de "
"medios arcanos! Desafortunadamente no tuviste mucho tiempo para disfrutar de"
" tu poder, a medida que los eventos se desarrollaban..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Stormshaper"
msgstr "Moldeador de Tormentas Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Stormshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The son of a weatherman, you were always interested in the weather.  "
"Recently you found it was possible to manipulate the weather yourself "
"through arcane means!  Unfortunately you did not have long to enjoy your "
"power, as events unfolded…"
msgstr ""
"Hijo de un meteorólogo, siempre te interesó el clima. ¡Recientemente "
"descubriste que era posible manipular el clima por ti mismo a través de "
"medios arcanos! Desafortunadamente no tuviste mucho tiempo para disfrutar de"
" tu poder, a medida que los eventos se desarrollaban..."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Earthshaper"
msgstr "Terraformante Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Earthshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always were tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick "
"or two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste duro en una pelea. Tu entrenador se las arregló para "
"enseñarte uno o dos trucos para hacerte un poco más duro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Earthshaper"
msgstr "Terraformante Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Earthshaper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always were tough in a fight.  Your coach managed to teach you a trick "
"or two to make you a little tougher."
msgstr ""
"Siempre fuiste duro en una pelea. Tu entrenador se las arregló para "
"enseñarte uno o dos trucos para hacerte un poco más duro."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Novice Technomancer"
msgstr "Tecnomante Novato"

#. ~ Profession (male Novice Technomancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr ""
"Con el reciente Cataclismo, la forma que encontrastes de hacer trampas en "
"los exámenes puede tener algún otro uso."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Novice Technomancer"
msgstr "Tecnomante Novata"

#. ~ Profession (female Novice Technomancer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the recent Cataclysm, the way you found to cheat on tests may have to "
"find some other use."
msgstr ""
"Con el reciente Cataclismo, la forma que encontrastes de hacer trampas en "
"los exámenes puede tener algún otro uso."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Introspectionist"
msgstr "Introspeccionista"

#. ~ Profession (male Introspectionist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You segregated yourself from society because you wanted to concentrate on "
"improving yourself.  It was you and your best friend, but now the apocalypse"
" won't leave you alone."
msgstr ""
"Te apartaste de la sociedad porque querías concentrarte en mejorarte a ti "
"mismo. Eras tú y tu mejor amigo, pero ahora el apocalipsis no te deja en "
"paz."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Introspectionist"
msgstr "Introspeccionista"

#. ~ Profession (female Introspectionist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You segregated yourself from society because you wanted to concentrate on "
"improving yourself.  It was you and your best friend, but now the apocalypse"
" won't leave you alone."
msgstr ""
"Te apartaste de la sociedad porque querías concentrarte en mejorarte a ti "
"mismo. Eras tú y tu mejor amigo, pero ahora el apocalipsis no te deja en "
"paz."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Vengeful Preacher"
msgstr "Predicador Vengativo"

#. ~ Profession (male Vengeful Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You lost your faith when your spouse died of illness.  You've been drinking "
"yourself to death ever since.  God is punishing everyone with this "
"apocalypse, you are going to show them your brand of mercy."
msgstr ""
"Perdiste la fe cuando tu esposa murió por una enfermedad. Desde entonces has"
" estado bebiendo hasta la muerte. Dios está castigando a todos con este "
"apocalipsis, tú vas a mostrarles tu marca de misericordia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Vengeful Preacher"
msgstr "Predicadora Vengativa"

#. ~ Profession (female Vengeful Preacher) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You lost your faith when your spouse died of illness.  You've been drinking "
"yourself to death ever since.  God is punishing everyone with this "
"apocalypse, you are going to show them your brand of mercy."
msgstr ""
"Perdiste la fe cuando tu esposo murió por una enfermedad. Desde entonces has"
" estado bebiendo hasta la muerte. Dios está castigando a todos con este "
"apocalipsis, tú vas a mostrarles tu marca de misericordia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Techno-Prepper"
msgstr "Preparador Tecno"

#. ~ Profession (male Techno-Prepper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've long suspected the world might suddenly turn over.  With your "
"training, spells, and revolver, your chances are far better than most."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo que sospechas que el mundo podría cambiar de repente. Con tu "
"entrenamiento, tus hechizos y tu revólver, tus posibilidades son mucho "
"mayores que las de la mayoría."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Techno-Prepper"
msgstr "Preparadora Tecno"

#. ~ Profession (female Techno-Prepper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've long suspected the world might suddenly turn over.  With your "
"training, spells, and revolver, your chances are far better than most."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo que sospechas que el mundo podría cambiar de repente. Con tu "
"entrenamiento, tus hechizos y tu revólver, tus posibilidades son mucho "
"mayores que las de la mayoría."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Pseudovamp"
msgstr "Pseudovampiro Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Pseudovamp) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've long had an obsession with horror novels, and used your wealth to "
"augment yourself with spells and bionics into a denizen of the night.  Your "
"neglect to your health in your pursuit has left you pale and unlively."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo que estás obsesionado con las novelas de horror y utilizaste tu "
"riqueza para convertirte en un habitante de la noche con hechizos y biónica."
" El descuido de tu salud en tu búsqueda te ha dejado pálido y sin vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Pseudovamp"
msgstr "Pseudovampira Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Pseudovamp) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've long had an obsession with horror novels, and used your wealth to "
"augment yourself with spells and bionics into a denizen of the night.  Your "
"neglect to your health in your pursuit has left you pale and unlively."
msgstr ""
"Hace tiempo que estás obsesionada con las novelas de horror y utilizaste tu "
"riqueza para convertirte en una habitante de la noche con hechizos y "
"biónica. El descuido de tu salud en tu búsqueda te ha dejado pálido y sin "
"vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Academy Wizard"
msgstr "Mago de Academia"

#. ~ Profession (male Academy Wizard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, "
"and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead"
" and classes cancelled, the final lesson has begun."
msgstr ""
"Un año de matrícula en una academia de magos te ha enseñado paciencia, "
"sabiduría y un puñado de hechizos útiles. Con los profesores convertidos en "
"muertos vivientes y las clases canceladas, la lección final ha comenzado."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Academy Wizard"
msgstr "Maga de Academia"

#. ~ Profession (female Academy Wizard) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A year of enrollment in a wizard's academy has taught you patience, wisdom, "
"and a handful of useful spells.  With the teachers converted into the undead"
" and classes cancelled, the final lesson has begun."
msgstr ""
"Un año de matrícula en una academia de magos te ha enseñado paciencia, "
"sabiduría y un puñado de hechizos útiles. Con los profesores convertidos en "
"muertos vivientes y las clases canceladas, la lección final ha comenzado."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Corrosive Rocker"
msgstr "Rockero Corrosivo"

#. ~ Profession (male Corrosive Rocker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your metal career soared to new heights when you swapped special effects for"
" acrid gore and spiked whips.  It seems the Cataclysm is now your final "
"tour."
msgstr ""
"Tu carrera en el mundo del metal alcanzó nuevas cotas cuando cambiaste los "
"efectos especiales por el gore acre y los látigos con pinchos. Parece que el"
" Cataclismo es ahora tu última gira."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Corrosive Rocker"
msgstr "Rockera Corrosiva"

#. ~ Profession (female Corrosive Rocker) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your metal career soared to new heights when you swapped special effects for"
" acrid gore and spiked whips.  It seems the Cataclysm is now your final "
"tour."
msgstr ""
"Tu carrera en el mundo del metal alcanzó nuevas cotas cuando cambiaste los "
"efectos especiales por el gore acre y los látigos con pinchos. Parece que el"
" Cataclismo es ahora tu última gira."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Shock Officer"
msgstr "Oficial Eléctrico"

#. ~ Profession (male Shock Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were enrolled in a experimental law enforcement program designed to "
"decrease suspect casualties and equipment costs by substituting tasers and "
"bullets for less-lethal Stormshaping."
msgstr ""
"Te inscribiste en un programa experimental de aplicación de la ley diseñado "
"para disminuir las bajas de los sospechosos y los costes de equipamiento, "
"sustituyendo las pistolas eléctricas y las balas por el menos letal Moldeado"
" de Tormentas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Shock Officer"
msgstr "Oficial Eléctrico"

#. ~ Profession (female Shock Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were enrolled in a experimental law enforcement program designed to "
"decrease suspect casualties and equipment costs by substituting tasers and "
"bullets for less-lethal Stormshaping."
msgstr ""
"Te inscribiste en un programa experimental de aplicación de la ley diseñado "
"para disminuir las bajas de los sospechosos y los costes de equipamiento, "
"sustituyendo las pistolas eléctricas y las balas por el menos letal Moldeado"
" de Tormentas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Earthquake Brawler"
msgstr "Matón Terremoto"

#. ~ Profession (male Earthquake Brawler) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've made a name for yourself in underground magic boxing rings as an "
"unstoppable punching machine.  Now that all your opponents are undead, "
"there's no need to hold back."
msgstr ""
"Te has hecho un nombre en los cuadriláteros de boxeo mágico clandestino como"
" una máquina de golpear imparable. Ahora que todos tus oponentes son muertos"
" vivientes, no hay necesidad de contenerse."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Earthquake Brawler"
msgstr "Matóna Terremoto"

#. ~ Profession (female Earthquake Brawler) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've made a name for yourself in underground magic boxing rings as an "
"unstoppable punching machine.  Now that all your opponents are undead, "
"there's no need to hold back."
msgstr ""
"Te has hecho un nombre en los cuadriláteros de boxeo mágico clandestino como"
" una máquina de golpear imparable. Ahora que todos tus oponentes son muertos"
" vivientes, no hay necesidad de contenerse."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Illicit Fleshmender"
msgstr "Rememdador de Carne Ilícito"

#. ~ Profession (male Illicit Fleshmender) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and "
"combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to "
"kill you, the lack of a license is the least of your worries."
msgstr ""
"Tras fracasar en la facultad de medicina, tomaste sus métodos mundanos y los"
" combinaste con la magia para salvar a tus pacientes. Ahora que todos "
"quieren matarte, la falta de licencia es la menor de tus preocupaciones."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Illicit Fleshmender"
msgstr "Rememdadora de Carne Ilícita"

#. ~ Profession (female Illicit Fleshmender) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After failing out of medical school, you took their mundane methods and "
"combined it with magic to save your patients.  Now that they all want to "
"kill you, the lack of a license is the least of your worries."
msgstr ""
"Tras fracasar en la facultad de medicina, tomaste sus métodos mundanos y los"
" combinaste con la magia para salvar a tus pacientes. Ahora que todos "
"quieren matarte, la falta de licencia es la menor de tus preocupaciones."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Wildborne Rider"
msgstr "Jinete Nacido Salvaje"

#. ~ Profession (male Wildborne Rider) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Abandoned at a young age and raised by moose, you had to master the wilds to"
" survive.  While the modern world has been devoured, you and your steed are "
"no stranger to hardship."
msgstr ""
"Abandonado a una edad temprana y criado por los alces, tuviste que dominar "
"la naturaleza para sobrevivir. Aunque el mundo moderno ha sido devorado, tú "
"y tu corcel no sois ajenos a las dificultades."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Wildborne Rider"
msgstr "Jinete Nacida Salvaje"

#. ~ Profession (female Wildborne Rider) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Abandoned at a young age and raised by moose, you had to master the wilds to"
" survive.  While the modern world has been devoured, you and your steed are "
"no stranger to hardship."
msgstr ""
"Abandonada a una edad temprana y criada por los alces, tuviste que dominar "
"la naturaleza para sobrevivir. Aunque el mundo moderno ha sido devorado, tú "
"y tu corcel no sois ajenos a las dificultades."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Deep-Cold Marksman"
msgstr "Francotirador Bajo Cero"

#. ~ Profession (male Deep-Cold Marksman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were a special operative conducting covert sniper ops in sub-zero "
"temperatures, and had just finished your tour when society was destroyed.  "
"Having retained your gear, it's time to join the new war."
msgstr ""
"Eras un agente especial que realizaba operaciones encubiertas de "
"francotirador a temperaturas bajo cero, y acababas de terminar tu último "
"tour cuando la sociedad fue destruida. Habiendo conservado tu equipamiento, "
"es hora de unirte a la nueva guerra."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Deep-Cold Marksman"
msgstr "Francotiradora Bajo Cero"

#. ~ Profession (female Deep-Cold Marksman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were a special operative conducting covert sniper ops in sub-zero "
"temperatures, and had just finished your tour when society was destroyed.  "
"Having retained your gear, it's time to join the new war."
msgstr ""
"Eras una agente especial que realizaba operaciones encubiertas de "
"francotirador a temperaturas bajo cero, y acababas de terminar tu último "
"tour cuando la sociedad fue destruida. Habiendo conservado tu equipamiento, "
"es hora de unirte a la nueva guerra."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Arsonist"
msgstr "Pirómano"

#. ~ Profession (male Arsonist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Penned in a cell without fuel, you've been extinguished for years for "
"setting buildings on fire.  In your escape, you grabbed your familiar tool "
"to reignite the embers."
msgstr ""
"Encerrado en una celda sin combustible, llevas apagado durante años por "
"incendiar edificios. En tu huida, agarraste tu conocida herramienta para "
"reavivar las brasas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Arsonist"
msgstr "Pirómano"

#. ~ Profession (female Arsonist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Penned in a cell without fuel, you've been extinguished for years for "
