"to reignite the embers."
msgstr ""
"Encerrada en una celda sin combustible, llevas apagada durante años por "
"incendiar edificios. En tu huida, agarraste tu conocida herramienta para "
"reavivar las brasas."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Ecoterrorist"
msgstr "Ecoterrorista"

#. ~ Profession (male Ecoterrorist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"These bastards were destroying Earth far before the undead came, and mauling"
" those execs was worth the federal charges.  Now, you may have greater "
"priorities than pollution."
msgstr ""
"Estos bastardos estaban destruyendo la Tierra mucho antes de que llegaran "
"los muertos vivientes, y destrozar a esos ejecutivos merecía los cargos "
"federales. Ahora, puede que tengas mayores prioridades que la contaminación."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Ecoterrorist"
msgstr "Ecoterrorista"

#. ~ Profession (female Ecoterrorist) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"These bastards were destroying Earth far before the undead came, and mauling"
" those execs was worth the federal charges.  Now, you may have greater "
"priorities than pollution."
msgstr ""
"Estos bastardos estaban destruyendo la Tierra mucho antes de que llegaran "
"los muertos vivientes, y destrozar a esos ejecutivos merecía los cargos "
"federales. Ahora, puede que tengas mayores prioridades que la contaminación."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Frost Cream Man"
msgstr "Hombre de Crema Helada"

#. ~ Profession (Frost Cream Man) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You learned Kelvinist spells to keep equipment costs down on your ice cream "
"truck.  While their tastes have changed, the kids still scream for you."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido hechizos kelvinistas para mantener bajos los costes de "
"equipamiento de tu camión de helados. Aunque sus gustos han cambiado, los "
"niños siguen gritando por ti."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Frost Cream Woman"
msgstr "Mujer de Crema Helada"

#. ~ Profession (Frost Cream Woman) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You learned Kelvinist spells to keep equipment costs down on your ice cream "
"truck.  While their tastes have changed, the kids still scream for you."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido hechizos kelvinistas para mantener bajos los costes de "
"equipamiento de tu camión de helados. Aunque sus gustos han cambiado, los "
"niños siguen gritando por ti."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Knife Thrower"
msgstr "Lanzador de Cuchillos"

#. ~ Profession (male Knife Thrower) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You entertained the masses, displaying an expert hand tossing knives "
"conjured from nowhere.  Now, you're bringing the show to them."
msgstr ""
"Has entretenido a las masas, mostrando una mano experta lanzando cuchillos "
"conjurados de la nada. Ahora, estás llevando el espectáculo a ellos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Knife Thrower"
msgstr "Lanzadora de Cuchillos"

#. ~ Profession (female Knife Thrower) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You entertained the masses, displaying an expert hand tossing knives "
"conjured from nowhere.  Now, you're bringing the show to them."
msgstr ""
"Has entretenido a las masas, mostrando una mano experta lanzando cuchillos "
"conjurados de la nada. Ahora, estás llevando el espectáculo a ellos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Sugar Boy"
msgstr "Chico Azúcar"

#. ~ Profession (Sugar Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You're a human shaped candy brought to life under unknown circumstances.  "
"You have your whole life ahead of you and it's gonna be sweet!"
msgstr ""
"Eres un caramelo con forma humana que cobra vida en circunstancias "
"desconocidas. ¡Tienes toda la vida por delante y va a ser dulce!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Sugar Girl"
msgstr "Chica Azucar"

#. ~ Profession (Sugar Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You're a human shaped candy brought to life under unknown circumstances.  "
"You have your whole life ahead of you and it's gonna be sweet!"
msgstr ""
"Eres un caramelo con forma humana que cobra vida en circunstancias "
"desconocidas. ¡Tienes toda la vida por delante y va a ser dulce!"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Athlete"
msgstr "Atleta Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Athlete) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You'll never get your shot at the Cyberolympics.  All that's left of your "
"dream is a single leftover protein shake.  Well, that and your bulging, "
"cybernetically-enhanced muscles."
msgstr ""
"Nunca tendrás tu oportunidad en las Ciberolimpiadas. Todo lo que queda de tu"
" sueño es un único batido de proteínas sobrante. Bueno, eso y tus abultados "
"músculos mejorados cibernéticamente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Athlete"
msgstr "Atleta Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Athlete) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You'll never get your shot at the Cyberolympics.  All that's left of your "
"dream is a single leftover protein shake.  Well, that and your bulging, "
"cybernetically-enhanced muscles."
msgstr ""
"Nunca tendrás tu oportunidad en las Ciberolimpiadas. Todo lo que queda de tu"
" sueño es un único batido de proteínas sobrante. Bueno, eso y tus abultados "
"músculos mejorados cibernéticamente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Police Officer"
msgstr "Ag. Biónico de Policía"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Police Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Mortally injured in the line of duty, you were resurrected by the surgeons "
"from the department's revolutionary Cybercop program.  Now, in these lawless"
" times, you are truly the future of law enforcement."
msgstr ""
"Mortalmente herido en el cumplimiento del deber, fuiste resucitado por los "
"cirujanos del programa del departamento revolucionario de Ciberpolicías. "
"Ahora, en estos tiempos sin leyes, eres verdaderamente el futuro de las "
"fuerzas de la ley."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Police Officer"
msgstr "Ag. Biónica de Policía"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Police Officer) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Mortally injured in the line of duty, you were resurrected by the surgeons "
"from the department's revolutionary Cybercop program.  Now, in these lawless"
" times, you are truly the future of law enforcement."
msgstr ""
"Mortalmente herida en el cumplimiento del deber, fuiste resucitada por los "
"cirujanos del programa del departamento revolucionario de Ciberpolicías. "
"Ahora, en estos tiempos sin leyes, eres verdaderamente el futuro de las "
"fuerzas de la ley."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Commercial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Comercial"

#. ~ Profession (male Commercial Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You always had to have the latest and best gadgets and gizmos, so is it any "
"wonder that you upgraded your flesh along with your smart phone?"
msgstr ""
"Siempre has tenido que tener los últimos y mejores gadgets y artilugios, así"
" que ¿es de extrañar que hayas actualizado tu carne junto con tu teléfono "
"inteligente?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Commercial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Comercial"

#. ~ Profession (female Commercial Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You always had to have the latest and best gadgets and gizmos, so is it any "
"wonder that you upgraded your flesh along with your smart phone?"
msgstr ""
"Siempre has tenido que tener los últimos y mejores gadgets y artilugios, así"
" que ¿es de extrañar que hayas actualizado tu carne junto con tu teléfono "
"inteligente?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombero Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As a second-generation augmented firefighter, you have been cybernetically "
"enhanced to operate in the most dire of emergency situations.  You're pretty"
" sure this counts."
msgstr ""
"Como bombero aumentado de segunda generación, has sido mejorado "
"cibernéticamente para actuar en las situaciones de emergencia más graves. "
"Estás seguro de que esto cuenta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Firefighter"
msgstr "Bombera Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Firefighter) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As a second-generation augmented firefighter, you have been cybernetically "
"enhanced to operate in the most dire of emergency situations.  You're pretty"
" sure this counts."
msgstr ""
"Como bombera aumentada de segunda generación, has sido mejorada "
"cibernéticamente para actuar en las situaciones de emergencia más graves. "
"Estás seguro de que esto cuenta."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Game Master"
msgstr "Game Master Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You came into a large fortune, through luck or will, and hosted games for "
"world-famous celebrities.  You could afford to spoil your players, and so "
"you did.  You invested in bionics to make you smarter and memorized the "
"entire handbook.  Let's hope that knowledge helps you now."
msgstr ""
"Te hiciste con una gran fortuna, por suerte o por voluntad, y organizaste "
"juegos para celebridades de fama mundial. Podías permitirte mimar a tus "
"jugadores, y así lo hiciste. Invertiste en biónica para hacerte más "
"inteligente y memorizaste el manual entero. Esperemos que ese conocimiento "
"te ayude ahora."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Game Master"
msgstr "Game Master Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Game Master) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You came into a large fortune, through luck or will, and hosted games for "
"world-famous celebrities.  You could afford to spoil your players, and so "
"you did.  You invested in bionics to make you smarter and memorized the "
"entire handbook.  Let's hope that knowledge helps you now."
msgstr ""
"Te hiciste con una gran fortuna, por suerte o por voluntad, y organizaste "
"juegos para celebridades de fama mundial. Podías permitirte mimar a tus "
"jugadores, y así lo hiciste. Invertiste en biónica para hacerte más "
"inteligente y memorizaste el manual entero. Esperemos que ese conocimiento "
"te ayude ahora."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Gangster"
msgstr "Mafioso biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Gangster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the boss's favorite, their protege; they always counted on you to "
"get the toughest jobs done.  They invested in \"basic\" augments and the "
"best gear on the market in preparation for your biggest hit yet.  Sadly, you"
" came out of surgery to find your whole gang had been eaten."
msgstr ""
"Eras el favorito del jefe, su protegido; siempre contaban contigo para "
"realizar los trabajos más duros. Invirtieron en aumentos \"básicos\" y en el"
" mejor equipo del mercado para preparar tu mayor golpe. Tristemente, al "
"salir del quirófano descubriste que toda tu banda había sido devorada."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Gangster"
msgstr "Mafiosa biónico"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Gangster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the boss's favorite, their protege; they always counted on you to "
"get the toughest jobs done.  They invested in \"basic\" augments and the "
"best gear on the market in preparation for your biggest hit yet.  Sadly, you"
" came out of surgery to find your whole gang had been eaten."
msgstr ""
"Eras la favorita del jefe, su protegida; siempre contaban contigo para "
"realizar los trabajos más duros. Invirtieron en aumentos \"básicos\" y en el"
" mejor equipo del mercado para preparar tu mayor golpe. Tristemente, al "
"salir del quirófano descubriste que toda tu banda había sido devorada."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Assassin"
msgstr "Asesino Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Assassin) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"The product of millions of dollars of clandestine research, you are a bionic"
" sleeper agent capable of silently engaging your target while maintaining an"
" innocuous appearance.  Your handler cut all contact a week ago."
msgstr ""
"Producto de millones de dólares de investigación clandestina, eres un agente"
" durmiente biónico capaz de atacar silenciosamente a tu objetivo manteniendo"
" una apariencia inocua. Tu controlador cortó todo contacto hace una semana."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Assassin"
msgstr "Asesina Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Assassin) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The product of millions of dollars of clandestine research, you are a bionic"
" sleeper agent capable of silently engaging your target while maintaining an"
" innocuous appearance.  Your handler cut all contact a week ago."
msgstr ""
"Producto de millones de dólares de investigación clandestina, eras una "
"agente durmiente biónica capaz de atacar silenciosamente a tu objetivo "
"manteniendo una apariencia inocua. Tu controlador cortó todo contacto hace "
"una semana."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Augmentation Associate"
msgstr "Asociado de Aumento"

#. ~ Profession (male Augmentation Associate) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When bionics first emerged, you were quick to make them into your career, "
"and spent your days overseeing their installation.  That makes you one of "
"the few non-zombies in the world that can calibrate an Autodoc, which might "
"come in handy."
msgstr ""
"Cuando aparecieron los biónicos por primera vez, te apresuraste a "
"convertirlos en tu carrera, y pasaste tus días supervisando su instalación. "
"Eso te convierte en uno de los pocos no zombis del mundo que puede calibrar "
"un Autodoc, lo que podría resultar útil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Augmentation Associate"
msgstr "Asociado de Aumento"

#. ~ Profession (female Augmentation Associate) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When bionics first emerged, you were quick to make them into your career, "
"and spent your days overseeing their installation.  That makes you one of "
"the few non-zombies in the world that can calibrate an Autodoc, which might "
"come in handy."
msgstr ""
"Cuando aparecieron los biónicos por primera vez, te apresuraste a "
"convertirlos en tu carrera, y pasaste tus días supervisando su instalación. "
"Eso te convierte en uno de los pocos no zombis del mundo que puede calibrar "
"un Autodoc, lo que podría resultar útil."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Surgeon"
msgstr "Cirujano Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Surgeon) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"As one of the top surgeons in the country, you were chosen for an "
"augmentation program to expand the medical field.  With your expertise and "
"augmentations, you can perform precise surgery with little assistance."
msgstr ""
"Como uno de los mejores cirujanos del país, fuiste elegido para un programa "
"de aumentos para expandir el campo de la medicina. Con tu experiencia y los "
"aumentos, puedes realizar cirugías de precisión con poca ayuda."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Surgeon"
msgstr "Cirujano Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Surgeon) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"As one of the top surgeons in the country, you were chosen for an "
"augmentation program to expand the medical field.  With your expertise and "
"augmentations, you can perform precise surgery with little assistance."
msgstr ""
"Como uno de los mejores cirujanos del país, fuiste elegido para un programa "
"de aumentos para expandir el campo de la medicina. Con tu experiencia y los "
"aumentos, puedes realizar cirugías de precisión con poca ayuda."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Boffin"
msgstr "Cerebrito Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Boffin) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were employed by a major international corporation as a representative "
"and technical advisor, utilizing the incredible power of your cybernetically"
" augmented mind."
msgstr ""
"Una importante corporación internacional te contrató como representante y "
"asesor técnico, utilizando el increíble poder de tu mente aumentada "
"cibernéticamente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Boffin"
msgstr "Cerebrito Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Boffin) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were employed by a major international corporation as a representative "
"and technical advisor, utilizing the incredible power of your cybernetically"
" augmented mind."
msgstr ""
"Una importante corporación internacional te contrató como representante y "
"asesor técnica, utilizando el increíble poder de tu mente aumentada "
"cibernéticamente."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Patient"
msgstr "Paciente Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Patient) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you signed up for a series of "
"experimental bionic surgeries that saved your life.  Now you're healthier "
"than you ever were before, thanks to a suite of bionic systems powered by "
"your own metabolic functions.  Make the most of your second chance at life."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el diagnóstico fue positivo, te apuntaste a una serie de cirugías "
"biónicas experimentales que te salvaron la vida. Ahora estás más sano que "
"nunca, gracias a un conjunto de sistemas biónicos alimentados por tus "
"propias funciones metabólicas. Aprovecha al máximo tu segunda oportunidad en"
" la vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Patient"
msgstr "Paciente Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Patient) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"When the diagnosis came back positive, you signed up for a series of "
"experimental bionic surgeries that saved your life.  Now you're healthier "
"than you ever were before, thanks to a suite of bionic systems powered by "
"your own metabolic functions.  Make the most of your second chance at life."
msgstr ""
"Cuando el diagnóstico fue positivo, te apuntaste a una serie de cirugías "
"biónicas experimentales que te salvaron la vida. Ahora estás más sana que "
"nunca, gracias a un conjunto de sistemas biónicos alimentados por tus "
"propias funciones metabólicas. Aprovecha al máximo tu segunda oportunidad en"
" la vida."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Prepper"
msgstr "Survivalista Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Prepper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You knew the end was coming.  You augmented yourself with some basic bionic "
"tools and underwent extensive survival training.  Now the end has come, and "
"it is time to see if your efforts have paid off."
msgstr ""
"Sabías que se acercaba el final. Te has dotado de algunas herramientas "
"biónicas básicas y te has sometido a un exhaustivo entrenamiento de "
"supervivencia. Ahora ha llegado el final, y es hora de ver si tus esfuerzos "
"han merecido la pena."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Prepper"
msgstr "Survivalista Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Prepper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You knew the end was coming.  You augmented yourself with some basic bionic "
"tools and underwent extensive survival training.  Now the end has come, and "
"it is time to see if your efforts have paid off."
msgstr ""
"Sabías que se acercaba el final. Te has dotado de algunas herramientas "
"biónicas básicas y te has sometido a un exhaustivo entrenamiento de "
"supervivencia. Ahora ha llegado el final, y es hora de ver si tus esfuerzos "
"han merecido la pena."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Runner"
msgstr "Corredor biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Runner) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were the kind of sportsman who couldn't get off the track.  You love "
"running, and you enhanced your body with cybernetics to go even faster.  Now"
" there's plenty to run from - this is your kind of game."
msgstr ""
"Eras el tipo de deportista que no podía salir de la pista. Te encanta correr"
" y mejoraste tu cuerpo con cibernética para ir aún más rápido. Ahora hay "
"mucho que correr: este es tu tipo de juego."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Runner"
msgstr "Corredora biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Runner) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were the kind of sportsman who couldn't get off the track.  You love "
"running, and you enhanced your body with cybernetics to go even faster.  Now"
" there's plenty to run from - this is your kind of game."
msgstr ""
"Eras el tipo de deportista que no podía salir de la pista. Te encanta correr"
" y mejoraste tu cuerpo con cibernética para ir aún más rápido. Ahora hay "
"mucho que correr: este es tu tipo de juego."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Sniper"
msgstr "Francotirador Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Sniper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"A top-secret military program sought to convert you into the perfect sniper."
"  Your bionics, equipment, and extensive field training enable you to drop "
"targets from implausible distances, even after weeks of total isolation in "
"enemy territory."
msgstr ""
"Un programa militar ultrasecreto pretendía convertirte en el francotirador "
"perfecto. Tu biónica, tu equipo y tu extenso entrenamiento de campo te "
"permiten abatir objetivos desde distancias inverosímiles, incluso tras "
"semanas de total aislamiento en territorio enemigo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Sniper"
msgstr "Francotiradora Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Sniper) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"A top-secret military program sought to convert you into the perfect sniper."
"  Your bionics, equipment, and extensive field training enable you to drop "
"targets from implausible distances, even after weeks of total isolation in "
"enemy territory."
msgstr ""
"Un programa militar ultrasecreto pretendía convertirte en la francotiradora "
"perfecto. Tu biónica, tu equipo y tu extenso entrenamiento de campo te "
"permiten abatir objetivos desde distancias inverosímiles, incluso tras "
"semanas de total aislamiento en territorio enemigo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Soldier"
msgstr "Soldado Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Soldier) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You are the result of one of the military's last research programs: a "
"prototype cyborg soldier.  The wars they expected you to fight have become "
"obsolete, but war never changes."
msgstr ""
"Eres el resultado de uno de los últimos programas de investigación del "
"ejército: un prototipo de soldado cíborg. Las guerras que esperaban que "
"combatieras se han quedado obsoletas, pero la guerra nunca cambia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Soldier"
msgstr "Soldado Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Soldier) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the result of one of the military's last research programs: a "
"prototype cyborg soldier.  The wars they expected you to fight have become "
"obsolete, but war never changes."
msgstr ""
"Eres el resultado de uno de los últimos programas de investigación del "
"ejército: un prototipo de soldada cíborg. Las guerras que esperaban que "
"combatieras se han quedado obsoletas, pero la guerra nunca cambia."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Agent"
msgstr "Agente Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Agent) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your body conceals several bionic components, worth millions of dollars in "
"public taxes.  The government turned you into an infiltration and recon "
"specialist: you have night vision, an alarm, lock picking capabilities and a"
" hacking module."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo esconde varios componentes biónicos, valorados en millones de "
"dólares en impuestos públicos. El gobierno te convirtió en un especialista "
"en infiltración y reconocimiento: tienes visión nocturna, una alarma, "
"capacidad de abrir cerraduras y un módulo de hackeo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Agent"
msgstr "Agente Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Agent) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your body conceals several bionic components, worth millions of dollars in "
"public taxes.  The government turned you into an infiltration and recon "
"specialist: you have night vision, an alarm, lock picking capabilities and a"
" hacking module."
msgstr ""
"Tu cuerpo esconde varios componentes biónicos, valorados en millones de "
"dólares en impuestos públicos. El gobierno te convirtió en una especialista "
"en infiltración y reconocimiento: tienes visión nocturna, una alarma, "
"capacidad de abrir cerraduras y un módulo de hackeo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Student"
msgstr "Estudiante Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Student) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Your parents were so obsessed with making sure you aced every test that they"
" had you outfitted with bionics to enhance your intellect and memory.  Now "
"you're facing the hardest test yet, and you're not sure if those are the "
"right kind of tools for the job."
msgstr ""
"Tus padres estaban tan obsesionados con que aprobaras todos los exámenes que"
" te equiparon con biónica para mejorar tu intelecto y tu memoria. Ahora te "
"enfrentas a la prueba más difícil, y no estás seguro de que esas sean las "
"herramientas adecuadas para el trabajo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Student"
msgstr "Estudiante Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Student) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Your parents were so obsessed with making sure you aced every test that they"
" had you outfitted with bionics to enhance your intellect and memory.  Now "
"you're facing the hardest test yet, and you're not sure if those are the "
"right kind of tools for the job."
msgstr ""
"Tus padres estaban tan obsesionados con que aprobaras todos los exámenes que"
" te equiparon con biónica para mejorar tu intelecto y tu memoria. Ahora te "
"enfrentas a la prueba más difícil, y no estás seguro de que esas sean las "
"herramientas adecuadas para el trabajo."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Thief"
msgstr "Ladrón Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Thief) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Impeccable style and a few bionic tricks up your sleeve have seen you pull "
"off a string of daring, high-profile heists.  The cops would love to get "
"their hands on you, but seem otherwise occupied."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo impecable y unos cuantos trucos biónicos en la manga te han "
"permitido llevar a cabo una serie de atrevidos atracos de alto nivel. A la "
"policía le encantaría echarte el guante, pero parece estar ocupada."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Thief"
msgstr "Ladrona Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Thief) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Impeccable style and a few bionic tricks up your sleeve have seen you pull "
"off a string of daring, high-profile heists.  The cops would love to get "
"their hands on you, but seem otherwise occupied."
msgstr ""
"Un estilo impecable y unos cuantos trucos biónicos en la manga te han "
"permitido llevar a cabo una serie de atrevidos atracos de alto nivel. A la "
"policía le encantaría echarte el guante, pero parece estar ocupada."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Industrial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Industrial"

#. ~ Profession (male Industrial Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"For better or for worse, bionic augmentation has turned you into a walking "
"power tool.  Upgraded with a standard industrial-grade manual labor surgery "
"and training package, you are augmented with bionic muscles and an "
"integrated toolset, both powered by standard batteries."
msgstr ""
"Para mejor o para peor, las alteraciones biónicas te han convertido en una "
"herramienta eléctrica con patas. Mejorado con cirugía de grado industrial y "
"un paquete de entrenamiento, se te ha instalado musculatura biónica y una "
"caja de herramientas, alimentadas con baterías normales."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Industrial Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Industrial"

#. ~ Profession (female Industrial Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"For better or for worse, bionic augmentation has turned you into a walking "
"power tool.  Upgraded with a standard industrial-grade manual labor surgery "
"and training package, you are augmented with bionic muscles and an "
"integrated toolset, both powered by standard batteries."
msgstr ""
"Para mejor o para peor, las alteraciones biónicas te han convertido en una "
"herramienta eléctrica con patas. Mejorada con cirugía de grado industrial y "
"un paquete de entrenamiento, se te ha instalado musculatura biónica y una "
"caja de herramientas, alimentadas con baterías normales."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Prototype Cyborg"
msgstr "Prototipo de Ciborg"

#. ~ Profession (male Prototype Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were normal once.  Before the tests, before the procedures, before they "
"stripped away every outward sign of your humanity.  You're more machine than"
" human now, but that might prove to be an advantage against the horrors that"
" await."
msgstr ""
"Una vez fuiste normal. Antes de las pruebas, antes de los procedimientos, "
"antes de que te quitaran todo signo externo de tu humanidad. Ahora eres más "
"máquina que humano, pero eso puede ser una ventaja contra los horrores que "
"te esperan."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Prototype Cyborg"
msgstr "Prototipo de Ciborg"

#. ~ Profession (female Prototype Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were normal once.  Before the tests, before the procedures, before they "
"stripped away every outward sign of your humanity.  You're more machine than"
" human now, but that might prove to be an advantage against the horrors that"
" await."
msgstr ""
"Una vez fuiste normal. Antes de las pruebas, antes de los procedimientos, "
"antes de que te quitaran todo signo externo de tu humanidad. Ahora eres más "
"máquina que humana, pero eso puede ser una ventaja contra los horrores que "
"te esperan."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Cyberjunkie"
msgstr "Ciberadicto"

#. ~ Profession (male Cyberjunkie) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Long ago your lifelong infatuation with bionic enhancement lead you into a "
"shady world of back-alley bionic clinics and self-installed secondhand CBMs."
"  Your posthuman hunger still cries out to be fed; where will you get your "
"bionic fix now?"
msgstr ""
"Hace mucho, tu capricho con las mejoras biónicas te llevó a un mundo oscuro "
"de clínicas biónicas en callejones perdidos y auto-instalaciones de MCB "
"usados. Tu hambre posthumana todavía grita por ser satisfecha. ¿Dónde "
"conseguirás ahora ese repuesto biónico?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Cyberjunkie"
msgstr "Ciberadicta"

#. ~ Profession (female Cyberjunkie) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Long ago your lifelong infatuation with bionic enhancement lead you into a "
"shady world of back-alley bionic clinics and self-installed secondhand CBMs."
"  Your posthuman hunger still cries out to be fed; where will you get your "
"bionic fix now?"
msgstr ""
"Hace mucho, tu capricho con las mejoras biónicas te llevó a un mundo oscuro "
"de clínicas biónicas en callejones perdidos y auto-instalaciones de MCB "
"usados. Tu hambre posthumana todavía grita por ser satisfecha. ¿Dónde "
"conseguirás ahora ese repuesto biónico?"

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Bionic Monster"
msgstr "Monstruo Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (male Bionic Monster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Completely overtaken by bionic-induced psychosis, you are a deformed "
"posthuman monster, forced to hide in the shadows.  Amidst the desolation, "
"however, even a creature such as yourself might find its niche."
msgstr ""
"Completamente superado por la psicosis inducida por los biónicos, eres un "
"monstruo posthumano deformado, obligado a esconderse en las sombras. Sin "
"embargo, en medio de la desolación, incluso una criatura como tú puede "
"encontrar su lugar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Bionic Monster"
msgstr "Monstruo Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (female Bionic Monster) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Completely overtaken by bionic-induced psychosis, you are a deformed "
"posthuman monster, forced to hide in the shadows.  Amidst the desolation, "
"however, even a creature such as yourself might find its niche."
msgstr ""
"Completamente superada por la psicosis inducida por los biónicos, eres una "
"monstruo posthumana deformada, obligada a esconderse en las sombras. Sin "
"embargo, en medio de la desolación, incluso una criatura como tú puede "
"encontrar su lugar."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Failed Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Fallido"

#. ~ Profession (male Failed Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"After a series of surgical mistakes, your body is a wreck of bionic parts.  "
"You have a large capacity for power, but are filled with broken and useless "
"bionics.  Your ethanol power supply still works, at least."
msgstr ""
"Después de una serie de errores quirúrgicos, tu cuerpo es una ruina de "
"partes biónicas. Tienes una gran capacidad de energía, pero estás lleno de "
"biónicos rotos e inútiles. Tu fuente de alimentación de etanol aún funciona,"
" al menos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Failed Cyborg"
msgstr "Cíborg Fallida"

#. ~ Profession (female Failed Cyborg) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"After a series of surgical mistakes, your body is a wreck of bionic parts.  "
"You have a large capacity for power, but are filled with broken and useless "
"bionics.  Your ethanol power supply still works, at least."
msgstr ""
"Después de una serie de errores quirúrgicos, tu cuerpo es una ruina de "
"partes biónicas. Tienes una gran capacidad de energía, pero estás lleno de "
"biónicos rotos e inútiles. Tu fuente de alimentación de etanol aún funciona,"
" al menos."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Drone Operator"
msgstr "Operador de Drone"

#. ~ Profession (male Drone Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You had a job programming machines such as automatic street cleaners, "
"newsbots, and pizza delivery drones.  Bionic implants helped you control "
"them remotely.  Now all the drones carry guns instead of pizza."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un trabajo programando máquinas como limpiadores de calles "
"automáticos, robots de noticias y drones repartidores de pizza. Los "
"implantes biónicos te ayudaban a controlarlos a distancia. Ahora todos los "
"drones llevan armas en lugar de pizza."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Drone Operator"
msgstr "Operadora de Drone"

#. ~ Profession (female Drone Operator) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You had a job programming machines such as automatic street cleaners, "
"newsbots, and pizza delivery drones.  Bionic implants helped you control "
"them remotely.  Now all the drones carry guns instead of pizza."
msgstr ""
"Tenías un trabajo programando máquinas como limpiadores de calles "
"automáticos, robots de noticias y drones repartidores de pizza. Los "
"implantes biónicos te ayudaban a controlarlos a distancia. Ahora todos los "
"drones llevan armas en lugar de pizza."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Razor Boy"
msgstr "Mercenario Biónico"

#. ~ Profession (Razor Boy) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Through a series of painful and expensive surgeries, you became a walking "
"bionic weapon, your services as a mercenary available to the highest bidder."
msgstr ""
"A través de una serie de dolorosas y costosas cirugías, te convertiste en un"
" arma biónica andante, tus servicios como mercenario disponibles al mejor "
"postor."

#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Razor Girl"
msgstr "Mercenaria Biónica"

#. ~ Profession (Razor Girl) description
#: lang/json/professions_from_json.py
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Through a series of painful and expensive surgeries, you became a walking "
"bionic weapon, your services as a mercenary available to the highest bidder."
msgstr ""
"A través de una serie de dolorosas y costosas cirugías, te convertiste en "
"una arma biónica andante, tus servicios como mercenaria disponibles al mejor"
" postor."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Chemistry"
msgstr "Principios de Química"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Chemistry
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are beginning to grasp a general idea of how elements and compounds "
"react with each other."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a tener una idea general de cómo reaccionan los elementos y los "
"compuestos entre sí."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Biology"
msgstr "Principios de Biología"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Biology
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are beginning to gain a general idea of how various living beings "
"fuction."
msgstr ""
"Empiezas a tener una idea general de cómo funcionan los distintos seres "
"vivos."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Organic Chemistry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Organic Chemistry
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Knowledge of the branch of chemistry that studies and uses carbon-containing"
" compounds."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Inorganic Chemistry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Inorganic Chemistry
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Knowledge of the branch of chemistry that studies and uses compounds not "
"containing carbon."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Biochemistry"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Biochemistry
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "The understanding of the chemistry of living things."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Physiology"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Physiology
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "An in-depth understanding of how humans and animals operate."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Xenology"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Xenology
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are beginning to grasp a general idea of how alien and post-Cataclysm "
"mutated creatures function and operate."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Chemical Synthesis"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Principles of Chemical Synthesis
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You're beginning to grasp the basics of chemical production."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Complex Chemical Synthesis"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Complex Chemical Synthesis
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The proper understanding of safe chemical synthesization and how to clean "
"your tools used for the next batch."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Distillation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Distillation
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The process of separating two mixed liquids by their different boiling "
"points."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Metallurgy"
msgstr "Metalurgia"

#. ~ Description for Metallurgy
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "An understanding of the chemistry of metalworking and alloys."
msgstr "Comprensión de la química de la metalurgia y las aleaciones."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Pharmaceutical Production."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Pharmaceutical Production.
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An understanding of how to produce various natural and chemical substances "
"pure enough for human consumption."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Food Preparation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Food Preparation
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've done enough cooking to know the basics about how to quickly and "
"efficiently sort your ingredients."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Knife Skills"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Knife Skills
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're quite skilled at culinary knife work, making you noticeably faster at"
" preparing meals that involve a lot of chopping."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Baking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Principles of Baking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know the basics of baking - proportions, leavening, and things - and are"
" less likely to make a dramatic mistake when working from memory."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Breadmaking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Breadmaking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've baked enough bread to consider yourself an expert.  May your yeast be"
" ever frothy."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Dessert Baking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Dessert Baking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Anyone can make a cookie, but you can make it look amazing.  Cakes and other"
" fluffies are also no longer a barrier."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Patisserie Expert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Patisserie Expert
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You could have been a professional baker before the Cataclysm.  Your "
"profiteroles are the envy of the wastelands."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Frying"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Principles of Frying
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Anyone can toss stuff into deep frier oil.  You know more about selecting "
"oil, keeping the food from burning, and the like."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Breading & Battering"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Breading & Battering
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know enough about deep frying breads and batters to do it easily without"
" thinking about it."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Fried Desserts"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Fried Desserts
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You know the vaunted secrets of creating delicious deep fried sweets."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Culinary Fermentation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Culinary Fermentation
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The basics of fermenting for human consumption, including sanitary "
"technique, avoiding harmful molds, and identifying common problems."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Beverage Distillation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Beverage Distillation
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Applying the science of distillation to alcoholic beverages to get something"
" tasty."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Brewing"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Brewing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "The fine art of brewing grains into beers."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Winemaking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Winemaking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The knowledge of how to turn sugary fruits, and occasionally vegetables, "
"into fermented beverages."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Lactofermentation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Lactofermentation
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The microbiology of most non-alcoholic fermented edibles, from sauerkraut to"
" sourdough."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Cheesemaking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Principles of Cheesemaking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The basics of curdling and coagulating milk and similar things without the "
"wrong kinds of bacteria and mold winning out."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Cheesemaking Expert"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Cheesemaking Expert
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Taking the basics of curdled milk and making it delicious."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Food Preservation"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Food Preservation
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The basic knowledge of ways to keep food safe for long periods of time in a "
"post-refrigeration world."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Curing and Drying Food"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Curing and Drying Food
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Using salt, smoke, and similar agents to cure or dehydrate food."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Canning Food"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Canning Food
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Using pressure canning or tinning to safely store food in sealed containers."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Scavenger Cooking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Scavenger Cooking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know the secrets of cooking tasty food using strange substitutions and "
"weird things you found in a cabinet in an abandoned house."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Forager Cooking"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Forager Cooking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Cooking with foraged ingredients that you wouldn't find in most cookbooks."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Electronics Soldering"
msgstr "Soldadura Electrónica"

#. ~ Description for Electronics Soldering
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An understanding of the skills and tools needed to create durable, effective"
" soldered electrical connections."
msgstr ""
"Comprensión de las habilidades y herramientas necesarias para crear "
"conexiones eléctricas soldadas duraderas y eficaces."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Electromagnetics"
msgstr "Electromagnética"

#. ~ Description for Electromagnetics
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A practical working knowledge of electromagnetic fields and their creation "
"and application."
msgstr ""
"Conocimiento práctico de los campos electromagnéticos y de su creación y "
"aplicación."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Electroshock Weapons"
msgstr "Armas de Electroshock"

#. ~ Description for Electroshock Weapons
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"An understanding of how to use high voltage, low-current devices to cause "
"debilitating muscle spasms.  Includes some theoretical knowledge of how to "
"protect yourself from these."
msgstr ""
"Conocimiento de cómo utilizar dispositivos de alta tensión y baja corriente "
"para provocar espasmos musculares debilitantes. Incluye algunos "
"conocimientos teóricos sobre cómo protegerse de ellos."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Gunsmithing"
msgstr "Principios de Armas de Fuego"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Gunsmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A basic understanding of how guns are put together and what tools and "
"materials are needed for the job."
msgstr ""
"Conocimiento básico de cómo se arman las armas y qué herramientas y "
"materiales se necesitan para el trabajo."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Improvised Gunmaking"
msgstr "Armas de Fuego Improvisadas"

#. ~ Description for Improvised Gunmaking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've become an expert at putting together guns and launchers from "
"makeshift parts."
msgstr ""
"Te has convertido en un experto en armar armas y lanzadores con piezas "
"improvisadas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Antique Gunsmithing"
msgstr "Armas de Fuego Antiguas"

#. ~ Description for Antique Gunsmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You're specifically skilled at building and repairing antique guns."
msgstr ""
"Específicamente eres experto en la construcción y reparación de armas "
"antiguas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Spring-powered Guns and Crossbows"
msgstr "Armas y Ballestas de Muelle"

#. ~ Description for Spring-powered Guns and Crossbows
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Similar to bowyery, the art of making guns that are powered by elastic "
"mechanisms."
msgstr ""
"Similar a la arquería, el arte de fabricar armas accionadas por mecanismos "
"elásticos."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Revolver Gunsmithing"
msgstr "Armas de Fuego de Revolver"

#. ~ Description for Revolver Gunsmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've got the know-how to make a classic Western revolver, and its many "
"variants."
msgstr ""
"Tienes los conocimientos necesarios para fabricar un revólver clásico del "
"Oeste, y sus muchas variantes."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Metalworking"
msgstr "Principios de la Metalurgia"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Metalworking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A basic understanding of the properties of metal as a material, and the "
"concepts behind smithing, die casting, and other metalworking techniques."
msgstr ""
"Una comprensión básica de las propiedades del metal como material, y los "
"conceptos detrás de la herrería, la fundición a presión y otras técnicas de "
"trabajo del metal."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Welding"
msgstr "Principios de Soldadura"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Welding
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A basic understanding of the different types of welding, welding tools and "
"fuels, how to weld different materials, and more."
msgstr ""
"Conocimiento básico de los diferentes tipos de soldadura, herramientas y "
"combustibles para soldar, cómo soldar diferentes materiales, etc."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Welding"
msgstr "Soldadura"

#. ~ Description for Welding
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You are an experienced welder."
msgstr "Eres un soldador con experiencia."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py src/crafting_gui.cpp
msgid "Blacksmithing"
msgstr "Herrería"

#. ~ Description for Blacksmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "The craft of working metal into tools and other items of use."
msgstr ""
"El oficio de trabajar el metal para convertirlo en herramientas y otros "
"artículos de uso."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Redsmithing"
msgstr "Herreria de Cobre"

#. ~ Description for Redsmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Working copper and bronze shares a lot of techniques with blacksmithing, but"
" the more ductile copper-containing metals have a trick all their own."
msgstr ""
"Trabajar el cobre y el bronce comparte muchas técnicas con la herrería, pero"
" los metales más dúctiles que contienen cobre tienen un truco propio."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Fine Metalsmithing"
msgstr "Orfebrería"

#. ~ Description for Fine Metalsmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "How to make jewelry from precious metals like gold and silver."
msgstr "Cómo fabricar joyas con metales preciosos como el oro y la plata."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Armorsmithing"
msgstr "Armador"

#. ~ Description for Armorsmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "How to make articulated armor from pieces of metal."
msgstr "Cómo hacer una armadura articulada con piezas de metal."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Bladesmithing"
msgstr "Cuchilleria"

#. ~ Description for Bladesmithing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "How to fabricate sharp and reliable blades from scratch."
msgstr "Cómo fabricar cuchillas afiladas y fiables desde cero."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Manual Tooling"
msgstr "Utillaje manual"

#. ~ Description for Manual Tooling
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"How to make high-quality tools and parts by hand.  Includes techniques like "
"threading, durable articulation points, and using appropriate metals for "
"appropriate tasks.  Also applies to making blunt instruments that can "
"withstand a severe beating without distortion."
msgstr ""
"Cómo hacer herramientas y piezas de alta calidad a mano. Incluye técnicas "
"como el roscado, los puntos de articulación duraderos y el uso de metales "
"adecuados para las tareas correspondientes. También se aplica a la "
"fabricación de instrumentos contundentes que puedan soportar fuertes golpes "
"sin distorsión."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Wire Making"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Wire Making
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"How to turn raw ingots and metals into usable wire.  Includes both drawing "
"and extruding."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Basic Knapping"
msgstr "Esculpido Básico"

#. ~ Description for Basic Knapping
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know the basic principles of turning stones into more useful tools."
msgstr ""
"Conoces los principios básicos para convertir las piedras en herramientas "
"más útiles."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Knapping"
msgstr "Esculpido"

#. ~ Description for Knapping
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've banged rocks together so much and for so long, you've become "
"extremely fast at it."
msgstr ""
"Has golpeado tanto las piedras y durante tanto tiempo que te has vuelto "
"extremadamente rápido en ello."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Glassblowing"
msgstr "Soplado de Vidrio"

#. ~ Description for Glassblowing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Working with glass and heat without poisoning or perforating yourself."
msgstr "Trabajar con vidrio y calor sin envenenarse o agujerearse."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Plumbing"
msgstr "Fontanería"

#. ~ Description for Plumbing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Working with pipes and pipe fittings to transport fluids without leakage."
msgstr ""
"Trabajar con tuberías y accesorios para transportar fluidos sin fugas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Pottery"
msgstr "Alfarería"

#. ~ Description for Pottery
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Basic pottery, from shaping to working with slip to fuse pieces."
msgstr ""
"Alfarería básica, desde el modelado hasta el trabajo con engobe para fundir "
"piezas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Bowyery"
msgstr "Fabricante de Arcos"

#. ~ Description for Bowyery
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "The ability to make durable, effective bows."
msgstr "La capacidad de fabricar arcos duraderos y eficaces."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Fletching"
msgstr "Emplumado"

#. ~ Description for Fletching
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "The skill involved in making arrows that fly true."
msgstr "La habilidad para hacer flechas que vuelen de verdad."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Basketweaving"
msgstr "Cestería"

#. ~ Description for Basketweaving
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Forming coarse fibers into shapes."
msgstr "Crear formas con fibras gruesas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Pottery Glazing"
msgstr "Alfarería Esmaltada"

#. ~ Description for Pottery Glazing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Adding glazes to pottery to make them waterproof."
msgstr "Añadir esmaltes a la cerámica para hacerla impermeable."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Plastic Working"
msgstr "Trabajo con Plástico"

#. ~ Description for Plastic Working
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Working with plastic using your hands, including carving, molding, and "
"gluing it.  You know how to identify thermoplastics that are suitable for "
"mold casting, and how to identify the right plastic for the right job."
msgstr ""
"Trabajar con el plástico utilizando las manos, incluyendo el tallado, el "
"moldeado y el pegado. Sabes identificar los termoplásticos que son adecuados"
" para el moldeo, y cómo identificar el plástico adecuado para el trabajo "
"adecuado."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Carving"
msgstr "Tallado"

#. ~ Description for Carving
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Shaping wood, bone, and similar materials with a cutting implement."
msgstr ""
"Dar forma a madera, hueso y materiales similares con un instrumento de "
"corte."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Helicopter Piloting"
msgstr "Piloto de Helicóptero"

#. ~ Description for Helicopter Piloting
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Before the cataclysm, you were a helicopter pilot.  Now, you just hope you "
"can fly again."
msgstr ""
"Antes del cataclismo, eras piloto de helicóptero. Ahora, solo esperas poder "
"volver a volar."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Airframe and Powerplant Mechanic"
msgstr "Mecánico de Fuselaje y Planta de Energía"

#. ~ Description for Airframe and Powerplant Mechanic
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've been trained and certified to repair aircraft.  You're not really "
"sure how that could help you survive now."
msgstr ""
"Has recibido formación y certificación para reparar aviones. No estás muy "
"seguro de cómo eso podría ayudarte a sobrevivir ahora."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Gem Setting"
msgstr "Engastador de gemas"

#. ~ Description for Gem Setting
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "How to add gemstones to jewelry."
msgstr "Como añadir gemas a la joyería"

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Handloading"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Handloading
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know how to accurately measure powder and projectile weights for "
"reloading firearm cartridges."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Joint Articulation"
msgstr "Articulador de juntas"

#. ~ Description for Joint Articulation
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Making flexible items out of hard materials is tricky.  You've done enough "
"of it to understand how to make smoothly articulated joints out of rigid or "
"semi-rigid materials."
msgstr ""
"Hacer objetos flexibles a partir de materiales duros es complicado. Ya has "
"hecho lo suficiente para entender cómo hacer articulaciones suaves a partir "
"de materiales rígidos o semirrígidos."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Garment Closures"
msgstr "Cierres de Prendas de Vestir"

#. ~ Description for Garment Closures
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the adjustments and tricks needed to make properly "
"functional buttons, zippers, and other closures on garments."
msgstr ""
"Está familiarizado con los ajustes y trucos necesarios para hacer que los "
"botones, cremalleras y otros cierres de las prendas funcionen correctamente."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Fabric Waterproofing"
msgstr "Impermeabilización de Tejidos"

#. ~ Description for Fabric Waterproofing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know how to making garments and fabric containers sealed against water."
msgstr ""
"Sabes cómo hacer que las prendas y los contenedores de tela estén sellados "
"contra el agua."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Stretch Fabric"
msgstr "Tejido Elástico"

#. ~ Description for Stretch Fabric
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Making elastic bands is easy enough, but making a whole garment from "
"stretchy cloth takes a bit of finesse.  You're good at it."
msgstr ""
"Hacer bandas elásticas es bastante fácil, pero hacer una prenda entera con "
"tela elástica requiere un poco de delicadeza. Se te da bien."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Cobbling"
msgstr "Zapatero"

#. ~ Description for Cobbling
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Like a magical elf, you've learned how to construct footwear by hand."
msgstr "Como un elfo mágico, has aprendido a construir el calzado a mano."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Spinning"
msgstr "Hilado"

#. ~ Description for Spinning
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "The art of spinning fiber into thread."
msgstr "El arte de hilar la fibra para convertirla en hilo."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Weaving"
msgstr "Tejido"

#. ~ Description for Weaving
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've learned how to use a loom to produce sheets of fabric from thread."
msgstr ""
"Has aprendido a utilizar un telar para producir hojas de tela con hilo."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Millinery"
msgstr "Sombrerería"

#. ~ Description for Millinery
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Like a solitary mouse, you've learned how to construct hats by hand."
msgstr "Como un ratón solitario, has aprendido a construir sombreros a mano."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Knitting"
msgstr "Tejido de Punto"

#. ~ Description for Knitting
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Knitting, one of the oldest ways of tying knots in fiber until it is fabric."
msgstr ""
"Tejido de punto, una de las formas más antiguas de hacer nudos en la fibra "
"hasta convertirla en tejido."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Speed Knitting"
msgstr "Tejido de Punto Veloz"

#. ~ Description for Speed Knitting
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have knitted and knitted and knitted some more, and have the consistent "
"string tension to show for it.  When you get going, the clicking of your "
"needles is like a metronome."
msgstr ""
"Has tejido y tejido y tejido un poco más, y tienes una tensión de hilo "
"consistente para demostrarlo. Cuando te pones en marcha, el chasquido de tus"
" agujas es como un metrónomo."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Leatherworking"
msgstr "Principios de la Peletería"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Leatherworking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've got a basic familiarity with how to work with leather, furs, hides, "
"and similar materials."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un conocimiento básico de cómo trabajar con cuero, pieles, pellejos y"
" materiales similares."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Leatherworking"
msgstr "Trabajo con Cuero"

#. ~ Description for Leatherworking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Working with leather requires a specific set of skills and tools… a set you "
"are familiar with."
msgstr ""
"Trabajar el cuero requiere un conjunto específico de habilidades y "
"herramientas... un conjunto con el estás familiarizado."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Furriery"
msgstr "Peletería"

#. ~ Description for Furriery
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Working with fur and faux fur is a skill all its own."
msgstr "Trabajar con pieles y pieles sintéticas es una habilidad propia."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Chitinworking"
msgstr "Trabajo con Quitina"

#. ~ Description for Chitinworking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It seems unlikely that anyone prior to the cataclysm knew how to work with "
"the shells of giant bugs as well as you do now."
msgstr ""
"Parece poco probable que alguien antes del cataclismo supiera trabajar con "
"los caparazones de los bichos gigantes tan bien como tú lo haces ahora."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Chain Garments"
msgstr "Prendas de Cadena"

#. ~ Description for Chain Garments
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Turning sheets of chain links into effective, wearable clothing that doesn't"
" bind up."
msgstr ""
"Convertir hojas de eslabones de cadena en prendas eficaces y vestibles que "
"no se atan."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Advanced polymer sewing"
msgstr "Costura de polímeros avanzado"

#. ~ Description for Advanced polymer sewing
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know the tricks for working with Kevlar, Nomex, and other advanced "
"polymer cloth."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Lockpicking"
msgstr "Abridor de Cerraduras"

#. ~ Description for Lockpicking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You know how to pick a lock, at least in theory."
msgstr "Sabes cómo abrir una cerradura, al menos en teoría."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Locksmith"
msgstr "Cerrajero"

#. ~ Description for Locksmith
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You can pick a lock in the dark, blindfolded.  Although that doesn't make it"
" all that much harder.  You're good at locks, OK?"
msgstr ""
"Puedes abrir una cerradura en la oscuridad, con los ojos vendados. Aunque "
"eso no lo hace mucho más difícil. Eres bueno con las cerraduras, ¿vale?"

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Safecracking"
msgstr "Abridor de Cajas Fuertes"

#. ~ Description for Safecracking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Opening safes is an exacting skill, one that you are proficient at."
msgstr "Abrir cajas fuertes es una habilidad exigente, que tu dominas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Principles of Trapping"
msgstr "Principios de Trampeo"

#. ~ Description for Principles of Trapping
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You know the basics of setting and taking down traps safely."
msgstr ""
"Conoce los fundamentos de la instalación y retirada de trampas de forma "
"segura."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Trap Setting"
msgstr "Ajuste de Trampas"

#. ~ Description for Trap Setting
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You're specifically quite skilled at setting effective traps."
msgstr "Específicamente eres muy hábil poniendo trampas efectivas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Trap Disarming"
msgstr "Desarmador de Trampas"

#. ~ Description for Trap Disarming
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You know how to take down a trap safely."
msgstr "Sabes cómo desarmar una trampa con seguridad."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Spotting and Awareness"
msgstr "Vigilancia y Reconocimiento"

#. ~ Description for Spotting and Awareness
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are skilled at spotting things out of the ordinary, like traps or "
"ambushes."
msgstr ""
"Eres hábil detectando cosas fuera de lo común, como trampas o emboscadas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Fiber Twisting"
msgstr "Girador de Fibras"

#. ~ Description for Fiber Twisting
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You've got a basic grasp of the theory of how to twist and arrange fibers "
"into a more durable cord."
msgstr ""
"Tienes un conocimiento básico de la teoría de cómo retorcer y ordenar las "
"fibras para conseguir un cordón más duradero."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Ropemaking"
msgstr "Fabricación de Cuerdas"

#. ~ Description for Ropemaking
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Making twisted fibers into durable and useful rope."
msgstr "Convertir fibras retorcidas en una soga duradera y útil."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Basic Tanning"
msgstr "Curtido Básico"

#. ~ Description for Basic Tanning
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "You're familiar with the theory behind turning raw hides into leather."
msgstr ""
"Ya conoces la teoría de la transformación de las pieles crudas en cuero."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Tanning"
msgstr "Curtido"

#. ~ Description for Tanning
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have a lot of practice and experience with processing hides to leather, "
"as well as various similar techniques like making boiled leather."
msgstr ""
"Tienes mucha práctica y experiencia en la transformación de pellejos en "
"cuero, así como en diversas técnicas similares como la fabricación de cuero "
"hervido."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Basic Carpentry"
msgstr "Carpintería Básica"

#. ~ Description for Basic Carpentry
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Simple projects involving holding planks and panels of wood together with "
"nails or similar fasteners."
msgstr ""
"Proyectos simples que implican la sujeción de tablones y paneles de madera "
"juntos con clavos o elementos de fijación similares."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Alchemy"
msgstr "Alquimía"

#. ~ Description for Alchemy
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You know the basics of manipulating the mana of objects through application "
"of chemical laws."
msgstr ""
"Conoces los fundamentos de la manipulación del maná de los objetos mediante "
"la aplicación de las leyes químicas."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Almetallurgy"
msgstr "Almetalurgia"

#. ~ Description for Almetallurgy
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The forging of magical alloys is a complex process requiring an "
"understanding of both mundane metals and alchemy."
msgstr ""
"La forja de aleaciones mágicas es un proceso complejo que requiere un "
"conocimiento tanto de los metales mundanos como de la alquimia."

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon leather working"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Dragon leather working
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Working with dragon leather requires a specific set of skills and tools… a "
"set you are familiar with."
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid "Dragon scale working"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description for Dragon scale working
#: lang/json/proficiency_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Working with dragon scales requires a specific set of skills and tools… a "
