#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We need to survey the base site first."
msgstr "Tenemos que inspeccionar el sitio base en primer lugar."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The first thing we are going to need is a command tent to manage and task "
"workers from."
msgstr ""
"Lo primero que vamos a necesitar es una tienda de campaña para la "
"comandancia, para administrar a los trabajadores desde ahí."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic northeast tent"
msgstr "tienda básica del noreste"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We're going to need a fire pit and a bed if we want to stay here "
"permanently."
msgstr ""
"Necesitaremos un fogón y una cama si queremos quedarnos aquí "
"permanentemente."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic firepit"
msgstr "fogón básico"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"To make this outpost functional we are going to need storage containers to "
"organize our supplies."
msgstr ""
"Para hacer este puesto funcional vamos a necesitar contenedores de "
"almacenamiento para organizar nuestros provisiones."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic storage"
msgstr "almacenamiento básico"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Next we should expand the camp to comfortably support two people "
"indefinitely."
msgstr ""
"Lo siguiente que tenemos que hacer es expandir el campamento para poder "
"permitir que vivan dos personas indefinidamente."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic northeast bed"
msgstr "cama básica del noreste"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Additional housing and storage will allow our camp to expand into "
"specialized industries."
msgstr ""
"Casas y almacenamiento adicionales permitirán que nuestro campamento se "
"expanda hacia industrias especializadas."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic northwest tent"
msgstr "tienda básica del noroeste"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Constructing a hard command post will transform our little camp into a true "
"base."
msgstr ""
"Construir un puesto de comando transformará nuestro pequeño campamento en "
"una verdadera base."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic central building"
msgstr "edificio central básico"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Building additional housing will allow us to send companions out to find "
"recruits."
msgstr ""
"La construcción de viviendas adicionales nos permitirá enviar compañeros a "
"buscar reclutas."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic west tent"
msgstr "tienda básica del oeste"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We need to expand our base to include basic dining facilities."
msgstr ""
"Necesitamos expandir nuestra base para incluir instalaciones básicas de "
"comedor."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic central kitchen"
msgstr "cocina central básica"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "More housing means that we can support additional specialists."
msgstr ""
"Más hogares nos dará la posibilidad de incorporar especialistas adicionales."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic southeast tent"
msgstr "tienda básica del sureste"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "An expanded kitchen is needed to support our growing settlement."
msgstr ""
"Necesitamos una cocina expandida para satisfacer las necesidades de nuestro "
"asentamiento en crecimiento."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic expanded kitchen"
msgstr "cocina básica ampliada"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Finishing the hard structure will give us a more secure place to retreat to "
"if we come under attack."
msgstr ""
"Termina la estructura dura, nos dará un lugar más seguro para retirarnos si "
"nos atacan."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic completed central building"
msgstr "edificio central básico completado"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"I'm surprised we've made it this long without securing a clean water source,"
" we need a well."
msgstr ""
"Estoy sorprendido de que hayamos llegado hasta aquí sin asegurarnos una "
"fuente de agua potable. Necesitamos un pozo."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic water well"
msgstr "pozo de agua básico"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Building a strong wall will keep the base secure even if a small horde "
"attacks."
msgstr ""
"Construir una pared fuerte mantendrá nuestra base segura aunque nos ataque "
"una pequeña horda."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic partial wall"
msgstr "pared parcial básica"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We need to finish our half built fortifications."
msgstr "Necesitamos terminar nuestras fortificaciones a medio hacer."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic complete wall"
msgstr "pared completa básica"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We're running out of room and need another living quarters."
msgstr "Nos estamos quedando sin espacio, necesitamos más dormitorios."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic east tent"
msgstr "tienda este básica"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Our kitchen isn't able to keep up with demand, we need to expand it."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra cocina no es capaz de mantener la demanda, tenemos que ampliarla."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic dining hall"
msgstr "comedor básico"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We should build stronger doors to secure our compound."
msgstr ""
"Deberíamos construir puertas más fuertes para asegurar nuestro complejo."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic reinforced gates"
msgstr "puertas básicas reforzadas"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "One more tent and our living space will be full."
msgstr "Una tienda más y nuestro espacio vital estará lleno."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic southwest tent"
msgstr "tienda básica del suroeste"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"We could construct a radio tower to improve communication range, first step "
"is the tower structure."
msgstr ""
"Podríamos construir una torre de radio para mejorar el alcance de las "
"comunicaciones, el primer paso es la estructura de la torre."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic radio tower"
msgstr "torre de radio básica"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We need to build a console to control the radio tower."
msgstr "Necesitamos construir una consola para controlar la torre de radio."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "basic radio console"
msgstr "consola de radio básica"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Survey land for a farm shop."
msgstr "Inspeccionar el terreno para poner un negocio de productos de granja."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Farm survey"
msgstr "Informe de la granja"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Plowing a few plots should get us started."
msgstr "Si aramos algunas áreas ya podríamos empezar."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Farm basic plots"
msgstr "Parcelas básicas de la granja"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We could use a farming shed to store resources where we'll be working."
msgstr ""
"Podríamos necesitar una caseta para la granja, para guardar las cosas con "
"las que trabajamos."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Farm basic shed"
msgstr "Cobertizo básico de granja"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our farm could be expanded by finishing the shed and adding additional "
"plots."
msgstr ""
"Nuestra granja podría expandirse su terminamos la caseta y agregamos algún "
"área más."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Farm upgraded shed"
msgstr "Cobertizo mejorado de la granja"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Building a processing shack should allow us to reclaim additional seeds from"
" our byproducts."
msgstr ""
"La construcción de una cabaña de procesamiento debería permitirnos recuperar"
" semillas adicionales de nuestros subproductos."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Farm processing shack"
msgstr "Cabaña de procesamiento de la granja"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Survey land for a garage."
msgstr "Informe de la tierra para un garaje."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Garage survey"
msgstr "Informe del Garaje"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Building a tool rack should be the first priority."
msgstr ""
"La construcción de un estante de herramientas debería ser la primera "
"prioridad."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Garage tool rack"
msgstr "Estante de herramientas del garaje"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We should start construction of a roof for the garage."
msgstr "Deberíamos comenzar la construcción de un techo para el garage."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Garage partial roof"
msgstr "Techo parcial del garaje"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Finishing out the roof will let our mechanics work rain or shine."
msgstr ""
"Terminar el techo permitirá a nuestros mecánicos trabajar bajo la lluvia o "
"el sol."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Garage completed roof"
msgstr "Techo del garaje completado"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Our garage isn't big enough to work on larger vehicles.  Let's start "
"expanding it."
msgstr ""
"Nuestro garaje no es lo suficientemente grande para trabajar con vehículos "
"más grandes. Empecemos a expandirlo."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Garage partial expansion"
msgstr "Expansión parcial del garaje"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Finishing the roof will let us park RVs and buses in the garage."
msgstr ""
"Terminar el techo nos permitirá aparcar caravanas y autobuses en el garaje."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Garage expanded roof"
msgstr "Techo expandido del garaje"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Attaching quarters will let our mechanics work longer hours when needed."
msgstr ""
"Unir cuartos permitirá a nuestros mecánicos trabajar más horas cuando sea "
"necesario."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Garage mechanics quarters"
msgstr "Cuartos mecánicos del garaje"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Survey land for a kitchen."
msgstr "Informe del terreno para una cocina."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Kitchen survey"
msgstr "Informe de la cocina"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Building a cook-shack is our first task."
msgstr "Construir un cuarto para la cocina es nuestra primera tarea."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Kitchen fireplace shack"
msgstr "Cocina chimenea de cabaña"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "We need to finish framing the walls for the cook-shack."
msgstr ""
"Necesitamos terminar la estructura de las paredes para el cuarto de cocina."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Kitchen finished shack"
msgstr "Cabaña de la cocina terminada"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Expanding the shack by including a smoker will increase our versatility."
msgstr ""
"Expandir la cabaña incluyendo un ahumador aumentará nuestra versatilidad."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Kitchen charcoal smoker"
msgstr "Ahumador de carbón de cocina"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "A pantry will allow our cooks to store more non-perishables."
msgstr ""
"Una despensa les permitirá a nuestros cocineros guardar más alimentos no "
"perecederos."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Kitchen pantry expansion"
msgstr "La expansión de la despensa de la cocina"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Increasing our number of smoking racks will let us craft larger batches."
msgstr ""
"Aumenta nuestro número de estantes de ahumado nos permitirá fabricar lotes "
"más grandes."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "Kitchen more smoking racks"
msgstr "Más estantes para ahumado en la cocina"

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
msgid "A well is needed so our cooks don't have to haul in water."
msgstr ""
"Se necesita un pozo para que nuestros cocineros no tengan que transportar "
"agua."

#: lang/json/recipe_from_json.py
