#. ~ Description for scenario 'Last Flight' for a male character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Once it became clear that the world was ending you took to the skies, hoping"
" that your flying skills could lead you to safety.  You found no standing "
"safe zones, and when your fuel ran out, were forced to land over an empty "
"bridge."
msgstr ""
"Una vez que quedó claro que el mundo se estaba acabando, te lanzaste a los "
"cielos con la esperanza de que tus habilidades de vuelo te llevaran a un "
"lugar seguro. No encontraste ninguna zona segura y, cuando se te acabó el "
"combustible, te viste obligado a aterrizar sobre un puente vacío."

