"the evacuation and managed to avoid being turned into one of those things "
"outside.  You are now left in a city full of the hateful revenants of your "
"neighbors."
msgstr ""
"Sea por tu tozudez, ignorancia, o simplemente mala suerte, te perdiste la "
"evacuación y lograste evitar ser convertida en una de esas cosas de afuera. "
"Ahora estás atrapada en una ciudad llena de los antipáticos retornados de "
"tus vecinos."

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Surrounded' for a male character.
#: lang/json/scenario_from_json.py
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've attracted the attention of a pack of mutants in some way, now they're"
" all around and you'll likely have to fight thorough them if you want to "
"escape."
msgstr ""
"Has atraído la atención de una manada de mutantes de alguna manera, ahora "
"están por todas partes y es probable que tengas que luchar a través de ellos"
" si quieres escapar."

#. ~ Description for scenario 'Surrounded' for a female character.
