#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  It has an unsettling loose and spongy "
"texture, but smells… mostly normal.  There are strange tangles and "
"formations in it that don't appear natural at all: bits of bone and hair "
"crusted up inside the muscle, as if trying to form another organism.  Still,"
" it seems digestible at least, if you cook it and remove the worst parts."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal fuertemente mutado. Tiene una inquietante textura suelta "
"y esponjosa, pero huele... mayormente normal. Hay extraños enredos y "
"formaciones en ella que no parecen naturales en absoluto: trozos de hueso y "
"pelo encostrados en el interior del músculo, como si se tratara de formar "
"otro organismo. Aún así, parece digerible al menos, si lo cocinas y quitas "
"las peores partes."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although it came from muscle tissue, it"
" has a curious swirling grain pattern, and at the center of each grain is a "
"knot of hard, cartilaginous tissue.  It smells offputting."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de tejido muscular, tiene un "
"curioso patrón de grano arremolinado, y en el centro de cada grano hay un "
"nudo de tejido duro y cartilaginoso. Tiene un olor desagradable."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  This is from muscle, but in the fascial"
" tissue between the muscles, thick spiny hairs have grown.  Foul-smelling, "
"cream-colored fluid gushes out whenever a hair pulls loose."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Esto es de un músculo, pero en el tejido "
"facial entre los músculos han crecido gruesos pelos espinosos. Un fluido "
"maloliente y de color crema sale a borbotones cada vez que se suelta un "
"pelo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Meat from a heavily mutated animal.  Although this came from muscle, it has "
"a thick cordlike texture and smells like leather and bread mold."
msgstr ""
"Carne de un animal muy mutado. Aunque procede de un músculo, tiene una "
"textura espesa como un cordón y huele a cuero y a moho del pan."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  It has an unsettling,"
" spongy texture, but otherwise tastes… mostly normal.  Hopefully you got all"
" the bits of hair and bone out…"
msgstr ""
"Este es un trozo de carne cocido de un animal mutado. Tiene una textura "
"esponjosa e inquietante, pero por lo demás tiene un sabor... casi normal. "
"Esperemos que hayas sacado todos los trozos de pelo y hueso..."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  You thought you'd "
"cleared out all the gross parts, but while cooking, a fluid-filled sac "
"inside burst and covered it in some kind of thick grease."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocinada de un animal mutante. Pensabas que habías"
" limpiado todas las partes asquerosas, pero mientras se cocinaba, un saco "
"lleno de líquido en su interior se reventó y lo cubrió de una especie de "
"grasa espesa."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  The surface is "
"peppered with divots from the pieces you had to dig out to make it seem "
"edible."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutante. La superficie está "
"salpicada de muescas de los trozos que has tenido que extraer para que "
"parezca comestible."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a cooked chunk of meat from a mutated animal.  Heat caused the "
"muscles to twist and move as if they were alive, and now it has writhed "
"itself into a dense knot."
msgstr ""
"Esto es un trozo de carne cocida de un animal mutado. El calor hizo que los "
"músculos se retorcieran y se movieran como si estuvieran vivos, y ahora se "
"ha retorcido hasta formar un denso nudo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug, and you really aren't sure what "
"to make of them.  There are things you've never seen in any anatomy book, "
"with spines and hair and other unidentified parts protruding seemingly at "
"random."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos proceden de un bicho mutante gigante, y realmente no estás "
"seguro de qué hacer con ellos. Hay cosas que nunca has visto en ningún libro"
" de anatomía, con espinas y pelos y otras partes no identificadas que "
"sobresalen aparentemente al azar."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"These organs came from a giant mutant bug.  They have a sickly green color, "
"and one of them ripped when you were removing it, revealing an inner surface"
" that looks like row upon row of human fingers, nails and all."
msgstr ""
"Estos órganos proceden de un bicho mutante gigante. Tienen un color verde "
"enfermizo, y uno de ellos se desgarró cuando lo estabas quitando, revelando "
"una superficie interior que parece una fila y otra de dedos humanos, con "
"uñas y todo."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a huge, thick, fleshy sac you removed from a giant mutant bug.  The "
"surface is covered in smooth, soft skin, and beneath it is a coiled, twisted"
" mess of cordlike tissue."
msgstr ""
"Este es un enorme y grueso saco carnoso que extrajiste de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. La superficie está cubierta de piel suave y lisa, y debajo hay un "
"lío enrollado y retorcido de tejido similar a un cordón."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a long, corded organ you removed from a giant mutant bug.  It ran "
"from the head to the abdomen and has long tendrils coming off it, not unlike"
" a spinal cord."
msgstr ""
"Este es un órgano largo y con cuerdas que extrajistes de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. Va desde la cabeza hasta el abdomen y tiene largos zarcillos que "
"salen de él, no muy diferentes de una médula espinal."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a meaty grey organ you removed from a mutant.  It has a chalky "
"yellow coating that burns your skin, and several unidentifiable fleshy tubes"
" sticking out of it.  The smell it gives off stings your nostrils.  You're "
"pretty confident no natural creature has one of these."
msgstr ""
"Este es un órgano gris carnoso que has extraído de un mutante. Tiene una "
"capa amarilla calcárea que te quema la piel, y varios tubos carnosos "
"inidentificables que salen de él. El olor que desprende te escuece en las "
"fosas nasales. Estás seguro de que ninguna criatura natural tiene uno de "
"estos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This organ meat, retrieved from a mutated creature, looks like a series of "
"small mammalian hearts arranged in series on a long fleshy tube.  At the end"
" of the chain is a large fleshy sac resembling a stomach."
msgstr ""
"Esta carne de órgano, obtenida de una criatura mutante, parece una serie de "
"pequeños corazones de mamífero dispuestos en serie en un largo tubo carnoso."
" Al final de la cadena hay un gran saco carnoso que se parece a un estómago."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It looks like a lung from a larger "
"mammal, like a dog, but instead of a few distinct lobes, it has dozens of "
"lobes arranged in sheets.  Strange spindles and gnarled tumescences dot the "
"surface."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro de que esto es tejido pulmonar. Parece un pulmón de un"
" mamífero más grande, como un perro, pero en lugar de unos pocos lóbulos "
"distintos, tiene docenas de lóbulos dispuestos en láminas. Extraños husos y "
"tumorcillos nudosos salpican la superficie."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're pretty sure this is lung tissue.  It has a vaguely wing-like shape, "
"with a series of nodules around what would be the trailing edge of the "
"'wing'.  A cluster of quills in each corner of the organ held it to the "
"bug's carapace like clasps."
msgstr ""
"Estás bastante seguro de que esto es tejido pulmonar. Tiene una forma "
"vagamente parecida a un ala, con una serie de nódulos alrededor de lo que "
"sería el borde de salida del \"ala\". Un grupo de púas en cada esquina del "
"órgano lo sujetaba al caparazón del bicho como si fueran broches."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton, but mutated.  The inner side is lined with "
"veins and strange, hooked protuberances."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo del exoesqueleto de un bicho, pero mutado. La cara interna está "
"recubierta de venas y extrañas protuberancias ganchudas."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A piece of a bug's exoskeleton.  Stringy lines of nervous tissue and blood "
"vessels still cling to the inner surface."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo del exoesqueleto de un insecto. Líneas fibrosas de tejido nervioso "
"y vasos sanguíneos todavía se aferran a la superficie interior."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A piece of rigid, tube-shaped chitin from the inside of a giant bug.  It "
"seemed to be performing some kind of support role.  You're quite sure normal"
" insects don't have these."
msgstr ""
"Un trozo de quitina rígida, con forma de tubo, del interior de un bicho "
"gigante. Parecía estar realizando algún tipo de función de apoyo. Estás "
"bastante seguro de que los insectos normales no tienen esto."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A long, flexible rod of chitin from inside a giant mutant bug.  It is laced "
"with blood vessels and chitinous nodules."
msgstr ""
"Una varilla larga y flexible de quitina del interior de un bicho mutante "
"gigante. Está repleta de vasos sanguíneos y nódulos quitinosos."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you peel away the outer shell, you find veins lining the chitin plates"
msgstr ""
"Al pelar la cáscara exterior, te encuentras las venas que recubren las "
"placas de quitina"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "With the creature dead, its carapace comes away surprisingly easily"
msgstr ""
"Con la criatura muerta, su caparazón se desprende con sorprendente facilidad"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There's a thin membrane, much like skin, spread over the chitin of this "
"creature"
msgstr ""
"Hay una fina membrana, muy parecida a la piel, extendida sobre la quitina de"
" esta criatura"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Under the carapace of this mutant is a bristly, velcro-like material"
msgstr ""
"Bajo el caparazón de este mutante hay un material erizado, parecido al "
"velcro"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The anatomy concealed beneath seems almost like a small mammal given a shell"
" and twisted into the shape of an arthropod"
msgstr ""
"La anatomía que se esconde debajo parece casi un pequeño mamífero al que se "
"le ha dado un caparazón y se ha retorcido en forma de artrópodo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You crack the beast open like a horrific lobster"
msgstr "Abres a la bestia como una horrible langosta"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chitin holds tight to the creature, and you need to snap and tear it "
"away, sawing at tough fibers beneath"
msgstr ""
"La quitina se adhiere fuertemente a la criatura, y hay que romperla y "
"desgarrarla, aserrando las duras fibras que hay debajo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The moment you start cutting into the corpse, a few of what you thought were"
" extra legs detach and scurry off into the undergrowth"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que empiezas a cortar el cadáver, algunas de las que creías"
" que eran patas extra se desprenden y se escabullen entre la maleza"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"For your first cut you connect the dozen openings on the creature's sides, "
"only to reveal a finger-sized wriggling grub in each"
msgstr ""
"Para tu primer corte conectas la docena de aberturas en los lados de la "
"criatura, sólo para revelar una larva del tamaño de un dedo en cada una"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your work disturbs the parasites still clinging to the joints of the "
"creature, and a few size you up as a potential new home before scurrying "
"away"
msgstr ""
"Tu trabajo molesta a los parásitos que aún se aferran a las articulaciones "
"de la criatura, y algunos te consideran como un posible nuevo hogar antes de"
" huir"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Spaced evenly across the entire body you find small sacs of eggs in "
"different stages of growth"
msgstr ""
"Espaciados uniformemente por todo el cuerpo se encuentran pequeños sacos de "
"huevos en diferentes etapas de crecimiento"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its intestines grew into a labyrinthine tangle, like so many worms devouring"
" each other"
msgstr ""
"Sus intestinos crecieron en una maraña laberíntica, como tantos gusanos "
"devorándose unos a otros"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside, half-formed organs press against spongy meat that doesn't look "
"anything like raw arthropod meat from normal creatures"
msgstr ""
"En el interior, los órganos a medio formar presionan contra una carne "
"esponjosa que no se parece en nada a la carne cruda de los artrópodos de las"
" criaturas normales"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Beneath, you find a collection of hooked spines that seem to have been "
"clasping it on somehow"
msgstr ""
"Debajo, se encuentra una colección de espinas enganchadas que parecen haber "
"sido sujetadas de alguna manera"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside is a complex, still-squirming mess of strange appendages and organs "
"that bear only a passing resemblance to any natural creature"
msgstr ""
"En tu interior hay un complejo y todavía retorcido lío de extraños apéndices"
" y órganos que sólo se parecen de pasada a cualquier criatura natural"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Beneath the chitin, the meat is covered in thick, bristly hair hiding a "
"chaotic bramble of half-formed, mutated organs"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina, la carne está cubierta de pelos gruesos y erizados que"
" esconden una caótica zarza de órganos mutantes a medio formar"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside is a tangled mess of organs and tissues that do not appear entirely "
"natural"
msgstr ""
"En tu interior hay una maraña de órganos y tejidos que no parecen del todo "
"naturales"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Inside the creature you find lungs, hearts, and intestines more like a "
"mammal than a giant bug"
msgstr ""
"En el interior de la criatura se encuentran pulmones, corazones e intestinos"
" más propios de un mamífero que de un bicho gigante"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite the apparent death of the whole, some organs still pump, beat, and "
"churn on undisturbed"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The meat inside gives off a horrifying stench, and seems to be covered in "
"thin damp hair, like a newborn animal gone horribly wrong"
msgstr ""
"La carne de tu interior desprende un hedor espantoso, y parece estar "
"cubierta de un fino pelo húmedo, como un animal recién nacido que ha salido "
"terriblemente mal"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Small bundles of fiber break loose as you work, splitting open to reveal "
"twisted, half-formed copies of the creature itself"
msgstr ""
"Pequeños manojos de fibra se desprenden mientras trabajas, abriéndote para "
"revelar copias retorcidas y medio formadas de la propia criatura"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"It is difficult to work, as the spongey tissue tears apart under your tools"
msgstr ""
"Es difícil de trabajar, ya que el tejido esponjoso se desgarra bajo tus "
"herramientas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Despite its outward appearance, both the organs and the endolymph of this "
"creature is pristinely white"
msgstr ""
"A pesar de su aspecto exterior, tanto los órganos como la endolinfa de esta "
"criatura son de un blanco impoluto"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some of your cuts meet nerves, and the already stiff corpse shudders with "
"movement each time"
msgstr ""
"Algunos de tus cortes se encuentran con los nervios, y el ya rígido cadáver "
"se estremece con el movimiento cada vez"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You follow what you think are superflous veins into the deep, finding a "
"gorged, tick-like creature at their convergence"
msgstr ""
"Sigues lo que crees que son venas superfluas en las profundidades, "
"encontrando una criatura atiborrada de garrapatas en tu convergencia"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Every cut reveals an organ you can't quite recognize, and you start to "
"wonder what your insides look like by now"
msgstr ""
"Cada corte revela un órgano que no puedes reconocer del todo, y empiezas a "
"preguntarte cómo son tus entrañas a estas alturas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You are dizzied by the rainbow coloration of the creature's muscles, "
"clashing with the bloody mess in its guts"
msgstr ""
"Te marea la coloración del arco iris de los músculos de la criatura, que "
"choca con el desorden sangriento en sus tripas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you cut into its flesh you are disturbed by its sickly-sweet smell, like "
"fermenting fruit"
msgstr ""
"Al cortar su carne te molesta su olor enfermizo y dulce, como de fruta en "
"fermentación"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There are fist-sized globs of nervous tissue dotted about its insides, "
"sending the corpse into a spasm every time you touch one"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The muscles grow stiff, and begin leaking a dark gray liquid that pools "
"around your feet"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Its legs contain no muscles, just sinews hanging in yellow-green ichor"
msgstr ""
"Sus piernas no tienen músculos, sólo tendones que cuelgan de un ichor "
"amarillo-verdoso."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The legs fall off easily, leaving the main body looking like an armored worm"
msgstr ""
"Las patas se desprenden fácilmente, dejando el cuerpo principal con el "
"aspecto de un gusano acorazado"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Each pair of legs is slightly different.  These end in hooks, the next in "
"talons like a bird's, there's a pair of chitinous tentacles"
msgstr ""
"Cada par de patas es ligeramente diferente. Estas terminan en ganchos, las "
"siguientes en garras como las de un pájaro, hay un par de tentáculos "
"quitinosos"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The mandibles keep snapping, and acrid-smelling venom wets the soil.  You "
"decide to begin your work at its tail"
msgstr ""
"Las mandíbulas siguen chasqueando, y el veneno de olor acre moja el suelo. "
"Decides comenzar tu trabajo en su cola"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You're startled as its antenna whips out and briefly coils around your arm"
msgstr ""
"Te sorprendes cuando su antena se extiende y se enrosca brevemente alrededor"
" de tu brazo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Underneath the surface, there are small plates of chitin dotted about, much "
"harder than the rest"
msgstr ""
"Bajo la superficie, hay pequeñas placas de quitina con puntos, mucho más "
"duras que el resto"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On its tail end the segments get smaller and smaller, until they terminate "
"in a small copy of the head, looking backwards"
msgstr ""
"En su extremo de cola los segmentos se hacen cada vez más pequeños, hasta "
"que terminan en una pequeña copia de la cabeza, mirando hacia atrás"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chitin of the head is caked in old blood and lymph of its previous "
"victims"
msgstr ""
"La quitina de la cabeza está empapada de sangre vieja y linfa de sus "
"víctimas anteriores"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find vacuoles filled with its venom in the most unexpected nooks, "
"forcing you to work carefully"
msgstr ""
"Encuentras vacuolas llenas de su veneno en los rincones más inesperados, lo "
"que te obliga a trabajar con cuidado"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The indescribable stench of the remains of its last meal make you question "
"your decision to butcher it"
msgstr ""
"El indescriptible hedor de los restos de su última comida te hace cuestionar"
" tu decisión de descuartizarlo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On some organs you see the same swollen ulcers as around your own wounds.  "
"It seems not all of it is venom-proof"
msgstr ""
"En algunos órganos se ven las mismas úlceras hinchadas que alrededor de tus "
"propias heridas. Parece que no todo es a prueba de veneno"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This one's very blood stinks like its venom, and even the slightest drop "
"makes your skin itch"
msgstr ""
"La propia sangre de éste apesta como su veneno, e incluso la más mínima gota"
" hace que te pique la piel"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"There is order to the chaos in this one.  Each segment's insides is a "
"perfect copy of the last, down to each sinew"
msgstr ""
"Hay orden en el caos en este caso. El interior de cada segmento es una copia"
" perfecta del anterior, hasta cada tendón"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This one smells disturbingly appetizing, like a memory of a childhood meal "
"whose details you forgot"
msgstr ""
"Este huele inquietantemente apetecible, como el recuerdo de una comida de la"
" infancia cuyos detalles has olvidado"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"By the time you reach the rear of the matriarch, most of its offspring have "
"disappeared into the grass.  Some stuck around feeding on their unhatched "
"siblings, unwilling to give up the easy meal until the last moment"
msgstr ""
"Cuando llegas a la parte trasera de la matriarca, la mayoría de sus crías "
"han desaparecido en la hierba. Algunas se han quedado alimentándose de sus "
"hermanos no nacidos, sin querer renunciar a la comida fácil hasta el último "
"momento"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The moment the matriarch grows still, the last third of its body flops to "
"the ground, letting go of dozens of eggs and small centipedes"
msgstr ""
"En el momento en que la matriarca se queda quieta, el último tercio de su "
"cuerpo cae al suelo, dejando escapar decenas de huevos y pequeños ciempiés"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"After cleaning away the rotten meat and mess of eggs shrouding the "
"matriarch's hind segments, you find its carapace chewed open, and much of "
"its flesh already eaten by its ever-hungry young"
msgstr ""
"Después de limpiar la carne podrida y el amasijo de huevos que cubren los "
"segmentos traseros de la matriarca, encuentras su caparazón abierto a "
"mordiscos, y gran parte de su carne ya devorada por sus siempre hambrientas "
"crías"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As if they noticed the death of their mother, the dozens of centipedes still"
" clinging to it attack each other with a sudden frenzy.  You decide to give "
"them time to disperse before continuing"
msgstr ""
"Como si se hubieran dado cuenta de la muerte de su madre, las decenas de "
"ciempiés que aún se aferran a ella se atacan entre sí con un repentino "
"frenesí. Decides darles tiempo para que se dispersen antes de continuar"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Since your tools barely have purchase on its carapace you decide to dig the "
"meat and viscera out from your first cut.  At times, you disappear up to "
"your waist in its armored insides"
msgstr ""
"Dado que tus herramientas apenas tienen compra en su caparazón, decides "
"desenterrar la carne y las vísceras de tu primer corte. A veces, desapareces"
" hasta la cintura en sus entrañas acorazadas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you cut more and more meat away, some of the resilient chitin plates fall"
" away with a loud squelch"
msgstr ""
"A medida que se corta más y más carne, algunas de las resistentes placas de "
"quitina se desprenden con un fuerte chirrido"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"To bypass the armor you had to start your work by its mandibles, inches away"
" from its venom-coated fangs and the remains of chitin, bones, and strands "
"of Kevlar stuck between their points"
msgstr ""
"Para sortear la armadura había que empezar el trabajo por sus mandíbulas, cm"
" a cm desde sus colmillos recubiertos de veneno y los restos de quitina, "
"huesos y hebras de Kevlar pegados entre sus puntas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This feels more like scrapping a car than butchering an animal.  Instead of "
"veins and legs you find yourself thinking about joints, panels, and cabling"
msgstr ""
"Esto se parece más a desguazar un coche que a descuartizar un animal. En "
"lugar de venas y piernas, te encuentras pensando en juntas, paneles y "
"cableado"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"On closer inspection, the head's armor is pocked by finger-sized holes with "
"jagged edges, reminiscent of the creature's fangs"
msgstr ""
"En una inspección más cercana, la armadura de la cabeza está llena de "
"agujeros del tamaño de un dedo con bordes dentados, que recuerdan a los "
"colmillos de la criatura"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In a hidden organ without an obvious connection to the outside world, you "
"find a seemingly forgotten handful of glistening eggs"
msgstr ""
"En un órgano oculto sin conexión evidente con el mundo exterior, encuentras "
"un puñado aparentemente olvidado de huevos brillantes"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The wings of this creature break apart upon the slightest touch into myriad "
"identical rainbow crystals"
msgstr ""
"Las alas de esta criatura se rompen al menor toque en una miríada de "
"cristales de arco iris idénticos"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Even as the body grows still, the wings keep on beating slowly"
msgstr "Aunque el cuerpo se quede quieto, las alas siguen batiendo lentamente"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The chitin of this one is light and brittle, like an empty eggshell"
msgstr ""
"La quitina de éste es ligera y frágil, como una cáscara de huevo vacía"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Where you came to expect smooth chitin you find exposed flesh, shot with a "
"web of hardened strands"
msgstr ""
"Donde esperabas una quitina lisa, encuentras carne expuesta, disparada con "
"una red de hebras endurecidas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You cough as you inhale the fine, colorful dust shedded from the wings"
msgstr "Toses al inhalar el fino y colorido polvo desprendido de las alas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The carapace of this one still feels hot to the touch, especially around the"
" wings"
msgstr ""
"El caparazón de este todavía se siente caliente al tacto, especialmente "
"alrededor de las alas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What you thought was shuddering chitinous fuzz on the creature's back is, in"
" reality, thousands of miniature copies of its main wings, flapping in "
"unison"
msgstr ""
"Lo que creías que era una temblorosa pelusa quitinosa en la espalda de la "
"criatura es, en realidad, miles de copias en miniatura de sus alas "
"principales, batiendo al unísono"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The wings are held in place by stiff muscles, reaching into the deep"
msgstr ""
"Las alas se mantienen en su lugar por medio de músculos rígidos, llegando a "
"lo más profundo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Underneath the chitin you find bundles of small, floating pearls, each held "
"in place by a single strand of sinew"
msgstr ""
"Debajo de la quitina se encuentran manojos de pequeñas perlas flotantes, "
"cada una de ellas sujeta por una sola hebra de tendón"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Near its wings you find a black, bubbling organ still periodically emitting "
"a bundle of floating bubbles"
msgstr ""
"Cerca de sus alas se encuentra un órgano negro y burbujeante que sigue "
"emitiendo periódicamente un haz de burbujas flotantes"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you open its intestines by mistake, you can barely pull your finger away "
"from the dozen snapping mandibles on its inside"
msgstr ""
"Al abrir sus intestinos por error, apenas puedes apartar el dedo de la "
"docena de mandíbulas que chasquean en su interior"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The space not taken up by the now-familiar floating sacs is almost entirely "
"filled by a sticky, homogenous yellow jelly that seems to actively try to "
"avoid your knife"
msgstr ""
"El espacio que no está ocupado por los ya conocidos sacos flotantes está "
"casi totalmente ocupado por una gelatina amarilla pegajosa y homogénea que "
"parece tratar de evitar activamente tu cuchillo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The wings are rooted in its flesh by an almost transparent, fractal root "
"structure, making you question if it always belonged to the creature"
msgstr ""
"Las alas están arraigadas en su carne por una estructura de raíces casi "
"transparente y fractal, lo que hace que te preguntes si siempre perteneció a"
" la criatura"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "The light of its abdomen flickers with each cut, growing ever dimmer"
msgstr "La luz de su abdomen parpadea con cada corte, cada vez más tenue"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "An errant cut coats your tools with foul-smelling, glowing goop"
msgstr ""
"Un corte equivocado cubre tus herramientas con una sustancia maloliente y "
"brillante."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"What you saw as a homogenous light from a distance was the result of myriad "
"strands of glowing chitin criscrossing just beneath the carapace"
msgstr ""
"Lo que veías como una luz homogénea desde la distancia era el resultado de "
"una miríada de hilos de quitina brillante que se entrecruzaban justo debajo "
"del caparazón"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This one's very flesh is glowing with a blinding intensity, lighting up your"
" gruesome work"
msgstr ""
"La propia carne de éste brilla con una intensidad cegadora, iluminando tu "
"horripilante trabajo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_flying_chitin>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_chitin>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its chitin is sturdier than usual for the flying insects, and marked by the "
"struggles of its previous victims"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The stripes on the back of its abdomen are warped into a nauseating spiral "
"you can't tear your eyes away from"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Upon closer inspection, the uniform black stripes reveal themselves to be "
"rows upon rows of glistening eyes"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"With each cut, the stinger springs from its sheath, tip bending ever so "
"slightly towards your leg"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The stripes -so uniform at a distance- reveal themselves to be jagged, "
"strangely familiar patterns, like the cursive of an unknown language"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_flying_deeper>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_deeper>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The chaotic bundle of organs in its torso look much like those of other "
"mutated insects, but as you near the abdomen there's order to the madness: "
"comparatively neat rows of venom-filled glands, each feeding into a "
"reservoir at the base of the stinger"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "You open a stomach, releasing a gush of sweet-smelling grey fluid"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "For its apparent hunger for meat, its intestines seem almost atrophied"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Your knife reaches the retracted stinger and slips on its smooth surface, "
"opening half a dozen venom glands in the process.  You haven't cut yourself,"
" have you?"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You find a handful of dead grubs underneath its chitin, near a chewed-open "
"venom gland"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Deep, deep within the dead queen you find a smooth, brightly colored plaque "
"the size of your fingernail, reading <number><number>"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some of the now-familiar venom glands also contain dozens of shiny white "
"eggs, undisturbed by their deadly surroundings"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"As you cut into its abdomen you disturb a handful of normal-sized, wingless "
"wasps clinging to a strange, tubular organ.  They crawl a few steps before "
"falling lifelessly to the ground"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Some of the egg clusters are ransacked by fat, white worms tunneling blindly"
" through its flesh"
msgstr ""

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Steaming puddles of acid spill from its outer shell as you pull it back"
msgstr ""
"Charcos humeantes de ácido se derraman de su cáscara exterior cuando se tira"
" hacia atrás"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "Steaming acid burbles from the creature's chitin as you peel it back"
msgstr "El ácido humeante brota de la quitina de la criatura cuando la pelas"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Several acid glands rupture as you peel back the carapace, sending streams "
"of steaming caustic fluids spraying around"
msgstr ""
"Varias glándulas ácidas se rompen al pelar el caparazón, enviando chorros de"
" fluidos cáusticos humeantes rociando alrededor"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The organs themselves have an acrid odour, but don't seem as caustically "
"acidic as the outer shell"
msgstr ""
"Los propios órganos tienen un olor acre, pero no parecen tan cáusticamente "
"ácidos como la cubierta exterior"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You carefully avoid breaking through pockets of what you think may be acid-"
"secreting glands"
msgstr ""
"Evita cuidadosamente romper las bolsas de lo que cree que pueden ser "
"glándulas secretoras de ácido"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Thick, ropey cords of tissue beneath its chitin protect an inner layer of "
"strange organs, resembling those of a bird more than anything"
msgstr ""
"Unas gruesas cuerdas de tejido bajo su quitina protegen una capa interna de "
"extraños órganos, que se parecen más a los de un pájaro que a cualquier otra"
" cosa."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"
msgstr "<bug_harvest_general_descriptive>"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The powerfully acidic vapors coming from the carcass make it hard to work"
msgstr ""
"Los vapores fuertemente ácidos que salen de la carcasa dificultan el trabajo"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The tissues of the creature are full of half-formed organs, their purpose "
"unclear"
msgstr ""
"Los tejidos de la criatura están llenos de órganos a medio formar, su "
"propósito no está claro"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Several times, you nearly burn yourself piercing a concealed gland full of "
"acid"
msgstr ""
"Varias veces, casi te quemas perforando una glándula oculta llena de ácido"

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The skin is so riddled with wounds that you barely need to cut to pull it "
"away."
msgstr ""
"La piel está tan plagada de heridas que apenas hay que cortar para "
"arrancarla."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The poor creature has stopped breathing, but there's still a lot of movement"
" in the corpse."
msgstr ""
"La pobre criatura ha dejado de respirar, pero todavía hay mucho movimiento "
"en el cadáver."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"The larvae seem to have taken care to leave enough intact not to kill their "
"host, but the rest is practically hollow."
msgstr ""
"Las larvas parecen haber tenido cuidado de dejar lo suficiente intacto su "
"huésped para no matarlo, pero el resto está prácticamente vacío."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"You have to pause often to stomp on the slower grubs, who only now realized "
"that their home is growing cold."
msgstr ""
"Hay que detenerse a menudo para pisar a los gusanos más lentos, que sólo "
"ahora se han dado cuenta de que su hogar se está enfriando."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"Its stomach is full of grubs even more malformed than the rest.  The runt of"
" the litter got recycled, it seems."
msgstr ""
"Su estómago está lleno de larvas aún más malformadas que el resto. El más "
"pequeño de la camada fue reciclado, parece."

#: lang/json/snippet_from_json.py
msgid ""
"In the beginning you take care to separate parasite and host, but after a "
"while you give up and start cutting through."
msgstr ""
"Al principio te cuidaste de separar parásito y huésped, pero al cabo de un "
"tiempo se abandona y se empieza a cortar."

