#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "broken diesel tank"
msgstr "tanque diesel roto"

#. ~ Description for centrifuge
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This is a centrifuge, a liquid separating device with an automated analyzer "
"unit.  It could be used to analyze a medical fluid sample, such as blood, if"
" a test tube was placed in it."
msgstr ""
"Esta es una centrifugadora, un dispositivo de separación de líquidos con una"
" unidad analizadora automática. Podría usarse para analizar una muestra de "
"fluido médico, como sangre, si se colocara un tubo de ensayo en ella."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "plutonium generator"
msgstr "generador de plutonio"

#. ~ Description for plutonium generator
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"This imposing apparatus harnesses the power of the atom.  Refined nuclear "
"fuel is 'burned' to provide nearly limitless electrical power.  It's not "
"doing much good here though.  Perhaps it could be salvaged for other "
"purposes."
msgstr ""
"Este imponente aparato aprovecha el poder del átomo. El combustible nuclear "
"refinado se \"quema\" para proporcionar una energía eléctrica casi "
"ilimitada. Sin embargo, no está haciendo mucho bien aquí. Tal vez podría ser"
" recuperado para otros propósitos."

#. ~ Description for old machinery
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "Assorted old machinery.  You could scavenge it for parts."
msgstr "Una variedad de maquinaria vieja. Podrías buscar piezas en la basura."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "scorched earth"
msgstr "tierra calcinada"

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "alder tree"
msgstr "aliso"

#. ~ Description for alder tree
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A deciduous flowering tree with serrate, scalloped, round-obovate leaves, "
"commonly forming dense groves alongside water."
msgstr ""
"Árbol de floración caducifolio con hojas serradas, festoneadas y "
"redondeadas-obovadas, que suele formar densas arboledas junto al agua."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "walkway"
msgstr "acera"

#. ~ Description for walkway
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A metallic bridge commonly used in industrial settings to meet specified "
"safety standards."
msgstr ""
"Es un puente metálico comúnmente utilizado en industrias para cumplir con "
"las reglas de seguridad establecidas."

#. ~ Description for dock
#. ~ Description for shallow bridge
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "A wooden platform held by a support made of logs dug into the ground."
msgstr ""
"Una plataforma de madera sostenida por un soporte hecho de leños excavados "
"en el suelo."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "deep dock pile"
msgstr "postes de muelle profundos"

#. ~ Description for deep dock pile
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid ""
"A sturdy pile made of wood extending all the way to the riverbed.  A frame "
"will be required to support a surface."
msgstr ""
"Una pila robusta de madera que se extiende hasta el lecho del río. Se "
"necesitará un marco para soportar una superficie."

#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
msgid "deep dock frame"
msgstr "estructura de muelle"

#. ~ Description for deep dock frame
#: lang/json/terrain_from_json.py
