"You feel excited as the Autodoc slices painlessly into you.  You enjoy the "
"sight of scalpels slicing you apart."
msgstr ""
"Te sientes excitado mientras el Autodoc te corta sin dolor. Disfrutas de la "
"vista de los escalpelos que te cortándote."

#: src/bionics.cpp
msgid ""
"You stay very, very still, focusing intently on an interesting stain on the "
"ceiling, as the Autodoc slices painlessly into you."
msgstr ""
"Te quedas muy, muy quieto, enfocandote intensamente en una interesante "
"mancha en el techo, mientras el Autodoc te corta sin dolor."

#: src/bionics.cpp
msgid ""
"As your consciousness slips away, you feel regret that you won't be able to "
"enjoy the operation."
msgstr ""
"A medida que tu conciencia se escapa, sientes pena de no poder disfrutar de "
"la operación."

